values
  ('390772148003087099', 'Evil Dress', 2026, 'Horror', 'Jacob Santana', 'Frank Ariza, Diego Ayala, Marco Lagarde', 'Belén Rueda, Vera Centenera, Elena Irureta, Luisa Merelas, Belén Écija', null, 'After her divorce, Alicia moves to a remote house with daughter Carla. When Carla finds a blue dress and contacts a ghost girl, dark secrets surface, leading to violence and a child in a coma.', 'After her divorce, Alicia moves to a remote house with daughter Carla. When Carla finds a blue dress and contacts a ghost girl, dark secrets surface, leading to violence and a child in a coma.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNzU3MjE4N2MtNWJlMi00OGY1LWI1ZTItOWI0NjcyY2JjZDk1XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:evil-dress-2026'),
  ('822732319800214806', 'Evil Ed', 1995, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Anders Jacobsson, Anders Jacobsson', 'Christer Ohlsson, Anders Jacobsson, Göran Lundström', 'Johan Rudebeck, Per Löfberg, Olof Rhodin, Camela Leierth, Gert Fylking, Cecilia Ljung, Michael Kallaanvaara, Hans Wilhelmsson', null, 'Edward is a friendly, harmless film editor in the splatter and gore department of a horror film company. Ed is assigned to work on the new Loose Limbs series of horror films after the previous editor killed himself with a hand grenade. Later his reality begins to twist and distort into a horrifying world where nothing is as it seems. Soon enough this turns Ed into Evil Ed!', 'Edward is a friendly, harmless film editor in the splatter and gore department of a horror film company. Ed is assigned to work on the new Loose Limbs series of horror films after the previous editor killed himself with a hand grenade. Later his reality begins to twist and distort into a horrifying world where nothing is as it seems. Soon enough this turns Ed into Evil Ed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnfYoAaNVFM4XZbpEN7MtI5R4Hp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25234'),
  ('942809215258374475', 'Evil Eye', 1975, 'Horror, Crime', 'Vicente Minaya Ortega, Mario Siciliano', 'Julio Buchs, Mario Siciliano', 'Anthony Steffen, Richard Conte, Pilar Velázquez, Jorge Rivero, Eduardo Fajardo, Pia Giancaro, Luis La Torre, Eva Vanicek', null, 'People around Peter Crane begin dying in mysterious fashion. How is Playboy Peter involved in this? He begins having nightmares dealing with murder...His psychiatrist has no idea of what Peter is suffering from. Even the police are in danger as they start investigating the case. What is the secret of the "Magic Circle"?', 'People around Peter Crane begin dying in mysterious fashion. How is Playboy Peter involved in this? He begins having nightmares dealing with murder...His psychiatrist has no idea of what Peter is suffering from. Even the police are in danger as they start investigating the case. What is the secret of the "Magic Circle"?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81T28hFKXgUaAjEKmdIyKheDS3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105424'),
  ('440452191039265724', 'Evil Eye', 2020, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Elan Dassani, Rajeev Dassani, Yaron Levy', 'Madhuri Shekar', 'Sarita Choudhury, Sunita Mani, Bernard White, Omar Maskati, Anjali Bhimani, Rachel Cora Wood, Ramesh Reddy, Lena Clark', 'NR', 'A seemingly perfect romance turns dark when a mother becomes convinced her daughter’s new boyfriend has a sinister connection to her own past.', 'A seemingly perfect romance turns dark when a mother becomes convinced her daughter’s new boyfriend has a sinister connection to her own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhExfe0yTZL2DRVkou9hnNlOcc9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732713'),
  ('515088065020450460', 'Evil Eye', 2022, 'Horror', 'Isaac Ezban, Isi Sarfati', 'Junior Rosario', 'Ofelia Medina, Paola Miguel, Ivanna Sofia Ferro, Samantha Castillo, Arap Bethke, Mauro González, Mildred Motta, Paloma Alvamar', null, 'Nala, a thirteen-year-old girl from the city, travels with her family to her grandmother''s home in the countryside, to try to find a cure for her little sister''s mysterious illness - But she''ll soon find her granny is not exactly what she seems...', 'Nala, a thirteen-year-old girl from the city, travels with her family to her grandmother''s home in the countryside, to try to find a cure for her little sister''s mysterious illness - But she''ll soon find her granny is not exactly what she seems...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcym9A0idLCFI1iIMRFiXKRvnbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943221'),
  ('353382165887227986', 'Evil Games', 2015, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Adrián García Bogliano', 'Adrián García Bogliano', 'Francisco Barreiro, Daniela Soto Vell, Jorge Molina, Milena Pezzi, Vita Vargas, Pablo Guisa Koestinger, Tito Guillén, Evan Alducin', null, 'Aram is a wearied accountant with an unbearably dull existence. With a nagging wife who berates him for not being assertive enough, and a measly paycheck, he quietly suffers while awaiting a long-deserved promotion. But there''s more to Aram than his mild-mannered demeanor lets on: he has been secretly devising a scheme to finally get what he feels he is owed. One day he asserts his power menacingly when he kidnaps a schoolgirl and keeps her tied up in an abandoned warehouse. What seems like the perfect plan soon unravels into his worst nightmare, and his carefully constructed scheme comes crashing down piece by bloody piece.', 'Aram is a wearied accountant with an unbearably dull existence. With a nagging wife who berates him for not being assertive enough, and a measly paycheck, he quietly suffers while awaiting a long-deserved promotion. But there''s more to Aram than his mild-mannered demeanor lets on: he has been secretly devising a scheme to finally get what he feels he is owed. One day he asserts his power menacingly when he kidnaps a schoolgirl and keeps her tied up in an abandoned warehouse. What seems like the perfect plan soon unravels into his worst nightmare, and his carefully constructed scheme comes crashing down piece by bloody piece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hqxqgmGUJSy9bkkTHFrAM2xhIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333318'),
  ('1033191750979485539', 'Evil in the Woods', 1986, 'Horror', 'William J. Oates', 'William J. Oates', 'Brian Abent, Stephanie Kaskel, Carolina Antonini, Schelli Marie Barbaro, Jennifer Bates, Lauren Kingsley, Walter L. Johnston, Mary Alice Johnston', 'PG-13', 'A young boy checks out a book titled Evil in the Woods from his local library. He immediately takes the book home and begins to read it and is soon sucked into a strange world set in Mildew Georgia. The book describes the plight of a group of low budget film makers who start to make their newest schlock piece in a woods that is occupied by not only an evil witch but also her cannibalistic and mentally disabled family. As the boy reads the book he starts to get sucked into the story just a little too much, the plot draws him in but will his will be enough to finish the fractured fable or will he forever get sucked into its pages.', 'A young boy checks out a book titled Evil in the Woods from his local library. He immediately takes the book home and begins to read it and is soon sucked into a strange world set in Mildew Georgia. The book describes the plight of a group of low budget film makers who start to make their newest schlock piece in a woods that is occupied by not only an evil witch but also her cannibalistic and mentally disabled family. As the boy reads the book he starts to get sucked into the story just a little too much, the plot draws him in but will his will be enough to finish the fractured fable or will he forever get sucked into its pages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcdiIHRGQVa49ZmJe7l0qEjh75U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132361'),
  ('316671686402398948', 'Evil Influencer: The Jodi Hildebrandt Story', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Skye Borgman, Bryan Gosline', null, 'Jodi Hildebrandt, Ruby Franke, Jessica Bate, Eric Clarke, Ethan Prete, Valerie Jackson, Natasha Helfer, Laura Howells Leavitt', null, 'Unravel the case of Utah therapist Jodi Hildebrandt, whose child abuse arrest with parenting YouTuber Ruby Franke exposed a twisted tale of manipulation.', 'Unravel the case of Utah therapist Jodi Hildebrandt, whose child abuse arrest with parenting YouTuber Ruby Franke exposed a twisted tale of manipulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rM3NLZgjs7vVWX3htMAWfwHypO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1591516'),
  ('530643412269799355', 'Evil Instinct', 1996, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Barry Chu, Coffee Hui Tak-Cheung, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung', 'Lu Bing, Barry Chu', 'Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Diana Pang Dan, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Evergreen Mak Cheung-Ching, Stuart Yung Sai-Kit, Chung Sau-Han, Le Rong-Rong, Jimmy Wong', null, 'Penny and Wendy originally are co-workers and best friends until Wendy is promoted. Penny feels that she is getting old and can''t compete with Wendy, she leaves Hong Kong, takes snake blood to cleanse herself, and then returns to Hong Kong for revenge.', 'Penny and Wendy originally are co-workers and best friends until Wendy is promoted. Penny feels that she is getting old and can''t compete with Wendy, she leaves Hong Kong, takes snake blood to cleanse herself, and then returns to Hong Kong for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyaPkz0AHFSEd8ODIwLY0wLkJJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360227'),
  ('446360382961234980', 'Evil Laugh', 1986, 'Horror', 'Dominick Brascia', 'Steven Baio, Dominick Brascia', 'Ashlyn Gere, Steven Baio, Tony Griffin, Jody Gibson, Jerold Pearson, Myles O''Brien, Howard Weiss, Karyn O''Bryan', 'R', 'A group of medical students take a weekend to fix up an old house where a mass murder occurred 10 years earlier.', 'A group of medical students take a weekend to fix up an old house where a mass murder occurred 10 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPZ1MwWx2Aic0nxUn1kCcVyIzGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85165'),
  ('955531436204934022', 'Evil of Dracula', 1974, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Michio Yamamoto, Kazutami Hara', 'Ei Ogawa, Masaru Takesue', 'Toshio Kurosawa, Mariko Mochizuki, Kunie Tanaka, Shin Kishida, Katsuhiko Sasaki, Mio Outa, Mika Katsuragi, Keiko Aramaki', 'NR', 'A professor takes up a new post at an all-girls school only to discover the principal concealing a dark secret.', 'A professor takes up a new post at an all-girls school only to discover the principal concealing a dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZRslwVszyWzwV4UiapJdkqzBFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108545'),
  ('890956522180337871', 'Evil Roy Slade', 1972, 'TV Movie, Western, Comedy', 'Jerry Paris, Sam Leavitt', 'Jerry Belson, Garry Marshall', 'John Astin, Mickey Rooney, Dick Shawn, Henry Gibson, Dom DeLuise, Edie Adams, Pamela Austin, Milton Berle', null, 'Orphaned and left in the desert as an infant, Evil Roy Slade grew up alone—save for his teddy bear—and mean. As an adult, he is notorious for being the "meanest villain in the West"—so he''s thrown for quite a loop when he falls for sweet schoolteacher Betsy Potter. There''s also Nelson L. Stool, a railroad tycoon, who, along with his dimwitted nephew Clifford (Henry Gibson), is trying to get revenge on Evil Roy Slade for robbing him.', 'Orphaned and left in the desert as an infant, Evil Roy Slade grew up alone—save for his teddy bear—and mean. As an adult, he is notorious for being the "meanest villain in the West"—so he''s thrown for quite a loop when he falls for sweet schoolteacher Betsy Potter. There''s also Nelson L. Stool, a railroad tycoon, who, along with his dimwitted nephew Clifford (Henry Gibson), is trying to get revenge on Evil Roy Slade for robbing him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkxLMe6jXhuyzQnNfCi4jGcvQ0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25109'),
  ('1011154022450479058', 'Evil Spawn', 1987, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kenneth J. Hall, Chris J. Condon, Fred Olen Ray', 'Kenneth J. Hall, Ted Newsom', 'Bobbie Bresee, Drew Godderis, Dawn Wildsmith, Fox Harris, John Terrence, Pamela Gilbert, Mark Anthony, Gary J. Levinson', null, 'Microbes are brought back to earth via a space probe from Venus. A scientist is using them in experiments on aging, but dies before the work is finished. His assistant approaches an aging actress who is being passed by for the lead roles, and she injects the serum hoping to become young again. When the actress is still passed up for the plum roles, the alien bacterium transforms her into a hideous bug-like alien resulting in a predictable attrition problem amongst her detractors.', 'Microbes are brought back to earth via a space probe from Venus. A scientist is using them in experiments on aging, but dies before the work is finished. His assistant approaches an aging actress who is being passed by for the lead roles, and she injects the serum hoping to become young again. When the actress is still passed up for the plum roles, the alien bacterium transforms her into a hideous bug-like alien resulting in a predictable attrition problem amongst her detractors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQXLHjXmaqW9KWKpwANJzxCEdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28338'),
  ('860254882802183864', 'Evil Things', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dominic Perez', 'Dominic Perez', 'Gail Cadden, Laurel Casillo, Morgan Hooper, Ryan Maslyn, Elyssa Mersdorf, Torrey Weiss, Leo''s Dog, Sarah E. Harwood', 'R', 'On January 9, 2009, five college students left New York City for a weekend in the country. 48 hours later, all five students have simply vanished without a trace. There were no leads and no evidence - until now.', 'On January 9, 2009, five college students left New York City for a weekend in the country. 48 hours later, all five students have simply vanished without a trace. There were no leads and no evidence - until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5J2PIAudfPaHMuAgs9tc29vbEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74555'),
  ('223973331927342542', 'Evil Thoughts', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Alfio Contini', 'Antonio Leonviola', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Edwige Fenech, Paolo Bonacelli, Piero Mazzarella, Yanti Somer, Mara Venier, Luc Merenda, Laura Bonaparte', null, 'Mario Marani is a well-respected lawyer in late 70s Milan, with a wonderful wife and a high social life. But Mario has a problem: every time he sees his wife talking to one of their friends he immediately visualises them in a hot affair. His jealousy spirals out of control, until a young man who hides inside their flat crosses his path.', 'Mario Marani is a well-respected lawyer in late 70s Milan, with a wonderful wife and a high social life. But Mario has a problem: every time he sees his wife talking to one of their friends he immediately visualises them in a hot affair. His jealousy spirals out of control, until a young man who hides inside their flat crosses his path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CEUCrwT1ENkVfpjZIx6GVjTTi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74187'),
  ('834512023463414708', 'Evil Toons', 1992, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Gary Graver, Fred Olen Ray, Jane E. B. Gurtiza', 'Fred Olen Ray', 'David Carradine, Monique Gabrielle, Arte Johnson, Dick Miller, Madison, Suzanne Ager, Barbara Dare, Don Dowe', 'R', 'Four sexy young girls are to clean an old house for the new owners. They get delivered an old book full of magic incantations, and while reading it they accidentally bring a cartoon character to life. The cartoon character likes the blood of young girls...', 'Four sexy young girls are to clean an old house for the new owners. They get delivered an old book full of magic incantations, and while reading it they accidentally bring a cartoon character to life. The cartoon character likes the blood of young girls...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCyBph5p7V09csf40hYrfVGoxy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30785'),
  ('554370111352480038', 'Evil Town', 1987, 'Horror', 'Mardi Rustam, Larry Spiegel, Peter S. Traynor', 'Richard Benson, Larry Spiegel, Robert Bassing', 'Greg Finley, Keith Hefner, Lynda Wiesmeier, Christie Houser, Noelle Harling, Jillian Kesner, Paul McCauley, Scott Hunter', 'R', 'A mad scientist seeks eternal youth by developing a drug derived from human pituitary glands, aided by the local townsfolk, who help abduct visitors to their town for his experiments.', 'A mad scientist seeks eternal youth by developing a drug derived from human pituitary glands, aided by the local townsfolk, who help abduct visitors to their town for his experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LvgaGxujar4cFp2Zq1MqKsYxU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200639'),
  ('410366313206055200', 'Evil Under the Sun', 1982, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Christopher Challis, Guy Hamilton, Andy Armstrong', 'Barry Sandler', 'Peter Ustinov, James Mason, Sylvia Miles, Roddy McDowall, Maggie Smith, Jane Birkin, Nicholas Clay, Diana Rigg', 'PG', 'An opulent beach resort provides a scenic background to this amusing whodunit as Poirot attempts to uncover the nefarious evildoer behind the strangling of a notorious stage star.', 'An opulent beach resort provides a scenic background to this amusing whodunit as Poirot attempts to uncover the nefarious evildoer behind the strangling of a notorious stage star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQNMZoVVURf9YyYiBTsrOTEKALH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4193'),
  ('97441003647333076', 'Evil Woman', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Adrián Caetano', 'Bruno Hernández, Adrián Caetano, Luciana Piantanida', 'Florencia Raggi, Rafael Ferro, Ana Celentano, Liz Solari, Juana Viale, Brenda Gandini, María Dupláa, Julián Krakov', null, 'Rosario is a paid assassin who kills men who mistreat or abuse women. When the police capture her, it''s the end of the myth. But Maria, a hysteric invalid, saves Rosario in exchange for a different job.', 'Rosario is a paid assassin who kills men who mistreat or abuse women. When the police capture her, it''s the end of the myth. But Maria, a hysteric invalid, saves Rosario in exchange for a different job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jqDObs4w3fJx8m33HEq6YTdOZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203316'),
  ('321928666954049378', 'Evil Words', 2003, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Éric Tessier, Denis-Noël Mostert', 'Patrick Senécal, Éric Tessier', 'Michel Côté, Patrick Huard, Catherine Florent, Albert Millaire, Jean L''Italien, Jacques Lavallée, Jean-Pierre Bergeron, Nicolas Canuel', null, 'One day, for no apparent reason, a cop kills 11 children. The same day, horror novelist Thomas Roy tries to commit suicide after cutting his fingers. At first glance, nothing seems to link the two events – until Dr. Paul Lacasse, a disillusioned psychiatrist, takes over the case. Prompted by his colleague Jeanne, a fan of Thomas Roy, Dr. Lacasse investigates the writer’s past. Hounded by a gossip columnist, Dr. Lacasse uncovers a series of troubling facts that bolster his convictions about the case. As he tries to reassemble the pieces of the puzzle in order to better treat the famous writer, Dr. Lacasse is dragged further and further into a series of events, with terrifying consequences.', 'One day, for no apparent reason, a cop kills 11 children. The same day, horror novelist Thomas Roy tries to commit suicide after cutting his fingers. At first glance, nothing seems to link the two events – until Dr. Paul Lacasse, a disillusioned psychiatrist, takes over the case. Prompted by his colleague Jeanne, a fan of Thomas Roy, Dr. Lacasse investigates the writer’s past. Hounded by a gossip columnist, Dr. Lacasse uncovers a series of troubling facts that bolster his convictions about the case. As he tries to reassemble the pieces of the puzzle in order to better treat the famous writer, Dr. Lacasse is dragged further and further into a series of events, with terrifying consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwH7X2Gaf07nNnTDfD2VvIMtN5D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50538'),
  ('137842656761812143', 'Evil''s Return', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Zhao Cong', 'Zhao Cong', 'Han Dong, Dou Guiyu, Song Haijie, Zhao Daixi', 'PG-13', 'During the chaotic final days of the Tang Dynasty, Wu Ling refuses to believe the rumors that his sister Wu Shuang has become a malevolent spirit. Using a forbidden resurrection technique, he brings her back to life and devises a cunning plan in the shadowy Temple of the Plague God to uncover the real villains and restore justice.', 'During the chaotic final days of the Tang Dynasty, Wu Ling refuses to believe the rumors that his sister Wu Shuang has become a malevolent spirit. Using a forbidden resurrection technique, he brings her back to life and devises a cunning plan in the shadowy Temple of the Plague God to uncover the real villains and restore justice.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fl6jzWopN47S1EC7g7bplMcG0adO.jpg', 'plex:movie:evils-return'),
  ('636281947968953065', 'Evilenko', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Grieco, Fabio Zamarion, Fabrizio Sergenti Castellani', 'David Grieco', 'Malcolm McDowell, Marton Csokas, Ronald Pickup, Frances Barber, John Benfield, Evgeniya Gladiy, Ihor Ciszkewycz, Fabrizio Sergenti Castellani', 'R', 'For years, Andrei Evilenko eluded the obsessive Detective Lesiev and the psychiatric profiler Aron Richter. Spurred on by his rabid fury at the gradual crumbling of his precious Soviet Union, Evilenko is a man who will live, die and kill as a communist.', 'For years, Andrei Evilenko eluded the obsessive Detective Lesiev and the psychiatric profiler Aron Richter. Spurred on by his rabid fury at the gradual crumbling of his precious Soviet Union, Evilenko is a man who will live, die and kill as a communist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbSjcMoWAijPqdhqhbBJd6WcYgQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46342'),
  ('892142691152240411', 'Evils of the Night', 1985, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Mardi Rustam, Richard Kanter, Bill Goodwin', 'Philip Dennis Connors, Mardi Rustam', 'Aldo Ray, Neville Brand, Tina Louise, John Carradine, Julie Newmar, Karrie Emerson, Bridget Holloman, David Hawk', 'R', 'Sex-hungry teens are kidnapped by auto mechanics, who take them to a rural hospital run by aliens who need their blood as the key to their own longevity.', 'Sex-hungry teens are kidnapped by auto mechanics, who take them to a rural hospital run by aliens who need their blood as the key to their own longevity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Jj9BVTc7SXPzftRyZ7ft3WRshQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67642'),
  ('746727585667086006', 'Evilspeak', 1981, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Eric Weston, Irv Goodnoff', 'Joseph Garofalo, Eric Weston', 'Clint Howard, R.G. Armstrong, Joe Cortese, Claude Earl Jones, Haywood Nelson, Don Stark, Charles Tyner, Hamilton Camp', 'R', 'Bullied by classmates, a pudgy military-school student fights back by computer with the devil.', 'Bullied by classmates, a pudgy military-school student fights back by computer with the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xoFmhndSAlNqPGd3nALD0cpmazx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39868'),
  ('393206809220239017', 'Evita', 1996, 'History, Drama', 'Darius Khondji, Alan Parker, Dennis Maguire', 'Alan Parker, Oliver Stone', 'Madonna, Antonio Banderas, Jonathan Pryce, Jimmy Nail, Victoria Sus, Julian Littman, Olga Merediz, Laura Pallas', 'PG', 'The hit musical based on the life of Evita Duarte, an Argentinian actress who eventually became the wife of Argentinian president Juan Perón, and the most beloved and hated woman in Argentina.', 'The hit musical based on the life of Evita Duarte, an Argentinian actress who eventually became the wife of Argentinian president Juan Perón, and the most beloved and hated woman in Argentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVdQatilUGMtB6sV4FXA7O473UD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8818'),
  ('826274322025547276', 'Evolution', 2001, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Ivan Reitman, Michael Chapman, Yuri Bartoli', 'Don Jakoby, David Weissman, David Diamond', 'David Duchovny, Julianne Moore, Orlando Jones, Seann William Scott, Ted Levine, Ty Burrell, Ethan Suplee, Michael Bower', 'PG-13', 'A comedy that follows the chaos that ensues when a meteor hits the Earth carrying alien life forms that give new meaning to the term "survival of the fittest." David Duchovny, Orlando Jones, Seann William Scott, and Julianne Moore are the only people standing between the aliens and world domination... which could be bad news for the Earth.', 'A comedy that follows the chaos that ensues when a meteor hits the Earth carrying alien life forms that give new meaning to the term "survival of the fittest." David Duchovny, Orlando Jones, Seann William Scott, and Julianne Moore are the only people standing between the aliens and world domination... which could be bad news for the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwIrP544LxJtXToLpzkEa08pIMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9397'),
  ('643280970230980246', 'Evolution', 2016, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Lucile Hadžihalilović, Manuel Dacosse', 'Geoff Cox', 'Max Brebant, Roxane Duran, Julie-Marie Parmentier, Mathieu Goldfeld, Nissim Renard, Pablo-Noé Etienne, Nathalie Legosles, Chantal Aimée', null, '11-year-old Nicolas lives with his mother in a seaside housing estate. The only place that ever sees any activity is the hospital. It is there that all the boys from the village are forced to undergo strange medical trials that attempt to disrupt the phases of evolution.', '11-year-old Nicolas lives with his mother in a seaside housing estate. The only place that ever sees any activity is the hospital. It is there that all the boys from the village are forced to undergo strange medical trials that attempt to disrupt the phases of evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLluKqBaGl0NLOFTtoXLXN9u9G6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330770'),
  ('811872828697305556', 'Evolution', 2021, 'Drama', 'Kornél Mundruczó, Yorick Le Saux', 'Kata Wéber, Kornél Mundruczó', 'Lili Monori, Annamária Láng, Goya Rego, Padmé Hamdemir', null, 'Tracing three generations of a family that is unable to process its past in a society still coping with the wounds of its history, from a surreal memory of World War II to modern-day Berlin.', 'Tracing three generations of a family that is unable to process its past in a society still coping with the wounds of its history, from a surreal memory of World War II to modern-day Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhgBQAeK2G92AjCCkQGLnaTd5Q8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836563'),
  ('266588306378266330', 'Evolution of a Filipino Family', 2004, 'Drama', 'Lav Diaz, Richard C. De Guzman, Paul Tañedo', 'Lav Diaz', 'Pen Medina, Ronnie Lazaro, Joel Torre, Angel Aquino, Elryan de Vera, Angie Ferro, Marife Necesito, Lui Manansala', null, 'Spanning from 1971 to 1987, in rural areas under the Marcos regime, a poor farming family struggle to overcome challenges brought on by corruption and greed for power.', 'Spanning from 1971 to 1987, in rural areas under the Marcos regime, a poor farming family struggle to overcome challenges brought on by corruption and greed for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Y5fOWPfjuKvjagRuIIF2fC1EGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163957'),
  ('896841399920771912', 'Evolver', 1995, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Mark Rosman, Jacques Haitkin', 'Mark Rosman', 'Ethan Embry, Cassidy Rae, William H. Macy, Nassira Nicola, Chance Quinn, Cindy Pickett, John de Lancie, Paul Dooley', 'R', 'A teenage boy gets a robotic opponent after winning a laser tag contest; however the robot is not what it seems!', 'A teenage boy gets a robotic opponent after winning a laser tag contest; however the robot is not what it seems!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0cNbTMqJF4hZqF8FjV5aVSatsY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48038'),
  ('494977843295847072', 'Ewa Wants to Sleep', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Tadeusz Chmielewski, Jerzy Stawicki, Jerzy Zarzycki', 'Andrzej Czekalski, Tadeusz Chmielewski', 'Barbara Lass, Stanisław Mikulski, Stefan Bartik, Ludwik Benoit, Maria Kaniewska, Roman Kłosowski, Wacław Kowalski, Gustaw Lutkiewicz', null, 'Ewa Bonecka, a young student about to start school in a new place finds herself without a place to sleep after she is declined a room in a women-only hotel. Helped by a pleasant policeman, Piotr, she tries to find a lodging in the strange town full of thieves and petty troublemakers.', 'Ewa Bonecka, a young student about to start school in a new place finds herself without a place to sleep after she is declined a room in a women-only hotel. Helped by a pleasant policeman, Piotr, she tries to find a lodging in the strange town full of thieves and petty troublemakers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noOp6OOcrFG2kVHvfqUa4WwGVRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89900'),
  ('930939830601787192', 'Ewoks: The Battle for Endor', 1985, 'Adventure, Family, TV Movie, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Jim Wheat, Ken Wheat, Isidore Mankofsky', 'Jim Wheat, Ken Wheat', 'Wilford Brimley, Warwick Davis, Aubree Miller, Siân Phillips, Carel Struycken, Niki Botelho, Paul Gleason, Eric Walker', 'NR', 'The army of the Marauders, led by King Terak and the witch Charal, attack the Ewoks village, killing Cindel''s family. Cindel and the Ewok Wicket escape and meet Teek in the forest, a naughty and very fast animal. Teek takes them to a house in which an old man, Noa, lives. Like Cindel, he also crashed with his Starcruiser on Endor. Together they fight Terak and Charal.', 'The army of the Marauders, led by King Terak and the witch Charal, attack the Ewoks village, killing Cindel''s family. Cindel and the Ewok Wicket escape and meet Teek in the forest, a naughty and very fast animal. Teek takes them to a house in which an old man, Noa, lives. Like Cindel, he also crashed with his Starcruiser on Endor. Together they fight Terak and Charal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntgKdekb7xMKscyh2Hei706LBLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10372'),
  ('1050094896389325946', 'Ex', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fausto Brizzi, Marcello Montarsi, Alessandro Pascuzzo', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Marco Martani, Fausto Brizzi', 'Claudio Bisio, Nancy Brilli, Cristiana Capotondi, Cécile Cassel, Fabio De Luigi, Alessandro Gassmann, Claudia Gerini, Flavio Insinna', null, 'Six people struggling with their relationship, or lack thereof, cross paths with their respective exes — and discover they might still harbor feelings for each other.', 'Six people struggling with their relationship, or lack thereof, cross paths with their respective exes — and discover they might still harbor feelings for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQ5R1mZMaAT7wuyytBHxUeXuzZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15681'),
  ('1148059906273803449', 'Ex 2: Still Friends', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giorgio Melidoni, Matteo Vicario', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Enrico Brignano, Tosca D''Aquino, Anna Foglietta, Alessandro Gassmann, Teresa Mannino, Ricky Memphis, Gabriella Pession, Paolo Ruffini', null, 'Marco encounters his ex-girlfriend Consueloand starts seeing her without telling that he has just married. Antonio is an MP and during his European trip he has a love affair with elegant Olga who has a big secret to hide. Recently-jilted Fabio is mistaken for psychiatrist by a beautiful girl Valentina with whom he falls in love. A divorce lawyer Sandra is romantically attracted to her client''s husband Massimo.', 'Marco encounters his ex-girlfriend Consueloand starts seeing her without telling that he has just married. Antonio is an MP and during his European trip he has a love affair with elegant Olga who has a big secret to hide. Recently-jilted Fabio is mistaken for psychiatrist by a beautiful girl Valentina with whom he falls in love. A divorce lawyer Sandra is romantically attracted to her client''s husband Massimo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oHibOvv8snMlPe9De0GBChPlLO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79395'),
  ('499425010436944154', 'Ex Libris: The New York Public Library', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Frederick Wiseman, John Davey', null, 'Richard Dawkins, Elvis Costello, Patti Smith, Ta-Nehisi Coates, Edmund de Waal', null, 'A documentary about how a dominant cultural and demographic institution both sustains their traditional activities and adapts to the digital revolution.', 'A documentary about how a dominant cultural and demographic institution both sustains their traditional activities and adapts to the digital revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UAtolZFuOFYqUpHcDYamsVKWvb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446173'),
  ('593879654526924094', 'Ex Machina', 2015, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Alex Garland, Rob Hardy, Ketan Waikar', 'Alex Garland', 'Domhnall Gleeson, Alicia Vikander, Oscar Isaac, Sonoya Mizuno, Corey Johnson, Claire Selby, Symara A. Templeman, Gana Bayarsaikhan', 'R', 'Caleb, a coder at the world''s largest internet company, wins a competition to spend a week at a private mountain retreat belonging to Nathan, the reclusive CEO of the company. But when Caleb arrives at the remote location he finds that he will have to participate in a strange and fascinating experiment in which he must interact with the world''s first true artificial intelligence, housed in the body of a beautiful robot girl.', 'Caleb, a coder at the world''s largest internet company, wins a competition to spend a week at a private mountain retreat belonging to Nathan, the reclusive CEO of the company. But when Caleb arrives at the remote location he finds that he will have to participate in a strange and fascinating experiment in which he must interact with the world''s first true artificial intelligence, housed in the body of a beautiful robot girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmJW8IAKHKxFNiUnoDR7JfsK7Rp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264660'),
  ('1036289163730037893', 'Ex-Files', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tian Yusheng', 'Tian Yusheng', 'Han Geng, Yao Xingtong, Zhang Hanyu, Ryan Zheng, Liu Yan, Wang Likun, Li Yu, Joe Easy', null, 'Meng Yun, a former womanizer, meets and falls in love with Xia Lu and they become a couple. Their exes, however, have different ideas.', 'Meng Yun, a former womanizer, meets and falls in love with Xia Lu and they become a couple. Their exes, however, have different ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VNHIRsVejn6EbLW6R4HrXQu8KX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275579'),
  ('312189610439780547', 'Ex-Files 2: The Backup Strikes Back', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Tian Yusheng', null, 'Ryan Zheng, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Wang Chuanjun, Zhang Dianlun, Zhang Yixing, Qiqi, Sabrina Qiu', null, 'A woman seeks revenge on the man pretending to fall in love with her to gain professional advantage.', 'A woman seeks revenge on the man pretending to fall in love with her to gain professional advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkJPGYaZchi0mPQ3GYDSKHJNhKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366686'),
  ('65476875083895208', 'Ex-Lady', 1933, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Florey, Tony Gaudio', 'David Boehm', 'Bette Davis, Gene Raymond, Frank McHugh, Monroe Owsley, Claire Dodd, Kay Strozzi, Ferdinand Gottschalk, Alphonse Ethier', 'NR', 'Although free spirit Helen Bauer does not believe in marriage, she consents to marry Don, but his infidelities cause her to also take on a lover.', 'Although free spirit Helen Bauer does not believe in marriage, she consents to marry Don, but his infidelities cause her to also take on a lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYKtoVtx0yRHzgaGOhh88Dt9JYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52228'),
  ('131837220588924533', 'Ex-Shaman', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Luiz Bolognesi', null, null, null, 'Ever since their first contact with the Western world in 1969 the Paiter Suruí, an indigenous people living in the Amazon basin, have been exposed to sweeping social changes. Smartphones, gas, electricity, medicines, weapons and social media have now replaced their traditional way of life. Illness is a risk for a community increasingly unable to isolate itself from the modernization brought by white people or the power of the church. Ethnocide threatens to destroy their soul. With dogged persistence, Perpera, a former shaman, is searching for a way to restore the old vitality to his village.', 'Ever since their first contact with the Western world in 1969 the Paiter Suruí, an indigenous people living in the Amazon basin, have been exposed to sweeping social changes. Smartphones, gas, electricity, medicines, weapons and social media have now replaced their traditional way of life. Illness is a risk for a community increasingly unable to isolate itself from the modernization brought by white people or the power of the church. Ethnocide threatens to destroy their soul. With dogged persistence, Perpera, a former shaman, is searching for a way to restore the old vitality to his village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCBs4bd4D9ZDvB7MOtWhsIy3tdr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493661'),
  ('148257181276519546', 'Exam', 2009, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Stuart Hazeldine, Tim Wooster', 'Stuart Hazeldine', 'Luke Mably, Chukwudi Iwuji, Adar Beck, Jimi Mistry, Nathalie Cox, Pollyanna McIntosh, Gemma Chan, John Lloyd Fillingham', 'NR', 'Eight talented candidates have reached the final stage of selection to join the ranks of a mysterious and powerful corporation. Entering a windowless room, where an armed guard keeps watch, they are given 80 minutes to answer one simple question.', 'Eight talented candidates have reached the final stage of selection to join the ranks of a mysterious and powerful corporation. Entering a windowless room, where an armed guard keeps watch, they are given 80 minutes to answer one simple question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1J2zBCyOQJKsQipqJ0qXERC1Ma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29917'),
  ('953570406892332117', 'Examined Life', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Astra Taylor, John M. Tran', 'Astra Taylor', 'Cornel West, Judith Butler, Slavoj Žižek, Peter Singer, Michael Hardt, Kwame Anthony Appiah, Martha C. Nussbaum, Avital Ronell', null, 'Examined Life pulls philosophy out of academic journals and classrooms, and puts it back on the streets. Offering privileged moments with great thinkers from fields ranging from moral philosophy to cultural theory, Examined Life reveals philosophy''s power to transform the way we see the world around us and imagine our place in it.', 'Examined Life pulls philosophy out of academic journals and classrooms, and puts it back on the streets. Offering privileged moments with great thinkers from fields ranging from moral philosophy to cultural theory, Examined Life reveals philosophy''s power to transform the way we see the world around us and imagine our place in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/safs2eMlCyHo0J9qtRKGNzXTRkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24566'),
  ('370005721482312', 'Exams at Any Odd Time', 1974, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ivanka Grubcheva', 'Bratya Mormarevi', 'Dimitar Ganev, Wojciech Todorow, Ani Bakalova, Georgi Rusev, Yanko Yankov, Ognian Zheliazkov, Nikolay Teoharov, Mihail Lazarow', null, 'Two novels united by common characters and a never-settled problem: the clash between sincerity of children and the heartless pragmatism and ambitions of grown-ups.', 'Two novels united by common characters and a never-settled problem: the clash between sincerity of children and the heartless pragmatism and ambitions of grown-ups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ienPawrNz7r7kDkTiWqiGAc00kT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266945'),
  ('440902629356711077', 'Excalibur', 1981, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'John Boorman, Alex Thomson, Barry Blackmore', 'John Boorman, Rospo Pallenberg', 'Nigel Terry, Nicol Williamson, Helen Mirren, Nicholas Clay, Paul Geoffrey, Cherie Lunghi, Robert Addie, Gabriel Byrne', 'R', 'Arthur fulfills his fate by bringing together the Knights of the Round Table at Camelot and unifying the country. However, this flawed monarch faces greater tests ahead in pursuit of love, the Holy Grail, and his nation''s survival.', 'Arthur fulfills his fate by bringing together the Knights of the Round Table at Camelot and unifying the country. However, this flawed monarch faces greater tests ahead in pursuit of love, the Holy Grail, and his nation''s survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTWF6zkr5mUOnheowKODIijWYcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11527'),
  ('485404994698002811', 'Excavator', 2017, 'Drama', 'Lee Ju-hyoung', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Uhm Tae-woong, Kim Kyung-ik, Jeong Se-hyeong, Jo Deok-jae, Jo Young-jin, Kim Jung-pal, Cho Won-hee, Shin Yoo-ram', null, '20 years after discharge from the army and now an excavator driver, a former paratrooper who had been mobilized to suppress the May 18th Democratic Uprising in Korea in 1980, happens to find a skull in the ground one day. Driving his excavator, he pays visits to his former superiors one by one and realizes they were all both assailants and victims of the times.', '20 years after discharge from the army and now an excavator driver, a former paratrooper who had been mobilized to suppress the May 18th Democratic Uprising in Korea in 1980, happens to find a skull in the ground one day. Driving his excavator, he pays visits to his former superiors one by one and realizes they were all both assailants and victims of the times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq9h2czjuPZKQXaNuTKBME7xReg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469203'),
  ('725902485615463163', 'Excellent Cadavers', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller, History, TV Movie, Crime', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Alessio Gelsini Torresi, Fred Schuler', 'Peter Pruce', 'Chazz Palminteri, F. Murray Abraham, Anna Galiena, Andy Luotto, Lina Sastri, Arnoldo Foà, Ivo Garrani, Gianmarco Tognazzi', 'R', 'Palermo, Sicily, 1984. Examining magistrate Giovanni Falcone allies with Tomasso Buscetta, a former mobster, to defeat the clan of Corleone, the ruthless Mafia faction that rules Cosa Nostra with an iron hand, cruelly eliminating all those who dare to oppose its immense power: other criminals, policemen, judges, even innocent civilians. One of them wants revenge, the other wants justice. But only one can survive such an unequal fight.', 'Palermo, Sicily, 1984. Examining magistrate Giovanni Falcone allies with Tomasso Buscetta, a former mobster, to defeat the clan of Corleone, the ruthless Mafia faction that rules Cosa Nostra with an iron hand, cruelly eliminating all those who dare to oppose its immense power: other criminals, policemen, judges, even innocent civilians. One of them wants revenge, the other wants justice. But only one can survive such an unequal fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PGKekbYuushvovzHCEl4X51sfl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19189'),
  ('266219366368876358', 'Excess Baggage', 1997, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Marco Brambilla, Christine Derek, Bridget McGuire', 'Max D. Adams', 'Alicia Silverstone, Benicio del Toro, Christopher Walken, Jack Thompson, Harry Connick Jr., Nicholas Turturro, Michael Bowen, Robert Wisden', 'PG-13', 'A rich brat fakes her own kidnapping, but in the process ends up locked in the trunk of a car that gets stolen.', 'A rich brat fakes her own kidnapping, but in the process ends up locked in the trunk of a car that gets stolen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfKaCA32iSkEQiu37drvIAZWZFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26180'),
  ('1047185884731027775', 'Excessive Force', 1993, 'Action', 'Jon Hess, Donald M. Morgan', 'Thomas Ian Griffith', 'Thomas Ian Griffith, Lance Henriksen, James Earl Jones, Burt Young, Tony Todd, Antoni Corone, Charlotte Lewis, Carl Ciarfalio', 'R', 'Chicago policeman Terry McCain is determined to put away mobster Sal DiMarco, who always gets acquitted on technicalities. While monitoring a drug sale, a shootout ensues, and one of Terry''s fellow officers gets away with $3 million of Sal''s money. Suspecting Terry took the cash, the mobster sends his men to kill Terry''s brother, Dylan, and partner, Frankie Hawkins. Furious, Terry sets out to take his revenge by any means necessary.', 'Chicago policeman Terry McCain is determined to put away mobster Sal DiMarco, who always gets acquitted on technicalities. While monitoring a drug sale, a shootout ensues, and one of Terry''s fellow officers gets away with $3 million of Sal''s money. Suspecting Terry took the cash, the mobster sends his men to kill Terry''s brother, Dylan, and partner, Frankie Hawkins. Furious, Terry sets out to take his revenge by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DzUkmxUAdlq993UpV0Cw5SiPH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24227'),
  ('479647748535865548', 'Excessive Force II: Force on Force', 1995, 'Action', 'Russ Brandt, Jonathan Winfrey', 'Mark Sevi', 'Stacie Randall, Dan Gauthier, Jay Patterson, John Mese, John Sanderford, Henry Brown, Tom Wright, Dan Lauria', null, 'Stacie Randall plays Harley, a Special Forces agent-turned-investigator, who arrives on the scene of an apparent mob hit to help the local police. In actuality, she''s hunting down Francis Lydell, her former C.O. and lover, who shot her in the head when she turned down his offer to become part of the freelance assassination squad he was forming. Ignoring the need for surgery to remove the bullet fragment which still causes her to have occasional bouts of disorientation, she continues her quest to bring down Lydell before he has the chance to kill a Mafia informant being held at the police station. Written by Chris Holland', 'Stacie Randall plays Harley, a Special Forces agent-turned-investigator, who arrives on the scene of an apparent mob hit to help the local police. In actuality, she''s hunting down Francis Lydell, her former C.O. and lover, who shot her in the head when she turned down his offer to become part of the freelance assassination squad he was forming. Ignoring the need for surgery to remove the bullet fragment which still causes her to have occasional bouts of disorientation, she continues her quest to bring down Lydell before he has the chance to kill a Mafia informant being held at the police station. Written by Chris Holland', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9waKuGkN0gFUy0DBo9uYMhX4zfw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86848'),
  ('723764189707420155', 'Exchange Wife 2', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lee Si-young', null, 'Lee Soo, Do Hee, Jo Wan-jin, Min Jo-ah, Sang Woo', null, 'Kyeong-soo, an art dealer who specializes in painting, goes to evaluate the requested painting and accidentally damages it. Chang-in, the owner of the painting, suggests one thing from Kyung-soo, who was at a loss.', 'Kyeong-soo, an art dealer who specializes in painting, goes to evaluate the requested painting and accidentally damages it. Chang-in, the owner of the painting, suggests one thing from Kyung-soo, who was at a loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZzZUuMNoCRdPpNrSKYZSvRzc5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231767'),
  ('1096740922243502094', 'Exchanged', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Urdapilleta', 'Nicolás Saad, Almudena Vázquez', 'Silvia Navarro, Michelle Rodríguez, Mauricio Islas, Alejandro Calva, Kaled Acab, Cassandra Iturralde, Erick Chapa, Ana Gonzalez Bello', null, 'One enchanted night, during a meteor shower, young Sebastián made a heartfelt wish: for his loving nanny, Lupe, to become his mother, for her warmth and care were what he longed for, unlike his busy mother, Paola. The stars listened, and in their mysterious way, granted his wish, exchanging the roles of the two women, leading to a whimsical adventure full of unexpected laughs and heartwarming chaos.', 'One enchanted night, during a meteor shower, young Sebastián made a heartfelt wish: for his loving nanny, Lupe, to become his mother, for her warmth and care were what he longed for, unlike his busy mother, Paola. The stars listened, and in their mysterious way, granted his wish, exchanging the roles of the two women, leading to a whimsical adventure full of unexpected laughs and heartwarming chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnvUGHyV21rJOG9KyJojJNHg3nA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1362961'),
  ('65569478791828879', 'Excision', 2012, 'Drama, Horror, Comedy', 'Richard Bates Jr., Itay Gross, James Cooney', 'Richard Bates Jr.', 'AnnaLynne McCord, Traci Lords, Ariel Winter, Roger Bart, Jeremy Sumpter, John Waters, Malcolm McDowell, Marlee Matlin', 'NR', 'A disturbed, delusional high-school student with aspirations of a career in medicine goes to extremes to earn the approval of her controlling mother.', 'A disturbed, delusional high-school student with aspirations of a career in medicine goes to extremes to earn the approval of her controlling mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aLgB6FTQlNanER0RpckbKdwyh9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84194'),
  ('621304943729193264', 'Excitation', 1977, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jean Garrett, Carlos Reichenbach', 'Ody Fraga, Jean Garrett', 'Kate Hansen, Flávio Galvão, Betty Saddy, Zilda Mayo, Liana Duval, Abrahão Farc, João Paulo Ramalho, Carlos Meni', null, 'Helena and Renato are a couple who leave behind the big city to live in the comfort of a beach house and help Helena recover from her nervous crises. But soon she begins to suffer from increasingly worrying hallucinations, and the house’s mystery appliances begin to come to life. Is it all real or in her head?', 'Helena and Renato are a couple who leave behind the big city to live in the comfort of a beach house and help Helena recover from her nervous crises. But soon she begins to suffer from increasingly worrying hallucinations, and the house’s mystery appliances begin to come to life. Is it all real or in her head?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vVG9gRFzkRb8y6ligs2t2EgqBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195165'),
