  ('741874894714082166', 'Excuse Me Darling, But Lucas Loved Me', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Félix Sabroso, Dunia Ayaso, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Félix Sabroso, Dunia Ayaso', 'Jordi Mollà, Pepón Nieto, Roberto Correcher, Lucina Gil, María Pujalte, Esperanza Roy, Gracia Olayo, Ferran Rañé', 'NR', 'Three gay roommates must find a fourth to share their flat after blowing their rent on a stripper who won''t strip. In walks tall, sexy Lucas, the answer to their current problem and more than one of their dreams. But when they return home one night to find Lucas dead, and each tells his own real or imagined story about his relationship with Lucas, and they discover that they all had reasons to do him in.', 'Three gay roommates must find a fourth to share their flat after blowing their rent on a stripper who won''t strip. In walks tall, sexy Lucas, the answer to their current problem and more than one of their dreams. But when they return home one night to find Lucas dead, and each tells his own real or imagined story about his relationship with Lucas, and they discover that they all had reasons to do him in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGATOJBZtmV7jz7L78D7aRpMXx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80145'),
  ('807798870026548480', 'Execution in Autumn', 1972, 'Drama', 'Lee Hsing, Cheng-ying Lai', 'Chang Yung-hsiang', 'Tang Pao-Yun, Ou Wei, Ko Hsiang-Ting, Fu Pi-Hui, Wu Chia-Chi, Hsiang Li, Tsui Fu-Sheng, Chen Hui-Lou', null, 'Peigang, his family''s only son for three generations running, is to be executed on account of larceny, but not without the intervention of his grandmother.', 'Peigang, his family''s only son for three generations running, is to be executed on account of larceny, but not without the intervention of his grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIfz33ie3mPdYEfOCdrm1v1AtKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176633'),
  ('617232379192311779', 'Execution Squad', 1972, 'Crime, Drama', 'Steno, Mario Forges Davanzati, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Steno, Lucio De Caro', 'Enrico Maria Salerno, Mariangela Melato, Mario Adorf, Franco Fabrizi, Cyril Cusack, Laura Belli, Jürgen Drews, Corrado Gaipa', null, 'Bertone is a moderately honest homicide cop. Unfortunately, the court system is so inept and corrupt that many more-or-less honest policemen have begun taking the law into their own hands. Between his efforts to thwart the growth of crime and to control his vengeful co-workers, homicide-chief Bertone has his hands full', 'Bertone is a moderately honest homicide cop. Unfortunately, the court system is so inept and corrupt that many more-or-less honest policemen have begun taking the law into their own hands. Between his efforts to thwart the growth of crime and to control his vengeful co-workers, homicide-chief Bertone has his hands full', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lD0oLGX6zckUcO9zEwKwGyzy4nL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79572'),
  ('1116109356345061198', 'Executioners', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Johnnie To, Lo Kim-Wah', 'Susan Chan Suk-Yin', 'Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Michelle Yeoh, Maggie Cheung, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Takeshi Kaneshiro, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Paul Chun Pui', 'R', 'In a post-nuclear world, three superpowered women fight an evil genius controlling the government and the water supply.', 'In a post-nuclear world, three superpowered women fight an evil genius controlling the government and the water supply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJZntaDcv7C2V4VTV5Ch4idjq7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58311'),
  ('51950648647943140', 'Executioners from Shaolin', 1977, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Law Wan-Shing, Huang Pa-Ching', 'Ni Kuang', 'Lo Lieh, Lee Hoi-Sang, Chen Kuan-Tai, Cheng Kang-Yeh, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Chiang Tao, John Cheung Ng-Long, Tin Ching', 'R', 'After the destruction of the Temple, a Shaolin disciple devotes years to mastering the Tiger style in order to defeat the martial arts master who killed his teacher. His wife, a Crane style specialist, has a feeling one style won''t be enough.', 'After the destruction of the Temple, a Shaolin disciple devotes years to mastering the Tiger style in order to defeat the martial arts master who killed his teacher. His wife, a Crane style specialist, has a feeling one style won''t be enough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PJyuHP1nNDMyJDZMpZWpwEduSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22124'),
  ('165491802873124616', 'Executive Action', 1973, 'Thriller', 'David Miller, Robert Steadman', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Burt Lancaster, Robert Ryan, Will Geer, Gilbert Green, John Anderson, Paul Carr, Colby Chester, Ed Lauter', 'PG', 'Rogue intelligence agents, right-wing politicians, greedy capitalists, and free-lance assassins plot and carry out the JFK assassination in this speculative agitprop.', 'Rogue intelligence agents, right-wing politicians, greedy capitalists, and free-lance assassins plot and carry out the JFK assassination in this speculative agitprop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdULVfaVkGVJZ0XRjqgqtoPVWgW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29142'),
  ('179421974971312913', 'Executive Decision', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Alex Thomson, Stuart Baird, Steve Perry', 'John Thomas, Jim Thomas', 'Kurt Russell, Steven Seagal, Halle Berry, John Leguizamo, Oliver Platt, Joe Morton, David Suchet, BD Wong', 'R', 'Terrorists hijack a 747 inbound to Washington D.C., demanding the release of their imprisoned leader. Intelligence expert David Grant suspects another reason and he is soon the reluctant member of a special assault team that is assigned to intercept the plane and hijackers.', 'Terrorists hijack a 747 inbound to Washington D.C., demanding the release of their imprisoned leader. Intelligence expert David Grant suspects another reason and he is soon the reluctant member of a special assault team that is assigned to intercept the plane and hijackers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLjXkFr9fHlWzRVwu1T31QSVHRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2320'),
  ('1041370784900231985', 'Executive Koala', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Minoru Kawasaki, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Minoru Kawasaki', '''Hurricane'' Ryu Hariken, Eiichi Kikichi, Arthur Kuroda, Hironobu Nomura, Hideki Saijo, Hitomi Takashima, Shoko Nakagawa', null, 'Minoru Kawasaki directs this comedic psychological thriller that follows a large koala as he looks for help from several of his closest friends, which include a giant rabbit and frog. A hardworking executive at a pickle company, Mr. Tamura stands out from other employees because he''s a koala bear who stands six feet tall. When his human girlfriend is found murdered, the blackout-prone Tamura goes on the run and tries to solve the mystery.', 'Minoru Kawasaki directs this comedic psychological thriller that follows a large koala as he looks for help from several of his closest friends, which include a giant rabbit and frog. A hardworking executive at a pickle company, Mr. Tamura stands out from other employees because he''s a koala bear who stands six feet tall. When his human girlfriend is found murdered, the blackout-prone Tamura goes on the run and tries to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5oY9UCyL1kidHGfyhANSjcn31b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56255'),
  ('369383026972005913', 'Executive Order', 2022, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lázaro Ramos, Bartô Luiz, Adrian Teijido', 'Aldri Anunciação, Elísio Lopes Jr.', 'Alfred Enoch, Taís Araújo, Seu Jorge, Adriana Esteves, Renata Sorrah, Diva Guimarães, Hilton Cobra, William Russell', null, 'In a dystopian future, the Brazilian government decrees a measure that forces black citizens to migrate to Africa in an attempt to return to their origins. Seeing themselves in the center of terror, two cousins take refuge in an apartment, where they debate social and racial issues, and share the same yearning for the change of country.', 'In a dystopian future, the Brazilian government decrees a measure that forces black citizens to migrate to Africa in an attempt to return to their origins. Seeing themselves in the center of terror, two cousins take refuge in an apartment, where they debate social and racial issues, and share the same yearning for the change of country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wdCvVsQGf76QOWDqcrgobLjWLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614282'),
  ('130049268027683917', 'Executive Protection', 2001, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Anders Nilsson', 'Joakim Hansson, Anders Nilsson', 'Jakob Eklund, Samuel Fröler, Alexandra Rapaport, Marie Richardson, Per Burell, Krister Henriksson, Christoph M. Ohrt, Lia Boysen', null, 'After causing a commotion with his last assignment, Falk has been given a desk job, which hardly agrees with his personality, and he ends up accepting an offer from an old friend to buy into a private investigation agency. Another friend of Falk''s, Sven, purchased a business in Estonia, and when local gangsters attempted to pressure him into paying protection money, Sven retained the services of Nikolaus Lehmann, a burly private eye, to throw them off his trail. However, Lehmann does his job all too well, murdering the racketeers, and then threatening Sven and his family. With no where else to turn, Sven asks Falk to help him deal with the crazed Lehmann; Falk agrees, but soon realizes he''s dealing with a more dangerous man than he imagined when Lehmann kidnaps Falk''s wife Jeanette, and then releases her with a time bomb locked around her neck, demanding that Falk hand over ownership of his detective agency to Lehmann.', 'After causing a commotion with his last assignment, Falk has been given a desk job, which hardly agrees with his personality, and he ends up accepting an offer from an old friend to buy into a private investigation agency. Another friend of Falk''s, Sven, purchased a business in Estonia, and when local gangsters attempted to pressure him into paying protection money, Sven retained the services of Nikolaus Lehmann, a burly private eye, to throw them off his trail. However, Lehmann does his job all too well, murdering the racketeers, and then threatening Sven and his family. With no where else to turn, Sven asks Falk to help him deal with the crazed Lehmann; Falk agrees, but soon realizes he''s dealing with a more dangerous man than he imagined when Lehmann kidnaps Falk''s wife Jeanette, and then releases her with a time bomb locked around her neck, demanding that Falk hand over ownership of his detective agency to Lehmann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnLVCqgSg9tEpB3QSmtpyMiwOVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21040'),
  ('516891870248244699', 'Executive Suite', 1954, 'Drama', 'Robert Wise, George J. Folsey, George Rhein', 'Ernest Lehman', 'William Holden, June Allyson, Barbara Stanwyck, Fredric March, Walter Pidgeon, Shelley Winters, Paul Douglas, Louis Calhern', 'NR', 'When the head of a large manufacturing firm dies suddenly from a stroke, his vice-presidents vie to see who will replace him.', 'When the head of a large manufacturing firm dies suddenly from a stroke, his vice-presidents vie to see who will replace him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ5LdPOkRwlTTl3ocObuNGKB1of.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43336'),
  ('1090062976029222145', 'Executive Target', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Joseph Merhi, Ken Blakey, Cole S. McKay', 'Dayton Callie, Joe Hart', 'Michael Madsen, Roy Scheider, Keith David, Angie Everhart, Dayton Callie, Kathy Christopherson, Gareth Williams, Robert Miano', 'R', 'His wife held hostage, a stunt driver is forced to drive a getaway car in a plot to kidnap the President from a motorcade.', 'His wife held hostage, a stunt driver is forced to drive a getaway car in a plot to kidnap the President from a motorcade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ct6PWs5NimnyFVvdQzkfYOLuK0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134458'),
  ('527658142131842080', 'Exeter', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Marcus Nispel, Eric Treml, Gregory J. Smith', 'Kirsten Elms', 'Stephen Lang, Kelly Blatz, Brittany Curran, Gage Golightly, Nick Nicotera, Michael Ormsby, Brett Dier, Kevin Chapman', 'R', 'During an all-night, drug-fueled party at an abandoned asylum known for the horrific treatment of its patients, a group of ordinary teens decide to experiment with the occult, mysteriously leading to a violent possession. In an effort to find help, the group rushes to escape, only to find themselves locked inside with no means of communication. Tempers flare, trusts are broken and in attempt to save one of their friends possessed by the demon, the amateurs try to perform an exorcism. Instead of solving the problem, and unbeknownst to them, they unleash an even more powerful and vengeful spirit, one with a distinct motive and which wants them all dead. The teen''s only chance of survival is to uncover the asylum''s deep mysteries and find a way out before it''s too late.', 'During an all-night, drug-fueled party at an abandoned asylum known for the horrific treatment of its patients, a group of ordinary teens decide to experiment with the occult, mysteriously leading to a violent possession. In an effort to find help, the group rushes to escape, only to find themselves locked inside with no means of communication. Tempers flare, trusts are broken and in attempt to save one of their friends possessed by the demon, the amateurs try to perform an exorcism. Instead of solving the problem, and unbeknownst to them, they unleash an even more powerful and vengeful spirit, one with a distinct motive and which wants them all dead. The teen''s only chance of survival is to uncover the asylum''s deep mysteries and find a way out before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFgrMSOSnsVP9tzqVFNqDt8rvKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226458'),
  ('263588252917701293', 'Exhibit A', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Dom Rotheroe, Rob Hardy', 'Dom Rotheroe', 'Bradley Cole, Oliver Lee, Brittany Ashworth, Angela Forrest, Jason Allen', null, 'Exhibit A tells the timely story of a normal family disintegrating under financial pressure. All is not as it seems as the King family go about their day-to-day lives oblivious of the horror to come. Dad Andy (Bradley Cole) is nursing a secret that ultimately leads to terrible consequences for them all. We witness these chilling events unfold through daughter Judith''s video camera, which subsequently becomes Exhibit A.', 'Exhibit A tells the timely story of a normal family disintegrating under financial pressure. All is not as it seems as the King family go about their day-to-day lives oblivious of the horror to come. Dad Andy (Bradley Cole) is nursing a secret that ultimately leads to terrible consequences for them all. We witness these chilling events unfold through daughter Judith''s video camera, which subsequently becomes Exhibit A.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rh0TE5qEKZ6LuIDSOEvU8jA7YT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49341'),
  ('461215739660431641', 'Exhibiting Forgiveness', 2024, 'Drama', 'Titus Kaphar, Lachlan Milne, Marc Bowen', 'Titus Kaphar', 'André Holland, Andra Day, John Earl Jelks, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Daniel Michael Barriere, Ian Foreman, Matthew Elam, Jaime Ray Newman', 'R', 'A Black artist on the path to success is derailed by an unexpected visit from his estranged father, a recovering addict desperate to reconcile. Together, they struggle and learn that forgetting might be a greater challenge than forgiving.', 'A Black artist on the path to success is derailed by an unexpected visit from his estranged father, a recovering addict desperate to reconcile. Together, they struggle and learn that forgetting might be a greater challenge than forgiving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGlvpqgmyJovSA0Ny0D0gvUZFV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1203653'),
