  ('207972778174955939', 'Exile', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Visar Morina, Matteo Cocco', 'Visar Morina', 'Mišel Matičević, Sandra Hüller, Rainer Bock, Thomas Mraz, Flonja Kodheli, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Stephan Grossmann, Uwe Preuss', null, 'Exil tells the story of a chemical engineer of foreign origin who feels discriminated and bullied at work, plunging him into an identity crisis.', 'Exil tells the story of a chemical engineer of foreign origin who feels discriminated and bullied at work, plunging him into an identity crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIeSCnR65wRTk01OOUrEagriECF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570358'),
  ('440122493764895662', 'Exiled', 1998, 'TV Movie, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Christopher Swartout, Peter Leto, Nina Jack', null, 'Chris Noth, Dabney Coleman, Dana Eskelson, John Fiore, Dann Florek, Paul Guilfoyle, Ice-T, Costas Mandylor', null, 'NYPD Detective Mike Logan, who was reassigned to Staten Island after punching a corrupt politician, takes on a grisly murder case. When the investigation leads him back to the 27th Precinct, Logan sees a chance to resurrect his flailing career and be reinstated as a homicide detective.', 'NYPD Detective Mike Logan, who was reassigned to Staten Island after punching a corrupt politician, takes on a grisly murder case. When the investigation leads him back to the 27th Precinct, Logan sees a chance to resurrect his flailing career and be reinstated as a homicide detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hz4I3oHkz9wOhCgp3mLKa9Fb1hz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87901'),
  ('33210101690592969', 'Exiled', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung, Law Wing-Cheong', 'Yip Tin-Shing, Szeto Kam-Yuen', 'Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Lam Suet, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Josie Ho, Richie Jen, Simon Yam', null, 'A friendship is formed between an ex-gangster, and two groups of hitmen - those who want to protect him and those who were sent to kill him.', 'A friendship is formed between an ex-gangster, and two groups of hitmen - those who want to protect him and those who were sent to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x58B3v4U7jqGmPsNk3Znv3PWLuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13807'),
  ('186043005182002646', 'Exiles', 2004, 'Adventure, Drama, Music', 'Tony Gatlif, Céline Bozon', 'Tony Gatlif', 'Romain Duris, Lubna Azabal, Zouhir Gacem, Lila Makhlouf, Habib Cheik, Latifa Ahrar', null, 'One day Zano suggest a crazy idea to his companion Naïma: travel across France and Spain down to Algeria, where they might ultimately come to know the land their parents once had to flee.', 'One day Zano suggest a crazy idea to his companion Naïma: travel across France and Spain down to Algeria, where they might ultimately come to know the land their parents once had to flee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enhjywSKKDgdZZKhRp0iEWfJFZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18497'),
  ('359969786391467472', 'Exist Within', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Kim Jung-wook', 'Kim Jung-wook', 'Ryu Hwa-young, Park Jin-woo, Jeong Dong-hoon, Kim Dae-han, Chae Yeon-jung, Oh Young-shil, Ahn Se-bin, Jang Jae-hee', null, 'Eun-soo dreams of being a professional writer but in reality, has been jobless for quite a long time. While she is looking for materials to submit a contest exhibition, she gets sick of the annoying noise from upstairs and she wonders what is going on. She begins to watch over the owner of the upstairs and the guy Ho-kyung lives right upstairs, also realizes that Eun-soo is keeping her eyes on him. Eventually, Eun-soo witnessed the staggering truth. Another annoying noise again, the story is only able to exist in imagination, could it be real?', 'Eun-soo dreams of being a professional writer but in reality, has been jobless for quite a long time. While she is looking for materials to submit a contest exhibition, she gets sick of the annoying noise from upstairs and she wonders what is going on. She begins to watch over the owner of the upstairs and the guy Ho-kyung lives right upstairs, also realizes that Eun-soo is keeping her eyes on him. Eventually, Eun-soo witnessed the staggering truth. Another annoying noise again, the story is only able to exist in imagination, could it be real?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chja5hwDZp2Ev0eHbWb4Ie5U2Oo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026103'),
