  ('364307372202477199', 'Exists', 2014, 'Horror', 'Eduardo Sánchez, John W. Rutland, George P. Gakoumis Jr.', 'Jamie Nash', 'Denise Williamson, Samuel Davis, Roger Edwards, Chris Osborn, Dora Madison, Brian Steele, Jeff Schwan, George P. Gakoumis Jr.', 'R', 'A group of friends venture into the remote Texas woods for a party weekend and find themselves stalked by Bigfoot.', 'A group of friends venture into the remote Texas woods for a party weekend and find themselves stalked by Bigfoot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3BteJOJcbEI3pDgrZ1Fguy0ndV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124470'),
  ('187651938155195138', 'Exit', 2000, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Olivier Megaton, Michel Taburiaux', 'Olivier Megaton, Olivier Megaton', 'Patrick Fontana, Clotilde Courau, Féodor Atkine, Serge Blumental, Manuel Blanc, Jean-Michel Fête, Élodie Mennegand, Jean Barat', null, 'A mentally unstable man who doesn''t have a firm grip on reality must investigate whether or not he''s a serial killer.', 'A mentally unstable man who doesn''t have a firm grip on reality must investigate whether or not he''s a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lv2LpwqmAulIrddACzZZb6E60Ju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228642'),
  ('482862536122935698', 'Exit', 2006, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Peter Lindmark, Eric Maddison, Daniel Chilla', null, 'Mads Mikkelsen, Alexander Skarsgård, Samuel Fröler, Börje Ahlstedt, Johan Rabaeus, Kirsti Eline Torhaug, Ia Langhammer, Kristina Törnqvist', null, 'There is a thin line between money and loyalty. Thomas Skepphult runs an investment company, and is arrested for the murder of his business partner when his fingerprint is found on the murder weapon. When he tries to call his lawyer, the phone is answered by someone who he thought had committed suicide years ago.', 'There is a thin line between money and loyalty. Thomas Skepphult runs an investment company, and is arrested for the murder of his business partner when his fingerprint is found on the murder weapon. When he tries to call his lawyer, the phone is answered by someone who he thought had committed suicide years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qLiAfCLQIpdjWte073jXPlCZE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9345'),
  ('644596538647994927', 'Exit', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Willy Dettmeyer, Sebastian Marka', 'Erol Yesilkaya', 'Friedrich Mücke, Laura de Boer, Aram Tafreshian, Jan Krauter, David K.S. Tse, Emanuela von Frankenberg, Astrid Polak, Thorsten Merten', null, 'Year 2047: "Inifinitalk" is the AI developed by some guys, offering possible eternal life through digitization of peoples mind and when they want to sell it they get into major trouble.', 'Year 2047: "Inifinitalk" is the AI developed by some guys, offering possible eternal life through digitization of peoples mind and when they want to sell it they get into major trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJ1x8z6ADETTldgR29R1tE0e0lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756207'),
  ('382315031709614703', 'EXIT', 2019, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lee Seok-sool, Kim Min-jae, Lee Sang-geun', 'Lee Sang-geun', 'Cho Jung-seok, Yoona, Goh Doo-shim, Park In-hwan, Kim Ji-young, Kang Ki-young, Kim Jong-goo, Kim Byeong-soon', null, 'At his mother''s 70th birthday party, Yong-nam runs into Eui-joo, who rejected him in college. When the city is engulfed in toxic gas from a terrorist attack, the two must find a way to escape using all the techniques they learned in their college rock climbing club.', 'At his mother''s 70th birthday party, Yong-nam runs into Eui-joo, who rejected him in college. When the city is engulfed in toxic gas from a terrorist attack, the two must find a way to escape using all the techniques they learned in their college rock climbing club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zf16eomhCB13cwMb4iFEbBT0Tsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572164'),
  ('329733691828788786', 'Exit 8', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Genki Kawamura, Toshie Tabata, Yoko Yamashita', 'Genki Kawamura, Kentaro Hirase', 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Yamato Kochi, Nana Komatsu, Naru Asanuma, Kotone Hanase, Hirota Otsuka, Tara Nakashima, Reo Soda', 'PG-13', 'A man trapped in an endless sterile subway passageway sets out to find Exit 8. The rules of his quest are simple: do not overlook anything out of the ordinary. If you discover an anomaly, turn back immediately. If you don’t, carry on. Then leave from Exit 8. But even a single oversight will send him back to the beginning. Will he ever reach his goal and escape this infinite corridor?', 'A man trapped in an endless sterile subway passageway sets out to find Exit 8. The rules of his quest are simple: do not overlook anything out of the ordinary. If you discover an anomaly, turn back immediately. If you don’t, carry on. Then leave from Exit 8. But even a single oversight will send him back to the beginning. Will he ever reach his goal and escape this infinite corridor?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQXYTvm6AY4WmtcPskroqC7Skh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1408208'),
  ('805906204192110364', 'Exit Humanity', 2011, 'Drama, Horror', 'John Geddes, Brendan Uegama', 'John Geddes', 'Stephen McHattie, Brian Cox, Mark Gibson, Ari Millen, Jordan Hayes, Dee Wallace, Bill Moseley, Adam Seybold', 'R', 'A decade after the American Civil War, Edward Young returns home from a hunting trip to find a horrific reanimation of his wife and that their son Adam has disappeared. He must battle his way through an unexplainable outbreak of the walking dead.', 'A decade after the American Civil War, Edward Young returns home from a hunting trip to find a horrific reanimation of his wife and that their son Adam has disappeared. He must battle his way through an unexplainable outbreak of the walking dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qdu0lDpQLKOqkTcyhO8Hv0gjYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86305'),
  ('1098107719245670698', 'Exit in Red', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yurek Bogayevicz, Ericson Core', 'David Womark', 'Mickey Rourke, Anthony Michael Hall, Carré Otis, Annabel Schofield, Hank Garrett, Pat Destro, Robert F. Lyons, Dean Simone', 'R', 'Psychiatrist Ed Altman relocates to Palm Springs in order to avoid a lawsuit. However, he wanders directly into more trouble when he begins an affair with the wealthy Ally Mercer, who has her own motives for getting involved with Ed. Soon Ally''s volatile lover Nick is caught in the intrigue, resulting in shady dealings, betrayal, and, ultimately, murder.', 'Psychiatrist Ed Altman relocates to Palm Springs in order to avoid a lawsuit. However, he wanders directly into more trouble when he begins an affair with the wealthy Ally Mercer, who has her own motives for getting involved with Ed. Soon Ally''s volatile lover Nick is caught in the intrigue, resulting in shady dealings, betrayal, and, ultimately, murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvTHLfBI3S2Cl7cg2PhNUUWtGMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82081'),
  ('1001863978824766308', 'Exit Marrakech', 2013, 'Drama', 'Caroline Link', 'Caroline Link', 'Ulrich Tukur, Samuel Schneider, Hafsia Herzi, Marie-Lou Sellem, Josef Bierbichler, Abdesselam Bouhasni, Mourad Zaoui, Laila M''Rabti', null, 'When 17-year-old Ben visits his father Heinrich in Marrakech, it is the start of an adventurous journey through a foreign country with a picturesque charm and a rough beauty where everything appears possible — including the chance that father and son will lose each other for good, or find one another again.', 'When 17-year-old Ben visits his father Heinrich in Marrakech, it is the start of an adventurous journey through a foreign country with a picturesque charm and a rough beauty where everything appears possible — including the chance that father and son will lose each other for good, or find one another again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JRNY3lD5huKpbnYQ00QGUIF5Ed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209266'),
  ('644532136028138904', 'Exit Plan', 2019, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Niels Thastum, Jonas Alexander Arnby', 'Rasmus Birch', 'Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Tuva Novotny, Sonja Richter, Kate Ashfield, Robert Aramayo, Jan Bijvoet, Slimane Dazi, Johanna Wokalek', null, 'Insurance broker Max''s life is about one thing - keeping his walnut brain tumour in check. He eats properly, exercises and lives properly, but all of this self-consciousness makes him more and more depressed. When he realises that his beloved wife plans to leave him, he decides to take his own life.', 'Insurance broker Max''s life is about one thing - keeping his walnut brain tumour in check. He eats properly, exercises and lives properly, but all of this self-consciousness makes him more and more depressed. When he realises that his beloved wife plans to leave him, he decides to take his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8eXWirzPtjRG5n8JHcuqSN30ch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538715'),
  ('982376435033842546', 'Exit Protocol', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Shane Dax Taylor', 'Chad Law', 'Scott Martin, Dolph Lundgren, Michael Jai White, Charlotte Kirk, Lina Maya, Stephanie Beran, J.B. Yowell, Aaron McPherson', 'R', 'An assassin whose specialty is killing other assassins trying to get out of the business decides to try to get out himself and must then team up with his former mark to escape the hired killers now gunning for them both.', 'An assassin whose specialty is killing other assassins trying to get out of the business decides to try to get out himself and must then team up with his former mark to escape the hired killers now gunning for them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flMnawvBtLvMStfeAjuBE1K9ykX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1293167'),
  ('435407115995310872', 'Exit Speed', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Scott Ziehl, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Michael Stokes', 'Desmond Harrington, Lea Thompson, Julie Mond, Alice Greczyn, Fred Ward, Gregory Jbara, David Rees Snell, Kelli Dawn Hancock', 'R', 'On Christmas Eve, ten strangers board a bus traveling across Texas and are forced off the road by a motorcycle gang. The passengers then take refuge in an abandoned scrap yard. When their defense against the gang weakens and their numbers dwindle they must do the unthinkable go on the offense.', 'On Christmas Eve, ten strangers board a bus traveling across Texas and are forced off the road by a motorcycle gang. The passengers then take refuge in an abandoned scrap yard. When their defense against the gang weakens and their numbers dwindle they must do the unthinkable go on the offense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WU9FDMdkUBMNXbqQ7rwu7WmhcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17144'),
  ('880559340755668264', 'Exit the Dragon, Enter the Tiger', 1976, 'Action', 'Lee Tso-Nam, Yeh Ching-Piao', 'Chang Hsin-Yi', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Chin Kang, An Ping, Chang Yi, Lung Fei, Tsao Shao Jung, Hsin-Yi Chiang, Bruce Lee', 'R', 'This martial arts movie tries to explain the strange death of the international movie star and kung fu master Bruce Lee. Most of the story centers on a former disciple of Lee who launches a private investigation and ends up avenging the brutal death of his own girlfriend.', 'This martial arts movie tries to explain the strange death of the international movie star and kung fu master Bruce Lee. Most of the story centers on a former disciple of Lee who launches a private investigation and ends up avenging the brutal death of his own girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBmT1xUhvLxGvCWlbNEaDEVRuaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73826'),
  ('257473505974578661', 'Exit Through the Gift Shop', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Banksy', 'Banksy', 'Rhys Ifans, Thierry Guetta, Banksy, Shepard Fairey, INVADER, Debora Guetta, Monsieur André, Zeus', 'R', 'Banksy is a graffiti artist with a global reputation whose work can be seen on walls from post-hurricane New Orleans to the separation barrier on the Palestinian West Bank. Fiercely guarding his anonymity to avoid prosecution, Banksy has so far resisted all attempts to be captured on film. Exit Through the Gift Shop tells the incredible true story of how an eccentric French shop keeper turned documentary maker attempted to locate and befriend Banksy, only to have the artist turn the camera back on its owner.', 'Banksy is a graffiti artist with a global reputation whose work can be seen on walls from post-hurricane New Orleans to the separation barrier on the Palestinian West Bank. Fiercely guarding his anonymity to avoid prosecution, Banksy has so far resisted all attempts to be captured on film. Exit Through the Gift Shop tells the incredible true story of how an eccentric French shop keeper turned documentary maker attempted to locate and befriend Banksy, only to have the artist turn the camera back on its owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruM5ehUQlHC1Kx3SF18d6klfrAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39452'),
  ('566230135170939942', 'Exit to Eden', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Garry Marshall, Theo van de Sande', 'Deborah Amelon, Bob Brunner', 'Dana Delany, Paul Mercurio, Rosie O''Donnell, Dan Aykroyd, Héctor Elizondo, Stuart Wilson, Iman, Sean O''Bryan', 'R', 'Photographer Elliot Slater has inadvertently snapped the only existing photos of elusive jewel thief Omar. When Elliot leaves for a private vacation on an S&M island, he is followed by Omar, Omar''s partner, Nina, and undercover police officers Fred and Sheila. Unaware of the number of people chasing him, Elliot enjoys his stay at the resort, and finds himself falling in love with head dominatrix Lisa.', 'Photographer Elliot Slater has inadvertently snapped the only existing photos of elusive jewel thief Omar. When Elliot leaves for a private vacation on an S&M island, he is followed by Omar, Omar''s partner, Nina, and undercover police officers Fred and Sheila. Unaware of the number of people chasing him, Elliot enjoys his stay at the resort, and finds himself falling in love with head dominatrix Lisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUtpplO9K03uYCA71Vqj9ZRkVyA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18395'),
  ('880488457261885694', 'Exit Wounds', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Glen MacPherson, Jonathan Wright', 'Richard D''Ovidio, Ed Horowitz', 'Steven Seagal, DMX, Isaiah Washington, Anthony Anderson, Bill Duke, Michael Jai White, Jill Hennessy, Tom Arnold', 'R', 'Maverick cop Orin Boyd always brings down the domestic terrorists he tracks, but he ruffles feathers with his unorthodox techniques -- and soon finds himself reassigned to the toughest district in Detroit. When he discovers a group of detectives secretly operating a drug ring, Boyd joins forces with an unlikely ally -- gangster Latrell Walker -- to bring down the rotten cops.', 'Maverick cop Orin Boyd always brings down the domestic terrorists he tracks, but he ruffles feathers with his unorthodox techniques -- and soon finds himself reassigned to the toughest district in Detroit. When he discovers a group of detectives secretly operating a drug ring, Boyd joins forces with an unlikely ally -- gangster Latrell Walker -- to bring down the rotten cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGIJhBejmredgUZRNdteZyiahag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10877'),
  ('1001153005228069587', 'EXmas', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jonah Feingold, Stephen Chandler Whitehead, Eliason Aboukassam', 'Dan Steele', 'Leighton Meester, Robbie Amell, Michael Hitchcock, Kathryn Greenwood, Veronika Slowikowska, Steven Huy, Thomas Cadrot, Donna Benedicto', 'PG-13', 'When Graham decides to surprise his family by traveling home for Christmas, he is shocked to discover them already celebrating with an unexpected guest of honor, his ex-fiancée, Ali. The two exes battle it out to see who the family will pick to stay through Christmas Day and who must go.', 'When Graham decides to surprise his family by traveling home for Christmas, he is shocked to discover them already celebrating with an unexpected guest of honor, his ex-fiancée, Ali. The two exes battle it out to see who the family will pick to stay through Christmas Day and who must go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WfzdlUXUAd1QA6xmbbNH89Kgbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1192745'),
  ('144847668884579724', 'Exode', 2014, 'Animation', 'Kathleen Cartier, Sandrine Gimenez, Thomas Saez', null, null, null, 'One march ends, a journey begins. In a desert land, the last breath of a giant creature spurs the exodus of an entire people.', 'One march ends, a journey begins. In a desert land, the last breath of a giant creature spurs the exodus of an entire people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBpyR8YcIUALpcLUzJGhM7iY3t1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368010'),
  ('515341977298722348', 'Exodus', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Otto Preminger, Sam Leavitt', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Paul Newman, Eva Marie Saint, Ralph Richardson, Peter Lawford, Lee J. Cobb, Sal Mineo, John Derek, Hugh Griffith', null, 'Ari Ben Canaan, a passionate member of the Jewish paramilitary group Haganah, attempts to transport 600 Jewish refugees on a dangerous voyage from Cyprus to Palestine on a ship named the Exodus. He faces obstruction from British forces, who will not grant the ship passage to its destination.', 'Ari Ben Canaan, a passionate member of the Jewish paramilitary group Haganah, attempts to transport 600 Jewish refugees on a dangerous voyage from Cyprus to Palestine on a ship named the Exodus. He faces obstruction from British forces, who will not grant the ship passage to its destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JXFJRztd43gCf4TAodNUwkfZoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1941'),
  ('117062729143085926', 'Exodus 1945: Our Blood', 2026, 'Drama', 'Vid Planinc', 'Vid Planinc', 'Jernej Kuntner, Matevž Müller, Alenka Tetičkovič', null, 'May 1945, Ljubljana. Following the end of World War II and the communist seizure of power, many opponents of communism flee Yugoslavia, retreating to Austrian Carinthia toward the British Allies. On a medical train from Ljubljana, alongside wounded members of the Home Guard, travel two physicians: Dr. Janez Janez and Dr. Valentin Mersol with his family. Their principles and consciences are put to the test as they face the brutal truth that they cannot save everyone - the survival of some will mean the death of others.', 'May 1945, Ljubljana. Following the end of World War II and the communist seizure of power, many opponents of communism flee Yugoslavia, retreating to Austrian Carinthia toward the British Allies. On a medical train from Ljubljana, alongside wounded members of the Home Guard, travel two physicians: Dr. Janez Janez and Dr. Valentin Mersol with his family. Their principles and consciences are put to the test as they face the brutal truth that they cannot save everyone - the survival of some will mean the death of others.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fj2B4ewVBu6qdQlMkF4tiyEVMSZQ.jpg', 'plex:movie:exodus-1945-nasa-kri'),
  ('775759135980840979', 'Exodus: Gods and Kings', 2014, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Ridley Scott, Dariusz Wolski, Mark Patten', 'Bill Collage, Steven Zaillian, Adam Cooper', 'Christian Bale, Joel Edgerton, Ben Kingsley, John Turturro, Aaron Paul, Golshifteh Farahani, Ben Mendelsohn, Sigourney Weaver', 'PG-13', 'The defiant leader Moses rises up against the Egyptian Pharaoh Ramses, setting 400,000 slaves on a monumental journey of escape from Egypt and its terrifying cycle of deadly plagues.', 'The defiant leader Moses rises up against the Egyptian Pharaoh Ramses, setting 400,000 slaves on a monumental journey of escape from Egypt and its terrifying cycle of deadly plagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaDj37JtvLan9tihxZ18e6qL33b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147441'),
