  ('232524913532444390', 'Exorcism Chronicles: The Beginning', 2025, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Action', 'Kim Dong-chul, Park Yong-keon, Kim So-yoon', 'Lee Dong-ha', 'Choi Han, Nam Doh-hyeong, Jung Yoo-jung, Kim Yeon-woo, Hong Seung-hyo, Hwang Chang-yung, Kim Min-ju, Pyo Yeong-jae', 'R', 'When a demonic uprising threatens to end the world as they know it, a monk and an excommunicated priest join forces to protect a powerful young boy and the next generation of magic. As dark forces close in, the unlikely trio must confront their inner demons.', 'When a demonic uprising threatens to end the world as they know it, a monk and an excommunicated priest join forces to protect a powerful young boy and the next generation of magic. As dark forces close in, the unlikely trio must confront their inner demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7mf3Bu7PSw8uZtKUtYNNndTc0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233199'),
  ('1096358631395477358', 'Exorcism in Utero', 2023, 'Horror', 'Erik Skybak', 'Erik Skybak', 'Allegra Sweeney, Calvin Morie McCarthy, Neil Green, Sam Bangs, Leonard Hoge, Steve Larkin', null, 'Herma finds a powerful ring that possesses her when she tries it on; as her body transforms and mind begins to deteriorate, she must find a way out to save herself and her unborn baby.', 'Herma finds a powerful ring that possesses her when she tries it on; as her body transforms and mind begins to deteriorate, she must find a way out to save herself and her unborn baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HKgVo8jBISdqxtn4h9CnEgFrKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122504'),
  ('469456289429051758', 'Exorcismo', 1975, 'Horror', 'Juan Bosch, Francisco Sánchez', 'Jordi Gigó', 'Paul Naschy, Maria Perschy, María Kosty, Mercedes Molina, Joan Llaneras, Luis Induni, Jordi Torras, Roger Leveder', null, 'A young woman participates (unknowingly) in a satanic ceremony and gets possessed by the spirit of her late father.', 'A young woman participates (unknowingly) in a satanic ceremony and gets possessed by the spirit of her late father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieXrIrSsVPDHfe8GYlW71BkFRm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77257'),
  ('377745387259419600', 'Exorcismo Documentado', 2012, 'Horror', 'Rodrigo Estrada Alday, Rodrigo Estrada Alday', 'Rodrigo Estrada Alday, Ray Figueroa', 'Daniela Castillo, José Manuel de la Puente, William García Silva, Hilda Mansilla, Roberto Díaz Gomar', null, 'While a sixteen year old girl is possessed by an evil spirit, her mother tries to find help, but everything goes wrong with horrible consequences.', 'While a sixteen year old girl is possessed by an evil spirit, her mother tries to find help, but everything goes wrong with horrible consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5djJKrzq8VhZvXALw9thDnFfnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366799'),
  ('200029452826347134', 'Exorcismus', 2010, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Manuel Carballo', 'David Muñoz', 'Doug Bradley, Stephen Billington, Sophie Vavasseur, Richard Felix, Tommy Bastow, Clàudia Costas, Jo-Anne Stockham', null, 'Fifteen-year-old Emma Evans is like any other teenage girl; she thinks that her parents don''t understand her. She longs for independence and a life free of family ties and responsibilities and she is prepared to do anything to achieve it. But one day she will be forced to face up to the consequences of her actions.Life seems to be carrying on as normal, until one day Emma starts experiencing frightening fits. Her parents are convinced that her problems are either medical or psychological, but when doctors'' tests are unable to draw any conclusions, the family is forced to look elsewhere for answers.It all started off as a bit of fun, Emma never really believed it, but the truth is there is something dark and sinister within her, and it won''t take long to surface.', 'Fifteen-year-old Emma Evans is like any other teenage girl; she thinks that her parents don''t understand her. She longs for independence and a life free of family ties and responsibilities and she is prepared to do anything to achieve it. But one day she will be forced to face up to the consequences of her actions.Life seems to be carrying on as normal, until one day Emma starts experiencing frightening fits. Her parents are convinced that her problems are either medical or psychological, but when doctors'' tests are unable to draw any conclusions, the family is forced to look elsewhere for answers.It all started off as a bit of fun, Emma never really believed it, but the truth is there is something dark and sinister within her, and it won''t take long to surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mNSRW05Y80iS9HdwvP5SIq4oL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63727'),
  ('1013758144554278907', 'Exorcist II: The Heretic', 1977, 'Horror', 'John Boorman, Victor Hsu, Rospo Pallenberg', 'William Goodhart, Rospo Pallenberg', 'Richard Burton, Linda Blair, Louise Fletcher, Max von Sydow, Kitty Winn, Paul Henreid, James Earl Jones, Ned Beatty', 'R', 'Bizarre nightmares plague Regan MacNeil four years after her possession and exorcism. Has the demon returned? And if so, can the combined faith and knowledge of a Vatican investigator and a research specialist free her from its grasp?', 'Bizarre nightmares plague Regan MacNeil four years after her possession and exorcism. Has the demon returned? And if so, can the combined faith and knowledge of a Vatican investigator and a research specialist free her from its grasp?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9i3LTMYLRHvCYSKimZEfd1Vqy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11586'),
  ('745788395543056391', 'Exorcist Master', 1993, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Wu Ma, Siu Tak-Foo, James Wu Kuo-Ren', 'Chiu Lo-Kong, Cheng Man-Wah', 'Lam Ching-Ying, Wu Ma, Collin Chou, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Hung Yue, Yuan Shen', null, 'When a Catholic church in a small Chinese town falls prey to an evil combing the powers of Western and Chinese vampirism, Taoist priest Uncle Nine (Lam Ching Ying) and Catholic priest Wu (Wu Ma) must overcome religious and cultural differences in order to defeat the vampire.', 'When a Catholic church in a small Chinese town falls prey to an evil combing the powers of Western and Chinese vampirism, Taoist priest Uncle Nine (Lam Ching Ying) and Catholic priest Wu (Wu Ma) must overcome religious and cultural differences in order to defeat the vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rx2kiB6pNGSZODXrWV3Lb9ZTLAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169163'),
  ('561741884367023166', 'Exorcist: The Beginning', 2004, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Renny Harlin, Vittorio Storaro, Oscar Beuselinck', 'Alexi Hawley', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Izabella Scorupco, James D''Arcy, Julian Wadham, Remy Sweeney, Andrew French, Antonie Kamerling, Ben Cross', 'R', 'Years before Father Merrin helped save Regan MacNeil’s soul, he first encounters the demon Pazuzu in East Africa.', 'Years before Father Merrin helped save Regan MacNeil’s soul, he first encounters the demon Pazuzu in East Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4b7Mhc4HZN7XzMMLukaQ9C0x1Dx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11026'),
  ('909569692429368635', 'Exotica', 1994, 'Drama', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy, Fergus Barnes', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Bruce Greenwood, Mia Kirshner, Don McKellar, Sarah Polley, Victor Garber, David Hemblen, Peter Krantz, Arsinée Khanjian', 'R', 'In the upscale Toronto strip club Exotica, dancer Christina is visited nightly by the obsessive Francis, a depressed tax auditor. Her ex-boyfriend, the club''s MC, Eric, still jealously pines for her even as he introduces her onstage, but Eric is having his own relationship problems with the club''s female owner. Thomas, a mysterious pet-shop owner, is about to become unexpectedly involved in their lives.', 'In the upscale Toronto strip club Exotica, dancer Christina is visited nightly by the obsessive Francis, a depressed tax auditor. Her ex-boyfriend, the club''s MC, Eric, still jealously pines for her even as he introduces her onstage, but Eric is having his own relationship problems with the club''s female owner. Thomas, a mysterious pet-shop owner, is about to become unexpectedly involved in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWcJdcIHjL3P6NaEJKeV6ONfAMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20156'),
  ('114996536430907801', 'Exotica, Erotica, Etc.', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Evangelia Kranioti', 'Evangelia Kranioti', 'Evangelia Kranioti', null, 'This essay film tells of the ocean as a place of yearning, of the world of giant container ships and their crews, and the women that wait for them in ports and drinking holes. The protagonists'' thoughts are rendered as inner monologues in voiceover, all set to striking documentary images.', 'This essay film tells of the ocean as a place of yearning, of the world of giant container ships and their crews, and the women that wait for them in ports and drinking holes. The protagonists'' thoughts are rendered as inner monologues in voiceover, all set to striking documentary images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g320EzbjAUT7yF1VYy7ThjSd34G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325419'),
