  ('259718371141821794', 'Expect No Mercy', 1995, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Zale Dalen, Curtis Petersen', 'J. Stephen Maunder', 'Billy Blanks, Jalal Merhi, Wolf Larson, Laurie Holden, Anthony De Longis, Michael Blanks, Réal Andrews, Sam Moses', 'R', 'Federal Service Agent Justin Vanier has been assigned to infiltrate the mysterious Virtual Arts Academy in search of Eric, a fellow agent. In this high-tech facility, the maniacal leader Warbeck is training assassins to become even more efficient killing machines using virtual reality. Penetrating the organization as a new recruit, Justin finds Eric, and together with the idealistic Vicki must bring down Warbeck before he succeeds with his deadly plans', 'Federal Service Agent Justin Vanier has been assigned to infiltrate the mysterious Virtual Arts Academy in search of Eric, a fellow agent. In this high-tech facility, the maniacal leader Warbeck is training assassins to become even more efficient killing machines using virtual reality. Penetrating the organization as a new recruit, Justin finds Eric, and together with the idealistic Vicki must bring down Warbeck before he succeeds with his deadly plans', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsw3FSUhXBJQLUT4txqzTxsStAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124409'),
  ('874773020083579416', 'Expect the Unexpected', 1998, 'Action, Crime', 'Patrick Yau Tat-Chi, Ko Chiu-Lam', 'Taures Chow Yin-Han, Yau Nai-Hoi, Szeto Kam-Yuen', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Simon Yam, Ruby Wong Cheuk-Ling, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Yoyo Mung Ka-Wai, Bak Ka-Sin, Sato Keiji', null, 'Bumbling mainland crooks mess up a jewelry heist. Two cops serious Ken and jokey Sam investigate but mix up these amateurs with dangerous mainland robbers in the neighborhood.', 'Bumbling mainland crooks mess up a jewelry heist. Two cops serious Ken and jokey Sam investigate but mix up these amateurs with dangerous mainland robbers in the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQveKpyNQQXJtaKNS5N9g3E99kZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72897'),
