  ('1072433979294208229', 'Expedition Happiness', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Felix Starck, Selima Taibi', null, 'Felix Starck, Selima Taibi', null, 'A German couple and their dog travel across North America in a school bus searching for a state of pure bliss.', 'A German couple and their dog travel across North America in a school bus searching for a state of pure bliss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS09wiv0IF3n3lONGOtZo5EXqac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455918'),
  ('1091236067415365332', 'Expelled', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Alex Goyette, Jan-Michael Del Mundo, Ted Campbell', 'Alex Goyette', 'Cameron Dallas, Matt Shively, Lia Marie Johnson, Marcus Johns, Andrea Russett, Emilio Palame, Kristina Hayes, Teala Dunn', 'PG-13', 'Felix is a legendary prankster who gets expelled from his high school and, with his friend’s help, stops at nothing to hide it from his parents.', 'Felix is a legendary prankster who gets expelled from his high school and, with his friend’s help, stops at nothing to hide it from his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9p7VzMhvchlA4WdpgAXBnFg7l2I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305932'),
  ('514124632114286809', 'Expelled from Paradise', 2014, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Seiji Mizushima, Haruna Gohzu, Kojiro Hayashi', 'Gen Urobuchi', 'Rie Kugimiya, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hiroshi Kamiya, Megumi Hayashibara, Minami Takayama, Kotono Mitsuishi, Kenta Miyake, Daichi Endo', null, 'A.D. 2400, DEVA''s central council detects an incident of unauthorized access into their mainframe. Someone on Earth was trying to hack into the system. The only information DEVA was able to retrieve was that hacker referred to themselves as "Frontier Setter." To investigate the mysterious hacker''s motives, the high officials of DEVA dispatch system Security Third Officer Angela Balzac to the Earth''s surface. Equipped with a prosthetic "material body," Angela attempts to make contact with a local agent Dingo, but what awaited her instead was a swarm of Sandworms now infesting the Earth''s surface. Angela intercepts the gruesome pests with her exoskeleton powered suit Arhan.', 'A.D. 2400, DEVA''s central council detects an incident of unauthorized access into their mainframe. Someone on Earth was trying to hack into the system. The only information DEVA was able to retrieve was that hacker referred to themselves as "Frontier Setter." To investigate the mysterious hacker''s motives, the high officials of DEVA dispatch system Security Third Officer Angela Balzac to the Earth''s surface. Equipped with a prosthetic "material body," Angela attempts to make contact with a local agent Dingo, but what awaited her instead was a swarm of Sandworms now infesting the Earth''s surface. Angela intercepts the gruesome pests with her exoskeleton powered suit Arhan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TJ8ilNGZe6OyVaj4VMmT3lp2x4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304023'),
  ('456957922440532982', 'Expelled: No Intelligence Allowed', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Nathan Frankowski', 'Kevin Miller, Ben Stein', 'Ben Stein, Richard Dawkins, William Dembski, Paul Zachary Myers', 'PG', 'Pro-intelligent design scholars and scientists are often chastised, fired or denied tenured positions by those who believe in Darwin''s theory of evolution.', 'Pro-intelligent design scholars and scientists are often chastised, fired or denied tenured positions by those who believe in Darwin''s theory of evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQgNm7DK6DxfBuSfhQSjtGZYALf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13359'),
  ('491572478627620228', 'Expend4bles', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Scott Waugh, Martyn John, Aliki Nakopoulou', 'Max Adams, Kurt Wimmer, Tad Daggerhart', 'Jason Statham, 50 Cent, Megan Fox, Dolph Lundgren, Tony Jaa, Iko Uwais, Andy Garcia, Sylvester Stallone', 'R', 'Armed with every weapon they can get their hands on and the skills to use them, The Expendables are the world’s last line of defense and the team that gets called when all other options are off the table. But new team members with new styles and tactics are going to give “new blood” a whole new meaning.', 'Armed with every weapon they can get their hands on and the skills to use them, The Expendables are the world’s last line of defense and the team that gets called when all other options are off the table. But new team members with new styles and tactics are going to give “new blood” a whole new meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwsMu0ehRPbtaSxqiaUDQB9qMWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299054'),
  ('822756644182108100', 'Experiment in Evil', 1960, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jean Renoir, Georges Leclerc', 'Jean Renoir', 'Jean-Louis Barrault, Teddy Bilis, Michel Vitold, Sylviane Margollé, Jacques Danoville, André Certes, Jean-Pierre Granval, Jean Bertho', null, 'Dr. Cordelier, living in a suburb of Paris, withdraws from society to pursue research into the functioning of the human brain. His lifelong friend, Maître Joly, becomes concerned when Cordelier draws up a will that bequeaths his entire estate to a stranger, Monsieur Opale; he cannot understand why Cordelier defends him, considering Opale attacks women and children. After a colleague is killed, Joly confronts Cordelier and discovers the truth behind his friend''s behavior.', 'Dr. Cordelier, living in a suburb of Paris, withdraws from society to pursue research into the functioning of the human brain. His lifelong friend, Maître Joly, becomes concerned when Cordelier draws up a will that bequeaths his entire estate to a stranger, Monsieur Opale; he cannot understand why Cordelier defends him, considering Opale attacks women and children. After a colleague is killed, Joly confronts Cordelier and discovers the truth behind his friend''s behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Rlm1ynzU39TGKHdjvGziLVBSWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3026'),
  ('48413778877961154', 'Experiment in Terror', 1962, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Philip H. Lathrop, Blake Edwards, Sam Nelson', 'Gordon Gordon, Mildred Gordon', 'Glenn Ford, Lee Remick, Stefanie Powers, Roy Poole, Ned Glass, Anita Loo, Patricia Huston, Gilbert Green', null, 'A man with an asthmatic voice telephones and assaults clerk Kelly Sherwood at home and coerces her into helping him steal a large sum from her bank.', 'A man with an asthmatic voice telephones and assaults clerk Kelly Sherwood at home and coerces her into helping him steal a large sum from her bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knD04Xa9nYoGYQARpN2fXHf2JAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42995'),
  ('834084725779652106', 'Experiment Perilous', 1944, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Jacques Tourneur, Tony Gaudio, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Warren Duff', 'George Brent, Hedy Lamarr, Paul Lukas, Albert Dekker, Carl Esmond, Olive Blakeney, George N. Neise, Margaret Wycherly', 'PG', 'In 1903, Doctor Huntington Bailey meets a friendly older lady during a train trip. She tells him that she is going to visit her brother Nick and his lovely young wife Allida. Once in New York, Bailey hears that his train companion suddenly died. Shortly afterward, he meets the strange couple and gets suspicious of Nick''s treatment of his wife.', 'In 1903, Doctor Huntington Bailey meets a friendly older lady during a train trip. She tells him that she is going to visit her brother Nick and his lovely young wife Allida. Once in New York, Bailey hears that his train companion suddenly died. Shortly afterward, he meets the strange couple and gets suspicious of Nick''s treatment of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ERezpLYUc1SEKP3wGYixUAPhUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30574'),
  ('61160284060066993', 'Experimental Animation', 1933, 'Music, Animation', 'Len Lye', 'Len Lye', null, null, 'Len Lye scraped together enough funding and borrowed equipment to produce a two-minute short featuring his self-made monkey, singing and dancing to ''Peanut Vendor'', a 1931 jazz hit for Red Nichols. The two foot high monkey had bolted, moveable joints and some 50 interchangeable mouths to convey the singing. To get the movements right, Lye filmed his new wife, Jane, a prize-winning rumba dancer.', 'Len Lye scraped together enough funding and borrowed equipment to produce a two-minute short featuring his self-made monkey, singing and dancing to ''Peanut Vendor'', a 1931 jazz hit for Red Nichols. The two foot high monkey had bolted, moveable joints and some 50 interchangeable mouths to convey the singing. To get the movements right, Lye filmed his new wife, Jane, a prize-winning rumba dancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7iEkTEOCr5BnoLqpGZgwyh4mbt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248715'),
  ('518675749698083249', 'Experimental Treatment of a Hemorrhage in a Dog', 1930, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, null, 'Jean Painleve short about an experimental canine surgery.', 'Jean Painleve short about an experimental canine surgery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99Jk6mEVNaeF8gleb3tZibzjKGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117591'),
  ('411662906005329308', 'Experimenter', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Michael Almereyda, Ryan Samul', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Peter Sarsgaard, Winona Ryder, Jim Gaffigan, Edoardo Ballerini, John Palladino, Kellan Lutz, Dennis Haysbert, Danny A. Abeckaser', 'PG-13', 'Yale University, 1961. Stanley Milgram designs a psychology experiment that still resonates to this day, in which people think they’re delivering painful electric shocks to an affable stranger strapped into a chair in another room. Despite his pleads for mercy, the majority of subjects don’t stop the experiment, administering what they think is a near-fatal electric shock, simply because they’ve been told to do so. With Nazi Adolf Eichmann’s trial airing in living rooms across America, Milgram strikes a nerve in popular culture and the scientific community with his exploration into people’s tendency to comply with authority. Celebrated in some circles, he is also accused of being a deceptive, manipulative monster, but his wife Sasha stands by him through it all.', 'Yale University, 1961. Stanley Milgram designs a psychology experiment that still resonates to this day, in which people think they’re delivering painful electric shocks to an affable stranger strapped into a chair in another room. Despite his pleads for mercy, the majority of subjects don’t stop the experiment, administering what they think is a near-fatal electric shock, simply because they’ve been told to do so. With Nazi Adolf Eichmann’s trial airing in living rooms across America, Milgram strikes a nerve in popular culture and the scientific community with his exploration into people’s tendency to comply with authority. Celebrated in some circles, he is also accused of being a deceptive, manipulative monster, but his wife Sasha stands by him through it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMTLGbekuHkpw4M8XKdN2d7n2aF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309299'),
  ('1140630227414967191', 'Experiments in the Revival of Organisms', 1940, 'Documentary', 'David Yashin', 'Sergei Sergeevich Brukhonenko', 'J.B.S. Haldane', 'NR', 'This film shows experiments performed by Soviet scientists reviving the lungs, heart, and even the head of a dead dog.', 'This film shows experiments performed by Soviet scientists reviving the lungs, heart, and even the head of a dead dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5hDHvclcG0Pd2woqzYIvvTEjyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160105'),
  ('1102944624694177333', 'Expertos en pinchazos', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Horacio Guisado, Víctor Hugo Caula, Alejandro Arando', 'Hugo Sofovich', 'Alberto Olmedo, Jorge Porcel, Moria Casán, Patricia Dal, Reina Reech, César Bertrand, Carmen Barbieri, Tincho Zabala', null, 'Alberto and Jorge are employees of a pharmacy. One day, by mistake, they give a client a bottle of poison in exchange for a medication that she had to start ingesting 48 hours later. Realizing this, they decide to go out and look for her with the only data they have: her first name, her striking clothing, and that she was driving an imported motorcycle. So they launch into a crazy race against time touring the fashionable places of the Buenos Aires night, helped by a woman who claims to know the mysterious girl on the motorcycle.', 'Alberto and Jorge are employees of a pharmacy. One day, by mistake, they give a client a bottle of poison in exchange for a medication that she had to start ingesting 48 hours later. Realizing this, they decide to go out and look for her with the only data they have: her first name, her striking clothing, and that she was driving an imported motorcycle. So they launch into a crazy race against time touring the fashionable places of the Buenos Aires night, helped by a woman who claims to know the mysterious girl on the motorcycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aP4rQoaJsUSJEsIsO7YKjFEBpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369382'),
  ('981758363248291737', 'Expiration Date', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Juan Iribas, Daniel Ortega, Fernán Mirás', 'Rodrigo H. Vila, Fernán Mirás, Beatriz Carbajales', 'Natalia Oreiro, Diego Velázquez, Paola Barrientos, Ariel Staltari, Violeta Urtizberea, Alberto Ajaka, Vivian El Jaber, Fernán Mirás', null, 'María and Javi are two lifelong friends. Even though they have drifted apart over the course of the last year, when María suffers an accident that leaves her at the verge of dying, they reunite and discover that they have always been in love. Now Javi has to decide whether he continues with his new life with an Uruguayan girlfriend, or give a chance to a childhood love that could die out any second.', 'María and Javi are two lifelong friends. Even though they have drifted apart over the course of the last year, when María suffers an accident that leaves her at the verge of dying, they reunite and discover that they have always been in love. Now Javi has to decide whether he continues with his new life with an Uruguayan girlfriend, or give a chance to a childhood love that could die out any second.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSezYOBs7H3RG8rDcjsK3MqluxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791295'),
  ('344008088367216635', 'Expired', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cecilia Miniucchi, Zoran Popović', 'Cecilia Miniucchi', 'Samantha Morton, Jason Patric, Teri Garr, Illeana Douglas, Sonia Iris Lozada, Terence Bernie Hines, Joanne Baron, Carlease Burke', null, 'The film revolves around Claire, a kind soul who resents having to enforce the law at all times, and Jay, an angry Traffic Officer who loves his job, being the perfect outlet for his anger and frustrations. Coming both from a place of despair and loneliness, Jay and Claire meet and engage in a tumultuous relationship which will eventually teach them that love can spread redemption.', 'The film revolves around Claire, a kind soul who resents having to enforce the law at all times, and Jay, an angry Traffic Officer who loves his job, being the perfect outlet for his anger and frustrations. Coming both from a place of despair and loneliness, Jay and Claire meet and engage in a tumultuous relationship which will eventually teach them that love can spread redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riVxpKf2xWNMQhiGsUwhZTeyEEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18803'),
  ('473506884317236826', 'Explanation for Everything', 2023, 'Drama', 'Gábor Reisz, Kristóf Becsey', 'Gábor Reisz, Éva Schulze', 'Adonyi-Walsh Gáspár, István Znamenák, András Rusznák, Rebeka Hatházi, Lilla Kizlinger, Eliza Sodró, Dániel Király, Gergely Kocsis', null, 'It’s summer in Budapest, high school student Abel is struggling to focus on his final exams, whilst coming to the realisation that he is hopelessly in love with his best friend Janka. The studious Janka has her own unrequited love with married history teacher Jakab—who had a previous confrontation with Abel’s conservative father. The tensions of a polarised society come unexpectedly to the surface when Abel’s history graduation exam turns into a national scandal.', 'It’s summer in Budapest, high school student Abel is struggling to focus on his final exams, whilst coming to the realisation that he is hopelessly in love with his best friend Janka. The studious Janka has her own unrequited love with married history teacher Jakab—who had a previous confrontation with Abel’s conservative father. The tensions of a polarised society come unexpectedly to the surface when Abel’s history graduation exam turns into a national scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIof786gtEiJjAGBxrAaxDrWnCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075989'),
  ('268215989174779218', 'Exploited', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Jon Abrahams, Matthew Quinn, Anthony Del Negro', 'Anthony Del Negro, Carl Moellenberg', 'Jordan Ver Hoeve, Andrew Matthew Welch, Makenzie Vega, Hannah Rose May, Will Peltz, Spencer List, Sierra McCormick, Colin Bates', 'NR', 'A college freshman becomes obsessed with the previous owner of his school issued laptop, a webcam model whose last session may have ended in murder.', 'A college freshman becomes obsessed with the previous owner of his school issued laptop, a webcam model whose last session may have ended in murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fuyUJCQkCGCgW6Zs3M8vxfr9F0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947612'),
  ('797504868250656059', 'Exploits of a Young Don Juan', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gianfranco Mingozzi, Luigi Verga', 'Guillaume Apollinaire, Jean-Claude Carrière, Gianfranco Mingozzi', 'Serena Grandi, Claudine Auger, Marina Vlady, Fabrice Josso, François Perrot, Aurélien Recoing, Rosette, Laurent Spielvogel', null, 'In 1914, sixteen year old Roger returned home from boarding school during vacation to find his puberty hit hard in a house filled with beautiful women. These women have previous engagements with other men who are away, and during this time, Roger impregnates them all, including his aunt and sister, then devises plans to cuckold the men.', 'In 1914, sixteen year old Roger returned home from boarding school during vacation to find his puberty hit hard in a house filled with beautiful women. These women have previous engagements with other men who are away, and during this time, Roger impregnates them all, including his aunt and sister, then devises plans to cuckold the men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvtRgQIRegLjsjaIkKQbh0hk3Qy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81774'),
  ('394239221241475890', 'Explorer: The Last Tepui', 2022, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Matthew Irving, Renan Öztürk, Taylor Rees', null, 'Alex Honnold, Mark Synnott, Bruce Means, Michael Strahan', 'PG-13', 'This documentary starring climber Alex Honnold and famous biologist Bruce Means document their expedition to the South American sky islands in search of new species and discoveries. Follows elite climber Alex Honnold and a world-class climbing team led by National Geographic Explorer and climber Mark Synnott on a grueling mission deep in the Amazon jungle as they attempt a first-ascent climb up a 1000 foot sheer cliff.', 'This documentary starring climber Alex Honnold and famous biologist Bruce Means document their expedition to the South American sky islands in search of new species and discoveries. Follows elite climber Alex Honnold and a world-class climbing team led by National Geographic Explorer and climber Mark Synnott on a grueling mission deep in the Amazon jungle as they attempt a first-ascent climb up a 1000 foot sheer cliff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3csCMawDUyB6DZKI4q3j8m6vjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927081'),
  ('1080442814067290162', 'Explorers', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Family', 'Joe Dante, John Hora', 'Eric Luke', 'Ethan Hawke, River Phoenix, Jason Presson, Amanda Peterson, Bobby Fite, Dana Ivey, James Cromwell, Dick Miller', 'PG', 'Middle schooler Ben spends his free time watching sci-fi films, playing video games and reading comic books. Surprisingly, his affinity for all things fantastical yields a real result – when he has a vivid dream about technology, his prodigy best friend Wolfgang manages to create a working spacecraft. Joined by their buddy Darren, the boys take off into outer space and encounter some very odd extraterrestrial life.', 'Middle schooler Ben spends his free time watching sci-fi films, playing video games and reading comic books. Surprisingly, his affinity for all things fantastical yields a real result – when he has a vivid dream about technology, his prodigy best friend Wolfgang manages to create a working spacecraft. Joined by their buddy Darren, the boys take off into outer space and encounter some very odd extraterrestrial life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFJosj5ECYjf1jkvpTEjGNzPx2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9872'),
