  ('730701597399825261', 'Exte: Hair Extensions', 2007, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sion Sono, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Masaki Adachi, Makoto Sanada, Sion Sono', 'Chiaki Kuriyama, Ren Osugi, Megumi Sato, Tsugumi, Eri Machimoto, Miku Satô, Yūna Natsuo, Ken Mitsuishi', null, 'An aspiring hairdresser becomes the infatuation of a tricophilic man who sells hair extensions to nearby salons. The source is the corpse of a girl whose corpse continues to grow beautiful, voluminous, black hair that comes alive, either driving the extension user insane or killing them.', 'An aspiring hairdresser becomes the infatuation of a tricophilic man who sells hair extensions to nearby salons. The source is the corpse of a girl whose corpse continues to grow beautiful, voluminous, black hair that comes alive, either driving the extension user insane or killing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhfjXQxMoZkknfO0TVQGZrGzIk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21784'),
  ('871849893356429962', 'Extenuating Circumstances', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Jean Boyer, Georges Van Parys', 'Jean Boyer', 'Arletty, Michel Simon, Andrex, Suzanne Dantès, Mila Parély, Dorville, François Simon, Robert Arnoux', null, 'Harsh Parisian judge Gaetan (known as Monsieur Maximum), chafing in the idleness of retirement, leaves for a seaside holiday. But Gabriel the chauffeur has his mind on his girl, not the car; Gaetan and wife Nathalie are stranded in the country, where they find shelter in a low class bistro patronized by cheerful jail birds. Once the ice is broken, they have a wonderful time, but as the judge tries to trick his new friends into reforming, inevitable exposure approaches...', 'Harsh Parisian judge Gaetan (known as Monsieur Maximum), chafing in the idleness of retirement, leaves for a seaside holiday. But Gabriel the chauffeur has his mind on his girl, not the car; Gaetan and wife Nathalie are stranded in the country, where they find shelter in a low class bistro patronized by cheerful jail birds. Once the ice is broken, they have a wonderful time, but as the judge tries to trick his new friends into reforming, inevitable exposure approaches...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXg9OnNqmCkRHDkAWM3ySFTjMS7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64443'),
  ('120983603811135445', 'Exterior Night', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jacques Bral, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Jacques Bral', 'Christine Boisson, André Dussollier, Gérard Lanvin, Jean-Pierre Sentier, Marie Keime, Elisabeth Margoni, Lydie Pruvot, Henri-Jacques Huet', null, 'Hoping to make a fresh start, Léo, a jazz musician, takes up temporary residence with his friend Bony, a young writer who is struggling to get his work published. One evening, Léo strikes up an acquaintance with a woman taxi driver, Cora; in spite of her impulsive and moody temperament, he cannot help being attracted to her. On the spur of the moment, Cora invites Léo to make love to her. When Bony meets Cora, he too finds her irresistible, but he lacks Léo’s self-confidence to make his move. Cora is not a woman that any man can possess readily. She is like a wild animal, a creature that revels in its freedom. Will either Léo or Bony be able to tame her...?', 'Hoping to make a fresh start, Léo, a jazz musician, takes up temporary residence with his friend Bony, a young writer who is struggling to get his work published. One evening, Léo strikes up an acquaintance with a woman taxi driver, Cora; in spite of her impulsive and moody temperament, he cannot help being attracted to her. On the spur of the moment, Cora invites Léo to make love to her. When Bony meets Cora, he too finds her irresistible, but he lacks Léo’s self-confidence to make his move. Cora is not a woman that any man can possess readily. She is like a wild animal, a creature that revels in its freedom. Will either Léo or Bony be able to tame her...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnRjeHdhmVEzL36ibJdnZxRSxbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78448'),
  ('530339271787787844', 'Exterior Night', 1993, null, 'Serge Roman, Mark Rappaport', 'Mark Rappaport', 'David Patrick Kelly, Victoria Bastel, Johnny Mez, Martin Frische, Mark Arnott', null, 'Shot in high-definition video using rear-screen process plates from classic Warner Bros. films noirs. A young man (in color) searches for his past through black-and-white scenes from "The Big Sleep," "Mildred Pierce," and "Strangers on a Train."', 'Shot in high-definition video using rear-screen process plates from classic Warner Bros. films noirs. A young man (in color) searches for his past through black-and-white scenes from "The Big Sleep," "Mildred Pierce," and "Strangers on a Train."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wc6Y090RybBj4EAjODrlZBGqtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334859'),
  ('1131837555197094420', 'Exterminator 2', 1984, 'Action, Crime', 'Mark Buntzman, Robert M. Baldwin, Joseph Mangine', 'Mark Buntzman, William Sachs', 'Robert Ginty, Mario Van Peebles, Deborah Geffner, Frankie Faison, Scott ''Slo-motion'' Randolph, Reggie Rock Bythewood, Bruce Smolanoff, David Buntzman', 'R', 'The flamethrower-wielding vigilante John Eastland returns to rid New York of a drug lord and his gang.', 'The flamethrower-wielding vigilante John Eastland returns to rid New York of a drug lord and his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7n6lIVgfM2PVNqcEFSLbiQooHlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69343'),
  ('897270656419814645', 'ExTerminators', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Inwood, Robby Baumgartner', 'Suzanne Weinert', 'Heather Graham, Jennifer Coolidge, Amber Heard, Matthew Settle, Joey Lauren Adams, Sam Lloyd, Andy Buckley, Farah White', 'R', 'Three women from a rage-therapy group band together to dole out justice to the men who wronged them.', 'Three women from a rage-therapy group band together to dole out justice to the men who wronged them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYggIgOYQmlTnD1rALMC7sMyZxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25891'),
  ('298451001641095287', 'Exterminators of the Year 3000', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Giuliano Carnimeo, Alejandro Ulloa, Goffredo Unger', 'Elisa Briganti, Dardano Sacchetti, José Truchado', 'Robert Iannucci, Alicia Moro, Luciano Pigozzi, Eduardo Fajardo, Fernando Bilbao, Beryl Cunningham, Luca Venantini, Anna Orso', 'R', 'It''s the year 3000 and a nuclear war has turned the earth into a desert wasteland. A group of survivors living in a cave run out of water and desperately need to locate a new supply. The last guy they sent out to find water never returned, and now his 10 year old son Timmy wants to join the next search team. They think they know where there''s an untapped well of water, but to get there they have to travel through dangerous terrain controlled by a savage gang of motorcyclists under the bloodthirsty reign of ''Crazy Bull''. On their mission, Timmy and his team run into a lonesome stranger named Alien (Robert Iannucci) who may be able to help them against the marauding motorcyclists. Can the struggling survivors looking for water in this barren world defeat Crazy Bull and his exterminating minions? Hang on tight - the battle has just begun!', 'It''s the year 3000 and a nuclear war has turned the earth into a desert wasteland. A group of survivors living in a cave run out of water and desperately need to locate a new supply. The last guy they sent out to find water never returned, and now his 10 year old son Timmy wants to join the next search team. They think they know where there''s an untapped well of water, but to get there they have to travel through dangerous terrain controlled by a savage gang of motorcyclists under the bloodthirsty reign of ''Crazy Bull''. On their mission, Timmy and his team run into a lonesome stranger named Alien (Robert Iannucci) who may be able to help them against the marauding motorcyclists. Can the struggling survivors looking for water in this barren world defeat Crazy Bull and his exterminating minions? Hang on tight - the battle has just begun!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BRH5lAsCzhwx4q8CN2CXcrDgYj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115042'),
  ('748992620243413795', 'Extermineitors IV: As Twin Brothers', 1992, 'Action, Comedy', 'Carlos Galettini, Gabriel Arbós, Carlos Torlaschi', 'Salvador Valverde Freire, Salvador Valverde Calvo', 'Guillermo Francella, Randolph McClain, Javier Belgeri, Mike Kirton, Aldo Barbero, Verónica Varano, Marcela Labarca, Jorge Montejo', null, 'The Colonel of the Extermineitors has discovered that McClain (McClain Randolph), old enemy of the organization, crime has left to live quietly in Iguazu Falls and wants working for him. That''s how you develop a plan for Guillermo (Francella) perform McClain recruiting mission. The Colonel knows that William has a twin brother who never met and convinces him that the former offender is his lost brother ... Installed in Niagara, evading the thief who wants to kill Nico, an orphan who is in charge of William, MacClain convince that he is his twin brother, getting together to Buenos Aires to join the group of the Extermineitors.', 'The Colonel of the Extermineitors has discovered that McClain (McClain Randolph), old enemy of the organization, crime has left to live quietly in Iguazu Falls and wants working for him. That''s how you develop a plan for Guillermo (Francella) perform McClain recruiting mission. The Colonel knows that William has a twin brother who never met and convinces him that the former offender is his lost brother ... Installed in Niagara, evading the thief who wants to kill Nico, an orphan who is in charge of William, MacClain convince that he is his twin brother, getting together to Buenos Aires to join the group of the Extermineitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pxUGRofmMdQMz7orLMbkGVgGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197502'),
  ('948353374904786693', 'Exterritorial', 2025, 'Thriller, Action', 'Lisa Stutzky, Cornelia von Braun, Stefanie Miftari', 'Christian Zübert', 'Jeanne Goursaud, Dougray Scott, Lera Abova, Emanuel Fellmer, Annabelle Mandeng, Kayode Akinyemi, Nina Liu, Susanne Michel', 'R', 'When her son vanishes inside a US consulate, ex-special forces soldier Sara does everything in her power to find him — and uncovers a dark conspiracy.', 'When her son vanishes inside a US consulate, ex-special forces soldier Sara does everything in her power to find him — and uncovers a dark conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/micQGmD3K7Ni0wzyaSgBKGxrFWn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233069'),
  ('962632431007940054', 'Extinct', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Jason Ryan, David Silverman, Raymond S. Persi', 'Joel H. Cohen, John Frink, Rob LaZebnik', 'Adam Devine, Rachel Bloom, Zazie Beetz, Ken Jeong, Jim Jefferies, Catherine O''Hara, Reggie Watts, Henry Winkler', null, 'Op and Ed, two adorable donut-shaped animals - flummels - accidentally time-travel from 1835 to modern-day Shanghai. There they discover traffic, trans fats, and worst of all, that flummels are now extinct. It''s up to this bumbling pair to save themselves and their species...and, just maybe, change the course of history.', 'Op and Ed, two adorable donut-shaped animals - flummels - accidentally time-travel from 1835 to modern-day Shanghai. There they discover traffic, trans fats, and worst of all, that flummels are now extinct. It''s up to this bumbling pair to save themselves and their species...and, just maybe, change the course of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cnHvJPXNNxhnxHdDWHIEmxoilF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664236'),
  ('29449034204447139', 'Extinction', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Miguel Ángel Vivas, Josu Inchaustegui', 'Miguel Ángel Vivas, Alberto Marini', 'Matthew Fox, Jeffrey Donovan, Quinn McColgan, Valeria Vereau, Clara Lago, Matt Devere, Eduardo Fedriani, Lili Bordán', null, 'And suddenly, overnight, the world came to a halt. Two men, two survivors, one kid, and hatred that separates them. A place forgotten by everyone, including the creatures that inhabit the Earth... until now.', 'And suddenly, overnight, the world came to a halt. Two men, two survivors, one kid, and hatred that separates them. A place forgotten by everyone, including the creatures that inhabit the Earth... until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwIDreu9pYCqKpv4jomqVM9yX1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338676'),
