  ('849401653439438192', 'Extra Geography', 2026, 'Drama', 'Molly Manners, Andrew Commis, Lucy Pardee', 'Miriam Battye, Rose Tremain', 'Iyla Sundarsingh McKaig, Alice Englert, Galaxie Clear, Marni Duggan, Shvorne Marks', null, 'Set in an English boarding school, Extra Geography follows two teenage girls as they grapple with all the challenges of girlhood: friendship, boys, studies, growing up and their summer project, "to fall in love".', 'Set in an English boarding school, Extra Geography follows two teenage girls as they grapple with all the challenges of girlhood: friendship, boys, studies, growing up and their summer project, "to fall in love".', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FhJ5b864tsJVYjenKUmzElimtzXh.jpg', 'plex:movie:extra-geography'),
  ('188148676293216786', 'Extra Ordinary', 2019, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Mike Ahern, Enda Loughman, James Mather', 'Mike Ahern, Enda Loughman', 'Maeve Higgins, Barry Ward, Will Forte, Claudia O''Doherty, Jamie Beamish, Terri Chandler, Risteard Cooper, Emma Coleman', 'R', 'A driving instructor must use her other-worldly gifts to save a lonely man’s daughter from a rock star looking to use her for Satanic purposes.', 'A driving instructor must use her other-worldly gifts to save a lonely man’s daughter from a rock star looking to use her for Satanic purposes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3IRiGKXx2eMhxtV8GktKwvWkhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538227'),
  ('849097330812450018', 'Extract', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Mike Judge, Tim Suhrstedt, Venus Kanani', 'Mike Judge', 'Jason Bateman, Mila Kunis, Kristen Wiig, Ben Affleck, J.K. Simmons, Clifton Collins Jr., Dustin Milligan, David Koechner', 'R', 'The owner of a factory that produces flavor extracts, Joel Reynold seems to have it all, but really doesn''t. What''s missing is sexual attention from his wife, Suzie. Joel hatches a convoluted plan to get Suzie to cheat on him, thereby clearing the way for Joel to have an affair with Cindy, an employee. But what Joel doesn''t know is that Cindy is a sociopathic con artist, and a freak workplace accident clears the way for her to ruin Joel forever.', 'The owner of a factory that produces flavor extracts, Joel Reynold seems to have it all, but really doesn''t. What''s missing is sexual attention from his wife, Suzie. Joel hatches a convoluted plan to get Suzie to cheat on him, thereby clearing the way for Joel to have an affair with Cindy, an employee. But what Joel doesn''t know is that Cindy is a sociopathic con artist, and a freak workplace accident clears the way for her to ruin Joel forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjen0vxjybwItQPH3NNCJuME2MY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12569'),
  ('285796689390387359', 'Extracted', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nir Paniry, Mark Putnam', 'Nir Paniry', 'Sasha Roiz, Jenny Mollen, Dominic Bogart, Richard Riehle, Ty Simpkins, Frank Ashmore, Rodney Eastman, Nick Jameson', 'R', 'Thomas Jacobs invents a way to watch people''s memories from the inside. Going against his morals, he accepts an offer to enter a heroin addict''s memories to literally see if he committed a crime. However,a malfunction causes his consciousness to become trapped inside the criminal''s mind. He remains a prisoner in the addict''s memories for more than four years until he discovers the possibility of escape.', 'Thomas Jacobs invents a way to watch people''s memories from the inside. Going against his morals, he accepts an offer to enter a heroin addict''s memories to literally see if he committed a crime. However,a malfunction causes his consciousness to become trapped inside the criminal''s mind. He remains a prisoner in the addict''s memories for more than four years until he discovers the possibility of escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciuOIA66tZuCJRfRjfG9coiqjWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97605'),
