  ('798607389273382152', 'Extraordinary Tales', 2015, 'Horror, Animation, Mystery', 'Raúl García', 'Raúl García, Stéphan Roelants', 'Christopher Lee, Bela Lugosi, Julian Sands, Guillermo del Toro, Roger Corman, Stephen Hughes, Cornelia Funke, Karla Cervantes', 'NR', 'Five tales by Edgar Allan Poe come to life thanks to a pictorical style animation, five tales that exude madness, pestilence, murder and torture.', 'Five tales by Edgar Allan Poe come to life thanks to a pictorical style animation, five tales that exude madness, pestilence, murder and torture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGETWBPMDHgpdFVsJf8cYGsPWnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329020'),
  ('221663983372930444', 'Extraordinary: The Stan Romanek Story', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Documentary', 'Jon Sumple', null, 'Stan Romanek', null, 'Stan Romanek is the center of the world''s most documented extraterrestrial contact story, and the multitude of evidence accumulated over the past decade has convinced thousands around the world that his story is true. This documentary film takes audiences on a journey through Stan''s past, present and future with one goal in mind: help the world understand that no one knowingly chooses the challenges Stan and his family have endured. This film''s intention is not to prove the existence of UFOs and extraterrestrials, but it does pose the question'' What if this is all true? extraordinary: the stan romanek story is about one man''s evolution through a life he did not choose and the messages he is driven to deliver to mankind.', 'Stan Romanek is the center of the world''s most documented extraterrestrial contact story, and the multitude of evidence accumulated over the past decade has convinced thousands around the world that his story is true. This documentary film takes audiences on a journey through Stan''s past, present and future with one goal in mind: help the world understand that no one knowingly chooses the challenges Stan and his family have endured. This film''s intention is not to prove the existence of UFOs and extraterrestrials, but it does pose the question'' What if this is all true? extraordinary: the stan romanek story is about one man''s evolution through a life he did not choose and the messages he is driven to deliver to mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67f0QvxHly7VeaPkb9IAtbO3jT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451197'),
  ('268720128545395591', 'Extraterrestrial', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Jon D. Domínguez, Aitor Basterretxea', 'Nacho Vigalondo', 'Julián Villagrán, Michelle Jenner, Raúl Cimas, Carlos Areces, Miguel Noguera', null, 'Everyone knows what to do if one morning the sky would be absolutely full of UFOs: run as fast as you can. However, what would happen if the invasion started while you are in the flat of the girl of your dreams, the one you have just met?', 'Everyone knows what to do if one morning the sky would be absolutely full of UFOs: run as fast as you can. However, what would happen if the invasion started while you are in the flat of the girl of your dreams, the one you have just met?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIZCOW54wxYYsHBdL3Tion4ptHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76333'),
  ('1137382047969282797', 'Extraterrestrial', 2014, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Colin Minihan, Samy Inayeh', 'Colin Minihan, Stuart Ortiz', 'Brittany Allen, Melanie Papalia, Jesse Moss, Anja Savcic, Sean Rogerson, Emily Perkins, Mike Kovac, Ian Brown', 'NR', 'Five friends set out to a cabin in the woods for a fun weekend getaway that is, until extraterrestrial visitors turn it into a fight for their lives. The group is pulled from their reverie when a flickering object crashes deep in the woods. As they investigate, the friends stumble across an alien spacecraft, and its inhabitants have not arrived in peace.', 'Five friends set out to a cabin in the woods for a fun weekend getaway that is, until extraterrestrial visitors turn it into a fight for their lives. The group is pulled from their reverie when a flickering object crashes deep in the woods. As they investigate, the friends stumble across an alien spacecraft, and its inhabitants have not arrived in peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmiG916iIh6w378qBjRfTonqOWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265016'),
  ('30722963126606778', 'Extraterrestrial Visitors', 1983, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Juan Piquer Simón, Juan Mariné, Ricardo Navarrete', 'Juan Piquer Simón, Joaquín Grau', 'Ian Sera, Nina Ferrer, Guillermo Antón, Susanna Bequer, Óscar Martín, Frank Braña, Sara Palmer, Emilio Linder', null, 'After a meteor-like object lands in the woods, poachers unearth a cave filled with alien eggs. As they attempt to destroy the eggs, one of them is killed by an unseen creature, leaving one egg intact. A young boy named Tommy finds the remaining egg and brings it home to hatch. As more murders occur around town, Tommy learns that his new pet alien, who he names Trumpy, possesses telekinetic powers.', 'After a meteor-like object lands in the woods, poachers unearth a cave filled with alien eggs. As they attempt to destroy the eggs, one of them is killed by an unseen creature, leaving one egg intact. A young boy named Tommy finds the remaining egg and brings it home to hatch. As more murders occur around town, Tommy learns that his new pet alien, who he names Trumpy, possesses telekinetic powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxCxjUMv3TvARye7OxLHDcn6t9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28445'),
  ('138776879275460998', 'Extreme Happiness', 2010, 'Drama', 'Lauro Escorel, Arnaldo Jabor', 'Arnaldo Jabor, Ananda Rubinstein', 'Marco Nanini, Dan Stulbach, Mariana Lima, João Miguel, Maria Luísa Mendonça, Maria Flor, Elke Maravilha, Jayme Matarazzo', null, 'Shortly after World War II, the city of Rio de Janeiro experiments a period of great cultural, political and economic effervescence, when all the dreams – or nearly all – seem possible. In this exciting scenery of transformation, Paulo discovers love, friendship and sex through his childhood and adolescence in the 1950’s and 1960’s.', 'Shortly after World War II, the city of Rio de Janeiro experiments a period of great cultural, political and economic effervescence, when all the dreams – or nearly all – seem possible. In this exciting scenery of transformation, Paulo discovers love, friendship and sex through his childhood and adolescence in the 1950’s and 1960’s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4lXsDZewYsMK3FJdZzDWhXfzOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65150'),
  ('575606604626412311', 'Extreme Job', 2019, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Kim Hye-young, Park Sung-chan, Lee Byeong-heon', 'Moon Chung-il', 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Lee Hanee, Jin Sun-kyu, Lee Dong-hwi, Gong Myoung, Shin Ha-kyun, Oh Jung-se, Kim Eui-sung', null, 'A drug squad attempts to take down a criminal organization and they must go undercover to do so, so they begin working at a chicken restaurant, that becomes famous for its delicious chicken. Due to the unexpected popularity, the detectives find themselves in a situation they never expected.', 'A drug squad attempts to take down a criminal organization and they must go undercover to do so, so they begin working at a chicken restaurant, that becomes famous for its delicious chicken. Due to the unexpected popularity, the detectives find themselves in a situation they never expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52oLgq2gEiZyDjpJ7tgkGruoQI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567646'),
  ('865271094537220938', 'Extreme Justice', 1993, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mark L. Lester, Mark Irwin, Spiro Razatos', 'Robert Boris, Frank Sacks', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Scott Glenn, Chelsea Field, Yaphet Kotto, Andrew Divoff, Stephen Root, Richard Grove, William Lucking', 'R', 'Jeff Powers is the newest member of a very elite and very secret LAPD division. Their mission is to target important criminals and to get them to stop. Police brutality is not a known term for the division and they will stop at nothing to get the job done, even if it means murder.', 'Jeff Powers is the newest member of a very elite and very secret LAPD division. Their mission is to target important criminals and to get them to stop. Police brutality is not a known term for the division and they will stop at nothing to get the job done, even if it means murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAmQPtxrNvIuIjU4qmsrHN7JrqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103201'),
  ('749705545401540467', 'Extreme Measures', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Apted, John Bailey, Bruno Bryniarski', 'Tony Gilroy', 'Hugh Grant, Gene Hackman, Sarah Jessica Parker, David Morse, Bill Nunn, Paul Guilfoyle, Debra Monk, John Toles-Bey', 'R', 'Guy Luthan, a British doctor working at a hospital in New York, starts making unwelcome enquiries when the body of a man who died in his emergency room disappears. After the trail leads Luthan to the door of an eminent surgeon at the hospital, Luthan soon finds himself in extreme danger people who want the hospital''s secret to remain undiscovered.', 'Guy Luthan, a British doctor working at a hospital in New York, starts making unwelcome enquiries when the body of a man who died in his emergency room disappears. After the trail leads Luthan to the door of an eminent surgeon at the hospital, Luthan soon finds himself in extreme danger people who want the hospital''s secret to remain undiscovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uowP2Nw2mLpQni1vtbUb1LUSiP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11306'),
  ('626201836470026423', 'Extreme Movie', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Adam Jay Epstein, Andrew Jacobson, Anna Moulaison', 'Will Forte, Erica Rivinoja, Andy Jacobsen', 'Michael Cera, Jamie Kennedy, Matthew Lillard, Frankie Muniz, Ryan Pinkston, Patrick J. Adams, Denise Boutte, Brian Burt', 'R', 'A sketch comedy movie about the joys and embarrassments of teen sex. But mostly the embarrassments.', 'A sketch comedy movie about the joys and embarrassments of teen sex. But mostly the embarrassments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3N5XjwUITJo5MFhvWCJHVJt8pAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15544'),
  ('320899201761445098', 'Extreme Ops', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Christian Duguay, Hannes Hubach, Eric Bartonio', 'Michael Zaidan', 'Devon Sawa, Bridgette Wilson-Sampras, Rufus Sewell, Rupert Graves, Heino Ferch, Joe Absolom, Jana Pallaske, Jean-Pierre Castaldi', 'PG-13', 'While filming an advertisement, some extreme sports enthusiasts unwittingly stop a group of terrorists.', 'While filming an advertisement, some extreme sports enthusiasts unwittingly stop a group of terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/984tq1bRL2uzR0wHrNzZVYTR0Al.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15074'),
  ('1104468319908031634', 'Extreme Prejudice', 1987, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama, Western', 'Walter Hill, Dirk Petersmann, Bennie E. Dobbins', 'Deric Washburn, Harry Kleiner', 'Nick Nolte, Powers Boothe, Michael Ironside, María Conchita Alonso, Rip Torn, Clancy Brown, William Forsythe, Matt Mulhern', 'R', 'Lean, mean Texas Ranger Jack Benteen locks horns with a former friend, Cash Bailey, now a ruthless drug kingpin. Though they''re on opposite sides of the law, they share a love interest in the sensual Sarita. When a crew of rogue soldiers descends upon the border town for an off-the-books mission, all roads lead to a bloody, to-the-death showdown, as loyalties shift and the lines between good and evil are blurred.', 'Lean, mean Texas Ranger Jack Benteen locks horns with a former friend, Cash Bailey, now a ruthless drug kingpin. Though they''re on opposite sides of the law, they share a love interest in the sensual Sarita. When a crew of rogue soldiers descends upon the border town for an off-the-books mission, all roads lead to a bloody, to-the-death showdown, as loyalties shift and the lines between good and evil are blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqN3duCLrjcsF8dfiP1XCCtlWZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20287'),
  ('804919787468092318', 'Extreme Private Eros: Love Song 1974', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Kazuo Hara, Kazuo Hara', 'Kazuo Hara', 'Kazuo Hara, Miyuki Takeda, Sachiko Kobayashi', null, 'When his wife, the outspoken feminist Miyuki Takeda, announced that she was leaving him in order to find herself, Kazuo Hara began this raw, intensely personal documentary as a way to both maintain a connection to the woman he still cared for and to make sense of their complex relationship. Granted at times shockingly intimate access to Miyuki’s personal life, Hara follows her wayward journey toward liberation as she explores her sexuality with both men and women, becomes pregnant and raises a family as a single mother, and grows increasingly disenchanted with the constraints of traditional social structures.', 'When his wife, the outspoken feminist Miyuki Takeda, announced that she was leaving him in order to find herself, Kazuo Hara began this raw, intensely personal documentary as a way to both maintain a connection to the woman he still cared for and to make sense of their complex relationship. Granted at times shockingly intimate access to Miyuki’s personal life, Hara follows her wayward journey toward liberation as she explores her sexuality with both men and women, becomes pregnant and raises a family as a single mother, and grows increasingly disenchanted with the constraints of traditional social structures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e75Ts3Qk9GHLrb52e4qBoQiYdSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130639'),
  ('230086786963032052', 'Extremely Loud & Incredibly Close', 2011, 'Drama', 'Stephen Daldry, Chris Menges, I. Javier Ameijeiras', 'Eric Roth', 'Tom Hanks, Sandra Bullock, Thomas Horn, Viola Davis, John Goodman, Jeffrey Wright, Zoe Caldwell, Max von Sydow', 'PG-13', 'A year after his father''s death, Oskar, a troubled young boy, discovers a mysterious key he believes was left for him by his father and embarks on a scavenger hunt to find the matching lock.', 'A year after his father''s death, Oskar, a troubled young boy, discovers a mysterious key he believes was left for him by his father and embarks on a scavenger hunt to find the matching lock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pszViNvKr1r31pP7gJNYDHEx5P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64685'),
  ('829439345757991185', 'Extremely Wicked, Shockingly Evil and Vile', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Joe Berlinger, Brandon Trost, Stephen E. Hagen', 'Michael Werwie', 'Zac Efron, Lily Collins, Kaya Scodelario, Jeffrey Donovan, Angela Sarafyan, Dylan Baker, Brian Geraghty, Terry Kinney', 'R', 'A chronicle of the crimes of Ted Bundy, from the perspective of his longtime girlfriend, Elizabeth Kloepfer, who refused to believe the truth about him for years.', 'A chronicle of the crimes of Ted Bundy, from the perspective of his longtime girlfriend, Elizabeth Kloepfer, who refused to believe the truth about him for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7dVwEBU3vupg3hZQMeyL6ksz0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457799'),
  ('861570304706560073', 'Extremis', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Dan Krauss, Dan Krauss', null, 'Monica Bhargava, Jessica Zitter', null, 'A purely observational non-fiction film that takes viewers into the ethically murky world of end-of-life decision making in a public hospital.', 'A purely observational non-fiction film that takes viewers into the ethically murky world of end-of-life decision making in a public hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vDbsnL2601o6fyrNlXHu0wWP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393443'),
  ('28085697821893111', 'Extremities', 1986, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Robert M. Young, Curtis Clark', 'William Mastrosimone', 'Farrah Fawcett, James Russo, Alfre Woodard, Diana Scarwid, Sandy Martin, Eddie Velez, Tom Everett, Donna Lynn Leavy', 'R', 'A woman escapes from the man who is about to rape her, but leaves her purse behind. Afraid that her attacker might come after her, she goes to the police, but with no proof of the incident, they can do nothing. In fact, the man does use the information in her bag and comes to her apartment with the intent of rape, but she sprays him in the face with insect repellent, and then holds him captive. She is then faced with deciding whether to go to the police who might not believe her and release him, or to kill him.', 'A woman escapes from the man who is about to rape her, but leaves her purse behind. Afraid that her attacker might come after her, she goes to the police, but with no proof of the incident, they can do nothing. In fact, the man does use the information in her bag and comes to her apartment with the intent of rape, but she sprays him in the face with insect repellent, and then holds him captive. She is then faced with deciding whether to go to the police who might not believe her and release him, or to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnzuqWIL840oE2vgtW81q1p1CAL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44326'),
  ('384471253448222876', 'Extremity', 2018, 'Horror', 'Scott Winig, Rebecca Swan, Adam Barber', 'Rebecca Swan, David Bond', 'Chad Rook, September D''Angelo, Natalie Victoria, J. LaRose, Jeffrey Reddick, Cam Damage, Mark Kandborg, Ashley B. Smith', null, 'A young woman with a severely troubled past signs up for an extreme haunt called Perdition. She believes that putting herself through Perdition''s nightmarish trials will help her exorcise her internal traumas, but has no way of knowing just how shocking her ordeal will be-or what dark secrets buried in her psyche will emerge.', 'A young woman with a severely troubled past signs up for an extreme haunt called Perdition. She believes that putting herself through Perdition''s nightmarish trials will help her exorcise her internal traumas, but has no way of knowing just how shocking her ordeal will be-or what dark secrets buried in her psyche will emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cewpBXCzcBWNrfpwrSs83PxW2Xk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521509'),
  ('1134705968892714231', 'Eye for an Eye', 1996, 'Thriller, Drama', 'John Schlesinger, Amir Mokri, Gregory Jacobs', 'Amanda Silver, Rick Jaffa', 'Sally Field, Kiefer Sutherland, Ed Harris, Beverly D''Angelo, Charlayne Woodard, Joe Mantegna, Olivia Burnette, Alexandra Kyle', 'R', 'It''s fire and brimstone time as grieving mother Karen McCann takes justice into her own hands when a kangaroo court in Los Angeles fails to convict Robert Doob, the monster who raped and murdered her 17-year-old daughter.', 'It''s fire and brimstone time as grieving mother Karen McCann takes justice into her own hands when a kangaroo court in Los Angeles fails to convict Robert Doob, the monster who raped and murdered her 17-year-old daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2lZSdJ1o0VvLegTw3ad6KFtxra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17182'),
  ('711979158680894107', 'Eye for an Eye', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Lorena Vilas, Paco Plaza, Pablo Rosso', 'Juan Galiñanes, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Luis Tosar, María Vázquez, Ismael Martínez, Pablo Guisa Koestinger, Daniel Currás, María Luisa Mayol, Víctor Duplá, Enric Auquer', 'NR', 'Mario, an exemplary man, lives in a village on the Galician coast. In the old people’s home, where he works as a nurse, everyone appreciates him. When the best known narco in the area, Antonio Padín, recently released from prison, enters the residence, Mario tries to make Antonio feel at home. Now, Padín''s two sons, Kike and Toño, are in charge of the family business. The failure of an operation will put Kike in jail and cause them to owe a large debt to a Colombian supplier. Toño will turn to the nurse to try to convince his father to assume the debt. But Mario has his own plans.', 'Mario, an exemplary man, lives in a village on the Galician coast. In the old people’s home, where he works as a nurse, everyone appreciates him. When the best known narco in the area, Antonio Padín, recently released from prison, enters the residence, Mario tries to make Antonio feel at home. Now, Padín''s two sons, Kike and Toño, are in charge of the family business. The failure of an operation will put Kike in jail and cause them to owe a large debt to a Colombian supplier. Toño will turn to the nurse to try to convince his father to assume the debt. But Mario has his own plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WEJAWFusNeZIJDNYxeIPytuZ1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574376'),
  ('971121385295196337', 'Eye for an Eye', 2022, 'Action, Drama', 'Yang Bingjia, Zhao Xiaofeng, Qin Pengfei', 'Yang Bingjia', 'Xie Miao, Gao Weiman, Xiang Hao, Liu Ben, Zhang Di, Gao Yi, Zhang Haosen, Kang Xuan', 'NR', 'A highly trained and exceptionally deadly swordsman looks for revenge after being caught in the middle of a power struggle that results in the assassination of an innocent woman''s family.', 'A highly trained and exceptionally deadly swordsman looks for revenge after being caught in the middle of a power struggle that results in the assassination of an innocent woman''s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6IeDuUx5AuF66RSk7njc9RJYxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983311'),
  ('12852789501095759', 'Eye for an Eye', 2025, 'Horror', 'Colin Tilley, Rob Leitzell', 'Elisa Victoria', 'Whitney Peak, Golda Rosheuvel, Finn Bennett, Laken Giles, S. Epatha Merkerson, Carson Minniear, Wynn Reichert, Ben Bladon', null, 'Anna, grieving the sudden death of her parents, relocates from New York to a small Florida town to live with the grandmother she has never met. Isolated, vulnerable, and in need of friends, she finds brief solace in the company of two local teens. But when she becomes complicit to their unforgivable act of violence, she finds herself ensnared by Mr. Sandman – the twisted soul of a tormented child who haunts bullies’ dreams before feasting on their eyeballs when they finally wake - Anna must right her wrong before becoming a victim of this gruesome curse.', 'Anna, grieving the sudden death of her parents, relocates from New York to a small Florida town to live with the grandmother she has never met. Isolated, vulnerable, and in need of friends, she finds brief solace in the company of two local teens. But when she becomes complicit to their unforgivable act of violence, she finds herself ensnared by Mr. Sandman – the twisted soul of a tormented child who haunts bullies’ dreams before feasting on their eyeballs when they finally wake - Anna must right her wrong before becoming a victim of this gruesome curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpepbfVziHJLhVoxTEKs8ok00iu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1199869'),
  ('1041364083810607832', 'Eye For An Eye', 2008, 'Action, Crime', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Ahn Kwon-tae, Kim Sang-chul', 'Kim Dong-woo', 'Han Suk-kyu, Cha Seung-won, Song Young-chang, Lee Byung-joon, Jeong In-gi, Kim Ji-seok, Kim Yun-tae, Lee Jae-gu', null, 'The devious brain behind a heist draws a top police detective, on the eve of his retirement, into an elaborate plot of robbery and revenge.', 'The devious brain behind a heist draws a top police detective, on the eve of his retirement, into an elaborate plot of robbery and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNCV3ExvB5jD8ZAmbbkwbblF7gp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49095'),
  ('561121246366655571', 'Eye for an Eye 2', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'Yang Bingjia, Zhu Jintai, Zhao Xiaofeng', 'Yang Bingjia', 'Xie Miao, Yang Enyou, Huang Tao, Pei Kuishan, Pema Jyad, Liu Fengchao, Jampa Tseten, Xiao Songyuan', 'NR', 'The blind swordsman, skilled in martial arts, named Cheng Xiazi (Xie Miao), accidentally saves Zhang Xiaoyu (Yang Enyou), who has suffered from the destruction of his family. Under the persuasion of the orphan Xiaoyu, Cheng reluctantly keeps him by his side and teaches him skills. Xiaoyu also waits for the opportunity to seek revenge.', 'The blind swordsman, skilled in martial arts, named Cheng Xiazi (Xie Miao), accidentally saves Zhang Xiaoyu (Yang Enyou), who has suffered from the destruction of his family. Under the persuasion of the orphan Xiaoyu, Cheng reluctantly keeps him by his side and teaches him skills. Xiaoyu also waits for the opportunity to seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxGkinl8TwFdIUffEdTOw95lKL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235623'),
  ('229464502648832526', 'Eye in the Labyrinth', 1972, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mario Caiano, Giovanni Ciarlo', 'Horst Hächler', 'Rosemary Dexter, Adolfo Celi, Alida Valli, Horst Frank, Sybil Danning, Franco Ressel, Michael Maien, Benjamin Lev', null, 'Julie is disturbed by the disappearance of her psychiatrist boyfriend Luca following a bizarre dream where she witnessed him murdered. She travels to a seaside village where he might be and encounters Frank, who tells her Luca has indeed been there. Julie''s investigation leads her to the house of Gerta, where the mystery deepens among the odd characters residing at this artists enclave.', 'Julie is disturbed by the disappearance of her psychiatrist boyfriend Luca following a bizarre dream where she witnessed him murdered. She travels to a seaside village where he might be and encounters Frank, who tells her Luca has indeed been there. Julie''s investigation leads her to the house of Gerta, where the mystery deepens among the odd characters residing at this artists enclave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUEJ8L5Bw4SwElxKRolOBLOfk6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74325'),
  ('964287892936994909', 'Eye in the Sky', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung', 'Au Kin-Yee, Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Simon Yam, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Kate Tsui Tsz-Shan, Lam Suet, Maggie Shiu, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Berg Ng Ting-Yip, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung', null, 'The head of an elite Hong Kong surveillance unit keeps one eye on his rookie apprentice and the other on a notorious criminal he suspects of masterminding a recent jewel heist in this tense thriller from filmmaking duo Johnnie To and Nai-Hoi Yau. Of course, the criminal knows all along he''s being watched. But that doesn''t stop him from trying to pull off the biggest score of his career.', 'The head of an elite Hong Kong surveillance unit keeps one eye on his rookie apprentice and the other on a notorious criminal he suspects of masterminding a recent jewel heist in this tense thriller from filmmaking duo Johnnie To and Nai-Hoi Yau. Of course, the criminal knows all along he''s being watched. But that doesn''t stop him from trying to pull off the biggest score of his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY5A36rodvUBp4NkMrlH6HiDJrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37984'),
  ('887628008214560388', 'Eye in the Sky', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Gavin Hood, Haris Zambarloukos, Patrick O''Connor', 'Guy Hibbert', 'Helen Mirren, Aaron Paul, Alan Rickman, Barkhad Abdi, Jeremy Northam, Phoebe Fox, Armaan Haggio, Aisha Takow', 'R', 'A UK-based military officer in command of a top secret drone operation to capture terrorists in Kenya discovers the targets are planning a suicide bombing and the mission escalates from “capture” to “kill.” As American pilot Steve Watts is about to engage, a nine-year old girl enters the kill zone, triggering an international dispute reaching the highest levels of US and British government over the moral, political, and personal implications of modern warfare.', 'A UK-based military officer in command of a top secret drone operation to capture terrorists in Kenya discovers the targets are planning a suicide bombing and the mission escalates from “capture” to “kill.” As American pilot Steve Watts is about to engage, a nine-year old girl enters the kill zone, triggering an international dispute reaching the highest levels of US and British government over the moral, political, and personal implications of modern warfare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faRGb9SuyGuZpsNRoIxoVSLLCId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333352'),
  ('343844530936981809', 'Eye Myth', 1967, 'Animation', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'After the title, a white screen gives way to a series of frames suggestive of abstract art, usually with one or two colors dominating and rapid change in the images. Two figures emerge from this jungle of color: the first, a shirtless man, appears twice, coming into focus, then disappearing behind the bursts and patterns of color, then reappearing; the second figure appears later, in the right foreground. This figure suggests someone older, someone of substance. The myth? Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2012.', 'After the title, a white screen gives way to a series of frames suggestive of abstract art, usually with one or two colors dominating and rapid change in the images. Two figures emerge from this jungle of color: the first, a shirtless man, appears twice, coming into focus, then disappearing behind the bursts and patterns of color, then reappearing; the second figure appears later, in the right foreground. This figure suggests someone older, someone of substance. The myth? Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meHL1T6kaLsJoOckNynht23LeZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97516'),
  ('163492125676593214', 'Eye of God', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Tim Blake Nelson, Harry Jarvis, Brent Burditt', 'Tim Blake Nelson', 'Martha Plimpton, Kevin Anderson, Nick Stahl, Richard Jenkins, Margo Martindale, Maggie Moore, Mary Kay Place, Hal Holbrook', 'R', 'A small Oklahoma town is stripped of its innocence when one of its boys turns up mute and bloodied by the lakeside. Unable to tell his story, the local sheriff embarks on a quest to uncover the roots of a gruesome crime. He''s led to Ainsley DuPree and her new husband, Jack, a man whose interest in family may very well outweigh his morals.', 'A small Oklahoma town is stripped of its innocence when one of its boys turns up mute and bloodied by the lakeside. Unable to tell his story, the local sheriff embarks on a quest to uncover the roots of a gruesome crime. He''s led to Ainsley DuPree and her new husband, Jack, a man whose interest in family may very well outweigh his morals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMxJNqwDH9bm69z0DnPFyMrVv0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62184'),
  ('1104098869610967366', 'Eye of the Beast', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Gary Yates, Laurie Mirsky, Khali Wenaus', 'Mark Mullin', 'James Van Der Beek, Alexandra Castillo, Arne MacPherson, Ryan Rajendra Black, Brian Edward Roach, Kyra Harper, Kelly Wolfman, Rick Skene', 'NR', 'This menacing monster yarn stars James Van Der Beek as government scientist Dan Leland, who''s sent to investigate reported sightings of a giant squidlike beast that''s put the entire population of a fishing village on edge. Though Leland starts his journey confident that this sea creature with an insatiable appetite is the stuff of old legends, a string of horrific occurrences soon begins to change his mind.', 'This menacing monster yarn stars James Van Der Beek as government scientist Dan Leland, who''s sent to investigate reported sightings of a giant squidlike beast that''s put the entire population of a fishing village on edge. Though Leland starts his journey confident that this sea creature with an insatiable appetite is the stuff of old legends, a string of horrific occurrences soon begins to change his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqDYQBx7qYPONr0MsQTc6f7BvvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59127'),
  ('17030461093494091', 'Eye of the Beholder', 2000, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Stephan Elliott, Guy Dufaux', 'Stephan Elliott', 'Ewan McGregor, Ashley Judd, Patrick Bergin, K.D. Lang, Geneviève Bujold, Jason Priestley, Kaitlin Brown, Anne-Marie Brown', 'R', 'A reclusive surveillance expert is hired to spy on a mysterious blackmailer, who just may be a serial killer.', 'A reclusive surveillance expert is hired to spy on a mysterious blackmailer, who just may be a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eB1Gw5r3Etbe4su6PhOo6OAN9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18681'),
  ('871901599924001221', 'Eye of the Cat', 1969, 'Horror', 'David Lowell Rich, Ellsworth Fredericks, Russell Metty', 'Joseph Stefano', 'Michael Sarrazin, Gayle Hunnicutt, Eleanor Parker, Tim Henry, Laurence Naismith, Jennifer Leak, Linden Chiles, Mark Herron', null, 'A man and his girlfriend plan to rob the mansion of the man''s eccentric but wealthy aunt. However, the aunt keeps dozens of cats in her home, and the man is deathly afraid of cats.', 'A man and his girlfriend plan to rob the mansion of the man''s eccentric but wealthy aunt. However, the aunt keeps dozens of cats in her home, and the man is deathly afraid of cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoHaQFwqdZj5iusFoCE4w06D7MI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121401'),
  ('339732166585294776', 'Eye of the Devil', 1966, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'J. Lee Thompson, Erwin Hillier, Basil Rayburn', 'Dennis Murphy, Robin Estridge', 'Deborah Kerr, David Niven, Sharon Tate, David Hemmings, Donald Pleasence, Edward Mulhare, Flora Robson, John Le Mesurier', 'NR', 'A French nobleman deserts his wife because of an ancient family secret.', 'A French nobleman deserts his wife because of an ancient family secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14gehKJzoyoFWMqzCKDt5mHQXZs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3051'),
  ('502304295005684377', 'Eye of the Dolphin', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Michael D. Sellers, Alexa Sheehan, Guy Livneh', 'Wendell Morris, Michael D. Sellers', 'Carly Schroeder, Adrian Dunbar, George Harris, Katharine Ross, Christine Adams, Jane Lynch, Andrea Bowen, Kelly Vitz', 'PG-13', 'Alyssa is a troubled 14-year old, suspended from school a year after her mother has drowned. Her grandmother Lucy, at wit''s end, decides to take Alyssa to her father, James, whom Alyssa thought was dead for years. He studies dolphin communication at Smith''s Point, on the Grand Bahama Island. James has not known of Alyssa''s existence and is clueless about parenthood. The women arrive at the same time that James may lose his research operation to a tourist attraction. Father, daughter, dolphins, and town are on a collision course. Alyssa and James get encouragement from James''s girlfriend and her father. It''s the dolphins who can teach, and Alyssa who discovers how to listen.', 'Alyssa is a troubled 14-year old, suspended from school a year after her mother has drowned. Her grandmother Lucy, at wit''s end, decides to take Alyssa to her father, James, whom Alyssa thought was dead for years. He studies dolphin communication at Smith''s Point, on the Grand Bahama Island. James has not known of Alyssa''s existence and is clueless about parenthood. The women arrive at the same time that James may lose his research operation to a tourist attraction. Father, daughter, dolphins, and town are on a collision course. Alyssa and James get encouragement from James''s girlfriend and her father. It''s the dolphins who can teach, and Alyssa who discovers how to listen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oaWtuz9pfRtCOtHQ5KIWB3vnYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46849'),
  ('453593413075885685', 'Eye of the Eagle', 1997, 'Adventure, History, Drama, Family', 'Peter Flinth', 'Nikolaj Scherfig', 'Nijas Ørnbak-Fjeldmose, Lasse Baunkilde, Lars Lohmann, Maj Bockhahn Bjerregaard, Björn Granath, Bjørn Floberg, Torbjørn Hummel, Lasse Lunderskov', null, 'In 1218 Danish king Valdemar sends his homonymous young son and heir in safety, as war is at the borders, to Erskil, the bishop of Ravensburg, who is instructed to see to the prince''s education. Alas the bishop is the brain of a conspiracy to seize the crown for himself, as most of the nobles are dissatisfied with the endless wars that bring them no profit. The prince and kitchen-boy Aske accidentally fall out of the castle and overhear the conspirators, but are seen and pursued by the men of the One-eyed Man, a feared mercenary who is in the conspiracy to take mortal revenge on the king for leaving him behind on a battlefield where he lost an eye which was eaten by an eagle, which he tamed and now shares his sight with. Written by KGF Vissers', 'In 1218 Danish king Valdemar sends his homonymous young son and heir in safety, as war is at the borders, to Erskil, the bishop of Ravensburg, who is instructed to see to the prince''s education. Alas the bishop is the brain of a conspiracy to seize the crown for himself, as most of the nobles are dissatisfied with the endless wars that bring them no profit. The prince and kitchen-boy Aske accidentally fall out of the castle and overhear the conspirators, but are seen and pursued by the men of the One-eyed Man, a feared mercenary who is in the conspiracy to take mortal revenge on the king for leaving him behind on a battlefield where he lost an eye which was eaten by an eagle, which he tamed and now shares his sight with. Written by KGF Vissers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAClCaM9xQFmNWLtbn97qLdHh2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76323'),
  ('1135419549732904629', 'Eye of the Needle', 1981, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alan Hume, Richard Marquand, Roger Simons', 'Stanley Mann', 'Donald Sutherland, Kate Nelligan, Ian Bannen, Christopher Cazenove, Faith Brook, Barbara Ewing, David Hayman, Alex McCrindle', 'R', 'Great Britain, 1944, during World War II. Relentlessly pursued by several MI5 agents, Henry Faber the Needle, a ruthless German spy in possession of vital information about D-Day, takes refuge on Storm Island, an inhospitable, sparsely inhabited island off the coast of northern Scotland.', 'Great Britain, 1944, during World War II. Relentlessly pursued by several MI5 agents, Henry Faber the Needle, a ruthless German spy in possession of vital information about D-Day, takes refuge on Storm Island, an inhospitable, sparsely inhabited island off the coast of northern Scotland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDPnfXCuh280WHPk7xTfG7cDlAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10863'),
  ('586590471316541516', 'Eye of the Storm', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lin Chun-yang, Jake Pollock', 'Tsun-Han Liu', 'Edison Wang, Tseng Jing-hua, Simon Hsueh, Chloe Xiang, Hsieh Ying-shiuan, Angel Lee, Chang Yung-cheng, Wang Ming-tai', 'PG-13', 'A deadly virus outbreak puts a hospital in total lockdown, and various people trapped in the crisis must confront a deluge of agonizing choices.', 'A deadly virus outbreak puts a hospital in total lockdown, and various people trapped in the crisis must confront a deluge of agonizing choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GHzOzeljHDGxE2okVnouNuFvCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1040284'),
  ('678845393465021875', 'Eye of the Tiger', 1986, 'Action, Drama', 'Peter Lyons Collister, Richard C. Sarafian', 'Michael Thomas Montgomery', 'Gary Busey, Yaphet Kotto, Seymour Cassel, Denise Galik, Kimberlin Brown, Judith Barsi, Bert Remsen, William Smith', 'R', 'Buck is a Vietnam vet, recently released from prison. He returns home to discover the town being terrorized by a vicious motorcycle gang. When the bikers murder his wife and traumatize his daughter, Buck and his friends arm themselves to the teeth and wage war against the gang to destroy them once and for all.', 'Buck is a Vietnam vet, recently released from prison. He returns home to discover the town being terrorized by a vicious motorcycle gang. When the bikers murder his wife and traumatize his daughter, Buck and his friends arm themselves to the teeth and wage war against the gang to destroy them once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Gu1ihgAeO7MBbXe7nUKV7LyQpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27271'),
  ('212563692260517312', 'Eyeball', 1975, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Umberto Lenzi, Antonio Millán', 'Félix Tusell, Umberto Lenzi', 'Martine Brochard, John Richardson, Ines Pellegrini, Andrés Mejuto, Mirta Miller, Daniele Vargas, George Rigaud, Silvia Solar', 'R', 'A group of American tourists is traveling through Spain when two of them are murdered by a mysterious serial killer who removes an eyeball from every one of its victims. The tour presses on as the murders continue, with the travelers and the police trying to deduce which one of them is the killer.', 'A group of American tourists is traveling through Spain when two of them are murdered by a mysterious serial killer who removes an eyeball from every one of its victims. The tour presses on as the murders continue, with the travelers and the police trying to deduce which one of them is the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baGVhqWvP2h1KTKyJPRSsiJpAps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40474'),
  ('706367636286117931', 'Eyeblink', 1966, null, 'Yoko Ono, Peter Moore', null, 'Yoko Ono', null, 'A 16 mm film, featuring Yoko Ono''s own eye slowly blinking, shot by Peter Moore with a high-speed camera at 2,000 frames per second, which is projected at normal speed, 24 frames per second, thus creating a slow-motion effect.', 'A 16 mm film, featuring Yoko Ono''s own eye slowly blinking, shot by Peter Moore with a high-speed camera at 2,000 frames per second, which is projected at normal speed, 24 frames per second, thus creating a slow-motion effect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99al9IKmYZ3Vu8ypKEH5INOFJGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205912'),
  ('1042977901921921694', 'Eyeborgs', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Richard Clabaugh, Kenneth Wilson II', 'Richard Clabaugh, Fran Clabaugh', 'Adrian Paul, Megan Blake, Luke Eberl, Dale Girard, Mikey Wiseman, John S. Rushton, Kat Munday, Devin McGee', 'R', 'Following a major terrorist attack, the US government initiates the ODIN surveillance system, made up of millions of mobile, robotic security cameras known as "Eyeborgs." When the physical evidence in a string of odd murders doesn''t line up to the surveillance recordings, one federal agent finds himself working outside the system to find out who''s really controlling the Eyeborgs.', 'Following a major terrorist attack, the US government initiates the ODIN surveillance system, made up of millions of mobile, robotic security cameras known as "Eyeborgs." When the physical evidence in a string of odd murders doesn''t line up to the surveillance recordings, one federal agent finds himself working outside the system to find out who''s really controlling the Eyeborgs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUzsdMgukSsWLJ4OfmS2rZiTBOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40537'),
  ('783446834626555862', 'Eyes', 2015, 'Horror', 'Yôhei Fukuda, Kazuhiro Mimura, Yôhei Fukuda', 'Yuuka Tanaka', 'Marika Ito, Seiko Ozone, Kosuke Endo, Akari Yamada, Kōji Suzuki, Yue, Taichi Yamada, Hiroki Konno', null, 'One day, a mysterious letter ''F'' starts to be written on doorplates in a condominium building. Since then, mysterious incidents consistently occur around Yukari Yamamoto, who is an ordinary female high school student living in the building.', 'One day, a mysterious letter ''F'' starts to be written on doorplates in a condominium building. Since then, mysterious incidents consistently occur around Yukari Yamamoto, who is an ordinary female high school student living in the building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLUejz1vlFcbln3OyTyLWza5lc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376221'),
  ('54758941536996349', 'Eyes Behind the Stars', 1978, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Mario Gariazzo', 'Mario Gariazzo', 'Robert Hoffmann, Nathalie Delon, Martin Balsam, Sherry Buchanan, Victor Valente, Sergio Rossi, Mario Novelli, Franco Garofalo', null, 'A photographer and his model are on a photo shoot in a forest when they get the feeling they are being watched. The feeling becomes so strong that they decide to cut their session short and leave. Later, when they develop the photos they took, they discover what looks like alien creatures in the background.', 'A photographer and his model are on a photo shoot in a forest when they get the feeling they are being watched. The feeling becomes so strong that they decide to cut their session short and leave. Later, when they develop the photos they took, they discover what looks like alien creatures in the background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eb6ClfAfKTwYKQKOwlLNwBzBAOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72090'),
  ('1141450592881777963', 'Eyes Behind the Wall', 1977, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Giuliano Petrelli, Cristiano Pogany', 'Giuliano Petrelli', 'John Phillip Law, Fernando Rey, Olga Bisera, José Quaglio, Jho Jhenkins, John P. Dulaney, Enzo Robutti, Mónica Zanchi', null, 'Ivano is a wheelchair bound man with some strange perversions. He gets his sexual kicks by spying on Arturo, his tenant in the apartment next door, while he forces his sexy accomplice, Olga, to watch as well. To increase his perverse thrill, Ivano persuades Olga to seduce Arturo and to have sex him as he watches. Unfortunately for all involved, the sex game starts to get very deadly.', 'Ivano is a wheelchair bound man with some strange perversions. He gets his sexual kicks by spying on Arturo, his tenant in the apartment next door, while he forces his sexy accomplice, Olga, to watch as well. To increase his perverse thrill, Ivano persuades Olga to seduce Arturo and to have sex him as he watches. Unfortunately for all involved, the sex game starts to get very deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zl7nymU5zVZPGp5t9YhB0aD3rqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105662'),
  ('639067626096033280', 'Eyes in the Night', 1942, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Fred Zinnemann, Robert H. Planck, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Howard Emmett Rogers, Guy Trosper', 'Edward Arnold, Ann Harding, Donna Reed, Stephen McNally, Katherine Emery, Allen Jenkins, Stanley Ridges, Reginald Denny', 'NR', 'Blind detective Duncan Maclain gets mixed up with enemy agents and murder when he tries to help an old friend with a rebellious stepdaughter.', 'Blind detective Duncan Maclain gets mixed up with enemy agents and murder when he tries to help an old friend with a rebellious stepdaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZfZJNPxyKsrCblI7UT0EF1Cdul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84506'),
  ('1030336475400912501', 'Eyes of a Stranger', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mini Rojas, Ken Wiederhorn', 'Ron Kurz, Eric L. Bloom', 'Lauren Tewes, Jennifer Jason Leigh, John DiSanti, Peter DuPre, Gwen Lewis, Robert Small, Kitty Lunn, Timothy Hawkins', 'R', 'A TV newswoman catches a pervert watching her sister who cannot see, hear or speak.', 'A TV newswoman catches a pervert watching her sister who cannot see, hear or speak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uAQkwCIgK1LHacoHPHqWelzn8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79649'),
  ('1095115075953145845', 'Eyes of an Angel', 1991, 'Drama', 'Robert Harmon, Theo van de Sande', 'Robert Stitzel', 'John Travolta, Ellie Raab, Tito Larriva, Richard Edson, Vincent Guastaferro, Jeffrey DeMunn, Gene LeBell, Frank Ammirati', null, 'John Travolta is a downtrodden single father raising his daughter under difficult circumstances in Chicago. The young girl comes upon and then nurses a wounded Doberman used for fighting, back to health. Duped by underworld types he was working as a courier for, father and daughter leave the dog and flee cross-country to Los Angeles with both canine and mobsters in pursuit.', 'John Travolta is a downtrodden single father raising his daughter under difficult circumstances in Chicago. The young girl comes upon and then nurses a wounded Doberman used for fighting, back to health. Duped by underworld types he was working as a courier for, father and daughter leave the dog and flee cross-country to Los Angeles with both canine and mobsters in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/245VToHQ4z0zFhqXIfsFZDhuj7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50677'),
  ('896837854067685179', 'Eyes of Crystal', 2004, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Eros Puglielli, Ivan Ranghelov, Anton Bakarski', 'Eros Puglielli, Gabriella Blasi, Franco Ferrini', 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Desislava Tenekedjieva, Simón Andreu, José Ángel Egido, Lucía Jiménez, Carmelo Gómez, Eusebio Poncela, Branimir Miladinov', null, 'While hunting a cultured and vicious psychopath, detective Amaldi faces the physical and moral decay of his city as well as the ghosts of his past.', 'While hunting a cultured and vicious psychopath, detective Amaldi faces the physical and moral decay of his city as well as the ghosts of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AhCbCWmDQPJdfm07LdrLUkpui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89587'),
  ('164528473681358142', 'Eyes of Fire', 1983, 'Horror, Drama', 'Avery Crounse, Robert Birnberg, Corinne Pierce', 'Avery Crounse', 'Dennis Lipscomb, Guy Boyd, Rebecca Stanley, Sally Klein, Karlene Crockett, Fran Ryan, Rob Paulsen, Kerry Sherman', 'R', 'In 1750, an adulterous preacher is ejected from a small British colony with his motley crew of followers, who make their way downriver to establish a new settlement of their own beyond the western frontier.', 'In 1750, an adulterous preacher is ejected from a small British colony with his motley crew of followers, who make their way downriver to establish a new settlement of their own beyond the western frontier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxT0psJTjT2yri8QOvHE4N7iANo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72349'),
  ('776681792635665672', 'Eyes of Laura Mars', 1978, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Irvin Kershner, Cis Corman, Victor J. Kemper', 'David Zelag Goodman, John Carpenter', 'Faye Dunaway, Tommy Lee Jones, Brad Dourif, René Auberjonois, Raúl Juliá, Darlanne Fluegel, Michael Tucker, Frank Adonis', 'R', 'A famous fashion photographer develops a disturbing ability to see through the eyes of a serial killer.', 'A famous fashion photographer develops a disturbing ability to see through the eyes of a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6njtFr9IkmJGzwCkZWpDIYI1oC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29143'),
  ('411693795325387905', 'Eyes of the Dead', 1956, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Antonio Santillán, José María Nunes, Ricardo Albiñana', 'Ignacio F. Iquino, Joaquina Algars, José Antonio de la Loma Jr.', 'Carlos López Moctezuma, Armando Moreno, Beatriz Aguirre, Carolina Jiménez, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Miguel Fleta, Jesús Colomer, María Luz de Reyes', null, 'Enrique kills a man for stealing him a check he has received due to an accident. However, things get complicated because it had not yet been cashed. This will force him to try to forge the signature and eliminate any suspect, including his girlfriend Clara, who works in a law office and who talked him about the check. Police tracks the case, but by chance Pedrito, the police inspector''s son, is also investigating on his own.', 'Enrique kills a man for stealing him a check he has received due to an accident. However, things get complicated because it had not yet been cashed. This will force him to try to forge the signature and eliminate any suspect, including his girlfriend Clara, who works in a law office and who talked him about the check. Police tracks the case, but by chance Pedrito, the police inspector''s son, is also investigating on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYGNTc9ggXFf3e6qLrB3EpPH5jp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100153'),
  ('1072962435422122201', 'Eyes of the Spider', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Masaki Tamura, Tatsuya Yoshimura', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Yōichi Nishiyama', 'Show Aikawa, Dankan, Ren Osugi, Shun Sugata, Kumi Nakamura, Susumu Terajima, Sadao Abe, Moe Sakura', null, 'After killing the man he believes murdered his daughter, a white-collar worker returns to his mundane life, until he''s approached by a man offering a mysterious job opportunity.', 'After killing the man he believes murdered his daughter, a white-collar worker returns to his mundane life, until he''s approached by a man offering a mysterious job opportunity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDnZwVZWXxZvUSVELePhMmbfHay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66061'),
