  ('100097553300093213', 'F.T.W.', 1994, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Michael Karbelnikoff, Phil Robinson, James L. Carter', 'Mari Kornhauser', 'Mickey Rourke, Lori Singer, Brion James, Peter Berg, Rodney A. Grant, Aaron Neville, Frank P. Costanza, Charlie Sexton', 'R', 'A man and a woman running from their pasts are trapped on a collision course with the future. Frank T. Wells, a newly-released ex-con looking for a few acres of freedom on the rodeo circuit. Scarlett Stuart, a wild beautiful woman on the run from a bank robbery gone desperately wrong. Together they will explore their own personal vision of the American Dream.', 'A man and a woman running from their pasts are trapped on a collision course with the future. Frank T. Wells, a newly-released ex-con looking for a few acres of freedom on the rodeo circuit. Scarlett Stuart, a wild beautiful woman on the run from a bank robbery gone desperately wrong. Together they will explore their own personal vision of the American Dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyRZiujS6iRsQaJNmqdQFAHskT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26937'),
