  ('250697795639122331', 'F*ckin'' Fred : Comme un Léopard', 2025, 'Comedy, Documentary, Music', 'Clément Cotentin', 'Clément Cotentin, Orelsan, Jonathan Cohen', 'Jonathan Cohen, Orelsan, Ablaye, Skread, Clément Cotentin, Eddie Purple, Phazz', null, 'One of the most iconic characters of Jonathan Cohen, F*ckin'' Fred, makes his return after being created in the 2020 Orelsan''s Epilogue Tour where Jonathan was a surprise guest. This epic documentary will tell how F*ckin'' Fred was created but also his journey through the first official Fuckin'' Fred concert.', 'One of the most iconic characters of Jonathan Cohen, F*ckin'' Fred, makes his return after being created in the 2020 Orelsan''s Epilogue Tour where Jonathan was a surprise guest. This epic documentary will tell how F*ckin'' Fred was created but also his journey through the first official Fuckin'' Fred concert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZgnVd8PY4AQSQAo3n9HKpKn2Sx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1428847'),
