  ('951620565658037231', 'F1', 2025, 'Action, Drama', 'Joseph Kosinski, Claudio Miranda, Kailyn Dabkowski', 'Ehren Kruger', 'Brad Pitt, Damson Idris, Javier Bardem, Kerry Condon, Tobias Menzies, Kim Bodnia, Sarah Niles, Will Merrick', 'PG-13', 'Racing legend Sonny Hayes is coaxed out of retirement to lead a struggling Formula 1 team—and mentor a young hotshot driver—while chasing one more chance at glory.', 'Racing legend Sonny Hayes is coaxed out of retirement to lead a struggling Formula 1 team—and mentor a young hotshot driver—while chasing one more chance at glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqBmyAj0Xm9LnS1xe1MSlMAJyHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911430'),
