  ('626207449188256547', 'Fab Five: The Texas Cheerleader Scandal', 2008, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Tom McLoughlin, Lloyd Ahern II', 'Teena Booth', 'Jenna Dewan, Ashley Benson, Tatum O''Neal, Aimée Spring Fortier, Jessica Heap, Stephanie Honoré, Ashlynn Ross, Jason Davis', null, 'Based on a true story. Five high school cheerleaders, including the daughter of the school principal, run amok -- and teachers, parents and administrators allow them to get away with a wide range of scandalous behavior. Known as the "Fab Five," the girls disregard school rules, drink alcohol and post suggestive pictures on the Internet. But when the new cheerleading coach attempts to discipline them, her superiors ask her to resign.', 'Based on a true story. Five high school cheerleaders, including the daughter of the school principal, run amok -- and teachers, parents and administrators allow them to get away with a wide range of scandalous behavior. Known as the "Fab Five," the girls disregard school rules, drink alcohol and post suggestive pictures on the Internet. But when the new cheerleading coach attempts to discipline them, her superiors ask her to resign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0OlzhHEfzGeibxgz6iltsCB8QC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37432'),
  ('475125954759443143', 'Fabian and the Deadly Wedding', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Markus Sehr, Giedrius Aleknavičius, Paul Pieck', 'Martin Eigler, Judy Horney, Sven S. Poser', 'Bastian Pastewka, Tamara Romera Ginés, Anton Dreger, Barbara Philipp, Ercan Durmaz, Mira Partecke, Bernhard Schütz, Nicole Beutler', null, 'Hapless con artist Fabian crashes a quirky winter wedding, planning to steal a valuable gift meant for the bride. But when a murder disrupts his scheme, Fabian finds himself unexpectedly drawn into solving the mystery. A thrilling murder mystery comedy packed with dark secrets.', 'Hapless con artist Fabian crashes a quirky winter wedding, planning to steal a valuable gift meant for the bride. But when a murder disrupts his scheme, Fabian finds himself unexpectedly drawn into solving the mystery. A thrilling murder mystery comedy packed with dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2T4gc5njZ0JJVYLn6Q8VxS9RoM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1436061'),
  ('471565291318637432', 'Fabian: Going to the Dogs', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Petra Misovic, Luisa Leopold, Rosa Münzing', 'Constantin Lieb, Dominik Graf', 'Tom Schilling, Albrecht Schuch, Saskia Rosendahl, Michael Wittenborn, Petra Kalkutschke, Elmar Gutmann, Aljoscha Stadelmann, Anne Bennent', null, 'In 1930s Berlin, Dr. Jakob Fabian, who works by day in advertising for a cigarette company and by night wanders the streets of the city, falls in love with an actress. As her career begins to blossom, prospects for his future begin to wane.', 'In 1930s Berlin, Dr. Jakob Fabian, who works by day in advertising for a cigarette company and by night wanders the streets of the city, falls in love with an actress. As her career begins to blossom, prospects for his future begin to wane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfrHq2hg24ZMpesf8xfXUt3wAKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620498'),
  ('801350352344346771', 'Fabiola', 1949, 'History, Drama', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Mario Craveri, Ubaldo Marelli', null, 'Michèle Morgan, Henri Vidal, Michel Simon, Louis Salou, Elisa Cegani, Massimo Girotti, Gino Cervi, Rina Morelli', null, 'In ancient Rome a love story blossoms between Fabiola, daughter of a senator, and Rhual, a Gallic gladiator. After Fabiola''s father is killed, the Romans blame the Christians and the persecution begins. Rhual confesses to being a Christian, is accused of the murder and sentenced to fight to the death in the arena.', 'In ancient Rome a love story blossoms between Fabiola, daughter of a senator, and Rhual, a Gallic gladiator. After Fabiola''s father is killed, the Romans blame the Christians and the persecution begins. Rhual confesses to being a Christian, is accused of the murder and sentenced to fight to the death in the arena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otnxpiWiM0DS7R03Kz2mPMmB4Xy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167603'),
  ('798197374217740426', 'Fable', 1996, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Fabrizio De Angelis', null, 'Ambra Angiolini, Ryan Krause, Enzo Cannavale, Agostina Belli, Milena Vukotić', null, 'Teresa, a young saleswoman of a music shop, meets Alfonso, with whom she falls in love.', 'Teresa, a young saleswoman of a music shop, meets Alfonso, with whom she falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYqlIRmHsBCcRDeIUbVLlXNuDaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60118'),
  ('843629543570103262', 'Fabrice Éboué - Adieu Hier', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Fabrice Eboué, Thomas Gaudin, Marc-Antoine Hélard', 'Fabrice Eboué', 'Fabrice Eboué', null, 'Social networks, exacerbated militancy, Cancel Culture, the Covid crisis has only accelerated the emergence of the new world... Fabrice Eboué already feels overwhelmed... After the success of "Plus Rien à Perdre" and this long period of pandemic, Fabrice Eboué returns to the stage with his fourth and new show!', 'Social networks, exacerbated militancy, Cancel Culture, the Covid crisis has only accelerated the emergence of the new world... Fabrice Eboué already feels overwhelmed... After the success of "Plus Rien à Perdre" and this long period of pandemic, Fabrice Eboué returns to the stage with his fourth and new show!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNRPrQTdKdJsclr2pCHGy27Wbo5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1111957'),
  ('72559254571155377', 'Fabrice Eboué - Levez-vous !', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Fabrice Eboué, Fabrice Eboué, Benjamin Guinois', 'Fabrice Eboué', 'Fabrice Eboué', null, 'After the success of "Faites entrer Fabrice Eboué", the agitator resumes hostilities with his new show: "Fabrice Eboué, levez-vous!" Always accused of the same crime, he makes through the trial of his existence that of our society ... Without modesty or demagogy! Between the death penalty, religion or Oscar Pistorius, he takes the challenge of laughing and making people laugh about the most sensitive subjects...', 'After the success of "Faites entrer Fabrice Eboué", the agitator resumes hostilities with his new show: "Fabrice Eboué, levez-vous!" Always accused of the same crime, he makes through the trial of his existence that of our society ... Without modesty or demagogy! Between the death penalty, religion or Oscar Pistorius, he takes the challenge of laughing and making people laugh about the most sensitive subjects...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0Y7nbVjshKaz08NmB7ct4Y08lc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367264'),
  ('177693314080932137', 'Fabrice Éboué - Plus rien à perdre', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Fabrice Eboué, Thomas Gaudin, Noémie Denat', 'Fabrice Eboué', 'Fabrice Eboué', null, 'Nothing left to lose... Fabrice Eboué lets loose like never before in this new show. If he has a field day with vegans, conspiracy theorists or his mixed couple, it is above all himself that he prefers to laugh at! 1h30 of healthy and jubilant anger!', 'Nothing left to lose... Fabrice Eboué lets loose like never before in this new show. If he has a field day with vegans, conspiracy theorists or his mixed couple, it is above all himself that he prefers to laugh at! 1h30 of healthy and jubilant anger!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bF8PDcRuLbk1pzpHZ54yvKPvUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689065'),
  ('174633378967496698', 'Fabrizio De André e PFM - Il concerto ritrovato', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Emanuele Cerri, Walter Veltroni', 'Walter Veltroni', 'Fabrizio De Andrè, Dori Ghezzi, Franz Di Cioccio, Patrick Djivas, Guido Harari, Franco Mussida, Flavio Premoli, David Riondino', null, 'This documentary explores the partnership between the prolific singer-songwriter and pioneering rock band — and their historic 1979 Genoa concert.', 'This documentary explores the partnership between the prolific singer-songwriter and pioneering rock band — and their historic 1979 Genoa concert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5v1caz6nctnb1LBfJ14RyPrzFre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656949'),
