  ('443094095074101355', 'Fabulous', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Mélanie Charbonneau, Ariel Méthot Bellemare', 'Mélanie Charbonneau, Geneviève Pettersen', 'Noémie O''Farrell, Juliette Gosselin, Mounia Zahzam, Alexandre Nachi, Alexandre Bacon, Olivia Palacci, Mikhaïl Ahooja, Hélène Major', null, 'Fabulous is a light comedy about three young women. It is an entertaining look at the paradoxes that young women face in a world where value depends on how many “likes” you receive online.', 'Fabulous is a light comedy about three young women. It is an entertaining look at the paradoxes that young women face in a world where value depends on how many “likes” you receive online.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZn9NocW7wj4SPf7fXM1k5iRZ0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611852'),
