  ('739763280868244793', 'Facing Nolan', 2022, 'Documentary, History', 'Bradley Jackson, Jacob Hamilton', 'Bradley Jackson', 'Nolan Ryan, George W. Bush, Roger Clemens, Randy Johnson, Pete Rose, Alan Ashby, Buzzie Bavasii, Craig Biggio', null, 'In the world of Major League Baseball no one has created a mythology like Nolan Ryan. Told from the point of view of the hitters who faced him and the teammates who revered him, Facing Nolan is the definitive documentary of a Texas legend.', 'In the world of Major League Baseball no one has created a mythology like Nolan Ryan. Told from the point of view of the hitters who faced him and the teammates who revered him, Facing Nolan is the definitive documentary of a Texas legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9C4yW2qEktOQW6748X6zx6aNz4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934649'),
  ('314068619629255685', 'Facing the Giants', 2006, 'Drama', 'Alex Kendrick', 'Alex Kendrick, Stephen Kendrick', 'Alex Kendrick, Shannen Fields, Bill Butler, Bailey Cave, Steve Williams, Tracy Goode, Jim McBride, Tommy McBride', 'PG', 'A losing coach with an underdog football team faces their giants of fear and failure on and off the field to surprising results.', 'A losing coach with an underdog football team faces their giants of fear and failure on and off the field to surprising results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eY8O7fIGcmwetNqvwnnkQB0LYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18925'),
  ('946667702678681921', 'Facing Windows', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ferzan Özpetek', 'Gianni Romoli, Ferzan Özpetek', 'Massimo Girotti, Raoul Bova, Filippo Nigro, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Serra Yılmaz, Maria Grazia Bon, Massimo Poggio, Ivan Bacchi', null, 'Overburdened and stuck in a greying marriage, Giovanna takes to caring for a Jewish Holocaust survivor her husband brings home. As she begins to reflect on her life, she turns to the man who lives across from her.', 'Overburdened and stuck in a greying marriage, Giovanna takes to caring for a Jewish Holocaust survivor her husband brings home. As she begins to reflect on her life, she turns to the man who lives across from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yeh5uQ6KgvxnInUYE0SYSUWd22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29987'),
  ('8712702091330544', 'Facing Your Danger', 1946, 'Documentary', 'Edwin E. Olsen, Edwin E. Olsen', 'De Leon Anthony', 'Knox Manning', null, 'This Warner Bros. The Sports Parade series short chronicles the attempt by a group of men to navigate the Colorado River through the Grand Canyon to Lake Mead. Led by Norman D. Nevills, nine men undertake a nineteen days trip in three specially built rowboats through the more than 200 rapids, some which run at 30 mph. Along the way, they see the remnants of previous expeditions. They also visit abandoned Pueblo Indian cave dwellings.', 'This Warner Bros. The Sports Parade series short chronicles the attempt by a group of men to navigate the Colorado River through the Grand Canyon to Lake Mead. Led by Norman D. Nevills, nine men undertake a nineteen days trip in three specially built rowboats through the more than 200 rapids, some which run at 30 mph. Along the way, they see the remnants of previous expeditions. They also visit abandoned Pueblo Indian cave dwellings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJFl77KVCAt7PS7FMWtPsdqsKoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240410'),
  ('821979479825080426', 'Fackham Hall', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Jim O''Hanlon, Philipp Blaubach', 'Jimmy Carr, Patrick Carr, Steve Dawson', 'Thomasin McKenzie, Ben Radcliffe, Katherine Waterston, Emma Laird, Tom Goodman-Hill, Ramon Tikaram, Tim McMullan, Anna Maxwell Martin', 'R', 'A new servant embarks on an unlikely relationship with the youngest daughter of a prominent English family. Simultaneously, rivalries are spilling over in the Davenport family, led by the Lord and Lady as they also weather the epic failure of the wedding of their eldest daughter to her caddish cousin.', 'A new servant embarks on an unlikely relationship with the youngest daughter of a prominent English family. Simultaneously, rivalries are spilling over in the Davenport family, led by the Lord and Lady as they also weather the epic failure of the wedding of their eldest daughter to her caddish cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwpdRe6WGmzqXFEJYJVepDQ6jrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175174'),
  ('799876195640630816', 'Factory', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Stanislaw Niedbalski', null, null, null, 'A documentary revolving around the Polish situation on an industrial level at the tail-end of the 1960s: it alternates between stark images at a metallurgic foundry and a board-room meeting among the various executives involved in its management.', 'A documentary revolving around the Polish situation on an industrial level at the tail-end of the 1960s: it alternates between stark images at a metallurgic foundry and a board-room meeting among the various executives involved in its management.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yv9BzQfoGqUaz1ynvQY7xDdEGOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47202'),
  ('521168065284813332', 'Factory Girl', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'George Hickenlooper, Michael Grady, Danny Green', 'Captain Mauzner', 'Sienna Miller, Guy Pearce, Hayden Christensen, Mena Suvari, Jimmy Fallon, Tara Summers, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Jack Huston', 'R', 'In the mid-1960s, wealthy debutant Edie Sedgwick meets artist Andy Warhol. She joins Warhol''s famous Factory and becomes his muse. Although she seems to have it all, Edie cannot have the love she craves from Andy, and she has an affair with a charismatic musician, who pushes her to seek independence from the artist and the milieu.', 'In the mid-1960s, wealthy debutant Edie Sedgwick meets artist Andy Warhol. She joins Warhol''s famous Factory and becomes his muse. Although she seems to have it all, Edie cannot have the love she craves from Andy, and she has an affair with a charismatic musician, who pushes her to seek independence from the artist and the milieu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5Sq71054VptVUQYGdIjjim4hFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12271'),
  ('800955445157799015', 'Factotum', 2005, 'Drama', 'John Christian Rosenlund, Bent Hamer, Paul B. Johnson', 'Bent Hamer, Jim Stark', 'Matt Dillon, Lili Taylor, Marisa Tomei, Fisher Stevens, Didier Flamand, Adrienne Shelly, Karen Young, Thomas Lyons', 'R', 'This drama centers on Hank Chinaski, the fictional alter-ego of "Factotum" author Charles Bukowski, who wanders around Los Angeles, CA trying to live off jobs which don''t interfere with his primary interest, which is writing. Along the way, he fends off the distractions offered by women, drinking and gambling.', 'This drama centers on Hank Chinaski, the fictional alter-ego of "Factotum" author Charles Bukowski, who wanders around Los Angeles, CA trying to live off jobs which don''t interfere with his primary interest, which is writing. Along the way, he fends off the distractions offered by women, drinking and gambling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfuqZHaAFiC4N8natPXojrpXR2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10475'),
  ('674727181428445389', 'Fade to Black', 1980, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'Vernon Zimmerman, Jeff Knight, Paul Chavez', 'Vernon Zimmerman', 'Dennis Christopher, Tim Thomerson, Gwynne Gilford, Norman Burton, Linda Kerridge, Morgan Paull, James Luisi, Eve Brent', 'R', 'A shy, lonely film buff embarks on a killing spree against those who browbeat and betray him, all the while stalking his idol, a Marilyn Monroe lookalike.', 'A shy, lonely film buff embarks on a killing spree against those who browbeat and betray him, all the while stalking his idol, a Marilyn Monroe lookalike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuqhXRYYrEiWBobsZcq1DvIrloB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40034'),
  ('901184740006380996', 'Fadily Camara: La plus drôle de tes copines', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Sylvain Leduc, Thierry Gautier', null, 'Fadily Camara', null, 'Irrepressible French comedian Fadily Camara weaves jokes, vivid characters and physical comedy into a lively stand-up show at La Cigale in Paris.', 'Irrepressible French comedian Fadily Camara weaves jokes, vivid characters and physical comedy into a lively stand-up show at La Cigale in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wt7YPLv0ARFHhU4VMzt0UsEBWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644350'),
  ('19015690210611447', 'Fading Gigolo', 2013, 'Comedy', 'John Turturro, Marco Pontecorvo', 'John Turturro', 'John Turturro, Woody Allen, Vanessa Paradis, Liev Schreiber, Sharon Stone, Sofía Vergara, Loan Chabanol, Bob Balaban', 'R', 'Fioravante decides to become a professional Don Juan as a way of making money to help his cash-strapped friend, Murray. With Murray acting as his "manager", the duo quickly finds themselves caught up in the crosscurrents of love and money.', 'Fioravante decides to become a professional Don Juan as a way of making money to help his cash-strapped friend, Murray. With Murray acting as his "manager", the duo quickly finds themselves caught up in the crosscurrents of love and money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bThnmRhh0d3oKcmte2w0aArm8Lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214030'),
  ('295833904714585692', 'Fading of the Cries', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy, Action', 'Steven Maguire', 'Steven Maguire', 'Jordan Matthews, Thomas Ian Nicholas, Brad Dourif, Mackenzie Rosman, Elaine Hendrix, Jessica Morris, Julia Whelan, Lateef Crowder', 'R', 'Jacob, a young man armed with a deadly sword, saves Sarah, a teenage girl, from Mathias, a malevolent evil that has begun plaguing a small farmland town while in search of an ancient necklace that had belonged to Sarah''s uncle. Jacob sets out to get Sarah home safely, running through streets, fields, churches and underground tunnels, while being pursued by hordes of demonic creatures. Along the way, both come to terms with the demons within themselves - Sarah begins to understand her hatred towards her mother and sister may be unjustified and Jacob discovers the secrets of his past, realizing the only way to truly defeat the demons is to return to the very place his family was murdered.', 'Jacob, a young man armed with a deadly sword, saves Sarah, a teenage girl, from Mathias, a malevolent evil that has begun plaguing a small farmland town while in search of an ancient necklace that had belonged to Sarah''s uncle. Jacob sets out to get Sarah home safely, running through streets, fields, churches and underground tunnels, while being pursued by hordes of demonic creatures. Along the way, both come to terms with the demons within themselves - Sarah begins to understand her hatred towards her mother and sister may be unjustified and Jacob discovers the secrets of his past, realizing the only way to truly defeat the demons is to return to the very place his family was murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyV2nITyo5GyGmrLnDeipjRpizd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42916'),
  ('769378060660457848', 'Fado', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jonas Rothlaender, Alex Hasskerl', 'Jonas Rothlaender, Sebastian Bleyl', 'Golo Euler, Luise Heyer, Albano Jerónimo, Pirjo Lonka, Isabel Abreu, Duarte Grilo, Suzana Borges, Rui Morisson', null, 'The mysteriously familiar face of a deceased young woman shakes young surgeon Fabian out of his lethargy. On a whim, he leaves Berlin for Portugal, determined to win back his former girlfriend Doro, who works at an architectural company in Lisbon.', 'The mysteriously familiar face of a deceased young woman shakes young surgeon Fabian out of his lethargy. On a whim, he leaves Berlin for Portugal, determined to win back his former girlfriend Doro, who works at an architectural company in Lisbon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDxIUmwr4n3bk5qWNHEzKzGocxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326381'),
  ('829574132252457175', 'Fados', 2007, 'Music, Documentary', 'Carlos Saura, José Luis López-Linares, Eduardo Serra', 'Carlos Saura, Ivan Dias', 'Carlos do Carmo, Mariza, Camané, Chico Buarque, Caetano Veloso, Toni Garrido, Lura, Lila Downs', null, 'A series of musical performances showcasing the diverse facets of fado, a musical genre from Lisbon.', 'A series of musical performances showcasing the diverse facets of fado, a musical genre from Lisbon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2KZGafUEXr4mi33jFzk2RCGrlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25774'),
  ('1000460498530078005', 'Faeries', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Gary Hurst', 'Jocelyn Stevenson', 'Carley O''Neill, Geoffrey Williams, Tony Robinson, Dougray Scott, Kate Winslet, John Sessions, Jeremy Irons, Elizabeth Heery', null, 'While waiting for their new home to be renovated, Nellie and her younger brother George are sent to a farm in the countryside, much to George''s delight and Nellie''s disgust. However, the farmhouse and the surrounding area are teeming with fey creatures. The first the two children encounter is a somewhat crotchety and unfriendly hobgoblin named Broom, who is (more or less) secretly looking after the farm.', 'While waiting for their new home to be renovated, Nellie and her younger brother George are sent to a farm in the countryside, much to George''s delight and Nellie''s disgust. However, the farmhouse and the surrounding area are teeming with fey creatures. The first the two children encounter is a somewhat crotchety and unfriendly hobgoblin named Broom, who is (more or less) secretly looking after the farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ki3QYasgKl4vEReTZffnpsLiroJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213033'),
  ('206031133618740819', 'Fag', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Valérie Val, Gauthier Manot, Olivier Lallart', 'Olivier Lallart', 'Paul Gomerieux, Jacques Lepesqueur, Yannis Perrier-Gustin, Henri Flesselle, Brigitta Skarpalezos, Jessy Hamy, Antonin Bytebier, Camille Melot', 'NR', 'Thomas, a 17-year-old high school student, finds himself attracted to Esteban, another boy from his school. The rumor of Thomas''s homosexuality is spreading fast, and he begins to suffer the gaze of others.', 'Thomas, a 17-year-old high school student, finds himself attracted to Esteban, another boy from his school. The rumor of Thomas''s homosexuality is spreading fast, and he begins to suffer the gaze of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmduzHXtJICUBVPhqGyE60KMN2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648987'),
