  ('885007599303836894', 'Fahrenheit 11/9', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Michael Moore, Luke Geissbühler, Jayme Roy', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore, Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, Bernie Sanders, David Hogg, Donald Trump, Steve Bannon, Roseanne Barr, Roger Ailes', 'R', 'Michael Moore''s provocative documentary explores the two most important questions of the Trump Era: How did we get here, and how do we get out.', 'Michael Moore''s provocative documentary explores the two most important questions of the Trump Era: How did we get here, and how do we get out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2G8IO5oGHezde70Xv7falXhuWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532908'),
  ('165201920992241555', 'Fahrenheit 451', 1966, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'François Truffaut, Bryan Coates, Ron Benton', 'François Truffaut, Jean-Louis Richard', 'Julie Christie, Oskar Werner, Cyril Cusack, Anton Diffring, Jeremy Spenser, Bee Duffell, Alex Scott, Gillian Aldam', 'NR', 'In the future, the government maintains control of public opinion by outlawing literature and maintaining a group of enforcers, known as “firemen,” to perform the necessary book burnings. Fireman Montag begins to question the morality of his vocation…', 'In the future, the government maintains control of public opinion by outlawing literature and maintaining a group of enforcers, known as “firemen,” to perform the necessary book burnings. Fireman Montag begins to question the morality of his vocation…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2CTpexoS9MO9lKVFfnzwVdJuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1714'),
  ('1012198013956856387', 'Fahrenheit 451', 2018, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ramin Bahrani, Shari Spier, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Amir Naderi, Ramin Bahrani', 'Michael B. Jordan, Michael Shannon, Sofia Boutella, Khandi Alexander, Lilly Singh, Martin Donovan, Andy McQueen, Dylan Taylor', 'PG-13', 'In an oppressive future, a ''fireman'' whose duty is to destroy all books begins to question his task.', 'In an oppressive future, a ''fireman'' whose duty is to destroy all books begins to question his task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urH9H50gKbUK8U6qTVd89SLQPjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401905'),
  ('722875296450034153', 'Fahrenheit 9/11', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore, John Conyers, Abdul Henderson, Craig Unger, George W. Bush, Saddam Hussein, Osama bin Laden, Larry King', 'R', 'Michael Moore''s view on how the Bush administration allegedly used the tragic events on 9/11 to push forward its agenda for unjust wars in Afghanistan and Iraq.', 'Michael Moore''s view on how the Bush administration allegedly used the tragic events on 9/11 to push forward its agenda for unjust wars in Afghanistan and Iraq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WQgOCJj22zF7Bsr0pIBgGBr71q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1777'),
  ('355129209596867776', 'Fail Safe', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'John A. Alonzo, Stephen Frears', null, 'Walter Cronkite, Richard Dreyfuss, Noah Wyle, Brian Dennehy, Sam Elliott, James Cromwell, John Diehl, Hank Azaria', null, 'Cold War tensions climb to a fever pitch when a U.S. bomber is accidentally ordered to drop a nuclear warhead on Moscow.', 'Cold War tensions climb to a fever pitch when a U.S. bomber is accidentally ordered to drop a nuclear warhead on Moscow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hg2R1TllSeXGeHYJjIqWuIJ6SKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31067'),
  ('345948181761448951', 'Failan', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Song Hae-sung, Kim Yeong-cheol', 'Ahn Sang-hoon, Song Hae-sung, Kim Hae-gon', 'Choi Min-sik, Cecilia Cheung, Son Byung-ho, Gong Hyung-jin, Min Kyung-jin, Kim Ji-young, Kim Hae-gon, Ji Dae-han', null, 'After losing both her parents, Failan emmigrates to Korea to seek her only remaining relatives. Once she reaches Korea, she finds out that her relatives have moved to Canada well over a year ago. Desperate to stay and make a living in Korea, Failan is forced to have an arranged marriage through a match-making agency.', 'After losing both her parents, Failan emmigrates to Korea to seek her only remaining relatives. Once she reaches Korea, she finds out that her relatives have moved to Canada well over a year ago. Desperate to stay and make a living in Korea, Failan is forced to have an arranged marriage through a match-making agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DG3eUhXyV0bVOuw3V0a1nIy7Jh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18704'),
  ('249863890505179049', 'Failure to Launch', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tom Dey, Claudio Miranda, Brian Agnew', 'Tom J. Astle, Matt Ember', 'Matthew McConaughey, Sarah Jessica Parker, Zooey Deschanel, Justin Bartha, Bradley Cooper, Terry Bradshaw, Kathy Bates, Tyrel Jackson Williams', 'PG-13', 'At 35, Tripp has an interesting job, a hip car, a passion for sailing, an active dating life, and a great house - trouble is, he still lives with his parents, Al and Sue, who are not happy about it. Al and Sue are fascinated when friends whose adult son has recently moved away from home reveal they hired an expert to help. In desperation to push Tripp out of the nest once and for all, Al and Sue hatch a plan to hire Paula, an "interventionist," who has a formula in these cases.', 'At 35, Tripp has an interesting job, a hip car, a passion for sailing, an active dating life, and a great house - trouble is, he still lives with his parents, Al and Sue, who are not happy about it. Al and Sue are fascinated when friends whose adult son has recently moved away from home reveal they hired an expert to help. In desperation to push Tripp out of the nest once and for all, Al and Sue hatch a plan to hire Paula, an "interventionist," who has a formula in these cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omReuKQ8ItWYD5pOLmsKh3MF24w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6877'),
  ('671376481491577060', 'Faintheart', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Vito Rocco, Tom Mulberge, Alexandra Collins', 'David Lemon, Vito Rocco', 'Eddie Marsan, Ewen Bremner, Jessica Hynes, Bronagh Gallagher, Tim Healy, Paul Nicholls, Anne Reid, Chloe Hesar', null, 'A romantic comedy set in the world of battle re-enactments, about an irresponsible guy who has to shape up in order to win back his wife.', 'A romantic comedy set in the world of battle re-enactments, about an irresponsible guy who has to shape up in order to win back his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUGySvz2Hhb4Nt8jJlD9TADl9mu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18739'),
  ('796979545107260658', 'Fair Game', 1986, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Mario Andreacchio, Andrew Lesnie, Christopher Williams', 'Rob George', 'Cassandra Delaney, Peter Ford, Garry Who, David Sandford, Don Barker, Carmel Young, Adrian Shirley, Tony Clay', 'R', 'A young woman running a wildlife sanctuary in the Australian outback is in for trouble when she is confronted by three kangaroo hunters. Bored with killing kangaroos, they decide to kill the animals in the sanctuary, and when they see how attractive the owner is, they decide to have a little "fun" with her, too. Turns out that they may get a bit more "fun" than they bargained for.', 'A young woman running a wildlife sanctuary in the Australian outback is in for trouble when she is confronted by three kangaroo hunters. Bored with killing kangaroos, they decide to kill the animals in the sanctuary, and when they see how attractive the owner is, they decide to have a little "fun" with her, too. Turns out that they may get a bit more "fun" than they bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOY9aKB1ls7LjzTMvVxSNSz25Ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49237'),
  ('216240078665432760', 'Fair Game', 1988, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Mario Orfini, Dante Spinotti, Filiberto Fiaschi', 'Lidia Ravera', 'Trudie Styler, Gregg Henry, Bill Moseley', null, 'When Gene, a maniacally deranged computer-game designer, gets dumped by his beautiful artist wife, he devises a masochistic plan for revenge. Taking his spouse prisoner, Gene locks her in her windowless Los Angeles loft but leaves her with something to keep her company -- a deadly mamba snake. Via electronic sensors and cameras, he watches with glee as his terrorized ex-lover fights for her life.', 'When Gene, a maniacally deranged computer-game designer, gets dumped by his beautiful artist wife, he devises a masochistic plan for revenge. Taking his spouse prisoner, Gene locks her in her windowless Los Angeles loft but leaves her with something to keep her company -- a deadly mamba snake. Via electronic sensors and cameras, he watches with glee as his terrorized ex-lover fights for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqDQpJO0bsX5LIvRFwBzhHPXT0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121377'),
  ('819580151215179757', 'Fair Game', 1995, 'Action', 'Richard Bowen, Andrew Sipes, Charlie Picerni', 'Charlie Fletcher', 'William Baldwin, Cindy Crawford, Steven Berkoff, Christopher McDonald, Miguel Sandoval, Johann Carlo, Salma Hayek Pinault, John Bedford Lloyd', 'R', 'Max Kirkpatrick is a cop who protects Kate McQuean, a civil law attorney, from a renegade KGB team out to terminate her', 'Max Kirkpatrick is a cop who protects Kate McQuean, a civil law attorney, from a renegade KGB team out to terminate her', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcxsWOzBaF7MZNNThtRQWQ9Wrdk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11859'),
  ('1002943615290126265', 'Fair Game', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Doug Liman, Doug Liman', 'John-Henry Butterworth, Jez Butterworth', 'Naomi Watts, Sean Penn, Sam Shepard, Noah Emmerich, Michael Kelly, Bruce McGill, David Andrews, Tim Griffin', 'PG-13', 'A devoted wife and mother leads a secret life as a CIA agent until her husband’s article exposes a scandal, putting her identity and loved ones at risk. As her world crumbles, she must navigate the fallout of her double life.', 'A devoted wife and mother leads a secret life as a CIA agent until her husband’s article exposes a scandal, putting her identity and loved ones at risk. As her world crumbles, she must navigate the fallout of her double life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tX2cafjaDnEOi50xnUIloAc2fp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38363'),
  ('683064930438822226', 'Fair Haven', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kerstin Karlhuber', 'Jack Bryant', 'Tom Wopat, Michael Grant, Gregory Harrison, Jennifer Bini Taylor, Josh Green, Lily Anne Harrison, Tom Malloy, Lisa Varga', null, 'After a long stint in gay conversion therapy, James, a young piano prodigy, returns home to his family farm and his emotionally-distant father, Richard. After Richard pressures James to give up his music career and take over the farm, James agrees as a way to make up for his past. Soon, however, James finds himself face-to-face with a former lover, Charlie, who wants to help him turn away from his new beliefs and family expectations and follow his dreams of studying music.', 'After a long stint in gay conversion therapy, James, a young piano prodigy, returns home to his family farm and his emotionally-distant father, Richard. After Richard pressures James to give up his music career and take over the farm, James agrees as a way to make up for his past. Soon, however, James finds himself face-to-face with a former lover, Charlie, who wants to help him turn away from his new beliefs and family expectations and follow his dreams of studying music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lary9OSK5aYRtcFovAbPSVu5ueu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397992'),
  ('733300080954910615', 'Fair is Fair', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Isabelle Mergault', 'Jean-Pierre Hasson, Isabelle Mergault', 'Daniel Auteuil, Sabine Azéma, Medeea Marinescu, Géraldine Bonnet-Guérin, Agnès Boury, Ariane Pirié, Anne-Sophie Germanaz, Jean-Louis Barcelona', null, 'Condamné pour un crime qui n''était, selon lui, qu''un accident, Constant réussit à s''évader de la prison où il purge sa peine... Après une fuite aveugle, livré à tous les hasards, Constant finit par échouer dans un coin perdu, près des berges désertes d''un canal.... Se cachant sur une péniche à l''abandon, Constant tente de reprendre son souffle, accalmie de courte durée... Dès l''aube, Sylvia une pétillante jeune femme qui a reconnu l''homme traqué, lui propose un implacable marché : assassiner (puisqu''elle le pense être un tueur professionnel) Jeanne, sa mère adoptive sinon elle le dénonce à la police ! Piégé, Constant ne peut qu''accepter cette périlleuse " mission ". Mais bien loin de tuer Jeanne, Constant la sauve d''un suicide annoncé.', 'Condamné pour un crime qui n''était, selon lui, qu''un accident, Constant réussit à s''évader de la prison où il purge sa peine... Après une fuite aveugle, livré à tous les hasards, Constant finit par échouer dans un coin perdu, près des berges désertes d''un canal.... Se cachant sur une péniche à l''abandon, Constant tente de reprendre son souffle, accalmie de courte durée... Dès l''aube, Sylvia une pétillante jeune femme qui a reconnu l''homme traqué, lui propose un implacable marché : assassiner (puisqu''elle le pense être un tueur professionnel) Jeanne, sa mère adoptive sinon elle le dénonce à la police ! Piégé, Constant ne peut qu''accepter cette périlleuse " mission ". Mais bien loin de tuer Jeanne, Constant la sauve d''un suicide annoncé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYeROnYnvU21GyQutJzHE3ukSYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53866'),
  ('506517124176767258', 'Fair Play', 2006, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lionel Bailliu, Christophe Paturange', 'Lionel Bailliu', 'Benoît Magimel, Jérémie Renier, Mélanie Doutey, Marion Cotillard, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Éric Savin, Malcolm Conrath', null, 'A company, where manipulation and harassment is a problem between colleagues, decides to organize a canyoning trip for its employees. The building tensions between co-workers might actually explode during this trip.', 'A company, where manipulation and harassment is a problem between colleagues, decides to organize a canyoning trip for its employees. The building tensions between co-workers might actually explode during this trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzukKnXm43klCSXpUrsaJD2IIvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42427'),
  ('42203843551430512', 'Fair Play', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Chloe Domont, Menno Mans, Vladimir Aleksić', 'Chloe Domont', 'Phoebe Dynevor, Alden Ehrenreich, Eddie Marsan, Rich Sommer, Sebastian de Souza, Sia Alipour, Yacine Ramoul, Brandon Bassir', 'R', 'An unexpected promotion at a cutthroat hedge fund pushes a young couple''s relationship to the brink, threatening to unravel not only their recent engagement but their lives.', 'An unexpected promotion at a cutthroat hedge fund pushes a young couple''s relationship to the brink, threatening to unravel not only their recent engagement but their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGgojtD6vJKYeCfktAhhA1pmH0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910571'),
