  ('1031003140021859357', 'Fairy', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Andrey Kudin, Alexandr Mikeladze, Kirill Vasilenko', 'Anna Melikyan', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Nikita Elenev, Ekaterina Ageeva, Alexandra Dishdishyan, Tinatin Dalakishvili, Mariya Shalaeva, Vladimir Mishukov', null, 'The creator of the best virtual reality games is convinced that in reality everyone and everything is controlled, but a chance meeting with a young activist opens his eyes to the fact that the world is much wider and more complicated than anything that he knows and understands about it.', 'The creator of the best virtual reality games is convinced that in reality everyone and everything is controlled, but a chance meeting with a young activist opens his eyes to the fact that the world is much wider and more complicated than anything that he knows and understands about it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHCSHmwCyGtTSz224JdT6bX7gBU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575121'),
  ('968784262341458320', 'Fairy Tail: Dragon Cry', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Animation', 'Isamu Fukushima, Kana Miyai, Tatsuma Minamikawa', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Aya Hirano, Rie Kugimiya, Yuichi Nakamura, Sayaka Ohara, Satomi Sato, Yui Horie, Wataru Hatano', 'PG-13', 'Dragon Cry is a magical artifact of deadly power, formed into a staff by the fury and despair of dragons long gone. Now, this power has been stolen from the hands of the Fiore kingdom by the nefarious traitor Zash Caine, who flees with it to the small island nation of Stella. Frightened that the power has fallen into the wrong hands, the King of Fiore hastily sends Fairy Tail to retrieve the staff. But this task proves frightening as a shadowy secret lies in the heart of the kingdom of Stella. Dragon Cry follows their story as they muster up all their strength to recover the stolen staff and save both kingdoms.', 'Dragon Cry is a magical artifact of deadly power, formed into a staff by the fury and despair of dragons long gone. Now, this power has been stolen from the hands of the Fiore kingdom by the nefarious traitor Zash Caine, who flees with it to the small island nation of Stella. Frightened that the power has fallen into the wrong hands, the King of Fiore hastily sends Fairy Tail to retrieve the staff. But this task proves frightening as a shadowy secret lies in the heart of the kingdom of Stella. Dragon Cry follows their story as they muster up all their strength to recover the stolen staff and save both kingdoms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CtvjdvuRj3iPlvtpvFomhTxjXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433422'),
  ('54709296657155840', 'Fairy Tail: Phoenix Priestess', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Yousuke Motoki, Tadashi Sakazaki, Chiharu Sato', 'Masashi Sogo', 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Aya Hirano, Rie Kugimiya, Yuichi Nakamura, Sayaka Ohara, Satomi Sato, Yui Horie, Aya Endo', 'PG-13', 'The film revolves around a mysterious girl named Éclair who appears before Fairy Tail, the world''s most notorious wizard''s guild. She lost all of her memories, except for the imperative that she must deliver two Phoenix Stones somewhere. The stones may spell the collapse of the magical world, and Natsu, Lucy, and the rest of the Fairy Tail guild are caught up in the intrigue.', 'The film revolves around a mysterious girl named Éclair who appears before Fairy Tail, the world''s most notorious wizard''s guild. She lost all of her memories, except for the imperative that she must deliver two Phoenix Stones somewhere. The stones may spell the collapse of the magical world, and Natsu, Lucy, and the rest of the Fairy Tail guild are caught up in the intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDuie7u8AL3J6ZH2LS5ySnPkX1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135531'),
