  ('1017366685665567988', 'Faithful', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hichame Alaouié, Franck Morand, Hélier Cisterne', 'Katell Quillévéré, Antoine Barraud, Hélier Cisterne', 'Vincent Lacoste, Vicky Krieps, Jules Langlade, Marc Brunet, Thomas Ducasse, Jeanne Carré, Raphaël Thiéry, Yoann Zimmer', null, '1956. Algeria is a French colony. Fernand and Helene are madly in love. Fernand is an activist, fighting for independence alongside the Algerians. Helene is fighting for Fernand’s life. History will irrevocably change the course of their destiny.', '1956. Algeria is a French colony. Fernand and Helene are madly in love. Fernand is an activist, fighting for independence alongside the Algerians. Helene is fighting for Fernand’s life. History will irrevocably change the course of their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlvqW6scNyNRCB5Sg13AQgrvES5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575554'),
  ('905830955562159704', 'Faithfully Yours', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Wong Wa-Kei, Chung Pooi-Laan, Lau Hung-Chuen', 'Cheung Hoi-Hing', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Max Mok Siu-Chung, Stephen Chow, Sharla Cheung, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Lydia Shum Tin-Ha, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Sing Yan', null, 'A playboy and his two friends get drunk and wake up next to a girl who claims to be pregnant by one of them.', 'A playboy and his two friends get drunk and wake up next to a girl who claims to be pregnant by one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14vJXF7F748fBeNFGpm0QxLTxkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70573'),
