  ('1040706733079848165', 'Faithless', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Liv Ullmann, Jörgen Persson, Roland Lindmark', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Lena Endre, Erland Josephson, Krister Henriksson, Thomas Hanzon, Marie Richardson, Michelle Gylemo, Juni Dahr, Philip Zandén', 'R', 'Scripted by Ingmar Bergman, this very personal film is about a destructive affair which wrecks the marriage of an actress (Marianne) and musician (Markus). Wanting to continue the affair, Marianne moves in with her lover. But she is tormented by Markus'' decision not to let her have custody of their daughter. Finally Markus announces he may have a solution to the stalemate, but this leads to deception, lies and ultimately, tragedy.', 'Scripted by Ingmar Bergman, this very personal film is about a destructive affair which wrecks the marriage of an actress (Marianne) and musician (Markus). Wanting to continue the affair, Marianne moves in with her lover. But she is tormented by Markus'' decision not to let her have custody of their daughter. Finally Markus announces he may have a solution to the stalemate, but this leads to deception, lies and ultimately, tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fshpCYhGUBPrPsBgFY4mlLqnEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47595'),
  ('531533857921348251', 'Fake', 1996, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Comedy, Romance, Horror', 'Iku Suzuki, Fusanobu Fujiyama, Nagisa Miyazaki', 'Akinori Endo', 'Tomokazu Seki, Nobuo Tobita, Tetsuya Iwanaga, Rica Matsumoto, Wakana Yamazaki, Masashi Ebara', null, 'Meet Dee Laytner and his half-Japanese partner, Ryo McLane, a pair of detectives from New York. Not only are these two always chasing down criminals, but Dee can''t stop himself from trying to ''chase'' Ryo. While on a trip to England, Dee hopes to make his feelings for Ryo known but uninvited guests and a string of murders gets in the way. The pair become involved in the local crime scene when Japanese Americans start turning up dead. Will Ryo be in danger?', 'Meet Dee Laytner and his half-Japanese partner, Ryo McLane, a pair of detectives from New York. Not only are these two always chasing down criminals, but Dee can''t stop himself from trying to ''chase'' Ryo. While on a trip to England, Dee hopes to make his feelings for Ryo known but uninvited guests and a string of murders gets in the way. The pair become involved in the local crime scene when Japanese Americans start turning up dead. Will Ryo be in danger?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dmDh0VIZEIlmL17iHWDezXPKDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30620'),
  ('446949366797937664', 'Fake Blonde', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlos Reichenbach, Josmar Bueno Júnior, Jacob Solitrenick', 'Carlos Reichenbach', 'Rosanne Mulholland, Cauã Reymond, Maurício Mattar, Djin Sganzerla, João Bourbonnais, Léo Áquilla, Suzana Alves, Vanessa Prieto', null, 'Silmara, an industrial worker and a woman of exuberant beauty, supports her arsonist father and gets involved with two different pop stars, from whom she learns traumatic life lessons.', 'Silmara, an industrial worker and a woman of exuberant beauty, supports her arsonist father and gets involved with two different pop stars, from whom she learns traumatic life lessons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNCF5Fj54fkqACXZblFxqeJmAzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169497'),
