  ('633554180740024823', 'Fake Famous', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Nick Bilton, Barney Broomfield', 'Nick Bilton', 'Christopher Bailey, Osiris Bashir, Justine Bateman, Shannon Dee, Dominique Druckman, Liz Eswein, Sarah Frier, Wylie Heiner', 'R', 'Explores the meaning of fame and influence in the digital age through an innovative social experiment. Following three Los Angeles-based people with relatively small followings, the film explores the attempts made to turn them into famous influencers by purchasing fake followers and bots to “engage” with their social media accounts.', 'Explores the meaning of fame and influence in the digital age through an innovative social experiment. Following three Los Angeles-based people with relatively small followings, the film explores the attempts made to turn them into famous influencers by purchasing fake followers and bots to “engage” with their social media accounts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWNK3XH1W8cVDVLeysQ5snCMqxW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788610'),
  ('773153054131307285', 'Fake Fruit Factory', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Chick Strand', null, null, null, 'Intimate documentary about young women who make papier mache fruit and vegetables in a small factory in Mexico. They have a gringo boss, but the factory is owned by his Mexican wife. The focus of the film is on the color, music and movement involved, and the gossip which goes on constantly, revealing what the young women think about men.', 'Intimate documentary about young women who make papier mache fruit and vegetables in a small factory in Mexico. They have a gringo boss, but the factory is owned by his Mexican wife. The focus of the film is on the color, music and movement involved, and the gossip which goes on constantly, revealing what the young women think about men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSiXxe4oGuuIquRjdX7hhnZrPUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150711'),
  ('895371483900235511', 'Fake Gangster', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Suavi Sualp', 'Kemal Sunal, Hakkı Kıvanç, Kazım Kartal, Suna Selen, Mümtaz Ener, Hasan Ceylan, Yadigar Ejder, İbrahim Kurt', null, 'Kemal, unaware that his father is a mafia boss, sells cotton candy at train stations. After his father is killed, his inheritance is divided. Kemal begins visiting the establishments of Istanbul''s most notorious thugs one by one to reclaim his father''s inheritance, and gradually gains a reputation.', 'Kemal, unaware that his father is a mafia boss, sells cotton candy at train stations. After his father is killed, his inheritance is divided. Kemal begins visiting the establishments of Istanbul''s most notorious thugs one by one to reclaim his father''s inheritance, and gradually gains a reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yk71HfKyCMxa5K1I4yqUb8xTMir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74171'),
  ('958847372215254681', 'Fake News', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marco Graziaplena, Mouloud Achour, Dominique Baumard', 'Dominique Baumard, Mouloud Achour', 'Roman Frayssinet, Djimo Salim, Ludivine Sagnier, Anthony Bajon, Kyan Khojandi, Mathieu Kassovitz, Alban Ivanov, Samy Naceri', null, 'After stealing a gaming console from migrants, Sébastien tries to sell it to Patrick, a good guy. So far, nothing too serious. But when a rapper straight out of jail, a TV host willing to do anything to go viral and click traffickers get involved... Sébastien and Patrick become France’s most wanted bad guys.', 'After stealing a gaming console from migrants, Sébastien tries to sell it to Patrick, a good guy. So far, nothing too serious. But when a rapper straight out of jail, a TV host willing to do anything to go viral and click traffickers get involved... Sébastien and Patrick become France’s most wanted bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2UC3Cp96yribP7od4ZZ76DguAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735716'),
  ('843111307012135853', 'Fake Tattoos', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Pascal Plante, Vincent Allard', 'Pascal Plante, Geneviève Dulude-De Celles', 'Anthony Therrien, Rose-Marie Perreault, Lysandre Nadeau, Brigitte Poupart, Nicole-Sylvie Lagarde, Léona Rousseau, Rémi Goulet, Lauren Mallais-DeLuca', null, 'Theo spends his 18th birthday alone, getting drunk at a brutal punk rock show. There, he meets Mag, a marginal teenager who invites him to spend the night at her place. A love story unfolds between them, but Theo has to move at the end of the summer in a small town, far away from a painful past.', 'Theo spends his 18th birthday alone, getting drunk at a brutal punk rock show. There, he meets Mag, a marginal teenager who invites him to spend the night at her place. A love story unfolds between them, but Theo has to move at the end of the summer in a small town, far away from a painful past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jLiOcInzCMUbv3cnt0pLZu31US.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493905'),
  ('956286867092145904', 'Fakin'' Da Funk', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Timothy A. Chey, Donald Paul Pemrick, Zoltán David', 'Timothy A. Chey', 'Dante Basco, Tatyana Ali, Pam Grier, Ernie Hudson, Rashaan Nall, Tichina Arnold, Margaret Cho, Duane Martin', 'R', 'Chinese kid Julian, who was adopted by the black family of Joe and Annabelle Lee -- and Asian exchange student May-Ling, who is housed with a black family -- are trying to adapt to their mostly black neighborhood of South Central.', 'Chinese kid Julian, who was adopted by the black family of Joe and Annabelle Lee -- and Asian exchange student May-Ling, who is housed with a black family -- are trying to adapt to their mostly black neighborhood of South Central.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yR2XzSGH4I2bTshziMqdDx5ak7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64254'),
