  ('661566179295547069', 'Faktor 8 – Der Tag ist gekommen', 2009, 'TV Movie, Action, Thriller', 'Rainer Matsutani, Gerhard Schirlo', 'Benedikt Röskau', 'Emilia Schüle, André Hennicke, Gesine Cukrowski, Stephan Luca, Muriel Baumeister, Max von Thun, Oliver Mommsen, Heio von Stetten', null, 'A presumed virus outbreak during a flight from south Asia to Munich. Most of all, the scientific premise is utterly wrong. Retroviruses is shown as multiplying in erythrocytes, which lack a) DNA (necessary for retrovirus replication) and b) the enzymatic apparatus for multiplying any viral nucleic acids.', 'A presumed virus outbreak during a flight from south Asia to Munich. Most of all, the scientific premise is utterly wrong. Retroviruses is shown as multiplying in erythrocytes, which lack a) DNA (necessary for retrovirus replication) and b) the enzymatic apparatus for multiplying any viral nucleic acids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlBrcrKZW4JM7poO4AuBq1PCLmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52692'),
