  ('747242371284516997', 'Falchi', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Toni D''Angelo, Rocco Marra, Valentina Longobardi', 'Toni D''Angelo, Giorgio Caruso, Marcello Olivieri', 'Fortunato Cerlino, Michele Riondino, Pippo Delbono, Stefania Sandrelli, Aniello Arena, Oscar Di Maio, Gaetano Amato, Alessandra Cao', null, 'Falchi is a melodrama set in the city of Naples, in its pulsating multi ethnic veins. The movie tells the story of two agents of the Special Squad of Naples, a police unit that investigates organized crime. Though impeccable at their work, the two cops hide strong weaknesses, shady secrets, loneliness, and overwhelming passions in their private lives.', 'Falchi is a melodrama set in the city of Naples, in its pulsating multi ethnic veins. The movie tells the story of two agents of the Special Squad of Naples, a police unit that investigates organized crime. Though impeccable at their work, the two cops hide strong weaknesses, shady secrets, loneliness, and overwhelming passions in their private lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOmznOEl2GpDQePedALD6f1nvpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420597'),
  ('548507834154090417', 'Falco: Damn It, We''re Still Alive!', 2008, 'Drama, Music', 'Thomas Roth', 'Thomas Roth', 'Manuel Rubey, Patricia Aulitzky, Christian Tramitz, Martin Loos, Nicholas Ofczarek, Susi Stach, Markus Mössmer, Doris Golpashin', null, 'Deals with the life, work, and tragic death of Johann "Falco" Hölzel. The biopic portrays his work through his early days, as member of the Viennese band "Drahdiwaberl", and later with his own hits as solo artist, like "Der Kommissar", "Wiener Blut", and his worldwide smash-hit "Rock Me Amadeus".', 'Deals with the life, work, and tragic death of Johann "Falco" Hölzel. The biopic portrays his work through his early days, as member of the Viennese band "Drahdiwaberl", and later with his own hits as solo artist, like "Der Kommissar", "Wiener Blut", and his worldwide smash-hit "Rock Me Amadeus".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOOLXTUSLg0blT0IamsUwwQ1lak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42862'),
