  ('561927296755658894', 'Fall Guy', 1947, 'Crime', 'Reginald Le Borg, Mack Stengler', 'John O''Dea, Jerry Warner', 'Leo Penn, Robert Armstrong, Teala Loring, Elisha Cook Jr., Douglas Fowley, Charles Arnt, Virginia Dale, Iris Adrian', 'NR', 'A drugged man covered in blood is picked up by police. Before the cops can get answers the man escapes in search of answers to the mystery himself.', 'A drugged man covered in blood is picked up by police. Before the cops can get answers the man escapes in search of answers to the mystery himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daQ97l7hRFuEuiaKGEwbXOOS7wq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44572'),
