  ('688681174671107331', 'Fall in Love at First Kiss', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Frankie Chen', 'Zero Huang', 'Darren Wang, Lin Yun, Kenji Chen, Cecilia Choi, Christopher Lee, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Yi-Chen Tsai, Alina Cheng', null, 'Yuan Xiangqin, a high school student, is deeply in love with Jiang Zhishu, her schoolmate. He rejects her, only for them to live together when the house that she resides in collapses.', 'Yuan Xiangqin, a high school student, is deeply in love with Jiang Zhishu, her schoolmate. He rejects her, only for them to live together when the house that she resides in collapses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yM00obaRRlZxr7VLt3ebDjOFyJC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576393'),
  ('129258820397382276', 'Fall in Love Like a Star', 2015, 'Romance', 'Tony Chan', 'Tony Chan', 'Li Yifeng, Yang Mi, Chen Shu, Dilraba Dilmurat, Jin Shijia, Tiger Hu, Leon Zhang, David Wang', null, 'After a casual acquaintance, rookie actor Su Xingyu and assistant Tian Xin separate. Five years later, they meet again as successful individuals. They both share similar feelings in the workforce and in their personal lives. However, Su Xingyu''s idol identity means that their relationship must be kept in the shadows, and their love is tested.', 'After a casual acquaintance, rookie actor Su Xingyu and assistant Tian Xin separate. Five years later, they meet again as successful individuals. They both share similar feelings in the workforce and in their personal lives. However, Su Xingyu''s idol identity means that their relationship must be kept in the shadows, and their love is tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFxNLiBon5N0kfFTyGCsf3GuaU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369553'),
  ('464258262888991326', 'Fall Into Winter', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'T.W. Peacocke, Jonathan Yapp', 'Cara J. Russell', 'Lori Loughlin, James Tupper, Darrin Baker, Marc Senior, Cherion Drakes, Allan Royal, Janaya Stephens, Hannah Kanter', 'G', 'Keely is aghast when her brother sells his half of their family-owned, upscale candy shop to his best friend from high school orcing a sudden urgency to find connection and common ground. Keely has been hurt before; change is her new nemesis. Brooks’ past is a mirror of Keely’s. He, too, has a fortress around his heart. Fate brings the pair together. Might it also offer new beginnings?', 'Keely is aghast when her brother sells his half of their family-owned, upscale candy shop to his best friend from high school orcing a sudden urgency to find connection and common ground. Keely has been hurt before; change is her new nemesis. Brooks’ past is a mirror of Keely’s. He, too, has a fortress around his heart. Fate brings the pair together. Might it also offer new beginnings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKvBcgmhGNDEGPY4zZFnuGOK9KC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027330'),
