  ('995557942324379614', 'False Hopes', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'David D. Dietrich, Gus Cantavero', 'Cyndi Monroe', 'Justin Ray, Christine Juarbe, Aaron Groben, Claire Bermingham, Katy Bodenhamer, Vicky Dawson, Victor Marx, Toni Lewis', 'PG', 'Ace photographer Thomas McKenzie''s been seeking the perfect girl his entire life - yet when two women simultaneously capture his interest, he learns he may not have been seeking the kind of love which truly makes us whole.', 'Ace photographer Thomas McKenzie''s been seeking the perfect girl his entire life - yet when two women simultaneously capture his interest, he learns he may not have been seeking the kind of love which truly makes us whole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15maI9gtazx1Vov1768vHTJifgi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672852'),
  ('517667925230246068', 'False Movement', 2015, 'Drama', 'Christophe Cousin, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Christophe Cousin', 'Zacharie Chasseriaud, Antoine L''Écuyer, Aure Atika, Anne-Marie Cadieux, Philomène Bilodeau, Léo Caron, Hugues Frenette', null, 'Victor feels adrift. Uprooted by his mother from Paris to his new home in Quebec City, he''s still reeling from the recent death of his father. One day while skipping class, Victor stumbles upon a classmate''s suicide.', 'Victor feels adrift. Uprooted by his mother from Paris to his new home in Quebec City, he''s still reeling from the recent death of his father. One day while skipping class, Victor stumbles upon a classmate''s suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXOKgjDB3F7FW0BMpvxKfaQLogo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321214'),
  ('684996283442480948', 'False Positive', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Lee, Alice Johnson', 'Ilana Glazer, John Lee', 'Ilana Glazer, Justin Theroux, Pierce Brosnan, Zainab Jah, Gretchen Mol, Sophia Bush, Josh Hamilton, Kelly AuCoin', 'R', 'After months of trying and failing to get pregnant, Lucy and Adrian finally find their dream fertility doctor in the illustrious Dr. Hindle. But after becoming pregnant with a healthy baby girl, Lucy begins to notice something sinister through Hindle''s gleaming charm, and she sets out to uncover the unsettling truth about him.', 'After months of trying and failing to get pregnant, Lucy and Adrian finally find their dream fertility doctor in the illustrious Dr. Hindle. But after becoming pregnant with a healthy baby girl, Lucy begins to notice something sinister through Hindle''s gleaming charm, and she sets out to uncover the unsettling truth about him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HSov8EW2fI3oQbUJxOvnf684ej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591634'),
  ('723149420405567156', 'False Trail', 2011, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Kjell Sundvall, Jallo Faber', 'Björn Carlström, Stefan Thunberg', 'Rolf Lassgård, Peter Stormare, Annika Nordin, Kim Tjernström, Eero Milonoff, Lo Kauppi, Jesper Barkselius, Hanna Ek', null, 'The Interrogator Erik Backstrom is forced to return to his former home village to solve a murder mystery, in which the local polices and some hunters and even Erik''s family seems to be involved. Soon, the conflicts are in full action, especially between Erik and the local police Torsten. Torsten does not support Erik very much in his job and has, for some personal reasons, already arrested a suspected perpetrator. Eric takes great risks when he starts digging in the criminal material of the horrible murder case.', 'The Interrogator Erik Backstrom is forced to return to his former home village to solve a murder mystery, in which the local polices and some hunters and even Erik''s family seems to be involved. Soon, the conflicts are in full action, especially between Erik and the local police Torsten. Torsten does not support Erik very much in his job and has, for some personal reasons, already arrested a suspected perpetrator. Eric takes great risks when he starts digging in the criminal material of the horrible murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LamLvbVqwBddlfF2GdqrwtzXRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74626'),
  ('114243510522838649', 'Fame', 1980, 'Drama, Music', 'Alan Parker, Michael Seresin, Robert F. Colesberry', 'Christopher Gore', 'Irene Cara, Barry Miller, Maureen Teefy, Paul McCrane, Lee Curreri, Gene Anthony Ray, Antonia Franceschi, Laura Dean', 'R', 'A chronicle of the lives of several teenagers who attend a New York high school for students gifted in the performing arts.', 'A chronicle of the lives of several teenagers who attend a New York high school for students gifted in the performing arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewuGn4kxsqbYfgSO8Y5kzYlBcKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3537'),
  ('743758942531166391', 'Fame', 2009, 'Music, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kevin Tancharoen, Scott Kevan', 'Christopher Gore', 'Kay Panabaker, Walter Perez, Naturi Naughton, Asher Book, Kherington Payne, Collins Pennie, Kristy Flores, Paul McGill', 'PG', 'At New York''s High School of Performing Arts, students from all walks of life get the chance to hone their skills as singers, actors, dancers, and more. Over four years, these young men and women will see if they truly have the dedication and talent to achieve success, while still juggling regular schoolwork, feelings of self-doubt, and budding romances.', 'At New York''s High School of Performing Arts, students from all walks of life get the chance to hone their skills as singers, actors, dancers, and more. Over four years, these young men and women will see if they truly have the dedication and talent to achieve success, while still juggling regular schoolwork, feelings of self-doubt, and budding romances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hm7f9a0BdjV9OLOJ5wFWQq55Jfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28665'),
  ('552708076757288482', 'Fame Chimica', 2004, 'Drama', 'Paolo Vari, Antonio Bocola, Enrico Clerico Nasino', 'Paolo Vari, Antonio Bocola, Francesco Scarpelli', 'Andrea Kenni, Marco Foschi, Matteo Gianoli, Valeria Solarino, Giulio Baraldi, Mimmo Allanprese, Joel Bossi, Andrea Canesi', null, 'Two childhood friends from a tough Milanese suburb—one a low-level drug dealer, the other stuck in a back-breaking, underpaid job—find their bond tested when they both fall for the same girl against a backdrop of escalating social unrest in their neighborhood square.', 'Two childhood friends from a tough Milanese suburb—one a low-level drug dealer, the other stuck in a back-breaking, underpaid job—find their bond tested when they both fall for the same girl against a backdrop of escalating social unrest in their neighborhood square.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0vJl5ODX8lcKM1RzO0fTsNrEJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57919'),
  ('576660775534266468', 'Familia', 2005, 'Drama', 'Louise Archambault, André Turpin', 'Louise Archambault', 'Sylvie Moreau, Macha Grenon, Juliette Gosselin, Mylène St-Sauveur, Micheline Lanctôt, Patricia Nolin, Paul Savoie, Vincent Graton', null, 'When gambling addict Michele moves in with her childhood friend Janine, their teenaged daughter’s burgeoning friendship produces both humorous and heartbreaking results.', 'When gambling addict Michele moves in with her childhood friend Janine, their teenaged daughter’s burgeoning friendship produces both humorous and heartbreaking results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XPJRv05p7SMc2aBhjq9wzMqAJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42052'),
  ('79279042620499721', 'Familia', 2023, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo García, Igor Jadue-Lillo', 'Bárbara Colio, Rodrigo García', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Ilse Salas, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Natalia Solián, Maribel Verdú, Ángeles Cruz, Natalia Plascencia, Brian Shortall', 'R', 'As a family discusses the future of their idyllic olive farm over a meal, the complexity of their relationships emerges through laughs and confessions.', 'As a family discusses the future of their idyllic olive farm over a meal, the complexity of their relationships emerges through laughs and confessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LyiadeCXEsoqmph0fZZhoCBWJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1204812'),
  ('702551872427849488', 'Familia', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Francesco Costabile, Giuseppe Maio, Pietro Ragazzini', 'Francesco Costabile, Vittorio Moroni, Adriano Chiarelli', 'Francesco Gheghi, Barbara Ronchi, Francesco Di Leva, Marco Cicalese, Enrico Borello, Tecla Insolia, Francesco De Lucia, Stefano Valentini', null, 'Luigi looks after his mother and his little brother since their abusive father Franco left when he was 10. Now a young man brimming with rage, he joins a far-right gang in search of belonging just as Franco shows up again in their life.', 'Luigi looks after his mother and his little brother since their abusive father Franco left when he was 10. Now a young man brimming with rage, he joins a far-right gang in search of belonging just as Franco shows up again in their life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6z6w9RcgswGofN3Z9oItnLdiJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1313006'),
  ('589389964458915728', 'Familia a la Deriva', 2026, 'Family, Comedy', 'Alfonso Pineda Ulloa, María Sarasvati Herrera', 'Marcos Osorio Vidal, Jorge Edelstein', 'Mauricio Ochmann, Memo Villegas, Roberto Zamarripa, Irán Castillo', null, 'A workaholic used car dealer in Mexico City neglects his four children from two marriages. After a wake-up call, he plans a Caribbean yacht trip to bond with them, but things go wrong when they end up adrift at sea.', 'A workaholic used car dealer in Mexico City neglects his four children from two marriages. After a wake-up call, he plans a Caribbean yacht trip to bond with them, but things go wrong when they end up adrift at sea.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjofyMzEnLoBZFKezmcCli3bEFwz.jpg', 'plex:movie:familia-a-la-deriva'),
  ('142065430211662728', 'Familiar Strangers', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zackary Adler', null, 'Shawn Hatosy, DJ Qualls, Tom Bower, Nikki Reed, Ann Dowd', null, '"Familiar Strangers" asks the question. "Is it really possible to relate to ones parents and siblings after being replaced by the family dog? . . . Perhaps as friends - weird friends?" An off beat - funny - heartfelt story of family negotiating the changing relationships between parents and children, especially as those children grow into adulthood.', '"Familiar Strangers" asks the question. "Is it really possible to relate to ones parents and siblings after being replaced by the family dog? . . . Perhaps as friends - weird friends?" An off beat - funny - heartfelt story of family negotiating the changing relationships between parents and children, especially as those children grow into adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8Zr9An8Qc6rX2lzLTJEVFhz2Dy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28917'),
  ('838131882649925077', 'Familiar Touch', 2025, 'Drama', 'Sarah Friedland, Gabe C. Elder, Betsy Fippinger', 'Sarah Friedland', 'Kathleen Chalfant, Carolyn Michelle, Andy McQueen, H. Jon Benjamin, Katelyn Nacon, Joahn Webb, London Garcia, Mike G.', null, 'An octogenarian woman transitions to life in assisted living as she contends with her conflicting relationship to herself and her caregivers amidst her shifting memory, age identity, and desires.', 'An octogenarian woman transitions to life in assisted living as she contends with her conflicting relationship to herself and her caregivers amidst her shifting memory, age identity, and desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUKpIGBCiUTyFTEPJxc7nJtLU3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265717'),
  ('323679332060280790', 'Families', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Thierry Arbogast', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau', 'Nicole Garcia, Mathieu Amalric, Marine Vacth, Gilles Lellouche, Karin Viard, Catherine Chevallier, Claude Perron, Gemma Chan', null, 'Jérôme Varenne, a French financier, lives and works in Shanghai with Chen-Li, his life and business partner. One day, during a short stay in Paris, while paying a call to his mother, he is very displeased to learn from her and his hated brother, that the family house in Ambray is going to be sold. Jerome decides to go to the town where he grew up to see what is going on. Little does he know how eventful his escapade will be. Little does he know that it will change his life from soup to nuts...', 'Jérôme Varenne, a French financier, lives and works in Shanghai with Chen-Li, his life and business partner. One day, during a short stay in Paris, while paying a call to his mother, he is very displeased to learn from her and his hated brother, that the family house in Ambray is going to be sold. Jerome decides to go to the town where he grew up to see what is going on. Little does he know how eventful his escapade will be. Little does he know that it will change his life from soup to nuts...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iJ2UcUx28IA3BzWutMb5WHmsLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348025'),
  ('709078347104365639', 'Familiye', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kubilay Sarikaya, Sedat Kirtan, Erhan Emre', 'Sedat Kirtan, Kubilay Sarikaya', 'Arnel Taci, Violetta Schurawlow, Kubilay Sarikaya, Muhammed Kirtan, Michael Hanemann, Hubert Burczek, Ulrich Faßnacht, Mario Lutz', null, 'Familiye tells the story of an ex-con who, after his release from prison, has to care for his two younger brothers. One of whom is a gambling addict, the other has Down Syndrome.', 'Familiye tells the story of an ex-con who, after his release from prison, has to care for his two younger brothers. One of whom is a gambling addict, the other has Down Syndrome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqjl8jkQpoeAXdUCO0qMy21fmnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521929'),
  ('554043414494146667', 'Family', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Fernando León de Aranoa, José Luis Ruiz Marcos, Alfredo Mayo', 'Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Amparo Muñoz, Ágata Lys, Juan Luis Galiardo, Elena Anaya, Chete Lera, Raquel Rodrigo, Juan Querol, Aníbal Carbonero', null, 'Santiago wakes up like any other morning. He goes down to the kitchen and his whole family is waiting for him: it''s his birthday. They all sing "Happy Birthday to You" and give him presents. But when he opens the present of his youngest son, he gets angry and says he doesn''t like it. The boy starts crying and saying that he loves him, but Santiago answers that he doesn''t believe him and he tells the boy that he is fired and that he wants another son, who is thinner, who doesn''t need glasses and who resembles him more. Written by Pablo Montoya', 'Santiago wakes up like any other morning. He goes down to the kitchen and his whole family is waiting for him: it''s his birthday. They all sing "Happy Birthday to You" and give him presents. But when he opens the present of his youngest son, he gets angry and says he doesn''t like it. The boy starts crying and saying that he loves him, but Santiago answers that he doesn''t believe him and he tells the boy that he is fired and that he wants another son, who is thinner, who doesn''t need glasses and who resembles him more. Written by Pablo Montoya', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4x1jiEfaKN0HCJAE3hDSKtL7fW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107667'),
  ('731915668005153198', 'Family', 2006, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'John Landis, Jon Joffin', 'Brent Hanley', 'George Wendt, Matt Keeslar, Meredith Monroe, Haley Guiel, Kerry Sandomirsky, Nancy Whyte, Emily Tennant, John B. Scott', null, 'Harold is a seemingly peaceful neighbor in a quiet mid-western neighborhood, but underneath, he''s a murderous psychopath who sets his eyes on a couple that have moved in across the street.', 'Harold is a seemingly peaceful neighbor in a quiet mid-western neighborhood, but underneath, he''s a murderous psychopath who sets his eyes on a couple that have moved in across the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7NdfRWxbbC08OErQYb9HWKGcEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319309'),
  ('1005307327090439451', 'Family', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Laura Steinel, Michael Simmonds', 'Laura Steinel', 'Taylor Schilling, Brian Tyree Henry, Bryn Vale, Allison Tolman, Fabrizio Guido, Kate McKinnon, Peter Horton, Jessie Ennis', 'R', 'Kate Stone is career-focused with a brash attitude that keeps relationships at an arm''s length. When her estranged brother calls asking her to baby-sit her tween niece Maddie, Kate reluctantly agrees to help. But baby-sitting overnight unexpectedly turns into a week, and Kate''s life spins into chaos. As Maddie reveals stories of being bullied and of wanting to run away and be a Juggalo, the two form a unique bond.', 'Kate Stone is career-focused with a brash attitude that keeps relationships at an arm''s length. When her estranged brother calls asking her to baby-sit her tween niece Maddie, Kate reluctantly agrees to help. But baby-sitting overnight unexpectedly turns into a week, and Kate''s life spins into chaos. As Maddie reveals stories of being bullied and of wanting to run away and be a Juggalo, the two form a unique bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUhBEVwzvLsbWRnUNQsWkj7luAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462550'),
  ('1077355189783481545', 'Family Affairs', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Sönke Wortmann, Jo Heim', 'Claudius Pläging, Alexandre de La Patellière, Matthieu Delaporte', 'Iris Berben, Christoph Maria Herbst, Florian David Fitz, Caroline Peters, Justus von Dohnányi, Janina Uhse, Elena Sancho Pereg', null, 'The Berger and Böttcher families come to Dorothea''s finca on Lanzarote for a weekend trip. The mood is tense and escalates as various mysteries are revealed.', 'The Berger and Böttcher families come to Dorothea''s finca on Lanzarote for a weekend trip. The mood is tense and escalates as various mysteries are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lY64iy8nzuUq8O8PPN2x5sm5QLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899792'),
  ('797974960018437655', 'Family Affairs', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Carolina África, Guillermo Navajo, Kiko de la Rica', 'Carolina África', 'Carmen Machi, Bárbara Lennie, Victoria Luengo, Beatriz Grimaldos, Lola Cordón, Vega Bosque, Antonio Resines, Irene Escolar', null, 'Teresa''s daughters and her mother-in-law, a nonagenarian with senile dementia, arrive at her house. The daughters will meet their mother and grandmother at a family reunion to commemorate the anniversary of their father''s death.', 'Teresa''s daughters and her mother-in-law, a nonagenarian with senile dementia, arrive at her house. The daughters will meet their mother and grandmother at a family reunion to commemorate the anniversary of their father''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUJecKzNuaL5CCqO6MS7V4S7oBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1360733'),
  ('672975626826564176', 'Family Blood', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Larkin Donley, Sonny Mallhi, Rachel Hatcher', 'Nick Savvides, Sonny Mallhi', 'Vinessa Shaw, James Ransone, Colin Ford, Eloise Lushina, Ajiona Alexus, Carson Meyer, France Jean-Baptiste, Ciaran Brown', null, 'Ellie, a recovering drug addict, has just moved to a new city with her two teenage children. She has struggled to stay sober in the past and is determined to make it work this time, finding a stable job and regularly attending her meetings. Unfortunately, new friends, a new job, and the chance of a new life, can’t keep Ellie from slipping once again. Her life changes when she meets Christopher – a different kind of addict – which forces her daughter and son to accept a new version of Ellie.', 'Ellie, a recovering drug addict, has just moved to a new city with her two teenage children. She has struggled to stay sober in the past and is determined to make it work this time, finding a stable job and regularly attending her meetings. Unfortunately, new friends, a new job, and the chance of a new life, can’t keep Ellie from slipping once again. Her life changes when she meets Christopher – a different kind of addict – which forces her daughter and son to accept a new version of Ellie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQ8SC6wCARc0pOTrHMCr8cFoHms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511449'),
  ('1090055314748277248', 'Family Business', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Costa-Gavras, Robert Alazraki', 'Costa-Gavras', 'Johnny Hallyday, Fanny Ardant, Guy Marchand, Rémi Martin, Caroline Pochon, Fabrice Luchini, Françoise Bette, Ann-Gisel Glass', null, 'A recently released safecracker returns to stealing in order to support his family. After several successful thefts, he decides to induct his teenage son into the ''family business''.', 'A recently released safecracker returns to stealing in order to support his family. After several successful thefts, he decides to induct his teenage son into the ''family business''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvfK0G7DLrY11sLJsUXnTV50MMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63398'),
  ('661523894235274904', 'Family Business', 1989, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Sidney Lumet, Michael Haley', 'Vincent Patrick', 'Sean Connery, Dustin Hoffman, Matthew Broderick, Rosanna DeSoto, Janet Carroll, Victoria Jackson, Bill McCutcheon, Deborah Rush', 'R', 'Jessie is an aging career criminal who has been in more jails, fights, schemes, and lineups than just about anyone else. His son Vito, while currently on the straight and narrow, has had a fairly shady past and is indeed no stranger to illegal activity. They both have great hope for Adam, Vito''s son and Jessie''s grandson, who is bright, good-looking, and without a criminal past.', 'Jessie is an aging career criminal who has been in more jails, fights, schemes, and lineups than just about anyone else. His son Vito, while currently on the straight and narrow, has had a fairly shady past and is indeed no stranger to illegal activity. They both have great hope for Adam, Vito''s son and Jessie''s grandson, who is bright, good-looking, and without a criminal past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nALlbKdoKxlvwx9LDglOHZj0hs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10551'),
  ('859539634647764053', 'Family Business', 2014, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Frédéric Berthe', 'Richard Berry, Eric Assous', 'Michaël Youn, Ary Abittan, Marie Denarnaud, Pascal Louange, Denise Chalem, Michel Jonasz, Richard Berry, Claire Tran', null, 'Brothers Yvan and Max are total opposites. One is a hypochondriac; the other, a carefree optimist. Their little sister Hélène suffers from kidney problems and urgently needs a transplant. Both are called upon but only one will be chosen.', 'Brothers Yvan and Max are total opposites. One is a hypochondriac; the other, a carefree optimist. Their little sister Hélène suffers from kidney problems and urgently needs a transplant. Both are called upon but only one will be chosen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVNhldY4e03s5j1RvxtdJsakMMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307710'),
  ('226935699045893478', 'Family Business', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Dailland, Anne Le Ny, Sylvie Peyre', 'Anne Le Ny, Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Julia Piaton, Baptiste Lecaplain, Margot Bancilhon, Alice Belaïdi, Yannik Landrein, Miou-Miou, Anémone, Pablo Beugnet', null, 'When their aunt''s inheritance is given to their annoying cousin, three brothers and sisters have to work to get it back.', 'When their aunt''s inheritance is given to their annoying cousin, three brothers and sisters have to work to get it back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOwoii6DzAWBdgRQfEK8b6OdJWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432625'),
  ('89500938880707822', 'Family Camp', 2022, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'James King, Brian Cates', 'Brian Cates, Rene Gutteridge', 'Leigh-Allyn Baker, Tommy Woodard, Eddie James, Gigi Orsillo, Jacob Wade, Elias Kemuel, Cece Kelly, Keslee Blalock', 'PG', 'When workaholic Tommy''s wife insists that he spend more time with his family, he agrees to sign up for Family Camp. What Tommy didn''t count on was being forced to share a yurt at camp with the larger-than-life Sanders family.', 'When workaholic Tommy''s wife insists that he spend more time with his family, he agrees to sign up for Family Camp. What Tommy didn''t count on was being forced to share a yurt at camp with the larger-than-life Sanders family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbldvA34IVNwfKv8aUumZBg0D5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846528'),
  ('742787922076549061', 'Family Commitments', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Hanno Olderdissen, Carol Burandt von Kameke', 'Lucas Banuscha, Michael Comtesse', 'Maximilian von Pufendorf, Omar El-Saeidi, Maren Kroymann, Ramin Yazdani, Franziska Brandmeier, Nikola Kastner, Kristin Alia Hunold, Hendrik von Bültzingslöwen', null, 'The happy gay couple David and Khaled would love to marry publicly - if there weren''t Khaled''s homophobic father Faisal, David''s pseudo orthodox Jewish acting mother Lea and a possible paternity and gallery insolvency.', 'The happy gay couple David and Khaled would love to marry publicly - if there weren''t Khaled''s homophobic father Faisal, David''s pseudo orthodox Jewish acting mother Lea and a possible paternity and gallery insolvency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uorbKUwuwODOwuC5lMBR4M7YVaT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370509'),
  ('497764199551864867', 'Family Diary', 1962, 'Drama', 'Valerio Zurlini, Piero Schivazappa, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Valerio Zurlini, Mario Missiroli', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Jacques Perrin, Salvo Randone, Valeria Ciangottini, Sylvie, Marco Guglielmi, Serena Vergano, Marcella Valeri', null, 'Enrico is a struggling journalist in the Rome of 1945. He receives a phone call informing him that his younger brother Lorenzo has died. Enrico recalls their long and difficult relationship; he was brought up by their poor but warm-hearted grandmother, Lorenzo was raised as a gentleman by a wealthy local aristocrat. Reunited in the Florence of the 1930s, Enrico becomes his spoilt brother''s keeper, forever haunted by a sense of guilty responsibility towards a man he both hates and loves.', 'Enrico is a struggling journalist in the Rome of 1945. He receives a phone call informing him that his younger brother Lorenzo has died. Enrico recalls their long and difficult relationship; he was brought up by their poor but warm-hearted grandmother, Lorenzo was raised as a gentleman by a wealthy local aristocrat. Reunited in the Florence of the 1930s, Enrico becomes his spoilt brother''s keeper, forever haunted by a sense of guilty responsibility towards a man he both hates and loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXSBKcxowauPtMlpvjqNM15NbCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80557'),
  ('563643299122037293', 'Family Dinner', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Peter Hengl, Gabriel Krajanek', 'Peter Hengl', 'Pia Hierzegger, Nina Katlein, Michael Pink, Alexander Sladek', null, 'Overweight and insecure, Simi spends Easter weekend with her famous nutritionist aunt. The hope is that it’ll help her get on a healthier track, but as the aunt’s family’s icy dynamics and an increasingly malevolent atmosphere leave Simi feeling uneasy, weight isn’t the only thing she’s about to lose.', 'Overweight and insecure, Simi spends Easter weekend with her famous nutritionist aunt. The hope is that it’ll help her get on a healthier track, but as the aunt’s family’s icy dynamics and an increasingly malevolent atmosphere leave Simi feeling uneasy, weight isn’t the only thing she’s about to lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UTo2GqSwN2xUPM56xblerPlPaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964825'),
