  ('273652844663197880', 'Family Life', 1971, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Andrzej Kotkowski, Joanna Krauze', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Daniel Olbrychski, Jan Nowicki, Maja Komorowska, Halina Mikołajska, Jan Kreczmar, Anna Milewska, Barbara Sołtysik, Barbara Kobrzynska', null, 'A young industrial designer named Wit reluctantly returns to his family home to look after his gravely ill father. Upon entering the dark confines of a house he has not visited in six years, Wit once again finds himself exposed to the idiosyncratic pathologies of his father, sister, and aunt.', 'A young industrial designer named Wit reluctantly returns to his family home to look after his gravely ill father. Upon entering the dark confines of a house he has not visited in six years, Wit once again finds himself exposed to the idiosyncratic pathologies of his father, sister, and aunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbYXJBsFaDn2BHjM6AhTb88DHXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245073'),
  ('1050225953014556899', 'Family Matters', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Guillaume Deffontaines, Simone Godano, Vincenzo Rosa', 'Simone Godano, Luca Infascelli', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Adriano Giannini, Gabriel Montesi, Valentina Bellè, Claire Romain, Mati Galey, Linda Caridi, Judith El Zein', null, 'Marco, Guido, Leo, Luisa, Gaelle and Mattia have different mothers, they are not all biological children of the same father but they have a single true father figure of reference: Manfredi Alicante. When the latter passes away, they all find themselves together for the first time in their father''s house in Bordeaux, living the illusion of being able to become a united family. But now each of them brings with them a story, an identity and going back won''t be easy.', 'Marco, Guido, Leo, Luisa, Gaelle and Mattia have different mothers, they are not all biological children of the same father but they have a single true father figure of reference: Manfredi Alicante. When the latter passes away, they all find themselves together for the first time in their father''s house in Bordeaux, living the illusion of being able to become a united family. But now each of them brings with them a story, an identity and going back won''t be easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0dOH8kGNnFvuklzKqBdmFD1VRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1113505'),
  ('692011059534099144', 'Family Matters', 2025, 'Drama, Family', 'Pan Ke-yin, Eric Chao, Jill Hu', 'Pan Ke-yin', 'Lan Wei-hua, Alexia Kao, Tseng Jing-hua, Queena Huang, Chu Yi-ming, Jack Yao, Yen Yi-wen, Yu Chia-hsuan', null, 'Elder sister, Spring, seeks her origins before heading to university, Autumn, the mother, grapples with conceiving a child through artificial insemination, Summer, the younger brother, tries to engage with a paternal figure he barely knows just before his military service, and Winter, the father, desperately tries to change his fate as problems mount up.', 'Elder sister, Spring, seeks her origins before heading to university, Autumn, the mother, grapples with conceiving a child through artificial insemination, Summer, the younger brother, tries to engage with a paternal figure he barely knows just before his military service, and Winter, the father, desperately tries to change his fate as problems mount up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmTk4v2f6d2Bgeiq049xSMV0Dgt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047884'),
  ('707830425808050230', 'Family Members', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mateo Bendesky, Roman Kasseroller', 'Mateo Bendesky', 'Tomás Wicz, Laila Maltz, Alejandro Russek, Edgardo Castro, Sergio Boris, Javier Abril Rotger, Ofelia Fernández', null, 'Body-obsessed teenager Lucas and his mystically-inclined older sister, Gilda, unexpectedly become stranded when they travel to a nearly deserted coastal town to try to fulfill their dead mother''s last wishes in whatever way they can.', 'Body-obsessed teenager Lucas and his mystically-inclined older sister, Gilda, unexpectedly become stranded when they travel to a nearly deserted coastal town to try to fulfill their dead mother''s last wishes in whatever way they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8kIptVzCKfEryFkuCKAYSNVovj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570745'),
  ('370798681889667284', 'Family Nest', 1979, 'Drama', 'Béla Tarr, Ferenc Pap', 'Béla Tarr', 'László Horváth, Gábor Kun, Gábor Ifj. Kun, Gaborne Kún, Jánosné Szekeres, Jozsef Korn, Iren Racz, Jánosné Oláh', null, 'A family slowly disintegrates under various pressures in late 1970s communist Hungary.', 'A family slowly disintegrates under various pressures in late 1970s communist Hungary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNizybxpOcOAkBzzOyRGVJ323pF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48318'),
  ('851117077165025166', 'Family of Cops', 1995, 'Action, Crime, TV Movie', 'Ted Kotcheff, François Protat', 'Joel Blasberg', 'Charles Bronson, Angela Featherstone, Sebastian Spence, Kate Trotter, Caroline Barclay, Simon MacCorkindale, John Vernon, Barbara Williams', 'PG-13', 'Paul Fein is a veteran police detective whose son Eddie is also a cop. Paul is assigned to investigate the murder of a prominent businessman, and he soon learns that the field of suspects has been narrowed down to two—the victim''s sexually freewheeling wife Anna, and Paul''s wild-child daughter Jackie. Neither Paul nor Eddie believe that Jackie could have committed the murder, and soon Paul is using himself as a decoy in a bid to find out more about what Anna does and doesn''t know about her husband''s death.', 'Paul Fein is a veteran police detective whose son Eddie is also a cop. Paul is assigned to investigate the murder of a prominent businessman, and he soon learns that the field of suspects has been narrowed down to two—the victim''s sexually freewheeling wife Anna, and Paul''s wild-child daughter Jackie. Neither Paul nor Eddie believe that Jackie could have committed the murder, and soon Paul is using himself as a decoy in a bid to find out more about what Anna does and doesn''t know about her husband''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2egbVICXRMfyX9ebrKmPVEYFdiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76392'),
  ('754901046059579233', 'Family of Cops III: Under Suspicion', 1999, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Sheldon Larry, Elizabeth Scherberger, Albert J. Dunk', 'Noah Jubelirer', 'Charles Bronson, Sebastian Spence, Barbara Williams, Kim Weeks, Torri Higginson, Nicole De Boer, Sean McCann, Sabrina Grdevich', 'PG-13', 'Police Inspector Paul Fein copes with family troubles while also dealing with the possibility of advancement to police chief. Meanwhile, his son is investigating the murder of a banker.', 'Police Inspector Paul Fein copes with family troubles while also dealing with the possibility of advancement to police chief. Meanwhile, his son is investigating the murder of a banker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbzLbS5Mf1d5VbqeFOydRsXzJbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110110'),
  ('30068572810519769', 'Family of Strangers', 2019, 'Drama', 'Hideyuki Hirayama, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Hideyuki Hirayama', 'Nana Komatsu, Tsurube Shofukutei, Go Ayano, Ryota Bando, Kami Hiraiwa, Toshiki Ayata, Yoshiyuki Morishita, Shingo Mizusawa', null, 'Three patients of different backgrounds, illnesses and stages are being treated at a psychiatric clinic in Nagano Prefecture. Their cases range from the criminal to merely asocial. That should be that, but soon matters take a darker turn when a corpse turns up and a murder has occurred. The culprit fingered is one of the patients.', 'Three patients of different backgrounds, illnesses and stages are being treated at a psychiatric clinic in Nagano Prefecture. Their cases range from the criminal to merely asocial. That should be that, but soon matters take a darker turn when a corpse turns up and a murder has occurred. The culprit fingered is one of the patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5w0gDXhIa9lDz6r65K1Z73eBZ8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582589'),
  ('1105221515473620027', 'Family Pack', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michel Houssiau, Chris Vander Stappen, Cati Le Du', 'Chris Vander Stappen', 'Marie Bunel, Hélène Vincent, Tsilla Chelton, Mimie Mathy, Macha Grenon, Christian Crahay, Emmanuel Bilodeau, Michel Israël', null, 'A young woman tries to ease herself out of the closet without terrifying her parents in the process in this comedy-drama. The year is 1969, and Sacha (Marie Bunel) is a young Belgian woman living in Canada. Sacha''s family sent her to Canada to attend medical school, but she hasn''t had the heart to tell them that she''s dropped out of college to devote herself to her new interest in photography. Sacha also hasn''t told her parents that she''s a lesbian -- and that she has a new girlfriend, Odile (Macha Grenon). Odile is tired of being kept a secret, and insists that Sacha tell her parents the truth before American astronauts land on the moon in a few months -- or else. Sacha flies home to Belgium for a visit, planning to come clean to her folks, but she discovers they''ve arranged a huge welcome home party for the entire neighborhood. With everyone so excited that the soon-to-be-doctor is paying them a visit, Sacha wonders when the time will be right to give her family the news.', 'A young woman tries to ease herself out of the closet without terrifying her parents in the process in this comedy-drama. The year is 1969, and Sacha (Marie Bunel) is a young Belgian woman living in Canada. Sacha''s family sent her to Canada to attend medical school, but she hasn''t had the heart to tell them that she''s dropped out of college to devote herself to her new interest in photography. Sacha also hasn''t told her parents that she''s a lesbian -- and that she has a new girlfriend, Odile (Macha Grenon). Odile is tired of being kept a secret, and insists that Sacha tell her parents the truth before American astronauts land on the moon in a few months -- or else. Sacha flies home to Belgium for a visit, planning to come clean to her folks, but she discovers they''ve arranged a huge welcome home party for the entire neighborhood. With everyone so excited that the soon-to-be-doctor is paying them a visit, Sacha wonders when the time will be right to give her family the news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz1wRm6YmF10By17DNTy1rJL0Nd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78790'),
  ('87951633622134224', 'Family Pack', 2024, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Family', 'François Uzan, Denis Rouden', 'François Uzan, Céleste Balin', 'Franck Dubosc, Jean Reno, Suzanne Clément, Lisa Do Couto Texeira, Raphael Romand, Alizée Caugnies, Jonathan Lambert, Grégory Fitoussi', 'PG-13', 'When an old card game comes to life, a family jumps back in time to a medieval village where they must unmask werewolves to secure their return home.', 'When an old card game comes to life, a family jumps back in time to a medieval village where they must unmask werewolves to secure their return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uL1dR0L65GZgy3h2gvZcxDu0bRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091181'),
  ('604268506067359280', 'Family Party', 2015, 'Drama, Family', 'Lars Kraume, Jens Harant', 'Martin Rauhaus, Andrea Stoll', 'Günther Maria Halmer, Hannelore Elsner, Michaela May, Lars Eidinger, Jördis Triebel, Barnaby Metschurat, Marc Hosemann, Nele Mueller-Stöfen', null, 'On the 70th birthday of famous piano virtuoso Hannes Westhoff, a celebration is to take place at the patriarch''s estate. For this occasion, his second wife Anne not only invited Westhoff''s three sons Max, Fredrik and Gregor, but also their mother, Westhoff''s ex-wife Renate. While Anne tries to maintain a friendly atmosphere, old conflicts resurface among the family. With tensions already high, things take a turn for the dramatic when son Max reveals shocking news.', 'On the 70th birthday of famous piano virtuoso Hannes Westhoff, a celebration is to take place at the patriarch''s estate. For this occasion, his second wife Anne not only invited Westhoff''s three sons Max, Fredrik and Gregor, but also their mother, Westhoff''s ex-wife Renate. While Anne tries to maintain a friendly atmosphere, old conflicts resurface among the family. With tensions already high, things take a turn for the dramatic when son Max reveals shocking news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnTFQkDwS89nestXQ2jsK2VsWnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362555'),
  ('528209714315337769', 'Family Plan', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Fred Gerber, John Fleckenstein', 'Paul Bernbaum', 'Leslie Nielsen, Judge Reinhold, Eddie Bowz, Emily Procter, Zachary Browne, Trevor Morgan, Tony Rosato, Harry Morgan', 'PG', 'A bumbling guy takes a group of orphans to summer camp.', 'A bumbling guy takes a group of orphans to summer camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zA26F6S83D8sVy24rCuoAvpmsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11505'),
  ('4271382462326038', 'Family Plot', 1976, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Leonard J. South, Howard G. Kazanjian', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Barbara Harris, Bruce Dern, Karen Black, William Devane, Ed Lauter, Cathleen Nesbitt, Katherine Helmond, Warren J. Kemmerling', null, 'Spiritualist Blanche Tyler and her cab-driving boyfriend encounter a pair of serial kidnappers while trailing a missing heir in California.', 'Spiritualist Blanche Tyler and her cab-driving boyfriend encounter a pair of serial kidnappers while trailing a missing heir in California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4ha3GUNDJ864gx81e91kvp97aW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5854'),
  ('977091210972829277', 'Family Practice', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jeshua Dreyfus', 'Jeshua Dreyfus, Marcel Gisler', 'Dimitri Stapfer, Dani Levy, Sibylle Canonica, Katja Kolm, Miriam Joya Strübel, Morgane Ferru, Georg Scharegg, Giulin Stäubli', null, 'Simon has a love-hate relationship with his father. When his parents go on holiday, Simon initiates a seductive game of cat-and-mouse with his father’s mistress and gets disastrously tangled up in the sticky family network.', 'Simon has a love-hate relationship with his father. When his parents go on holiday, Simon initiates a seductive game of cat-and-mouse with his father’s mistress and gets disastrously tangled up in the sticky family network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqRQpYOc5TUTTGmLaTWtp0QXo4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578498'),
  ('65318628203501033', 'Family Reconstruction', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', null, null, 'Yoon Se-na, Baek Se-ri, Sin Seong-hoon, Kim Yo-seob', null, 'Gwang-sik is a single father with a son and Hae-ra is a widow with a daughter. They get remarried and become one family. Gwang-sik''s son Myeong-ho and Hae-ra''s daughter Dal-rae are brother and sister but they end up having sex. Their parents notice something is wrong but they pretend they don''t know anything. That''s because Gwang-sik feels attracted to Dal-rae and Hae-ra feels attracted to Myeong-ho. They go on a family trip to Kangwondo. They end up colliding with their sexual desires for each other and in the end, their family is reconstructed.', 'Gwang-sik is a single father with a son and Hae-ra is a widow with a daughter. They get remarried and become one family. Gwang-sik''s son Myeong-ho and Hae-ra''s daughter Dal-rae are brother and sister but they end up having sex. Their parents notice something is wrong but they pretend they don''t know anything. That''s because Gwang-sik feels attracted to Dal-rae and Hae-ra feels attracted to Myeong-ho. They go on a family trip to Kangwondo. They end up colliding with their sexual desires for each other and in the end, their family is reconstructed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfl7CBslXn67PucISrVmJREx4tz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440617'),
  ('630484420643918087', 'Family Resemblances', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Cédric Klapisch, Benoît Delhomme, Jacques Royer', 'Agnès Jaoui, Cédric Klapisch, Jean-Pierre Bacri', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Catherine Frot, Agnès Jaoui, Claire Maurier, Wladimir Yordanoff, Alain Guillo, Cédric Klapisch', null, 'An upper middle-class French family celebrates a birthday in a restaurant. In one evening and during one meal, family history, tensions, collective and separate grudges, delights, and memories both clash and coalesce.', 'An upper middle-class French family celebrates a birthday in a restaurant. In one evening and during one meal, family history, tensions, collective and separate grudges, delights, and memories both clash and coalesce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKGcispYwnZdC4FPctDAtFXLkyu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14646'),
  ('707781423770323546', 'Family Romance, LLC', 2019, 'Drama', 'Werner Herzog, Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog', 'Yuichi Ishii, Mahiro Tanimoto, Miki Fujimaki, Takashi Nakatani, Yuka Watanabe, Jin Kuroinu, Airi Coats, Shun Ishigaki', 'NR', 'Love is a business at Family Romance, a company that rents human stand-ins for any occasion. Founder Yuichi Ishii helps make his clients’ dreams come true. But when the mother of 12-year-old Mahiro hires Ishii to impersonate her missing father, the line between acting and reality threatens to blur.', 'Love is a business at Family Romance, a company that rents human stand-ins for any occasion. Founder Yuichi Ishii helps make his clients’ dreams come true. But when the mother of 12-year-old Mahiro hires Ishii to impersonate her missing father, the line between acting and reality threatens to blur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igtALo7638WulIIdBSQetdjFGWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595900'),
  ('693926988094604468', 'Family Saga', 2006, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Olaf Ittenbach, Martina Ittenbach', 'Olaf Ittenbach', 'Olaf Ittenbach, Martina Ittenbach, Yazid Benfeghoul, Daniel Ittenbach', null, 'Spouses bully and terrorize each other and their children.', 'Spouses bully and terrorize each other and their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zV6bKFcybn4Llv9Ol9qvDuQbt8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104233'),
  ('126596174545738446', 'Family Swap', 2021, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Gilles Porte, Jean-Patrick Benes', 'Jean-Patrick Benes, Martin Douaire, Allan Mauduit', 'Franck Dubosc, Alexandra Lamy, Christiane Millet, Rose de Kervenoaël, Mathilde Roehrich, Anaëlle Othenin-Girard, Artus, Jackie Berroyer', null, 'Husband does not understand his wife? Conflict with children? Do you want to be heard and stood in your place? Be afraid of your desires. In this family, everything changed places, including grandmother.', 'Husband does not understand his wife? Conflict with children? Do you want to be heard and stood in your place? Be afraid of your desires. In this family, everything changed places, including grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXeJkpKnG5wl2UqnudHapIEjyaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606236'),
  ('346410179625332844', 'Family Switch', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Marc Spicer, McG, Shauna Duggins', 'Adam Sztykiel, Victoria Strouse', 'Jennifer Garner, Ed Helms, Emma Myers, Brady Noon, Rita Moreno, Matthias Schweighöfer, Vanessa Carrasco, Cyrus Arnold', 'PG', 'When the Walker family members switch bodies with each other during a rare planetary alignment, their hilarious journey to find their way back to normal will bring them closer together than they ever thought possible.', 'When the Walker family members switch bodies with each other during a rare planetary alignment, their hilarious journey to find their way back to normal will bring them closer together than they ever thought possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8Gwitm4CtZBSYhLeSY4Z3Xwwcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798021'),
  ('764014765123586660', 'Family Ties', 2006, 'Drama', 'Kim Tae-yong, Chu In-sik', 'Kim Tae-yong', 'Moon So-ri, Goh Doo-shim, Uhm Tae-woong, Gong Hyo-jin, Kim Hye-ok, Bong Tae-gyu, Jung Yu-mi, Ju Jin-mo', null, 'A story of three families living different but similar lives. They always fight and quarrel, but love is the common denominator for their relationship, making people think about what families are for.', 'A story of three families living different but similar lives. They always fight and quarrel, but love is the common denominator for their relationship, making people think about what families are for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIjYHaP98yGEPpJd7KsPX4uifom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64223'),
  ('228318616700652216', 'Family Tree', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jacques Martineau, Olivier Ducastel', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau', 'Guy Marchand, Françoise Fabian, Sabrina Seyvecou, Yannick Renier, François Négret, Catherine Mouchet, Sandrine Dumas, Pierre-Loup Rajot', null, 'When Frédérick, the patriarch of the Alsatian Muller family, is conspicuously absent from his son Charles'' funeral, Frédérick''s surviving son and his granddaughter, raw from their loss, await an explanation. Once revealed, Frédérick''s reasons and the painful secret Charles harbored for years threaten the foundations of the entire family.', 'When Frédérick, the patriarch of the Alsatian Muller family, is conspicuously absent from his son Charles'' funeral, Frédérick''s surviving son and his granddaughter, raw from their loss, await an explanation. Once revealed, Frédérick''s reasons and the painful secret Charles harbored for years threaten the foundations of the entire family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZUbn7GImq9pnCvOupt3Y5KwMzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111481'),
  ('500417643914695330', 'Family United', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo, Juan Carlos Gómez, Antton Zabala', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Antonio de la Torre, Roberto Álamo, Quim Gutiérrez, Miquel Fernández, Patrick Criado, Héctor Colomé, Verónica Echegui, Arantxa Martí', null, 'Five siblings gather to celebrate a wedding at their family estate on the day Spain plays the final of the 2010 World Cup.', 'Five siblings gather to celebrate a wedding at their family estate on the day Spain plays the final of the 2010 World Cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqAn7UYNLexx5EDxXoeV8CLpqtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215848'),
  ('558585942763900240', 'Family Values', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Claus Drexel, Antoine Roch', 'Claus Drexel, Claude Scasso', 'André Dussollier, Miou-Miou, Éric Caravaca, Hande Kodja, Julien Courbey, Philippe Hérisson, Sylviane Goudal, Laurent Bariteau', null, 'A look at the violent consequences faced by a middle-class family, as seen by three different points of view.', 'A look at the violent consequences faced by a middle-class family, as seen by three different points of view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9n9sCQYgZfXFtJfuWnT1MBASqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15619'),
  ('682371624677926829', 'Family Way', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joram Lürsen, Lex Brand', 'Kim van Kooten', 'Carice van Houten, Thijs Römer, Benja Bruijning, Jacob Derwig, Kees Hulst, Diederik Ebbinge, Willeke Alberti, Tjitske Reidinga', null, 'All the members of the De Roover family have ended up at a point of no return in their lives where crucial choices have to be made. Winnie wants a child. Her husband Rutmer wants to get in touch with his feelings. His brother Charlie doesn''t want any responsibilities. Their brother-in-law Dick wants his deceased wife back. Head of the family Arend wants to be happy. Mother Jeannette wants somebody to want her. Written by Topkapi Films', 'All the members of the De Roover family have ended up at a point of no return in their lives where crucial choices have to be made. Winnie wants a child. Her husband Rutmer wants to get in touch with his feelings. His brother Charlie doesn''t want any responsibilities. Their brother-in-law Dick wants his deceased wife back. Head of the family Arend wants to be happy. Mother Jeannette wants somebody to want her. Written by Topkapi Films', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2fvw790H7znQUtrhxEmIa8wSBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144595'),
  ('75983155600092137', 'Family Weekend', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Benjamin Epps, Christopher Norr, Daniel S. Noga', 'Matt K. Turner', 'Olesya Rulin, Kristin Chenoweth, Matthew Modine, Joey King, Shirley Jones, Eddie Hassell, Chloe Bridges, Adam Saunders', 'R', 'A 16-year-old girl takes her parents hostage after they miss her big jump-roping competition.', 'A 16-year-old girl takes her parents hostage after they miss her big jump-roping competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RiUNV96HPP14OfB7ILEOe2Vj26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172631'),
  ('699245521940800561', 'Family: Ties of Blood', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, Shridhar Raghavan', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Akshay Kumar, Bhumika Chawla, Aryeman Ramsay, Sushant Singh, Kader Khan, Sunil Grover, Nawazuddin Siddiqui', null, 'The story is on the concept of karma and bad deeds. It follows Viren Sahai (Amitabh Bachchan), underworld don who rules over India. His son Abhir (Sushant Singh) is spoilt and believes he can do anything due to his father''s power. When Viren''s enemy Khan (Kader Khan) attacks Abhir, Viren demands revenge.', 'The story is on the concept of karma and bad deeds. It follows Viren Sahai (Amitabh Bachchan), underworld don who rules over India. His son Abhir (Sushant Singh) is spoilt and believes he can do anything due to his father''s power. When Viren''s enemy Khan (Kader Khan) attacks Abhir, Viren demands revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMo4b6JqrpbP8bkQpdqu5VlYybC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136542'),
  ('507311353138213863', 'Familyhood', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Tae-gon, Lee Chang-jae', 'Sin Dong-seon', 'Kim Hye-soo, Don Lee, Kim Hyeon-soo, Kim Yong-geon, Seo Hyun-jin, Kwak Si-yang, Hwang Mi-young, Jun Suk-ho', null, 'An aging actress is desperate to become a mother. In menopause and too controversial for legal adoption, she decides to illegally adopt from a pregnant teenager while publicly faking pregnancy. The ensuing media circus at first revitalizes her career but then threatens to grow out of control and destroy everything she cares about.', 'An aging actress is desperate to become a mother. In menopause and too controversial for legal adoption, she decides to illegally adopt from a pregnant teenager while publicly faking pregnancy. The ensuing media circus at first revitalizes her career but then threatens to grow out of control and destroy everything she cares about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMYRNPtfzFKZ8qdqcakf9tZPIBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402648'),
  ('621322417236417259', 'Famine-33', 1991, 'Drama, History', 'Oles Yanchuk, Vasyl Borodin, Mykhailo Kretov', 'Serhiy Dyachenko, Les Tanyuk', 'Oleksiy Horbunov, Galina Sulima, Heorhiy Morozyuk, Maksymko Koval, Olenka Kovtun, Leonid Yanovskyi, Petro Beniuk, Larysa Kadyrova', 'R', 'The film about the Holodomor famine in Ukraine, based on the novel ''The Yellow Prince'' by Vasyl Barka. The film is told through the lives of the Katrannyk family of six. It relies more on images than on words shot in black-and-white.', 'The film about the Holodomor famine in Ukraine, based on the novel ''The Yellow Prince'' by Vasyl Barka. The film is told through the lives of the Katrannyk family of six. It relies more on images than on words shot in black-and-white.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pfPRbP46R94Ho5nQixE4WMFqYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204022'),
  ('837231105575238498', 'Famo$o', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Giuseppe Domingo Romano', null, 'Sfera Ebbasta, Fabio Bartolo Rizzo, Diplo, Steve Aoki, Rvssian, Charlie Charles, Shablo', null, 'Musicfilm with unpublished images from the life of the most famous Italian trapper: Sfera Ebbasta. Between concerts, studio sessions and lifestyle, the movie retraces his entire artistic career from the beginning together with producer Charlie Charles, to international success. With testimonials from Marracash, Shablo, Steve Aoki and Rvssian.', 'Musicfilm with unpublished images from the life of the most famous Italian trapper: Sfera Ebbasta. Between concerts, studio sessions and lifestyle, the movie retraces his entire artistic career from the beginning together with producer Charlie Charles, to international success. With testimonials from Marracash, Shablo, Steve Aoki and Rvssian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLcbwOgav55rxuuFyrhqSvA89UZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755230'),
  ('328664455702885850', 'Famous Five', 2012, 'Family, Adventure', 'Mike Marzuk, Jason M. Wiedenfeld, Bernhard Jasper', 'Peer Klehmet, Sebastian Wehlings', 'Valeria Eisenbart, Neele-Marie Nickel, Anja Kling, Quirin Oettl, Justus Schlingensiepen, Anatole Taubman, Michael Fitz, Armin Rohde', 'G', 'The film recounts the adventures of Julian, Dick, Anne, George and Timmy the dog on their first holiday together at the seaside. In an old smugglers'' cave, the children happen to overhear a radio message that refers to the abduction of George’s father Quentin. The professor has set up a laboratory on Kirrin Island where he’s doing research on a new energy generation method. Someone has obviously taken great interest in the valuable research results. But neither the police nor George’s mother Fanny believe the children. They are now on their own and discover a conspiracy that almost takes their breath away.', 'The film recounts the adventures of Julian, Dick, Anne, George and Timmy the dog on their first holiday together at the seaside. In an old smugglers'' cave, the children happen to overhear a radio message that refers to the abduction of George’s father Quentin. The professor has set up a laboratory on Kirrin Island where he’s doing research on a new energy generation method. Someone has obviously taken great interest in the valuable research results. But neither the police nor George’s mother Fanny believe the children. They are now on their own and discover a conspiracy that almost takes their breath away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkpZ33Ph5wFi85NZvHDA27aoKSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80714'),
  ('723521548502577772', 'Famous Five 2', 2013, 'Family, Adventure', 'Mike Marzuk, Bernhard Jasper', 'Sebastian Wehlings, Peer Klehmet', 'Valeria Eisenbart, Justus Schlingensiepen, Neele-Marie Nickel, Quirin Oettl, Kristo Ferkic, Heio von Stetten, Peter Lohmeyer, Oliver Korittke', 'G', 'For their bicycle tour to Catmoor, the friends Julian, Dick and Anne, their cousin Georgina, called George, and her dog Timmy have long looked forward to. But the camping holiday in the countryside ends with the kidnapping of Dick, confuse the two underprivileged hoodlums with the same age millionaire''s son Hardy. With sophistication and courage, the five friends take on his trail that leads from a mysterious traveling circus to the castle "Owls Nest" where the kidnappers force Dick to coax the clue to a giant emerald.', 'For their bicycle tour to Catmoor, the friends Julian, Dick and Anne, their cousin Georgina, called George, and her dog Timmy have long looked forward to. But the camping holiday in the countryside ends with the kidnapping of Dick, confuse the two underprivileged hoodlums with the same age millionaire''s son Hardy. With sophistication and courage, the five friends take on his trail that leads from a mysterious traveling circus to the castle "Owls Nest" where the kidnappers force Dick to coax the clue to a giant emerald.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvOHxVRIB6yGRMWvRkcr7sx8hLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175806'),
  ('243121659985962790', 'Famous Five 3', 2014, 'Family, Adventure', 'Mike Marzuk, Philip Peschlow', 'Peer Klehmet, Sebastian Wehlings', 'Valeria Eisenbart, Quirin Oettl, Justus Schlingensiepen, Neele-Marie Nickel, Sky du Mont, Michael Fitz, Nora Waldstätten, Michael Kessler', 'G', 'In their third cinema adventure the Famous Five are searching for a pirate treasure...', 'In their third cinema adventure the Famous Five are searching for a pirate treasure...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFloolev7iM4i0nBR6qgvNnRvkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249053'),
  ('458735506162879722', 'Famous Five 4', 2015, 'Family, Adventure, Thriller, Crime', 'Korbinian Wandinger, Mike Marzuk, Philip Peschlow', 'Simon Hauschild, Peer Klehmet, Sebastian Wehlings', 'Valeria Eisenbart, Quirin Oettl, Justus Schlingensiepen, Neele-Marie Nickel, Samuel Finzi, Adnan Maral, Pasquale Aleardi, Ramin Yazdani', 'G', 'The famous five George, Julian, Dick, Anne and Timmy the dog are spending holidays together. But when they are invited by Berhard, father of Julian, Dick and Anne, to visit an egyptian exhibition they see a burglar. They have a look at the mummy the burglar was tempering with to find a golden amulet. The famous five decide to visit Egypt to hand over the amulet. When arriving in Egypt Bernhard is arrested because he''s asserted he stole the amulet and replaced it with a fake. Now its up to the young detectives to solve the case and prove their fathers innocence.', 'The famous five George, Julian, Dick, Anne and Timmy the dog are spending holidays together. But when they are invited by Berhard, father of Julian, Dick and Anne, to visit an egyptian exhibition they see a burglar. They have a look at the mummy the burglar was tempering with to find a golden amulet. The famous five decide to visit Egypt to hand over the amulet. When arriving in Egypt Bernhard is arrested because he''s asserted he stole the amulet and replaced it with a fake. Now its up to the young detectives to solve the case and prove their fathers innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx0lziJ5GJDyvOX82Fqyixvn1xp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321620'),
  ('776671686557549604', 'Fan', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Maneesh Sharma, Sakshi V Kapoor, Adhip Chopra', 'Habib Faisal', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Deepika Amin, Yogendra Tiku, Shriya Pilgaonkar, Sayani Gupta, Waluscha D''Souza, Indraneel Bhattacharya, Taher Shabbir', null, 'A man who bears a striking resemblance to a renowned movie star becomes an obsessive fan, but when his fierce love is spurned by the star, he decides to destroy the star''s life and reputation.', 'A man who bears a striking resemblance to a renowned movie star becomes an obsessive fan, but when his fierce love is spurned by the star, he decides to destroy the star''s life and reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukMYsujfyWhSeIBAc9hGEFEkrJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377985'),
  ('266041796138355945', 'Fan Girl', 2015, 'Music, Comedy, Family', 'Brian Burgoyne, Paul Jarrett', 'Gina O''Brien', 'Kiernan Shipka, Kara Hayward, Meg Ryan, Scott Adsit, Joshua Boone, Nicole Coulon, Pico Alexander, Danny Flaherty', null, 'A 15-year-old girl decides to bring her two passions together for her final film project: making movies and her favorite band.', 'A 15-year-old girl decides to bring her two passions together for her final film project: making movies and her favorite band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6p7sGRIeCMDrKJt3je9xZVsrvva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333678'),
  ('233535284682697653', 'Fan-Fan the Tulip', 1952, 'Romance, Adventure, Comedy, War', 'Christian-Jaque, Christian Matras', 'René Wheeler, René Fallet', 'Gérard Philipe, Gina Lollobrigida, Marcel Herrand, Olivier Hussenot, Noël Roquevert, Geneviève Page, Sylvie Pelayo, Henri Rollan', null, 'Fanfan is a young handsome peasant. He joins the army to escape marriage because a gypsy girl predicted he will get glory and the king''s daughter as a wife. But the gypsy girl was in fact Adeline, the daughter of the recruiting officer. Once he has discovered the stratagem, Fanfan refuses to forget this dream and decides to fulfill the destiny of the fake prediction.', 'Fanfan is a young handsome peasant. He joins the army to escape marriage because a gypsy girl predicted he will get glory and the king''s daughter as a wife. But the gypsy girl was in fact Adeline, the daughter of the recruiting officer. Once he has discovered the stratagem, Fanfan refuses to forget this dream and decides to fulfill the destiny of the fake prediction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdhnzJfcwvi0i6a8wqasRN3sq6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62547'),
  ('547858089171667294', 'Fan-Fan the Tulip', 2003, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Gérard Krawczyk, Gérard Simon', 'Luc Besson, Jean Cosmos', 'Penélope Cruz, Vincent Perez, Didier Bourdon, Michel Muller, Hélène de Fougerolles, Jacques Frantz, Gérald Laroche, Philippe Dormoy', null, 'In this 2003 remake of the classic 1952 French film, Fanfan la Tulipe is a swashbuckling lover who is tricked into joining the army of King Louis XV by Adeline La Franchise, who tells Fanfan that by doing so, he will eventually marry one of the king''s daughters', 'In this 2003 remake of the classic 1952 French film, Fanfan la Tulipe is a swashbuckling lover who is tricked into joining the army of King Louis XV by Adeline La Franchise, who tells Fanfan that by doing so, he will eventually marry one of the king''s daughters', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykQjvmeJf4QbRSnVpUS2W6jAgFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37559'),
  ('1110337814225682273', 'Fanaa', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Kunal Kohli, Ravi K. Chandran, G.A. Aguilar', 'Shibani Bathija', 'Aamir Khan, Kajol, Rishi Kapoor, Kirron Kher, Sanaya Irani, Shiney Ahuja, Lillete Dubey, Tabu', null, 'Zooni Ali Beg is a blind Kashmiri girl who travels without her parents for the first time with a dance troupe to Delhi to perform in a ceremony for independence day. On her journey, she meets Rehan Khan, a casanova and tour guide who flirts with her. Although her friends warn Zooni about him, she cannot resist falling in love with him and he takes her on a private tour of New Delhi. But there is more to Rehan than meets the eye and Zooni will have to make a heartbreaking decision.', 'Zooni Ali Beg is a blind Kashmiri girl who travels without her parents for the first time with a dance troupe to Delhi to perform in a ceremony for independence day. On her journey, she meets Rehan Khan, a casanova and tour guide who flirts with her. Although her friends warn Zooni about him, she cannot resist falling in love with him and he takes her on a private tour of New Delhi. But there is more to Rehan than meets the eye and Zooni will have to make a heartbreaking decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ji0nyfJmXJDw5icyOZcsVAyiiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8453'),
  ('82277494712548727', 'Fanatic', 1965, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Arthur Ibbetson, Silvio Narizzano, Claude Watson', 'Richard Matheson', 'Tallulah Bankhead, Stefanie Powers, Peter Vaughan, Donald Sutherland, Maurice Kaufmann, Yootha Joyce, Gwendolyn Watts, Robert Dorning', null, 'A young woman is terrorized by her former fiance''s demented mother who blames her for her son''s death. Also known as Die! Die! My Darling!', 'A young woman is terrorized by her former fiance''s demented mother who blames her for her son''s death. Also known as Die! Die! My Darling!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0FiaEEMw0WPGSh7MslmPgs9DFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42735'),
  ('1083601336437702238', 'Fanboys', 2009, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Kyle Newman, Lukas Ettlin', 'Ernest Cline, Adam F. Goldberg', 'Sam Huntington, Jay Baruchel, Dan Fogler, Kristen Bell, Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, David Denman, Christopher McDonald, Isaac Kappy', 'PG-13', 'In 1999, Star Wars fanatics take a cross-country trip to George Lucas'' Skywalker Ranch so their dying friend can see a screening of The Phantom Menace before its release.', 'In 1999, Star Wars fanatics take a cross-country trip to George Lucas'' Skywalker Ranch so their dying friend can see a screening of The Phantom Menace before its release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fitksX4J3xfBjT38YgDUXOlBkHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13532'),
  ('498799655515837478', 'Fancy Dance', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Masayuki Suō, Yuichi Nagata', 'Masayuki Suō', 'Masahiro Motoki, Honami Suzuki, Kenji Ohtsuki, Ken Osawa, Hikomaro, Hiromasa Taguchi, Miyako Koda, Naoto Takenaka', null, 'Yohei, a punk rocker, becomes a Buddhist monk in order to inherit a mountain temple. Though initially rebelling against the tough monastic discipline, he learns to adjust. Then his girlfriend shows up, enticing him to return to his rock ''n'' roll roots.', 'Yohei, a punk rocker, becomes a Buddhist monk in order to inherit a mountain temple. Though initially rebelling against the tough monastic discipline, he learns to adjust. Then his girlfriend shows up, enticing him to return to his rock ''n'' roll roots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIBq78zpt0JiufRA91NLE8NeGSB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338374'),
  ('420811348928787183', 'Fancy Dance', 2024, 'Drama', 'Erica Tremblay, Carolina Costa, Micah Floyd', 'Miciana Alise, Erica Tremblay', 'Lily Gladstone, Isabel DeRoy-Olson, Ryan Begay, Shea Whigham, Audrey Wasilewski, Crystle Lightning, Tamara Podemski, Patrice Fisher', 'R', 'Following her sister''s disappearance, Jax and her niece Roki must stick together. Desperate to keep what''s left of their family intact, Jax and Roki defy the law and hit the road on a journey to the Grand Nation Powwow in Oklahoma City.', 'Following her sister''s disappearance, Jax and her niece Roki must stick together. Desperate to keep what''s left of their family intact, Jax and Roki defy the law and hit the road on a journey to the Grand Nation Powwow in Oklahoma City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMOqbt2cdWryPJIrxnwzplPNmF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058617'),
  ('481592256648318105', 'Fancy Pants', 1950, 'Music, Comedy, Western', 'George Marshall, Oscar Rudolph, Charles Lang', 'Edmund L. Hartmann, Robert O''Brien', 'Bob Hope, Lucille Ball, Bruce Cabot, Jack Kirkwood, Lea Penman, Hugh French, Eric Blore, Joseph Vitale', null, 'An American actor, impersonating an English butler, is hired by a rich woman from New Mexico to refine her husband and headstrong daughter. The complications increase when the town believes the actor/butler to be an earl and President Roosevelt decides to pay a visit.', 'An American actor, impersonating an English butler, is hired by a rich woman from New Mexico to refine her husband and headstrong daughter. The complications increase when the town believes the actor/butler to be an earl and President Roosevelt decides to pay a visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGdQJlatFeexcPU82UTSnnq9jns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55441'),
  ('922246887352229164', 'Fandango', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kevin Reynolds, Thomas Del Ruth', 'Kevin Reynolds', 'Kevin Costner, Judd Nelson, Sam Robards, Chuck Bush, Marvin J. McIntyre, Suzy Amis, Glenne Headly, Pepe Serna', 'PG', 'In 1971, five college buddies from the University of Texas embark on a final road trip odyssey across the Mexican border before facing up to uncertain futures, in Vietnam and otherwise.', 'In 1971, five college buddies from the University of Texas embark on a final road trip odyssey across the Mexican border before facing up to uncertain futures, in Vietnam and otherwise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hdQUp17uXp8tZJWB8eWh25DWbc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20348'),
  ('154319700662908161', 'Fando and Lis', 1972, 'Romance, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Rafael Corkidi, Antonio Reynoso', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Fernando Arrabal', 'Sergio Kleiner, Diana Mariscal, María Teresa Rivas, Tamara Garina, Juan José Arreola, Rene Rebetez, Amparo Villegas, Miguel Álvarez Acosta', null, 'Fando and his partially paralysed lover Lis search for the mythical city of Tar.', 'Fando and his partially paralysed lover Lis search for the mythical city of Tar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GBjyujvyLEOtKL5WIm4UN9WHh5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33257'),
  ('360638003999658157', 'Fanfan', 1993, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alexandre Jardin, Jean-Yves Le Mener', 'Alexandre Jardin', 'Sophie Marceau, Vincent Perez, Marine Delterme, Gérard Séty, Bruno Todeschini, Arielle Sémenoff, Marcel Maréchal, Gérard Caillaud', null, 'After seeing the initial passion and romance fade into a series of routine and boring relationships, Alexandre (Vincent Perez) concludes that romance ends when sex enters into a relationship. Determined to prevent this from happening with his latest love-interest—a sexy young woman named Fanfan (Sophie Marceau)—he decides that platonic love is the solution. Despite the wonderful, romantic, and inventive ways Alexandre finds for them to spend time together, Fanfan is left disappointed by his refusal to make love to her. Their exciting relationship becomes jeopardized by Alexandre''s unwillingness to change his new approach to love.', 'After seeing the initial passion and romance fade into a series of routine and boring relationships, Alexandre (Vincent Perez) concludes that romance ends when sex enters into a relationship. Determined to prevent this from happening with his latest love-interest—a sexy young woman named Fanfan (Sophie Marceau)—he decides that platonic love is the solution. Despite the wonderful, romantic, and inventive ways Alexandre finds for them to spend time together, Fanfan is left disappointed by his refusal to make love to her. Their exciting relationship becomes jeopardized by Alexandre''s unwillingness to change his new approach to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKX3qjZ4XI2iDLU33EBsxPjqLzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38012'),
  ('217007246076982239', 'Fanfare', 1958, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Bert Haanstra, George Sluizer', 'Jan Blokker, Bert Haanstra', 'Hans Kaart, Bernard Droog, Ineke Brinkman, Wim Van den Heuvel, Andrea Domburg, Albert Mol, Henk van Buuren, Herbert Joeks', null, 'In the small Dutch village of Lagerheide, two members of the local brass band get into a fight, forcing the band to be split in two. The two hotheads and their followers are doing their utmost to sabotage each other’s attempts at becoming the band who will represent the village at the upcoming brass band competition.', 'In the small Dutch village of Lagerheide, two members of the local brass band get into a fight, forcing the band to be split in two. The two hotheads and their followers are doing their utmost to sabotage each other’s attempts at becoming the band who will represent the village at the upcoming brass band competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5znrKi2sicXgr7RH51Unqk43zx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52775'),
  ('426742617063113342', 'Fango e Gloria - La Grande Guerra', 2014, 'History, Drama', 'Stefano Paradiso, Leonardo Tiberi', 'Leonardo Tiberi, Salvatore De Mola', 'Eugenio Franceschini, Valentina Corti, Domenico Fortunato, Francesco Martino, Alberto Lo Porto, Michele Vigilante', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EBmLUcErGVsvMB1F4C37gh4GFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297751'),
  ('1084881299901704212', 'Fangs', 1974, 'Horror', 'Art Names', 'John T. Wilson, Art Names', 'Les Tremayne, Janet Wood, Bebe Kelly, Marvin Kaplan, Alice Nunn, Bruce Kimball, Richard Kennedy, Cecil Reddick', 'R', 'A snake lover sends out poisonous snakes and reptiles to kill his enemies.', 'A snake lover sends out poisonous snakes and reptiles to kill his enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtPkOHOZszYhJylYgyw5cm1YdMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81469'),
  ('804246502842853741', 'Fangs of the Living Dead', 1969, 'Horror', 'Fulvio Testi, Amando de Ossorio, Alfonso Donati', 'Amando de Ossorio', 'Anita Ekberg, Julián Ugarte, Gianni Medici, Diana Lorys, Rosanna Yanni, Adriana Ambesi, César Benet, Carlos Casaravilla', 'PG', 'A beautiful virgin inherits a castle, but when she arrives at it, she finds that the inhabitants include a strange nobleman and a bevy of beautiful women she suspects may be vampires.', 'A beautiful virgin inherits a castle, but when she arrives at it, she finds that the inhabitants include a strange nobleman and a bevy of beautiful women she suspects may be vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLG4t7sQY16t4LBZb9hzuSYFxMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28690'),
  ('732951713806439191', 'Fanney Khan', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Atul Manjrekar, S. Thirunavukkarasu', 'Atul Manjrekar, Abbas Dalal, Hussain Dalal', 'Anil Kapoor, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Rajkummar Rao, Divya Dutta, Satish Kaushik, Girish Kulkarni, Semwal Swati, Asif Basra', null, 'The journey of a struggling singer ''Fanney Khan'' who aspires to make his daughter a big name in the music world.', 'The journey of a struggling singer ''Fanney Khan'' who aspires to make his daughter a big name in the music world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vi6ROSYs0kOgYzKc15X3MrwKsI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465651'),
  ('393570673651561823', 'Fanny', 1932, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Allégret, Nikolai Toporkoff, Yves Allégret', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Orane Demazis, Raimu, Fernand Charpin, Alida Rouffe, Auguste Mouriès, Marcel Maupi, Robert Vattier, Milly Mathis', null, 'Soon after Marius''s departure, Fanny learns that she is pregnant with his child, to the disappointment of her mother and of Marius''s father, César. To secure a better life for her unborn child, she accepts a marriage proposal from the aging widower Honoré Panisse.', 'Soon after Marius''s departure, Fanny learns that she is pregnant with his child, to the disappointment of her mother and of Marius''s father, César. To secure a better life for her unborn child, she accepts a marriage proposal from the aging widower Honoré Panisse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hY9A0mWwVXhgdV1S2YKxSp1ruS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43146'),
  ('264995694469391003', 'Fanny', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jack Cardiff, Joshua Logan, Michel Romanoff', 'Julius J. Epstein', 'Leslie Caron, Maurice Chevalier, Charles Boyer, Horst Buchholz, Georgette Anys, Salvatore Baccaloni, Lionel Jeffries, Raymond Bussières', null, 'Almost 19-year-old Marius feels himself in a rut in Marseille, his life planned for him by his cafe''-owning father, and he longs for the sea. The night before he is to leave on a 5-year voyage, Fanny, a girl he grew up with, reveals that she is in love with him, and he discovers that he is in love with her. He must choose between an exciting life at sea, and a boring life with the woman he loves. And Fanny must choose between keeping the man she loves, and letting him live the life he seems to want.', 'Almost 19-year-old Marius feels himself in a rut in Marseille, his life planned for him by his cafe''-owning father, and he longs for the sea. The night before he is to leave on a 5-year voyage, Fanny, a girl he grew up with, reveals that she is in love with him, and he discovers that he is in love with her. He must choose between an exciting life at sea, and a boring life with the woman he loves. And Fanny must choose between keeping the man she loves, and letting him live the life he seems to want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hEQpSE3D9rsMw37N30T9EZwLoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84050'),
  ('278747541969227890', 'Fanny', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jean-François Robin, Daniel Auteuil', 'Daniel Auteuil', 'Daniel Auteuil, Victoire Bélézy, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Raphaël Personnaz, Marie-Anne Chazel, Nicolas Vaude, Daniel Russo, Ariane Ascaride', null, '"Fanny" is the second part of the "Marseille trilogy", made by Marcel Pagnol with the generic name of "Marius, Fanny and César". Fanny falls in love and is abandoned by Marius. Now she discovers she is pregnant. Her mother and Marius''s father, César, persuade her to accept the romantic advances of a much older man. To save face, Fanny accepts to marry Honoré Panisse, a rich merchant of the Vieux Port, 30 years her senior who will recognize her son.', '"Fanny" is the second part of the "Marseille trilogy", made by Marcel Pagnol with the generic name of "Marius, Fanny and César". Fanny falls in love and is abandoned by Marius. Now she discovers she is pregnant. Her mother and Marius''s father, César, persuade her to accept the romantic advances of a much older man. To save face, Fanny accepts to marry Honoré Panisse, a rich merchant of the Vieux Port, 30 years her senior who will recognize her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvb4hT4rEnAxMxo3zJj8X2fXROY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201018'),
  ('378424384986087575', 'Fanny Hill', 1964, 'Comedy, History', 'Heinz Hölscher, Russ Meyer', 'Robert Hill', 'Miriam Hopkins, Alexander D''Arcy, Walter Giller, Chris Howland, Ulli Lommel, Helmut Weiss, Letícia Román, Cara Garnett', 'PG-13', 'Young, pretty and innocent, Fanny Hill has lost her parents and must find her way in life amidst the perils of turbulent 18th-century London. She''s fortunate enough to rapidly find a place as chambermaid of the effusive Mrs. Brown, who lives in a large house teeming with female ''relatives'' in negligée and with very relaxed manners. She also insists that Fanny alone meets various gentlemen who show an ardent interest in her.', 'Young, pretty and innocent, Fanny Hill has lost her parents and must find her way in life amidst the perils of turbulent 18th-century London. She''s fortunate enough to rapidly find a place as chambermaid of the effusive Mrs. Brown, who lives in a large house teeming with female ''relatives'' in negligée and with very relaxed manners. She also insists that Fanny alone meets various gentlemen who show an ardent interest in her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8gcQ0MSymcqnvR4OQSngI6SgRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5744'),
  ('331877581307888977', 'Fanny Hill', 1983, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Gerry O''Hara, Tony Spratling', 'Stephen Chesley', 'Lisa Foster, Oliver Reed, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Shelley Winters, Alfred Marks, Paddie O''Neil, Barry Stokes, Maria Harper', 'R', 'Happily engaged to her handsome fiance, Charles, Fanny is soon hit with one misfortune after another until she is forced to become a prostitute to survive. This is the story, with many erotic asides, of her struggle to regain her pride in herself and find happiness in life once again.', 'Happily engaged to her handsome fiance, Charles, Fanny is soon hit with one misfortune after another until she is forced to become a prostitute to survive. This is the story, with many erotic asides, of her struggle to regain her pride in herself and find happiness in life once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8qy0hfwfk8VjgSKxUMHrMEPmQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58843'),
  ('1066703801366423738', 'Fanny Hill', 2007, 'Drama', 'James Hawes', 'Andrew Davies', 'Rebecca Night, Alison Steadman, Hugo Speer, Joanna Miller, Emma Stansfield, Ruth Sheen, Samantha Bond, Claire Murphy', null, 'Orphaned by smallpox, young Lancashire country lady Fanny Hill cheerfully accepts her friend Esther Davies''s offer to join the London ''working girls'' with Mrs. Brown, a madam who recruits her as charmingly fresh enough to wait, in-living, on gentlemen.', 'Orphaned by smallpox, young Lancashire country lady Fanny Hill cheerfully accepts her friend Esther Davies''s offer to join the London ''working girls'' with Mrs. Brown, a madam who recruits her as charmingly fresh enough to wait, in-living, on gentlemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gYyyVqfxJEafg6L0e2JPcnGhTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47963'),
  ('1019584466136070513', 'Fanny Lye Deliver''d', 2019, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Mariana Vodenicharova, Ina Lüders, Michelle McDermott', 'Thomas Clay', 'Maxine Peake, Charles Dance, Freddie Fox, Tanya Reynolds, Zak Adams, Peter McDonald, Perry Fitzpatrick, Kenneth Collard', null, 'On an isolated English farm in 1657, Fanny lives a quiet life with her oppressive husband John and their young son. One day their life is rocked with the arrival of young couple Thomas and Rebecca who claim to have been robbed and need a place to stay. But are these strangers really who they say they are?', 'On an isolated English farm in 1657, Fanny lives a quiet life with her oppressive husband John and their young son. One day their life is rocked with the arrival of young couple Thomas and Rebecca who claim to have been robbed and need a place to stay. But are these strangers really who they say they are?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOv76Cr5wHLUYyjHvk0C33GaWC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443072'),
  ('152260478726796924', 'Fanny Straw-Top', 1984, 'Crime', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Fanny Cottençon, Bruno Cremer, Francisco Algora, Berta Cabré, Ian Sera, Paca Gabaldón, Eduardo MacGregor, Joaquim Cardona', null, 'In the slums of Barcelona, Fanny, a woman just released from prison, tries to carry out a revenge that has nourished for years: to kill "El Gallego", the corrupt and brutal policeman who killed her boyfriend', 'In the slums of Barcelona, Fanny, a woman just released from prison, tries to carry out a revenge that has nourished for years: to kill "El Gallego", the corrupt and brutal policeman who killed her boyfriend', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJOQAolFLmqtnL24j5mDl3nG0VS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94386'),
  ('487398544533543144', 'Fanny''s Journey', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Lola Doillon, Pierre Cottereau', 'Anna Peyregne, Lola Doillon', 'Léonie Souchaud, Fantine Harduin, Juliane Lepoureau, Cécile de France, Stéphane De Groodt, Lou Lambrecht, Alice D''Hauwe, Igor van Dessel', null, 'Fanny is a Jewish girl in a French orphanage in 1943. When she and her friends are no longer safe from the Nazis, they try to flee to Switzerland. After their guide disappears, Fanny has to take the lead and help the other kids make it over the mountains.', 'Fanny is a Jewish girl in a French orphanage in 1943. When she and her friends are no longer safe from the Nazis, they try to flee to Switzerland. After their guide disappears, Fanny has to take the lead and help the other kids make it over the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nsdiyG3B39KKWOI0aVmNaaLXwK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384581'),
  ('1111403999101837215', 'Fanon', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'Marie Fischer, Ariel Méthot Bellemare, Jean-Claude Barny', 'Philippe Bernard, Jean-Claude Barny', 'Alexandre Bouyer, Déborah François, Stanislas Merhar, Mehdi Senoussi, Olivier Gourmet, Salomé Partouche, Nicolas Buchoux, Salem Kali', null, 'Frantz Fanon, a French psychiatrist from Martinique, has just been appointed head of department at the psychiatric hospital in Blida, Algeria. His methods contrast with those of the other doctors in a context of colonization. A biopic in the heart of the Algerian war where a fight is waged in the name of Humanity.', 'Frantz Fanon, a French psychiatrist from Martinique, has just been appointed head of department at the psychiatric hospital in Blida, Algeria. His methods contrast with those of the other doctors in a context of colonization. A biopic in the heart of the Algerian war where a fight is waged in the name of Humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eseIExk6NMLs3IRE86JZNayRKsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000432'),
  ('40148228543129888', 'Fantasia', 1940, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Samuel Armstrong, James Algar, Bill Roberts', null, 'Deems Taylor, Walt Disney, Julietta Novis, Leopold Stokowski', 'G', 'Walt Disney''s timeless masterpiece is an extravaganza of sight and sound! See the music come to life, hear the pictures burst into song and experience the excitement that is Fantasia over and over again.', 'Walt Disney''s timeless masterpiece is an extravaganza of sight and sound! See the music come to life, hear the pictures burst into song and experience the excitement that is Fantasia over and over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m9njnidjR0syG2gpVPVgcEMB2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756'),
  ('714756590670850638', 'Fantasia', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Horace Wong Wing-Hang, Law Wing-Cheong', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Au Kin-Yee, Jonathan Li Tsz-Chun', 'Cecilia Cheung, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Louis Koo, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Gillian Chung', null, 'In Hong Kong 1969, private investigation agency boss Man is investigating an extra marital case. With his two employees, the smart looking idiot Kit and the Hong Kong Columbia Radio Night School graduate Pufferfish, he follows the target Lascar Row. The trio stumbles into an antique shop and breaks many antiques in the store. The cheap Man force Kit and Pufferfish to take responsibility. Kit wisely makes Pufferfish take sole responsibility. The dumb Pufferfish helpless buys the pile of shattered antiques with his own money. In the pieces he finds a broken magic lamp...', 'In Hong Kong 1969, private investigation agency boss Man is investigating an extra marital case. With his two employees, the smart looking idiot Kit and the Hong Kong Columbia Radio Night School graduate Pufferfish, he follows the target Lascar Row. The trio stumbles into an antique shop and breaks many antiques in the store. The cheap Man force Kit and Pufferfish to take responsibility. Kit wisely makes Pufferfish take sole responsibility. The dumb Pufferfish helpless buys the pile of shattered antiques with his own money. In the pieces he finds a broken magic lamp...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRN1gkDKG0RqMtn6lq5oVxyiehM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45430'),
  ('1139035368939991305', 'Fantasia 2000', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'James Algar, Gaëtan Brizzi, Paul Brizzi', 'David Reynolds, Don Hahn, Irene Mecchi', 'Steve Martin, Itzhak Perlman, Quincy Jones, Bette Midler, James Earl Jones, Penn Jillette, Teller, James Levine', 'G', 'Blending lively music and brilliant animation, this sequel to the original ''Fantasia'' restores ''The Sorcerer''s Apprentice'' and adds seven new shorts.', 'Blending lively music and brilliant animation, this sequel to the original ''Fantasia'' restores ''The Sorcerer''s Apprentice'' and adds seven new shorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rwAtUaKEK48CPUijVfVU0IPKPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49948'),
  ('65404936306388626', 'Fantasia Among the Squares', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Pirès, Edmond Richard', null, 'Lino Ventura, Jean Yanne, Mireille Darc, Jacques Dufilho, Georges Beller, Rufus, Georges Demestre, Nanni Loy', null, 'Sagamore Noonan lives in seclusion on a farm in Alabama, where he distills moonshine during Prohibition. He receives a visit from his brother Doc Noonan and his son Billy. A young stripper and her gangster boyfriend come to disturb their peace.', 'Sagamore Noonan lives in seclusion on a farm in Alabama, where he distills moonshine during Prohibition. He receives a visit from his brother Doc Noonan and his son Billy. A young stripper and her gangster boyfriend come to disturb their peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8T8MijXkm0l1UMZWwiC8k22AvL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18097'),
  ('203481040587111374', 'Fantasías', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jorge Araujo, Sergio Ulloa', null, 'Mónica Dionne, Alexis Ayala, Manuel Ojeda, Luis Felipe Tovar, Patricia Muñoz, Magi Avila, Silvia Mariscal, Cecilia Romo', null, 'The movie tells the story of a middle-class couple with two teenage children and a boring sex life, in search of new experiences- first with their sexy maid. Later with the advice of an older female friend who has swinger lifestyle with her husband, they decide to explore the possibility of sparking fresh passion by hooking up with a swinger couple. But then, problems arrive when they start to get blackmailed by the male swinger, who wants money to not show some private pictures of the wife. Written by lament', 'The movie tells the story of a middle-class couple with two teenage children and a boring sex life, in search of new experiences- first with their sexy maid. Later with the advice of an older female friend who has swinger lifestyle with her husband, they decide to explore the possibility of sparking fresh passion by hooking up with a swinger couple. But then, problems arrive when they start to get blackmailed by the male swinger, who wants money to not show some private pictures of the wife. Written by lament', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4108x5C7aXu5dJPY6ujZjRpQOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108299'),
  ('1003824536809618781', 'Fantasies', 1981, 'Drama', 'John Derek, Panos Roussos', 'John Derek', 'Peter Hooten, Bo Derek, Anna Alexiadis, Faidon Georgitsis, Nikos Pashalidis, Kostas Baladimas', null, 'Set on a lush Greek island, the story concerns a sister and brother, who return home after years abroad. Falling under the island''s erotic spell, the girl and boy discover that their love goes beyond filial...', 'Set on a lush Greek island, the story concerns a sister and brother, who return home after years abroad. Falling under the island''s erotic spell, the girl and boy discover that their love goes beyond filial...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b48g8uEZLqtoEgMYmJTzPVvBVtr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194697'),
  ('421181165103921743', 'Fantasies', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alexis Kavyrchine, Stéphane Foenkinos, David Foenkinos', 'David Foenkinos, Stéphane Foenkinos', 'Ramzy Bedia, Nicolas Bedos, Monica Bellucci, Carole Bouquet, Suzanne Clément, Joséphine de Meaux, William Lebghil, Karin Viard', null, 'Faced with their fantasies, six couples try to explore the hidden sides of their intimate life. Six questions on access to pleasure. From role play to abstinence, via exhibition, six separate stories with the same questioning of desire today in the center.', 'Faced with their fantasies, six couples try to explore the hidden sides of their intimate life. Six questions on access to pleasure. From role play to abstinence, via exhibition, six separate stories with the same questioning of desire today in the center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTAuejHywUWi3jrT3FPUT38nOnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768127'),
  ('318839439068566017', 'Fantasm', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Richard Franklin', 'Ross Dimsey', 'Dee Dee Levitt, Maria Arnold, William Margold, Rene Bond, Con Covert, Mara Lutra, Uschi Digard, John Holmes', null, 'Jurgen Noetafreud is a professor of the psyche of human sexuality, who introduces 10 short segments from his case studies of the most common female sexual fantasies.', 'Jurgen Noetafreud is a professor of the psyche of human sexuality, who introduces 10 short segments from his case studies of the most common female sexual fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvGT2cOSYUpyetcER3ggQoMxcFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30829'),
  ('372997365304640153', 'Fantasm Comes Again', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Colin Eggleston', 'Ross Dimsey', 'Uschi Digard, Cheryl Smith, Serena, William Margold, Rick Cassidy, Con Covert, Candy Samples, Brenda Fogarty', 'NR', 'Libbie is assigned to her paper''s sexual advice column, "Dear Collete". She is taking over the job of Harry a crusty old journalist who shows her the pro''s and cons of the job while running on a tight deadline to get the column finished for the morning''s paper. During the course of the evening they reply to a wide variety of sexual experiences submitted by the readers, some these include, sex in a threesome at a drive-in theatre, sex in a gymnasium, and sex in a library where the "Silence Please" sign gives the male librarian an advantage over the female readers.', 'Libbie is assigned to her paper''s sexual advice column, "Dear Collete". She is taking over the job of Harry a crusty old journalist who shows her the pro''s and cons of the job while running on a tight deadline to get the column finished for the morning''s paper. During the course of the evening they reply to a wide variety of sexual experiences submitted by the readers, some these include, sex in a threesome at a drive-in theatre, sex in a gymnasium, and sex in a library where the "Silence Please" sign gives the male librarian an advantage over the female readers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85QcmpWio9AuitrqkcwoZnGsgPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30830'),
  ('788710791832126183', 'Fantasma', 2007, 'Drama', 'Lisandro Alonso, Delfina Castagnino, Lucio Bonelli', 'Lisandro Alonso', 'Argentino Vargas, Misael Saavedra', null, 'A solitary man''s only pastime is to go to a movie theatre, the Teatro San Martín, on Corrientes Avenue in Buenos Aires. There he exorcises his ghosts.', 'A solitary man''s only pastime is to go to a movie theatre, the Teatro San Martín, on Corrientes Avenue in Buenos Aires. There he exorcises his ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ncw6smQzlnXaaLcQzyPf444O3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114246'),
  ('623496822260664767', 'Fantasmagorie', 1908, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Émile Cohl', 'Émile Cohl', null, null, 'An animated film by French auteur Émile Cohl, one of the earliest examples of hand-drawn film animation. Drawing inspiration from J. Stuart Blackton and the Incoherents of club Hydropathes, the film, with all its wild transformations, sees our protagonist materialize a movie theatre, meet an elephant and escape from jail; A morphing, stream-of-consciousness delight.', 'An animated film by French auteur Émile Cohl, one of the earliest examples of hand-drawn film animation. Drawing inspiration from J. Stuart Blackton and the Incoherents of club Hydropathes, the film, with all its wild transformations, sees our protagonist materialize a movie theatre, meet an elephant and escape from jail; A morphing, stream-of-consciousness delight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDlC9FuKEZgpz9rRPNHZO22ARZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85221'),
  ('1058055107883123717', 'Fantasme', 2020, 'Romance', 'Eléonore Costes', 'Eléonore Costes', 'Audrey Pirault, Sébastien Chassagne, Adrien Ménielle, Anaïs Fabre, Louis Vasquez, Eléonore Costes, Sabine Pakora, Sandy Lobry', null, 'We all have ghosts (or cosmonauts) in our lives.', 'We all have ghosts (or cosmonauts) in our lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k08cSNCJPAxdiupFoVBbMMSVBUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:780836'),
  ('2080736314637259', 'Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them', 2016, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'David Yates, Philippe Rousselot, Josh Robertson', 'J.K. Rowling', 'Eddie Redmayne, Katherine Waterston, Dan Fogler, Alison Sudol, Colin Farrell, Jon Voight, Ron Perlman, Johnny Depp', 'PG-13', 'In 1926, Newt Scamander arrives at the Magical Congress of the United States of America with a magically expanded briefcase, which houses a number of dangerous creatures and their habitats. When the creatures escape from the briefcase, it sends the American wizarding authorities after Newt, and threatens to strain even further the state of magical and non-magical relations.', 'In 1926, Newt Scamander arrives at the Magical Congress of the United States of America with a magically expanded briefcase, which houses a number of dangerous creatures and their habitats. When the creatures escape from the briefcase, it sends the American wizarding authorities after Newt, and threatens to strain even further the state of magical and non-magical relations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLsaFKExQt05yqjoAvKsmOMYvJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259316'),
  ('717226409913308636', 'Fantastic Beasts: A Natural History', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Chris Chapman, Adam White', null, 'Stephen Fry, J.K. Rowling, Christian Manz', null, 'Stephen Fry embarks on a journey to discover the stories behind some of the world''s most fantastic beasts that have inspired myths and legends in history, story-telling and film.', 'Stephen Fry embarks on a journey to discover the stories behind some of the world''s most fantastic beasts that have inspired myths and legends in history, story-telling and film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcdlsiw5fIVteprvq8a6VyRsFHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662244'),
  ('821501064289239061', 'Fantastic Beasts: The Crimes of Grindelwald', 2018, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'David Yates, Philippe Rousselot, Stephen Woolfenden', 'J.K. Rowling', 'Eddie Redmayne, Katherine Waterston, Dan Fogler, Alison Sudol, Johnny Depp, Jude Law, Ezra Miller, Zoë Kravitz', 'PG-13', 'Gellert Grindelwald has escaped imprisonment and has begun gathering followers to his cause—elevating wizards above all non-magical beings. The only one capable of putting a stop to him is the wizard he once called his closest friend, Albus Dumbledore. However, Dumbledore will need to seek help from the wizard who had thwarted Grindelwald once before, his former student Newt Scamander, who agrees to help, unaware of the dangers that lie ahead. Lines are drawn as love and loyalty are tested, even among the truest friends and family, in an increasingly divided wizarding world.', 'Gellert Grindelwald has escaped imprisonment and has begun gathering followers to his cause—elevating wizards above all non-magical beings. The only one capable of putting a stop to him is the wizard he once called his closest friend, Albus Dumbledore. However, Dumbledore will need to seek help from the wizard who had thwarted Grindelwald once before, his former student Newt Scamander, who agrees to help, unaware of the dangers that lie ahead. Lines are drawn as love and loyalty are tested, even among the truest friends and family, in an increasingly divided wizarding world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMMrl8fD9gRCFJvsx0SuFwkEOop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338952'),
  ('829520239652230620', 'Fantastic Beasts: The Secrets of Dumbledore', 2022, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Stephen Woolfenden, Tim Dutton, Josh Robertson', 'J.K. Rowling, Steve Kloves', 'Eddie Redmayne, Jude Law, Mads Mikkelsen, Ezra Miller, Dan Fogler, Alison Sudol, Callum Turner, Jessica Williams', 'PG-13', 'Professor Albus Dumbledore knows the powerful, dark wizard Gellert Grindelwald is moving to seize control of the wizarding world. Unable to stop him alone, he entrusts magizoologist Newt Scamander to lead an intrepid team of wizards and witches. They soon encounter an array of old and new beasts as they clash with Grindelwald''s growing legion of followers.', 'Professor Albus Dumbledore knows the powerful, dark wizard Gellert Grindelwald is moving to seize control of the wizarding world. Unable to stop him alone, he entrusts magizoologist Newt Scamander to lead an intrepid team of wizards and witches. They soon encounter an array of old and new beasts as they clash with Grindelwald''s growing legion of followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3c5GNLB4yRSLBby0trHoA1DSQxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338953'),
  ('536260666644091421', 'Fantastic Four', 2005, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Oliver Wood, Tim Story, Shepherd Frankel', 'Mark Frost, Michael France', 'Ioan Gruffudd, Jessica Alba, Chris Evans, Michael Chiklis, Julian McMahon, Hamish Linklater, Kerry Washington, Laurie Holden', 'PG-13', 'During a space voyage, four scientists are altered by cosmic rays: Reed Richards gains the ability to stretch his body; Sue Storm can become invisible; Johnny Storm controls fire; and Ben Grimm is turned into a super-strong … thing. Together, these "Fantastic Four" must now thwart the evil plans of Dr. Doom and save the world from certain destruction.', 'During a space voyage, four scientists are altered by cosmic rays: Reed Richards gains the ability to stretch his body; Sue Storm can become invisible; Johnny Storm controls fire; and Ben Grimm is turned into a super-strong … thing. Together, these "Fantastic Four" must now thwart the evil plans of Dr. Doom and save the world from certain destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HLQLILZLhDQWO6JDpvY6XJLH75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9738'),
  ('254967976250182513', 'Fantastic Four', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Matthew Jensen, Josh Trank, Fabiano Petroni', 'Jeremy Slater, Simon Kinberg, Josh Trank', 'Miles Teller, Michael B. Jordan, Kate Mara, Jamie Bell, Toby Kebbell, Reg E. Cathey, Tim Blake Nelson, Tim Heidecker', 'PG-13', 'Four young outsiders teleport to a dangerous universe, which alters their physical form in shocking ways. Their lives irrevocably upended, the team must learn to harness their daunting new abilities and work together to save Earth from a former friend turned enemy.', 'Four young outsiders teleport to a dangerous universe, which alters their physical form in shocking ways. Their lives irrevocably upended, the team must learn to harness their daunting new abilities and work together to save Earth from a former friend turned enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDroz5qSlP8xZ6tOpeYoPkBvKyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166424'),
  ('974601542285009304', 'Fantastic Four: Rise of the Silver Surfer', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Larry Blanford, Tim Story, Daniel T. Dorrance', 'Don Payne, Mark Frost', 'Ioan Gruffudd, Jessica Alba, Chris Evans, Michael Chiklis, Julian McMahon, Laurence Fishburne, Doug Jones, Kerry Washington', 'PG', 'The Fantastic Four return to the big screen as a new and all powerful enemy threatens the Earth. The seemingly unstoppable ''Silver Surfer'', but all is not what it seems and there are old and new enemies that pose a greater threat than the intrepid superheroes realize.', 'The Fantastic Four return to the big screen as a new and all powerful enemy threatens the Earth. The seemingly unstoppable ''Silver Surfer'', but all is not what it seems and there are old and new enemies that pose a greater threat than the intrepid superheroes realize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rxTraSO45jbvTrCeSvJ6RmOu1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1979'),
  ('845933857367068892', 'Fantastic Fungi', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Louie Schwartzberg', 'Mark Monroe', 'Brie Larson, Paul Stamets, Michael Pollan, Roland Griffiths, Andrew Weil, Mary P. Cosmiano', 'NR', 'A vivid journey into the mysterious subterranean world of mycelium and its fruit— the mushroom. A story that begins 3.5 billion years ago, fungi makes the soil that supports life, connecting vast systems of roots from plants and trees all over the planet, like an underground Internet. Through the eyes of renowned mycologist Paul Stamets, professor of forest ecology Suzanne Simard, best selling author Michael Pollan, food naturalist Eugenia Bone and others, we experience the power, beauty and complexity of the fungi kingdom.', 'A vivid journey into the mysterious subterranean world of mycelium and its fruit— the mushroom. A story that begins 3.5 billion years ago, fungi makes the soil that supports life, connecting vast systems of roots from plants and trees all over the planet, like an underground Internet. Through the eyes of renowned mycologist Paul Stamets, professor of forest ecology Suzanne Simard, best selling author Michael Pollan, food naturalist Eugenia Bone and others, we experience the power, beauty and complexity of the fungi kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giIGfFqirPk3I2azp8Ow98oOnzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612654'),
  ('966820536494530073', 'Fantastic Mr. Fox', 2009, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Wes Anderson, Mark Gustafson, Dan Pascall', 'Noah Baumbach, Wes Anderson', 'George Clooney, Robin Hurlstone, Meryl Streep, Jason Schwartzman, Eric Chase Anderson, Wallace Wolodarsky, Willem Dafoe, Hugo Guinness', 'PG', 'The Fantastic Mr. Fox, bored with his current life, plans a heist against the three local farmers. The farmers, tired of sharing their chickens with the sly fox, seek revenge against him and his family.', 'The Fantastic Mr. Fox, bored with his current life, plans a heist against the three local farmers. The farmers, tired of sharing their chickens with the sly fox, seek revenge against him and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euZyZb6iGreujYKrGyZHRddhUYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10315'),
  ('323767864448664740', 'Fantastic Night', 1942, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Marcel L''Herbier, Pierre Montazel', 'Louis Chavance', 'Fernand Gravey, Micheline Presle, Saturnin Fabre, Charles Granval, Bernard Blier, Marcel Lévesque, Christiane Nère, Jean Parédès', null, 'Denis, a poor student in philosophy, works as a night porter in the Paris market of Les Halles in order to pay for his studies. Constantly weary, he falls asleep and dreams of a beautiful girl in white, Irène, with whom he falls in love.', 'Denis, a poor student in philosophy, works as a night porter in the Paris market of Les Halles in order to pay for his studies. Constantly weary, he falls asleep and dreams of a beautiful girl in white, Irène, with whom he falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irJXPfqu6TesMb8ckbyD474ifij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67455'),
  ('70395986764339357', 'Fantastic Return to Oz', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Fedor Dmitriev', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Yekaterina Gorokhovskaya, Aleksandr Bykovsky, Dmitry Vysotsky, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Andrey Levin, Yuliya Rudina, Mariya Tsvetkova-Ovsyannikova', null, 'A year to the day after Dorothy and the people of the Emerald City defeated Urfin Jus, the villain is trying to exact his revenge. To command the army of Carraci, however, Urfin needs not only the magic book, but also Dorothy’s silver slippers. The slippers are safely hidden away in Dorothy’s house. Unfortunately, Dorothy’s guest, Tim, is overcome by curiosity and picks up the shoes, accidentally transporting himself, Dorothy and the slippers to the Land of Oz. The Emerald City and its citizens are in danger once again.', 'A year to the day after Dorothy and the people of the Emerald City defeated Urfin Jus, the villain is trying to exact his revenge. To command the army of Carraci, however, Urfin needs not only the magic book, but also Dorothy’s silver slippers. The slippers are safely hidden away in Dorothy’s house. Unfortunately, Dorothy’s guest, Tim, is overcome by curiosity and picks up the shoes, accidentally transporting himself, Dorothy and the slippers to the Land of Oz. The Emerald City and its citizens are in danger once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15OvRH9eYDsMtkUvJ6GUUaPX5Zn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518596'),
  ('247846409913522730', 'Fantastic Voyage', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Richard Fleischer, Ernest Laszlo, Ad Schaumer', 'Harry Kleiner', 'Stephen Boyd, Raquel Welch, Edmond O''Brien, Donald Pleasence, Arthur O''Connell, William Redfield, Arthur Kennedy, Jean Del Val', 'PG', 'In order to save an assassinated scientist, a submarine and its crew are shrunk to microscopic size and injected into his bloodstream.', 'In order to save an assassinated scientist, a submarine and its crew are shrunk to microscopic size and injected into his bloodstream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEWWLe1Lrk58gle3IKCnjBScfzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2161'),
  ('493554910464129270', 'Fantastica: A Boonie Bears Adventure', 2017, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Action', 'Ding Liang, Yongchang Lin, Huida Lin', 'Ding Liang, Qin Wan', 'Tan Xiao, Ruke Zhang, Zhang Wei, Zhang Bingjun, Joseph Zeng, Laure Shang, Chunlai Bao, Sun Jianhong', null, 'Boonie bears and Bald Qiang work together with secret primitive girl to smash a conspiracy to destroy old-growth forest.', 'Boonie bears and Bald Qiang work together with secret primitive girl to smash a conspiracy to destroy old-growth forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgmfCGzVViXqW02Pt29ylUFOP8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462927'),
  ('212263102695242717', 'Fantastique', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Marjolijn Prins, Johan Legraie', 'Marjolijn Prins', 'Fanta Turpin', null, 'A 14-year-old contortionist in Guinea balances caring for her sick mother and school with her dream of touring with a circus. As pressures mount, she questions her path and searches for her true identity.', 'A 14-year-old contortionist in Guinea balances caring for her sick mother and school with her dream of touring with a circus. As pressures mount, she questions her path and searches for her true identity.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwVignVF3vFCmQRFkGpWyXw2wev3.jpg', 'plex:movie:fantastique-2026'),
  ('1097286799109692108', 'Fantasy Football Ruined Our Lives', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Alessio Maria Federici, Manfredo Archinto, Armen Mailyan', 'Giulio Carrieri, Michele Bertini Malgarini', 'Giacomo Ferrara, Silvia D''Amico, Enrico Borello, Francesco Russo, Antonio Bannò, Caterina Guzzanti, Francesco Giordano, Giacomo Bottoni', null, 'When a member of their fantasy football league vanishes on his wedding day, a motley group of friends recount the lead-up to his chaotic bachelor party.', 'When a member of their fantasy football league vanishes on his wedding day, a motley group of friends recount the lead-up to his chaotic bachelor party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3T9jjdLjnhMzuFvmWImlVKiIrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1500691'),
  ('576995229524396062', 'Fantasy Island', 2020, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'James Moran, Dean Hudson, Marc Newland', 'Jillian Jacobs, Jeff Wadlow, Christopher Roach', 'Michael Peña, Maggie Q, Lucy Hale, Michael Rooker, Austin Stowell, Jimmy O. Yang, Portia Doubleday, Charlotte McKinney', 'PG-13', 'A group of contest winners arrive at an island hotel to live out their dreams, only to find themselves trapped in nightmare scenarios.', 'A group of contest winners arrive at an island hotel to live out their dreams, only to find themselves trapped in nightmare scenarios.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZMrZGGW65ePWIgRn1260nA1uUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539537'),
  ('30911503227246606', 'Fantasy Life', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matthew Shear, Conor Murphy, Douglas Aibel, Stephanie Holbrook', 'Matthew Shear', 'Alessandro Nivola, Judd Hirsch, Bob Balaban, Andrea Martin, Zosia Mamet', 'R', 'An anxious law school dropout (Matthew Shear) stumbles into a job babysitting his psychiatrist''s three granddaughters and falls for the girls'' mother (Amanda Peet), an actress in a rocky marriage. A smart, New York-set romantic comedy co-starring Alessandro Nivola, Judd Hirsch, Bob Balaban, Andrea Martin, Zosia Mamet, and Holland Taylor. Winner of the SXSW Narrative Feature Audience Award.', 'An anxious law school dropout (Matthew Shear) stumbles into a job babysitting his psychiatrist''s three granddaughters and falls for the girls'' mother (Amanda Peet), an actress in a rocky marriage. A smart, New York-set romantic comedy co-starring Alessandro Nivola, Judd Hirsch, Bob Balaban, Andrea Martin, Zosia Mamet, and Holland Taylor. Winner of the SXSW Narrative Feature Audience Award.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fe0qtdCm7TJGRfMv0tmdP8DsOy3U.jpg', 'plex:movie:fantasy-life-2026'),
  ('226248634926319722', 'Fantasy Magician', 2020, 'Drama, Action', 'Xiang Qiuliang, Xiang Hesheng', 'Yang Bingjia', 'He Peng, Lin Yanrou, Eddy Ko Hung, Yue Xin, Wang Hongqian, Sun Jiaolong, Ariel Ann, Xu Shaohang', null, 'Based on the 2017 movie "The Thousand Faces of Dunjia". Zhou Tong, a constable in Luosha Town, has been obsessed with Wuyin Clan since childhood. He lived a peaceful life together with Zhou Shouyi, the magistrate of Luosha Town. Unexpectedly, they were framed by Jia Ming, the son of a squire in the township, and his father, Jia Youwei. Zhou Tong''s father was wronged and jailed. Zhou Tong escaped fortunately. On the way, he met an elder of the Wuyin Clan who passed on the "Jia" in his body to Zhou Tong. Zhou Tong wanted to rescue his father with the power of "Jia", but could only watch his father be killed by the villain Bifang.', 'Based on the 2017 movie "The Thousand Faces of Dunjia". Zhou Tong, a constable in Luosha Town, has been obsessed with Wuyin Clan since childhood. He lived a peaceful life together with Zhou Shouyi, the magistrate of Luosha Town. Unexpectedly, they were framed by Jia Ming, the son of a squire in the township, and his father, Jia Youwei. Zhou Tong''s father was wronged and jailed. Zhou Tong escaped fortunately. On the way, he met an elder of the Wuyin Clan who passed on the "Jia" in his body to Zhou Tong. Zhou Tong wanted to rescue his father with the power of "Jia", but could only watch his father be killed by the villain Bifang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38nsHaKT2TPQjMjrYuWOlvSwzcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684780'),
  ('112711548712474910', 'Fantasy Mission Force', 1983, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Kevin Chu, Huang Tian-Ru, Tiu Lim-Hung', 'Wei Hsin', 'Jackie Chan, Brigitte Lin, Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Jimmy Wang Yu, Hsu Pu-Liao, Fang Cheng, Sun Yueh, David Tao', 'NR', 'A force of loners and fighters is put together to try and rescue the generals and save the war effort with the promise of gold and pardons of past crimes.', 'A force of loners and fighters is put together to try and rescue the generals and save the war effort with the promise of gold and pardons of past crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irKjRoSKk8cywZ9UbYfFF5kmJrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38425'),
  ('435147507472406409', 'Fantasy of the Girls', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ahn Jeong-min, Jeon Byeong-yun, Kim Jong-jin', 'Ahn Jeong-min', 'Roh Jeong-eui, Cho Soo-hyang, Kwon Na-ra, Cho Soo-ha, Cho Byeong-kyu, Park Soo-yeon, Yoo Chung-eun, Kim Jung-pal', null, 'Upon helping her friend audition for their all-girls high school''s production of Romeo & Juliet, freshman Sun-wha is unexpectedly cast as Juliet. To her surprise Romeo is played by the über-cool and stunning senior Ha-nam, whom all the girls seem to have a crush on. As the two would-be thespians grow closer, Ha-nam takes Sun-wha under her wing in more ways than one. However this sparks the jealousy of the play''s director, Su-yeon, whom, it turns out, is more than friends with Ha-nam.', 'Upon helping her friend audition for their all-girls high school''s production of Romeo & Juliet, freshman Sun-wha is unexpectedly cast as Juliet. To her surprise Romeo is played by the über-cool and stunning senior Ha-nam, whom all the girls seem to have a crush on. As the two would-be thespians grow closer, Ha-nam takes Sun-wha under her wing in more ways than one. However this sparks the jealousy of the play''s director, Su-yeon, whom, it turns out, is more than friends with Ha-nam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/am7C4K6cWMhfqmkEsOvXUg0zFpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462698'),
  ('368476025837914108', 'Fantasy of Youth', 2020, 'Drama', 'Jaume Sucarrats, Bernat Eguiluz', 'Jaume Sucarrats', 'Cinta Hervàs, Genís Casals, Aleix Delgado, Maria Martos Alba, Rubén Pino, Claire Peteiro, Noa Rodríguez, Judith Vidal', null, 'Summer is approaching, which means the end of classes and the last exams, but Aina has only one thing on her mind: Pol, her first love. Aina is too reserved to take the step and spends her days hoping that Pol will be the one to dare. But that day never comes. Seeing that time passes and that the boy does not respond, Aina is willing to do anything to get his attention. So she puts aside her studies, goes to all the parties and, above all, lives surrounded by music and poetry while waiting for what she wants to happen.', 'Summer is approaching, which means the end of classes and the last exams, but Aina has only one thing on her mind: Pol, her first love. Aina is too reserved to take the step and spends her days hoping that Pol will be the one to dare. But that day never comes. Seeing that time passes and that the boy does not respond, Aina is willing to do anything to get his attention. So she puts aside her studies, goes to all the parties and, above all, lives surrounded by music and poetry while waiting for what she wants to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BJY6LepBIfq8S5kW1EPew7vO66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946775'),
  ('163515378231279023', 'Fantasy: Mariah Carey at Madison Square Garden', 1995, 'Music', 'Lawrence Jordan', null, 'Mariah Carey', null, '"Fantasy: Mariah Carey at Madison Square Garden" is Mariah Carey''s fourth DVD/home video release. It presents Carey performing live at the Madison Square Garden on October 10, 1995. The home video was originally released in early 1996, and the DVD was released in late 2004. It was distributed by Columbia Pictures.', '"Fantasy: Mariah Carey at Madison Square Garden" is Mariah Carey''s fourth DVD/home video release. It presents Carey performing live at the Madison Square Garden on October 10, 1995. The home video was originally released in early 1996, and the DVD was released in late 2004. It was distributed by Columbia Pictures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4V1QEeBjjU9mh07OkgNljhgOQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35043'),
  ('8313327255412967', 'Fante-Anne', 1920, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Rasmus Breistein, Gunnar Nilsen-Vig', 'Rasmus Breistein', 'Aasta Nielsen, Einar Tveito, Lars Tvinde, Johanne Bruhn, Dagmar Myhrvold, Henny Skjønberg, Kristine Ullmo, Magnus Falkberget', null, 'The story of an orphaned girl brought up by the Storlein family. Young Anne (Asta Nielsen) is brought as an infant to the Storlein farm by her mother, who has been traveling and is in need of a rest. The two are turned away at the door, and the mother takes her young daughter to the barn to sleep. The farmhand Jon discovers them in the morning but the mother has not made it through the night, so young Anne is taken in and raised by the family.', 'The story of an orphaned girl brought up by the Storlein family. Young Anne (Asta Nielsen) is brought as an infant to the Storlein farm by her mother, who has been traveling and is in need of a rest. The two are turned away at the door, and the mother takes her young daughter to the barn to sleep. The farmhand Jon discovers them in the morning but the mother has not made it through the night, so young Anne is taken in and raised by the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FJnH37VYc8lCfZu7IlnrUcjEBU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175216'),
  ('307302827756563059', 'Fantom Kiler 2', 1999, 'Horror, Crime', 'Roman Nowicki', null, 'Eliza Borecka, Andrej Jass, Magda Szymborska, Katarzyna Zelnik', null, 'One hooker found hanging in a meat van, another is sawed in half while a policewoman is mercilessly slashed to pieces. A detective, haunted by his lack of results, vents his frustration by abusing the same women who are being preyed upon by the mysterious killer. For the police and the hookers of this small east European town, there seems to be no end to the sadistic nightmare.', 'One hooker found hanging in a meat van, another is sawed in half while a policewoman is mercilessly slashed to pieces. A detective, haunted by his lack of results, vents his frustration by abusing the same women who are being preyed upon by the mysterious killer. For the police and the hookers of this small east European town, there seems to be no end to the sadistic nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNF1MZzhJeOVSoFlKw7IoB4AT2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157164'),
  ('554066440710526227', 'Fantomas', 1964, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure', 'Marcel Grignon, André Hunebelle, Jacques Besnard', 'Pierre Foucaud, Jean Halain', 'Jean Marais, Louis de Funès, Mylène Demongeot, Jacques Dynam, Robert Dalban, Marie-Hélène Arnaud, Anne-Marie Peysson, Christian Toma', 'NR', 'Fantômas is a man of many disguises. He uses maquillage as a weapon. He can impersonate anyone using an array of masks and can create endless confusion by constantly changing his appearance.', 'Fantômas is a man of many disguises. He uses maquillage as a weapon. He can impersonate anyone using an array of masks and can create endless confusion by constantly changing his appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tw1dTJgyCb9ZEpMBPZnmB0tsg4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1871'),
  ('472433543191851920', 'Fantômas', 1913, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Louis Feuillade, Georges Guérin', 'Louis Feuillade', 'René Navarre, Edmund Breon, Georges Melchior, Renée Carl, Fabienne Fabrèges, Armand Dutertre, André Luguet, Yvette Andréyor', null, 'A French silent film serial which follows the exploits of the archvillain Fantômas, who commits crimes while eluding Inspector Juve''s tireless persecution.', 'A French silent film serial which follows the exploits of the archvillain Fantômas, who commits crimes while eluding Inspector Juve''s tireless persecution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aw8uIA5NnPLckS9pg3M8DgPLwB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319287'),
  ('384884430978835851', 'Fantomas Unleashed', 1965, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure, Fantasy', 'André Hunebelle, Marcel Grignon, Jacques Besnard', 'Jean Halain, Pierre Foucaud', 'Jean Marais, Louis de Funès, Mylène Demongeot, Jacques Dynam, Robert Dalban, Albert Dagnant, Christian Toma, Michel Duplaix', null, 'In the second episode of the trilogy Fantômas kidnaps distinguished scientist professor Marchand with the aim to develop a super weapon that will enable him to menace the world. Fantômas is also planning to abduct a second scientist, professor Lefebvre.', 'In the second episode of the trilogy Fantômas kidnaps distinguished scientist professor Marchand with the aim to develop a super weapon that will enable him to menace the world. Fantômas is also planning to abduct a second scientist, professor Lefebvre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtMGO5JyORkd1CF7e6pyn47dITm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1870'),
  ('981313280753731509', 'Fantomas vs. Scotland Yard', 1967, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure, Fantasy', 'André Hunebelle, Marcel Grignon', 'Pierre Foucaud, Jean Halain', 'Jean Marais, Louis de Funès, Mylène Demongeot, Françoise Christophe, Jean-Roger Caussimon, Robert Dalban, André Dumas, Max Montavon', null, 'In the third and final episode of the trilogy, Fantômas imposes a head tax on the rich, threatening to kill those who do not comply.', 'In the third and final episode of the trilogy, Fantômas imposes a head tax on the rich, threatening to kill those who do not comply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrs0leNyQwVbUOoXCnfMf3Bix4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1875'),
