  ('599700975979716699', 'Fantozzi Retires', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Giacomo Lesina, Sergio D''Offizi', 'Paolo Villaggio, Neri Parenti, Piero De Bernardi', 'Paolo Villaggio, Milena Vukotić, Gigi Reder, Anna Mazzamauro, Plinio Fernando, Paul Müller, Antonio Allocca, Pino Ferrara', null, 'After thirty years in the big corporation, Ugo Fantozzi retires. Suddenly, he needs things to do in everyday life and he tries a number of activities: helping Pina shopping; babysitting grand-daughter Uga; a trip to Venice; learning golf. He then fakes documents to get a new job, but in the end he becomes a hypochondriac and doesn''t even take a long-awaited chance with Miss Silvani.', 'After thirty years in the big corporation, Ugo Fantozzi retires. Suddenly, he needs things to do in everyday life and he tries a number of activities: helping Pina shopping; babysitting grand-daughter Uga; a trip to Venice; learning golf. He then fakes documents to get a new job, but in the end he becomes a hypochondriac and doesn''t even take a long-awaited chance with Miss Silvani.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9FTwNcdWQX5xzoIVtYUQHSR99p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41664'),
  ('237643471215186771', 'Fantozzi Still Suffers', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Marina Mattoli, Alberto Spagnoli', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Paolo Villaggio', 'Paolo Villaggio, Milena Vukotić, Plinio Fernando, Gigi Reder, Anna Mazzamauro, Riccardo Garrone, Ugo Bologna, Mario Pedone', null, 'After a hard day at work and a condominium-board meeting, accountant Ugo Fantozzi goes on a trip with his family. Unfortunately, he will face a nasty surprise upon his return.', 'After a hard day at work and a condominium-board meeting, accountant Ugo Fantozzi goes on a trip with his family. Unfortunately, he will face a nasty surprise upon his return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MfDUCcf8KUgFSvz8eI2lW3bp2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26285'),
  ('723041757207679294', 'Fantozzi The Return', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Maria Pia Rocco, Alessandro D''Eva', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Alessandro Bencivenni', 'Paolo Villaggio, Milena Vukotić, Gigi Reder, Maria Cristina Maccà, Maurizio Mattioli, Anna Mazzamauro, Antonio Allocca, Sergio Gibello', null, 'Ugo Fantozzi has been ejected from Heaven and is sent back to Earth for a short period of time until the staff in Heaven can get Fantozzi a place there. Fantozzi goes through a variety of unfortunate experiences, such as rescuing his retro punk granddaughter Uga, and having to pay a vast telephone bill due to frequent chat line conversations. He ends up getting arrested instead of his ex-boss, who was originally charged with corruption. Just as he is about to enjoy the World Cup Final with Italy, he is called back into Heaven. Can he find peace once again?', 'Ugo Fantozzi has been ejected from Heaven and is sent back to Earth for a short period of time until the staff in Heaven can get Fantozzi a place there. Fantozzi goes through a variety of unfortunate experiences, such as rescuing his retro punk granddaughter Uga, and having to pay a vast telephone bill due to frequent chat line conversations. He ends up getting arrested instead of his ex-boss, who was originally charged with corruption. Just as he is about to enjoy the World Cup Final with Italy, he is called back into Heaven. Can he find peace once again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sL0Ay3GQZRup2xOPkL63qujgzgh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41668'),
  ('724606501362072120', 'Fantozzi to the Rescue', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Maria Pia Rocco, Alessandro D''Eva', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Paolo Villaggio, Domenico Saverni', 'Paolo Villaggio, Milena Vukotić, Gigi Reder, Plinio Fernando, Anna Mazzamauro, Luigi Petrucci, Paul Müller, Silvia Annichiarico', null, 'Fantozzi is now retired but continues to go to the office where it is held up as a fine example of employees intending to do career.', 'Fantozzi is now retired but continues to go to the office where it is held up as a fine example of employees intending to do career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJWsCKzOtDHqoRQlW6S8j5a29eX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37770'),
  ('1145180640766700747', 'Far and Away', 1992, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance, Western', 'Mikael Salomon, Ron Howard, Todd Hallowell', 'Bob Dolman', 'Tom Cruise, Nicole Kidman, Thomas Gibson, Robert Prosky, Barbara Babcock, Cyril Cusack, Eileen Pollock, Colm Meaney', 'PG-13', 'A young free-spirited Irish woman from an affluent Protestant family spontaneously befriends a street-smart commoner cheated by her family’s hostile land takeovers. They escape to America, ready to take advantage of the 19th century Oklahoma land rush.', 'A young free-spirited Irish woman from an affluent Protestant family spontaneously befriends a street-smart commoner cheated by her family’s hostile land takeovers. They escape to America, ready to take advantage of the 19th century Oklahoma land rush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/is80o8p0sCok3UqtnHEE2oyXyad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11259'),
  ('344319477166180593', 'Far Away', 2001, 'Drama', 'André Téchiné, Germain Desmoulins, Bruno Bernard', 'André Téchiné, Faouzi Bensaïdi', 'Stéphane Rideau, Lubna Azabal, Mohamed Hamaidi, Yasmina Reza, Jack Taylor, Gaël Morel, Rachida Brakni, Faouzi Bensaïdi', null, 'Serge is a long distance lorry driver between Morocco andEurope. In Tangier, he tries to reconcile with his former girlfriend, Sarah. She has refused to have anything to do with him since her mother’s death and intends to join her brother in Canada. Serge appeals to Sarah’s protector, a young Arab named Saïd, to allow him to meet up with Sarah, promising in return to smuggle Saïd into Europe...', 'Serge is a long distance lorry driver between Morocco andEurope. In Tangier, he tries to reconcile with his former girlfriend, Sarah. She has refused to have anything to do with him since her mother’s death and intends to join her brother in Canada. Serge appeals to Sarah’s protector, a young Arab named Saïd, to allow him to meet up with Sarah, promising in return to smuggle Saïd into Europe...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UAZsEZEEWj6XKsKFQodbxKYsFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38304'),
  ('1028926474587955877', 'Far Cry', 2008, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann, Iesza Jessica Jordan', 'Michael Roesch, Peter Scheerer', 'Til Schweiger, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Udo Kier, Natalia Avelon, Don S. Davis, Ralf Moeller, Craig Fairbrass, Michael Paré', 'R', 'Jack Carver, a former member of the Special Forces takes the journalist Valerie Cardinal to an Island to visit her uncle Max who is working in a Military complex on the Island. As they arrive Valerie gets captured by the minions of Doctor Krüger. After the destruction of his boat Jack finds out about the true purpose of the Facilities on the Island, which is the creation of genetic soldiers.', 'Jack Carver, a former member of the Special Forces takes the journalist Valerie Cardinal to an Island to visit her uncle Max who is working in a Military complex on the Island. As they arrive Valerie gets captured by the minions of Doctor Krüger. After the destruction of his boat Jack finds out about the true purpose of the Facilities on the Island, which is the creation of genetic soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOMM5tHlY6eBNnRYVttq9dU9Sqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7916'),
  ('1071004531299153631', 'Far Far Away Idol', 2004, 'Music, Comedy, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Simon J. Smith', 'David Lipman', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Antonio Banderas, Simon Cowell, Chris Miller, Larry King, Cody Cameron', 'NR', 'Shrek, Fiona, Donkey, Puss in Boots, and the rest of the Far Far Away Kingdom battle it out in a singing competition.', 'Shrek, Fiona, Donkey, Puss in Boots, and the rest of the Far Far Away Kingdom battle it out in a singing competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dYOQjiUS9WY4AuXYvJG6cMZZmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58508'),
  ('617212034104236907', 'Far from Heaven', 1952, 'Drama', 'Rogelio A. González, Agustín Martínez Solares', 'Gregorio Walerstein, Rogelio A. González', 'Pedro Infante, Marga López, Antonio Aguilar, Irma Dorantes, Eduardo Alcaraz, Arturo Soto Rangel, Gilberto González, Gloria Mestre', null, 'Pedro Gonzalez first gets into trouble as part of a criminal gang and then works honourably to become rich. Money is his undoing allowing him to become a womanizer and drinker, almost losing his wife. Finally he rejoins her, they have a son and he pays for his mistakes.', 'Pedro Gonzalez first gets into trouble as part of a criminal gang and then works honourably to become rich. Money is his undoing allowing him to become a womanizer and drinker, almost losing his wife. Finally he rejoins her, they have a son and he pays for his mistakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQkHiVMV30xIajFKaSHY4zHaoi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151569'),
  ('279669531791498004', 'Far from Heaven', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Todd Haynes, Edward Lachman, Timothy Bird', 'Todd Haynes', 'Julianne Moore, Dennis Quaid, Dennis Haysbert, Patricia Clarkson, Viola Davis, James Rebhorn, Bette Henritze, Michael Gaston', 'PG-13', 'In 1950s Connecticut, a housewife''s life is upended by a marital crisis and mounting racial tensions in society.', 'In 1950s Connecticut, a housewife''s life is upended by a marital crisis and mounting racial tensions in society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gQuvFDRPLx39smUvyafm36tp0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10712'),
  ('740655633307729211', 'Far from Home', 1989, 'Thriller', 'Paul Elliott, Meiert Avis', 'Tommy Lee Wallace', 'Matt Frewer, Drew Barrymore, Richard Masur, Karen Austin, Susan Tyrrell, Andras Jones, Dick Miller, Anthony Rapp', 'R', 'Charlie Cox should have stopped for gas in California. While he''s on a cross-country trip with his teenage daughter, Joleen, his car hits empty in a creepy town in Nevada. With nary a drop of fuel to be found, Charlie and Joleen stop for the night at a dilapidated trailer park. There, Joleen catches the eye of two teenage boys, Jimmy and Pinky -- either of whom could be the serial killer currently terrorizing the town.', 'Charlie Cox should have stopped for gas in California. While he''s on a cross-country trip with his teenage daughter, Joleen, his car hits empty in a creepy town in Nevada. With nary a drop of fuel to be found, Charlie and Joleen stop for the night at a dilapidated trailer park. There, Joleen catches the eye of two teenage boys, Jimmy and Pinky -- either of whom could be the serial killer currently terrorizing the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Sbb0DbjvwZLi7Zb8DSK3sZ9Bsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27984'),
  ('134829847925226522', 'Far from Home: The Adventures of Yellow Dog', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Phillip Borsos, James Gardner', 'Phillip Borsos', 'Mimi Rogers, Jesse Bradford, Bruce Davison, Tom Bower, Joel Palmer, Dakotah, Josh Wannamaker, Margot Finley', 'PG', 'Teenager Angus adopts a stray dog and names him Yellow. Several days later, while travelling along the coast of British Columbia with Angus''s father, John, the boy and dog become stranded when turbulent waters capsize their boat. Angus''s parents relentlessly badger rescue teams. Angus, schooled by his father in wilderness survival skills, and assisted by the intelligent Yellow Dog, tries to attract rescuers.', 'Teenager Angus adopts a stray dog and names him Yellow. Several days later, while travelling along the coast of British Columbia with Angus''s father, John, the boy and dog become stranded when turbulent waters capsize their boat. Angus''s parents relentlessly badger rescue teams. Angus, schooled by his father in wilderness survival skills, and assisted by the intelligent Yellow Dog, tries to attract rescuers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHtNHOiSmfX1KlJwc9Jvc8sYcjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27985'),
  ('876791981142004972', 'Far from Men', 2015, 'Drama, War', 'David Oelhoffen, Guillaume Deffontaines, Jérôme Brière', 'David Oelhoffen', 'Viggo Mortensen, Reda Kateb, Djemel Barek, Vincent Martin, Nicolas Giraud, Jean-Jérôme Esposito, Yann Goven, Antoine Régent', null, 'A French teacher in a small Algerian village during the Algerian War forms an unexpected bond with a dissident who is ordered to be turned in to the authorities.', 'A French teacher in a small Algerian village during the Algerian War forms an unexpected bond with a dissident who is ordered to be turned in to the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wREvEplB0wUf9eGLVTWpCR4Dz8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283708'),
  ('234732748648505838', 'Far from the Madding Crowd', 1967, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Nicolas Roeg, John Schlesinger, Kip Gowans', 'Frederic Raphael', 'Julie Christie, Terence Stamp, Alan Bates, Peter Finch, Fiona Walker, Prunella Ransome, Alison Leggatt, Paul Dawkins', null, 'Bathsheba Everdine, a willful, flirtatious, young woman, unexpectedly inherits a large farm and becomes romantically involved with three widely divergent men.', 'Bathsheba Everdine, a willful, flirtatious, young woman, unexpectedly inherits a large farm and becomes romantically involved with three widely divergent men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cCHnpaf5JTRlgO07uulEdUpFkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3469'),
  ('1110219389626927911', 'Far from the Madding Crowd', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Nicholas Renton, John Daly', 'Philomena McDonagh', 'Paloma Baeza, Nigel Terry, Nathaniel Parker, Jonathan Firth, Natasha Little, Linda Bassett, Sean Gilder', null, 'This powerful adaptation of Thomas Hardy''s classic novel spins a story of passion and destruction set in the nineteenth century. The proud, flighty and bewitching Bathsheba Everdene finds herself entangled into the passions of three men and her impulsive nature pushes her into a web of deceit and destruction.', 'This powerful adaptation of Thomas Hardy''s classic novel spins a story of passion and destruction set in the nineteenth century. The proud, flighty and bewitching Bathsheba Everdene finds herself entangled into the passions of three men and her impulsive nature pushes her into a web of deceit and destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwbjmVeuAzhobnzSM2lbGKXBcGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128710'),
  ('1021084072768908698', 'Far from the Madding Crowd', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Charlotte Bruus Christensen, Julia Castle', 'David Nicholls', 'Carey Mulligan, Matthias Schoenaerts, Michael Sheen, Tom Sturridge, Juno Temple, Jessica Barden, Hilton McRae, Harry Peacock', 'PG-13', 'In Victorian England, the independent and headstrong Bathsheba Everdene attracts three very different suitors: Gabriel Oak, a hardworking young sheep farmer; Frank Troy, a handsome and reckless Sergeant; and William Boldwood, a prosperous and mature bachelor.', 'In Victorian England, the independent and headstrong Bathsheba Everdene attracts three very different suitors: Gabriel Oak, a hardworking young sheep farmer; Frank Troy, a handsome and reckless Sergeant; and William Boldwood, a prosperous and mature bachelor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr4cctBPv9qHDtjDps4wi0kqI7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250734'),
  ('760641516690116357', 'Far from the Sea', 2015, 'Drama', 'Imanol Uribe, Guillermo Navajo', 'Imanol Uribe, Daniel Cebrián', 'Eduard Fernández, Elena Anaya, Verónica Moral, José Luis García Pérez, Ignacio Mateos, Olivia Delcán', null, 'A love story between a terrorist and his victim.', 'A love story between a terrorist and his victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3VJYCsB2AQskU2Era3PXE7vCjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350848'),
  ('638032384310199704', 'Far from Vietnam', 1967, 'Documentary, War, Drama', 'Claude Lelouch, William Klein, Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean Lacouture, François Maspero, Jacques Sternberg', 'Maurice Garrel, Anne Bellec, Karen Blanguernon, Bernard Fresson, Marie-France Mignal, Hồ Chí Minh, Agnès Varda, Jean-Luc Godard', 'NR', 'In seven different parts, Godard, Ivens, Klein, Lelouch, Marker, Resnais, and Varda show their sympathy for the North-Vietnamese army during the Vietnam War.', 'In seven different parts, Godard, Ivens, Klein, Lelouch, Marker, Resnais, and Varda show their sympathy for the North-Vietnamese army during the Vietnam War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwMPDjZKim3BQFomQfPcywwEwOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36140'),
  ('946666948880354542', 'Far North', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance, Crime', 'Asif Kapadia, Roman Osin, Jack Ravenscroft', 'Asif Kapadia, Tim Miller', 'Michelle Yeoh, Michelle Krusiec, Sean Bean, Gary Pillai, Bjarne Østerud, Sven Henriksen, Neeru Agarwal, Per Egil Aske', 'R', 'In the arctic, as Saiva is being born, a shaman declares that she is evil and will bring harm to all who become involved with her. Saiva is cast out of her tribe of herders and grows up to live a nomadic existence with Anja, a young woman she adopts as an infant. Then Loki, an injured and starving soldier, stumbles into their isolated lives. The women nurse him back to health, but treachery, violence and doom await them all.', 'In the arctic, as Saiva is being born, a shaman declares that she is evil and will bring harm to all who become involved with her. Saiva is cast out of her tribe of herders and grows up to live a nomadic existence with Anja, a young woman she adopts as an infant. Then Loki, an injured and starving soldier, stumbles into their isolated lives. The women nurse him back to health, but treachery, violence and doom await them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d31sugp9MHWv7YHGxgM5iYQVmXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8471'),
  ('903734168679170927', 'Far Out Man', 1990, 'Action, Comedy', 'Tommy Chong, Greg Gardiner', 'Tommy Chong', 'Tommy Chong, C. Thomas Howell, Rae Dawn Chong, Shelby Chong, Paris Chong, Martin Mull, Bobby Taylor, Reynaldo Rey', 'R', 'An aging hippie sets out on a trip across America to find his family.', 'An aging hippie sets out on a trip across America to find his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17ivrq2ziE8CZ4oknJXuXEBVE3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25111'),
  ('127253153145422403', 'Far Side of the Moon', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Robert Lepage, Ronald Plante', 'Robert Lepage', 'Robert Lepage, Céline Bonnier, Anne-Marie Cadieux, Marco Poulin, Érika Gagnon, Fabrice Mongeau, Raphaël Dury, Étienne Bouchard-Dauphin', null, 'After the death of his mother, a man tries to discover a meaning to his life, to the universe and to rebuild a relationship with the only family he has left: his gay brother.', 'After the death of his mother, a man tries to discover a meaning to his life, to the universe and to rebuild a relationship with the only family he has left: his gay brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sq4pT3u7r7Os6TVqHtJPSIHzYJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22618'),
  ('312419596550719467', 'FAR. The Story of a Journey around the World', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Gwendolin Weisser, Patrick Allgaier', null, 'Gwendolin Weisser, Patrick Allgaier', null, 'Documentary about the journey of Patrick Allgair and Gwendolin Weisser, who travelled over 100,000 kilometres on foot and by hitchhiking. Starting in Freiburg, Germany, they travelled eastwards for three and a half years, passing through Ukraine, Russia, China, Japan and Mexico on their way around the world.', 'Documentary about the journey of Patrick Allgair and Gwendolin Weisser, who travelled over 100,000 kilometres on foot and by hitchhiking. Starting in Freiburg, Germany, they travelled eastwards for three and a half years, passing through Ukraine, Russia, China, Japan and Mexico on their way around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18LACzrgCsKN53zfqko5E0TShvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453386'),
  ('298573731799314057', 'Faraday', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Roland de Middel, Norberto Ramos del Val', 'Pablo Vázquez, Jimina Sabadú', 'Javier Bódalo, Diana Gómez, Alba García, Daniela Costa, Alejandro Tous, Ismael Martínez, Eduardo Ferrés, Denny Horror', null, 'Faraday is a weirdo telepath who is starting to lose his faith in the paranormal. His girlfriend, Diana, is a blogger whose highest aspiration in life is to be famous on the internet. When they decide to move in together they opt for a suspiciously cheap flat which turns out to be haunted.', 'Faraday is a weirdo telepath who is starting to lose his faith in the paranormal. His girlfriend, Diana, is a blogger whose highest aspiration in life is to be famous on the internet. When they decide to move in together they opt for a suspiciously cheap flat which turns out to be haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NfYnCSRqUG5a9OjDm9pagSjLSm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214632'),
  ('1108991904040510491', 'Faratyev''s Fantasies', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Ilya Averbakh, Dmitriy Dolinin, Boris Andreyev', 'Ilya Averbakh', 'Marina Neyolova, Andrey Mironov, Zinaida Sharko, Liliya Gritsenko, Maksim Britvenkov, Yekaterina Durova, Elena Stavrogina', null, 'Averbakh''s adaptation of a play by Alla Sokolova, Faratyev''s Fantasies is the story of a man surrounded by four woman, Faratyev, he is madly in love with on, Aleksandra, compassionately take care of another, her aunt, and is indifferent to the other two, Aleksandra''s mother, and her sister, Lyuba. The world of these characters are that of dreams, each one''s dream in interconnected to that of other, and each respond differently to it. Faratyev is a man who dreams, he live in the world of fantasies. Aleksandra and her mother listen to him, but do not take him seriously, his aunt listen to him, believe him, but do not encourage him, only Lyuba understand him, but to him, she is a mere child, he is madly in love with her sister, Aleksandra, she is a realist, she does not love him, but for sake of her own prosperity and that of her mother and sister, she agree to marry him, only to run away with the mysterious Bedhudov...', 'Averbakh''s adaptation of a play by Alla Sokolova, Faratyev''s Fantasies is the story of a man surrounded by four woman, Faratyev, he is madly in love with on, Aleksandra, compassionately take care of another, her aunt, and is indifferent to the other two, Aleksandra''s mother, and her sister, Lyuba. The world of these characters are that of dreams, each one''s dream in interconnected to that of other, and each respond differently to it. Faratyev is a man who dreams, he live in the world of fantasies. Aleksandra and her mother listen to him, but do not take him seriously, his aunt listen to him, believe him, but do not encourage him, only Lyuba understand him, but to him, she is a mere child, he is madly in love with her sister, Aleksandra, she is a realist, she does not love him, but for sake of her own prosperity and that of her mother and sister, she agree to marry him, only to run away with the mysterious Bedhudov...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v45HpT95aESiC5VWkuQWTE7KsMH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83448'),
  ('803952510417117624', 'Faraway', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sanja Drakulić, Daniela Tolkien, Daniel Rosness', 'Jane Ainscough', 'Naomi Krauss, Goran Bogdan, Adnan Maral, Bahar Balci, Vedat Erincin, Artjom Gilz, Davor Tomić, Mladen Vasary', null, 'Zeynap Altin is at the end of her tether: she works far too much and is not valued at all by her husband, daughter and father. To make matters worse, the funeral home dressed her beloved late mother in a man''s suit instead of her favorite dress. Enough is enough: Zeynep flees from Munich to the previously unknown holiday home on a Croatian island that her mother secretly bought years ago - with the hope of finding quiet, peace and herself there. If only the previous owner Josip, a rough islander, didn''t still live on the same property and annoy her with his views and wisdom.', 'Zeynap Altin is at the end of her tether: she works far too much and is not valued at all by her husband, daughter and father. To make matters worse, the funeral home dressed her beloved late mother in a man''s suit instead of her favorite dress. Enough is enough: Zeynep flees from Munich to the previously unknown holiday home on a Croatian island that her mother secretly bought years ago - with the hope of finding quiet, peace and herself there. If only the previous owner Josip, a rough islander, didn''t still live on the same property and annoy her with his views and wisdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4czyy4HQuOMQtGCCB9N6JcvJwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081291'),
  ('748609308257840984', 'Faraway Eyes', 2021, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Ozum Demirel, Henriette Ohno, Doro Pesce', 'Harry Greenberger', 'Andy Karl, Christina Ricci, Nora Arnezeder, Michael Rispoli, Alex Hurt, Richard Topol, Ray Iannicelli, Jeannie Berlin', 'R', 'Michael, a struggling actor, dies right after a bad breakup. He finds himself awakening in a very bright room with a very strange lady and learns that he is in singles Purgatory, where he must find his soul mate in order to cross over to the other side. With limited time to find true love among other recently deceased single New Yorkers, Michael must navigate the new customs of a ghostly dating life... as if dating in life wasn''t hard enough already.', 'Michael, a struggling actor, dies right after a bad breakup. He finds himself awakening in a very bright room with a very strange lady and learns that he is in singles Purgatory, where he must find his soul mate in order to cross over to the other side. With limited time to find true love among other recently deceased single New Yorkers, Michael must navigate the new customs of a ghostly dating life... as if dating in life wasn''t hard enough already.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIyEZ1L2eR6337usDnzwpmOQyI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534038'),
  ('41697164595885540', 'Faraway, So Close!', 1993, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jürgen Jürges, Wim Wenders, Caroline Veyssière', 'Ulrich Zieger, Wim Wenders, Richard Reitinger', 'Otto Sander, Bruno Ganz, Nastassja Kinski, Peter Falk, Solveig Dommartin, Heinz Rühmann, Rüdiger Vogler, Willem Dafoe', 'PG-13', 'A group of angels look longingly upon the life of humans. Berlin now is a very different place: unified in name but overrun with crime, corruption, and—in what turns out to be a key theme here—Americans.', 'A group of angels look longingly upon the life of humans. Berlin now is a very different place: unified in name but overrun with crime, corruption, and—in what turns out to be a key theme here—Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VaPw0NgM4DloukmQTggzgvD4rb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10434'),
  ('545440957827115073', 'Farce of the Penguins', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, Documentary', 'Bob Saget, Scott Billups', 'Bob Saget', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Alyson Hannigan, Bob Saget, Brie Larson, Carlos Mencia, Dave Coulier, John Stamos, Jodie Sweetin', 'R', 'In this spoof of "March of the Penguins," nature footage of penguins near the South Pole gets a soundtrack of human voices. Carl and Jimmy, best friends, walk 70 miles to the mating grounds where the female penguins wait. The huddled masses of females - especially Melissa and Vicki - talk about males, mating, and what might happen this year. Carl, Jimmy, and the other males make the long trek talking about food, fornication and flatulence. Until this year, Carl''s sex life has been dismal, but he falls hard for Melissa. She seems to like him. A crisis develops when Jimmy comes upon something soft in the dark. Can friends forgive? Does parenthood await Carl and Melissa?', 'In this spoof of "March of the Penguins," nature footage of penguins near the South Pole gets a soundtrack of human voices. Carl and Jimmy, best friends, walk 70 miles to the mating grounds where the female penguins wait. The huddled masses of females - especially Melissa and Vicki - talk about males, mating, and what might happen this year. Carl, Jimmy, and the other males make the long trek talking about food, fornication and flatulence. Until this year, Carl''s sex life has been dismal, but he falls hard for Melissa. She seems to like him. A crisis develops when Jimmy comes upon something soft in the dark. Can friends forgive? Does parenthood await Carl and Melissa?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bb3f1catVid2yDqHvhygai2RUoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12486'),
  ('686518155133764170', 'Farewell', 1983, 'Drama', 'Elem Klimov, Yuri Skhirtladze, Alexey Rodionov', 'German Klimov, Larisa Shepitko, Rudolf Tyurin', 'Stefaniya Stanyuta, Lev Durov, Aleksey Petrenko, Yuri Katin-Yartsev, Maya Bulgakova, Leonid Kryuk, Vadim Yakovenko, Naidan Gendunova', null, 'Matyora is a small village on an eponymous beautiful island; its existence is threatened with flooding by the construction of a dam, leaving its citizens forced to bid farewell to their beloved home.', 'Matyora is a small village on an eponymous beautiful island; its existence is threatened with flooding by the construction of a dam, leaving its citizens forced to bid farewell to their beloved home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoyKNuQtEQSxR1EqcTaLhg3DOG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139169'),
  ('246989040399342950', 'Farewell', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Christian Carion, Walther van den Ende', 'Eric Raynaud, Christian Carion', 'Guillaume Canet, Emir Kusturica, Alexandra Maria Lara, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Dina Korzun, Evgeniy Kharlanov, Niels Arestrup, Willem Dafoe', null, 'An intricate thriller about an ordinary man thrust into the biggest theft of Soviet information of the Cold War. Right after the Soviet invasion of Afghanistan. A French businessman based in Moscow, Pierre Froment, makes an unlikely connection with Grigoriev, a senior KGB officer disenchanted with what the Communist ideal has become under Brezhnev. Grigoriev begins passing Froment highly sensitive information about the Soviet spy network in the US.', 'An intricate thriller about an ordinary man thrust into the biggest theft of Soviet information of the Cold War. Right after the Soviet invasion of Afghanistan. A French businessman based in Moscow, Pierre Froment, makes an unlikely connection with Grigoriev, a senior KGB officer disenchanted with what the Communist ideal has become under Brezhnev. Grigoriev begins passing Froment highly sensitive information about the Soviet spy network in the US.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNTJBINBZH9jk0R5OnyUDg9haSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33996'),
  ('1038638014665961515', 'Farewell Amor', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ekwa Msangi, Bruce Francis Cole', 'Ekwa Msangi', 'Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine, Zainab Jah, Jayme Lawson, Joie Lee, Marcus Scribner, Nana Mensah, Memo', null, 'Reunited after a 17-year separation, Walter, an Angolan immigrant, is joined in the U.S. by his wife and teenage daughter. Now absolute strangers sharing a one-bedroom apartment, they discover a shared love of dance that may help overcome the emotional distance between them.', 'Reunited after a 17-year separation, Walter, an Angolan immigrant, is joined in the U.S. by his wife and teenage daughter. Now absolute strangers sharing a one-bedroom apartment, they discover a shared love of dance that may help overcome the emotional distance between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evH5FR3TGbRDWfftpdpQf5jIq5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653665'),
  ('264560858457277815', 'Farewell Moscow', 1987, 'Drama, History', 'Mauro Bolognini, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Mauro Bolognini, Marcello Andrei, Nicola Badalucco', 'Liv Ullmann, Daniel Olbrychski, Aurore Clément, Anna Galiena, Saverio Vallone, Francesca Ciardi, Ermanno De Biagi, Edoardo Siravo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/es5Ha9va8yU1TgYCG6loNs2YFDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273304'),
  ('607850956559180209', 'Farewell My Concubine', 1993, 'Drama', 'Gu Changwei, Chen Kaige, Bai Yu', 'Lilian Lee Bik-Wah, Lu Wei', 'Leslie Cheung, Zhang Fengyi, Gong Li, Lü Qi, Ying Da, Ge You, Lei Han, Tong Di', 'R', 'In an epic tale of theater, gender, love and class, two Beijing opera actors navigate political turmoil as their friendship evolves over decades.', 'In an epic tale of theater, gender, love and class, two Beijing opera actors navigate political turmoil as their friendship evolves over decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJ99VEPZ8aZTGm18DN6RfZCxYwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10997'),
  ('1018422591763354124', 'Farewell Song', 2019, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Akihiko Shiota, Hidetoshi Shinomiya, Yasutaka Mori', 'Akihiko Shiota', 'Nana Komatsu, Mugi Kadowaki, Ryo Narita, Akinobu Shinoyama, Takaya Aoyagi, Yuzumi Shintani, Marin Hidaka, Marika Matsumoto', null, 'Haru and Reo perform as musical duo Haru-Reo. With their indie music, they suddenly get popular. Even with their newfound success, they decide to disband the duo. Haru-Reo go on one last tour together. Their roadie Shima goes with the girls on the tour.', 'Haru and Reo perform as musical duo Haru-Reo. With their indie music, they suddenly get popular. Even with their newfound success, they decide to disband the duo. Haru-Reo go on one last tour together. Their roadie Shima goes with the girls on the tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWR2AD8mqR2iz71kcaRUY1eJhjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586969'),
  ('557444980391053031', 'Farewell to Space Battleship Yamato', 1978, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Toshio Masuda, Leiji Matsumoto, Kazunori Tanahashi', 'Leiji Matsumoto, Yoshinobu Nishizaki', 'Kei Tomiyama, Yoko Asagami, Gorō Naya, Shūsei Nakamura, Kenichi Ogata, Shinji Nomura, Yoshito Yasuhara, Akira Kamiya', null, 'The Yamato and her crew face the onslaught of the Comet Empire, a civilization from the Andromeda Galaxy who seek to conquer Earth, led by Prince Zordar. They have harnessed a comet and is using its terrible power to unleash destruction upon its rivals and inferiors... which are in fact everyone. The Space Battleship Yamato heads back into action. But this time, it shall not return, and much of the Yamato crew have signed on for their last voyage.', 'The Yamato and her crew face the onslaught of the Comet Empire, a civilization from the Andromeda Galaxy who seek to conquer Earth, led by Prince Zordar. They have harnessed a comet and is using its terrible power to unleash destruction upon its rivals and inferiors... which are in fact everyone. The Space Battleship Yamato heads back into action. But this time, it shall not return, and much of the Yamato crew have signed on for their last voyage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2nBGv3VXcSuiB0NGbLejnpFp3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65665'),
  ('688966142339639921', 'Farewell to the Ark', 1984, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Shūji Terayama, Yoshio Unno, Koji Enokido', 'Shūji Terayama, Rio Kishida', 'Tsutomu Yamazaki, Mayumi Ogawa, Yoshio Harada, Yoko Takahashi, Renji Ishibashi, Hideyo Amamoto, Hōsei Komatsu, Seiji Miyaguchi', null, 'A surreal, isolated village sees its inhabitants gradually leave behind their mutual traditions and superstitions as they leave for the city. Among them are two cousins who love each other and who get into a quarrel with other villagers.', 'A surreal, isolated village sees its inhabitants gradually leave behind their mutual traditions and superstitions as they leave for the city. Among them are two cousins who love each other and who get into a quarrel with other villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3io9ElEVFHsJ58xg002MFG6z4Zm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104292'),
  ('30491202330783863', 'Farewell to the King', 1989, 'War, Adventure', 'John Milius, Dean Semler, Terry Leonard', 'John Milius', 'Nick Nolte, Nigel Havers, Marilyn Tokuda, Frank McRae, Gerry Lopez, James Fox, Marius Weyers, John Bennett Perry', 'PG-13', 'An American soldier who escapes the execution of his comrades by Japanese soldiers in Borneo during WWII becomes the leader of a personal empire among the headhunters in this war story told in the style of Joseph Conrad and Rudyard Kipling. The American is reluctant to rejoin the fight against the Japanese on the urging of a British commando team but conducts a war of vengeance when the Japanese attack his adopted people.', 'An American soldier who escapes the execution of his comrades by Japanese soldiers in Borneo during WWII becomes the leader of a personal empire among the headhunters in this war story told in the style of Joseph Conrad and Rudyard Kipling. The American is reluctant to rejoin the fight against the Japanese on the urging of a British commando team but conducts a war of vengeance when the Japanese attack his adopted people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TflAOAoV7C0XPqNyIhjhOelr8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20713'),
  ('1041294210077270474', 'Farewell to the Night', 2019, 'Drama', 'Julien Hirsch, André Téchiné', 'Léa Mysius, André Téchiné', 'Catherine Deneuve, Kacey Mottet Klein, Oulaya Amamra, Stéphane Bak, Kamel Labroudi, Mohamed Djouhari, Amer Alwan, Tamara De Leener', null, 'Muriel is overjoyed, as her beloved grandson Alex is staying at her place for a few days before moving to Canada to work. But when the changes in his behavior arouse her curiosity, she is led to the discovery of a dark secret.', 'Muriel is overjoyed, as her beloved grandson Alex is staying at her place for a few days before moving to Canada to work. But when the changes in his behavior arouse her curiosity, she is led to the discovery of a dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p21M93EHlFc5oYidlDY8Kz9G0k6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575458'),
  ('678281687712614104', 'Farewell to the Summer Light', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Yûji Okumura, Motokichi Hasegawa', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Masahiro Yamada, Ryusei Hasegawa', 'Mariko Okada, Tadashi Yokouchi, Paul Beauvais, Hélène Soubielle', null, 'A spontaneous romance blooms between Kawamura, a professor touring Europe, and Naoko, a married woman living in Paris, scarred by the Nagasaki atomic bombings. The two protagonists travel around Europe trying to find themselves.', 'A spontaneous romance blooms between Kawamura, a professor touring Europe, and Naoko, a married woman living in Paris, scarred by the Nagasaki atomic bombings. The two protagonists travel around Europe trying to find themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgAfymWo3A5Vp2INSuTqNwg4CBb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105833'),
  ('205732911569105675', 'Farewell, Friend', 1968, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Jean Herman, Jean-Jacques Tarbès, Pierre Grunstein', 'Sébastien Japrisot, Jean Herman', 'Alain Delon, Charles Bronson, Olga Georges-Picot, Bernard Fresson, Brigitte Fossey, Ellen Bahl, Michel Barcet, Jean-Claude Ballard', null, 'After serving together in the French Foreign Legion, a mercenary and a doctor leave the service and go their separate ways. Later, they are reunited and become involved with a caper involving millions in a high-security safe. The two men become locked in during a holiday weekend as they attempt to crack the safe''s combination.', 'After serving together in the French Foreign Legion, a mercenary and a doctor leave the service and go their separate ways. Later, they are reunited and become involved with a caper involving millions in a high-security safe. The two men become locked in during a holiday weekend as they attempt to crack the safe''s combination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jk8tuEAaxpi6kgIX02FK1aXvKuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4857'),
  ('836032557471971737', 'Farewell, Home Sweet Home', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'William Lubtchansky, Otar Iosseliani', 'Otar Iosseliani', 'Nico Tarielashvili, Lily Lavina, Philippe Bas, Stephanie Hainque, Mirabelle Kirkland, Amiran Amiranashvili (II), Joachim Salinger, Emmanuel de Chauvigny', null, 'Nicholas is the eldest son of a wealthy suburban family, whose businesswoman mother makes deals from a helicopter and has an affair with her business partner. His cheerful, alcoholic father, on the other hand, is reduced to a prisoner in his room with his devoted dog and electric train set. Unbeknownst to his parents, Nicholas works as a window cleaner and dish washer in a Parisian cafe. He is also in love with the daughter of another cafe''s owner, who, however, has an abusive boyfriend. One night, Nicholas sneaks a few drunken drifters into his family wine cellar and his father unexpectedly takes a liking to the stranger.', 'Nicholas is the eldest son of a wealthy suburban family, whose businesswoman mother makes deals from a helicopter and has an affair with her business partner. His cheerful, alcoholic father, on the other hand, is reduced to a prisoner in his room with his devoted dog and electric train set. Unbeknownst to his parents, Nicholas works as a window cleaner and dish washer in a Parisian cafe. He is also in love with the daughter of another cafe''s owner, who, however, has an abusive boyfriend. One night, Nicholas sneaks a few drunken drifters into his family wine cellar and his father unexpectedly takes a liking to the stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ArZCnPS6TqmnkT3O8dhHKPUOBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4962'),
  ('818319296964094071', 'Farewell, Mr. Haffmann', 2022, 'History, Drama', 'Denis Rouden, Fred Cavayé', 'Sarah Kaminsky, Fred Cavayé, Jean-Philippe Daguerre', 'Daniel Auteuil, Gilles Lellouche, Sara Giraudeau, Nikolai Kinski, Mathilde Bisson, Anne Coesens, Jérôme Cachon, Guillaume Marquet', null, 'Paris 1942. François Mercier is an ordinary man who only aspires to start a family with the woman he loves, Blanche. He is also the employee of a talented jeweler, Mr. Haffmann. But faced with the German occupation, the two men will have no other choice but to conclude an agreement whose consequences, over the months, will upset the fate of our three characters.', 'Paris 1942. François Mercier is an ordinary man who only aspires to start a family with the woman he loves, Blanche. He is also the employee of a talented jeweler, Mr. Haffmann. But faced with the German occupation, the two men will have no other choice but to conclude an agreement whose consequences, over the months, will upset the fate of our three characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nO35bPDrXixL4ZrRxcQwvu9ECmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670243'),
  ('531163714569684753', 'Farewell, Mr. President', 1987, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Kari Sohlberg, Matti Kassila, Taavi Kassila', 'Matti Kassila, Taavi Kassila', 'Hannu Lauri, Laila Räikkä, Antti Litja, Esa Saario, Aake Kalliala, Markku Huhtamo, Markku Nieminen, Tarmo Manni', null, 'Asko Mertanen is a waiter who is very interested in shooting. He gets fed up how the things are run in Finland, so he thinks that the best way to change them is to shoot the Finnish president.', 'Asko Mertanen is a waiter who is very interested in shooting. He gets fed up how the things are run in Finland, so he thinks that the best way to change them is to shoot the Finnish president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPQMwUpssuhDx2zN0j8WITMdTwn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252096'),
  ('582881876284912107', 'Farewell, My Lovely', 1975, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'John A. Alonzo, Dick Richards, David Sosna', 'David Zelag Goodman', 'Robert Mitchum, Charlotte Rampling, John Ireland, Sylvia Miles, Anthony Zerbe, Harry Dean Stanton, Jack O''Halloran, Joe Spinell', null, 'Private eye Philip Marlowe is hired by ex-con Moose Malloy to find his girlfriend, a former lounge dancer. While also investigating the murder of a client and the theft of a jade necklace, Marlowe becomes entangled with seductress Helen Grayle and discovers a web of dark secrets that are better left hidden.', 'Private eye Philip Marlowe is hired by ex-con Moose Malloy to find his girlfriend, a former lounge dancer. While also investigating the murder of a client and the theft of a jade necklace, Marlowe becomes entangled with seductress Helen Grayle and discovers a web of dark secrets that are better left hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygk9oP5BJM7viLut42RidNB5JPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1835'),
  ('65801246581949376', 'Farewell, My Queen', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Benoît Jacquot, Romain Winding', 'Benoît Jacquot, Gilles Taurand', 'Léa Seydoux, Diane Kruger, Virginie Ledoyen, Noémie Lvovsky, Xavier Beauvois, Michel Robin, Julie-Marie Parmentier, Lolita Chammah', 'R', 'A look at the relationship between Marie Antoinette and one of her readers during the final days of the French Revolution.', 'A look at the relationship between Marie Antoinette and one of her readers during the final days of the French Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKPFwAzaTjh4fwKMyvZM8T1asDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99579'),
  ('963070389310988430', 'Farewells', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wojciech Has, Mieczysław Jahoda, Andrzej Czekalski', 'Wojciech Has, Stanisław Dygat', 'Maria Wachowiak, Tadeusz Janczar, Gustaw Holoubek, Stanisław Jaworski, Stanisław Milski, Zdzisław Mrożewski, Irena Netto, Józef Pieracki', null, 'The story takes place before World War II and centers on Pawel, a member of a conservative, middle-class family, and his love for Lidka, a taxi dancer. Social conventions and the lovers'' inability to defy those forces Pawel and Lidka benefit. Times change, war breaks out, leading to Pawel sent to Auschwitz while Lidka marry his cousin. Their love has survived and conventions are no longer the issue.', 'The story takes place before World War II and centers on Pawel, a member of a conservative, middle-class family, and his love for Lidka, a taxi dancer. Social conventions and the lovers'' inability to defy those forces Pawel and Lidka benefit. Times change, war breaks out, leading to Pawel sent to Auschwitz while Lidka marry his cousin. Their love has survived and conventions are no longer the issue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DmqCIbk8AbuYG3lhIrTQXbSf1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105762'),
  ('984103082029684018', 'Farfallon', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Riccardo Pazzaglia, Guglielmo Mancori, Roberto Pariante', 'Riccardo Pazzaglia', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Fiorenzo Fiorentini, Gina Rovere, Micaela Pignatelli, Mario Carotenuto, Rosanna Ruffini, Nino Terzo', null, 'A man who has tried to kill his unfaithful wife goes to prison, escapes, ends up in a convent, teaches the nuns to make cookies, captured again and before going back to prison tries to take his long awaited revenge again. Does he eventually succeed in killing his wife?', 'A man who has tried to kill his unfaithful wife goes to prison, escapes, ends up in a convent, teaches the nuns to make cookies, captured again and before going back to prison tries to take his long awaited revenge again. Does he eventually succeed in killing his wife?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7EqdAr1Idmp0nmM2EAY25LcHUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121322'),
  ('705684891393129023', 'Fargo', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Roger Deakins, Joel Coen, Donald Murphy', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen', 'Frances McDormand, William H. Macy, Steve Buscemi, Peter Stormare, Harve Presnell, John Carroll Lynch, Kristin Rudrüd, Bruce Bohne', 'R', 'Jerry, a small-town Minnesota car salesman is bursting at the seams with debt... but he''s got a plan. He''s going to hire two thugs to kidnap his wife in a scheme to collect a hefty ransom from his wealthy father-in-law. It''s going to be a snap and nobody''s going to get hurt... until people start dying. Enter Police Chief Marge, a coffee-drinking, parka-wearing - and extremely pregnant - investigator who''ll stop at nothing to get her man. And if you think her small-time investigative skills will give the crooks a run for their ransom... you betcha!', 'Jerry, a small-town Minnesota car salesman is bursting at the seams with debt... but he''s got a plan. He''s going to hire two thugs to kidnap his wife in a scheme to collect a hefty ransom from his wealthy father-in-law. It''s going to be a snap and nobody''s going to get hurt... until people start dying. Enter Police Chief Marge, a coffee-drinking, parka-wearing - and extremely pregnant - investigator who''ll stop at nothing to get her man. And if you think her small-time investigative skills will give the crooks a run for their ransom... you betcha!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rt7cpEr1uP6RTZykBFhBTcRaKvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275'),
  ('98400070862818751', 'Fargo Theatre: The First 100 Years', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Mike Scholtz', null, null, null, 'In celebration of the Theatre’s centennial, we take a look back at the first hundred years of movies, pipe organs, concerts, festivals, popcorn, architecture, smoking lounges, and, very briefly, farm animals.', 'In celebration of the Theatre’s centennial, we take a look back at the first hundred years of movies, pipe organs, concerts, festivals, popcorn, architecture, smoking lounges, and, very briefly, farm animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xq563WW5ntOxosbP91khv9e6HB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1652510'),
  ('161587879154440409', 'Farha', 2021, 'Drama, History, War', 'Darin J. Sallam, Rachelle Aoun', 'Deema Azar', 'Ashraf Barhom, Karam Taher, Tala Gammoh, Ali Suliman, Sameera Asir, Majd Eid, Tulin Al Quran, Lamar Al Quran', null, 'Palestine, 1948. After the withdrawal of the British occupiers, tensions rise between Arabs and Jews. Meanwhile, Farha, the smart daughter of the mayor of a small village, unaware of the coming tragedy, dreams of going to study in the big city.', 'Palestine, 1948. After the withdrawal of the British occupiers, tensions rise between Arabs and Jews. Meanwhile, Farha, the smart daughter of the mayor of a small village, unaware of the coming tragedy, dreams of going to study in the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/X4kRsdyP9FgMfKKn9LZiVscZY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856437'),
