  ('680996704831889436', 'Fario', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lucie Prost, Marylou Weber, Thomas Favel', 'Nathalie Saugeon, Alain Layrac', 'Finnegan Oldfield, Florence Loiret Caille, Megan Northam, Andranic Manet, Léna Laurent, Idir Chender, Olivia Côte, Camille Rutherford', null, 'Léo, a twenty-seven-year-old engineer, has to sell his late father''s farmland to a rare metals drilling company. His father, a farmer, committed suicide three years earlier. However, strange occurrences have led him to believe that the project has been polluting the river since his childhood. He then embarks on a surreal investigation that forces him to confront his grief.', 'Léo, a twenty-seven-year-old engineer, has to sell his late father''s farmland to a rare metals drilling company. His father, a farmer, committed suicide three years earlier. However, strange occurrences have led him to believe that the project has been polluting the river since his childhood. He then embarks on a surreal investigation that forces him to confront his grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emWTl62eW3Rwa3KhINahhtILWmr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000064'),
  ('237463792570803389', 'Farlig ungdom', 1953, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lau Lauritzen Jr., Robert Saaskin', 'Johannes Allen', 'Birgitte Price, Ib Mossin, Per Lauesgaard, Ole Wisborg, Kirsten Werner, Karl Stegger, Ebba Amfeldt, Anker Taasti', null, 'Egon, a young man from Jutland living with relatives in Copenhagen, meets sensible young girl Ruth and falls in love. But Egon is involved with a gang of criminals, and when they assault a man they meet in a bar they are caught by the police. Egon is sent to a juvenile home, but can he stay out of trouble?', 'Egon, a young man from Jutland living with relatives in Copenhagen, meets sensible young girl Ruth and falls in love. But Egon is involved with a gang of criminals, and when they assault a man they meet in a bar they are caught by the police. Egon is sent to a juvenile home, but can he stay out of trouble?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGu2CIX1EcEmkF6F1wfI6ENw7HO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155748'),
