  ('557080528292848833', 'Farming', 2018, 'Drama', 'Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Kit Fraser', 'Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje', 'Damson Idris, Kate Beckinsale, John Dagleish, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Jaime Winstone, Genevieve Nnaji, Zephan Amissah, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje', null, 'Based on the writer/director''s childhood, FARMING tells the story of a young Nigerian boy, ''farmed out'' by his parents to a white British family in the hope of a better future. Instead, he becomes the feared leader of a white skinhead gang.', 'Based on the writer/director''s childhood, FARMING tells the story of a young Nigerian boy, ''farmed out'' by his parents to a white British family in the hope of a better future. Instead, he becomes the feared leader of a white skinhead gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wndlhQGs0KAwQFhaKTVgPd9lkgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475214'),
  ('1036244311767176745', 'Farmyard Symphony', 1938, 'Animation, Music', 'Jack Cutting', null, 'Lee Sweetland, Billy Bletcher, Florence Gill, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'The farm comes to life, to various classical tunes. The high point is a rooster serenading a chicken, with all the animals joining in. But then comes the sound that''s even more welcome to the animals: the farmer and his wife with food (the only actual words spoken).', 'The farm comes to life, to various classical tunes. The high point is a rooster serenading a chicken, with all the animals joining in. But then comes the sound that''s even more welcome to the animals: the farmer and his wife with food (the only actual words spoken).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5ND7bL1HjBDtEgkIeprPHcqQIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109337'),
  ('505394014363986502', 'Fårö Document', 1970, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist', null, 'Ingmar Bergman', null, 'Shot on the island of Fårö, this documentary presents interviews with local inhabitants as they discuss work, family life, and the conditions of living in a sparsely populated rural community. Bergman documents generational differences and practical concerns surrounding farming, fishing, education, and migration as the island confronts social and economic change.', 'Shot on the island of Fårö, this documentary presents interviews with local inhabitants as they discuss work, family life, and the conditions of living in a sparsely populated rural community. Bergman documents generational differences and practical concerns surrounding farming, fishing, education, and migration as the island confronts social and economic change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMreRvAhYrDkw0uqn450NIlELRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304081'),
  ('694415879008152387', 'Fårö Document 1979', 1979, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Ingmar Bergman, Daniel Bergman', null, 'Ingmar Bergman', null, 'Returning to Fårö a decade after his earlier documentary, Ingmar Bergman records the daily lives of farmers, fishermen, and families living on the island. Structured around the four seasons, the film documents labor, communal routines, and reflections on how life on Fårö has changed since the late 1960s.', 'Returning to Fårö a decade after his earlier documentary, Ingmar Bergman records the daily lives of farmers, fishermen, and families living on the island. Structured around the four seasons, the film documents labor, communal routines, and reflections on how life on Fårö has changed since the late 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iECEwAs53cYQ0JQeiZORhBxZtQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119421'),
  ('277497537031190428', 'Farrebique, or the Four Seasons', 1947, 'Documentary', 'Georges Rouquier, André Dantan, Roger Desormière', 'Georges Rouquier', null, null, 'Farrebique, the first feature-length effort of French documentary filmmaker Georges Rouqier, is widely regarded as his finest film. Rouqier concentrates on a single French farm family, following them through the four seasons. As in the works of Robert Flaherty, the human characters and the land surrounding them are "one", and Rouqier never misses an opportunity to parallel their lives with the eons-old phases of nature. The final symbolic images of Spring, achieved through time-lapse photography, are almost unbearably beautiful. The winner of several festival awards, Farrebique nonetheless did not immediately result in an outpouring of financing for Rouqier''s follow-up films (this was a common problem in the financially strapped French film industry of the 1940s). Perhaps as a result, Rouqier did not make his sequel, Biquefarre (filmed in the same region, with some of the same "actors"), until 1983.', 'Farrebique, the first feature-length effort of French documentary filmmaker Georges Rouqier, is widely regarded as his finest film. Rouqier concentrates on a single French farm family, following them through the four seasons. As in the works of Robert Flaherty, the human characters and the land surrounding them are "one", and Rouqier never misses an opportunity to parallel their lives with the eons-old phases of nature. The final symbolic images of Spring, achieved through time-lapse photography, are almost unbearably beautiful. The winner of several festival awards, Farrebique nonetheless did not immediately result in an outpouring of financing for Rouqier''s follow-up films (this was a common problem in the financially strapped French film industry of the 1940s). Perhaps as a result, Rouqier did not make his sequel, Biquefarre (filmed in the same region, with some of the same "actors"), until 1983.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y23s63OMl4mDGOybh3RbXiuMsQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110771'),
  ('1082053214185819609', 'Farruko: En letra de otro', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Leonardo Linkowski, Sergio Donis', 'Sandra Aragón', 'Farruko', null, 'Famed Puerto Rican reggaeton singer Farruko puts his own spin on classic hits in this HBO Latino concert special.', 'Famed Puerto Rican reggaeton singer Farruko puts his own spin on classic hits in this HBO Latino concert special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Of0L85SByQi9zXybiZPaaNuqRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627728'),
  ('936223364080205303', 'Fary : Aime-moi si tu peux', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Idriss "Yagooz" Tidjani', null, 'Fary Lopes', null, 'Fary is back on stage to probe, uncompromisingly, the torments of couples and love. After two previous shows broadcast in over 190 countries, he returns with a new show: "Love me if you can". With this new performance, Fary demonstrates an extraordinary ability to reinvent himself while continuing to subtly address the themes that are dear to him.', 'Fary is back on stage to probe, uncompromisingly, the torments of couples and love. After two previous shows broadcast in over 190 countries, he returns with a new show: "Love me if you can". With this new performance, Fary demonstrates an extraordinary ability to reinvent himself while continuing to subtly address the themes that are dear to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhu6lSxXfRxmsKVQacUDNzbOfg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317357'),
  ('1105930270072696668', 'Fary Is the New Black', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Richard Valverde', 'Kader Aoun, Fary Lopes, Jason Brokerss', 'Fary Lopes', null, 'Armed with sly wit, a fresh outlook and plenty of style, French comedy star Fary veers from dating to stereotypes and beyond in this exclusive special.', 'Armed with sly wit, a fresh outlook and plenty of style, French comedy star Fary veers from dating to stereotypes and beyond in this exclusive special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zgxfrt04cy50XVFfoOebaMGKmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516038'),
  ('803131112457511637', 'Fascination', 1979, 'Horror', 'Georgie Fromentin, Jean Rollin, Natalie Perrey', 'Jean Rollin', 'Franca Maï, Jean-Marie Lemaire, Brigitte Lahaie, Fanny Magier, Muriel Montossé, Sophie Noël, Evelyne Thomas, Joe de Palmer', null, 'A runaway criminal breaks into an eerie chateau, taking its two frightened chambermaids hostage. As night falls, a group of mysterious aristocratic women arrive and the criminal begins to realize the women are hiding a sinister secret.', 'A runaway criminal breaks into an eerie chateau, taking its two frightened chambermaids hostage. As night falls, a group of mysterious aristocratic women arrive and the criminal begins to realize the women are hiding a sinister secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQE9wsLpXfmBmG2gUycwr1K7oK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29562'),
  ('882180810938941838', 'Fascists on Mars', 2006, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Corrado Guzzanti, Igor Skofic, Massimiliano De Nicola', 'Paola Cannatello', 'Corrado Guzzanti, Marco Marzocca, Caterina Guzzanti, Andrea Blarzino, Lillo Petrolo, Andrea Purgatori, Andrea Salerno, Irene Ferri', null, 'In 1938 a group of fascists led by the general Gaetano Maria Barbagli decides to invade the planet of Mars.', 'In 1938 a group of fascists led by the general Gaetano Maria Barbagli decides to invade the planet of Mars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmaCV3ClPWwb9SVclPKrMOdBLeW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48250'),
  ('832096772549200496', 'Fashion', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Madhur Bhandarkar, Mahesh Limaye', 'Anuradha Tiwari, Madhur Bhandarkar, Ajay Monga', 'Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Kangana Ranaut, Mugdha Godse, Arjan Bajwa, Samir Soni, Ashwin Mushran, Kitu Gidwani, Arbaaz Khan', 'PG-13', 'A small-town girl finally realizes her dream of becoming a famous supermodel but soon finds out that there''s a price for her glamorous new life.', 'A small-town girl finally realizes her dream of becoming a famous supermodel but soon finds out that there''s a price for her glamorous new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PQyJUJ3Ny1AZegtL5OkUATCIcr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19624'),
  ('522788345261361159', 'Fashion Chicks', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Elbers, Max Maloney', 'Adel Adelson, Dick Bouquet, Appie Boudellah', 'Liza Sips, Pip Pellens, Robin Martens, Melody Raymann, Victoria Koblenko, Kaj van der Voort, Patrick Martens, Jason de Ridder', null, 'A nerdy girl creates an alter-ego to launch a successful fashion blog.', 'A nerdy girl creates an alter-ego to launch a successful fashion blog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmroX5SXSgwxX46ifrD1fMUR9XH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366755'),
  ('927886456515789924', 'Fashion King', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Oh Ki-hwan, Choi Sang-ho, Kim Gwan-cheol', 'Yoon In-wan', 'Joo Won, Sulli, Ahn Jae-hyun, Park Se-young, Kim Seung-o, Lee Il-hwa, Shin Ju-hwan, Min Jin-woong', null, 'A teenaged boy transforms from a ''fashion terrorist'' to a ''fashion king'' in order to win the heart of the prettiest girl in school. The story is about high school boy Ki-myung, who has a crush on the prettiest girl in his class and opens his eyes to fashion in order to become the best dressed person in the world.', 'A teenaged boy transforms from a ''fashion terrorist'' to a ''fashion king'' in order to win the heart of the prettiest girl in school. The story is about high school boy Ki-myung, who has a crush on the prettiest girl in his class and opens his eyes to fashion in order to become the best dressed person in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itutzEAq6PUHLW6YBHKhoXmxdEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297292'),
  ('763917280372398740', 'Fashion Victims', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Ingo Rasper', 'Tim Streuber, Ingo Rasper', 'Edgar Selge, Florian Bartholomäi, Roman Knižka, Franziska Walser, Traute Hoess, Horst Krause, Gottfried Breitfuß, Lara Beckmann', null, 'At 52, traveling salesman Wolfgang Zenker (Edgar Selge) is in old school territory: he peddles the company''s classic clothing line to boutiques that cater to women over 35. When Wolfi loses his drivers license in his brand-new Mercedes but can''t afford to lose the season''s sales because his frustrated wife (Franziska Walser) desperately wants a new bathroom, their son''s vacation plans take a back seat as Karsten (Florian Bartholomäi) is forced to making sales rounds with his father instead of celebrating his high school graduation in Spain. Also making the rounds in small town southern Germany is successful and attractive sales rival Steven Brookmüller (Roman Knizka), 33. As the men''s paths cross, long-hidden secrets are revealed and things come to a hilarious head.', 'At 52, traveling salesman Wolfgang Zenker (Edgar Selge) is in old school territory: he peddles the company''s classic clothing line to boutiques that cater to women over 35. When Wolfi loses his drivers license in his brand-new Mercedes but can''t afford to lose the season''s sales because his frustrated wife (Franziska Walser) desperately wants a new bathroom, their son''s vacation plans take a back seat as Karsten (Florian Bartholomäi) is forced to making sales rounds with his father instead of celebrating his high school graduation in Spain. Also making the rounds in small town southern Germany is successful and attractive sales rival Steven Brookmüller (Roman Knizka), 33. As the men''s paths cross, long-hidden secrets are revealed and things come to a hilarious head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsm1SBWwQLjn29fN078mFdxWxR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60850'),
  ('343703219068457820', 'Fashionably Yours', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michael Johansson, Jason Bohn, Brandon Johannson', null, 'Kat Graham, Kendrick Sampson, Jordan Claire Robbins, Miranda Edwards, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Kayla Heller, Antonio Cayonne, Shayn Walker', null, 'After years of organizing fashion in the city, Lauren decides to move home. In exchange for her organizing services, mover Rob makes it his mission to help her see the beauty of Seattle.', 'After years of organizing fashion in the city, Lauren decides to move home. In exchange for her organizing services, mover Rob makes it his mission to help her see the beauty of Seattle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2CJ6ncw7PYe7UqjcDsMADrLTmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677210'),
  ('1029490901379000436', 'Fashions of 1934', 1934, 'Comedy, Music', 'William Dieterle, William Rees, Busby Berkeley', 'F. Hugh Herbert, Carl Erickson', 'William Powell, Bette Davis, Frank McHugh, Hugh Herbert, Verree Teasdale, Reginald Owen, Henry O''Neill, Phillip Reed', 'NR', 'When the Manhattan investment firm of Sherwood Nash goes broke, he joins forces with his partner Snap and fashion designer Lynn Mason to provide discount shops with cheap copies of Paris couture dresses.', 'When the Manhattan investment firm of Sherwood Nash goes broke, he joins forces with his partner Snap and fashion designer Lynn Mason to provide discount shops with cheap copies of Paris couture dresses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izDJEEPZDxhTV5LTyPSotNMyb3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53872'),
  ('1060622089690556570', 'Fast', 1995, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Dante Desarthe, Ariane Damain', 'Dante Desarthe, Jackie Berroyer, Dodine Herry-Grimaldi', 'Frédéric Gélard, Jean-François Stévenin, Karin Viard, Nathalie Schmidt, Georges Claisse, Paul Crauchet, Gaël Baron', null, 'Jean-Louis is an naive, amiable orphan who spent his life with his elderly and very strict grandfather. Jean-Louis was a 25-year old virgin when a free-spirited young Parisian woman was temporarily stranded in his village after a bus broke down. She left him a changed man, and she also left a match book from a fast food restaurant called Fast Burger. Soon after his grandfather passes away, the innocent rube Jean-Louis hops on his bike and embarks upon a quest to Paris to find this enigmatic woman. But he is not prepared for the size of Paris, and instead ends up working at a Fast Burger outlet himself. Jean-Louis is a simple soul and freely expresses himself without guile. For some reason this endears him to the staff and management; soon he has been promoted into the upper echelons of the company. One day he meets a rather ditzy Metro security guard, Henriette, who is also at sea in the big city. The kindred spirits click and a sweet romance ensues.', 'Jean-Louis is an naive, amiable orphan who spent his life with his elderly and very strict grandfather. Jean-Louis was a 25-year old virgin when a free-spirited young Parisian woman was temporarily stranded in his village after a bus broke down. She left him a changed man, and she also left a match book from a fast food restaurant called Fast Burger. Soon after his grandfather passes away, the innocent rube Jean-Louis hops on his bike and embarks upon a quest to Paris to find this enigmatic woman. But he is not prepared for the size of Paris, and instead ends up working at a Fast Burger outlet himself. Jean-Louis is a simple soul and freely expresses himself without guile. For some reason this endears him to the staff and management; soon he has been promoted into the upper echelons of the company. One day he meets a rather ditzy Metro security guard, Henriette, who is also at sea in the big city. The kindred spirits click and a sweet romance ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ai1vJjK5Mv8SEJXbV27h5nP3Azl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325334'),
  ('31760158594098802', 'Fast', 2007, null, 'Sujin Lee', null, null, null, 'A woman signs the verb “fast” in American Sign Language by putting her thumb and index finger together and “zipping” her mouth, which resembles the action of closing one’s mouth to be silent. The speed of the action is slowed down, so the person signs the word "fast" very slowly.', 'A woman signs the verb “fast” in American Sign Language by putting her thumb and index finger together and “zipping” her mouth, which resembles the action of closing one’s mouth to be silent. The speed of the action is slowed down, so the person signs the word "fast" very slowly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3F9HuLEo6t6SG34griZ3oRiVLAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130892'),
  ('946129047677284006', 'Fast', 2010, 'Action, Comedy', 'Daniel Scheinert', 'Steve Clemmons', 'Steve Clemmons, Lo Mutuc', null, 'A balls to the wall action film about Fast, the fastest person alive, who is also named Fast.', 'A balls to the wall action film about Fast, the fastest person alive, who is also named Fast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8c0a159yKnpciQCFsR8BaC23po.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391559'),
  ('351574275647646491', 'Fast & Feel Love', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Action, Drama', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit, Natdanai Naksuwan, Siraya Saicheua', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit', 'Nat Kitcharit, Urassaya Sperbund, Anusara Korsamphan, Kanokwan Butrachart, Wipawee Patnasiri, Keetapat Pongruea, Joohong Lee, Chanyoung Kim', null, 'When a world champion of sport stacking is dumped by his long-time girlfriend, he has to learn basic adulting skills in order to live alone and take care of himself.', 'When a world champion of sport stacking is dumped by his long-time girlfriend, he has to learn basic adulting skills in order to live alone and take care of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwkrv2C1CH0OICYDkvTAsXXh8uG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889741'),
  ('210194885684175255', 'Fast & Furious', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Justin Lin, Amir Mokri, Chris John Jones', 'Chris Morgan', 'Vin Diesel, Paul Walker, Michelle Rodriguez, Jordana Brewster, John Ortiz, Laz Alonso, Gal Gadot, Jack Conley', 'PG-13', 'When a crime brings them back to L.A., fugitive ex-con Dom Toretto reignites his feud with agent Brian O''Conner. But as they are forced to confront a shared enemy, Dom and Brian must give in to an uncertain new trust if they hope to outmaneuver him. And the two men will find the best way to get revenge: push the limits of what''s possible behind the wheel.', 'When a crime brings them back to L.A., fugitive ex-con Dom Toretto reignites his feud with agent Brian O''Conner. But as they are forced to confront a shared enemy, Dom and Brian must give in to an uncertain new trust if they hope to outmaneuver him. And the two men will find the best way to get revenge: push the limits of what''s possible behind the wheel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUtVoRukW7WNtUySwd8hWlByBds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13804'),
  ('535112748068160941', 'Fast & Furious 6', 2013, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Justin Lin, Stephen F. Windon, James Hambidge', 'Chris Morgan', 'Vin Diesel, Paul Walker, Dwayne Johnson, Jordana Brewster, Michelle Rodriguez, Tyrese Gibson, Sung Kang, Gal Gadot', 'PG-13', 'Hobbs has Dominic and Brian reassemble their crew to take down a team of mercenaries; Dominic unexpectedly gets sidetracked with facing his presumed deceased girlfriend, Letty.', 'Hobbs has Dominic and Brian reassemble their crew to take down a team of mercenaries; Dominic unexpectedly gets sidetracked with facing his presumed deceased girlfriend, Letty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thSmnRdrzPBBospIOJjLZBReqzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82992'),
  ('1058391527937008582', 'Fast & Furious Presents: Hobbs & Shaw', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jonathan Sela, Dominic Hyman, Fraser Fennell-Ball', 'Chris Morgan, Drew Pearce', 'Dwayne Johnson, Jason Statham, Idris Elba, Vanessa Kirby, Helen Mirren, Eiza González, Eddie Marsan, Eliana Su''a', 'PG-13', 'Ever since US Diplomatic Security Service Agent Hobbs and lawless outcast Shaw first faced off, they just have traded smack talk and body blows. But when cyber-genetically enhanced anarchist Brixton''s ruthless actions threaten the future of humanity, they join forces to defeat him.', 'Ever since US Diplomatic Security Service Agent Hobbs and lawless outcast Shaw first faced off, they just have traded smack talk and body blows. But when cyber-genetically enhanced anarchist Brixton''s ruthless actions threaten the future of humanity, they join forces to defeat him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRyy2UmjC5ur9bDi3kpNNRCc5nc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384018'),
  ('493347481548318684', 'Fast and Fierce: Death Race', 2020, 'Action', 'Jared Cohn, Eamon Long, Jared Cohn', 'Marc Gottlieb', 'Michael Devorzon, Paulina Nguyen, DMX, Becca Buckalew, Gigi Gustin, Kassandra Escandell, Jack Pearson, Veronika Issa', 'NR', 'Jack is on his way to grabbing the cash prize for an illegal car race in Mexico to California, when a desperate woman, fleeing from her gangster boyfriend who runs the tournament, jumps into his car pleading for help.', 'Jack is on his way to grabbing the cash prize for an illegal car race in Mexico to California, when a desperate woman, fleeing from her gangster boyfriend who runs the tournament, jumps into his car pleading for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9bPKQUQtdNh1ZlAfNFaGVg8C1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701675'),
  ('334597863774977366', 'Fast and Furious', 1939, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Daniel B. Cathcart, Douglas Shearer, Busby Berkeley', 'Harry Kurnitz', 'Franchot Tone, Ann Sothern, Ruth Hussey, Lee Bowman, Allyn Joslyn, John Miljan, Bernard Nedell, Mary Beth Hughes', 'NR', 'Joel & Garda Sloan, a husband and wife detective team, who also sell rare books in New York, take a vacation to Seaside City. At Seaside, Joel''s pal, Mike Stevens is managing and preparing for their beauty pageant. Joel is made one of the judges plus he has invested $5,000 in it, to Garda''s dismay. Eric Bartell, promoter, arrives to dupe Stevens. When Ed Connors, New York racketeer arrives, Bartell is mysteriously murdered. Joel and Garda set out to investigate the murder.', 'Joel & Garda Sloan, a husband and wife detective team, who also sell rare books in New York, take a vacation to Seaside City. At Seaside, Joel''s pal, Mike Stevens is managing and preparing for their beauty pageant. Joel is made one of the judges plus he has invested $5,000 in it, to Garda''s dismay. Eric Bartell, promoter, arrives to dupe Stevens. When Ed Connors, New York racketeer arrives, Bartell is mysteriously murdered. Joel and Garda set out to investigate the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdQrh59Gq0DX8OmoQeECUtBkoH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169822'),
