  ('345902350200737187', 'Fast and Furry-ous', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Paul Julian, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'This was the debut for Wile E. Coyote and the Road Runner. It was also their only cartoon made in the 1940s. It set the template for the series, in which Wile E. Coyote (here given the ersatz Latin name Carnivorous Vulgaris) tries to catch Roadrunner (Accelleratii Incredibus) through many traps, plans and products, although in this first cartoon not all of the products are yet made by the Acme Corporation.', 'This was the debut for Wile E. Coyote and the Road Runner. It was also their only cartoon made in the 1940s. It set the template for the series, in which Wile E. Coyote (here given the ersatz Latin name Carnivorous Vulgaris) tries to catch Roadrunner (Accelleratii Incredibus) through many traps, plans and products, although in this first cartoon not all of the products are yet made by the Acme Corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XinMQ1x8kejVMDl5AAKULonOCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74961'),
  ('656740121132224652', 'Fast and Loose', 1930, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fred C. Newmeyer, William O. Steiner', null, 'Miriam Hopkins, Carole Lombard, Frank Morgan, Charles Starrett, Henry Wadsworth, Winifred Harris, Barry O''Moore, David Hutcheson', null, 'A wealthy family is thrown into turmoil when the daughter falls for the family chauffeur and the son begins to keep company with a chorus girl.', 'A wealthy family is thrown into turmoil when the daughter falls for the family chauffeur and the son begins to keep company with a chorus girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWraNZC7999GJe007Hy78y0b69N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262506'),
  ('292600975821038362', 'Fast and Sexy', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Carlo Lastricati, Vittorio De Sica, Luisa Alessandri', 'Luciana Corda, Ettore Maria Margadonna', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Vittorio De Sica, Dale Robertson, Amedeo Nazzari, Peppino De Filippo, Carla Macelloni, Gabriella Pallotta, Luigi De Filippo', null, 'A beautiful, wealthy widow leaves New York to find herself a husband in the Italian village in which she was born. After many tries she...chooses the village blacksmith.', 'A beautiful, wealthy widow leaves New York to find herself a husband in the Italian village in which she was born. After many tries she...chooses the village blacksmith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZpGKg8ZU2LdVuPXu3lQvZNqFyE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269281'),
  ('452726824340183762', 'Fast Charlie', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Phillip Noyce, Sonia Torres, Noga Isackson', 'Richard Wenk', 'Pierce Brosnan, Morena Baccarin, James Caan, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Toby Huss, Fredric Lehne, Brennan Keel Cook, Christopher Matthew Cook', 'NR', 'When his aging mob boss is whacked, Charlie Swift, a loyal friend and hired gun, will stop at nothing to destroy the upcoming crew that took him out.', 'When his aging mob boss is whacked, Charlie Swift, a loyal friend and hired gun, will stop at nothing to destroy the upcoming crew that took him out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3y72ffwYRUPOj4yOQbiTaN897Tm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945937'),
  ('919319816104206072', 'Fast Charlie... the Moonbeam Rider', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Steve Carver, David McGiffert, Lewis Teague', 'Michael Gleason', 'David Carradine, Brenda Vaccaro, L.Q. Jones, R.G. Armstrong, Terry Kiser, Jesse Vint, Noble Willingham, Ralph James', 'PG', 'A World War I deserter competes in the first long-distance motorcycle race.', 'A World War I deserter competes in the first long-distance motorcycle race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzDOS1uNgs8e6q29Nd4krOyo9c7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84081'),
  ('13338031107916386', 'Fast Color', 2019, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Julia Hart, Michael Fimognari', 'Julia Hart, Jordan Horowitz', 'Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Saniyya Sidney, Lorraine Toussaint, David Strathairn, Christopher Denham, Ryan Begay, Matthew Van Wettering, Jermaine Washington', 'PG-13', 'A woman is forced to go on the run when her superhuman abilities are discovered. Years after having abandoned her family, the only place she has left to hide is home.', 'A woman is forced to go on the run when her superhuman abilities are discovered. Years after having abandoned her family, the only place she has left to hide is home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zZaZGMo23NsOGoGF5HRCPWwWN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450487'),
  ('928296976667403933', 'Fast Company', 1938, 'Mystery, Comedy, Romance', 'Gabriel Scognamillo, Douglas Shearer, Edwin B. Willis', 'Harold Tarshis, Harry Kurnitz', 'Melvyn Douglas, Florence Rice, Claire Dodd, Shepperd Strudwick, Louis Calhern, Nat Pendleton, Douglass Dumbrille, Mary Howard', 'NR', 'Married book-dealers Joel & Garda Sloane try to clear a friend in the murder of a rival book-seller.', 'Married book-dealers Joel & Garda Sloane try to clear a friend in the murder of a rival book-seller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGtUiGb9TYQIo2cPJhXM5Hk88TL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183175'),
  ('974822089804203789', 'Fast Company', 1979, 'Drama, Action', 'David Cronenberg, Mark Irwin, Jimmy Kaufman', 'Nicholas Campbell', 'William Smith, Claudia Jennings, John Saxon, Nicholas Campbell, Don Francks, Cedric Smith, Judy Foster, Robert Haley', 'R', 'An over the hill drag racer finds himself considering retirement and ceding the spotlight to his protégé and targeted for replacement by the oil-company executive who sponsors his team.', 'An over the hill drag racer finds himself considering retirement and ceding the spotlight to his protégé and targeted for replacement by the oil-company executive who sponsors his team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNpBNzzLUPl1df3nCUhEvfNzOEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38493'),
  ('99274369716251595', 'Fast Convoy', 2016, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Vincent Gallot, Yvon Crenn, Thierry Mauvoisin', 'Frédéric Schoendoerffer, Yann Brion', 'Benoît Magimel, Reem Kherici, Tewfik Jallab, Sofian Khammes, Amir el Kacem, Léon Garel, Foëd Amara, Mahdi Belemlih', null, 'Málaga, southern Spain. Seven men, divided into four cars, set off with a large drug shipment towards Creil, a city near Paris; a routine mission that will be complicated by a fatal sequence of events.', 'Málaga, southern Spain. Seven men, divided into four cars, set off with a large drug shipment towards Creil, a city near Paris; a routine mission that will be complicated by a fatal sequence of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CwMxCDRIFnei0S7BtJOxwiotSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375946'),
  ('428620194812543528', 'Fast Film', 2003, 'Adventure, Animation', 'Virgil Widrich, Martin Putz', 'Virgil Widrich', null, null, 'Bits of found film and different types of animation illustrate a classic chase scene scenario: A woman is abducted and a man comes to her rescue, but during their escape they find themselves in the enemy''s secret headquarters.', 'Bits of found film and different types of animation illustrate a classic chase scene scenario: A woman is abducted and a man comes to her rescue, but during their escape they find themselves in the enemy''s secret headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doTQV0qE70xQiVilfatXxX2veUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51887'),
  ('1000740648553853457', 'Fast Five', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Justin Lin, Stephen F. Windon, A. Todd Holland', 'Chris Morgan', 'Vin Diesel, Paul Walker, Jordana Brewster, Tyrese Gibson, Ludacris, Matt Schulze, Sung Kang, Gal Gadot', 'PG-13', 'Former cop Brian O''Conner partners with ex-con Dom Toretto on the opposite side of the law. Since Brian and Mia Toretto broke Dom out of custody, they''ve blown across many borders to elude authorities. Now backed into a corner in Rio de Janeiro, they must pull one last job in order to gain their freedom.', 'Former cop Brian O''Conner partners with ex-con Dom Toretto on the opposite side of the law. Since Brian and Mia Toretto broke Dom out of custody, they''ve blown across many borders to elude authorities. Now backed into a corner in Rio de Janeiro, they must pull one last job in order to gain their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEfQjjQwY7fh5bI4GlG0RrBu7Pz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51497'),
  ('803503520502753365', 'Fast Food', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Catherine Murphy, Dan Coffie, Jerry Pece', 'Lanny Horn, Clark Brandon', 'Clark Brandon, Tracy Griffith, Randal Patrick, Lanny Horn, Blake Clark, Pamela Springsteen, Traci Lords, Kevin McCarthy', 'PG-13', 'Auggie and his pals are living it up as perpetual college students. When the dean decides teh only way to stop their schemes and antics is to graduate them, they have to go out and find real work. Auggie hears that Samantha is planning on selling her father''s garage to fast food king Wrangler Bob, and comes up with one final scheme; a risky bank loan to turn the garage into stiff competition for Bob. When it looks like Bob will win after all, they develop a very special sauce that keeps the crowds coming because it has the effect of being an aphrodisiac. Bob doesn''t like to lose, so he sends his "spy" Dixie Love to infiltrate the restaurant and find out their secret. The ensuing FDA investigation culminates into a hilarious case of disorder in the court!', 'Auggie and his pals are living it up as perpetual college students. When the dean decides teh only way to stop their schemes and antics is to graduate them, they have to go out and find real work. Auggie hears that Samantha is planning on selling her father''s garage to fast food king Wrangler Bob, and comes up with one final scheme; a risky bank loan to turn the garage into stiff competition for Bob. When it looks like Bob will win after all, they develop a very special sauce that keeps the crowds coming because it has the effect of being an aphrodisiac. Bob doesn''t like to lose, so he sends his "spy" Dixie Love to infiltrate the restaurant and find out their secret. The ensuing FDA investigation culminates into a hilarious case of disorder in the court!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6qggt7kKFAQQ93SDGgTDJjdJnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71847'),
  ('376819193108830387', 'Fast Food Fast Women', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Amos Kollek, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Amos Kollek', 'Anna Thomson, Jamie Harris, Louise Lasser, Robert Modica, Lonette McKee, Victor Argo, Angelica Page, Austin Pendleton', 'R', 'How important is the truth when falling in love? Bella is a Manhattan café waitress, about to turn 35, stuck in a long-term affair going nowhere. Paul is a widower, facing old age alone. Bella''s mother sets her up with Bruno, a novelist/cabbie who likes to bed-hop and whose ex-wife expects their two children to stay with him for awhile. While Bruno learns some maturity from his young daughter, Paul answers a personals ad placed by a "widow, 60." The two couples - along with one of Paul''s older pals and a Jungian stripper - sort out how to initiate a relationship these days, what to do when someone you like disappoints you, and when to tell the truth.', 'How important is the truth when falling in love? Bella is a Manhattan café waitress, about to turn 35, stuck in a long-term affair going nowhere. Paul is a widower, facing old age alone. Bella''s mother sets her up with Bruno, a novelist/cabbie who likes to bed-hop and whose ex-wife expects their two children to stay with him for awhile. While Bruno learns some maturity from his young daughter, Paul answers a personals ad placed by a "widow, 60." The two couples - along with one of Paul''s older pals and a Jungian stripper - sort out how to initiate a relationship these days, what to do when someone you like disappoints you, and when to tell the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJuz51a3Whsh8mTRxXnaSzuXrRQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49453'),
  ('675506426864740029', 'Fast Food Nation', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Daniel, Richard Linklater', 'Richard Linklater', 'Greg Kinnear, Bobby Cannavale, Paul Dano, Luis Guzmán, Ashley Johnson, Kris Kristofferson, Patricia Arquette, Ethan Hawke', 'R', 'A dramatised examination of the health issues and social consequences of America''s love affair with fast food.', 'A dramatised examination of the health issues and social consequences of America''s love affair with fast food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcRgWIj4p6FtezgZTl4YoxYbSJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8324'),
  ('971748660839238267', 'Fast Forever', 2028, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Louis Leterrier', 'Christina Hodson, Oren Uziel, Zach Dean', 'Vin Diesel', 'PG-13', 'The eleventh and final installment in The Fast Saga. Plot TBA.', 'The eleventh and final installment in The Fast Saga. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaRzhQZ3zK5lN6vEetG8PD17KPF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755679'),
  ('1020509248521123553', 'Fast Forward', 1985, 'Music, Drama', 'Sidney Poitier, Candace Allen, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'Richard Wesley', 'John Scott Clough, Don Franklin, Tamara Mark, Tracy Silver, Cindy McGee, Gretchen Palmer, Monique Cintron, Debra Varnado', 'PG', 'Eight young people from Ohio who are dancers, come to New York, to compete in a major talent competition. But when they get there, they learn that they have to wait some time before they take part in it. So they try to do their best to survive in the Big Apple before competition, and get some lessons about the real World.', 'Eight young people from Ohio who are dancers, come to New York, to compete in a major talent competition. But when they get there, they learn that they have to wait some time before they take part in it. So they try to do their best to survive in the Big Apple before competition, and get some lessons about the real World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PqsWAh4PaT6nBQ9e6Srv5aDmMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106350'),
  ('233520677423556322', 'Fast Getaway', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Spiro Razatos, Jacques Haitkin, Denise Strong', 'James Dixon', 'Corey Haim, Cynthia Rothrock, Leo Rossi, Ken Lerner, Marcia Strassman, Shelli Lether, Tabitha Thompson, Jack North', 'PG-13', 'A falling out within a bank robbing foursome splits up the group and pits a father and his sixteen-year-old son against their vengeful former partners.', 'A falling out within a bank robbing foursome splits up the group and pits a father and his sixteen-year-old son against their vengeful former partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRzHAhMHdGgOx00ir4D2Wy8gTXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34598'),
  ('762894457558423769', 'Fast Getaway II', 1994, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Oley Sassone', 'Mark Sevi', 'Corey Haim, Cynthia Rothrock, Leo Rossi, Sarah Buxton, Peter Liapis, Ken Lerner, Anthony T. Pennello, Nicholas Mele', 'PG-13', 'A former robber (whose partner was his father) has reformed and is now running an insurance business with his girlfriend. An ex-partner frames him for a burglary. When his father gets out of prison, they go after the ex-partner.', 'A former robber (whose partner was his father) has reformed and is now running an insurance business with his girlfriend. An ex-partner frames him for a burglary. When his father gets out of prison, they go after the ex-partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZfRArVTNSSxpioIqdrUqxC0JRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74240'),
  ('509819790688179077', 'Fast Girls', 2012, 'Drama', 'Regan Hall, John Lynch', 'Noel Clarke', 'Lily James, Lenora Crichlow, Noel Clarke, Bradley James, Rupert Graves, Phil Davis, Lorraine Burroughs, Tiana Benjamin', null, 'A street smart runner develops an intense rivalry with an equally ambitious wealthy young athlete.', 'A street smart runner develops an intense rivalry with an equally ambitious wealthy young athlete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrsIUs4esWv3oncNpRI4ERon4bF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113294'),
  ('284464061539120317', 'Fast Times at Ridgemont High', 1982, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, Amy Heckerling, Marty P. Ewing', 'Cameron Crowe', 'Sean Penn, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Judge Reinhold, Phoebe Cates, Brian Backer, Robert Romanus, Ray Walston, Scott Thomson', 'R', 'Based on the real-life adventures chronicled by Cameron Crowe, Fast Times follows a group of high school students growing up in Southern California. Stacy Hamilton and Mark Ratner are looking for love, and are helped along by their older classmates, Linda Barrett and Mike Damone. Jeff Spicoli, a perpetually stoned surfer faces-off with the resolute teacher, Mr. Hand. Hilarity and heartbreak ensue.', 'Based on the real-life adventures chronicled by Cameron Crowe, Fast Times follows a group of high school students growing up in Southern California. Stacy Hamilton and Mark Ratner are looking for love, and are helped along by their older classmates, Linda Barrett and Mike Damone. Jeff Spicoli, a perpetually stoned surfer faces-off with the resolute teacher, Mr. Hand. Hilarity and heartbreak ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1DA8H7qwoOcAEhow2rCzuQtpuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13342'),
  ('377634193262158976', 'Fast Track: No Limits', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Axel Sand, Axel Sand', null, 'Erin Cahill, Joseph Beattie, Andrew W. Walker, Alexia Barlier, Pasquale Aleardi, Maurice Roëves, Jack Bence, Shaun Prendergast', 'R', 'Four young thrill-seekers (Erin Cahill, Andrew Walker, Alexia Barlier) race cars on the streets of Germany.', 'Four young thrill-seekers (Erin Cahill, Andrew Walker, Alexia Barlier) race cars on the streets of Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTnstXEsEMvBUisyYlyAaOsMVV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17143'),
  ('35817269136728827', 'Fast X', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Louis Leterrier, Andrew Palmer, Chris Heap', 'Justin Lin, Dan Mazeau', 'Vin Diesel, Michelle Rodriguez, Tyrese Gibson, Ludacris, John Cena, Nathalie Emmanuel, Jordana Brewster, Sung Kang', 'PG-13', 'Over many missions and against impossible odds, Dom Toretto and his family have outsmarted, out-nerved and outdriven every foe in their path. Now, they confront the most lethal opponent they''ve ever faced: A terrifying threat emerging from the shadows of the past who''s fueled by blood revenge, and who is determined to shatter this family and destroy everything—and everyone—that Dom loves, forever.', 'Over many missions and against impossible odds, Dom Toretto and his family have outsmarted, out-nerved and outdriven every foe in their path. Now, they confront the most lethal opponent they''ve ever faced: A terrifying threat emerging from the shadows of the past who''s fueled by blood revenge, and who is determined to shatter this family and destroy everything—and everyone—that Dom loves, forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiVW06jE7z9YnO4trhaMEdclSiC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385687'),
  ('863786918865095780', 'Fast-Walking', 1982, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'James B. Harris, King Baggot', 'James B. Harris', 'James Woods, Tim McIntire, Kay Lenz, Robert Hooks, Charles Weldon, M. Emmet Walsh, Susan Tyrrell, John Friedrich', null, 'A dirty corrections officer gets involved in a murder plot involving one of the inmates.', 'A dirty corrections officer gets involved in a murder plot involving one of the inmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wFLKdfLW5qFrCDLIGMwSdhebhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45962'),
  ('869386339457450815', 'Fast, Cheap & Out of Control', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Errol Morris, Robert Richardson', null, 'Dave Hoover, George Mendonça, Raymond A. Mendez, Rodney Brooks', null, 'Errol Morris’s Fast, Cheap & Out of Control interweaves the stories of four men, each driven to create eccentric worlds from their unique obsessions, all of which involve animals. There’s a lion tamer who shares his theories on the mental processes of wild animals; a topiary gardener who has devoted a lifetime to shaping bears and giraffes out of hedges and trees; a man fascinated with hairless mole rats; and an MIT scientist who has designed complex, autonomous robots that can crawl like bugs.', 'Errol Morris’s Fast, Cheap & Out of Control interweaves the stories of four men, each driven to create eccentric worlds from their unique obsessions, all of which involve animals. There’s a lion tamer who shares his theories on the mental processes of wild animals; a topiary gardener who has devoted a lifetime to shaping bears and giraffes out of hedges and trees; a man fascinated with hairless mole rats; and an MIT scientist who has designed complex, autonomous robots that can crawl like bugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uXV6w3ZQUtefqjCgxXswCwPSjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25099'),
  ('564471787722147552', 'Fastball', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Jonathan Hock', 'Jonathan Hock', 'Kevin Costner, Hank Aaron, Nolan Ryan, Derek Jeter, Denard Span, Craig Kimbrel, Justin Verlander, Bryce Harper', null, 'Since 1912, baseball has been a game obsessed with statistics and speed. Thrown at upwards of 100 miles per hour, a fastball moves too quickly for human cognition and accelerates into the realm of intuition. Fastball is a look at how the game at its highest levels of achievement transcends logic and even skill, becoming the primal struggle for man to control the uncontrollable.', 'Since 1912, baseball has been a game obsessed with statistics and speed. Thrown at upwards of 100 miles per hour, a fastball moves too quickly for human cognition and accelerates into the realm of intuition. Fastball is a look at how the game at its highest levels of achievement transcends logic and even skill, becoming the primal struggle for man to control the uncontrollable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0PI2XUPrse8pNhu2MWlul6u1S7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330068'),
  ('490570930174759492', 'Fasten Your Seatbelt', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Ha Jung-woo, Kim Ho-sung, Lee Ho-hyun', 'Ha Jung-woo', 'Jung Kyung-ho, Kim Byeong-ok, Choi Gyu-hwan, Kim Ki-cheon, Son Hwa-ryeong, Ko Sung-hee, Na Hye-jin, Kim Ye-rang', null, 'Hallyu star Ma Joon-Gyu boards an airplane that will take him from Tokyo to Seoul, but the plane is soon swept up into a typhoon and faces danger.', 'Hallyu star Ma Joon-Gyu boards an airplane that will take him from Tokyo to Seoul, but the plane is soon swept up into a typhoon and faces danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahPYwG5FTXuINC6SFDbLLjtplvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228560'),
  ('935827158716870669', 'Fasten Your Seatbelts', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ferzan Özpetek', 'Ferzan Özpetek', 'Kasia Smutniak, Francesco Arca, Filippo Scicchitano, Carolina Crescentini, Elena Sofia Ricci, Francesco Scianna, Carla Signoris, Paola Minaccioni', null, 'Elena and Antonio seem not to be made for each other. They are too different in terms of character, life choices, worldview, and the way they relate to others. They are total opposites. However, they are overwhelmed by a mutual attraction they''re trying hard to avoid; but to which they succumb to.', 'Elena and Antonio seem not to be made for each other. They are too different in terms of character, life choices, worldview, and the way they relate to others. They are total opposites. However, they are overwhelmed by a mutual attraction they''re trying hard to avoid; but to which they succumb to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yDZUKQQLZQEPw1wRXS2ZNEsHqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258322'),
  ('932306503922203030', 'Fastening Days', 2014, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Hiroyasu Ishida, Hiroyasu Ishida, Hiroki Matsuoka', 'Junichi Tanaka', 'Fuyuka Ono, Ryoko Shiraishi, Sayuri Sadaoka, Aimi Tanaka, Aki Kanada, Isamu Yusen, Junko Takeuchi, Miyuki Satou', null, 'Yoji and Kei, a boy and girl, live in a town in the not-so-distant future with their foster parent, Anna. But these seemingly ordinary children have a secret hidden even from their unsuspecting mother. Yoji and Kei are superhero defenders of their town! With a flap of their capes, the two of them and their robot bear sidekick, Oscar, protect the citizens in their town with their handmade high-tech machinery. But from what menace? And will our little heroes be able to overcome the crisis about to threaten the town''s peaceful everyday serenity?', 'Yoji and Kei, a boy and girl, live in a town in the not-so-distant future with their foster parent, Anna. But these seemingly ordinary children have a secret hidden even from their unsuspecting mother. Yoji and Kei are superhero defenders of their town! With a flap of their capes, the two of them and their robot bear sidekick, Oscar, protect the citizens in their town with their handmade high-tech machinery. But from what menace? And will our little heroes be able to overcome the crisis about to threaten the town''s peaceful everyday serenity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2mvrLKx3zJcC3DRaLf6eQSjrwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410422'),
  ('1014581570313863885', 'Faster', 2003, 'Action, Documentary', 'Mark Neale, Grant Gee', 'Mark Neale', 'Ewan McGregor, Valentino Rossi, Max Biaggi, Garry McCoy, Mick Doohan', 'PG-13', 'Faster is an electrifying tribute to the white-knuckle world of MotoGP™ — the fastest sport on two wheels — where the world’s top riders go wheel to wheel at over 200mph and crash at over 100mph. Narrated by Ewan McGregor, Faster chases two seasons’ worth of the world championship, featuring revealing interviews with riders, mechanics, doctors, commentators and fans. If you want high octane, adrenaline fuelled thrills, Faster will take you on a nerve shredding journey through the most exciting sport on the planet!', 'Faster is an electrifying tribute to the white-knuckle world of MotoGP™ — the fastest sport on two wheels — where the world’s top riders go wheel to wheel at over 200mph and crash at over 100mph. Narrated by Ewan McGregor, Faster chases two seasons’ worth of the world championship, featuring revealing interviews with riders, mechanics, doctors, commentators and fans. If you want high octane, adrenaline fuelled thrills, Faster will take you on a nerve shredding journey through the most exciting sport on the planet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puHBmn28Cxx53q2GBNSx06GafYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30129'),
  ('532966187315506235', 'Faster', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'George Tillman Jr., Michael Grady, Ron Mason', 'Tony Gayton, Joe Gayton', 'Dwayne Johnson, Billy Bob Thornton, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Maggie Grace, Carla Gugino, Tom Berenger, Matt Gerald, Jeff Daniel Phillips', 'R', 'After 10 years in prison, Driver is now a free man with a single focus - hunting down the people responsible for brutally murdering his brother.', 'After 10 years in prison, Driver is now a free man with a single focus - hunting down the people responsible for brutally murdering his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsUeaXrhw4oscCSjUZ6heh1pVvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41283'),
  ('411172977055711145', 'Faster', 2025, 'Action, Romance, Drama', 'Morgan S. Dalibert, Charlotte Trunet, Vanille Colienne', 'Alban Lenoir, Morgan S. Dalibert', 'Paola Locatelli, Alban Lenoir, Anne Marivin, Tchéky Karyo, Rik Kleve, Mathilde La Musse, Jérémie Dethelot, Sébastien Lalanne', null, 'A former racer returns to the sport through a racing academy, where she meets Will. As they fall for each other, they become rivals competing for the Formula 1 championship, forcing her to choose between love and victory.', 'A former racer returns to the sport through a racing academy, where she meets Will. As they fall for each other, they become rivals competing for the Formula 1 championship, forcing her to choose between love and victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3JoVnSi9xmfYDwoEbclurKDQLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261504'),
  ('716136695680245522', 'Faster, Faster', 1981, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Saura, José López Rodero, José Luis García-Berlanga', 'Carlos Saura', 'Berta Socuellamos Zarco, José Antonio Valdelomar , Jesús Arias, José María Hervás, María del Mar Serrano, Consuelo Pascual, André Falcon, Yves Arcanel', null, 'Angela is a young waitress who turns her back on society when she meets and falls in love with Pablo, a reckless criminal delinquent. Along with Pablo’s gang of car thieves, the pair embark on a drug and disco-fueled robbery spree as they hurtle toward oblivion.', 'Angela is a young waitress who turns her back on society when she meets and falls in love with Pablo, a reckless criminal delinquent. Along with Pablo’s gang of car thieves, the pair embark on a drug and disco-fueled robbery spree as they hurtle toward oblivion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93aeKG6qQ2feWX2lAZcjUATYpwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47211'),
  ('596171913731552414', 'Faster, Pussycat! Kill! Kill!', 1965, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Comedy', 'Russ Meyer, Walter Schenk, George Costello', 'Jack Moran', 'Tura Satana, Haji, Lori Williams, Sue Bernard, Stuart Lancaster, Paul Trinka, Dennis Busch, Ray Barlow', 'NR', 'A trio of thrill-seeking go-go dancers kidnap a young girl and attempt to seduce an old rancher and his two sons out of their small fortune, but their scheme doesn''t play out as intended.', 'A trio of thrill-seeking go-go dancers kidnap a young girl and attempt to seduce an old rancher and his two sons out of their small fortune, but their scheme doesn''t play out as intended.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hIHFk52SZ9XsZB4U85RUq36BT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315'),
  ('1003732945911663383', 'Fastest', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Mark Neale, Jan Zabeil, Grant Gee', 'Mark Neale', 'Ewan McGregor, Valentino Rossi, Ben Spies, Jorge Lorenzo, Casey Stoner, Marco Simoncelli, Colin Edwards, Dani Pedrosa', null, 'What does it take to be the fastest? From award-winning filmmaker Mark Neale, comes Fastest, a spectacular maximum-speed, full-length documentary delving deep into the world of MotoGP™. This thrilling documentary, narrated by Ewan McGregor, highlights the thrills, spills and incredible commitment and courage the sport demands of it stars. With unprecedented behind-the-scenes access and never before seen angles, interviews and insight, this truly cinematic experience charts the exhilarating highs, crushing lows, career-threatening crashes and spectacular comebacks, including Rossi’s 41 days turn around to race following a leg shattering crash.', 'What does it take to be the fastest? From award-winning filmmaker Mark Neale, comes Fastest, a spectacular maximum-speed, full-length documentary delving deep into the world of MotoGP™. This thrilling documentary, narrated by Ewan McGregor, highlights the thrills, spills and incredible commitment and courage the sport demands of it stars. With unprecedented behind-the-scenes access and never before seen angles, interviews and insight, this truly cinematic experience charts the exhilarating highs, crushing lows, career-threatening crashes and spectacular comebacks, including Rossi’s 41 days turn around to race following a leg shattering crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NcYnLOIg8V2ysBbQdajcejL8jc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82914'),
  ('742754680488531955', 'Fastest with the Mostest', 1960, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Paul Julian', null, 'Wile E. Coyote tries to drop a rocket bomb on the Road Runner from a balloon but inflates himself instead.', 'Wile E. Coyote tries to drop a rocket bomb on the Road Runner from a balloon but inflates himself instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkEuGAOK9hd2HfCFLSQztFmyYQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234762'),
  ('532385043604863939', 'Fastlife', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Ngijol', 'Mohamed Issolah, Thomas Ngijol', 'Thomas Ngijol, Karole Rocher, Julien Boisselier, Olivier Marchal, Yasit Ait Hamoudi, Clément Moreau, Olivia Biffot, Kaaris', null, 'Fastlife: always go further, faster, to shine in the eyes of others: this is the motto of Franklin. Franklin is a megalomaniac obsessed by the desire to shine at any price. He will have to choose between becoming a man or continue to live the Fastlife...', 'Fastlife: always go further, faster, to shine in the eyes of others: this is the motto of Franklin. Franklin is a megalomaniac obsessed by the desire to shine at any price. He will have to choose between becoming a man or continue to live the Fastlife...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdzW7z9L1lKhVQ2uIESImGFaAWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280511'),
  ('924005238904024211', 'Fat Albert', 2004, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Joel Zwick, Paul Elliott', 'Bill Cosby, Charles Kipps', 'Kenan Thompson, Kyla Pratt, Dania Ramirez, Shedrack Anderson III, Jermaine Williams, Keith D. Robinson, Marques Houston, Aaron Frazier', 'PG', 'Animated character Fat Albert emerges from his TV universe into the real world, accompanied by his friends Rudy, Mushmouth, Old Weird Harold and Dumb Donald. Though the gang is flabbergasted by the modern world, they make new friends, and Albert attempts to help young Doris become popular. But things get complicated when Albert falls for her older sister, Lauri, and must turn to creator Bill Cosby for advice.', 'Animated character Fat Albert emerges from his TV universe into the real world, accompanied by his friends Rudy, Mushmouth, Old Weird Harold and Dumb Donald. Though the gang is flabbergasted by the modern world, they make new friends, and Albert attempts to help young Doris become popular. But things get complicated when Albert falls for her older sister, Lauri, and must turn to creator Bill Cosby for advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biA3teAO8xZQfdBfLIK9ATdfOkJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15045'),
  ('978836488747045029', 'Fat Ass Zombies', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'George J. Bennett', 'Christopher De Maria, George J. Bennett, Brave Matthews', 'Kayla Vosburg, Gregg Daniel, Kristen Renton, Sondra Currie, Thomas Calabro, Skyler Joy, Amber McNutt, Robert Johnson', 'NR', 'In a sleepy town, one man, a wannabe horror film director is about to have his life and the world he knows change forever. Finally, he gets the big break he has been waiting a lifetime for, but its not Hollywood knocking on his door.', 'In a sleepy town, one man, a wannabe horror film director is about to have his life and the world he knows change forever. Finally, he gets the big break he has been waiting a lifetime for, but its not Hollywood knocking on his door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2UCD7xwWFKucozkKcKBiCayJC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664168'),
  ('432874096805271354', 'Fat Buddies', 2018, 'Comedy, Action', 'Qin Pengfei, Chan Chi-Ying, Bao Bei''er', 'Peng Zhang', 'Wen Zhang, Bao Bei''er, Clara Lee, Guo Jingfei, Yasuaki Kurata, Qi Yuwu, Ryu Kohata, Song Jia', null, 'The film revolves around a pair of big-boned, bumbling cops who find themselves at the heart of a drug trafficking case. The agent "J" (Zhang Wen) was shot in the head during an A-level mission, causing damage to the intracranial hypothalamus. During the period of rehabilitating, J gradually became a big fat man of three hundred pounds and suffered from severe narcolepsy, but J still considered himself a ace agent. Finally, J received the task again and went to Japan to retrieve the confidential documents. After the file was obtained, J arbitrarily opened the file and decided to continue the task of hiding the organization for the organization, but he fainted in the izakaya. J who woke up in the hospital got to know the security guard Handsome Hao (Bei-Er Bao), Handsome Hao to prove that he is not a waste of nothing to resolutely join the mission. In the process of carrying out the task, the temporary partner has experienced the ridiculous and dangerous crisis of time over and over ...', 'The film revolves around a pair of big-boned, bumbling cops who find themselves at the heart of a drug trafficking case. The agent "J" (Zhang Wen) was shot in the head during an A-level mission, causing damage to the intracranial hypothalamus. During the period of rehabilitating, J gradually became a big fat man of three hundred pounds and suffered from severe narcolepsy, but J still considered himself a ace agent. Finally, J received the task again and went to Japan to retrieve the confidential documents. After the file was obtained, J arbitrarily opened the file and decided to continue the task of hiding the organization for the organization, but he fainted in the izakaya. J who woke up in the hospital got to know the security guard Handsome Hao (Bei-Er Bao), Handsome Hao to prove that he is not a waste of nothing to resolutely join the mission. In the process of carrying out the task, the temporary partner has experienced the ridiculous and dangerous crisis of time over and over ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ur0RfNlY829zcwwjz7AWG3ihFr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551777'),
  ('283584657396812443', 'Fat Choi Spirit', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Johnnie To, Wai Ka-Fai, Cheang Pou-Soi', 'Au Kin-Yee, Wai Ka-Fai, Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Andy Lau, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Louis Koo, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Cherrie Ying Choi-Yi, Wong Tin-Lam, Bonnie Wong Man-Wai, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong', null, 'Follows the adventures of a compulsive Mahjong player named Andy and his aging mother, estranged brother, loyal ex-girlfriend, and a local gang.', 'Follows the adventures of a compulsive Mahjong player named Andy and his aging mother, estranged brother, loyal ex-girlfriend, and a local gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ohzkBUG45YvMWJrRZUSgKoTeEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60282'),
  ('484578883973498177', 'Fat City', 1972, 'Drama', 'John Huston, Conrad Hall', 'Leonard Gardner', 'Stacy Keach, Jeff Bridges, Susan Tyrrell, Candy Clark, Nicholas Colasanto, Art Aragon, Curtis Cokes, Sixto Rodriguez', 'PG', 'Two men, working as professional boxers, come to blows when their careers each begin to take opposite momentum.', 'Two men, working as professional boxers, come to blows when their careers each begin to take opposite momentum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ag7BOMnAuDKwNyI0wc8jTeimRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16993'),
  ('115955126019153735', 'Fat Girl', 2001, 'Drama', 'Catherine Breillat, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Catherine Breillat', 'Anaïs Reboux, Roxane Mesquida, Libero De Rienzo, Arsinée Khanjian, Romain Goupil, Laura Betti, Albert Goldberg, Odette Barrière', 'NR', 'Anaïs is twelve and bears the weight of the world on her shoulders. She watches her older sister, Elena, whom she both loves and hates. Elena is fifteen and devilishly beautiful. Neither more futile, nor more stupid than her younger sister, she cannot understand that she is merely an object of desire. And, as such, she can only be taken. Or had. Indeed, this is the subject: a girl''s loss of virginity. And, that summer, it opens a door to tragedy.', 'Anaïs is twelve and bears the weight of the world on her shoulders. She watches her older sister, Elena, whom she both loves and hates. Elena is fifteen and devilishly beautiful. Neither more futile, nor more stupid than her younger sister, she cannot understand that she is merely an object of desire. And, as such, she can only be taken. Or had. Indeed, this is the subject: a girl''s loss of virginity. And, that summer, it opens a door to tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afzbY1h7huuxlITigPfcyQSkqLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570'),
  ('712422182050005426', 'Fat Head', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Tom Naughton', 'Tom Naughton', 'Tom Naughton, Chareva Naughton, Morgan Spurlock, Michael Eades, Gary Taubes, Peter Paddon, Sally Fallon Morell, Mary Enig', null, 'A comedian replies to the "Super Size Me" crowd by losing weight on a fast-food diet while demonstrating that almost everything you think you know about the obesity "epidemic" and healthy eating is wrong.', 'A comedian replies to the "Super Size Me" crowd by losing weight on a fast-food diet while demonstrating that almost everything you think you know about the obesity "epidemic" and healthy eating is wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIEEV2bqJfZXQcB79DzY1Okb9wD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36944'),
  ('1113554994044126258', 'Fat Man and Little Boy', 1989, 'Drama, History, War', 'Roland Joffé, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Bruce Robinson, Roland Joffé', 'Paul Newman, Dwight Schultz, Bonnie Bedelia, John Cusack, Laura Dern, Ron Frazier, John C. McGinley, Natasha Richardson', 'PG-13', 'Assigned to oversee the development of the atomic bomb, Gen. Leslie Groves is a stern military man determined to have the project go according to plan. He selects J. Robert Oppenheimer as the key scientist on the top-secret operation, but the two men clash fiercely on a number of issues. Despite their frequent conflicts, Groves and Oppenheimer ultimately push ahead with two bomb designs — the bigger "Fat Man" and the more streamlined "Little Boy."', 'Assigned to oversee the development of the atomic bomb, Gen. Leslie Groves is a stern military man determined to have the project go according to plan. He selects J. Robert Oppenheimer as the key scientist on the top-secret operation, but the two men clash fiercely on a number of issues. Despite their frequent conflicts, Groves and Oppenheimer ultimately push ahead with two bomb designs — the bigger "Fat Man" and the more streamlined "Little Boy."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CLeeHTMUesP8MCFt5phmdPSS5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27461'),
  ('1129645909832156938', 'Fat People', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo, Juan Carlos Gómez, Antton Zabala', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Antonio de la Torre, Roberto Enríquez, Verónica Sánchez, Raúl Arévalo, Leticia Herrero, Fernando Albizu, Pilar Castro, María Morales', null, 'Due to many reasons, ranging from insecurity to trauma, a group of people have gained a lot of weight in recent times.', 'Due to many reasons, ranging from insecurity to trauma, a group of people have gained a lot of weight in recent times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50PWvVJXnuZaOCthrdml01KPao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28478'),
  ('7927962575961703', 'Fat Pizza', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Paul Fenech, Mike Kliem', 'Tahir Bilgiç, Paul Fenech', 'Paul Fenech, Paul Nakad, Tahir Bilgiç, Jabba, John Boxer, Rob Shehadie, Annalise Braakensiek, Rebel Wilson', null, 'Fat Pizza is yet another slice of life at a dodgy suburban Sydney take away. Bobo Gigliotti the psychotic pizzeria owner/pizza chef is awaiting the arrival of his mail-order refugee bride Lin Chow Bang, and a new pizza deliverer is on the block. Channel V''s Jabba almost steals the show as token skip delivery boy Davo Dinkum, a stoner with a bong strapped to his face like a feedbag.', 'Fat Pizza is yet another slice of life at a dodgy suburban Sydney take away. Bobo Gigliotti the psychotic pizzeria owner/pizza chef is awaiting the arrival of his mail-order refugee bride Lin Chow Bang, and a new pizza deliverer is on the block. Channel V''s Jabba almost steals the show as token skip delivery boy Davo Dinkum, a stoner with a bong strapped to his face like a feedbag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liPJfjBKSn0UKQ1W2GTgfk07Rmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15603'),
  ('777672010403175320', 'Fat Slags', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Ed Bye, Andrea Slater, Paul Cathie', 'William Osborne', 'Fiona Allen, Sophie Thompson, Jerry O''Connell, Anthony Stewart Head, Geri Halliwell-Horner, James Dreyfus, Naomi Campbell, Hugh Dennis', 'NR', 'Leaving their hometown of Fulchester in the North of England, Sandra and Tracey head for the bright lights of London, shagging and boozing their way to fame and fortune.', 'Leaving their hometown of Fulchester in the North of England, Sandra and Tracey head for the bright lights of London, shagging and boozing their way to fame and fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysb1ys1JtBHjDC2CjS06xv74JLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31120'),
  ('154454458276299438', 'Fat, Sick & Nearly Dead', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Joe Cross, Kurt Engfehr', null, 'Joe Cross, Phil Riverstone, Amy Badberg, Merv Cross, Virginia Cross', 'NR', '100 pounds overweight, loaded up on steroids and suffering from a debilitating autoimmune disease, Joe Cross is at the end of his rope and the end of his hope. In the mirror he saw a 310lb man whose gut was bigger than a beach ball and a path laid out before him that wouldn''t end well— with one foot already in the grave, the other wasn''t far behind. FAT, SICK &amp; NEARLY DEAD is an inspiring film that chronicles Joe''s personal mission to regain his health.', '100 pounds overweight, loaded up on steroids and suffering from a debilitating autoimmune disease, Joe Cross is at the end of his rope and the end of his hope. In the mirror he saw a 310lb man whose gut was bigger than a beach ball and a path laid out before him that wouldn''t end well— with one foot already in the grave, the other wasn''t far behind. FAT, SICK &amp; NEARLY DEAD is an inspiring film that chronicles Joe''s personal mission to regain his health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKXRwMValA4ZbCaC68ANO24ALcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72914'),
  ('780116994126843094', 'Fata Morgana', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein', 'Werner Herzog', 'Lotte Eisner, Wolfgang Bächler, Manfred Eigendorf, Günther W. Welpert, Eugen des Montagnes, James William Gledhill, Wolfgang von Ungern-Sternberg', null, 'Shot under extreme conditions and inspired by Mayan creation theory, the film contemplates the illusion of reality and the possibility of capturing for the camera something which is not there. It is about the mirages of nature—and the nature of mirage.', 'Shot under extreme conditions and inspired by Mayan creation theory, the film contemplates the illusion of reality and the possibility of capturing for the camera something which is not there. It is about the mirages of nature—and the nature of mirage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26rRMt2qdVzcppDXCPF0SeZeU5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55624'),
  ('100863940733148664', 'Fatal', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Michaël Youn, Lionel Steketee, Nicolas Bolduc', 'Isabelle Funaro, Michaël Youn, Jurij Prette', 'Michaël Youn, Stéphane Rousseau, Armelle, Ary Abittan, Vincent Desagnat, Jérôme Le Banner, Jean Benguigui, Niels Schneider', null, 'Fatal... short for Fatal Bazooka, a hardcore bling-bling rapper. A huge music star. Millions of fans, tons of hits, 4 Artist Of The Year Music Awards of Music, a fashion line, a magazine, and soon his own amusement park: Fataland. He is the undisputed number one, until...', 'Fatal... short for Fatal Bazooka, a hardcore bling-bling rapper. A huge music star. Millions of fans, tons of hits, 4 Artist Of The Year Music Awards of Music, a fashion line, a magazine, and soon his own amusement park: Fataland. He is the undisputed number one, until...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36bGGHNevGu8R7uq0dFxSdbSlqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45535'),
  ('1020827880781935541', 'Fatal Affair', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Eitan Almagor, Daniel Ringey, Peter Sullivan', 'Peter Sullivan, Rasheeda Garner', 'Nia Long, Omar Epps, Stephen Bishop, Aubrey Cleland, Maya Stojan, KJ Smith, Jason-Shane Scott, Carolyn Hennesy', null, 'After a brief encounter with David Hammond, an old college friend, successful lawyer Ellie Warren tries to mend her marriage with her husband Marcus. But she finds herself caught in a terrifying game of cat and mouse when the encounter escalates into an obsession that jeopardizes everyone she loves.', 'After a brief encounter with David Hammond, an old college friend, successful lawyer Ellie Warren tries to mend her marriage with her husband Marcus. But she finds herself caught in a terrifying game of cat and mouse when the encounter escalates into an obsession that jeopardizes everyone she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4EAJ6PXNbxBb2xrdTrT2SlJlCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714375'),
  ('559532355255493949', 'Fatal Attraction', 1987, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Adrian Lyne, Howard Atherton, Jane Paul', 'James Dearden', 'Michael Douglas, Glenn Close, Anne Archer, Ellen Hamilton Latzen, Stuart Pankin, Ellen Foley, Fred Gwynne, Tom Brennan', 'R', 'A married man''s one-night stand comes back to haunt him when that lover begins to stalk him and his family.', 'A married man''s one-night stand comes back to haunt him when that lover begins to stalk him and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjB9XwJKnYqFKKjhWcE6WpAf5Ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10998'),
  ('270696157064587116', 'Fatal Beauty', 1987, 'Action, Comedy', 'David M. Walsh, Tom Holland', 'Dean Riesner, Hilary Henkin', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Sam Elliott, Rubén Blades, Harris Yulin, John P. Ryan, Jennifer Warren, Brad Dourif, Mike Jolly', 'R', 'Detective Rita Rizzoli is accustomed to donning costumes and going undercover to nail crooks. But she''ll be required to use all of her get-ups and more when a major cocaine ring is suspected of turning out a potent new strain of the drug, called "Fatal Beauty." With the help of her partner and a former bodyguard for a local cartel, Rita will do whatever it takes to find out who''s dealing Fatal Beauty and stop them.', 'Detective Rita Rizzoli is accustomed to donning costumes and going undercover to nail crooks. But she''ll be required to use all of her get-ups and more when a major cocaine ring is suspected of turning out a potent new strain of the drug, called "Fatal Beauty." With the help of her partner and a former bodyguard for a local cartel, Rita will do whatever it takes to find out who''s dealing Fatal Beauty and stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGyz0mSsl1G4GHeGyj6HWlpVJMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35463'),
  ('524716714015709190', 'Fatal Bond', 1991, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ray Henman, Robin Newell, Andrew Timlin', 'Phillip Avalon', 'Linda Blair, Jerome Ehlers, Stephen Leeder, Joe Bugner, Caz Lederman, Donal Gibson, Teo Gebert, Penny Pederson', 'R', 'A young woman takes off with a charming stranger in Australia, then begins to think he''s a killer.', 'A young woman takes off with a charming stranger in Australia, then begins to think he''s a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHSX415053wnNNeTKX1ww07W9Kl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128795'),
  ('862159836101054032', 'Fatal Charm', 1990, 'Thriller, Crime, TV Movie', 'Jeff Shiffman, Richard Oswald, Fritz Kiersch', 'Nicholas Niciphor', 'Christopher Atkins, Amanda Peterson, Mary Frann, James Remar, Peggy Lipton, Andrew Robinson, Lar Park Lincoln, Robert Walker Jr.', null, 'Valerie''s prosecutor mom is trying to put away Adam, an alleged serial killer on trial for murdering six women. But he''s so charming that the teenage Valerie just can''t believe he really did it, and soon they begin sending each other letters. Adam is caught up in a jailbreak and ends up on the run.', 'Valerie''s prosecutor mom is trying to put away Adam, an alleged serial killer on trial for murdering six women. But he''s so charming that the teenage Valerie just can''t believe he really did it, and soon they begin sending each other letters. Adam is caught up in a jailbreak and ends up on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4L6nkMdlbiGfJ5vfL5tl3XFrU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182497'),
  ('741408825688105853', 'Fatal Contact', 2006, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Dennis Law Sau-Yiu, Herman Yau', 'Dennis Law Sau-Yiu', 'Wu Jing, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Miki Yeung Oi-Gan, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Andy On Chi-Kit, Lam Suet, Timmy Hung Tin-Ming', null, 'A young man learns the fighting techniques of Sanda from a coach. The two become best friends as the young man prepares to enter an underground tournament, competing against some of the top fighters of the world.', 'A young man learns the fighting techniques of Sanda from a coach. The two become best friends as the young man prepares to enter an underground tournament, competing against some of the top fighters of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koUrJtsoeKH5z63554SXWCl2b1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30942'),
  ('880495228886793165', 'Fatal Contact: Bird Flu in America', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Richard Pearce', 'Ron McGee', 'Joely Richardson, Justina Machado, Ann Cusack, Scott Cohen, David Ramsey, Peter O''Brien, Carolyn Dando, Kate Butler', null, 'An outbreak of avian flu mutates into a virus that becomes transmittable from human to human.', 'An outbreak of avian flu mutates into a virus that becomes transmittable from human to human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EDTJ2c0yx6tY1BJJCv2VJZ0PTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24676'),
  ('53178562598286658', 'Fatal Error', 1979, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Wim Verstappen, Marc Felperlaan, Hans Scheepmaker', 'Wim Verstappen', 'Rijk de Gooyer, Rutger Hauer, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Donald Jones, Frederik de Groot, Jan Retèl, Hans Croiset, Marjan Berk', null, 'Detectives Grijpstra and De Gier are sent to investigate the case of a man who apparently hanged himself in a center for oriental meditation. It is ruled as suicide and the case seems to be closed, but the same night there is an attempted break in. The investigation hits a dead end and everyone involved is a suspect. Based on the book "The Corpse in the Haarlemmer Houttuinen” by Jan-Willem van de Wetering.', 'Detectives Grijpstra and De Gier are sent to investigate the case of a man who apparently hanged himself in a center for oriental meditation. It is ruled as suicide and the case seems to be closed, but the same night there is an attempted break in. The investigation hits a dead end and everyone involved is a suspect. Based on the book "The Corpse in the Haarlemmer Houttuinen” by Jan-Willem van de Wetering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PAbJYeU4QsJ2WWb6cpAsVxWnGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96603'),
  ('101653863993659466', 'Fatal Error', 1999, 'Mystery, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Armand Mastroianni, David Geddes', null, 'Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Janine Turner, Robert Wagner, Jason Schombing, Malcolm Stewart', null, 'Seven executives die while on a video conference call, the victims of a rapidly spreading virus. Dr. Samantha Craig (Janine Turner) and disgraced doctor Nick Baldwin (Antonio Sabato Jr.) investigate, tracking the disease to a rival firm able to spread computer viruses to humans. They also discover the virus has killed before and is continuing on its deadly path, unless someone can stop it.', 'Seven executives die while on a video conference call, the victims of a rapidly spreading virus. Dr. Samantha Craig (Janine Turner) and disgraced doctor Nick Baldwin (Antonio Sabato Jr.) investigate, tracking the disease to a rival firm able to spread computer viruses to humans. They also discover the virus has killed before and is continuing on its deadly path, unless someone can stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRBBZ2gQnk8PAl52MWSpXk7YX4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55186'),
  ('196877835732252058', 'Fatal Exam', 1990, 'Horror', 'Jack Snyder', 'Jack Snyder', 'Mike Coleman, Terry Comer, Carol Fitzgerald Carlberg, Paul Steger, Gilio Gherardini, Joe Midyett, Maureen Lampert, Greg Rhodes', 'R', 'A group of parapsychology students, as part of their final project, head to a secluded house where a man murdered his entire family. Soon, they discover the dark and terrible secrets that lie within.', 'A group of parapsychology students, as part of their final project, head to a secluded house where a man murdered his entire family. Soon, they discover the dark and terrible secrets that lie within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vo1ff7yb0ZhiR7cSl2FijL7MKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291110'),
  ('269346560800844206', 'Fatal Exposure', 1989, 'Crime, Horror', 'Peter B. Good, Peter B. Good', 'Christopher Painter', 'Blake Bahner, Ena Henderson, Dan Schmale, Julie Austin, Renée Cline, Gary Wise, Marc Griggs, Jah Riley', 'R', 'The great grandson of the infamous Jack The Ripper is a photographer who murders women in bizarre ways. He photographs them and drinks their blood in order to increase his sexual potency. One day, he meets the girl of his dreams to carry on the family name, but he uses her to lure in more female models to murder and add to his collection. With the body count rising, Erica is unaware of her new boyfriend''s hobby, and soon he starts making mistakes.', 'The great grandson of the infamous Jack The Ripper is a photographer who murders women in bizarre ways. He photographs them and drinks their blood in order to increase his sexual potency. One day, he meets the girl of his dreams to carry on the family name, but he uses her to lure in more female models to murder and add to his collection. With the body count rising, Erica is unaware of her new boyfriend''s hobby, and soon he starts making mistakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWUndFx1ZohjHbknivf0TKwozPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201870'),
  ('408480097669007444', 'Fatal Frame', 2014, 'Horror', 'Mari Asato, Yuta Tsukinaga, Atsushi Unno', 'Mari Asato', 'Ayami Nakajo, Aoi Morikawa, Fujiko Kojima, Karen Miyama, Kasumi Yamaya, Minori Hagiwara, Yuri Nakamura, Kodai Asaka', null, 'High school student Aya Tsukimori becomes cursed and is unable to leave her school dormitory. Meanwhile, many students begin reporting ghost sightings at the school, while others go missing and are later discovered to have drowned mysteriously. Soon, Aya attempts to communicate with fellow student Michi Kazato, who begins investigating the disappearances of her friends.', 'High school student Aya Tsukimori becomes cursed and is unable to leave her school dormitory. Meanwhile, many students begin reporting ghost sightings at the school, while others go missing and are later discovered to have drowned mysteriously. Soon, Aya attempts to communicate with fellow student Michi Kazato, who begins investigating the disappearances of her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b21MIHLMhidIrZpTZlvHNhGGrAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297186'),
  ('100045510583515489', 'Fatal Frames', 1996, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Al Festa, Giuseppe Bernardini, Luigi Boscaino', 'Alessandro Monese', 'Stefania Stella, Rick Gianasi, David Warbeck, Ugo Pagliai, Leo Daniel, Alida Valli, Geoffrey Copleston, Linnea Quigley', null, 'Alex Ritt, a music video director comes to Italy to direct a video for pop sensation Stefania Stella. He soon encounters a mysterious killer who videotapes his victims for the police. As the horrible murders continue, Ritt is unknowingly pushed into the killer''s games and he soon becomes a target of the police. The video-killer is on the loose and Ritt must find out the truth before it''s too late.', 'Alex Ritt, a music video director comes to Italy to direct a video for pop sensation Stefania Stella. He soon encounters a mysterious killer who videotapes his victims for the police. As the horrible murders continue, Ritt is unknowingly pushed into the killer''s games and he soon becomes a target of the police. The video-killer is on the loose and Ritt must find out the truth before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCCtBCgcRf6gfjV77Z1g35B1hFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28788'),
  ('484742289160135267', 'Fatal Fury 2: The New Battle', 1993, 'Action, Animation', 'Kazuhiro Furuhashi, Hirotoshi Takaya, Kazuto Nakazawa', 'Takashi Yamada', 'Kazukiyo Nishikiori, Keiichi Nanba, Kotono Mitsuishi, Masami Kikuchi, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Daiki Nakamura, Hidekatsu Shibata', null, 'Terry is fighting abroad when a boy named Tony, who wants to be Terry''s student, follows him despite his mother and Terry''s wishes. When Terry Bogard is defeated by a foe more powerful than he''s ever seen before, Terry falls into depression and turns to the bottle. While his friends go after this new foe, Tony must restore Terry''s faith... and once he realizes that only he can defeat this ruthless fiend.', 'Terry is fighting abroad when a boy named Tony, who wants to be Terry''s student, follows him despite his mother and Terry''s wishes. When Terry Bogard is defeated by a foe more powerful than he''s ever seen before, Terry falls into depression and turns to the bottle. While his friends go after this new foe, Tony must restore Terry''s faith... and once he realizes that only he can defeat this ruthless fiend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4EuF7jGgAWJirjqzEAJTk3T3Uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72016'),
  ('882566764164688423', 'Fatal Fury: Legend of the Hungry Wolf', 1992, 'Action, Animation', 'Hiroshi Fukutomi, Seiichi Morishita, Tatsuya Tomaru', 'Takashi Yamada', 'Kazukiyo Nishikiori, Keiichi Nanba, Masaaki Satake, Daiki Nakamura, Hidekatsu Shibata, Kikuko Inoue, Koji Yada, Etsuko Nishimoto', null, 'Terry Bogard''s father was murdered by a man named Geese Howard for the purpose of retrieving an ancient manual on martial arts. When Terry grows up he is driven by hatred to avenge his father''s death, but must overcome this hatred if he is to complete his training on how to defeat Geese Howard.', 'Terry Bogard''s father was murdered by a man named Geese Howard for the purpose of retrieving an ancient manual on martial arts. When Terry grows up he is driven by hatred to avenge his father''s death, but must overcome this hatred if he is to complete his training on how to defeat Geese Howard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fD2rU6Q1P2hjQ5196acuPwyQFPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72015'),
  ('712937702737772262', 'Fatal Fury: The Motion Picture', 1994, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy', 'Masami Obari, Takehiro Nakayama, Kazuto Nakazawa', 'Yuji Matsumoto', 'Kazukiyo Nishikiori, Keiichi Nanba, Kotono Mitsuishi, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Shin-ichiro Miki, Tomo Sakurai, Chafurin, Kikuko Inoue', null, 'The Armor of Mars -- a suit of armor consisting of six pieces. If anyone from the bloodline of the ancient warrior Godimus were to find all six pieces for himself, he would receive power equal to the level of a god. The Curse of Godimus, however, also dictates that this same person would lose all sense of himself and become an insane killing machine.', 'The Armor of Mars -- a suit of armor consisting of six pieces. If anyone from the bloodline of the ancient warrior Godimus were to find all six pieces for himself, he would receive power equal to the level of a god. The Curse of Godimus, however, also dictates that this same person would lose all sense of himself and become an insane killing machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9s3eqjjRyAK8E9jyPTm14BiZfae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28697'),
  ('691819645608347132', 'Fatal Games', 1984, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Elliot, Alfred Taylor', 'Rafael Buñuel, Michael Elliot, Christopher Mankiewicz', 'Sally Kirkland, Lynn Banashek, Sean Masterson, Michael O''Leary, Teal Roberts, Spice Williams-Crosby, Melissa Prophet, Angela Bennett', 'R', 'The young athletes of Falcon Academy are training hard to earn their place in the nationals. But when these burgeoning sports stars start disappearing one after the other, Dr. Jordine and his team - who’ve started plying their athletes with new and untested performance-enhancing drugs - are baffled.', 'The young athletes of Falcon Academy are training hard to earn their place in the nationals. But when these burgeoning sports stars start disappearing one after the other, Dr. Jordine and his team - who’ve started plying their athletes with new and untested performance-enhancing drugs - are baffled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ws6JO9PwToGTfxj6X41rZBoh8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30706'),
  ('688444188389431911', 'Fatal Instinct', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Carl Reiner, Gabriel Beristain, M. James Arnett', 'David O''Malley', 'Armand Assante, Sherilyn Fenn, Kate Nelligan, Sean Young, Christopher McDonald, James Remar, Tony Randall, Clarence Clemons', 'PG-13', 'Ned Ravine is a police officer and lawyer who occasionally defends the delinquents he arrests. He crosses paths with seductive Lola Cain during an assignment and promptly begins an affair with her. Meanwhile, Ned''s wife, Lana, is deep in an affair of her own. Lana and her lover are planning to murder Ned in an elaborate fashion so they can collect on his triple indemnity life insurance policy.', 'Ned Ravine is a police officer and lawyer who occasionally defends the delinquents he arrests. He crosses paths with seductive Lola Cain during an assignment and promptly begins an affair with her. Meanwhile, Ned''s wife, Lana, is deep in an affair of her own. Lana and her lover are planning to murder Ned in an elaborate fashion so they can collect on his triple indemnity life insurance policy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syewFnehGbbya5BdxoHLzrcm5Ne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26141'),
  ('231909842285334383', 'Fatal Intuition', 2015, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Yun Jun-hyung, Park Si-hwan, Lee Jae-hyeok', 'Kim Young Kab, Hwang Jo-yoon, Kim Min-seo', 'Joo Won, Yoo Hai-jin, Lee You-young, Ryu Hye-young, Min Sung-wook, Seo Hyun-woo, Lee Jun-hyeok, Jang In-sub', null, 'Desperate for revenge, a young man enlists the aid of a medium to help him track down his sister''s killer.', 'Desperate for revenge, a young man enlists the aid of a medium to help him track down his sister''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHbamrUbEkTv3cB7zNvSnmWzO6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369443'),
  ('802235140708886330', 'Fatal Journey', 2020, 'Action, History, Drama, Fantasy', 'Qiu Zhongwei', null, 'Ji Li, Wang Yizhou, Zhu Zanjin, Xiang He, He Junhao, Zhou Lu', null, 'The story is set in when Qinghe Nie Sect was dealing with their ancestral knife tomb incident. Nie Mingjue brought Nie Huaisang alone to do good for others by restoring the tomb back to its original state to ensure peace in the Nie sect. Through this, Nie Huaisang went from a playful disciple to maturing into the next generation sect leader and Nie Mingjue learned, understood his brother more and helped him grow.', 'The story is set in when Qinghe Nie Sect was dealing with their ancestral knife tomb incident. Nie Mingjue brought Nie Huaisang alone to do good for others by restoring the tomb back to its original state to ensure peace in the Nie sect. Through this, Nie Huaisang went from a playful disciple to maturing into the next generation sect leader and Nie Mingjue learned, understood his brother more and helped him grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1FStxEKtXvFz3oAyGVPVghj4yI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683022'),
  ('1090666027459338523', 'Fatal Mission', 1990, 'War, Action, Adventure', 'Phil Parmet, George Rowe', 'Peter Fonda, Chosei Funahara', 'Peter Fonda, Tia Carrere, Mako, Ted Markland, James Mitchum', 'R', 'A CIA Agent must rely on reluctant help from a female spy in the North Vietnam jungle in order to pass through enemy lines.', 'A CIA Agent must rely on reluctant help from a female spy in the North Vietnam jungle in order to pass through enemy lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5YFPYOjVHSRWoaKPjCZiRP0ULJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138878'),
  ('289026721169583832', 'Fatal Nightmare', 1991, 'Horror', 'René Cardona III', null, 'Tatiana, Nuria Bages, Arsenio Campos, Patricia Álvarez, José Manuel Fernández, Alicia del Lago, Guillermo Quintanilla, Ofelia D''Rosas', null, 'When a young blind woman''s father is brutally murdered her life will never be the same... The murderer is now after her!', 'When a young blind woman''s father is brutally murdered her life will never be the same... The murderer is now after her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84pHcwdkt5qZmMS6L7NLXjRbGle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324075'),
  ('804873047368385374', 'Fatal Romance', 2010, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'Benoît d''Aubert', 'Alain Brunard, Yann Le Gal', 'Grégory Fitoussi, Nadia Fossier, Mathieu Lardier, Thierry Hancisse, Barbara Schulz', null, 'Alice is a family woman who begins an adulterous affair with a writer. They see hidden but one day he does not appear at the rendezvous. What Alice does not know is that behind the disappearance is her husband, who knows the ripples of his wife.', 'Alice is a family woman who begins an adulterous affair with a writer. They see hidden but one day he does not appear at the rendezvous. What Alice does not know is that behind the disappearance is her husband, who knows the ripples of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVPYAW4qxXVjujgIGJEQoLKob3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117864'),
  ('940473181956870621', 'Fatal Termination', 1990, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Patrick Jim, Ridley Tsui Bo-Wah, Paul Wong Kwan', 'Pang Chi-Ming', 'Ray Lui, Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Simon Yam, Robin Shou, Phillip Ko Fai, Chan Cheuk-Yan, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Cheung Chi-Tak', null, 'A Hong Kong police detective investigating weapons smuggling through the airport runs into a corrupt customs officer. Things escalate to a ruthless munitions smuggler kidnapping two security officers'' daughter.', 'A Hong Kong police detective investigating weapons smuggling through the airport runs into a corrupt customs officer. Things escalate to a ruthless munitions smuggler kidnapping two security officers'' daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cscoIcUWwB3lLFaG4Lb8uMtIqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45405'),
  ('56057032199380332', 'Fatal Vacation', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Nam Yin', 'Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Irene Wan, Tang Pik-Wan, Victor Wong, Tommy Wong, Joan Tong Lai-Kau, Cecilia Yiu Ching-Ching, Emily Kwan Bo-Wai', null, 'A pleasent trip to the Phillipines is turned into tragedy when the tour bus is kidnapped by a group of rebels that want to exchange the prisoners for the Rebel Leader''s brother...', 'A pleasent trip to the Phillipines is turned into tragedy when the tour bus is kidnapped by a group of rebels that want to exchange the prisoners for the Rebel Leader''s brother...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Qiiq88ynNvufkGUmTQ2Lc5Yejs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147755'),
  ('517010317878024433', 'Fatale', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dante Spinotti, Deon Taylor, Carl Goldstein', 'David Loughery', 'Hilary Swank, Michael Ealy, Mike Colter, Damaris Lewis, Tyrin Turner, Danny Pino, Geoffrey Owens, David Hoflin', 'R', 'After a wild one-night stand, successful sports agent Derrick Tyler watches his perfect life slowly disappear when he discovers the sexy and mysterious woman he risked everything for is determined police detective Valerie Quinlan who entangles him in her latest investigation. As he desperately tries to put the pieces together, he falls deeper into her trap, risking his family, his career, and even his life.', 'After a wild one-night stand, successful sports agent Derrick Tyler watches his perfect life slowly disappear when he discovers the sexy and mysterious woman he risked everything for is determined police detective Valerie Quinlan who entangles him in her latest investigation. As he desperately tries to put the pieces together, he falls deeper into her trap, risking his family, his career, and even his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGFXEyESXIuei5tZWXRkSRSFSxi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549514'),
  ('180715625905944405', 'Fate', 1994, 'Drama', 'Fred Kelemen, Fred Kelemen', 'Fred Kelemen', 'Valerij Fedorenko, Marc Ottiker, Sanja Spengler, Eddi Zacharias', null, 'The paths of people from various countries cross during the course of one night. They speak different languages, but they are fatefully bound together by the solitary quest for happiness and deliverance. Sloping paths are all that''s left for them in an age of lost perspectives, lost refuges and lost homelands. They sink deeper with every movement that should be liberating them. Every gesture of love becomes a gesture of humiliation. The desperate dance of their life has become a passionate dance of death. In the centre of this centrifuge at the end of the millennium the Russian emigrant Valery and his lover Ljuba are turning around each other in a nocturnal round dance of desire and pain, hope and violence and the indestructible will to survive', 'The paths of people from various countries cross during the course of one night. They speak different languages, but they are fatefully bound together by the solitary quest for happiness and deliverance. Sloping paths are all that''s left for them in an age of lost perspectives, lost refuges and lost homelands. They sink deeper with every movement that should be liberating them. Every gesture of love becomes a gesture of humiliation. The desperate dance of their life has become a passionate dance of death. In the centre of this centrifuge at the end of the millennium the Russian emigrant Valery and his lover Ljuba are turning around each other in a nocturnal round dance of desire and pain, hope and violence and the indestructible will to survive', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7oYmsyd7VZUDZoULQnlb3rV7NH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263546'),
  ('440826808735944245', 'Fate', 2001, 'Drama', 'Zeki Demirkubuz, Ali Utku, Guzide Balcı', 'Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Serdar Orçin, Zeynep Tokuş, Demir Karahan, Engin Günaydın, Nejmi Aykar, Türkan İnce, Feridun Koç, Canan Akgül', null, 'Musa, a customs clerk, sees life as absurd. He drifts with events; his mother''s death, though loved, brings him strange joy.', 'Musa, a customs clerk, sees life as absurd. He drifts with events; his mother''s death, though loved, brings him strange joy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGG8UlkKCS5l4qbYcx7hzfJ8yde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41187'),
  ('714303047185406863', 'Fate', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Kim Hae-gon, Choi Gi-youl', 'Kim Hae-gon', 'Song Seung-heon, Kwon Sang-woo, Ji Sung, Park Han-byul, Kim In-kwon, Ahn Nae-sang, Min Ji-a, Jung Woo', null, 'Four friends bound by destiny and unbeatable in the dark world. When a casino attack goes wrong as a result of betrayal, fate turns them into enemies. Now, forced to aim the gun at each other''s hearts, their unavoidable battle begins.', 'Four friends bound by destiny and unbeatable in the dark world. When a casino attack goes wrong as a result of betrayal, fate turns them into enemies. Now, forced to aim the gun at each other''s hearts, their unavoidable battle begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8vW7jMXak5tfoD02jOrmVmB7Hz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52418'),
  ('109143435074533163', 'Fate Is the Hunter', 1964, 'Drama', 'Ralph Nelson, Milton Krasner', 'Harold Medford', 'Glenn Ford, Jane Russell, Rod Taylor, Suzanne Pleshette, Nancy Kwan, Wally Cox, Nehemiah Persoff, Mark Stevens', 'NR', 'An airline executive refuses to believe that pilot error, by his friend, caused a fatal crash and persists in looking for another reason.', 'An airline executive refuses to believe that pilot error, by his friend, caused a fatal crash and persists in looking for another reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faDAYcBU0dboJ8QpYSSSCtKUwud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102286'),
  ('1079066570329304423', 'Fate of a Man', 1959, 'Drama, War', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Vladimir Monakhov, Yuri Mikhailov', 'Yuriy Lukin, Fyodor Shakhmagonov', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Pavel Boriskin, Zinaida Kirienko, Pavel Volkov, Yuri Averin, Konstantin Alekseev, Pavel Vinnikov, Yevgeni Teterin', null, 'The story of a man whose life was ruthlessly crippled by World War II. His wife and daughters were killed during the bombing of his village, he spent some time as a prisoner, and his only son was killed in action only a few days before the victory...', 'The story of a man whose life was ruthlessly crippled by World War II. His wife and daughters were killed during the bombing of his village, he spent some time as a prisoner, and his only son was killed in action only a few days before the victory...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10WCdk4KSQcQmG4iW87NOor9jvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88564'),
  ('1026126872322607978', 'Fate/Grand Order Final Singularity – Grand Temple of Time: Solomon', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Yuya Sakuma, Toshifumi Akai, Hiroyuki Yoshida', 'Kinoko Nasu', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Rie Takahashi, Ayako Kawasumi, Kenichi Suzumura, Maaya Sakamoto, Tomokazu Sugita, Mamoru Miyano, Yu Kobayashi', null, 'After battling their way through all seven Singularities, the Chaldea Security Organization has finally arrived at the endpoint of the Grand Order: The Final Singularity, Grand Temple of Time: Solomon. Now is the time to defeat the root of all evil, Solomon, the King of Mages. Now is the time to reclaim the future. With the final operation looming large, Romani Archaman considers the choices he will soon have to make, Mash Kyrielight dwells on life''s limitations, and Fujimaru prepares to receive a new Mystic Code. All their many encounters have led to this moment as Fujimaru and Mash at last embark on their final operation...', 'After battling their way through all seven Singularities, the Chaldea Security Organization has finally arrived at the endpoint of the Grand Order: The Final Singularity, Grand Temple of Time: Solomon. Now is the time to defeat the root of all evil, Solomon, the King of Mages. Now is the time to reclaim the future. With the final operation looming large, Romani Archaman considers the choices he will soon have to make, Mash Kyrielight dwells on life''s limitations, and Fujimaru prepares to receive a new Mystic Code. All their many encounters have led to this moment as Fujimaru and Mash at last embark on their final operation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTpw3z1OJkRfCWlIDvS28TCcoXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829920'),
  ('413509655730064956', 'Fate/Grand Order the Movie: Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelot 1 Wandering; Agateram', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, History, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kazuchika Kise, Koji Tanaka, Naofumi Mishina', 'Ukyo Kodachi', 'Mamoru Miyano, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Rie Takahashi, Ayako Kawasumi, Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Satoshi Tsuruoka, Takahiro Mizushima', null, 'The wandering knight, Bedivere, reaches the end of his journey. It is A.D. 1273 in Jerusalem. The Holy Land has been transformed into a massive desert and its people have been forced out of their homes as three major powers wage war with each other in this wasteland. The Knights of the Round Table come together to protect the Holy City and their Lion King. With the whole of his kingdom summoned into a strange land, Ozymandias, the Sun King, quietly plots against the tyranny of this bizarre realm. The mountain people, protectors of those who were stripped of their land, await their chance at rebellion. In order to fulfill his mission, Bedivere heads for the Holy City where the Lion King rules. There he meets humanity’s final Master, Ritsuka Fujimaru, who has come to Jerusalem, accompanied by his Demi-Servant, Mash Kyrielight, in their quest to restore human history.', 'The wandering knight, Bedivere, reaches the end of his journey. It is A.D. 1273 in Jerusalem. The Holy Land has been transformed into a massive desert and its people have been forced out of their homes as three major powers wage war with each other in this wasteland. The Knights of the Round Table come together to protect the Holy City and their Lion King. With the whole of his kingdom summoned into a strange land, Ozymandias, the Sun King, quietly plots against the tyranny of this bizarre realm. The mountain people, protectors of those who were stripped of their land, await their chance at rebellion. In order to fulfill his mission, Bedivere heads for the Holy City where the Lion King rules. There he meets humanity’s final Master, Ritsuka Fujimaru, who has come to Jerusalem, accompanied by his Demi-Servant, Mash Kyrielight, in their quest to restore human history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGlzqEwMv1OLHi6n8s2wRd4zAMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637202'),
  ('353046070188139558', 'Fate/Grand Order the Movie: Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelot 2 Paladin; Agateram', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, History, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kazuto Arai, Yosuke Kabashima, Kazuya Arahata', 'Ukyo Kodachi, Kazuto Arai', 'Mamoru Miyano, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Rie Takahashi, Maaya Sakamoto, Ayako Kawasumi, Takahiro Mizushima, Miyuki Sawashiro, Ryotaro Okiayu', null, 'The second part in a two-part anime film project adapting the "Sixth Singularity - Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelot" story from the game.', 'The second part in a two-part anime film project adapting the "Sixth Singularity - Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelot" story from the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GHW8hN8JAXDzid3WDoClz2App5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637462'),
  ('861237762031542133', 'Fate/Grand Order: First Order', 2016, 'Action, Fantasy, Animation', 'Hitoshi Nanba, Keiichi Tsuboyama, Yasuhiro Asagi', 'Ayumi Sekine', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Rie Takahashi, Madoka Yonezawa, Kenichi Suzumura, Tomokazu Sugita, Ayako Kawasumi, Nobutoshi Canna, Junichi Suwabe', null, 'The year 2015 CE. The last era in which magecraft still thrived. The Chaldea Security Organization was founded to focus on preserving the continuation of human history. They observe a world which magecraft couldn''t observe and science couldn''t measure all to prevent the certain extinction of humanity. But one day, the future that Chaldea continued to observe disappears and humanity''s extinction in 2017 becomes clear. Rather, it had already happened. The cause seems to be related to Fuyuki, a provincial town in Japan, in the year 2004 CE. There, an "unobservable region" that had not existed before appears. Based on the assumption that Fuyuki is the reason for humanity''s extinction, Chaldea issues an order to explore, investigate, and possibly destroy this singularity – a quest for the Holy Grail, the Grand Order.', 'The year 2015 CE. The last era in which magecraft still thrived. The Chaldea Security Organization was founded to focus on preserving the continuation of human history. They observe a world which magecraft couldn''t observe and science couldn''t measure all to prevent the certain extinction of humanity. But one day, the future that Chaldea continued to observe disappears and humanity''s extinction in 2017 becomes clear. Rather, it had already happened. The cause seems to be related to Fuyuki, a provincial town in Japan, in the year 2004 CE. There, an "unobservable region" that had not existed before appears. Based on the assumption that Fuyuki is the reason for humanity''s extinction, Chaldea issues an order to explore, investigate, and possibly destroy this singularity – a quest for the Holy Grail, the Grand Order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3u9kOT50sUxGGfzcVjljlQXbt4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428142'),
  ('216260264528060127', 'Fate/Grand Order: Moonlight/Lostroom', 2017, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action', 'Shunji Maki, Tomoya Kunisaki, Takuro Tsukada', 'Kinoko Nasu', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Rie Takahashi, Madoka Yonezawa, Tomokazu Sugita, Kenichi Suzumura', null, 'The Lostroom. A place where you can see what was lost, or maybe what will be lost to you in time. Existing in the innermost part of Chaldea, it is the boundary line between dream and reality where the light of the Moon shines through. Produced by the Chaldea Summoning System, the room holds a small number of worthwhile benefits to enjoy.', 'The Lostroom. A place where you can see what was lost, or maybe what will be lost to you in time. Existing in the innermost part of Chaldea, it is the boundary line between dream and reality where the light of the Moon shines through. Produced by the Chaldea Summoning System, the room holds a small number of worthwhile benefits to enjoy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pwWLiqtWcH2ZAp0dfY8hXTPZDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900497'),
  ('614244855746602943', 'Fate/kaleid liner Prisma☆Illya: Licht Nameless Girl', 2021, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Kazuya Hirata, Kazuya Hirata, Yusuke Sekine', 'Kenji Inoue, Hazuki Minase', 'Mai Kadowaki, Kaori Nazuka, Chiwa Saito, Natsuki Hanae, Sumire Morohoshi, Rie Kugimiya, Ryoko Shiraishi, Hitomi Nabatame', null, 'The world is dying, no longer able to support life. The Ainsworth family can use the Holy Grail to save humanity, but the price of salvation is sacrifice of the magical girl Miyu — but Miyu’s brother, Shirou, won’t let them have her without a fight. Now it’s up to Illya to step in and find a solution that will save not only Miyu, but the entire world for impending doom. But when the price for the world''s salvation is the life of a single, innocent girl, what will Illya choose?', 'The world is dying, no longer able to support life. The Ainsworth family can use the Holy Grail to save humanity, but the price of salvation is sacrifice of the magical girl Miyu — but Miyu’s brother, Shirou, won’t let them have her without a fight. Now it’s up to Illya to step in and find a solution that will save not only Miyu, but the entire world for impending doom. But when the price for the world''s salvation is the life of a single, innocent girl, what will Illya choose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYyMNJyUsutDRKutilhzGo7vzoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843243'),
  ('581374164666274475', 'Fate/kaleid liner Prisma☆Illya: Vow in the Snow', 2017, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kazuyuki Yamayoshi, Wakana Moriya, Hirohisa Kitamura', 'Hazuki Minase, Kenji Inoue', 'Noriaki Sugiyama, Kaori Nazuka, Rikiya Koyama, Noriko Shitaya, Natsuki Hanae, Jouji Nakata, Naoko Takano, Yumi Kakazu', null, 'Despite his adoptive father''s warnings that the girl found in the remnants of a destroyed city is too dangerous to be considered anything other than a tool or weapon, Shirou Emiya comes to treat Miyu as a younger sister. But when Shirou relaxes his guard and Miyu starts normal school, the Ainsworth family and their agents swoop in, kidnapping the girl with the goal of sacrificing her! Faced with the realization that Miyu''s ability to do good will always be equaled by her capacity for destruction, Shirou must attempt to both rescue his adopted sister, and decide how to confront the threat that her powers will always pose.', 'Despite his adoptive father''s warnings that the girl found in the remnants of a destroyed city is too dangerous to be considered anything other than a tool or weapon, Shirou Emiya comes to treat Miyu as a younger sister. But when Shirou relaxes his guard and Miyu starts normal school, the Ainsworth family and their agents swoop in, kidnapping the girl with the goal of sacrificing her! Faced with the realization that Miyu''s ability to do good will always be equaled by her capacity for destruction, Shirou must attempt to both rescue his adopted sister, and decide how to confront the threat that her powers will always pose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suy8nFraq8vASRKz6GcL6p9FEvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461083'),
  ('28243335304227519', 'Fate/Prototype', 2011, 'Action, Fantasy, Romance, Animation', 'Seiji Kishi', 'Makoto Uezu', 'Kana Hanazawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Yuichi Nakamura, Kazuya Nakai, Chiwa Saito, Aki Toyosaki, Mamoru Miyano, Megumi Ogata', null, 'Fate/Prototype is a reimagined version of Kinoko Nasu''s original version of Fate/stay night. The storyline takes place eight years after the tragic Heaven''s Feel. Here, the Holy Grail is still the so desired object. However, the darkness under this so-called "Grail" is revealed while the characters proceed to fight against each other in order to win.', 'Fate/Prototype is a reimagined version of Kinoko Nasu''s original version of Fate/stay night. The storyline takes place eight years after the tragic Heaven''s Feel. Here, the Holy Grail is still the so desired object. However, the darkness under this so-called "Grail" is revealed while the characters proceed to fight against each other in order to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pCZou4YuLz057MR5lgnAHhPnW5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415547'),
  ('447454936987768864', 'Fate/stay night: Heaven''s Feel I. Presage Flower', 2017, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Kasumi Takeuchi, Yuri Kabasawa, Tomonori Sudo', 'Akira Hiyama', 'Noriaki Sugiyama, Noriko Shitaya, Hiroshi Kamiya, Ayako Kawasumi, Kana Ueda, Miki Ito, Jouji Nakata, Masane Tsukayama', 'R', 'Ten years after the Fourth Holy Grail War, a devastating clash between Masters and Servants, another war erupts. Shirou Emiya, whose father fought in the first battle, was leading a peaceful life with the warmhearted Sakura Matou. But when hidden forces begin to stir, Shirou resolves to fulfill his father’s dying wish, protect Sakura, and fight for the Holy Grail.', 'Ten years after the Fourth Holy Grail War, a devastating clash between Masters and Servants, another war erupts. Shirou Emiya, whose father fought in the first battle, was leading a peaceful life with the warmhearted Sakura Matou. But when hidden forces begin to stir, Shirou resolves to fulfill his father’s dying wish, protect Sakura, and fight for the Holy Grail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nEtmBg07DA5BWjcrmD49rxHsVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283984'),
  ('769851793520310142', 'Fate/stay night: Heaven''s Feel II. Lost Butterfly', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Takuro Takahashi, Kasumi Takeuchi, Hikaru Kondô', 'Akira Hiyama', 'Noriaki Sugiyama, Noriko Shitaya, Hiroshi Kamiya, Ayako Kawasumi, Kana Ueda, Miki Ito, Jouji Nakata, Masane Tsukayama', 'R', 'Shirou has lost his Servant, Saber, and is no longer a Master in the Holy Grail War. Despite this, he refuses to leave the battle, determined to protect Sakura. Meanwhile, a mysterious shadow engulfs the city, killing Masters and Servants one by one. As Shirou faces new dangers, Sakura is drawn deeper into her own destiny as a mage.', 'Shirou has lost his Servant, Saber, and is no longer a Master in the Holy Grail War. Despite this, he refuses to leave the battle, determined to protect Sakura. Meanwhile, a mysterious shadow engulfs the city, killing Masters and Servants one by one. As Shirou faces new dangers, Sakura is drawn deeper into her own destiny as a mage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tS0iyKQBDFqVpVcH21MSJwXZdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390634'),
  ('1072816739135265315', 'Fate/stay night: Heaven''s Feel III. Spring Song', 2020, 'Animation, Romance, Fantasy, Action, Drama', 'Takuro Takahashi, Yuri Kabasawa, Tomonori Sudo', 'Akira Hiyama', 'Noriaki Sugiyama, Noriko Shitaya, Ayako Kawasumi, Kana Ueda, Mai Kadowaki, Miki Ito, Jouji Nakata, Masane Tsukayama', 'R', 'The battle rages on as Shirou continues to protect Sakura, now consumed by the darkness. He joins forces with Rin to end the Holy Grail War, while Illyasviel, who knows the truth behind it, confronts her fate. Amidst the chaos, Zouken plots to manipulate Sakura for his own desires. The final fight begins.', 'The battle rages on as Shirou continues to protect Sakura, now consumed by the darkness. He joins forces with Rin to end the Holy Grail War, while Illyasviel, who knows the truth behind it, confronts her fate. Amidst the chaos, Zouken plots to manipulate Sakura for his own desires. The final fight begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIK5kEdFwOHnHTa06ntTVSfG9im.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390635'),
  ('774758065707713461', 'Fate/stay night: Unlimited Blade Works', 2010, 'Action, Fantasy, Animation, Drama', 'Shin''yo Kondou, Yuji Yamaguchi, Toshimitsu Kobayashi', 'Takuya Sato', 'Ayako Kawasumi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Junichi Suwabe, Kana Ueda, Jouji Nakata, Noriko Shitaya, Yuu Asakawa, Mai Kadowaki', null, 'In the World before, novice mage Shirou Emiya summoned and bonded with beautiful heroic spirit Saber as they became enmeshed in the battle for supremacy known as the fifth Holy Grail War. Fate, however, is a fickle mistress, and there was more than one way for that story to transpire. Now, in an alternate timeline, the pairing’s destiny becomes more tightly intertwined with that of high school student/secret Mage Rin Tohsaka and her Servant Archer. Even if you think you know what will happen next, prepare to be surprised as new twists await at every turn.', 'In the World before, novice mage Shirou Emiya summoned and bonded with beautiful heroic spirit Saber as they became enmeshed in the battle for supremacy known as the fifth Holy Grail War. Fate, however, is a fickle mistress, and there was more than one way for that story to transpire. Now, in an alternate timeline, the pairing’s destiny becomes more tightly intertwined with that of high school student/secret Mage Rin Tohsaka and her Servant Archer. Even if you think you know what will happen next, prepare to be surprised as new twists await at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/it7MNgChJr70YGXwHm11BRT7igZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46304'),
  ('334276880279060632', 'Fate/strange Fake -Whispers of Dawn-', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Drama', 'Takahito Sakazume, Shun Enokido, Yohei Miyawaki', 'Daisuke Ohigashi', 'Kana Hanazawa, Yuki Ono, Sumire Morohoshi, Tomokazu Seki, Yu Kobayashi, Aoi Koga, Wataru Hatano, Showtaro Morikubo', 'PG-13', 'In a Holy Grail War, Mages (Masters) and their Heroic Spirits (Servants) fight for the control of the Holy Grail—an omnipotent wish-granting device said to fulfill any desire. Years have passed since the end of the Fifth Holy Grail War in Japan. Now, signs portend the emergence of a new Holy Grail in the western American city of Snowfield. Sure enough, Masters and Servants begin to gather... A missing Servant class... Impossible Servant summonings... A nation shrouded in secrecy... And a city created as a battleground. In the face of such irregularities, the Holy Grail War is twisted and driven into the depth of madness. Let the curtain rise on a masquerade of humans and heroes, made to dance upon the stage of a false Holy Grail.', 'In a Holy Grail War, Mages (Masters) and their Heroic Spirits (Servants) fight for the control of the Holy Grail—an omnipotent wish-granting device said to fulfill any desire. Years have passed since the end of the Fifth Holy Grail War in Japan. Now, signs portend the emergence of a new Holy Grail in the western American city of Snowfield. Sure enough, Masters and Servants begin to gather... A missing Servant class... Impossible Servant summonings... A nation shrouded in secrecy... And a city created as a battleground. In the face of such irregularities, the Holy Grail War is twisted and driven into the depth of madness. Let the curtain rise on a masquerade of humans and heroes, made to dance upon the stage of a false Holy Grail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Cf2NS9oH1VpH23NyWR4J7WIOv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145612'),
  ('1132869061495913890', 'Fateful Findings', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Neil Breen, Neil Breen', 'Neil Breen', 'Neil Breen, Klara Landrat, Jennifer Autry, David Silva, Gloria Hoffman, Danielle Andrade, Victoria Viveiros, John Henry Hoffman', 'NR', 'A small boy discovers a mystical power as a child. He is then separated from his childhood girlfriend. He grows up to be a computer scientist who is hacking into the most secret national and international secrets, as well as being an acclaimed novel writer. His childhood ''finding'' gives him amazing paranormal powers. He is reunited with the childhood girlfriend, mystically, on his hospital deathbed... as his relationship with his current drug addict girlfriend is deteriorating. The passions build between the threesome. Mystical, psychiatric and worldly forces rise to prevent him from revealing the hacked secrets. He attempts to reveal all in a Washington DC large press conference, with ''fateful'' and dangerous consequences.', 'A small boy discovers a mystical power as a child. He is then separated from his childhood girlfriend. He grows up to be a computer scientist who is hacking into the most secret national and international secrets, as well as being an acclaimed novel writer. His childhood ''finding'' gives him amazing paranormal powers. He is reunited with the childhood girlfriend, mystically, on his hospital deathbed... as his relationship with his current drug addict girlfriend is deteriorating. The passions build between the threesome. Mystical, psychiatric and worldly forces rise to prevent him from revealing the hacked secrets. He attempts to reveal all in a Washington DC large press conference, with ''fateful'' and dangerous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imTaWev7b4aDIC6WuNn9E1wJ4EB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197599'),
  ('570557264029070312', 'Fateh', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Sonu Sood, Anthony Pandey, Ritesh Verma', 'Sankalp Pawal, Rudra Anand, Shyam Nirmal', 'Sonu Sood, Jacqueline Fernandez, Naseeruddin Shah, Vijay Raaz, Shivjyoti Rajput, Dibyendu Bhattacharya, Prakash Belawadi, Akashdeep Sabir', null, 'Ex-Special Ops officer Fateh Singh springs back to action when a girl falls prey to a cybercrime syndicate. Racing against time, can he bring down the mafia?', 'Ex-Special Ops officer Fateh Singh springs back to action when a girl falls prey to a cybercrime syndicate. Racing against time, can he bring down the mafia?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cw8DitAELYtWSD1P8yd0hzufVHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:955496'),
  ('32661690134473103', 'Fateless', 2005, 'War, Drama', 'Lajos Koltai, Gyula Pados, Zoltán Bonta', 'Kertész Imre', 'Marcell Nagy, Béla Dóra, Bálint Péntek, Áron Dimény, Péter Fancsikai, Zsolt Dér, András M. Kecskés, Dani Szabó', null, 'A Hungarian youth comes of age at Buchenwald during World War II. György Köves is 14, the son of a merchant who''s sent to a forced labor camp. After his father''s departure, György gets a job at a brickyard; his bus is stopped and its Jewish occupants sent to camps. There, György find camaraderie, suffering, cruelty, illness, and death. He hears advice on preserving one''s dignity and self-esteem. He discovers hatred. If he does survive and returns to Budapest, what will he find? What is natural; what is it to be a Jew? Sepia, black and white, and color alternate to shade the mood.', 'A Hungarian youth comes of age at Buchenwald during World War II. György Köves is 14, the son of a merchant who''s sent to a forced labor camp. After his father''s departure, György gets a job at a brickyard; his bus is stopped and its Jewish occupants sent to camps. There, György find camaraderie, suffering, cruelty, illness, and death. He hears advice on preserving one''s dignity and self-esteem. He discovers hatred. If he does survive and returns to Budapest, what will he find? What is natural; what is it to be a Jew? Sepia, black and white, and color alternate to shade the mood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLR8T7uNFNYYwne7Z1fAjQi8Nzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41508'),
  ('636135024586262362', 'Father', 1966, 'Drama', 'István Szabó, Sára Sándor', 'István Szabó', 'András Bálint, Miklós Gábor, Dániel Erdély, Kati Sólyom, Klári Tolnay, Rita Békés', null, 'When young Tako''s father dies in Hungary in 1945, Tako is left with scant memories of him. Nurtured by his mother, the boy fantasizes about the man his father was, imagining him a hero. Grown into a man himself, Tako falls for a Jewish refugee, Anni. Burdened by her own heritage as a Jew, Anni sparks in Tako a desire to find out what his father was really like, and he delves into the role his father played in World War II.', 'When young Tako''s father dies in Hungary in 1945, Tako is left with scant memories of him. Nurtured by his mother, the boy fantasizes about the man his father was, imagining him a hero. Grown into a man himself, Tako falls for a Jewish refugee, Anni. Burdened by her own heritage as a Jew, Anni sparks in Tako a desire to find out what his father was really like, and he delves into the role his father played in World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FyQmF3aAtgEDrhBN6g2HixfpaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42715'),
  ('997539461757628281', 'Father', 2000, 'Drama', 'Wang Shuo, Xiaoxiong Yang', 'Feng Xiaogang, Wang Shuo', 'Feng Xiaogang, Xiaopei Hu, Xu Fan, Liu Bei, Qin Yan, Ye Jing, Yuan Yuan, Yao Er-ga', null, 'Father documents the tumultuous relationship between a widowed father, Ma Lisheng, and his school-age son, Ma Che. Though he works as a low-level party functionary during the day, he finds his greatest challenges in the raising of a son on his own. Alternating between trying to bond with his son (even getting drunk with him), and verbally accosting him, Ma is at a loss. One day the son decides that the best way for his father to stop harassing him, will be to find him a new wife, which he finds in the form of the mother of a school friend, Qing Huaiyuan.', 'Father documents the tumultuous relationship between a widowed father, Ma Lisheng, and his school-age son, Ma Che. Though he works as a low-level party functionary during the day, he finds his greatest challenges in the raising of a son on his own. Alternating between trying to bond with his son (even getting drunk with him), and verbally accosting him, Ma is at a loss. One day the son decides that the best way for his father to stop harassing him, will be to find him a new wife, which he finds in the form of the mother of a school friend, Qing Huaiyuan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYXI3bpBJUO9uFrACXP3NdAGq89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255526'),
  ('641610150681294033', 'Father', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Kad Merad, Régis Blondeau, Thierry Mauvoisin', 'Emmanuelle Cosso-Merad', 'Kad Merad, Michèle Laroque, Gaspard Meier-Chaurand, Vincent Perez, Judith El Zein, Florence Maury, Emmanuel Patron, Patrick Bonnel', 'PG', 'Monsieur Papa is a moving portrait of a modern family, centering around 12 year-old Marius Vallois. Born in a wealthy family, Marius is the son of Marie Vallois, a successful CEO. Marie loves her son unconditionally, but Marius has never known his father and suffers greatly from it. When Marius starts shoplifting and doing badly at school, Marie decides to recruit a father figure for him. One day in her office building, she meets Robert Pique. Robert is a peculiar man who has a background in finance, but makes ends meet ironing clothes for his neighbors. Reluctant at first, Robert agrees to be paid to meet Marius and pretends to be his father. Marius immediately understands that Robert is not his dad, but very quickly, a deep bond develops between them.', 'Monsieur Papa is a moving portrait of a modern family, centering around 12 year-old Marius Vallois. Born in a wealthy family, Marius is the son of Marie Vallois, a successful CEO. Marie loves her son unconditionally, but Marius has never known his father and suffers greatly from it. When Marius starts shoplifting and doing badly at school, Marie decides to recruit a father figure for him. One day in her office building, she meets Robert Pique. Robert is a peculiar man who has a background in finance, but makes ends meet ironing clothes for his neighbors. Reluctant at first, Robert agrees to be paid to meet Marius and pretends to be his father. Marius immediately understands that Robert is not his dad, but very quickly, a deep bond develops between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91YaM91p2RGWfbRUfUk35rJwQTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65647'),
  ('964304457962548460', 'Father', 2020, 'Drama', 'Srdan Golubović, Aleksandar Ilić', 'Srdan Golubović, Ognjen Sviličić', 'Goran Bogdan, Boris Isaković, Milica Janevski, Muharem Hamzić, Ajla Šantić, Vahid Džanković, Milan Marić, Nikola Rakočević', null, 'Nikola’s children are taken away from him after social services decide that he is too poor to provide them with a decent living environment. He sets off on foot to lodge a complaint in Belgrade.', 'Nikola’s children are taken away from him after social services decide that he is too poor to provide them with a decent living environment. He sets off on foot to lodge a complaint in Belgrade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/op9ZZvqYFqS2ZyiFAthvoqbTdc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665771'),
  ('195613371009208456', 'Father & Soldier', 2023, 'War, Drama, History', 'Mathieu Vadepied, Luis Armando Arteaga, Camille François', 'Olivier Demangel, Mathieu Vadepied', 'Omar Sy, Alassane Diong, Jonas Bloquet, Bamar Kane, Alassane Sy, Clément Sambou, Ibrahim Ba, Oumar Sey', null, '1917. Bakary Diallo enlists in the French army to join his 17-year-old son, Thierno, who has been forcibly recruited. Sent to the front, they will have to face the war together. While Thierno learns to become a man, Bakary will do everything to bring him back safely.', '1917. Bakary Diallo enlists in the French army to join his 17-year-old son, Thierno, who has been forcibly recruited. Sent to the front, they will have to face the war together. While Thierno learns to become a man, Bakary will do everything to bring him back safely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xi52A7e1ZjEyLiXxanEyOdR8ma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967874'),
  ('414611718254273156', 'Father & Sons', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Félix Moati, Yves Angelo', 'Florence Seyvos', 'Vincent Lacoste, Benoît Poelvoorde, Mathieu Capella, Anaïs Demoustier, Patrick d''Assumçao, Antoine de Bary, Noémie Lvovsky, India Hair', null, 'Joseph and his two sons, Joachim and Ivan, form a close-knit family but fail to see that each one is losing control of his life. Joachim is supposed to be studying psychiatry but spends most of his time daydreaming about his ex-girlfriend, Ivan cannot fit in at school despite being very smart, and Joseph has secretly quit his job as a doctor and is trying to become a writer. While there is plenty of affection at home, all three are also, clumsily, searching for love...', 'Joseph and his two sons, Joachim and Ivan, form a close-knit family but fail to see that each one is losing control of his life. Joachim is supposed to be studying psychiatry but spends most of his time daydreaming about his ex-girlfriend, Ivan cannot fit in at school despite being very smart, and Joseph has secretly quit his job as a doctor and is trying to become a writer. While there is plenty of affection at home, all three are also, clumsily, searching for love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLB9fVQnAv7fdVWzUVu5hRUnX6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542828'),
  ('514749745446516091', 'Father and Daughter', 2001, 'Animation, Drama', 'Michael Dudok de Wit', 'Michael Dudok de Wit', null, null, 'A father says goodbye to his young daughter. In time the daughter grows old, but within her there is always a deep longing for her father.', 'A father says goodbye to his young daughter. In time the daughter grows old, but within her there is always a deep longing for her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQOSA51phS7zqRqSHMXo67irfxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48617'),
  ('904127797894686555', 'Father and Guns', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Émile Gaudreault, Bruce Chun, Marc Larose', 'Émile Gaudreault, Ian Lauzon', 'Michel Côté, Louis-José Houde, Rémy Girard, Patrick Drolet, Caroline Dhavernas, Jean-Michel Anctil, Robin Aubert, Luc Senay', null, 'To save the life of fellow cop kidnapped by a biker gang, a father and a son who cannot stand the sight of each other infiltrate an outdoor adventure group-therapy for fathers and sons. Their biggest challenge is to survive the therapy without killing each other.', 'To save the life of fellow cop kidnapped by a biker gang, a father and a son who cannot stand the sight of each other infiltrate an outdoor adventure group-therapy for fathers and sons. Their biggest challenge is to survive the therapy without killing each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldIwA1FU8xAwqDtWn69cKUuPclP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26566'),
  ('192337175695890244', 'Father and Guns 2', 2017, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Émile Gaudreault, Geneviève Perron', 'Émile Gaudreault, Eric K. Boulianne, Sébastien Ravary', 'Michel Côté, Louis-José Houde, Patrice Robitaille, Julie Le Breton, Karine Vanasse, Hélène Bourgeois Leclerc, Sonia Vachon, Yves Jacques', null, 'A few years after they infiltrated a therapy program for fathers and sons, Marc Laroche is having some issues with his girlfriend Alice and Jacques is experiencing intense denial towards the fact that he is growing older. An incredible opportunity arises when Martin Germain, the lieutenant of the Mafia’s leader, and his girlfriend sign up for a bootcamp for couples. As Marc and Alice sign up for the therapy, Jacques invites himself in by pretending to be the psychologist''s assistant.', 'A few years after they infiltrated a therapy program for fathers and sons, Marc Laroche is having some issues with his girlfriend Alice and Jacques is experiencing intense denial towards the fact that he is growing older. An incredible opportunity arises when Martin Germain, the lieutenant of the Mafia’s leader, and his girlfriend sign up for a bootcamp for couples. As Marc and Alice sign up for the therapy, Jacques invites himself in by pretending to be the psychologist''s assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkJ3FbnGQyOT3rKHtWbQLdQEmYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417478'),
  ('713816091004937753', 'Father and Son', 2003, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Igor Berson, Tatyana Komarova', 'Sergei Potepalov', 'Andrei Shchetinin, Aleksei Neymyshev, Aleksandr Razbash, Fyodor Lavrov, Marina Zasukhina, Anna Aleksakhina, Jaime Freitas, Svetlana Svirko', null, 'In this dreamlike film, a nameless father and his son, Aleksei, live together in an apartment in St. Petersburg. Aleksei''s mother has died and consequently the two have a very close relationship. When Aleksei acquires a girlfriend, she refuses to take a back seat to his bond with his dad, and breaks up with him. Aleksei is also experiencing nightmares, dreading separation from his father to be a part of the military as his father was.', 'In this dreamlike film, a nameless father and his son, Aleksei, live together in an apartment in St. Petersburg. Aleksei''s mother has died and consequently the two have a very close relationship. When Aleksei acquires a girlfriend, she refuses to take a back seat to his bond with his dad, and breaks up with him. Aleksei is also experiencing nightmares, dreading separation from his father to be a part of the military as his father was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGGUrgF5nPyMpJbiN87SlT2zqxB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44513'),
  ('810421151370346838', 'Father and Sons', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Michel Boujenah, Patrick Blossier', 'Michel Boujenah, Edmond Bensimon, Pascal Elbé', 'Philippe Noiret, Charles Berling, Bruno Putzulu, Pascal Elbé, Marie Tifo, Geneviève Brouillette, Albert Kwan, Céline Thiou', null, 'Léo, un vieux père de famille ancien représentant de commerce, est prêt à tout pour retrouver l''affection de ses trois fils, David, Max et Simon. Il va même jusqu''à invoquer une maladie et une intervention chirurgicale pour les convaincre de l''accompagner dans un voyage au Canada, où il tentera de refaire l''unité du clan familial. Le quatuor de Français y fera la rencontre d''une guérisseuse et de sa fille.', 'Léo, un vieux père de famille ancien représentant de commerce, est prêt à tout pour retrouver l''affection de ses trois fils, David, Max et Simon. Il va même jusqu''à invoquer une maladie et une intervention chirurgicale pour les convaincre de l''accompagner dans un voyage au Canada, où il tentera de refaire l''unité du clan familial. Le quatuor de Français y fera la rencontre d''une guérisseuse et de sa fille.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvq9hHEB1pTKtZv6PnkagLSrKRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51870'),
  ('864696163073355064', 'Father Brown', 1954, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Robert Hamer, Harry Waxman, Max Varnel', 'Robert Hamer, Thelma Schnee, Maurice Rapf', 'Alec Guinness, Joan Greenwood, Peter Finch, Cecil Parker, Bernard Lee, Sidney James, Gérard Oury, Ernest Thesiger', 'NR', 'Works of art are disappearing, stolen by a master thief, a master of disguise. Father Brown has two goals: to catch the thief and to save his soul.', 'Works of art are disappearing, stolen by a master thief, a master of disguise. Father Brown has two goals: to catch the thief and to save his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDamZSvZMEbVUj1RNdfjRoETBsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89160'),
  ('527023302249253210', 'Father Came Too!', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Peter Graham Scott, Frank Hollands', 'Jack Davies, Henry Blyth', 'James Robertson Justice, Leslie Phillips, Stanley Baxter, Sally Smith, Eric Barker, Kenneth Cope, Terry Scott, Hugh Lloyd', null, 'When Dexter Munro and his new wife Juliet get married, they decide to escape Juliet''s meddling father by buying a rundown cottage and doing it up themselves. But when the cottage proves to be more ramshackle than they thought, and the scale of the repairs needed far out of their budget, the newlyweds are forced into calling on Juliet''s father after all. Before long he''s employed incompetent builder Josh Wicks, and the situation goes from bad to worse.', 'When Dexter Munro and his new wife Juliet get married, they decide to escape Juliet''s meddling father by buying a rundown cottage and doing it up themselves. But when the cottage proves to be more ramshackle than they thought, and the scale of the repairs needed far out of their budget, the newlyweds are forced into calling on Juliet''s father after all. Before long he''s employed incompetent builder Josh Wicks, and the situation goes from bad to worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6r3Vy7LaYSJ3vnVkL74twvMG5v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171192'),
  ('976957089036967165', 'Father Christmas', 1991, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Dave Unwin, Richard Nye', 'Dianne Jackson', 'Mel Smith', null, 'Classic animation based on Raymond Briggs'' book. What does Father Christmas do with himself for the other 364 days of the year ?', 'Classic animation based on Raymond Briggs'' book. What does Father Christmas do with himself for the other 364 days of the year ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRdN0f7LIOm2uCqWBrwKRYMK01O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24500'),
  ('685341254165613420', 'Father Christmas Is Back', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Philippe Martinez, Mick Davis, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Dylanne Corcoran, David Conolly, Hannah Davis', 'Nathalie Cox, Talulah Riley, Elizabeth Hurley, Kelsey Grammer, John Cleese, Caroline Quentin, April Bowlby, Kris Marshall', null, 'Four sisters – Caroline, Joanna, Paulina, and Vicky – reunite for the Christmas Holiday in a Yorkshire mansion. However, their estranged father, James, joins in for the first time since he left the family behind decades prior. The group attempts to get through the holiday despite comedic misunderstandings, while also uncovering the long-buried secret that tore their family apart, so many years ago.', 'Four sisters – Caroline, Joanna, Paulina, and Vicky – reunite for the Christmas Holiday in a Yorkshire mansion. However, their estranged father, James, joins in for the first time since he left the family behind decades prior. The group attempts to get through the holiday despite comedic misunderstandings, while also uncovering the long-buried secret that tore their family apart, so many years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI6mFCO3lrJ4ovzwfmoLs58uhlK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762469'),
  ('1146243864042080865', 'Father Figures', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Lawrence Sher, Richard L. Fox, Meaghan F. McLaughlin', 'Justin Malen', 'Owen Wilson, Ed Helms, J.K. Simmons, Katt Williams, Terry Bradshaw, Ving Rhames, Christopher Walken, Glenn Close', 'R', 'Upon learning that their mother has been lying to them for years about their allegedly deceased father, two fraternal twin brothers hit the road in order to find him.', 'Upon learning that their mother has been lying to them for years about their allegedly deceased father, two fraternal twin brothers hit the road in order to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avRiH6kbsw3Wxi1J7857alb9yyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354861'),
  ('776051642686355592', 'Father Frost', 1965, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Aleksandr Rou, Dmitri Surensky, B. Kanevskiy', 'Nikolay Erdman, Mikhail Volpin', 'Aleksandr Khvylia, Natalya Sedykh, Eduard Izotov, Inna Churikova, Georgi Millyar, Vera Altayskaya, Pavel Pavlenko, Tatyana Barysheva', null, 'A fairy tale about a conceited young man and a young woman with a tyrannical step-mother, who must overcome magical trials in order to be together.', 'A fairy tale about a conceited young man and a young woman with a tyrannical step-mother, who must overcome magical trials in order to be together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2rtXml5YXsIkNtEmEFtFciB7Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20932'),
