  ('1076859816885926904', 'Father Noah''s Ark', 1933, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Allan Watson, Delos Jewkes, Lucille La Verne, Dorothy Compton', 'NR', 'Noah, his family (wife, 3 sons, their wives), and various animals all help build the ark. The rains come, and the skunks barely miss the boat (not that anyone was particularly looking for them), but they manage to swim to it. After the rain and many lamentations by the humans, the sun returns, to the great joy of all. The ground appears, and the animals (and many new babies) disembark.', 'Noah, his family (wife, 3 sons, their wives), and various animals all help build the ark. The rains come, and the skunks barely miss the boat (not that anyone was particularly looking for them), but they manage to swim to it. After the rain and many lamentations by the humans, the sun returns, to the great joy of all. The ground appears, and the animals (and many new babies) disembark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50wNHV67mfGbSW3BzVO4EhZuGCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107511'),
