  ('403947977255048841', 'Father of Four and the Wolf Cubs', 1958, 'Family', 'Alice O''Fredericks', 'Alice O''Fredericks, Grete Frische', 'Karl Stegger, Birgitte Price, Otto Møller Jensen, Rudi Hansen, Ole Neumann, Peter Malberg, Ib Mossin, Agnes Rehni', null, 'Tiny Per gets its biggest wish: He becomes a scout. Sister also gets hers biggest wish: She''s getting married. So now Mie take over the household and it''s not going to go quietly.', 'Tiny Per gets its biggest wish: He becomes a scout. Sister also gets hers biggest wish: She''s getting married. So now Mie take over the household and it''s not going to go quietly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kCEf6D9dfYDRkXBrdpWLJsihSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19649'),
  ('102030781226713842', 'Father of Four: And Uncle Sofus', 1957, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alice O''Fredericks, Rudolf Frederiksen', 'Grete Frische, Jon Iversen, Alice O''Fredericks', 'Karl Stegger, Otto Møller Jensen, Rudi Hansen, Ole Neumann, Birgitte Price, Peter Malberg, Ib Mossin, Annizette Hansen', null, 'At home in the small family is nothing new. Tiny Per is the school''s mischief maker, Sister has heartaches, Mie and Ole has to be in the school play, etc. But suddenly something happens. Good old Uncle Anders has a twin brother in the United States. He called Sofus, and now he comes home to celebrate 70th birthday. He was a troublemaker when he left and now he has become even worse', 'At home in the small family is nothing new. Tiny Per is the school''s mischief maker, Sister has heartaches, Mie and Ole has to be in the school play, etc. But suddenly something happens. Good old Uncle Anders has a twin brother in the United States. He called Sofus, and now he comes home to celebrate 70th birthday. He was a troublemaker when he left and now he has become even worse', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9PhN2szh6GQDfXOjPicVvQlaLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19648'),
  ('641296186266981215', 'Father of Four: In the City', 1956, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alice O''Fredericks, Robert Saaskin, Rudolf Frederiksen', 'Grete Frische', 'Karl Stegger, Birgitte Price, Otto Møller Jensen, Rudi Hansen, Ole Neumann, Peter Malberg, Ebbe Langberg, Agnes Rehni', null, 'Lilleper is starting school, and on the last day of summer vacation, his father invites the whole family to a party at Tivoli. But then everything goes wrong. Per doesn''t like school. Søs falls out with Peter, Mie is accused of theft, and his father is fired from his job and talks about selling the house. Everyone is looking forward to a sad Christmas, but maybe Lilleper will still go to the "Christmas Ball in Nisseland."', 'Lilleper is starting school, and on the last day of summer vacation, his father invites the whole family to a party at Tivoli. But then everything goes wrong. Per doesn''t like school. Søs falls out with Peter, Mie is accused of theft, and his father is fired from his job and talks about selling the house. Everyone is looking forward to a sad Christmas, but maybe Lilleper will still go to the "Christmas Ball in Nisseland."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BLSqQBAhYOwMR9hUp4VlAYEP3j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54599'),
  ('278567510798355676', 'Father of Invention', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Trent Cooper, Steve Yedlin, David Ticotin', 'Jonathan D. Krane, Trent Cooper', 'Kevin Spacey, Camilla Belle, Heather Graham, Virginia Madsen, John Stamos, Johnny Knoxville, Michael Rosenbaum, Mary Cobb', 'PG-13', 'Nearly a decade after a faulty product landed him in prison, an arrogant inventor is determined to restore his reputation and rebuild his fortune. But first, he has to convince his estranged daughter that he''s worthy of a second chance.', 'Nearly a decade after a faulty product landed him in prison, an arrogant inventor is determined to restore his reputation and rebuild his fortune. But first, he has to convince his estranged daughter that he''s worthy of a second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZPJQpl6dRgTYQ1krbSBptZQjMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35221'),
  ('862560616344524137', 'Father of My Children', 2009, 'Drama', 'Mia Hansen-Løve, Marie Doller, Juliette Maillard', 'Mia Hansen-Løve', 'Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Chiara Caselli, Alice de Lencquesaing, Alice Gautier, Manelle Driss, Éric Elmosnino, Sandrine Dumas, Dominique Frot', null, 'Grégoire Canvel has everything a man could want. A wife he loves, three delightful children, and a stimulating job. He''s a film producer. Discovering talented filmmakers and developing films that fit his conception of the cinema-free and true to life-is precisely his reason for living. Yet his prestigious production company, Moon Films, is on its last legs.', 'Grégoire Canvel has everything a man could want. A wife he loves, three delightful children, and a stimulating job. He''s a film producer. Discovering talented filmmakers and developing films that fit his conception of the cinema-free and true to life-is precisely his reason for living. Yet his prestigious production company, Moon Films, is on its last legs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9kRv5aPeRAXWqvjn4HSAmT6DvH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43614'),
  ('149257175887602809', 'Father Of The Bird', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Stephen A. Fossati', null, 'Joe Alaskey, June Foray', 'G', 'Sylvester meets up with an adorable new character named Cornbread.', 'Sylvester meets up with an adorable new character named Cornbread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shLPK582B3HtHi5L8ERyC2WhfTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83762'),
  ('796776044830981068', 'Father of the Bride', 1950, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Vincente Minnelli, John Alton', 'Frances Goodrich, Albert Hackett', 'Spencer Tracy, Joan Bennett, Elizabeth Taylor, Don Taylor, Billie Burke, Leo G. Carroll, Moroni Olsen, Melville Cooper', 'NR', 'Proud father Stanley Banks remembers the day his daughter, Kay, got married. Starting when she announces her engagement through to the wedding itself, we learn of all the surprises and disasters along the way.', 'Proud father Stanley Banks remembers the day his daughter, Kay, got married. Starting when she announces her engagement through to the wedding itself, we learn of all the surprises and disasters along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sygyqqXq41SBZiYjY8nuQRAcuUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20758'),
  ('284067206664157363', 'Father of the Bride', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'John Lindley, Charles Shyer, Donna Isaacson', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Steve Martin, Diane Keaton, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Kieran Culkin, George Newbern, Martin Short, BD Wong, Peter Michael Goetz', 'PG', 'George Banks is an ordinary, middle-class man whose 22 year-old daughter Annie has decided to marry a man from an upper-class family, but George can''t think of what life would be like without his daughter. His wife tries to make him happy for Annie, but when the wedding takes place at their home and a foreign wedding planner takes over the ceremony, he becomes slightly insane.', 'George Banks is an ordinary, middle-class man whose 22 year-old daughter Annie has decided to marry a man from an upper-class family, but George can''t think of what life would be like without his daughter. His wife tries to make him happy for Annie, but when the wedding takes place at their home and a foreign wedding planner takes over the ceremony, he becomes slightly insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bU7HzJbJpY5OiLdqWhKSqGPtYii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11846'),
  ('876429536055418074', 'Father of the Bride', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Gary Alazraki, Igor Jadue-Lillo, Colin MacLellan', 'Matt Lopez', 'Andy Garcia, Gloria Estefan, Adria Arjona, Isabela Merced, Diego Boneta, Ana Fabrega, Enrique Murciano, Laura Harring', 'PG-13', 'A father comes to grips with his daughter’s upcoming wedding through the prism of multiple relationships within a big, sprawling Cuban-American family.', 'A father comes to grips with his daughter’s upcoming wedding through the prism of multiple relationships within a big, sprawling Cuban-American family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chKMG9tzFqSkj24ejXTio156Qo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746419'),
  ('776815059861267699', 'Father of the Bride Part 3 (ish)', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Nancy Meyers', 'Nancy Meyers', 'Steve Martin, Diane Keaton, Kieran Culkin, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Florence Pugh, Ben Platt, George Newbern, Alexandra Shipp', 'NR', 'The Banks Family reunites 25 years later for a very special event to benefit World Central Kitchen.', 'The Banks Family reunites 25 years later for a very special event to benefit World Central Kitchen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOsDWEq7U9xAtflxjUq83e0sBTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746358'),
  ('34983094442258829', 'Father of the Bride Part II', 1995, 'Comedy, Family', 'Charles Shyer, William A. Fraker, Jeff Greenberg', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Steve Martin, Diane Keaton, Martin Short, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, George Newbern, Kieran Culkin, BD Wong, Peter Michael Goetz', 'PG', 'Just when George Banks has recovered from his daughter''s wedding, he receives the news that she''s pregnant ... and that George''s wife is expecting too. He was planning on selling their home, but that''s a plan that—like George—will have to change with the arrival of both a grandchild and a kid of his own.', 'Just when George Banks has recovered from his daughter''s wedding, he receives the news that she''s pregnant ... and that George''s wife is expecting too. He was planning on selling their home, but that''s a plan that—like George—will have to change with the arrival of both a grandchild and a kid of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rj4LBtwQ0uGrpBnCELr716Qo3mw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11862'),
  ('1078326776264221884', 'Father of the Year', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Brad Shield, Tyler Spindel', 'Brandon Cournoyer, Tyler Spindel', 'David Spade, Nat Faxon, Joey Bragg, Matt Shively, Bridgit Mendler, Bill Kottkamp, Jackie Sandler, Ashley Rae Spillers', null, 'Two college grads return to their hometown, where a hypothetical question -- whose dad would win in a fight? -- leads to mass mayhem.', 'Two college grads return to their hometown, where a hypothetical question -- whose dad would win in a fight? -- leads to mass mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmBdCkZxHwQn5zM17cZmd3giJCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531949'),
  ('572372253783577019', 'Father Soldier Son', 2020, 'Documentary, War', 'Leslye Davis, Catrin Einhorn, Leslye Davis', null, 'Brian Eisch, Isaac Eisch, Joey Eisch, Roxanne Gregory', 'R', 'When Sgt. First Class Brian Eisch is critically wounded in Afghanistan, it sets him and his sons on a journey of love, loss, redemption and legacy.', 'When Sgt. First Class Brian Eisch is critically wounded in Afghanistan, it sets him and his sons on a journey of love, loss, redemption and legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AIU4rH3ExBHQg92UHYxFYxP82M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695476'),
  ('156983256167160094', 'Father Son Therapy', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Émile Gaudreault, Ronald Plante', 'Philippe de Chauveron, Guy Laurent, Émile Gaudreault', 'Richard Berry, Waly Dia, Jacques Gamblin, Baptiste Lorber, Damien Jouillerot, Féodor Atkine, Julie Ferrier, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu', null, 'A cop and his son have to put away their differences while undercover on a therapeutic trip.', 'A cop and his son have to put away their differences while undercover on a therapeutic trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvqdwX5w22OnLbvamu05cmSPAWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395762'),
  ('550653744568688741', 'Father Stu', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jacques Jouffret, Rosalind Ross, Phil DeSanti', 'Rosalind Ross', 'Mark Wahlberg, Mel Gibson, Jacki Weaver, Teresa Ruiz, Malcolm McDowell, Annet Mahendru, Cody Fern, Winter Ave Zoli', 'R', 'The true-life story of boxer-turned-priest. When an injury ends his amateur boxing career, Stuart Long moves to Los Angeles to find money and fame. While scraping by as a supermarket clerk, he meets Carmen, a Sunday school teacher who seems immune to his bad-boy charm. Determined to win her over, the longtime agnostic starts going to church to impress her. However, a motorcycle accident leaves him wondering if he can use his second chance to help others, leading to the surprising realization that he''s meant to be a Catholic priest.', 'The true-life story of boxer-turned-priest. When an injury ends his amateur boxing career, Stuart Long moves to Los Angeles to find money and fame. While scraping by as a supermarket clerk, he meets Carmen, a Sunday school teacher who seems immune to his bad-boy charm. Determined to win her over, the longtime agnostic starts going to church to impress her. However, a motorcycle accident leaves him wondering if he can use his second chance to help others, leading to the surprising realization that he''s meant to be a Catholic priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLAeWgqXbTeJ2gQtNvRmdIncYsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809140'),
  ('518403659999665608', 'Father There Is Only One 2', 2020, 'Comedy, Family', 'Santiago Segura', 'Santiago Segura, Marta González de Vega', 'Santiago Segura, Toni Acosta, Martina D’Antiochia, Calma Segura, Luna Fulgencio, Carlos González Morollón, Sirena Segura, Loles León', null, 'The success of the Conchy virtual assistant (which was developed by Javier) has earned him a favorable spot in the parents chat room - until something unexpected ruins it all.', 'The success of the Conchy virtual assistant (which was developed by Javier) has earned him a favorable spot in the parents chat room - until something unexpected ruins it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwPb2AfNzQXjb8sUM6mCzMvN5T3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668742'),
  ('298465268028565916', 'Father There is Only One 4', 2024, 'Family, Comedy', 'Santiago Segura, Javier Salmones', 'Marta González de Vega, Santiago Segura', 'Santiago Segura, Toni Acosta, Leo Harlem, Carlos Iglesias, Silvia Abril, Loles León, El Cejas, Martina D’Antiochia', null, 'The eldest of the family, Sara, comes of age and brings chaos to the family by announcing her intention to marry Ocho. Javier and Marisa try to avoid it at all costs. At the same time Dani has an existential crisis, Paulita feels jealous of Cris, Carlota announces that she has found a boyfriend from a high society family and Rocio has finally managed to be cast in her first film.', 'The eldest of the family, Sara, comes of age and brings chaos to the family by announcing her intention to marry Ocho. Javier and Marisa try to avoid it at all costs. At the same time Dani has an existential crisis, Paulita feels jealous of Cris, Carlota announces that she has found a boyfriend from a high society family and Rocio has finally managed to be cast in her first film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTMvGolGJLF0GQ7mlwNjbXpsPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030076'),
  ('69204406391503019', 'Father: The Judgement is inconclusive', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Chaminda Jayasooriya', 'Chamara Kodithuwakku', 'Saumya Liyanage, Poojana Dandeniya, Jagath Manuwarna Kodithuwakku, Bimal Jayakody, Shyam Fernando', null, 'In the 1970s, in the Gampaha district, Desmond Gunasekara , a deeply religious young man from a very ordinary family, accidentally clashes with a crime gang led by a man named Gnane operating in the area.', 'In the 1970s, in the Gampaha district, Desmond Gunasekara , a deeply religious young man from a very ordinary family, accidentally clashes with a crime gang led by a man named Gnane operating in the area.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FnKQWPTTh2h56pvpJHkAbB0qEYj.jpg', 'plex:movie:father-the-judgement-is-inconclusive'),
  ('1040571360059091132', 'Father’s Chair', 2012, 'Drama', 'Luciano Moura, Adrian Teijido', 'Luciano Moura, Elena Soarez', 'Wagner Moura, Mariana Lima, Brás Antunes, Lima Duarte, Abrahão Farc, Rui Rezende, Lúcia Bronstein, Edmilson Cordeiro', 'PG-13', 'Theo is living the good life in an upscale Brazilian neighborhood. He’s a hardworking doctor, husband, and father. However, Theo has chosen his career over his family, and little by little he discovers that his world is crumbling around him. His beloved mentor and surrogate father is dying, and his wife announces that she wants a divorce. Yet nothing prepares him for the day when he comes home to discover that his 15-year-old son, Pedro, has disappeared. Theo takes to the road in search of his son. In a journey that leads him throughout Brazil, Theo discovers what really matters to him. Searching for his missing son, Theo finds himself.', 'Theo is living the good life in an upscale Brazilian neighborhood. He’s a hardworking doctor, husband, and father. However, Theo has chosen his career over his family, and little by little he discovers that his world is crumbling around him. His beloved mentor and surrogate father is dying, and his wife announces that she wants a divorce. Yet nothing prepares him for the day when he comes home to discover that his 15-year-old son, Pedro, has disappeared. Theo takes to the road in search of his son. In a journey that leads him throughout Brazil, Theo discovers what really matters to him. Searching for his missing son, Theo finds himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6whqmaU1uYiaeAla2jxIDYla0py.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84195'),
  ('302691087491389878', 'Father''s Day', 2011, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Matthew Kennedy, Conor Sweeney, Adam Brooks', 'Steven Kostanski, Matthew Kennedy, Conor Sweeney', 'Adam Brooks, Matthew Kennedy, Conor Sweeney, Amy Groening, Garrett Hnatiuk, Brent Neale, Kevin Anderson, Meredith Sweeney', null, 'Ahab, a man obsessed with exacting a brutal, violent revenge on the man who murdered his dad, joins John, an eager priest, and Twink, a hot-headed street hustler, on an epic quest to find and defeat this mythical monster known as Chris Fuchman AKA The Father''s Day Killer.', 'Ahab, a man obsessed with exacting a brutal, violent revenge on the man who murdered his dad, joins John, an eager priest, and Twink, a hot-headed street hustler, on an epic quest to find and defeat this mythical monster known as Chris Fuchman AKA The Father''s Day Killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCRsXeAAj6nwf9kCt0e1wImalIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63350'),
  ('774792549296102757', 'Father''s Day', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aleksi Salmenperä, Tuomo Hutri, Joona Mielonen, Mikko Niskala', 'Aleksi Salmenperä', 'Tommi Korpela, Laura Birn, Tomi Lindfors, Varpu Rintanen, Vilja Rintanen', null, 'Tinke, who has been drinking his health away, lives in a care home, where his dark humour and his friend Veikko keeps him going. When Saimi''s teenage twins, whom he vaguely remembers from years ago, decide to find out about their father, their search leads them to Tinke. Saimi is determined to prevent the twins from meeting Tinke, but Veikko, who has been caught up in the mess, disagrees.', 'Tinke, who has been drinking his health away, lives in a care home, where his dark humour and his friend Veikko keeps him going. When Saimi''s teenage twins, whom he vaguely remembers from years ago, decide to find out about their father, their search leads them to Tinke. Saimi is determined to prevent the twins from meeting Tinke, but Veikko, who has been caught up in the mess, disagrees.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fa93RrzbmqFRyhyyTX6IFomUK0ZF.jpg', 'plex:movie:isanpaiva-2026'),
  ('546554687849626962', 'Father''s Day Off', 1953, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Alan Reed', null, 'Mrs. Goofy leaves for the day leaving the house in the hands of her husband, Goofy. Goofy is confident that he can handle the day''s household chores but he keeps making typical goof-ups while attempting them. His first mistake is sending Junior to school on a Saturday. At first, he just makes small blunders but, of course, they keep escalating to the point where his house is flooded, scribbled on, set on fire, invaded by firemen and policemen alike, and, basically, an utter disaster area when the wife returns.', 'Mrs. Goofy leaves for the day leaving the house in the hands of her husband, Goofy. Goofy is confident that he can handle the day''s household chores but he keeps making typical goof-ups while attempting them. His first mistake is sending Junior to school on a Saturday. At first, he just makes small blunders but, of course, they keep escalating to the point where his house is flooded, scribbled on, set on fire, invaded by firemen and policemen alike, and, basically, an utter disaster area when the wife returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l6UTde7YVotIPwiy8r1XxDSXWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66852'),
  ('411973505697854554', 'Father''s Law', 1999, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Marek Kondrat, Paweł Edelman', 'Michał Szczerbic', 'Marek Kondrat, Nina Roguz, Szymon Bobrowski, Piotr Machalica, Jeremi Jemiołowicz, Łukasz Nowicki, Dorota Landowska, Małgorzata Foremniak', null, 'When the ex-racing driver''s teenage daughter is brutally raped, her father seeks justice on his own.', 'When the ex-racing driver''s teenage daughter is brutally raped, her father seeks justice on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viSznT0E8b3o3v1cHKE0We6EP79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107789'),
  ('851773935178097001', 'Father''s Lion', 1952, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Bobby Driscoll', null, 'George Geef takes his son camping. His son thinks he sees lions everywhere; George can''t see them even when they are right next to him. Lucky for George, his son''s got his trusty pop-gun.', 'George Geef takes his son camping. His son thinks he sees lions everywhere; George can''t see them even when they are right next to him. Lucky for George, his son''s got his trusty pop-gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rse3qGMjRzLzj8C0kOOORhluXLv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66862'),
  ('512381174360261228', 'Father''s Little Dividend', 1951, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Vincente Minnelli, John Alton', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Spencer Tracy, Joan Bennett, Elizabeth Taylor, Don Taylor, Billie Burke, Moroni Olsen, Richard Rober, Marietta Canty', 'NR', 'Newly married Kay Dunstan announces that she and her husband are having a baby, leaving her father to come to grips with the fact that he will soon be a granddad.', 'Newly married Kay Dunstan announces that she and her husband are having a baby, leaving her father to come to grips with the fact that he will soon be a granddad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqGO8WJwha5Shc4I640s5xBndOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22968'),
  ('185888893201327867', 'Father''s Week-End', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, June Foray', null, 'Goofy plays everyman again. He''s an average working joe who demonstrates "the up on time/work on time/bed on time" routine while going from work to home every weekday. On Saturday night, however, he parties it up and attempts to get some rest the next Sunday but with his son around, it''s impossible. He insists Dad take him to the beach and, although Goofy refuses, he ends up going anyway where he gets into all sorts of trouble mainly as the result of chasing his son all over the place. Worse yet, when he leaves, he falls victim to the world''s biggest traffic jam. As a result of all this, he is relieved to go back to work the following week!', 'Goofy plays everyman again. He''s an average working joe who demonstrates "the up on time/work on time/bed on time" routine while going from work to home every weekday. On Saturday night, however, he parties it up and attempts to get some rest the next Sunday but with his son around, it''s impossible. He insists Dad take him to the beach and, although Goofy refuses, he ends up going anyway where he gets into all sorts of trouble mainly as the result of chasing his son all over the place. Worse yet, when he leaves, he falls victim to the world''s biggest traffic jam. As a result of all this, he is relieved to go back to work the following week!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6olhTOZthardxsG3tPWYulsQXxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66863'),
  ('797539999247310180', 'Fatherhood', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Natalia Grijalva, Jean-Andre Carriere, Renato De Cotiis', 'Paul Weitz, Dana Stevens', 'Kevin Hart, Melody Hurd, Alfre Woodard, DeWanda Wise, Lil Rel Howery, Anthony Carrigan, Deborah Ayorinde, Thedra Porter', 'PG-13', 'A widowed new dad copes with doubts, fears, heartache and dirty diapers as he sets out to raise his daughter on his own. Inspired by a true story.', 'A widowed new dad copes with doubts, fears, heartache and dirty diapers as he sets out to raise his daughter on his own. Inspired by a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvqO1gTAMZIFGi3Ioq1BN6KV95R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607259'),
  ('48735398040796252', 'Fatherland', 1986, 'Drama, Music', 'Ken Loach, Chris Menges', 'Trevor Griffiths', 'Gerulf Pannach, Fabienne Babe, Cristine Rose, Sigfrit Steiner, Heike Schroetter, Patrick Gilbert, Stephan Samuel, Heinz G. Diesing', null, 'Persona Non Grata in his homeland, protest singer Klaus Drittemann must leave East Berlin, his wife and child and emigrate to West Berlin, where the representatives of an American record company are eagerly waiting for him. They plan to exploit his defection from communism both ideologically and financially. But Klaus, as ill-at-ease in the West as he was in the East, is reluctant to be used as an expendable commodity. Leaving his contract unsigned (or signed in his manner), he leaves for Cambridge to meet his father, a concert player, who - just like him - left East Berlin thirty years ago as Klaus was a little boy. He is accompanied by a young French journalist, Emma, who knows where his father has been living since he disappeared for more than a decade. The young lady is cooperative but might hide things from him...', 'Persona Non Grata in his homeland, protest singer Klaus Drittemann must leave East Berlin, his wife and child and emigrate to West Berlin, where the representatives of an American record company are eagerly waiting for him. They plan to exploit his defection from communism both ideologically and financially. But Klaus, as ill-at-ease in the West as he was in the East, is reluctant to be used as an expendable commodity. Leaving his contract unsigned (or signed in his manner), he leaves for Cambridge to meet his father, a concert player, who - just like him - left East Berlin thirty years ago as Klaus was a little boy. He is accompanied by a young French journalist, Emma, who knows where his father has been living since he disappeared for more than a decade. The young lady is cooperative but might hide things from him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyCyJBiLe45Kd7ZVWZeVVc1NoEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129455'),
  ('13299570381307318', 'Fatherland', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, TV Movie', 'Christopher Menaul, Peter Sova', 'Stanley Weiser, Ron Hutchinson', 'Rutger Hauer, Miranda Richardson, Peter Vaughan, Michael Kitchen, Jean Marsh, John Shrapnel, John Woodvine, Bob Mason', null, 'Fictional account of what might have happened if Hitler had won the war. It is now the 1960s and Germany''s war crimes have so far been kept a secret. Hitler wants to talk peace with the US president. An American journalist and a German homicide cop stumble into a plot to destroy all evidence of the genocide.', 'Fictional account of what might have happened if Hitler had won the war. It is now the 1960s and Germany''s war crimes have so far been kept a secret. Hitler wants to talk peace with the US president. An American journalist and a German homicide cop stumble into a plot to destroy all evidence of the genocide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSOyk8fWs2sN7YHXsbsp5ZxcGG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11248'),
  ('884169918800552763', 'Fathers', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Buncha Luangaccaratorn, Jitrapa Manmungsil, Chalida Subnen', 'Palatpol Mingpornpichit', 'Uttsada Panichkul, Nat Sakdatorn, Sinjai Plengpanich, Raiwin Sirisatiensakul, Rangsima Mathipornwanich, Lerwith Sangsith, Sasinan Pattana, Sirawich Tangjitmankong', null, 'A gay couple faces personal challenges and society''s expectations when their adopted son starts grade school and notices his family''s unique dynamic.', 'A gay couple faces personal challenges and society''s expectations when their adopted son starts grade school and notices his family''s unique dynamic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MK9wGqRwupe8v7MdPwh5Cffuks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425208'),
  ('127502754895153368', 'Fathers & Sons', 1992, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Paul Mones, Ron Fortunato', 'Paul Mones', 'Jeff Goldblum, Rory Cochrane, Mitch Marchand, Famke Janssen, Natasha Gregson Wagner, Erika Alexander, Rocky Carroll, Paul Hipp', null, 'A beach runner and bookworm has difficulty communicating with his son. He meets a psychic on a pier at the beach and soon his world turns topsy-turvy with a serial killer coming between him and his son. The ensuing E.S.P. experiences and danger bond father and son.', 'A beach runner and bookworm has difficulty communicating with his son. He meets a psychic on a pier at the beach and soon his world turns topsy-turvy with a serial killer coming between him and his son. The ensuing E.S.P. experiences and danger bond father and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lfeEfKHxOyZptKBcxtCkBwqj20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86299'),
  ('642348793482839380', 'Fathers and Daughters', 2015, 'Drama', 'Gabriele Muccino, Shane Hurlbut', 'Brad Desch', 'Amanda Seyfried, Russell Crowe, Aaron Paul, Diane Kruger, Jane Fonda, Bruce Greenwood, Octavia Spencer, Quvenzhané Wallis', 'R', 'A Pulitzer-winning writer grapples with being a widower and father after a mental breakdown, while, 27 years later, his grown daughter struggles to forge connections of her own.', 'A Pulitzer-winning writer grapples with being a widower and father after a mental breakdown, while, 27 years later, his grown daughter struggles to forge connections of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgzp7gGea27hN5d26mgKtZJQgX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254172'),
  ('47313987673895105', 'Fathers and Mothers', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Paprika Steen, Jan Pallesen, Roni Ezra', 'Jakob Weis', 'Amanda Collin, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Lisa Loven Kongsli, Lars Brygmann, Katrine Greis-Rosenthal, Mikael Birkkjær, Carsten Bjørnlund, Jacob Lohmann', null, 'Follows Piv and Ulrik, who are trying to become part of the parent group in their daughter''s new school class, going to great lengths to be admitted.', 'Follows Piv and Ulrik, who are trying to become part of the parent group in their daughter''s new school class, going to great lengths to be admitted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5gEPhUiajwQ4Xs5BgrY6TKlM1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986812'),
  ('293241438588909658', 'Fathers and Sons', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Leonida Barboni, Mario Maffei, Mario Monicelli', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Agenore Incrocci, Mario Monicelli', 'Vittorio De Sica, Marcello Mastroianni, Antonella Lualdi, Marisa Merlini, Franco Interlenghi, Lorella De Luca, Memmo Carotenuto, Raffaele Pisu', null, 'The adventures of a young couple of high school students: her father is not opposed to their love, but the other, a doctor of prestige, is not at all happy about it.', 'The adventures of a young couple of high school students: her father is not opposed to their love, but the other, a doctor of prestige, is not at all happy about it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNEuDVz1UbFL0xUpFHoeu8xdmyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217648'),
  ('298833634141796107', 'Fathers Are People', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Bobby Driscoll, June Foray, Bob Jackman', null, 'George Geef rushes to the office to inform his fellow employees, "Hey, fellas! I''m a father!". Unfortunately, Geef later learns that, with fatherhood, comes responsibility and lots of it. He must discipline his son when he starts fighting with neighboring kids, filling his pipe with bubble water, and pestering him while he tries to read the newspaper. But most difficult of all is getting him to pick up his toys which is no easy task. Finally, he gets ready to apply hair brush to child''s behind but is talked out of it when he sees his son sleeping peacefully. "Kids, they''re wonderful," he concludes.', 'George Geef rushes to the office to inform his fellow employees, "Hey, fellas! I''m a father!". Unfortunately, Geef later learns that, with fatherhood, comes responsibility and lots of it. He must discipline his son when he starts fighting with neighboring kids, filling his pipe with bubble water, and pestering him while he tries to read the newspaper. But most difficult of all is getting him to pick up his toys which is no easy task. Finally, he gets ready to apply hair brush to child''s behind but is talked out of it when he sees his son sleeping peacefully. "Kids, they''re wonderful," he concludes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epB6Q2HhaJhMio6MqFfkNE2AQTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66851'),
  ('1042742864057201869', 'Fathers'' Day', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ivan Reitman, Stephen H. Burum, Kevin Kavanaugh', 'Francis Veber', 'Robin Williams, Billy Crystal, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Nastassja Kinski, Charlie Hofheimer, Bruce Greenwood, Dennis Burkley, Haylie Johnson', 'PG-13', 'A woman cons two old boyfriends into searching for her runaway son by convincing both that they are the boy''s father.', 'A woman cons two old boyfriends into searching for her runaway son by convincing both that they are the boy''s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/834wRxQRbbctFupf8AES7CCeTSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12499'),
  ('98146860582192441', 'Fathom', 1967, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Leslie H. Martinson, Douglas Slocombe, David Tringham', 'Lorenzo Semple Jr.', 'Raquel Welch, Anthony Franciosa, Ronald Fraser, Richard Briers, Greta Chi, Tom Adams, Elizabeth Ercy, Ann Lancaster', 'NR', 'While touring abroad in Europe, beautiful American skydiver Fathom Harvill gets wrapped up in international intrigue when Scottish spy Douglas Campbell recruits her to help him on a secret mission. Before long, Fathom realizes that no one around her, including the mysterious Peter Merriweather, can easily be trusted, leading to various adventures that involve bull fighting, beaches and, of course, romance.', 'While touring abroad in Europe, beautiful American skydiver Fathom Harvill gets wrapped up in international intrigue when Scottish spy Douglas Campbell recruits her to help him on a secret mission. Before long, Fathom realizes that no one around her, including the mysterious Peter Merriweather, can easily be trusted, leading to various adventures that involve bull fighting, beaches and, of course, romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8ere2qGBpoJ92lL6fsJ3hrYT6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43915'),
  ('777087589459811621', 'Fatima', 2015, 'Drama, Family', 'Philippe Faucon, Laurent Fénart', 'Philippe Faucon', 'Soria Zeroual, Zita Hanrot, Kenza Noah Aïche, Chawki Amari, Dalila Bencherif, Edith Saulnier, Mehdi Senoussi, Franck Andrieux', null, 'Fatima, an Algerian-born woman who now lives in France with her two teenage daughters, with whom she is barely able to communicate.', 'Fatima, an Algerian-born woman who now lives in France with her two teenage daughters, with whom she is barely able to communicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btzQZUQv2jsJ3M8EDyaSsM7YlBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336807'),
  ('72521082158372549', 'Fatima', 2020, 'Drama', 'Vincenzo Carpineta, Augusto Mayer, Edoardo Ferretti', 'Valerio D''Annunzio, Marco Pontecorvo, Barbara Nicolosi', 'Harvey Keitel, Sonia Braga, Goran Višnjić, Joaquim de Almeida, Lúcia Moniz, Joana Ribeiro, Stephanie Gil, Catarina Mira', 'PG-13', 'In 1917, outside the parish of Fátima, Portugal, a 10-year-old girl and her two younger cousins witness multiple visitations of the Virgin Mary, who tells them that only prayer and suffering will bring an end to World War I. As secularist government officials and Church leaders try to force the children to recant their story, word of the sighting spreads across the country, inspiring religious pilgrims to flock to the site in hopes of witnessing a miracle..', 'In 1917, outside the parish of Fátima, Portugal, a 10-year-old girl and her two younger cousins witness multiple visitations of the Virgin Mary, who tells them that only prayer and suffering will bring an end to World War I. As secularist government officials and Church leaders try to force the children to recant their story, word of the sighting spreads across the country, inspiring religious pilgrims to flock to the site in hopes of witnessing a miracle..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfA46pZbk4kxIaQvHyBPq0KH84Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520318'),
  ('487116709207799895', 'Fátima', 2017, 'Drama', 'João Canijo, Mário Castanheira', 'João Canijo', 'Rita Blanco, Anabela Moreira, Cleia Almeida, Teresa Tavares, Ana Bustorff, Sara Norte, Márcia Breia, Irís Macedo', null, 'The journey of 11 women while they go on a pilgrimage from Bragança to Fatima.', 'The journey of 11 women while they go on a pilgrimage from Bragança to Fatima.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yqS2CW5oyWdWRFvb4pCA7U4SOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418974'),
  ('821631905860706353', 'Fatman', 2020, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Ian Nelms, Eshom Nelms, Joseph J. Gillanders', 'Eshom Nelms, Ian Nelms', 'Mel Gibson, Walton Goggins, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Chance Hurstfield, Susanne Sutchy, Robert Bockstael, Michael Dyson, Deborah Grover', 'R', 'A rowdy, unorthodox Santa Claus is fighting to save his declining business. Meanwhile, Billy, a neglected and precocious 12 year old, hires a hit man to kill Santa after receiving a lump of coal in his stocking.', 'A rowdy, unorthodox Santa Claus is fighting to save his declining business. Meanwhile, Billy, a neglected and precocious 12 year old, hires a hit man to kill Santa after receiving a lump of coal in his stocking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n8QNNdk4BOX9Dslfbz5Dy6j1HK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602211'),
  ('662299410529083444', 'Fatso', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Anne Bancroft, Brianne Murphy', 'Anne Bancroft', 'Dom DeLuise, Anne Bancroft, Ron Carey, Candice Azzara, Michael Lombard, Sal Viscuso, Delia Salvi, Robert Costanzo', 'PG', 'Dominick DiNapoli is a man who loves food and is overweight as a result. After an obese cousin dies due to health problems, Dominick''s sister Antoinette sets out to help him lose weight. Although he has a hard time trying to slim down, Dominick finds inspiration when he meets and falls for shop owner Lydia. Can he get up the courage to ask her out, or will he go back to the comfort of overeating?', 'Dominick DiNapoli is a man who loves food and is overweight as a result. After an obese cousin dies due to health problems, Dominick''s sister Antoinette sets out to help him lose weight. Although he has a hard time trying to slim down, Dominick finds inspiration when he meets and falls for shop owner Lydia. Can he get up the courage to ask her out, or will he go back to the comfort of overeating?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYJLFdW1sucYRvqgfhC6MkX8Sme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38922'),
  ('207858460639859635', 'Fatso', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Arild Fröhlich, Askild Vik Edvardsen', 'Lars Gudmestad, Arild Fröhlich', 'Nils Jørgen Kaalstad, Josefin Ljungman, Kyrre Hellum, Jenny Skavlan, Per Kjerstad, Lisa Loven Kongsli, Mattis Herman Nyquist, Ann Eleonora Jørgensen', null, 'Overweight loner Rino spends his days in seclusion, until his dad rents a room to an overtly sexual girl who challenges Rino to break down his walls.', 'Overweight loner Rino spends his days in seclusion, until his dad rents a room to an overtly sexual girl who challenges Rino to break down his walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OVAzfeTRPI16iXbDaxdo0wmHVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16324'),
