  ('355165096211910235', 'Fatum', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Diego Méndez Lamas, Juan Galiñanes, Héctor Rodríguez', 'Juan Galiñanes, Alberto Marini', 'Luis Tosar, Elena Anaya, Álex García, Arón Piper, María Luisa Mayol, Pepa Gracia, Ethan Álvarez, Valentina Quiza', null, 'After receiving a tip-off, compulsive gambler Sergio returns to the betting house trying to recover all the money he has lost , but another gambler bursts into the place with a gun and a gunshot will change his life forever.', 'After receiving a tip-off, compulsive gambler Sergio returns to the betting house trying to recover all the money he has lost , but another gambler bursts into the place with a gun and a gunshot will change his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzmmJAa3OX302flRxg6fEf18FLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053587'),
  ('664605285847988751', 'Fauci', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Janet Tobias, John Hoffman, Claudia Raschke', null, 'Anthony Fauci, Christine Grady', 'PG-13', 'Exclusive access into the career and life of the public servant who has advised seven U.S. presidents beginning with the AIDS pandemic in the 1980s and through SARS, Ebola and COVID-19.', 'Exclusive access into the career and life of the public servant who has advised seven U.S. presidents beginning with the AIDS pandemic in the 1980s and through SARS, Ebola and COVID-19.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxBNDSHsDGIdfI8IRaKUg5woeRd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:825422'),
  ('209943520768020974', 'Faultless', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Sébastien Marnier, Laurent Brunet', 'Sébastien Marnier, Samuel Doux', 'Marina Foïs, Jérémie Elkaïm, Joséphine Japy, Benjamin Biolay, Jean-Luc Vincent, Jeanne Rosa, Véronique Ruggia Saura, Xavier Robic', null, 'Constance, a 40-years-old real estate agent, gets fired from her job. With no options left, she contacts her former boss, from the small agency where she started her career. To her surprise, he is hiring, but explains he may have already found someone. Constance is convinced she will get the job because of her experience and extensive qualifications. But when Audrey, a younger and prettier woman, is hired instead, it proves too much for Constance to take.', 'Constance, a 40-years-old real estate agent, gets fired from her job. With no options left, she contacts her former boss, from the small agency where she started her career. To her surprise, he is hiring, but explains he may have already found someone. Constance is convinced she will get the job because of her experience and extensive qualifications. But when Audrey, a younger and prettier woman, is hired instead, it proves too much for Constance to take.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oS7NwVS2Rm5jJT3YudiOrRUCOSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400711'),
  ('136921363152144819', 'Faults', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Riley Stearns, Michael Ragen', 'Riley Stearns', 'Leland Orser, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Chris Ellis, Jon Gries, Lance Reddick, Beth Grant, Cruz Flores, AJ Bowen', null, 'Claire is under the grip of a mysterious new cult called Faults. Desperate to be reunited with their daughter, Claire''s parents recruit one of the world''s foremost experts on mind control, Ansel Roth.', 'Claire is under the grip of a mysterious new cult called Faults. Desperate to be reunited with their daughter, Claire''s parents recruit one of the world''s foremost experts on mind control, Ansel Roth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syUVk09hC701h3C1pjaB69LXwJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243526'),
  ('456523813200444903', 'Faust', 1960, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Peter Gorski, Gustaf Gründgens', 'Johann Wolfgang von Goethe', 'Will Quadflieg, Gustaf Gründgens, Elisabeth Flickenschildt, Hermann Schomberg, Eduard Marks, Uwe Friedrichsen, Ella Büchi, Heinz Reincke', null, 'In 1957 Gustaf Gründgens staged a new production of Goethe''s Faust in which he once again played Mephisto, a part he had played since 1932. The brilliant production was a huge success and ran for a couple of years. In 1959 Peter Gorski captured the performance on film in his directorial film debut. Basically it is a registration of the production, but Gorksi did manage to accentuate the details of the acting by using enough medium and close-up shots which give a view on the acting you normally would not able to see in a theater.', 'In 1957 Gustaf Gründgens staged a new production of Goethe''s Faust in which he once again played Mephisto, a part he had played since 1932. The brilliant production was a huge success and ran for a couple of years. In 1959 Peter Gorski captured the performance on film in his directorial film debut. Basically it is a registration of the production, but Gorksi did manage to accentuate the details of the acting by using enough medium and close-up shots which give a view on the acting you normally would not able to see in a theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3m9EvQxCy9V4yL5RinB5G1OOmTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114242'),
  ('748876068498162000', 'Faust', 1994, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Petr Čepek, Jan Kraus, Vladimír Kudla, Antonín Zacpal, Jiří Suchý, Viktorie Knotková, Jana Mézlová, Miluse Straková', null, 'A very free adaptation of Marlowe''s "Doctor Faustus", Goethe''s "Faust" and various other treatments of the old legend of the man who sold his soul to the devil. A nondescript man is lured by a strange map into a sinister puppet theatre, where he finds himself immersed in an indescribably weird version of the play, blending live actors, clay animation and giant puppets.', 'A very free adaptation of Marlowe''s "Doctor Faustus", Goethe''s "Faust" and various other treatments of the old legend of the man who sold his soul to the devil. A nondescript man is lured by a strange map into a sinister puppet theatre, where he finds himself immersed in an indescribably weird version of the play, blending live actors, clay animation and giant puppets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyCHHLEdRJPx0BD22n9Cs7B78Wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18919'),
  ('178710991624427519', 'Faust', 2011, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Bruno Delbonnel', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Marina Koreneva', 'Johannes Zeiler, Anton Adasinsky, Isolda Dychauk-Ott, Georg Friedrich, Hanna Schygulla, Florian Brückner, Antje Lewald, Maxim Mehmet', null, 'A doctor in early 19th-century Germany becomes infatuated with the sister of a man he unintentionally killed and bargains with the Devil incarnate to conjure their union in exchange for his soul.', 'A doctor in early 19th-century Germany becomes infatuated with the sister of a man he unintentionally killed and bargains with the Devil incarnate to conjure their union in exchange for his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jH8wVLNZ24QVxm5IEByWpsmHXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77560'),
  ('638485226339686037', 'Faust and Marguerite', 1904, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy, Jeanne Calvière', null, 'Faust and his love Marguerite are sentenced to Hell where they are showed the torture that awaits.', 'Faust and his love Marguerite are sentenced to Hell where they are showed the torture that awaits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGUNlJVqJfhg56u0HGghDvhWbNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196145'),
  ('360248996263762253', 'Faust and Mephistopheles', 1903, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A re-telling of the classic tale of Faust in all of two minutes by French filmmaker Alice Guy.', 'A re-telling of the classic tale of Faust in all of two minutes by French filmmaker Alice Guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfMQ2gMHcn6136DjGXYrmKBBNyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119984'),
  ('814894459270342375', 'Faust in the Underworld', 1903, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'The German legend of a scholar''s unholy pact with the Devil would have been very familiar to most moviegoers (at least European ones), so Georges Méliès'' early cinematic treatment likely got away with simply offering a fancifully illustrated late episode without the earlier narrative context (however, spoken narration provides some of the latter in this restored print). Tempted by Mephistopheles with all kinds of dancing and ethereal babes, Faust is at first excited and then terrified by the sight of various demons and monsters. The painted-set designers really went hog wild on this one, depicting the (sometimes sexy) torments of subterranean Hell with in bold terms (even when ballerinas prance in the foreground). (Dennis Harvey, Fandor)', 'The German legend of a scholar''s unholy pact with the Devil would have been very familiar to most moviegoers (at least European ones), so Georges Méliès'' early cinematic treatment likely got away with simply offering a fancifully illustrated late episode without the earlier narrative context (however, spoken narration provides some of the latter in this restored print). Tempted by Mephistopheles with all kinds of dancing and ethereal babes, Faust is at first excited and then terrified by the sight of various demons and monsters. The painted-set designers really went hog wild on this one, depicting the (sometimes sexy) torments of subterranean Hell with in bold terms (even when ballerinas prance in the foreground). (Dennis Harvey, Fandor)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqg7v82BnHspy4Ll6HTdQdhHo4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190682'),
  ('1072319175960535123', 'Faust: Appearance of Mephistopheles', 1897, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'A short reenactment of a scene from Goethe''s Faust.', 'A short reenactment of a scene from Goethe''s Faust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ah1OaBjSnNtmQePUjgan4PAxIev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192794'),
  ('313710067402650857', 'Faust: Love of the Damned', 2000, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action', 'Brian Yuzna, Fernando Sánchez-Izquierdo, Jacques Haitkin', 'David Quinn', 'Mark Frost, Isabel Brook, Jennifer Rope, Jeffrey Combs, Mònica van Campen, Leslie Charles, Fermí Reixach, Junix Inocian', null, 'An artist sells his soul to the mysterious M in order to get revenge on the people who killed his girlfriend. Soon, he realises everything has a price, and he is transformed into a horned demon with a passion for killing.', 'An artist sells his soul to the mysterious M in order to get revenge on the people who killed his girlfriend. Soon, he realises everything has a price, and he is transformed into a horned demon with a passion for killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qewddAmFcD2XoGc4w1YwNdw8YXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64883'),
  ('201002714077080570', 'Faustina: Love and Mercy', 2019, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Michał Kondrat', 'Michał Kondrat', 'Kamila Kamińska, Maciej Małysa, Janusz Chabior, Remigiusz Jankowski, Piotr Cyrwus, Jacek Borkowski, Małgorzata Lewińska, Ewa Konstanciak', null, 'Docudrama tracing the life of Saint Faustina Kowalska, whose visions of Jesus Christ inspired the Roman Catholic devotion to the Divine Mercy and earned her the title of "Apostle of Divine Mercy".', 'Docudrama tracing the life of Saint Faustina Kowalska, whose visions of Jesus Christ inspired the Roman Catholic devotion to the Divine Mercy and earned her the title of "Apostle of Divine Mercy".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8pqRHRrCqcpj7bwkcPQwygJ4b8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588709'),
  ('1140958206991850237', 'Faustine and the Beautiful Summer', 1972, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Ghislain Cloquet, Nina Companéez', 'Nina Companéez', 'Muriel Catalá, Claire Vernet, Jacques Spiesser, Francis Huster, Georges Marchal, Isabelle Adjani, Marianne Eggerickx, Maurice Garrel', null, 'Faustine suffers the wounds of first love. During a summer when she is staying with her grandmother, she comes to know the nearby neighbors. Two brothers live in the large house. One is divorced and one has recently remarried, both of them live there with their teenaged and adult children. Though the boys of the household are drawn to Faustine, she grows ever more smitten with the divorced older man...', 'Faustine suffers the wounds of first love. During a summer when she is staying with her grandmother, she comes to know the nearby neighbors. Two brothers live in the large house. One is divorced and one has recently remarried, both of them live there with their teenaged and adult children. Though the boys of the household are drawn to Faustine, she grows ever more smitten with the divorced older man...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIomX5LwnsmcZkXtUWRfWxrfQaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259903'),
  ('586759184636655731', 'Fausto & Furio', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Germana Valentini, Lucio Gaudino', 'Alessandro Bonanni, Emiliano Morana', 'Enzo Salvi, Maurizio Battista, Stefano Ambrogi, Maria Del Monte, Ernesto Mahieux, Maurizio Mattioli, Salvatore Misticone, Barbara Foria', null, 'Fausto and Furio are two Romans with a precarious lifestyle. Fausto squanders his winnings while Furio lives thanks to small jobs. The death of their parents will make them meet because they inherit a repair shop. After some hesitation, the two, helped by an engineer with a mysterious past, will take the business over, but they will have to face a mafia boss who wants 200,000 euros, a debt matured by their fathers. The two will try to find a solution through clandestine races, drug trafficking, truck hijackings and the shared love for a fascinating bartender.', 'Fausto and Furio are two Romans with a precarious lifestyle. Fausto squanders his winnings while Furio lives thanks to small jobs. The death of their parents will make them meet because they inherit a repair shop. After some hesitation, the two, helped by an engineer with a mysterious past, will take the business over, but they will have to face a mafia boss who wants 200,000 euros, a debt matured by their fathers. The two will try to find a solution through clandestine races, drug trafficking, truck hijackings and the shared love for a fascinating bartender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IgG9fKcP4KQvTteIDUEgFO5YFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483517'),
  ('767553777951043724', 'Fausto 5.0', 2001, 'Drama, Horror', 'Isidro Ortiz, Alex Ollé', 'Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Miguel Ángel Solá, Eduard Fernández, Najwa Nimri, Rakel González-Huedo, Irene Montalà, Juan Fernández, Cristina Piaget, Carme Contreras', null, 'On his way to a medical convention, Dr Fausto runs into a man who claims the Doctor removed his stomach eight years ago in a surgical operation. Against all odds, he is still alive. The man turns up repeatedly and promises Fausto to make all his wishes come true. Reality starts dissolving and Fausto begins to lose control', 'On his way to a medical convention, Dr Fausto runs into a man who claims the Doctor removed his stomach eight years ago in a surgical operation. Against all odds, he is still alive. The man turns up repeatedly and promises Fausto to make all his wishes come true. Reality starts dissolving and Fausto begins to lose control', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ro3LJm6vfLTYymSwmKHMSUTsUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71786'),
  ('850118759353469553', 'Fauve', 2018, 'Drama', 'Jérémy Comte, Olivier Gossot, Catherine Kirouac', 'Jérémy Comte', 'Félix Grenier, Alexandre Perreault, Louise Bombardier', null, 'Set in a surface mine, two boys sink into a seemingly innocent power game with Mother Nature as the sole observer.', 'Set in a surface mine, two boys sink into a seemingly innocent power game with Mother Nature as the sole observer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VwI3q1AOxaCRMmMJ0ypV54IpJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504969'),
  ('1106134362019994303', 'Favorite Concubine', 2020, 'Drama', 'Richard Kim', null, 'Rika, Min Do-yoon, James', null, 'Jun-soo, a rich old man, decides to live in a local villa after retirement due to paralysis and health reasons. Only Jun-soo''s wife, Hye-sook, and Joo-seok, will move to the provinces, and Hye-sook will only wait for the day Jun-soo dies. Jun-soo gradually becomes paralyzed, so he relies on a wheelchair, and Hye-sook meets up Joo-seok. However, Jun-soo suffered from paralysis that night. Unaware of this, Hye-sook and Joo-seok hire Jun-soo''s caregiver to avoid Jun-soo and enjoy comfortably, but Joo-seok begins to look at the caregiver. After learning about the affair between Hye-sook and Joo-seok, Jun-soo begins to make a secret proposal to So-eun.', 'Jun-soo, a rich old man, decides to live in a local villa after retirement due to paralysis and health reasons. Only Jun-soo''s wife, Hye-sook, and Joo-seok, will move to the provinces, and Hye-sook will only wait for the day Jun-soo dies. Jun-soo gradually becomes paralyzed, so he relies on a wheelchair, and Hye-sook meets up Joo-seok. However, Jun-soo suffered from paralysis that night. Unaware of this, Hye-sook and Joo-seok hire Jun-soo''s caregiver to avoid Jun-soo and enjoy comfortably, but Joo-seok begins to look at the caregiver. After learning about the affair between Hye-sook and Joo-seok, Jun-soo begins to make a secret proposal to So-eun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGyQhfdqw9saOAlYHz4sxJO9Ot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793602'),
  ('479385030606252216', 'Favourites of the Moon', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Otar Iosseliani, Philippe Théaudière', 'Otar Iosseliani, Gérard Brach', 'Katja Rupé, Alix de Montaigu, Francois Michel, Jean-Pierre Beauviala, Pascal Aubier, Christiane Bailly, Bernard Eisenschitz, Hans Peter Cloos', null, 'A porcelain table service and a painting from the 19th century pass from hand to hand and deteriorate over time, sealing the fate of different characters who cross paths in Paris.', 'A porcelain table service and a painting from the 19th century pass from hand to hand and deteriorate over time, sealing the fate of different characters who cross paths in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOMkUa1XiAtldmfRwoeh130fB4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47450'),
  ('889206724255183346', 'Fay Grim', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Hal Hartley, Sarah Cawley', 'Hal Hartley', 'Parker Posey, Liam Aiken, James Urbaniak, Jeff Goldblum, D.J. Mendel, Megan Gay, Jasmin Tabatabai, Chuck Montgomery', 'R', 'Many years after her notorious husband, Henry Fool, fled after killing a neighbor, Fay Grim receives a visit from CIA agent Fulbright, who tells her that Henry is dead, but that some of his journals have been unearthed in France. She sets forth on a globe-trotting odyssey that soon leads to the discovery that he is alive, and his journals are more than they appear to be.', 'Many years after her notorious husband, Henry Fool, fled after killing a neighbor, Fay Grim receives a visit from CIA agent Fulbright, who tells her that Henry is dead, but that some of his journals have been unearthed in France. She sets forth on a globe-trotting odyssey that soon leads to the discovery that he is alive, and his journals are more than they appear to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20C2aywxWMvkXRP7H1mIkpJvxS7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24200'),
  ('708034807253318814', 'FB: Fighting Beat', 2007, 'Action', 'Piti Jaturaphat', 'Piti Jaturaphat', 'Than Thanakorn, Nattanun Jantarawetch, Sura Theerakon, Nahatai Lekbumrung, David Bueno, Lex de Groot, Perawatch Herabutya, Tim Man', null, 'A group of young Muay Thai experts led by David are forced to use their deadly training to protect themselves when the local extortionist threatens to kill their mentors daughter if he doesn''t give up his bar.', 'A group of young Muay Thai experts led by David are forced to use their deadly training to protect themselves when the local extortionist threatens to kill their mentors daughter if he doesn''t give up his bar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67iC3LyXvaogFMGpj6GsicGU7iC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13544'),
  ('248471553917661616', 'FC Venus', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joona Tena, Jarkko T. Laine, Hanna Virolainen', 'Katri Manninen, Joona Tena, Outi Keskevaari', 'Minna Haapkylä, Petteri Summanen, Laura Malmivaara, Taneli Mäkelä, Lotta Lehtikari, Miia Nuutila, Noora Peltokukka, Hannu-Pekka Björkman', null, 'Pete is a football enthusiast, who plays as a goalkeeper for FC HeMan, a team playing in the lowest possible league. His girlfriend, Anna, hates the whole sport. Pete and his teammates are planning to travel to watch the Football World Cup held in Germany. Anna is not excited about Pete''s plan to leave her alone for the summer. Therefore Anna decides to present a challenge to Pete: She will form a team from the wives and girlfriends of the FC HeMan players, and then the women''s team (FC Venus) would play against FC HeMan. If the women''s team wins, the men will have to give up football, and if the men''s team wins, the women will never complain about their hobby.', 'Pete is a football enthusiast, who plays as a goalkeeper for FC HeMan, a team playing in the lowest possible league. His girlfriend, Anna, hates the whole sport. Pete and his teammates are planning to travel to watch the Football World Cup held in Germany. Anna is not excited about Pete''s plan to leave her alone for the summer. Therefore Anna decides to present a challenge to Pete: She will form a team from the wives and girlfriends of the FC HeMan players, and then the women''s team (FC Venus) would play against FC HeMan. If the women''s team wins, the men will have to give up football, and if the men''s team wins, the women will never complain about their hobby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ANEWhwuZV6aNx45gZv0iAsSAcv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26147'),
  ('358536618749416041', 'FC Venus', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ute Wieland, Peter Przybylski, Bruno Grass', 'Outi Keskevaari, Katri Manninen', 'Christian Ulmen, Nora Tschirner, Florian Lukas, Anneke Kim Sarnau, Heinz Hoenig, Andreas Guenther, Petra Kleinert, Steffen Groth', null, 'Anna is persuaded by her boyfriend Paul to move from Berlin to his home town of Imma. What the notorious soccer hater doesn''t know, however, is that joining his best friend Steffen''s law firm is just a pretext. In reality, Paul and his buddies are there to save the soccer club he co-founded, Eintracht Imma 95, from relegation. Anna soon realizes that the players'' wives have nothing to say to their soccer junkies: Artificial turf in the bedroom, Effenberg bedding and weekends on the soccer pitch. When she finds out the real reason for the move, she mobilizes her fellow sufferers to counter-attack after a fierce bout of frustration and challenges Paul and his friends to the ultimate duel on the soccer pitch. The bet is on: women against men. If the women win, soccer is over - and Paul has to go back to Berlin with Anna. Forever. If the men win, there will be no more complaining.', 'Anna is persuaded by her boyfriend Paul to move from Berlin to his home town of Imma. What the notorious soccer hater doesn''t know, however, is that joining his best friend Steffen''s law firm is just a pretext. In reality, Paul and his buddies are there to save the soccer club he co-founded, Eintracht Imma 95, from relegation. Anna soon realizes that the players'' wives have nothing to say to their soccer junkies: Artificial turf in the bedroom, Effenberg bedding and weekends on the soccer pitch. When she finds out the real reason for the move, she mobilizes her fellow sufferers to counter-attack after a fierce bout of frustration and challenges Paul and his friends to the ultimate duel on the soccer pitch. The bet is on: women against men. If the women win, soccer is over - and Paul has to go back to Berlin with Anna. Forever. If the men win, there will be no more complaining.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IGAt9Q6vSy9zArm6GFfNCgaKG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1914'),
  ('531680436248053968', 'FCK 2020 – 2 and a Half Years With Scooter', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Cordula Kablitz-Post', 'Cordula Kablitz-Post', 'H.P. Baxxter, Jens Thele, Sebastian Schilde, Michael Simon, Rick J. Jordan, Ferris Buehler, Ellen Geerdes, Britt Geerdes', null, 'A success story at at least 150 BPM: A documentary about Hans Peter Geerdes aka H.P. Baxxter, the mastermind of Scooter', 'A success story at at least 150 BPM: A documentary about Hans Peter Geerdes aka H.P. Baxxter, the mastermind of Scooter', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jirISDOkFXOsFmMG4VE7mT2mBhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024192'),
  ('1007042834280805092', 'FDR: American Badass!', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Garrett Brawith, Evan Pesses', 'Ross Patterson', 'Barry Bostwick, Bruce McGill, Lin Shaye, Ray Wise, Ross Patterson, Keri Lynn Pratt, Matthew Moy, Kevin Sorbo', 'R', 'Chronicles the adventures of Franklin Delano Roosevelt, as he rides a "wheelchair of death" to stop the world from being taking over by polio-carrying werewolves during WWII. A deadly menace that are led by Werewolf Hitler, Mussolini and Emperor Hirohito.', 'Chronicles the adventures of Franklin Delano Roosevelt, as he rides a "wheelchair of death" to stop the world from being taking over by polio-carrying werewolves during WWII. A deadly menace that are led by Werewolf Hitler, Mussolini and Emperor Hirohito.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNTmjJ09POWy8peL6c9ZL5Rt3Dj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99223'),
  ('794257469444381647', 'Fe', 1994, 'Drama', 'Kanji Nakajima, Kanji Nakajima, Kazuma Yamaoka', 'Kanji Nakajima', 'Eiji Maruyama, Reina Oshibe, Fumiko Kawahara', null, 'Near the remains of an iron factory, an old painter faces the challenges of creation, as his longtime muse has not appeared in some time. A young girl lends her curiosity to discover what it is that holds the old painter back. Her mother tells her a bedtime story to which brings understanding of the relationship between the abandoned factory and the lonely artist nearby. Poetically representing a new relationship between human beings and things buried in oblivion after doing their duties, this work approaches the essence of ''science'' and ''civilization.''', 'Near the remains of an iron factory, an old painter faces the challenges of creation, as his longtime muse has not appeared in some time. A young girl lends her curiosity to discover what it is that holds the old painter back. Her mother tells her a bedtime story to which brings understanding of the relationship between the abandoned factory and the lonely artist nearby. Poetically representing a new relationship between human beings and things buried in oblivion after doing their duties, this work approaches the essence of ''science'' and ''civilization.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CtiSy8B947IZoAnOaxR9FPi3mJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305815'),
  ('272746593207819696', 'Fear', 1917, 'Horror, Drama', 'Robert Wiene', 'Robert Wiene', 'Bruno Decarli, Bernhard Goetzke, Mechthildis Thein, Hermann Picha, Conrad Veidt', null, 'A millionaire steals an ancient idol causing some natives call upon him a terrible curse.', 'A millionaire steals an ancient idol causing some natives call upon him a terrible curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCToHeo3KnXkEKhpdsGMhkPnp7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174723'),
  ('636128280884771706', 'Fear', 1946, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Alfred Zeisler, Jackson Rose', 'Alfred Zeisler, Dennis J. Cooper', 'Peter Cookson, Warren William, Anne Gwynne, Francis Pierlot, Nestor Paiva, James Cardwell, Almira Sessions, William Moss', 'NR', 'B-movie film noir take on Crime and Punishment. A college student gets deeper and deeper in trouble when he takes a loan from a shady college professor.', 'B-movie film noir take on Crime and Punishment. A college student gets deeper and deeper in trouble when he takes a loan from a shady college professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SPI9pO7j3w1rUS6N0QACsY2IDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31144'),
  ('615721983889614657', 'Fear', 1954, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Roberto Rossellini, Carlo Carlini, Heinz Schnackertz', 'Sergio Amidei, Franz von Treuberg, Roberto Rossellini', 'Ingrid Bergman, Mathias Wieman, Renate Mannhardt, Kurt Kreuger, Elise Aulinger, Edith Schultze-Westrum, Steffi Stroux, Annelore Wied', null, 'Irene Wagner, the wife of the prominent German scientist Professor Albert Wagner, had been having an affair with Erich Baumann. She does not disclose this to her husband, hoping to preserve his innocence and their "perfect marriage". This fills her with anxiety and guilt. However, Johanna Schultze, Erich''s jealous ex-girlfriend, learns about the affair and begins to blackmail Irene, turning Irene''s psychological torture into a harsh reality.', 'Irene Wagner, the wife of the prominent German scientist Professor Albert Wagner, had been having an affair with Erich Baumann. She does not disclose this to her husband, hoping to preserve his innocence and their "perfect marriage". This fills her with anxiety and guilt. However, Johanna Schultze, Erich''s jealous ex-girlfriend, learns about the affair and begins to blackmail Irene, turning Irene''s psychological torture into a harsh reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srnmuA2cg9ZAUNjnHQp1g1fbrmp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96546'),
  ('943739120803766748', 'Fear', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Rockne S. O''Bannon, Robert M. Stevens, John R. Woodward', 'Rockne S. O''Bannon', 'Ally Sheedy, Lauren Hutton, Michael O''Keefe, Stan Shaw, Dina Merrill, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Keone Young, Jonathan Prince', 'R', 'A psychic helps police solve murders by mentally linking with the murderer. Then she discovers a murderer with the same talent, who wants to share the fear of his victims with her!', 'A psychic helps police solve murders by mentally linking with the murderer. Then she discovers a murderer with the same talent, who wants to share the fear of his victims with her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A36ATn3m63VnjMR8lMJu2Z5L1dv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52395'),
  ('901901816723239082', 'Fear', 1996, 'Thriller', 'James Foley, Thomas Kloss, Bonnie Benwick', 'Christopher Crowe', 'Mark Wahlberg, Reese Witherspoon, William Petersen, Alyssa Milano, Amy Brenneman, Tracy Fraim, Jason Kristofer, Jed Rees', 'R', 'Nicole Walker always dreamed of being swept away by someone special — someone strong, sexy and sensitive who would care for her more than anything else in the world. David is all that and more: a modern-day knight who charms and seduces her, body and soul. But her perfect boyfriend is not all he seems to be. His sweet facade masks a savage, dark side that will soon transform Nicole''s dream into a nightmare.', 'Nicole Walker always dreamed of being swept away by someone special — someone strong, sexy and sensitive who would care for her more than anything else in the world. David is all that and more: a modern-day knight who charms and seduces her, body and soul. But her perfect boyfriend is not all he seems to be. His sweet facade masks a savage, dark side that will soon transform Nicole''s dream into a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ut8snuINzOibbKnvpTnsGWQr4Nl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10543'),
  ('300327728563788181', 'Fear', 2023, 'Horror, Drama', 'Deon Taylor, Christopher Duskin', 'Deon Taylor, John Ferry', 'Joseph Sikora, Andrew Bachelor, Annie Ilonzeh, Ruby Modine, Iddo Goldberg, Terrence J, Jessica Allain, T.I.', 'R', 'An author''s celebration with friends at a woodland cabin takes a terrifying turn when an airborne virus emerges at the same time supernatural forces target the group.', 'An author''s celebration with friends at a woodland cabin takes a terrifying turn when an airborne virus emerges at the same time supernatural forces target the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asCLy4s7HYP3zSRlLP4Qgme5L0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:880100'),
  ('154812760581960597', 'Fear and Desire', 1953, 'Drama, War, Thriller', 'Stanley Kubrick, Robert Dierks, Stanley Kubrick', 'Howard Sackler', 'Frank Silvera, Kenneth Harp, Paul Mazursky, Stephen Coit, Virginia Leith, David Allen', 'NR', 'After their airplane crashes behind enemy lines, four soldiers must survive and try to find a way back to their battalion. However, when they come across a local peasant girl the horrors of war quickly become apparent.', 'After their airplane crashes behind enemy lines, four soldiers must survive and try to find a way back to their battalion. However, when they come across a local peasant girl the horrors of war quickly become apparent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mj7CDh6d5nJDDmEhd0ft6s3L8CM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10165'),
  ('319279626380773261', 'Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas', 1998, 'Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Terry Gilliam, Nicola Pecorini, Philip A. Patterson', 'Terry Gilliam, Tony Grisoni, Tod Davies', 'Johnny Depp, Benicio del Toro, Tobey Maguire, Michael Lee Gogin, Larry Cedar, Brian Le Baron, Katherine Helmond, Michael Warwick', 'R', 'Raoul Duke and his attorney Dr. Gonzo drive a red convertible across the Mojave desert to Las Vegas with a suitcase full of drugs to cover a motorcycle race. As their consumption of drugs increases at an alarming rate, the stoned duo trash their hotel room and fear legal repercussions. Duke begins to drive back to L.A., but after an odd run-in with a cop, he returns to Sin City and continues his wild drug binge.', 'Raoul Duke and his attorney Dr. Gonzo drive a red convertible across the Mojave desert to Las Vegas with a suitcase full of drugs to cover a motorcycle race. As their consumption of drugs increases at an alarming rate, the stoned duo trash their hotel room and fear legal repercussions. Duke begins to drive back to L.A., but after an odd run-in with a cop, he returns to Sin City and continues his wild drug binge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tisNLcMkxryU2zxhi0PiyDFqhm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1878'),
  ('1148815848044354643', 'Fear and Trembling', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alain Corneau, Yves Angelo, Olivier Chiavassa', 'Alain Corneau', 'Sylvie Testud, Kaori Tsuji, Bison Katayama, Tarō Suwa, Yasunari Kondo, Sokyu Fujita, Gen Shimaoka, Heileigh Gomes', null, 'Amélie, a young Belgian woman, having spent her childhood in Japan, decides to return to live there and tries to integrate in the Japanese society. She is determined to be a "real Japanese" before her year contract runs out, though it precisely this determination that is incompatable with Japanese humility. Though she is hired for a choice position as a translator at an import/export firm, her inability to understand Japanese cultural norms results in increasingly humiliating demotions. Though Amelie secretly adulates her, her immediate supervisor takes sadistic pleasure in belittling her all along. She finally manages to break Amelie''s will by making her the bathroom attendant, and is delighted when Amelie tells her the she will not renew her contract. Amelie realizes that she is finally a real Japanese when she enters the company president''s office "with fear and trembling," which could only be possible because her determination was broken by Miss Fubuki''s systematic torture.', 'Amélie, a young Belgian woman, having spent her childhood in Japan, decides to return to live there and tries to integrate in the Japanese society. She is determined to be a "real Japanese" before her year contract runs out, though it precisely this determination that is incompatable with Japanese humility. Though she is hired for a choice position as a translator at an import/export firm, her inability to understand Japanese cultural norms results in increasingly humiliating demotions. Though Amelie secretly adulates her, her immediate supervisor takes sadistic pleasure in belittling her all along. She finally manages to break Amelie''s will by making her the bathroom attendant, and is delighted when Amelie tells her the she will not renew her contract. Amelie realizes that she is finally a real Japanese when she enters the company president''s office "with fear and trembling," which could only be possible because her determination was broken by Miss Fubuki''s systematic torture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42IOjOSnZAfXIKMtfI7alpLEMmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31076'),
  ('54807503976288391', 'Fear Below', 2025, 'Horror, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Matthew Holmes', 'Matthew Holmes, Gregory Moss', 'Hermione Corfield, Jake Ryan, Josh McConville, Kevin Dee, Clayton Watson, Sam Parsonson, Jacob Junior Nayinggul, Arthur Angel', 'R', 'A rag-tag team of divers attempting to salvage a sunken car from a river are thwarted by a highly aggressive bull shark.', 'A rag-tag team of divers attempting to salvage a sunken car from a river are thwarted by a highly aggressive bull shark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f90xO280gGQArVP2GU4IshAClt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232933'),
  ('395044017144501689', 'Fear Chamber', 1968, 'Horror', 'Juan Ibáñez, Jack Hill, Austin McKinney', 'Luis Enrique Vergara, Jack Hill', 'Boris Karloff, Julissa, Carlos East, Isela Vega, Yerye Beirute, Sandra Chávez, Eva Muller, Santanón', null, 'The frightening Boris Karloff 60s thriller with Karloff as a demented doctor using torture for scientific experiments.', 'The frightening Boris Karloff 60s thriller with Karloff as a demented doctor using torture for scientific experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlXSaP9EA0G2xFRLXKC4ouGLdvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49439'),
  ('3857983955056078', 'Fear City', 1984, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Abel Ferrara, James Lemmo, Johanna Ray', 'Nicholas St. John', 'Tom Berenger, Billy Dee Williams, Jack Scalia, Melanie Griffith, Rossano Brazzi, Rae Dawn Chong, Joe Santos, Michael V. Gazzo', 'R', 'Strippers in Manhattan are being stalked and murdered by a psycho. A hard-nosed police detective and a conflicted ex-boxer-turned-private-eye, hired by the strip club owners, set out to find him before he strikes again.', 'Strippers in Manhattan are being stalked and murdered by a psycho. A hard-nosed police detective and a conflicted ex-boxer-turned-private-eye, hired by the strip club owners, set out to find him before he strikes again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVcumIAhNCZ9xGYEk0ByLV9Hwbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18680'),
  ('863212093556862696', 'Fear City: A Family-Style Comedy', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Alain Berbérian, Dominique Warnier, Laurent Dailland', 'Alain Chabat, Dominique Farrugia, Chantal Lauby', 'Chantal Lauby, Alain Chabat, Dominique Farrugia, Gérard Darmon, Sam Karmann, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Eric Prat, Marc de Jonge', null, 'A second-class horror movie has to be shown at Cannes Film Festival, but, before each screening, the projectionist is killed by a mysterious fellow, with hammer and sickle, just as it happens in the film to be shown.', 'A second-class horror movie has to be shown at Cannes Film Festival, but, before each screening, the projectionist is killed by a mysterious fellow, with hammer and sickle, just as it happens in the film to be shown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RFbGblTn679rjPo88MPSbtbJx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15097'),
  ('424450624804555855', 'Fear Clinic', 2014, 'Horror', 'Andrew Shepherd, Robert Hall', 'Aaron Drane, Robert Hall', 'Thomas Dekker, Robert Englund, Cleopatra Coleman, Fiona Dourif, Kevin Gage, Bonnie Morgan, Brandon Beemer, Felisha Terrell', 'R', 'A doctor works to cure patients suffering from crippling phobias by placing them inside his invention which induces and controls hallucinations.', 'A doctor works to cure patients suffering from crippling phobias by placing them inside his invention which induces and controls hallucinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9srd2qdaJGu08ldr3PuhcMgNtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287524'),
  ('706567088214268607', 'Fear in the City', 1976, 'Crime, Action', 'Giuseppe Rosati, Giuseppe Bernardini, Giuseppe Pulieri', 'Giuseppe Rosati, Giuseppe Pulieri', 'Maurizio Merli, James Mason, Raymond Pellegrin, Silvia Dionisio, Fausto Tozzi, Gianfilippo Carcano, Giovanni Elsner, Mario Novelli', null, 'The film focuses on Murri; the token maverick cop. He is called in after a bunch of criminals pull off a successful prison break and spend the night picking off various informers and people they don''t like. Murri investigates; hooking up with one of the criminal''s nieces along the way. He uses his own methods; which mostly involve breaking all the rules, and thus comes under a lot of scrutiny from his superiors who don''t take too kindly to the cop''s way of working.', 'The film focuses on Murri; the token maverick cop. He is called in after a bunch of criminals pull off a successful prison break and spend the night picking off various informers and people they don''t like. Murri investigates; hooking up with one of the criminal''s nieces along the way. He uses his own methods; which mostly involve breaking all the rules, and thus comes under a lot of scrutiny from his superiors who don''t take too kindly to the cop''s way of working.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxXBhwpW3kOdkeHVxCkBZ1We5nw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105848'),
  ('715193458695122103', 'Fear in the Night', 1947, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Maxwell Shane, Jack Greenhalgh', 'Maxwell Shane', 'Paul Kelly, DeForest Kelley, Ann Doran, Kay Scott, Charles Victor, Robert Emmett Keane, Jeff York, Gladys Blake', 'NR', 'The dream is unusually vivid: Bank employee Vince Grayson finds himself murdering a man in a sinister octagonal-shaped room lined with mirrors while a mysterious woman breaks into a safe. It is so vivid that Vince suspects it may have really happened. To get the dream off his mind, he goes on a picnic with some relatives. When a thunderstorm forces his party into a nearby mansion, Vince discovers that the bizarre room does exist, and it means nothing but trouble.', 'The dream is unusually vivid: Bank employee Vince Grayson finds himself murdering a man in a sinister octagonal-shaped room lined with mirrors while a mysterious woman breaks into a safe. It is so vivid that Vince suspects it may have really happened. To get the dream off his mind, he goes on a picnic with some relatives. When a thunderstorm forces his party into a nearby mansion, Vince discovers that the bizarre room does exist, and it means nothing but trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aNGOSWDnIrQY2aZK1nkD87WiEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35401'),
  ('496233977984552346', 'Fear in the Night', 1972, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Jimmy Sangster, Arthur Grant, Ted Morley', 'Jimmy Sangster, Michael Syson', 'Joan Collins, Peter Cushing, Judy Geeson, Ralph Bates, James Cossins, Gillian Lind, Brian Grellis, John Bown', 'PG', 'It took Peggy Heller a long time to recover from the trauma of a brutal physical assault, suffered in her youth. When she married Robert, he provided her with the love and reassurance she craved for and the two settled down in a pretty house in the grounds of the public school where Robert was a master. But the headmaster of the school is not what he seems and Peggy is convinced he means to harm her - is her fear a figment of her tortured imagination or are there forces at work that intend to manipulate her anxieties with fatal consequences?', 'It took Peggy Heller a long time to recover from the trauma of a brutal physical assault, suffered in her youth. When she married Robert, he provided her with the love and reassurance she craved for and the two settled down in a pretty house in the grounds of the public school where Robert was a master. But the headmaster of the school is not what he seems and Peggy is convinced he means to harm her - is her fear a figment of her tortured imagination or are there forces at work that intend to manipulate her anxieties with fatal consequences?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5auttsrhz7ZVDdwNbMcrflnhzLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39925'),
  ('860407034665258736', 'Fear Is the Key', 1972, 'Action, Thriller', 'Michael Tuchner, Alex Thomson, Colin M. Brewer', 'Robert Carrington', 'Barry Newman, Suzy Kendall, John Vernon, Dolph Sweet, Ben Kingsley, Ray McAnally, Peter Marinker, Roland Brand', 'PG', 'A deep-sea salvage expert enacts an elaborate plan to infiltrate and take revenge on a criminal organization that dealt him a foul misdeed.', 'A deep-sea salvage expert enacts an elaborate plan to infiltrate and take revenge on a criminal organization that dealt him a foul misdeed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exEVWVE4WP6WktGGJFq2waVoKip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25266'),
  ('826417082152676893', 'Fear Island', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Michael Storey, Glenn Warner', 'Jack Harry, Jeff Martel', 'Aaron Ashmore, Haylie Duff, Lucy Hale, Kyle Schmid, Anne Marie DeLuise, Jacob Blair, Brenna O''Brien, Jessica Harmon', null, 'Five students on spring break meet at a secluded island cabin for a weekend getaway. Stranded on the island they become the prey of a mysterious killer who seems bent on revenge for something the friends have done.', 'Five students on spring break meet at a secluded island cabin for a weekend getaway. Stranded on the island they become the prey of a mysterious killer who seems bent on revenge for something the friends have done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozq6b1kgFdEpHdJdaBVnet1cbeW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42309'),
  ('887485875650707579', 'Fear Me Not', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kristian Levring', 'Kristian Levring, Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Ulrich Thomsen, Paprika Steen, Emma Sehested Høeg, Lars Brygmann, Stine Stengade, Josephine Märcher Sandig, Bodil Udsen, Bjarne Henriksen', null, 'Michael needs a change in his life, so when he hears about clinical trials for a new anti-depressant, he signs up to be a guinea pig - without telling his family. Because of dangerous side effects, the trial is subsequently abandoned but Michael continues to take the pills. Having lost all control, Michael''s repressed instincts resurface with a force and violence that no-one could have predicted.', 'Michael needs a change in his life, so when he hears about clinical trials for a new anti-depressant, he signs up to be a guinea pig - without telling his family. Because of dangerous side effects, the trial is subsequently abandoned but Michael continues to take the pills. Having lost all control, Michael''s repressed instincts resurface with a force and violence that no-one could have predicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBBJPyr77jPpKDUH9tsOUTvU52W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15834'),
  ('739797918179841872', 'Fear No Evil', 1969, 'TV Movie, Horror', 'Paul Wendkos, Andrew J. McIntyre, Kenny Williams', 'Richard Alan Simmons', 'Louis Jourdan, Lynda Day George, Carroll O''Connor, Bradford Dillman, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Marsha Hunt, Katherine Woodville, Harry Davis', 'NR', 'A psychiatrist specializing in the occult becomes involved in the case of a man who is possessed by a spirit in an antique mirror. The man''s fiance discovers that the mirror is able to bring back her former boyfriend, who had been killed in a car accident, from the dead.', 'A psychiatrist specializing in the occult becomes involved in the case of a man who is possessed by a spirit in an antique mirror. The man''s fiance discovers that the mirror is able to bring back her former boyfriend, who had been killed in a car accident, from the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUeHXpKqY5I0PcA7EVGbFwrVG98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284249'),
  ('987659897158239616', 'Fear No Evil', 1981, 'Horror', 'Frank LaLoggia, Fred Goodich', 'Frank LaLoggia', 'Stefan Arngrim, Elizabeth Hoffman, Kathleen Rowe McAllen, Frank Birney, Daniel Eden, John Holland, Barry Cooper, Alice Sachs', 'R', 'Brilliant and aloof teenager Andrew is always the butt of his classmates'' jokes — but little do they know that he is actually the demon Lucifer. As the evil wells up within him, he avenges himself in acts of demonic murder and destruction. But his foe, the archangel Gabriel, has assumed the form of 18 year old student Julie.', 'Brilliant and aloof teenager Andrew is always the butt of his classmates'' jokes — but little do they know that he is actually the demon Lucifer. As the evil wells up within him, he avenges himself in acts of demonic murder and destruction. But his foe, the archangel Gabriel, has assumed the form of 18 year old student Julie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwUTdLCBXnCvBD2S6XIZM7hBawT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91817'),
  ('148961617410837348', 'Fear of a Black Hat', 1994, 'Comedy, Music', 'Rusty Cundieff, John L. Demps Jr.', 'Rusty Cundieff', 'Larry B. Scott, Mark Christopher Lawrence, Rusty Cundieff, Kasi Lemmons, G. Smokey Campbell, Faizon Love, Deezer D, Devin Kamin', 'R', 'Chronicling the controversial career of bad boys N.W.H. (Niggaz With Hats), this uproarious ''mockumentary'' lampoons all of hardcore rap''s hot-button issues. This underground laugh riot recounts the rise, fall and resurrection of a clueless bunch of would-be rappers, Ice Cold, Tone-Def & Tasty Taste performing as N.W.H.', 'Chronicling the controversial career of bad boys N.W.H. (Niggaz With Hats), this uproarious ''mockumentary'' lampoons all of hardcore rap''s hot-button issues. This underground laugh riot recounts the rise, fall and resurrection of a clueless bunch of would-be rappers, Ice Cold, Tone-Def & Tasty Taste performing as N.W.H.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiJp7B74GBKJK8yCqLjMaFu24nJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20239'),
  ('1098036823866467430', 'Fear of Fear', 1975, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Jürgen Jürges, Renate Leiffer', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Margit Carstensen, Ulrich Faulhaber, Brigitte Mira, Irm Hermann, Armin Meier, Kurt Raab, Adrian Hoven, Ingrid Caven', null, 'After having her second child, a German housewife suffers from postpartum depression before inexplicably falling into a continually misdiagnosed mental state, befuddling her relatives.', 'After having her second child, a German housewife suffers from postpartum depression before inexplicably falling into a continually misdiagnosed mental state, befuddling her relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azHl3bYHmGJVa2hpSekzZNVR7CL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47239'),
  ('794305434647821492', 'Fear of Rain', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Steve Lasky, Joshua Reis, Deanna Dys', 'Castille Landon', 'Madison Iseman, Israel Broussard, Eugenie Bondurant, Katherine Heigl, Harry Connick Jr., Julia Vasi, Enuka Okuma, Hudson Rodgers', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl living with schizophrenia begins to suspect her neighbor has kidnapped a child. Her parents try desperately to help her live a normal life, without exposing their own tragic secrets, and the only person who believes her is Caleb – a boy she isn’t even sure exists.', 'A teenage girl living with schizophrenia begins to suspect her neighbor has kidnapped a child. Her parents try desperately to help her live a normal life, without exposing their own tragic secrets, and the only person who believes her is Caleb – a boy she isn’t even sure exists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hmaACPJfI2M0v38DeltW3dSggT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599281'),
  ('875677060044029633', 'Fear of the Dark', 2003, 'Horror', 'K.C. Bascombe, Marc Charlebois', 'John Sullivan', 'Kevin Zegers, Jesse James, Rachel Skarsten, Charles Edwin Powell, Linda Purl, Daniel Rindress-Kay, Derrick Damon Reeve, Derrick Damon Reeve', 'PG-13', 'Twelve year old Ryan Billings has been diagnosed with an acute fear of the dark. He spends each night lying awake in torment, waiting and watching as the evil in the darkness grows stronger, feeding off his fear. His older brother Dale, suspects that there is nothing wrong with Ryan and that this is just a ploy for more attention. Regardless, he promises to watch over his little brother as their parents head off to a party for the night. Outside a storm rages and when the power goes out, darkness envelops the house. Ryan knows that tonight the evil has finally come to claim him. Dale desperately tries everything to try and calm him down, until the horrors in the dark make him realize Ryan had good reason to be so afraid!', 'Twelve year old Ryan Billings has been diagnosed with an acute fear of the dark. He spends each night lying awake in torment, waiting and watching as the evil in the darkness grows stronger, feeding off his fear. His older brother Dale, suspects that there is nothing wrong with Ryan and that this is just a ploy for more attention. Regardless, he promises to watch over his little brother as their parents head off to a party for the night. Outside a storm rages and when the power goes out, darkness envelops the house. Ryan knows that tonight the evil has finally come to claim him. Dale desperately tries everything to try and calm him down, until the horrors in the dark make him realize Ryan had good reason to be so afraid!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPaqnJwsyGmljco3EOVq119Bg7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44195'),
  ('1035699820227344691', 'Fear of Water', 2012, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Pelletier, Nicolas Bolduc', 'Marcel Beaulieu, Gabriel Pelletier', 'Pierre-François Legendre, Brigitte Pogonat, Normand D''Amour, Michel Laperrière, Stéphanie Lapointe, Benoît Rousseau, Maxime Dumontier, Pascale Bussières', null, 'Rosalie Richard is found raped and dead at the foot of a cliff. This gruesome murder is the first ever in the Magdalen Islands. Her death will radically change the orderly life of Sergeant André Surprenant.', 'Rosalie Richard is found raped and dead at the foot of a cliff. This gruesome murder is the first ever in the Magdalen Islands. Her death will radically change the orderly life of Sergeant André Surprenant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZXOqIGs7FzTdwgTiGtJyuRtcaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109038'),
  ('845988617160376363', 'Fear PHarm', 2020, 'Horror', 'Dante Yore, Mason Greer', 'Dante Yore, Howard Burd, Mark S. Allen', 'John Littlefield, Tiana Tuttle, Houston Stevenson, Aimee Stolte, Chris Leary, Brandon J White, Mike Valentine, Jenn Tripp', null, 'Four people enter a corn maze for Halloween and are picked off one by one by the twisted family who own the scare attraction.', 'Four people enter a corn maze for Halloween and are picked off one by one by the twisted family who own the scare attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSlmVGukZquWwiw3Bv2sArX5UmE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743022'),
  ('814794476061578790', 'Fear Street: 1666', 2021, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Caleb Heymann, Doug Torres, Megan Schmidt', 'Kate Trefry, Leigh Janiak, Phil Graziadei', 'Kiana Madeira, Benjamin Flores Jr., Olivia Scott Welch, Ashley Zukerman, Darrell Britt-Gibson, Elizabeth Scopel, Randy Havens, Julia Rehwald', 'R', 'In 1666, a colonial town is gripped by a hysterical witch-hunt that has deadly consequences for centuries to come, and it''s up to teenagers in 1994 to finally put an end to their town''s curse, before it''s too late.', 'In 1666, a colonial town is gripped by a hysterical witch-hunt that has deadly consequences for centuries to come, and it''s up to teenagers in 1994 to finally put an end to their town''s curse, before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmEPtz3Ufzol2VWUAZYzOFaBio3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591275'),
  ('677398919824679702', 'Fear Street: 1978', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Caleb Heymann, Doug Torres, Megan Schmidt', 'Leigh Janiak, Zak Olkewicz', 'Sadie Sink, Emily Rudd, Ryan Simpkins, McCabe Slye, Gillian Jacobs, Kiana Madeira, Benjamin Flores Jr., Ted Sutherland', 'R', 'In 1978, two rival groups at Camp Nightwing must band together to solve a terrifying mystery when horrors from their towns'' history come alive.', 'In 1978, two rival groups at Camp Nightwing must band together to solve a terrifying mystery when horrors from their towns'' history come alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dNTxhoGDTHHGqUTdxcr4H1dqlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591274'),
  ('1039900753669585966', 'Fear Street: 1994', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Caleb Heymann, Catherine A. Cospelich, A.J. Bruno', 'Leigh Janiak, Phil Graziadei', 'Kiana Madeira, Olivia Scott Welch, Benjamin Flores Jr., Julia Rehwald, Fred Hechinger, Maya Hawke, Charlene Amoia, David Thompson', 'R', 'After a series of brutal slayings, a teen and her friends take on an evil force that''s plagued their notorious town for centuries.', 'After a series of brutal slayings, a teen and her friends take on an evil force that''s plagued their notorious town for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9J9Wy39ZjrVmfk7yMkulpcI5sy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591273'),
  ('561976380624441913', 'Fear Street: Prom Queen', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Matt Palmer, Márk Győri, Kim Sue Bartnik', 'Matt Palmer, Donald McLeary', 'India Fowler, Suzanna Son, Fina Strazza, Katherine Waterston, Lili Taylor, Chris Klein, Ariana Greenblatt, David Iacono', 'R', 'Who will be voted queen at Shadyside High''s 1988 prom? For underdog Lori, competition is cutthroat even before someone starts killing off the candidates.', 'Who will be voted queen at Shadyside High''s 1988 prom? For underdog Lori, competition is cutthroat even before someone starts killing off the candidates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gevScWYkF8l5i9NjFSXo8HfPNyy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001414'),
