  ('630506315583579283', 'FearDotCom', 2002, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Christian Sebaldt, William Malone, Igor Chevalier', 'Josephine Coyle', 'Stephen Dorff, Natascha McElhone, Stephen Rea, Udo Kier, Amelia Curtis, Jeffrey Combs, Nigel Terry, Gesine Cukrowski', 'R', 'When four bodies are discovered among the industrial decay and urban grime of New York City, brash young detective Mike Reilly teams with ambitious Department of Health researcher Terry Huston to uncover the cause behind their violent and inexplicable deaths. The only common factor shared by the victims? Each died exactly 48 hours after logging onto a website called feardotcom.', 'When four bodies are discovered among the industrial decay and urban grime of New York City, brash young detective Mike Reilly teams with ambitious Department of Health researcher Terry Huston to uncover the cause behind their violent and inexplicable deaths. The only common factor shared by the victims? Each died exactly 48 hours after logging onto a website called feardotcom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phcd5AJvA1S45JMKYoNLhTzFwsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9544'),
  ('374126447553427898', 'Fearless', 1993, 'Drama', 'Peter Weir, Allen Daviau', 'Rafael Yglesias', 'Jeff Bridges, Isabella Rossellini, Rosie Perez, Tom Hulce, John Turturro, Benicio del Toro, Deirdre O''Connell, John de Lancie', 'R', 'After surviving a plane crash that kills many others, Max Klein develops a sense of invulnerability, leading to radical, compulsive actions. Can a psychologist and a fellow guilt-ridden survivor bring him down to earth?', 'After surviving a plane crash that kills many others, Max Klein develops a sense of invulnerability, leading to radical, compulsive actions. Can a psychologist and a fellow guilt-ridden survivor bring him down to earth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFhzvwgv04VUmedB7pOO4cMP9xq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10443'),
