  ('495823227796339470', 'Fearless Hyena', 1979, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jackie Chan, Chen Jung-Shu, Chu Hsueh-Liang', 'Lo Wei, Jackie Chan', 'Jackie Chan, James Tien Chun, Yen Shi-Kwan, Dean Shek Tin, Li Kun, Wang Chi-Sheng, Chen Hui-Lou, Ma Chang', 'R', 'Lung is a talented fighter but prefers to spend his time loafing around and picking fights, despite orders from his grandfather not to fight. Unknown to him, a brutal general has been slaughtering all the people from his grandfather’s clan. When the general recognizes Lung’s style of kung fu during one of his street fights, he hunts down Lung’s grandfather and kills him.', 'Lung is a talented fighter but prefers to spend his time loafing around and picking fights, despite orders from his grandfather not to fight. Unknown to him, a brutal general has been slaughtering all the people from his grandfather’s clan. When the general recognizes Lung’s style of kung fu during one of his street fights, he hunts down Lung’s grandfather and kills him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmQR6gtoBJHUkgALLb1eGruKPll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19274'),
  ('114255582119731693', 'Fearless Hyena 2', 1983, 'Action, Comedy', 'Chan Chuen, Pang Chi-Ming, Yau Kei', 'Lo Wei', 'Jackie Chan, Dean Shek Tin, Yen Shi-Kwan, Kwon Yeong-Moon, James Tien Chun, Chen Hui-Lou, Austin Wai Tin-Chi, Hon Kwok-Choi', null, 'A pair of evil kung-fu artists, Heaven and Earth, are slaughtering the entire Yin-Yang brotherhood.', 'A pair of evil kung-fu artists, Heaven and Earth, are slaughtering the entire Yin-Yang brotherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZgp7NKoJMrvDvsqYBXyRtzF2Qj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18741'),
  ('73572731022872898', 'Feast', 2005, 'Horror, Action', 'Thomas L. Callaway, John Gulager', 'Marcus Dunstan, Patrick Melton', 'Navi Rawat, Balthazar Getty, Jenny Wade, Henry Rollins, Duane Whitaker, Judah Friedlander, Jason Mewes, Krista Allen', 'R', 'When a motley crew of strangers find themselves trapped in an isolated tavern, they must band together in a battle for survival against a family of flesh-hungry creatures.', 'When a motley crew of strangers find themselves trapped in an isolated tavern, they must band together in a battle for survival against a family of flesh-hungry creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9i3dfQRAyU8TPe1LrbvAdVoLfB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10070'),
  ('51533105783716260', 'Feast II: Sloppy Seconds', 2008, 'Horror, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'John Gulager, Kevin Atkinson, Thomas Kuk', 'Marcus Dunstan, Patrick Melton', 'Diane Ayala Goldner, Jenny Wade, Clu Gulager, Carl Anthony Payne II, Johanna Putnam, Martin Klebba, Juan Longoria García, Cassie Shea Watson', 'R', 'The monsters have made it into a small neighboring town in the middle of nowhere and the locals have to band with the survivors of the bar slaughter to figure out how to make it.', 'The monsters have made it into a small neighboring town in the middle of nowhere and the locals have to band with the survivors of the bar slaughter to figure out how to make it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYoaVnVWmM69DOHLdh7nzej3jtA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13797'),
