  ('976587355530942997', 'Feast of July', 1995, 'Drama, Crime', 'Christopher Menaul, Peter Sova', 'Christopher Neame', 'Embeth Davidtz, Tom Bell, Gemma Jones, James Purefoy, Ben Chaplin, Kenneth Anderson, Greg Wise, Richard Hope', null, 'After an abandoned young woman in late 19th Century England is taken in by a rural couple with three handsome sons, tragic consequences result.', 'After an abandoned young woman in late 19th Century England is taken in by a rural couple with three handsome sons, tragic consequences result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inUPybROcLlzdG4EQeDIShfFjsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259209'),
  ('527519200014842440', 'Feast of Love', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Robert Benton, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Allison Burnett', 'Morgan Freeman, Greg Kinnear, Radha Mitchell, Billy Burke, Selma Blair, Alexa Davalos, Toby Hemingway, Stana Katic', 'R', 'A meditation on love and its various incarnations, set within a community of friends in Oregon. It is described as an exploration of the magical, mysterious and sometimes painful incarnations of love.', 'A meditation on love and its various incarnations, set within a community of friends in Oregon. It is described as an exploration of the magical, mysterious and sometimes painful incarnations of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Uyl94M1Yi8U0o6GddMRqAfa466.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14313'),
  ('449824524760867384', 'Feast of the Seven Fishes', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Tinnell, Jamie Thompson', 'Robert Tinnell', 'Skyler Gisondo, Madison Iseman, Josh Helman, Addison Timlin, Ray Abruzzo, Andrew Schulz, Jess Darrow, Cameron Rostami', null, 'A slice of life story that follows a large Italian family on Christmas Eve as they prepare for the traditional Feast of the Seven Fishes, reminisce about the past and seek love in the future.', 'A slice of life story that follows a large Italian family on Christmas Eve as they prepare for the traditional Feast of the Seven Fishes, reminisce about the past and seek love in the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMHw1PC2nHMicGURcb6ORtc7Zqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635885'),
  ('522722156027500140', 'Feather', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Roan Johnson, Davide Manca', 'Roan Johnson', 'Blu Yoshimi, Luigi Fedele, Sergio Pierattini, Michela Cescon, Francesco Colella, Clara Alonso, Francesca Turrini, Brando Pacitto', null, 'Ferro and Cate, two kids trying to get to grips with an unplanned pregnancy, their families (rebellious Ferro’s hospitable, ‘normal’ family, and level-headed Cate’s unhinged, atypical one), exams at school, friends and a general lack of jobs.', 'Ferro and Cate, two kids trying to get to grips with an unplanned pregnancy, their families (rebellious Ferro’s hospitable, ‘normal’ family, and level-headed Cate’s unhinged, atypical one), exams at school, friends and a general lack of jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZTV7mQBbLSVj3eTe4O6j4yRnzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408540'),
  ('637803071322388682', 'Feather Dusted', 1955, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', null, 'Foghorn Leghorn decides to teach Miss Prissy''s genius son Egghead Jr. how to have fun by playing croquet, cowboys and Indians.', 'Foghorn Leghorn decides to teach Miss Prissy''s genius son Egghead Jr. how to have fun by playing croquet, cowboys and Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIxin7NHI6npxvwg1GoQuVfTKYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235169'),
  ('375524395174721775', 'Feathers', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kamal Samy, Ahmed Emad, Omar Zohairy', 'Ahmad Amer, Omar Zohairy', 'Samy Bassouny, Fady Mina Fawzy, Demyana Nassar, Abo Sefen Nabil Wesa, Mohamed Abdel Hady', null, 'A passive mother who dedicates her life to her husband and children. Stuck in daily, repetitive, mundane chores, she has made herself as little as she possibly could. When a magic trick goes wrong at her 4-year-old son''s birthday party, an avalanche of coincidental absurdities befalls the family. The magician turns her husband, the authoritarian father, into a chicken. The mother is now forced to come to the fore and take care of the family while moving heaven and earth to bring her husband back. As she tries to survive, she goes through a rough and absurd transformation.', 'A passive mother who dedicates her life to her husband and children. Stuck in daily, repetitive, mundane chores, she has made herself as little as she possibly could. When a magic trick goes wrong at her 4-year-old son''s birthday party, an avalanche of coincidental absurdities befalls the family. The magician turns her husband, the authoritarian father, into a chicken. The mother is now forced to come to the fore and take care of the family while moving heaven and earth to bring her husband back. As she tries to survive, she goes through a rough and absurd transformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2UpCdLJG0QbEnnBPtfyt9T3GZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796166'),
  ('403868393925166010', 'Features of the Russian Bath', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Aleksei Rudakov, Aleksey Molchanov', 'Mikhail Babakhanov', 'Iraida Sokolova, Olga Zueva, Lyubov Rusakova, Lyubov Neginskaya, Yelena Lushchik, Viktor Bychkov, Vyacheslav Kulakov, Aleksandr Pyatkov', null, 'Adult comedy about Russian saunas and the traditions, habits and jokes connected to them.', 'Adult comedy about Russian saunas and the traditions, habits and jokes connected to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwlWrUSTK8jMhrPodMuRPKMnQu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172151'),
  ('29663716118139217', 'February 15, 1839', 2001, 'Drama, History', 'Pierre Falardeau, Alain Dostie', 'Pierre Falardeau', 'Luc Picard, Sylvie Drapeau, Pierre Rivard, Thérèse Perreault, Frédéric Gilles, Mario Bard, Yvon Barrette, Denis Trudel', null, 'In 1839, months after the British army has repressed the insurrection of the Patriots, hundreds of rebels are still in prison. The morning of February 14, Marie-Thomas Chevalier De Lorimier and Charles Hindelang learn that they will be hung in 24 hours, with three others. While they await their death the condemned spend time and consult with companions and loved ones as well as entrust to those their last wills. At dawn, the five Patriots will walk to the scaffold, knowing will they die.', 'In 1839, months after the British army has repressed the insurrection of the Patriots, hundreds of rebels are still in prison. The morning of February 14, Marie-Thomas Chevalier De Lorimier and Charles Hindelang learn that they will be hung in 24 hours, with three others. While they await their death the condemned spend time and consult with companions and loved ones as well as entrust to those their last wills. At dawn, the five Patriots will walk to the scaffold, knowing will they die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdfQpgECLfmN3Ibg1Cves1xUUlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51953'),
  ('659614830232192753', 'Fed Up', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Stephanie Soechtig', 'Mark Monroe, Stephanie Soechtig', 'Katie Couric, Michael Pollan, Bill Clinton, Tom Vilsack, Kelly Brownell, Michael Bloomberg, Michele Simon', 'PG', 'Fed Up blows the lid off everything we thought we knew about food and weight loss, revealing a 30-year campaign by the food industry, aided by the U.S. government, to mislead and confuse the American public, resulting in one of the largest health epidemics in history.', 'Fed Up blows the lid off everything we thought we knew about food and weight loss, revealing a 30-year campaign by the food industry, aided by the U.S. government, to mislead and confuse the American public, resulting in one of the largest health epidemics in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiS6NjxcMzui3AMgOanQFrQnYUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250657'),
  ('609240432417372115', 'Federal', 2010, 'Action, Mystery', 'Erik de Castro, César Moraes, Liloye Boublie', 'Heber Trigueiro, Erico Beduschi, Erik de Castro', 'Carlos Alberto Riccelli, Selton Mello, Christovam Netto, Cesario Augusto, Eduardo Dussek, Carolina Gómez, Michael Madsen, Adriano Siri', null, 'Brasília. Vital is a Brazilian federal police deputy who leads a special investigation group that aims to capture the international drug trafficker Beque Batista. Three other officers make up the group: Dani, Rock and Lua. In parallel, Vital need to take care of Leila, his pregnant wife, and does everything so she does not participate in the violent world in which he lives.', 'Brasília. Vital is a Brazilian federal police deputy who leads a special investigation group that aims to capture the international drug trafficker Beque Batista. Three other officers make up the group: Dani, Rock and Lua. In parallel, Vital need to take care of Leila, his pregnant wife, and does everything so she does not participate in the violent world in which he lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KaLMpKXgt0LDXcoN5tz3D6tYjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63699'),
  ('1010515384750607566', 'Federal Bank Heist', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Marcos Paulo, André Moraes, José Roberto Eliezer', 'Rene Belmonte', 'Milhem Cortaz, Eriberto Leão, Hermila Guedes, Lima Duarte, Giulia Gam, Tonico Pereira, Gero Camilo, Vinícius de Oliveira', null, '"The Baron" wanted to commit the perfect heist involving 3 tons of money and no violence. For this he would need the right people willing to get 1 million dollars to take part in this job. Based on true events, in 2005, 168,000,000 Brazilian Real (almost 80,000,000 US dollars) were stolen from a Brazilian Central Bank (Federal Reserve), making it the biggest peace-time robbery in history. It was perhaps the most audacious bank heist ever.', '"The Baron" wanted to commit the perfect heist involving 3 tons of money and no violence. For this he would need the right people willing to get 1 million dollars to take part in this job. Based on true events, in 2005, 168,000,000 Brazilian Real (almost 80,000,000 US dollars) were stolen from a Brazilian Central Bank (Federal Reserve), making it the biggest peace-time robbery in history. It was perhaps the most audacious bank heist ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbUymWDX82csyNaTj3AmKGKqzrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72560'),
  ('47506161668861195', 'Federal Hill', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michael Corrente', 'Michael Corrente', 'Nicholas Turturro, Anthony DeSando, Libby Langdon, Frank Vincent, Michael Raynor, Robert Turano, Jason Andrews, Phyllis Kay', null, 'In Providence''s Italian neighborhood, Federal Hill, five young are immersed in drugs, crime and violence. Everything changes when one of the guys in the band know love.', 'In Providence''s Italian neighborhood, Federal Hill, five young are immersed in drugs, crime and violence. Everything changes when one of the guys in the band know love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qChLfULhgAhWHG9LbcBIv80r32i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171857'),
  ('791176489884477404', 'Federal Protection', 2002, 'TV Movie, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Anthony Hickox', 'Craig Smith', 'Armand Assante, Angela Featherstone, Dina Meyer, David Lipper, Frank Chiesurin, Tony Calabretta, Mark Camacho, Steven P. Park', null, '"Chop Chop" Frankie Carbone has made a career out of stealing cars for the mob in Chicago. An attempted assassination by a mob boss goes badly and Frankie retaliates, only to wind up in the hands of the Feds. Frankie agrees to testify against the mobsters and his life is suddenly worthless - unless he submits to going into federal protection.', '"Chop Chop" Frankie Carbone has made a career out of stealing cars for the mob in Chicago. An attempted assassination by a mob boss goes badly and Frankie retaliates, only to wind up in the hands of the Feds. Frankie agrees to testify against the mobsters and his life is suddenly worthless - unless he submits to going into federal protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dp1uQ4XcMOnP2ZiWyy0wBA4juaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37996'),
  ('513063970185753779', 'Federer: Twelve Final Days', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Asif Kapadia, Joe Sabia', null, 'Roger Federer, Rafael Nadal, Novak Đoković, Andy Murray, Mirka Federer, Leo Federer, Lenny Federer, Myla Federer', 'R', 'Originally a home video never intended for public viewing, this film captures the final chapter in Roger Federer''s legendary tennis career, featuring Roger, his family, and his three main rivals: Rafael Nadal, Novak Djokovic, and Andy Murray.', 'Originally a home video never intended for public viewing, this film captures the final chapter in Roger Federer''s legendary tennis career, featuring Roger, his family, and his three main rivals: Rafael Nadal, Novak Djokovic, and Andy Murray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kunqcryDeYZxBg4ESat2We5qRtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1247031'),
  ('1132167711269929117', 'Federica Pellegrini - Underwater', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Sara Ristori', 'Valdo Gamberutti, Sara Ristori, Davide Savelli', 'Federica Pellegrini, Matteo Giunta', null, 'Documentary that covers Federica Pellegrini''s career and her preparation in the last 300 days before the Tokyo 2020 Olympic Games.', 'Documentary that covers Federica Pellegrini''s career and her preparation in the last 300 days before the Tokyo 2020 Olympic Games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fd4BMawA5Be3s6mdLJeFgq28zG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923691'),
  ('1091847024462888404', 'Federico Chiesa - Back on Track', 2023, 'Documentary', null, 'Alessandro D''Ottavi', 'Federico Chiesa, Dušan Vlahović, Dr. Christian Fink', null, '9 January 2022, Olympic Stadium of Rome. Within the first thirty minutes of the game, Federico Chiesa collapsed on the ground, screaming in pain: he had ruptured the cruciate ligament in his left knee. It was the beginning of a ten-month ordeal, during which Federico had to rediscover himself, both professionally and personally. On his side will be his family, teammates and the Juventus staff.', '9 January 2022, Olympic Stadium of Rome. Within the first thirty minutes of the game, Federico Chiesa collapsed on the ground, screaming in pain: he had ruptured the cruciate ligament in his left knee. It was the beginning of a ten-month ordeal, during which Federico had to rediscover himself, both professionally and personally. On his side will be his family, teammates and the Juventus staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJ8auxg42vLN5d1RgpGJVumm124.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1082339'),
  ('860245220084957246', 'Fedora', 1978, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Billy Wilder, Gerry Fisher', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'William Holden, Marthe Keller, Hildegard Knef, José Ferrer, Frances Sternhagen, Mario Adorf, Stephen Collins, Henry Fonda', 'PG', 'Down-on-his-luck Hollywood producer Barry ''Dutch'' Detweiler attempts to lure Fedora, a famous but reclusive film actress, out of retirement, only to discover the horrifying truth behind her success.', 'Down-on-his-luck Hollywood producer Barry ''Dutch'' Detweiler attempts to lure Fedora, a famous but reclusive film actress, out of retirement, only to discover the horrifying truth behind her success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArU150uZXJ9IVa5puxZKotw54DP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54000'),
  ('663883170399069690', 'Feds!', 1988, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Daniel Goldberg, Tim Suhrstedt, Betsy Pollock', 'Daniel Goldberg, Len Blum', 'Rebecca De Mornay, Mary Gross, Fred Thompson, Larry Cedar, Ken Marshall, Raymond Singer, James Luisi, Rex Ryon', 'PG-13', 'Ellie DeWitt and Janis Zuckermann are admitted to the very strict FBI Training Academy. They get a hard course, in which they learn to deal with guns and to recognise crimes. They also get a physical training. It appears that Ellie is a real fighting- machine, in contrast with Janis, the great student. They have to help each other, all the way to graduation.', 'Ellie DeWitt and Janis Zuckermann are admitted to the very strict FBI Training Academy. They get a hard course, in which they learn to deal with guns and to recognise crimes. They also get a physical training. It appears that Ellie is a real fighting- machine, in contrast with Janis, the great student. They have to help each other, all the way to graduation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qMNwjNEOahviSeEGIWPEJ4NMM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25884'),
  ('486953890312536804', 'Feed', 2017, 'Drama', 'Igor Kropotov, Tommy Bertelsen', 'Troian Bellisario', 'Troian Bellisario, Tom Felton, Ben Winchell, James Remar, Paula Malcomson, Courtney Henggeler, Willie Garson, Adam Shapiro', 'PG-13', 'Olivia and Matthew Grey, 18-year-old twins born into a world of privilege and high expectations. There are almost no boundaries between them - even their dreams are connected.', 'Olivia and Matthew Grey, 18-year-old twins born into a world of privilege and high expectations. There are almost no boundaries between them - even their dreams are connected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBxilFh4Zkiq0h7Loe7A7GmWCZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459950'),
  ('881716116735309278', 'Feed', 2022, 'Horror', 'Johannes Persson, Hanna Kriisa', 'Paolo Vacirca, Henry Stenberg', 'Molly Nutley, Sofia Kappel, Vincent Grahl, Joel Lützow, Emelina Rosenstielke, Amanda Lindh, Michael Odhag, Annica Liljeblad', null, 'A group of social media experts are hired to help an old family business to strive. But they soon find themselves stuck on a tiny island in a lake in which an ancient Swedish witch is said to live.', 'A group of social media experts are hired to help an old family business to strive. But they soon find themselves stuck on a tiny island in a lake in which an ancient Swedish witch is said to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Qr8bsfup4bNnXWhBo5PbynqlkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015936'),
  ('479704122920743493', 'Feed Me', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Nadia Lamin, Richard Oakes, Craig Hinde', 'Adam Leader', 'Christopher Mulvin, Hannah Al Rashid, Samantha Loxley, Neal Ward, Nadia Lamin, Craig Hinde, Anto Sharp, Simba Masaku', null, 'Following the death of his wife, a broken man spirals into an abyss of night tremors and depression and finds himself in the home of a deranged cannibal who convinces him to take his own life in the most horrific way imaginable.', 'Following the death of his wife, a broken man spirals into an abyss of night tremors and depression and finds himself in the home of a deranged cannibal who convinces him to take his own life in the most horrific way imaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztYN6xo5meeEHLH3bXU6jej3Tad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996720'),
