  ('178741590033069014', 'Feedin'' the Kiddie', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, 'NR', 'Jerry and Tuffy lead the quest to thanksgiving. All the sudden, Tom sneaks into the dinning room to destroy Jerry and Tuffy. So, Jerry, Tuffy and Tom battle over thanksgiving. In the end, Jerry, Tuffy and Tom would agree to eat the whole turkey but Tuffy decides to ate the whole turkey.', 'Jerry and Tuffy lead the quest to thanksgiving. All the sudden, Tom sneaks into the dinning room to destroy Jerry and Tuffy. So, Jerry, Tuffy and Tom battle over thanksgiving. In the end, Jerry, Tuffy and Tom would agree to eat the whole turkey but Tuffy decides to ate the whole turkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHdnjsUrldXX3MfdQa2CRIZQNko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56700'),
  ('407109310198580865', 'Feel My Voice', 2026, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Luca Ribuoli, Ivan Casalgrandi, Federica Ciciarelli', 'Eric Lartigau, Stanislas Carré de Malberg, Thomas Bidegain', 'Sarah Toscano, Serena Rossi, Carola Insolera, Emilio Insolera, Antonio Iorillo, Asia Corvino, Alessandro Parigi, Simonetta Pellizzer', 'R', 'A teenager, the only hearing member of a deaf family, finds her voice and learns to believe in herself through her passion for singing.', 'A teenager, the only hearing member of a deaf family, finds her voice and learns to believe in herself through her passion for singing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Tf0qTA73XLhBnfP6YgvqtLZBnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1620551'),
  ('56892009233010901', 'Feel the Beat', 2020, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Elissa Down, Amir Mokri', 'Shawn Ku, Michael Armbruster', 'Sofia Carson, Wolfgang Novogratz, Donna Lynne Champlin, Enrico Colantoni, Dennis Andres, Rex Lee, Brandon Kyle Goodman, Eva Hauge', 'G', 'After failing to make it on Broadway, April returns to her hometown and reluctantly begins training a misfit group of young dancers for a competition.', 'After failing to make it on Broadway, April returns to her hometown and reluctantly begins training a misfit group of young dancers for a competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Af2jt7m9GLFpR4V11xOsFmT8OKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:707886'),
  ('930780802841901118', 'Feel the Motion', 1985, 'Comedy, Music', 'Wolfgang Büld, Roland Willaert', 'Wolfgang Büld, Rochus Hahn', 'Sissy Kelling, Frank Meyer-Brockmann, Ingolf Lück, Dietmar Bär, Falco, Limahl, Meat Loaf, Pia Zadora', null, 'Young Tina has a big dream, she wants to become a successful pop singer. That''s why she tries her luck in the music show ''Formel Eins''. There she meets all kinds of stars like Falco, Meat Loaf, Die Toten Hosen and Pia Zadora and of course the presenter Ingolf Lück. The result is a colorful mix-up and the question arises as to whether Tina can make her dream come true.', 'Young Tina has a big dream, she wants to become a successful pop singer. That''s why she tries her luck in the music show ''Formel Eins''. There she meets all kinds of stars like Falco, Meat Loaf, Die Toten Hosen and Pia Zadora and of course the presenter Ingolf Lück. The result is a colorful mix-up and the question arises as to whether Tina can make her dream come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6DotwO3UW4d5F64EEhzV2MR2dw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2145'),
  ('925832613190169859', 'Feel The Noise', 2007, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Alejandro Chomski, Zoran Popović', 'Albert Leon', 'Rosa Arredondo, Omarion, Giancarlo Esposito, Victor Rasuk, Melonie Díaz, Charles Duckworth, Alexis Isaac García, Zulay Henao', 'PG-13', 'After a run-in with local thugs, aspiring Harlem rapper Rob flees to a place and father he never knew, and finds his salvation in Reggaeton, a spicy blend of hip-hop, reggae and Latin beats. Puerto Rico, the spiritual home of Reggaeton, inspires Rob and his step-brother Javi to pursue their dream of becoming Reggaeton stars. Together with a dancer named C.C., they learn what it means to stay true to themselves and each other, while overcoming obstacles in love, greed and pride, all culminating in an explosive performance at New York’s Puerto Rican Day Parade.', 'After a run-in with local thugs, aspiring Harlem rapper Rob flees to a place and father he never knew, and finds his salvation in Reggaeton, a spicy blend of hip-hop, reggae and Latin beats. Puerto Rico, the spiritual home of Reggaeton, inspires Rob and his step-brother Javi to pursue their dream of becoming Reggaeton stars. Together with a dancer named C.C., they learn what it means to stay true to themselves and each other, while overcoming obstacles in love, greed and pride, all culminating in an explosive performance at New York’s Puerto Rican Day Parade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYuNrVhoAdrwqAQcefHrXVUv9dN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30319'),
  ('311998265216609556', 'Feel the Wind', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sumio Ōmori, Akira Sako, Hiroyuki Inokoshi', 'Sumio Ōmori', 'Keisuke Koide, Kento Hayashi, Yuichi Nakamura, Yôsuke Kawamura, Jun Hashimoto, Ren Mori, Ren Mori, Dante Carver', null, 'Haiji was an elite runner, but has not competed due to a past injury. He then meets fellow elite runner Kakeru who also left running, but caused by a dispute. Their meeting inspires both young men to run again, with Haiji choosing the fabled "Hakone Ekiden" (long distance relay race). The race requires a 10 member team so Haiji and Kakeru recruits 8 others (some of whom have never even run before). Within this unlikely group of runners a bond is formed through their training and a belief that they can accomplish the impossible.', 'Haiji was an elite runner, but has not competed due to a past injury. He then meets fellow elite runner Kakeru who also left running, but caused by a dispute. Their meeting inspires both young men to run again, with Haiji choosing the fabled "Hakone Ekiden" (long distance relay race). The race requires a 10 member team so Haiji and Kakeru recruits 8 others (some of whom have never even run before). Within this unlikely group of runners a bond is formed through their training and a belief that they can accomplish the impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17YlZvwFMY4CwYGDrIuLAsP1Eo7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184813'),
  ('949573736214353155', 'Feeling Better', 2025, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Guido Michelotti', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Enrico Audenino', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Dolores Fonzi, Lino Musella, Giorgio Montanini, Justin Alexander Korovkin, Barbara Ronchi, Luca Lionello, Laura Morante', null, 'A man spends peacefully his days in hospital without too many worries. He has been hospitalized for a while but that condition seems like the best way to live his life, safe from everything and everyone, without responsibilities and problems of any kind. It feels really good in there and even if some of his ward companions feel trapped, for them he can also feel free like nowhere else. That precious routine runs smoothly until a new person is admitted to the same ward. She is a restless, angry companion, she accepts nothing of that condition, especially the unwritten rules. She is not willing to wait, she wants to leave that place better or even worse. She wants to live as she should or die, as happens to those who end up in there. He is overwhelmed by that fury, first trying to defend himself and then accepting something incomprehensible. That encounter will help him accept that if you choose to truly face your heart and your emotions, there is no possible repair.', 'A man spends peacefully his days in hospital without too many worries. He has been hospitalized for a while but that condition seems like the best way to live his life, safe from everything and everyone, without responsibilities and problems of any kind. It feels really good in there and even if some of his ward companions feel trapped, for them he can also feel free like nowhere else. That precious routine runs smoothly until a new person is admitted to the same ward. She is a restless, angry companion, she accepts nothing of that condition, especially the unwritten rules. She is not willing to wait, she wants to leave that place better or even worse. She wants to live as she should or die, as happens to those who end up in there. He is overwhelmed by that fury, first trying to defend himself and then accepting something incomprehensible. That encounter will help him accept that if you choose to truly face your heart and your emotions, there is no possible repair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkpQQBgWt27klMPasJMwvTc0vgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1319473'),
  ('565906074257981722', 'Feeling Butterflies', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Jonathan Kischel, MJ Grabiak', 'T. Booker James', 'Kayla Wallace, Kevin McGarry, Alyssa Gervasi, Ish Morris, Kathryn Kohut, Amanda Jordan, Helena-Alexis Seymour, Randy Thomas', 'G', 'When you need butterflies for your wedding or birthday, there’s only one woman to call: Emily Mariposa. It’s what her business ‘Feeling Butterflies Inc.'' is all about – and right now, business is good! In fact it’s so good, Emily and her business partner Adam are struggling to keep up with demand.', 'When you need butterflies for your wedding or birthday, there’s only one woman to call: Emily Mariposa. It’s what her business ‘Feeling Butterflies Inc.'' is all about – and right now, business is good! In fact it’s so good, Emily and her business partner Adam are struggling to keep up with demand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSduohMZEVQHmYQKFFTkDi2ko6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927755'),
  ('1057006503078602664', 'Feeling from Mountain and Water', 1988, 'Animation', 'Te Wei, Yan Shanchun, Ma Kexuan', 'Wang Shuchen', null, null, 'The story is about an impoverished elderly scholar and a young girl who cares for him briefly in return for guqin lessons.', 'The story is about an impoverished elderly scholar and a young girl who cares for him briefly in return for guqin lessons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmHptsoiiOSXLSdS5p7UXdKPdX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195804'),
  ('733275228856655026', 'Feeling Good', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Étaix', 'Pierre Étaix', 'Roger Trapp, Preston, Robert Blome, Pierre Moncorbier, Pierre Étaix', null, 'Short film by Pierre Etaix, edited out from the anthology film As Long as You''ve Got Your Health (1966).', 'Short film by Pierre Etaix, edited out from the anthology film As Long as You''ve Got Your Health (1966).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6U5SgxcfvoWoZI2dpcTrVBeS8tZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207123'),
  ('123458175880730673', 'Feeling It', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Fernando León de Aranoa, Pilar de Heras, José Martín Rosete', 'Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Joaquín Sabina, Jimena Coronado, Joan Manuel Serrat, Leiva, José Tomás, Benjamín Prado, Carmela Martínez Oliart, Berry Navarro', null, 'An intimate portrait of Spanish singer-songwriter Joaquín Sabina without his signature bowler hat, at night and with malice aforethought. Rugged, direct, and unflinching, director Fernando León de Aranoa captures Sabina’s hidden side over 13 years of filming, where the artist steps off the stage to reveal stories of misfortune, comedy, inspiration, and of pain.', 'An intimate portrait of Spanish singer-songwriter Joaquín Sabina without his signature bowler hat, at night and with malice aforethought. Rugged, direct, and unflinching, director Fernando León de Aranoa captures Sabina’s hidden side over 13 years of filming, where the artist steps off the stage to reveal stories of misfortune, comedy, inspiration, and of pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLXkjfouAr219ip130bVNCdkTJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007698'),
  ('1147116014913803714', 'Feeling Minnesota', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Walt Lloyd, Steven Baigelman', 'Steven Baigelman', 'Keanu Reeves, Cameron Diaz, Vincent D''Onofrio, Delroy Lindo, Dan Aykroyd, Courtney Love, Drew Desmarais, Tuesday Weld', 'R', 'Sam Clayton''s marriage to ex-stripper Freddie comes about when she''s strong-armed into the match by Red, a club proprietor who once did her a favor. But Freddie falls in love with Jjaks, Sam''s brother, and the pair tries to escape the situation together. It isn''t long before both Sam and Red catch up with them, resulting in threats against the two of them -- although tension also starts to build between Sam and Red.', 'Sam Clayton''s marriage to ex-stripper Freddie comes about when she''s strong-armed into the match by Red, a club proprietor who once did her a favor. But Freddie falls in love with Jjaks, Sam''s brother, and the pair tries to escape the situation together. It isn''t long before both Sam and Red catch up with them, resulting in threats against the two of them -- although tension also starts to build between Sam and Red.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCJ5eUZw6mGS53spQxGUu7rzFm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12656'),
  ('887710288817286395', 'Feelings', 1985, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Fantasy', 'Todd Solondz', 'Todd Solondz', 'Todd Solondz, Jan Meredith', null, 'His first film shot with sound, Feelings is a two and a half minute movie made as an NYU film school assignment in 1984. Solondz himself takes the lead role of a sensitive young man who finds he can no longer endure life without his beloved. Photographed by Andy Day, the film is set to Todd Solondz''s personal rendition of the song "Feelings" by Morris Albert.', 'His first film shot with sound, Feelings is a two and a half minute movie made as an NYU film school assignment in 1984. Solondz himself takes the lead role of a sensitive young man who finds he can no longer endure life without his beloved. Photographed by Andy Day, the film is set to Todd Solondz''s personal rendition of the song "Feelings" by Morris Albert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ITB4LfWOe3ei1sddydfOW5wICP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110913'),
  ('837369024795555234', 'Feelings', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Noémie Lvovsky, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Florence Seyvos, Noémie Lvovsky', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Nathalie Baye, Isabelle Carré, Melvil Poupaud, Agathe Bonitzer, Virgile Grünberg, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Cécile Reigher', null, 'Two seemingly happily married French couples are forced to contend with a number of issues.', 'Two seemingly happily married French couples are forced to contend with a number of issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnC4jgDCyoOZwVzA70bXQ3Uvz7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18461'),
  ('419208289118876142', 'Feels Good Man', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Ben Cox, Christian Bruno, Arthur Jones', 'Giorgio Angelini, Arthur Jones, Aaron Wickenden', 'Matt Furie, Aiyana Udesen, Chris Sullivan, Johnny Ryan, Lisa Hanawalt, Emily Heller, Susan Blackmore, Dale Beran', 'NR', 'When indie comic character Pepe the Frog becomes an unwitting icon of hate, his creator, artist Matt Furie, fights to bring Pepe back from the darkness and navigate America''s cultural divide.', 'When indie comic character Pepe the Frog becomes an unwitting icon of hate, his creator, artist Matt Furie, fights to bring Pepe back from the darkness and navigate America''s cultural divide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osN5whpwiXN5j7umqemCKoCiXKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653578'),
  ('765876183985540017', 'Feet First', 1930, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Bruckman, Mal De Lay, Henry N. Kohler', 'Felix Adler, Lex Neal', 'Harold Lloyd, Barbara Kent, Robert McWade, Lillian Leighton, Henry Hall, Noah Young, Alec B. Francis, Arthur Housman', 'NR', 'An ambitious shoe salesman, Harold, unknowingly meets the boss'' daughter and tells her he is a leather tycoon. The rest of the film he spends hiding his true circumstances, in the store and later on a ship. Trying to deliver a letter, he later finds himself dangling high above the street on a building''s scaffolding.', 'An ambitious shoe salesman, Harold, unknowingly meets the boss'' daughter and tells her he is a leather tycoon. The rest of the film he spends hiding his true circumstances, in the store and later on a ship. Trying to deliver a letter, he later finds himself dangling high above the street on a building''s scaffolding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cD3xWlzcX7WwmQuqZ8Qi7BAz40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42363'),
  ('714516117337568823', 'Feisbum - Il film', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Tani Canevari, Stefano Paradiso, Mario Amura', 'Giorgio Fabbri, Dino Giarrusso, Laura Luchetti', 'Gigi Angelillo, Alessia Barela, Giulia Bevilacqua, Andrea Bosca, Massimiliano Bruno, Roberto Brunetti, Francesca Chillemi, Giorgio Colangeli', null, 'The title translates literally as "Faceboom." An omnibus film helmed by seven top-tiered Italian directors, this comedy explores the worldwide Facebook craze of the early 21st century by recounting the adventures of numerous Europeans whose lives are altered by that social networking site.', 'The title translates literally as "Faceboom." An omnibus film helmed by seven top-tiered Italian directors, this comedy explores the worldwide Facebook craze of the early 21st century by recounting the adventures of numerous Europeans whose lives are altered by that social networking site.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42esp9U5PaamB2LqGPrmXEmJvF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73688'),
