  ('830305467103043490', 'Felicia''s Journey', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Bob Hoskins, Elaine Cassidy, Arsinée Khanjian, Peter McDonald, Gerard McSorley, Brid Brennan, Sheila Reid, Nizwar Karanj', 'PG-13', 'Seventeen and pregnant, Felicia travels to England in search of her lover and is found instead by Joseph Ambrose Hilditch, a helpful catering manager whose kindness masks unsettling secret.', 'Seventeen and pregnant, Felicia travels to England in search of her lover and is found instead by Joseph Ambrose Hilditch, a helpful catering manager whose kindness masks unsettling secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itqEwiINuYvaqvFKw5YWitnqAUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47692'),
  ('569313078261294044', 'Felicidades', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Lucho Bender, Fabio Iastrebner, Diego Nuñez', 'Pablo Cedrón, Pedro Loeb, Lucho Bender', 'Gastón Pauls, Silke, Pablo Cedrón, Luis Machín, Carlos Belloso, Marcelo Mazzarello, Alfredo Casero, Cacho Castaña', null, 'Three stories of ordinary people intersect on Christmas Eve: a dentist desperate to find his son''s toy; a writer who is not happy and decides to look for the woman of his dreams; and a doctor who intends to flirt with a Spanish woman.', 'Three stories of ordinary people intersect on Christmas Eve: a dentist desperate to find his son''s toy; a writer who is not happy and decides to look for the woman of his dreams; and a doctor who intends to flirt with a Spanish woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozRxMgEMNITFS2tGRha3da7pJIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71118'),
  ('51112065134221776', 'Felicità', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Merle, Romain Carcanade', 'Bruno Merle', 'Pio Marmaï, Camille Rutherford, Rita Merle, Orelsan, Lulubelle Gobron-Amoti, Johanne Thibaut, Yvon Connan, Charles Catel', null, 'Tommy, 11 years old, is on the road again with her eccentric parents. This time, her freshly out-of-jail father has promised her: she won''t miss the first school-day of the term! That was before her dad stole a sports car, her mother disappeared and an astronaut popped by.', 'Tommy, 11 years old, is on the road again with her eccentric parents. This time, her freshly out-of-jail father has promised her: she won''t miss the first school-day of the term! That was before her dad stole a sports car, her mother disappeared and an astronaut popped by.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhAiRXQUkMRnalRZFr1jiRCohjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667071'),
  ('534837400348488154', 'Felicità', 2026, 'Short, Comedy, Drama', 'Salomé Alexi, Mariam Kandelaki, Giorgi Beridze, Assia Zipper', 'Zaira Arsenishvili', 'Zaira Arsenishvili, Nassim El Mounabbih, Cyril Holtz, Gia Abesalashvili, Nika Bakhia', null, 'Tamria looks after and old woman, Paola, and sends money to her husband and three kids. Suddenly her husband, Valiko dies in an accident. As an illegal immigrant, Tamria can not go to mourn him and decides to do it by cell phone.', 'Tamria looks after and old woman, Paola, and sends money to her husband and three kids. Suddenly her husband, Valiko dies in an accident. As an illegal immigrant, Tamria can not go to mourn him and decides to do it by cell phone.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FoM7mNT3RBihYn1KVTBkCHOEGOgb.jpg', 'plex:movie:bedniereba'),
  ('340315304599584627', 'Felicity', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'John D. Lamond, Andrew Friedman, Miki Viala', 'John D. Lamond', 'Glory Annen, Chris Milne, Joni Flynn, Jody Hanson, Marilyn Rodgers, Gordon Charles, John-Michael Howson, David Bradshaw', null, 'Felicity studies at a remote Roman Catholic boarding school in Australia. Consumed by curiosity about sex and heavily indulging in popular erotic novels as well as a lesbian affair with her friend Jenny, she yearns for a real-world experience.', 'Felicity studies at a remote Roman Catholic boarding school in Australia. Consumed by curiosity about sex and heavily indulging in popular erotic novels as well as a lesbian affair with her friend Jenny, she yearns for a real-world experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9pRJqvf7lbfWysuMGiFtxswulA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45048'),
  ('707091792395005192', 'Felicity: An American Girl Adventure', 2005, 'Action, Drama, Family, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Nadia Tass, David Parker', null, 'Shailene Woodley, Kevin Zegers, David Gardner, John Schneider, Marcia Gay Harden, Bruce Beaton, Peter Cockett, Harry Crane', null, 'A pre-American Revolution Virginian girl''s love for the outdoors leads to the friendship of a lifetime. Felicity loves horses, and though her parents plead with her to remain indoors, she yearns to ride the open plains. When Felicity comes into contact with a beautiful mare which has suffered at the hands of its callous owner, she takes it upon herself to care for the creature.', 'A pre-American Revolution Virginian girl''s love for the outdoors leads to the friendship of a lifetime. Felicity loves horses, and though her parents plead with her to remain indoors, she yearns to ride the open plains. When Felicity comes into contact with a beautiful mare which has suffered at the hands of its callous owner, she takes it upon herself to care for the creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5whGifOJWI6v93DJEClzxYiZKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25778'),
  ('307132403261309051', 'Felidae', 1994, 'Animation, Mystery, Horror', 'Michael Schaack, Werner Loss, Bernie Denk', 'Martin Kluger', 'Ulrich Tukur, Mario Adorf, Helge Schneider, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Wolfgang Hess, Gerhard Garbers, Ulrich Wildgruber', 'NR', 'A domestic house cat named Francis investigates the grisly feline murders taking place in his new neighborhood.', 'A domestic house cat named Francis investigates the grisly feline murders taking place in his new neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bI9fGbmtQhtHRTNaZXnFjDzoxtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8983'),
  ('517252363440385851', 'Feline Frame-Up', 1954, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce', 'NR', 'After Claude frames Marc Antony, making it look like the bulldog ate the kitty, Marc must try various methods of getting back at Claude from outside the yard.', 'After Claude frames Marc Antony, making it look like the bulldog ate the kitty, Marc must try various methods of getting back at Claude from outside the yard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upRHhaTeuveMhnnBhUuvDCcI4Y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83763'),
  ('747392917729153779', 'Felipe Neto: My Life Makes No Sense', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Felipe Neto', null, 'YouTube sensation Felipe Neto brings the stories from his autobiographical book ''Não Faz Sentido!'' to the stage in this comedy special.', 'YouTube sensation Felipe Neto brings the stories from his autobiographical book ''Não Faz Sentido!'' to the stage in this comedy special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNpDCyre6F5UWPf4KT5rXtfQjOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448723'),
  ('948028848392234439', 'Felix and Lola', 2001, 'Drama', 'Jean-Marie Dreujou, Patrice Leconte', 'Claude Klotz, Patrice Leconte', 'Philippe Torreton, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Alain Bashung, Philippe du Janerand, Ahmed Guedayia, Karim Soutan, Muriel Combeau, Didier Cauchy', null, 'Félix, operator of dodgem cars in a fairground, becomes obsessed by one of his customers, a mysterious young woman named Lola. Félix soon discovers that Lola is running away from her former boyfriend, a singer who continues to taunt her. Lola asks Félix to prove his love for her by murdering a man he does not know...', 'Félix, operator of dodgem cars in a fairground, becomes obsessed by one of his customers, a mysterious young woman named Lola. Félix soon discovers that Lola is running away from her former boyfriend, a singer who continues to taunt her. Lola asks Félix to prove his love for her by murdering a man he does not know...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwXWPm7Q8LVWYLycx95wZPbNGHJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76547'),
  ('508197820208243552', 'Felix and Meira', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maxime Giroux, Sara Mishara', 'Alexandre Laferrière, Maxime Giroux', 'Martin Dubreuil, Hadas Yaron, Luzer Twersky, Anne-Élisabeth Bossé, Benoît Girard', 'R', 'A young married woman from Montreal''s Orthodox Jewish community finds freedom from the strictures of her faith through her relationship with a young man who is mourning the death of his estranged father.', 'A young married woman from Montreal''s Orthodox Jewish community finds freedom from the strictures of her faith through her relationship with a young man who is mourning the death of his estranged father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKmrsUGqiFSwhBJTZBsmKCrfV4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285848'),
  ('381141666953848685', 'Felix and Otilia', 1972, 'Drama', 'Iulian Mihu, Ion P. Ion, Hortensia Mihalas', 'Ioan Grigorescu', 'Radu Boruzescu, Sergiu Nicolaescu, Julieta Szönyi, Gheorghe Dinică, Clody Bertola, Ovidiu Schumacher, Gina Patrichi, Elena Dacian', null, 'Young Felix moves into his eccentric uncle’s house and is immediately drawn to the enigmatic Otilia, a free-spirited woman who lives by her own rules. Love, inheritance games, decaying mansions, and fragile hearts collide in this elegant adaptation of George Călinescu’s novel Enigma Otiliei.', 'Young Felix moves into his eccentric uncle’s house and is immediately drawn to the enigmatic Otilia, a free-spirited woman who lives by her own rules. Love, inheritance games, decaying mansions, and fragile hearts collide in this elegant adaptation of George Călinescu’s novel Enigma Otiliei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMONOLHWjLT05roXkhAUOynPWi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89792'),
  ('1079225730107135071', 'Felix and the Treasure of Morgäa', 2021, 'Family, Adventure, Animation', 'Nicola Lemay', 'Marc Robitaille', 'Karine Vanasse, Gabriel Lessard, Guy Nadon, Marc Labrèche, Antoine Durand, Tristan Harvey, Éveline Gélinas, Catherine Proulx-Lemay', 'PG', 'Taking advantage of his mother''s absence as she departs on a cruise ship for some rest and relaxation, 12-year-old Félix sets out to find his father, a fisherman who disappeared at sea two years earlier.', 'Taking advantage of his mother''s absence as she departs on a cruise ship for some rest and relaxation, 12-year-old Félix sets out to find his father, a fisherman who disappeared at sea two years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqRKcVybzM2NXV9p9vvx337HMXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764807'),
  ('733483713075020926', 'Felix Austria', 2020, 'Romance, History', 'Khrystyna Syvolap, Oleksii Lamakh', 'Alina Semeryakova, Sofia Andrukhovych', 'Marianna Januszewicz, Alesya Romanova, Roman Lutskyi, Oleksandr Kobzar, Serhii Volosovets, Sebastian Cybulski, Maryna Koshkina, Ada Rohovtseva', null, 'The plot revolves around the controversial relationship between maid Stefania Chornenko and blueblood Adelia Anger against the backdrop of the provincial Austro-Hungary in 1900. Both Stefania’s parents and Adelia’s mother died during the fire. Adelia’s father adopted neighbors’ orphan. Girls grew up together to become as close as sisters, though Stefania served as the maid. This attachment develops into love-trap: on one hand full of mutual manipulation and jealousy, but equally based on сare and devotion. The illusion of balance is broken when Adelia marries sculptor Petro. Everything gets even more complicated when Joseph, the old love interest of Stefa, returns to town as the priest and married man. Illusions are destined to evaporate and reality comes into focus.', 'The plot revolves around the controversial relationship between maid Stefania Chornenko and blueblood Adelia Anger against the backdrop of the provincial Austro-Hungary in 1900. Both Stefania’s parents and Adelia’s mother died during the fire. Adelia’s father adopted neighbors’ orphan. Girls grew up together to become as close as sisters, though Stefania served as the maid. This attachment develops into love-trap: on one hand full of mutual manipulation and jealousy, but equally based on сare and devotion. The illusion of balance is broken when Adelia marries sculptor Petro. Everything gets even more complicated when Joseph, the old love interest of Stefa, returns to town as the priest and married man. Illusions are destined to evaporate and reality comes into focus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irLMuXA3twZ4Jy6FdsKlLwNcII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655655'),
  ('934010818938349587', 'Felix in Exile', 1994, 'Drama, Animation', 'William Kentridge', null, null, null, 'Felix in Exile introduces a new character to the ''Drawings for Projection'' series: Nandi, an African woman, who appears at the beginning of the film making drawings of the landscape. She observes the land with surveyor''s instruments, watching African bodies, with bleeding wounds, which melt into the landscape. She is recording the evidence of violence and massacre that is part of South Africa''s recent history. Felix Teitelbaum, who features in Kentridge''s first and fourth films as the humane and loving alter-ego to the ruthless capitalist white South African psyche, appears here semi-naked and alone in a foreign hotel room, brooding over Nandi''s drawings of the damaged African landscape, which cover his suitcase and walls. Kentridge has commented: ''Felix in Exile was made at the time just before the first general election in South Africa, and questioned the way in which the people who had died on the journey to this new dispensation would be remembered''.', 'Felix in Exile introduces a new character to the ''Drawings for Projection'' series: Nandi, an African woman, who appears at the beginning of the film making drawings of the landscape. She observes the land with surveyor''s instruments, watching African bodies, with bleeding wounds, which melt into the landscape. She is recording the evidence of violence and massacre that is part of South Africa''s recent history. Felix Teitelbaum, who features in Kentridge''s first and fourth films as the humane and loving alter-ego to the ruthless capitalist white South African psyche, appears here semi-naked and alone in a foreign hotel room, brooding over Nandi''s drawings of the damaged African landscape, which cover his suitcase and walls. Kentridge has commented: ''Felix in Exile was made at the time just before the first general election in South Africa, and questioned the way in which the people who had died on the journey to this new dispensation would be remembered''.', null, 'tmdb:movie:183913'),
  ('254330429234885766', 'Felix in Hollywood', 1923, 'Animation', 'Otto Messmer', null, null, null, 'A starving actor, reduced to trying his luck in the movies, travels to Hollywood. His cat, Felix, poses as a travel bag and comes along.', 'A starving actor, reduced to trying his luck in the movies, travels to Hollywood. His cat, Felix, poses as a travel bag and comes along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P3ztTCe5jL0Rza8m5ZsUT5NhH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128754'),
  ('112377281759855104', 'Felix Lobrecht: Hype', 2020, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Jan-Peter Horns, Arkin Atacan', 'Felix Lobrecht', 'Felix Lobrecht', null, 'Felix Lobrecht aims his dark humor at overly polite culture, weird laughter, the sheer awkwardness of a walking baby and more in this stand-up special.', 'Felix Lobrecht aims his dark humor at overly polite culture, weird laughter, the sheer awkwardness of a walking baby and more in this stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edcE61BiUQM8tzpxpApRvEX8yu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760314'),
  ('1137642793742850806', 'Félix Mayol Performs "Indiscreet Questions"', 1905, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Félix Mayol', null, 'Felix Mayol performs a song, in colour.', 'Felix Mayol performs a song, in colour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbDLNs7ahEoXnPGEmWFubC7s8PM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120011'),
  ('236843196984961497', 'Félix Mayol Performs "The Trottins'' Polka"', 1905, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Félix Mayol', null, 'Félix Mayol performs The Trottins Polka (La Polka des Trottins, by A. Trebitsch and H. Christine) in this phonoscene by Alice Guy. This early form of music video was created using a chronophone recording of Mayol, who was then filmed "lip singing". Guy would film phonoscenes of all three major Belle Époque celebrities in France: Polin, Félix Mayol, and Dranem.', 'Félix Mayol performs The Trottins Polka (La Polka des Trottins, by A. Trebitsch and H. Christine) in this phonoscene by Alice Guy. This early form of music video was created using a chronophone recording of Mayol, who was then filmed "lip singing". Guy would film phonoscenes of all three major Belle Époque celebrities in France: Polin, Félix Mayol, and Dranem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtwaFfwOB2k2OEfhiqHRNH382Sm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120012'),
  ('668785933114153205', 'Félix Mayol Performs "White Lilacs"', 1905, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Félix Mayol', null, 'Felix Mayol performs Théodore Botrel''s ''Lilas-blanc''.', 'Felix Mayol performs Théodore Botrel''s ''Lilas-blanc''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuDMXEu7yesi19NEXCKvYK2BgpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120013'),
  ('544646979112185899', 'Felix the Cat: The Movie', 1988, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Tibor Hernádi, László Radocsay, Tibor Belay', 'Pete Brown, Don Oriolo', 'Chris Phillips, Marbry Steward, Peter Newman, Alice Playten, Susan Montanaro, Don Oriolo, Christian Schneider, David Kolin', 'G', 'In another dimension, the villainous scientist Duke of Zill, with the help of his mechanical, geometric army, ultimately takes over the golden kingdom of Oriana, where Duke has just escaped exile! But Felix the Cat must bravely save Princess Oriana and restore order once again, from her terrible Uncle Zill and his smoke-belching mechanical troops before he can put his sinister plot into action!', 'In another dimension, the villainous scientist Duke of Zill, with the help of his mechanical, geometric army, ultimately takes over the golden kingdom of Oriana, where Duke has just escaped exile! But Felix the Cat must bravely save Princess Oriana and restore order once again, from her terrible Uncle Zill and his smoke-belching mechanical troops before he can put his sinister plot into action!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RvUPLEJ3oRJnu9xhY73kBC31o3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36523'),
  ('465236270759073427', 'Felix Turns the Tide', 1922, 'Animation', 'Otto Messmer', null, null, null, 'Felix the Cat becomes a soldier when the rats declare war on the cats.', 'Felix the Cat becomes a soldier when the rats declare war on the cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kb49fOFZFKmMTdEwqIXOwb50GCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175552'),
  ('110324365159162266', 'Felix: All Around the World', 2005, 'Family, Animation', 'Giuseppe Laganà', 'John Patterson, Gabriele M. Walther, Reinhard Brock', 'Patrick Flecken, Lilian Brock, Susanne von Medvey, Michael Schernthaner, Tim Schwarzmaier, Jasper Clemens Walther, Lara Wurmer, Uschi Glas', null, 'After being separated from his friend Sophie, Felix embarks on a journey filled with mystical creatures in this high quality animated feature for your kids and family.', 'After being separated from his friend Sophie, Felix embarks on a journey filled with mystical creatures in this high quality animated feature for your kids and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/werMeYAY6HwQPsltpednzAIUnko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172625'),
  ('256363036635056484', 'Feliz NaviDAD', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Melissa Joan Hart', 'Peter Murrieta', 'Mario López, AnnaLynne McCord, Paulina Chávez, Cheryl Freeman, Melissa Bolona, Marycarmen Lopez, Rick Najera, Ángel Alvarado', null, 'David Morales, an Arizona high school principal and single dad, has lost the holiday spirit after also losing his wife a few years ago during the Christmas season. Now, David will do anything to avoid Christmas so he moonlights as a delivery driver during the holidays. But this year David’s 14-year-old daughter, Noel, and his live-in sister, Marissa, are determined to bring the yuletide spirit back to the family and, with a little luck, also help David find love again via online dating. So when Sophie, a witty musician and customer on David’s delivery route, swipes right on him, something magical happens between them.', 'David Morales, an Arizona high school principal and single dad, has lost the holiday spirit after also losing his wife a few years ago during the Christmas season. Now, David will do anything to avoid Christmas so he moonlights as a delivery driver during the holidays. But this year David’s 14-year-old daughter, Noel, and his live-in sister, Marissa, are determined to bring the yuletide spirit back to the family and, with a little luck, also help David find love again via online dating. So when Sophie, a witty musician and customer on David’s delivery route, swipes right on him, something magical happens between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDUW43rl3H6H8I2YXhfXwLeTkYq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744939'),
  ('1073746537730026437', 'Fellini of the Spirits', 2020, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Daniele Botteselle, Selma Dell''Olio', 'Selma Dell''Olio', 'Terry Gilliam, Filippo Ascione, Damien Chazelle, William Friedkin, Andrea Minuz, Fiammetta Profili, Aldo Tassone, Sergio Zavoli', null, '2020 marks 100 years since the birth of Federico Fellini, the most prominent Italian director and one of the symbols of the insuperable cinematic heyday of mid-20th century. Fellini had always been a mysterious director, not only in his cryptic symbolism but also in his idiosyncratic, excessive mixture of psychoanalysis, Catholicism and faith in the mysterious. In this documentary, his relationship with the paranormal, luck and fate, alongside the coexistence of organized discourse and transcendence to the imaginary, is examined via friends, collaborators and distinguished fans (Friedkin, Gilliam, Chazelle). A great testimony to why rationalists and ideologists have a hard time with his work, ‘Fellini and the Spirits’ is an appropriate yet unexpected tribute.', '2020 marks 100 years since the birth of Federico Fellini, the most prominent Italian director and one of the symbols of the insuperable cinematic heyday of mid-20th century. Fellini had always been a mysterious director, not only in his cryptic symbolism but also in his idiosyncratic, excessive mixture of psychoanalysis, Catholicism and faith in the mysterious. In this documentary, his relationship with the paranormal, luck and fate, alongside the coexistence of organized discourse and transcendence to the imaginary, is examined via friends, collaborators and distinguished fans (Friedkin, Gilliam, Chazelle). A great testimony to why rationalists and ideologists have a hard time with his work, ‘Fellini and the Spirits’ is an appropriate yet unexpected tribute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMzrbkvXLTZ4jmWqXwYvL3oHsO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689540'),
  ('1021022885966973388', 'Fellini: A Director’s Notebook', 1969, 'TV Movie, Documentary', 'Liliana Betti, Maurizio Mein, Federico Fellini', 'Bernardino Zapponi, Federico Fellini', 'Federico Fellini, Giulietta Masina, Marcello Mastroianni, Caterina Boratto, Marina Boratto, David Maumsell, Pasqualino De Santis, Nino Rota', null, 'Fellini discusses his views of making motion pictures and his unorthodox procedures. He seeks inspiration in various out of the way places. During this film viewers go with him to the Colisseum at night, on a subway ride past Roman ruins, to the Appian Way, to a slaughterhouse, and on a visit to Marcello Mastroianni''s house. Fellini also is seen in his own office interviewing a series of unusual characters seeking work or his help.', 'Fellini discusses his views of making motion pictures and his unorthodox procedures. He seeks inspiration in various out of the way places. During this film viewers go with him to the Colisseum at night, on a subway ride past Roman ruins, to the Appian Way, to a slaughterhouse, and on a visit to Marcello Mastroianni''s house. Fellini also is seen in his own office interviewing a series of unusual characters seeking work or his help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptAWCqXRNEsSRhiHLG3BRVcOejl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335210'),
  ('822035839082762349', 'Fellini: I''m a Born Liar', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Damian Pettigrew, Paco Wiser', 'Olivier Gal, Damian Pettigrew', 'Roberto Benigni, Luigi ''Titta'' Benzi, Italo Calvino, Dante Ferretti, Rinaldo Geleng, Terence Stamp, Donald Sutherland, Tullio Pinelli', null, 'A look at Fellini''s creative process. In extensive interviews, Fellini talks a bit about his background and then discusses how he works and how he creates. Several actors, a producer, a writer, and a production manager talk about working with Fellini. Archive footage of Fellini and others on the set plus clips from his films provide commentary and illustration for the points interviewees make. Fellini is fully in charge; actors call themselves puppets. He dismisses improvisation and calls for "availability." His sets and his films create images that look like reality but are not; we see the differences and the results.', 'A look at Fellini''s creative process. In extensive interviews, Fellini talks a bit about his background and then discusses how he works and how he creates. Several actors, a producer, a writer, and a production manager talk about working with Fellini. Archive footage of Fellini and others on the set plus clips from his films provide commentary and illustration for the points interviewees make. Fellini is fully in charge; actors call themselves puppets. He dismisses improvisation and calls for "availability." His sets and his films create images that look like reality but are not; we see the differences and the results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57HGqJWJ7K2Ca9C2REHheqcQeWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203252'),
  ('49716563286327889', 'Fellini''s Casanova', 1976, 'Drama, History', 'Federico Fellini, Liliana Betti, Gérald Morin', 'Federico Fellini, Bernardino Zapponi', 'Donald Sutherland, Tina Aumont, Cicely Browne, Carmen Scarpitta, Clara Algranti, Daniela Gatti, Margareth Clémenti, Mario Cencelli', 'R', 'Imprisoned for practicing black magic, writer and adventurer Giacomo Casanova escapes and wanders Europe, using his fluid sexuality to find his place in life amid a variety of eccentric and strange characters.', 'Imprisoned for practicing black magic, writer and adventurer Giacomo Casanova escapes and wanders Europe, using his fluid sexuality to find his place in life amid a variety of eccentric and strange characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygTsnjWEUY8fbXzFWIh07eEHf3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42236'),
  ('1078287662269618549', 'Fellinopolis', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Silvia Giulietti, Paolo Oreto, Jessica Giaconi', 'Silvia Giulietti', 'Lina Wertmüller, Dante Ferretti, Maurizio Millenotti, Norma Giacchero, Ferruccio Castronuovo, Nicola Piovani, Romano Talevi, Federico Fellini', null, 'Ferruccio Castronuovo was the only authorized eye, between 1976 and 1986, to film the brilliant Italian filmmaker Federico Fellini (1920-1993) in his personal and creative intimacy, to capture the gears of his great circus, his fantastic lies and his crazy inventions.', 'Ferruccio Castronuovo was the only authorized eye, between 1976 and 1986, to film the brilliant Italian filmmaker Federico Fellini (1920-1993) in his personal and creative intimacy, to capture the gears of his great circus, his fantastic lies and his crazy inventions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qA3WQU0sE5lCKsKS2O8hwmillOX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806495'),
  ('4069635605998251', 'Fellowship of the Frog', 1959, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Ernst W. Kalinke, Harald Reinl, Lothar Gündisch', 'Egon Eis, J. Joachim Bartsch', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Siegfried Lowitz, Eddi Arent, Elfie von Kalckreuth, Walter Wilz, Carl Lange, Dieter Eppler, Jochen Brockmann', null, 'Both Scotland Yard and an amateur American sleuth are tracking a master criminal known as The Frog. This moniker refers to the bulging-eyed mask worn by the evildoer, and is reflected by the frog icons painfully tatooed onto the forearms of his henchmen. The trail leads to the country manor of an enigmatic, steely-eyed nabob, whose repressed son has eyes for the artistes at the Lolita cabaret, and whose lovely daughter captures the fancy of both the American playboy and the villain himself. Murder, kidnapping and seduction ensue.', 'Both Scotland Yard and an amateur American sleuth are tracking a master criminal known as The Frog. This moniker refers to the bulging-eyed mask worn by the evildoer, and is reflected by the frog icons painfully tatooed onto the forearms of his henchmen. The trail leads to the country manor of an enigmatic, steely-eyed nabob, whose repressed son has eyes for the artistes at the Lolita cabaret, and whose lovely daughter captures the fancy of both the American playboy and the villain himself. Murder, kidnapping and seduction ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrf942VxNkcJPZoXWfH474IKELE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6699'),
