  ('1061499162225807462', 'Femina', 1991, 'Drama', 'Dariusz Kuc, Krystyna Grochowicz, Małgorzata Zdziarska', 'Krystyna Kofta', 'Hanna Dunowska, Alina Janowska, Hanna Skarżanka, Ewa Frąckiewicz, Stanisława Celińska, Ewa Sałacka, Gustaw Lutkiewicz, Katarzyna Walter', null, 'The main character is Bogna, a thirty year old woman lost in her surrounding reality and unhappy in her private life. After her husband departs for a foreign scholarship, Bogna learns that her mother died. The trip to her hometown for the funeral becomes a voyage in time, during which she relives the memories of her idyllic childhood.', 'The main character is Bogna, a thirty year old woman lost in her surrounding reality and unhappy in her private life. After her husband departs for a foreign scholarship, Bogna learns that her mother died. The trip to her hometown for the funeral becomes a voyage in time, during which she relives the memories of her idyllic childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDOMr9YEYV6DXreMY0nvHfN5uEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262174'),
  ('891217821301204314', 'Feminists: What Were They Thinking?', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Kristy Tully, Johanna Demetrakas', null, 'Laurie Anderson, Phyllis Chesler, Judy Chicago, Funmilola Fagbamila, Jane Fonda, Sally Kirkland, Wendy J.N. Lee, Meredith Monk', null, 'In 1977, a book of photographs captured an awakening - women shedding the cultural restrictions of their childhoods and embracing their full humanity. This documentary revisits those photos, those women and those times and takes aim at our culture today that alarmingly shows the need for continued change.', 'In 1977, a book of photographs captured an awakening - women shedding the cultural restrictions of their childhoods and embracing their full humanity. This documentary revisits those photos, those women and those times and takes aim at our culture today that alarmingly shows the need for continued change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Af6B4RrmvkMrADxqvNy7DJTAxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507618'),
