  ('486573887041752722', 'Femme Fatale', 1991, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Andre R. Guttfreund', 'Michael Ferris, John Brancato', 'Colin Firth, Lisa Zane, Billy Zane, Scott Wilson, Suzanne Snyder, Pat Skipper, Lisa Blount, Carmine Caridi', 'R', 'A worried artist tries to locate his wife who suddenly abandoned him only to discover that she led a secret life - or two. He proceeds to investigate her past and stirs up a hornet''s nest.', 'A worried artist tries to locate his wife who suddenly abandoned him only to discover that she led a secret life - or two. He proceeds to investigate her past and stirs up a hornet''s nest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RwE3VSfKj1ETE3GRuj7n1lZOCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91121'),
  ('553556886602732986', 'Femme Fatale', 2002, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Brian De Palma, Thierry Arbogast, Gil Kenny', 'Brian De Palma', 'Rebecca Romijn, Antonio Banderas, Peter Coyote, Ériq Ebouaney, Édouard Montoute, Rie Rasmussen, Thierry Frémont, Gregg Henry', 'R', 'A $10-million diamond rip-off, a stolen identity, a new life married to a diplomat. Laure Ash has risked big, won big. But then a tabloid shutterbug snaps her picture in Paris, and suddenly, enemies from Laure''s secret past know who and where she is. And they all want their share of the diamond heist. Or her life. Or both.', 'A $10-million diamond rip-off, a stolen identity, a new life married to a diplomat. Laure Ash has risked big, won big. But then a tabloid shutterbug snaps her picture in Paris, and suddenly, enemies from Laure''s secret past know who and where she is. And they all want their share of the diamond heist. Or her life. Or both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2OgxmZVbIsJxaLiYMjCSewsLty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9280'),
