  ('1037855137951515523', 'Femmes Fatales', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Claude Renoir, Bertrand Blier', 'Philippe Dumarçay, Bertrand Blier', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Jean Rochefort, Brigitte Fossey, Bernard Blier, Claude Piéplu, Gérard Jugnot, Sylvie Joly, Dominique Lavanant', null, 'Two men, fortyish, worn out by their wives, abandon everything to go and live in the back of beyond. There they meet a truculent priest, a boozer, Émile who recalls them to life''s simple pleasures. Calm is what they want. But soon their example inspires thousands of disorientated males...', 'Two men, fortyish, worn out by their wives, abandon everything to go and live in the back of beyond. There they meet a truculent priest, a boozer, Émile who recalls them to life''s simple pleasures. Calm is what they want. But soon their example inspires thousands of disorientated males...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOnd2yApKBVyjxchUjN1hG5E0kV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63481'),
