  ('680431281235806271', 'Ferdinand', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Carlos Saldanha, Renato Falcão, Ferris Webby', 'Tim Federle, Brad Copeland, Robert L. Baird', 'John Cena, Kate McKinnon, Anthony Anderson, Bobby Cannavale, Peyton Manning, Gina Rodriguez, Miguel Ángel Silvestre, David Tennant', 'PG', 'Ferdinand, a little bull, prefers sitting quietly under a cork tree just smelling the flowers versus jumping around, snorting, and butting heads with other bulls. As Ferdinand grows big and strong, his temperament remains mellow. But one day five men come to choose the "biggest, fastest, roughest bull" for the bullfights in Madrid— and Ferdinand is mistakenly chosen.', 'Ferdinand, a little bull, prefers sitting quietly under a cork tree just smelling the flowers versus jumping around, snorting, and butting heads with other bulls. As Ferdinand grows big and strong, his temperament remains mellow. But one day five men come to choose the "biggest, fastest, roughest bull" for the bullfights in Madrid— and Ferdinand is mistakenly chosen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMm94JsRfcOPiPVsTRcBiiVBOhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364689'),
  ('608768787980681052', 'Ferdinand I King of Naples', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Franciolini, Gianfranco Mingozzi, Franco Montemurro', 'Massimo Franciosa, Pasquale Festa Campanile', 'Peppino De Filippo, Eduardo De Filippo, Titina De Filippo, Vittorio De Sica, Aldo Fabrizi, Marcello Mastroianni, Leslie Phillips, Renato Rascel', null, 'The story of "King Lazzarone" Ferdinand I of Bourbon whose pastime was to neglect the government and disguise himself as a poor man and turn to the infamous city premises in search of love adventures. With the De Filippo brothers to complete.', 'The story of "King Lazzarone" Ferdinand I of Bourbon whose pastime was to neglect the government and disguise himself as a poor man and turn to the infamous city premises in search of love adventures. With the De Filippo brothers to complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wRP5Sh2CZwhtiPPA51JFd3HhFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58006'),
  ('837519706086021626', 'Ferdinand the Bull', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Dick Rickard, Ford Beebe', null, 'Milt Kahl, Don Wilson, Walt Disney', 'G', 'This Oscar-winning short tells of a bull who preferred to sit under trees and smell flowers to clashing horns with his fellow animals. As luck would have it, an untimely bee reveals Ferdinand''s ferocious side via pained howls and wild stomping. This lands him in the bull-fighting arena amidst characters based on Walt''s animators with a matador reportedly modeled after Walt himself.', 'This Oscar-winning short tells of a bull who preferred to sit under trees and smell flowers to clashing horns with his fellow animals. As luck would have it, an untimely bee reveals Ferdinand''s ferocious side via pained howls and wild stomping. This lands him in the bull-fighting arena amidst characters based on Walt''s animators with a matador reportedly modeled after Walt himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b39Ydh8pmHjRyUUURLoVOdNxz5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47166'),
  ('546675936942570067', 'Ferdinando and Carolina', 1999, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy, History', 'Lina Wertmüller, Blasco Giurato', 'Lina Wertmüller, Raffaele La Capria', 'Sergio Assisi, Gabriella Pession, Nicole Grimaudo, Adriano Pantaleo, Lola Pagnani, Carlo Caprioli, Moira Grassi, Vanessa Sabet', null, 'On his death bed in the 1820s, King Ferdinando I of Naples tries to escape the ghosts of his bloody kingship by remembering his younger days, when he was allowed to go hunting and have fun, and inventing love games. Then he was obliged to marry Mary Caroline of Austria, daughter of Empress Mary Theresa, in a political marriage: unexpectedly, they became happy lovers, until court power games divided them, and a different historical season arrived.', 'On his death bed in the 1820s, King Ferdinando I of Naples tries to escape the ghosts of his bloody kingship by remembering his younger days, when he was allowed to go hunting and have fun, and inventing love games. Then he was obliged to marry Mary Caroline of Austria, daughter of Empress Mary Theresa, in a political marriage: unexpectedly, they became happy lovers, until court power games divided them, and a different historical season arrived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2H1WChjwGaKo3gvcTfseJ50DNG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61208'),
  ('611331314623549633', 'Férias Trocadas', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Barreto, Carina Sanginitto, Deborah Engiel', 'Bia Crespo, Juliana Araripe, Dario Pato', 'Edmilson Filho, Carol Castro, Aline Campos, Klara Castanho, Matheus Costa, Flávia Garrafa, Gustavo Mendes, Raphael Viana', null, 'José Eduardo, known as Zé, owns a small football school and wins a trip with his wife and blogger daughter to Cartagena in a raffle. José Eduardo, known as Edu, is a successful businessman who is going on vacation with his wife and son. The confusion begins when, by mistake, Zé stays at Edu''s luxury hotel, which, in turn, ends up at Zé''s simple inn. This exchange provides experiences that the two families were not used to, but which ends up uniting them even more.', 'José Eduardo, known as Zé, owns a small football school and wins a trip with his wife and blogger daughter to Cartagena in a raffle. José Eduardo, known as Edu, is a successful businessman who is going on vacation with his wife and son. The confusion begins when, by mistake, Zé stays at Edu''s luxury hotel, which, in turn, ends up at Zé''s simple inn. This exchange provides experiences that the two families were not used to, but which ends up uniting them even more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8znpzvzcPSRJnpuJ1eB8BV0SX13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952022'),
  ('518726186003475109', 'Ferien auf Immenhof', 1957, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Hermann Leitner, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Per Schwenzen, Hermann Leitner', 'Angelika Meissner, Heidi Brühl, Paul Klinger, Margarete Haagen, Paul Henckels, Raidar Müller-Elmau, Matthias Fuchs, Christiane Jansen', null, 'The pony hotel has just been opened, but so far no guests have arrived. Dick gets Ralf to design a brochure about the hotel. The girls and Ethelbert then lead the village children on horseback to Lübeck, where they all distribute the brochure - not knowing that Dalli has added some embellishments to the text.', 'The pony hotel has just been opened, but so far no guests have arrived. Dick gets Ralf to design a brochure about the hotel. The girls and Ethelbert then lead the village children on horseback to Lübeck, where they all distribute the brochure - not knowing that Dalli has added some embellishments to the text.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYIAD8Q6BIS5K24wC8Iq5paseUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52618'),
  ('744684041530064788', 'Fermat''s Room', 2007, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Luis Piedrahita, Migue Amoedo, Rodrigo Sopeña', 'Luis Piedrahita, Rodrigo Sopeña', 'Lluís Homar, Santi Millán, Alejo Sauras, Federico Luppi, Elena Ballesteros, Helena Carrión, Núria Badia, Mar del Hoyo', 'NR', 'Four mathematicians are imprisoned in a shrinking room; with the walls closing in, they must try anything to escape this fatal puzzle.', 'Four mathematicians are imprisoned in a shrinking room; with the walls closing in, they must try anything to escape this fatal puzzle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQcYvPXxvk6bQDV9Zgd6cnDQmKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5595'),
