  ('359206394541835944', 'Fernandel the Dressmaker', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Jean Boyer', 'Gérard Carlier, Jean Boyer, Jean Manse', 'Fernandel, Suzy Delair, Fred Pasquali, Françoise Fabian, André Bervil, Gaston Orbal, Robert Pizani, Georges Chamarat', null, 'A modest taylor the women found irresistible inherit a Maison de couture in financial difficulty. Decided to save it he prepare a great collection. But when his wife discovered his relations with one of the mannequin, how would he prevent the scandale without loosing... both of them?!', 'A modest taylor the women found irresistible inherit a Maison de couture in financial difficulty. Decided to save it he prepare a great collection. But when his wife discovered his relations with one of the mannequin, how would he prevent the scandale without loosing... both of them?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wp1rIptdpeRLD0tQYPDxinzjVBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79442'),
  ('559895332429064339', 'Fernando Torres: The Last Symbol', 2020, 'Documentary', 'José F. Ortuño, Laura Alvea, César Pérez', null, 'Fernando Torres, José Mourinho, Steven Gerrard, Andrés Iniesta, Petr Čech, Rafael Benítez, Vicente del Bosque', null, 'A look at the life and career of Spanish football star Fernando Torres.', 'A look at the life and career of Spanish football star Fernando Torres.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qkRIgA2ifAMBLVGEsHizggLK68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744470'),
  ('318955699063697719', 'FernGully 2: The Magical Rescue', 1998, 'Animation, Family', 'Dave Marshall, Phil Robinson', 'Chris Fink, Richard Tulloch', 'Laura Erlich, Digory Oaks, Erik Bergmann, Connie Champagne, Holly Conner, Harry Joseph, Gary Martin, Matt K. Miller', 'G', 'Pips wants to see more of the outside world. Batty arrives in a panic, announcing that two human poachers are right behind him. Poachers show up with their dogs and promptly capture the three baby animals. Pips and the Beetle Boys volunteer to follow the humans to town and rescue the babies, convincing Batty to be their guide.', 'Pips wants to see more of the outside world. Batty arrives in a panic, announcing that two human poachers are right behind him. Poachers show up with their dogs and promptly capture the three baby animals. Pips and the Beetle Boys volunteer to follow the humans to town and rescue the babies, convincing Batty to be their guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kOGXTvR5BFcyWD35MDXFisVhqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18948'),
  ('139315937536066581', 'FernGully: The Last Rainforest', 1992, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Bill Kroyer, Tony Fucile', 'Jim Cox', 'Samantha Mathis, Jonathan Ward, Christian Slater, Robin Williams, Tim Curry, Grace Zabriskie, Douglas Seale, Geoffrey Blake', 'G', 'When a sprite named Crysta shrinks a human boy, Zak, down to her size, he vows to help the magical fairy folk stop a greedy logging company from destroying their home: the pristine rainforest known as FernGully. Zak and his new friends fight to defend FernGully from lumberjacks — and the vengeful spirit they accidentally unleash after chopping down a magic tree.', 'When a sprite named Crysta shrinks a human boy, Zak, down to her size, he vows to help the magical fairy folk stop a greedy logging company from destroying their home: the pristine rainforest known as FernGully. Zak and his new friends fight to defend FernGully from lumberjacks — and the vengeful spirit they accidentally unleash after chopping down a magic tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Z4XMgqIY6yT6QpoBISIlHzh8ol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13225'),
  ('1067547469865317135', 'Ferocious Planet', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Billy O''Brien', 'Douglas G. Davis', 'Joe Flanigan, John Rhys-Davies, Kevin Flood, Catherine Walker, Dagmar Döring, Michael Yare, Chris Newman, Sam O''Mahony', 'NR', 'A groundbreaking device is designed to glimpse alternate universes. But when the machine malfunctions and transports a group of observers into a nightmarish dimension of alien terrors, the travelers must use ingenuity to survive.', 'A groundbreaking device is designed to glimpse alternate universes. But when the machine malfunctions and transports a group of observers into a nightmarish dimension of alien terrors, the travelers must use ingenuity to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwWF8T3c8aB7lASHzWJINeNdU8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61341'),
  ('860397496275689646', 'Ferocious Wolf', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gustavo Hernández', 'Aharon Keshales, Navot Papushado', 'Adriana Ugarte, Javier Gutiérrez, Rubén Ochandiano, Juana Acosta, Manuel Vega, Antonio Dechent, Luna Fulgencio, Fernando Tejero', null, 'A detective on trail of a suspected child killer, was arrested for the crime, but was allowed to walk free after a clerical error. The detective enlists the mother of the murdered child to exact a justice the legal system can''t provide.', 'A detective on trail of a suspected child killer, was arrested for the crime, but was allowed to walk free after a clerical error. The detective enlists the mother of the murdered child to exact a justice the legal system can''t provide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRPfJu2ZGLMlMY4IosUs2EDSBDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800085'),
  ('214733243995408358', 'Ferozz: The Wild Red Riding Hood', 2010, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Jorge Molina, Yanelvis González', 'Edgar Soberón Torchia, Alaín Jiménez, Jorge Molina', 'Roberto Perdomo, Dayana Legrá, Ana Silvia Machado, Francisco Garcia, Raul Capote', null, 'A young, attractive widow is protected from her vicious mother-in-law, by a male relative who practices Satanism, and lusts after the old woman''s sexy adolescent granddaughter.', 'A young, attractive widow is protected from her vicious mother-in-law, by a male relative who practices Satanism, and lusts after the old woman''s sexy adolescent granddaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x874eSbyd0ckuhw0eCW5D35Va0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82076'),
  ('969440611074567377', 'Ferrari', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller, Family, TV Movie', 'Carlo Carlei', 'Massimo De Rita, Carlo Carlei, Mario Falcone', 'Sergio Castellitto, Ed Stoppard, Cristina Moglia, Jessica Brooks, Mathew Bose, Pierfrancesco Favino, Vincent Schiavelli, Gabriella Pession', null, 'Story of Enzo Ferrari''s rise from a successful race driver to one of the most famous entrepreneurs of all time. Being interviewed by a fictitious, intrusive young journalist he recalls his setbacks and personal losses.', 'Story of Enzo Ferrari''s rise from a successful race driver to one of the most famous entrepreneurs of all time. Being interviewed by a fictitious, intrusive young journalist he recalls his setbacks and personal losses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dFxWdl2dX4Ma1H3oHQWN1GpETB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15475'),
  ('437067473347284714', 'Ferrari', 2023, 'History, Drama', 'Emyr Glyn Rees, Luigi Spoletini, Peter Thorell', 'Troy Kennedy Martin', 'Adam Driver, Penélope Cruz, Shailene Woodley, Gabriel Leone, Sarah Gadon, Jack O''Connell, Patrick Dempsey, Giuseppe Festinese', 'R', 'Set during the summer of 1957. Ex-racecar driver, Enzo Ferrari, is in crisis. Bankruptcy stalks the company he and his wife, Laura, built from nothing ten years earlier. Their tempestuous marriage struggles with the mourning for one son and the acknowledgement of another.', 'Set during the summer of 1957. Ex-racecar driver, Enzo Ferrari, is in crisis. Bankruptcy stalks the company he and his wife, Laura, built from nothing ten years earlier. Their tempestuous marriage struggles with the mourning for one son and the acknowledgement of another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LyCOcGqOTyTmaXu2TK8LfGveIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365620'),
  ('1024936980239197448', 'Ferrari 312B', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Andrea Marini, Emanuele Zarlenga, Philip Abussi', null, 'Paolo Barilla, Mario Forghieri, Niki Lauda, Jackie Stewart, Jacky Ickx, Bob Constanduros, Nigel Roebuck, Damon Hill', null, 'In a race against time and all odds, the revolutionary F1 racing car Ferrari 312B will get back on the Monaco circuit, 46 years later, under the wing of it’s creator, the genius engineer Mauro Forghieri.', 'In a race against time and all odds, the revolutionary F1 racing car Ferrari 312B will get back on the Monaco circuit, 46 years later, under the wing of it’s creator, the genius engineer Mauro Forghieri.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teTJtuIArAMPdGO5ValaZuOOezV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480432'),
  ('285823902524241047', 'Ferrari Ki Sawaari', 2012, 'Family, Comedy', 'Rajesh Mapuskar', 'Rajesh Mapuskar, Vidhu Vinod Chopra', 'Sharman Joshi, Ritwik Sahore, Boman Irani, Paresh Rawal, Seema Pahwa, Deepak Shirke, Satyadeep Misra, Achyut Potdar', null, 'A little boy thinks of nothing but cricket. His father, Rusy, thinks of nothing but his little boy. To fulfill his sons dream of playing at Lords cricket ground, the honest and upright Rusy takes a reckless step. He borrows a gleaming red Ferrari. Just for one hour. The only trouble-- he doesnt inform the cars legendary owner. A wild, breathless, bumpy ride begins. A naive Rusy must dodge bullets and bouncers for one unforgettable night, and play the role of a perfect father. Can he do it? Ferrari Ki Sawaari is a fun-filled story of small guys and their big dreams and how these dreams turn into a mad comedy of errors. Fasten your seatbelts. The joyride awaits', 'A little boy thinks of nothing but cricket. His father, Rusy, thinks of nothing but his little boy. To fulfill his sons dream of playing at Lords cricket ground, the honest and upright Rusy takes a reckless step. He borrows a gleaming red Ferrari. Just for one hour. The only trouble-- he doesnt inform the cars legendary owner. A wild, breathless, bumpy ride begins. A naive Rusy must dodge bullets and bouncers for one unforgettable night, and play the role of a perfect father. Can he do it? Ferrari Ki Sawaari is a fun-filled story of small guys and their big dreams and how these dreams turn into a mad comedy of errors. Fasten your seatbelts. The joyride awaits', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htmR4Id9iS0p7CIpLUKRlslwoZ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118032'),
  ('519962428260698098', 'Ferrari, Tsamere, Lecaplain : La Tournée du Trio', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Julien Faustino, Arnaud Tsamere, Baptiste Lecaplain', null, 'Jérémy Ferrari, Arnaud Tsamere, Baptiste Lecaplain', null, 'My name is Arnaud. I’m going to perform in the Trio show with Baptiste and Jérémy. I’ve been tasked with writing the pitch for the show. As I write these lines, I have no idea what it’s going to be. But roughly, here’s how it’ll go: we’re going to write a show, and it probably won’t go as planned because of one person. Apparently, me. Thanks to my vast experience, I’ll save the evening. Baptiste will follow me blindly because he loves me. Jérémy will yell at me. Because he’s an idiot. But one thing’s for sure: you’re going to laugh a lot. And so will we.', 'My name is Arnaud. I’m going to perform in the Trio show with Baptiste and Jérémy. I’ve been tasked with writing the pitch for the show. As I write these lines, I have no idea what it’s going to be. But roughly, here’s how it’ll go: we’re going to write a show, and it probably won’t go as planned because of one person. Apparently, me. Thanks to my vast experience, I’ll save the evening. Baptiste will follow me blindly because he loves me. Jérémy will yell at me. Because he’s an idiot. But one thing’s for sure: you’re going to laugh a lot. And so will we.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEgUyQW4wO3sqDz9rZoWCPemIjj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1433379'),
  ('655224959097261928', 'Ferrari: Race to Immortality', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Daryl Goodrich, David Meadows, Matt Lawson', 'Rupert Bush', 'Mike Hawthorn, Peter Collins, Enzo Ferrari, Stirling Moss, Tony Brooks, Doug Nye, Richard Williams, Nigel Roebuck', null, 'The late 1950s were known as golden years in the world of motor racing, champions were made and lost on a Sunday, and no losses were greater than those of Enzo Ferrari’s Scuderia. Based on Chris Nixon’s bestselling biography Mon Ami Mate, Ferrari: Race to Immortality tells the story of the loves and losses, triumphs and tragedy of a turbulent era that shook the motor racing world.', 'The late 1950s were known as golden years in the world of motor racing, champions were made and lost on a Sunday, and no losses were greater than those of Enzo Ferrari’s Scuderia. Based on Chris Nixon’s bestselling biography Mon Ami Mate, Ferrari: Race to Immortality tells the story of the loves and losses, triumphs and tragedy of a turbulent era that shook the motor racing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkN67j8e6fszSuRL7XuNMTY0oeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476275'),
  ('891403521061617567', 'Ferris Bueller''s Day Off', 1986, 'Comedy', 'John Hughes, Tak Fujimoto, George Kohut', 'John Hughes', 'Matthew Broderick, Alan Ruck, Mia Sara, Jeffrey Jones, Jennifer Grey, Cindy Pickett, Lyman Ward, Edie McClurg', 'PG-13', 'After high school slacker Ferris Bueller successfully fakes an illness in order to skip school for the day, he goes on a series of adventures throughout Chicago with his girlfriend Sloane and best friend Cameron, all the while trying to outwit his wily school principal and fed-up sister.', 'After high school slacker Ferris Bueller successfully fakes an illness in order to skip school for the day, he goes on a series of adventures throughout Chicago with his girlfriend Sloane and best friend Cameron, all the while trying to outwit his wily school principal and fed-up sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LTQNCvoLsKXP0LtaKAaYVtRaQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9377'),
  ('990916430052207979', 'Ferro', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Beppe Tufarulo', 'Beppe Tufarulo, Federico Giunta', 'Tiziano Ferro, Victor Allen, Fabrizio Giannini, Bianca Balti, Brigitte Nielsen, Amadeus, Massimo Ranieri, Fabio Fazio', null, 'One of the most famous Italian singers opens up about his music and his journey through love and addiction.', 'One of the most famous Italian singers opens up about his music and his journey through love and addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shnhyqAbfH7OY6SQBKKPDu1PI79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759024'),
  ('363375227798078955', 'Ferry', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Wouter Boels, Menno Mans, Cecilia Verheyden', 'Bart Uytdenhouwen, Nico Moolenaar', 'Frank Lammers, Elise Schaap, Huub Stapel, Monic Hendrickx, Raymond Thiry, Maarten Heijmans, Yannick van de Velde, Olaf Ait Tami', 'R', 'Before he built a drug empire, Ferry Bouman returns to his hometown on a revenge mission that finds his loyalty tested — and a love that alters his life.', 'Before he built a drug empire, Ferry Bouman returns to his hometown on a revenge mission that finds his loyalty tested — and a love that alters his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT0CbPtySSNLNh6MvFkq3xwbRBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717192'),
  ('1019177995883319761', 'Ferry 2', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Wannes Destoop, Dries Delputte, Jeff Theys', 'Tibbe van Hoof, Geerard Van de Walle', 'Frank Lammers, Aiko Beemsterboer, Tobias Kersloot, Marouane Meftah, Hamza Othman, Huub Smit, Jonas Smulders, Tom Wijkamp', 'R', 'After losing his drug empire, Ferry Bouman has found a measure of peace away from Brabant''s criminal underworld — until his past catches up to him.', 'After losing his drug empire, Ferry Bouman has found a measure of peace away from Brabant''s criminal underworld — until his past catches up to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pwdnL3pEISIN1EGmwZzU6hpNVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276945'),
  ('858500030992710836', 'Ferry to Hong Kong', 1959, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Lewis Gilbert, Otto Heller, Bert Batt', 'Vernon Harris, Lewis Gilbert', 'Curd Jürgens, Orson Welles, Sylvia Syms, Jeremy Spenser, Noel Purcell, Margaret Withers, Roy Chiao, Milton Reid', null, 'Mark Conrad, a habitual drunk and troublemaker with a shady past, is expelled by Hong Kong police after one too many bar fights. He''s sent to Macao on the Fa Tsan, a ferry owned by Captain Hart. Conrad''s papers are out of order and Macao refuses him entry. Unable to go ashore, Conrad is a permanent passenger on the ferry with Hart, who detests him. It''s all one long, lazy voyage for Conrad until one fateful trip when an encounter with a typhoon and pirates forces Conrad to choose between an aimless drifter''s life and becoming a man again.', 'Mark Conrad, a habitual drunk and troublemaker with a shady past, is expelled by Hong Kong police after one too many bar fights. He''s sent to Macao on the Fa Tsan, a ferry owned by Captain Hart. Conrad''s papers are out of order and Macao refuses him entry. Unable to go ashore, Conrad is a permanent passenger on the ferry with Hart, who detests him. It''s all one long, lazy voyage for Conrad until one fateful trip when an encounter with a typhoon and pirates forces Conrad to choose between an aimless drifter''s life and becoming a man again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/542JgNzHAQoE6wV0xEb2t1KNFRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85800'),
  ('675009811077138641', 'Fertile Ground', 2011, 'Horror', 'Adam Gierasch, Yaron Levy, Armando Salas', 'Jace Anderson, Adam Gierasch', 'Leisha Hailey, Gale Harold, Jami Bassman , Stephanie Brown, Kailah Combs, Ingrid Coree, James Stordahl, Douglas Roberts', 'R', 'Emily and Nate Weaver leave the city for the rural comfort of Nate’s ancestral home in the country. Once there, Emily is plagued by horrifying visions and haunted by the ghosts inhabiting their isolated new home. When Nate’s behavior undergoes a strange and fearful metamorphosis, Emily fears she might be the latest target in a murderous tradition.', 'Emily and Nate Weaver leave the city for the rural comfort of Nate’s ancestral home in the country. Once there, Emily is plagued by horrifying visions and haunted by the ghosts inhabiting their isolated new home. When Nate’s behavior undergoes a strange and fearful metamorphosis, Emily fears she might be the latest target in a murderous tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLSdXiveFrrUjCedujTl5NBxqDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64853'),
  ('53586640015194866', 'Festival', 1967, 'Documentary, Music', 'Murray Lerner, Francis Grumman, Murray Lerner', 'Murray Lerner', 'Horton Barker, Fiddler Beers, Theodore Bikel, Pete Seeger, Bob Dylan, Howlin'' Wolf, Donovan, Johnny Cash', null, 'Black and white footage of performances, interviews, and conversations at the Newport Folk Festival, from 1963 to 1966. The headliners are Peter, Paul and Mary, Joan Baez, Pete Seeger, and Bob Dylan, who''s acoustic and electric. Son House and Mike Bloomfield talk about the blues; John Hurt, Howlin'' Wolf, and Sonny Terry and Brownie McGhee show its range. The Osborne Brothers perform bluegrass. Donovan, Johnny Cash, Judy Collins, Mimi and Dick Farina, and others less well known also perform. Several talk musical philosophy, and there''s a running commentary about the nature and appeal of folk music. The crowd looks clean cut.', 'Black and white footage of performances, interviews, and conversations at the Newport Folk Festival, from 1963 to 1966. The headliners are Peter, Paul and Mary, Joan Baez, Pete Seeger, and Bob Dylan, who''s acoustic and electric. Son House and Mike Bloomfield talk about the blues; John Hurt, Howlin'' Wolf, and Sonny Terry and Brownie McGhee show its range. The Osborne Brothers perform bluegrass. Donovan, Johnny Cash, Judy Collins, Mimi and Dick Farina, and others less well known also perform. Several talk musical philosophy, and there''s a running commentary about the nature and appeal of folk music. The crowd looks clean cut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opVOkaGWfZqbEt5m6AlVMTtvNVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16247'),
  ('954292940392535671', 'Festival', 1996, 'Drama', 'Pupi Avati, Kika Ungaro, Giovanni Amadei', 'Pupi Avati, Antonio Avati, Nino Marino', 'Massimo Boldi, Gianni Cavina, Massimo Bonetti, Irene Grazioli, Paola Quattrini, Cinzia Monreale, Lorenzo Flaherty, Margaret Mazzantini', null, 'The annual film festival in Venice is, of course, an ideal place to make a film (how come no-one has thought of it before). Everything is there in Pupi Avati''s Festival: the famous hotels Des Bain and Excelsior on the Lido, the shimmering sandy beach which captivated Visconti. The film was made last spring and exploits the presence of passing film stars such as Jack Nicholson. We see the hysterical press conferences, where journalists and experts ask intelligent questions-without listening to the answers.', 'The annual film festival in Venice is, of course, an ideal place to make a film (how come no-one has thought of it before). Everything is there in Pupi Avati''s Festival: the famous hotels Des Bain and Excelsior on the Lido, the shimmering sandy beach which captivated Visconti. The film was made last spring and exploits the presence of passing film stars such as Jack Nicholson. We see the hysterical press conferences, where journalists and experts ask intelligent questions-without listening to the answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkwsZhW9dNFZJyMwsEiadEFgO17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225617'),
  ('5806948206623495', 'Festival At The Poolroom', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Boaz Davidson, David Gurfinkel', 'Eli Tavor, Uri Dan', 'Yehuda Barkan, Ze''ev Revach, Nitza Shaul, Tuvia Tzafir, Yosef Shiloach, Arieh Elias', null, 'The story is about two twin brothers, Azriel and Gavriel. Azriel is a shy, religious Jew who works in a fruit shop in Jaffa. Gavriel is a hoodlum and a good-for-nothing hustler who runs a snooker bar. Gavriel and his friend Hanuka make easy money by swindling people into gambling on snooker games. One day Gavriel is forced to renew contact with his brother because he is in trouble with a gangster.', 'The story is about two twin brothers, Azriel and Gavriel. Azriel is a shy, religious Jew who works in a fruit shop in Jaffa. Gavriel is a hoodlum and a good-for-nothing hustler who runs a snooker bar. Gavriel and his friend Hanuka make easy money by swindling people into gambling on snooker games. One day Gavriel is forced to renew contact with his brother because he is in trouble with a gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHFZHqzUbiltlGQBbwmfTuE0HlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13520'),
  ('700375703614000401', 'Festival Express', 2003, 'Documentary, History, Music', 'Bob Smeaton, Frank Cvitanovich', null, 'Rick Danko, Levon Helm, Garth Hudson, Richard Manuel, Robbie Robertson, Janis Joplin, Jon Bauman, Richard Bell', null, 'The filmed account of a large Canadian rock festival train tour boasting major acts. In the summer of 1970, a chartered train crossed Canada carrying some of the world''s greatest rock bands. The Grateful Dead, Janis Joplin, The Band, Buddy Guy, and others lived (and partied) together for five days, stopping in major cities along the way to play live concerts. Their journey was filmed.', 'The filmed account of a large Canadian rock festival train tour boasting major acts. In the summer of 1970, a chartered train crossed Canada carrying some of the world''s greatest rock bands. The Grateful Dead, Janis Joplin, The Band, Buddy Guy, and others lived (and partied) together for five days, stopping in major cities along the way to play live concerts. Their journey was filmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ehULJQMNCdASy2i7jaTbcIvQKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14770'),
  ('467440108865123223', 'Fetch', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Derek Drymon, Robert Porter, Larry Leichliter', 'Andy Rheingold, Dean Stefan', 'Jim Cummings, Tom Kenny, Carlos Alazraqui, Billy West, Maria Bamford', 'G', 'Cat wins a radio contest, and attempts to answer the phone as Dog chases down his tennis ball.', 'Cat wins a radio contest, and attempts to answer the phone as Dog chases down his tennis ball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XdnP5FUu2VT7C2bUD0XbXtUmuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543588'),
  ('1111373191770031672', 'Fetching Cody', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'David Ray, Paul Mitchnick, Collin Leadlay', 'David Ray', 'Jay Baruchel, Sarah Lind, Jim Byrnes, Lucas Blaney, Neil Denis, Liam McGuigan, Robert Kaiser, Chilton Crane', null, 'Art, a drug-addicted dealer and hustler, arrives at his girlfriend Cody''s apartment to find that she has overdosed on heroin. He tries to fix things by traveling back in time in an attempt to prevent her death.', 'Art, a drug-addicted dealer and hustler, arrives at his girlfriend Cody''s apartment to find that she has overdosed on heroin. He tries to fix things by traveling back in time in an attempt to prevent her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7vuoA0vIldc9t48CRwougpidoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46729'),
  ('158740304917347452', 'Fête de Paris 1899: Concours d''automobiles fleuries (départ)', 1899, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Carriages travel down the Champs Elysée.', 'Carriages travel down the Champs Elysée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smPtEbugJvvYUfGeWB17VlTBwqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262860'),
  ('735770882097391528', 'Fetishes', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Nick Broomfield, Christophe Lanzenberg, Robert Levi', 'Nick Broomfield', 'Mistress Beatrice, Nick Broomfield, Mistress Catherine, Mistress Delilah, Mistress Natasha, Mistress Raven, Elissa Wald', null, 'Nick Broomfield and a documentary crew visit Pandora''s Box, an up-scale house of bondage on Manhattan''s Fifth Avenue, where clients pay $175 an hour to be subservient to mistresses. Mistresses talk about their craft; a few clients, usually masked, are interviewed as well. Then, the camera watches sessions organized around fetishes: rubber, wrestling, corporal punishment, masochism, and infantilism. Mistress Raven, the owner of Pandora''s Box, explains that pain need not be part of the subservient experience: it is, at its root, a transfer of power. After their session has ended, clients talk about how drained, relaxed, relieved, and at peace they are.', 'Nick Broomfield and a documentary crew visit Pandora''s Box, an up-scale house of bondage on Manhattan''s Fifth Avenue, where clients pay $175 an hour to be subservient to mistresses. Mistresses talk about their craft; a few clients, usually masked, are interviewed as well. Then, the camera watches sessions organized around fetishes: rubber, wrestling, corporal punishment, masochism, and infantilism. Mistress Raven, the owner of Pandora''s Box, explains that pain need not be part of the subservient experience: it is, at its root, a transfer of power. After their session has ended, clients talk about how drained, relaxed, relieved, and at peace they are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRi154VzQjVPdHlhZaq4rnnMfTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63054'),
  ('657101671168308134', 'Feuer, Eis & Dosenbier', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Matthias Dinter, Stephan Schuh', 'Matthias Dinter, Martin Ritzenhoff', 'Rick Kavanian, Axel Stein, Eva Habermann, Christoph M. Ohrt, Jonas Gruber, Andreas Elsholz, Herbert Fux, Thorsten Feller', null, 'Two friends who are doing civil service flee to the Austrian Alps to escape being forced into the army. While there, one of them rediscovers his past and they realise that it''s going to be more fun than they thought.', 'Two friends who are doing civil service flee to the Austrian Alps to escape being forced into the army. While there, one of them rediscovers his past and they realise that it''s going to be more fun than they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p29vqeWk9aEDBxMPP8rDsry8h84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9274'),
  ('219684668696520190', 'Fever', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alex Winter, Joe DeSalvo', 'Alex Winter', 'Henry Thomas, Teri Hatcher, David O''Hara, Bill Duke, Irma St. Paule, Marisol Padilla Sánchez, Patricia Dunnock, Helen Hanft', null, 'A struggling artist is implicated in a string of macabre murders.', 'A struggling artist is implicated in a string of macabre murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hCTCslXzFpQkMQ9LT2PJUjG7fm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121091'),
  ('936316750825207990', 'Fever Dream', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Claudia Llosa, Óscar Faura', 'Claudia Llosa, Samanta Schweblin', 'María Valverde, Guillermo Pfening, Dolores Fonzi, Germán Palacios, Emilio Vodanovich, Guillermina Sorribes Liotta, Marcelo Michinaux', 'R', 'A woman named Amanda lies stricken, far from home. A young boy named David questions her, trying to make her remember. She''s not his mother, he''s not her son. As her time is running out, he helps her unravel a powerful, haunting story of obsessive jealousy, an invisible danger, and the power of a mother''s love for her child.', 'A woman named Amanda lies stricken, far from home. A young boy named David questions her, trying to make her remember. She''s not his mother, he''s not her son. As her time is running out, he helps her unravel a powerful, haunting story of obsessive jealousy, an invisible danger, and the power of a mother''s love for her child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8aR3usDzjSCeJ78ttHxNDCaEhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595280'),
  ('1118828191550396734', 'Fever Lake', 1997, 'Horror', 'Ralph E. Portillo, Keith Holland', 'Michael Edwards', 'Corey Haim, Bo Hopkins, Mario López, Randy Josselyn, Lauren Parker, Michael Wise, Mary-Rachel Foot, Mathea Webb', 'R', 'A group of teenagers drives to "Fever Lake" to spend the weekend in a cursed house near the lake despite warnings from the locals.', 'A group of teenagers drives to "Fever Lake" to spend the weekend in a cursed house near the lake despite warnings from the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qTOtl10AUwA3BIsjWmnKJrrqQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135482'),
  ('501261428575742293', 'Fever Mounts at El Pao', 1959, 'Drama', 'Luis Buñuel, Gabriel Figueroa, Juan Luis Buñuel', 'Luis Buñuel, Charles Dorat, Louis Sapin', 'María Félix, Gérard Philipe, Jean Servais, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Raúl Dantés, Domingo Soler, Víctor Junco, Roberto Cañedo', null, 'After Caribbean despot Mariano Vargas is murdered at the hands of his enraged populace, his secretary Ramón Vázquez takes not just control but also Vargas'' widow Inés, with whom he''s been having an affair. Special military unit leader Alejandro Gual arrives to overthrow Vázquez by turning the people and Inés against him.', 'After Caribbean despot Mariano Vargas is murdered at the hands of his enraged populace, his secretary Ramón Vázquez takes not just control but also Vargas'' widow Inés, with whom he''s been having an affair. Special military unit leader Alejandro Gual arrives to overthrow Vázquez by turning the people and Inés against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrlQzUGzi1FfMB6sh0p0H1ZYgsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48863'),
  ('253995816892379305', 'Fever Pitch', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Seager, David Evans, Mick Ward', 'Nick Hornby', 'Colin Firth, Ruth Gemmell, Mark Strong, Holly Aird, Ken Stott, Stephen Rea, Neil Pearson, Lorraine Ashbourne', null, 'A romantic comedy about a man, a woman and a football team. Based on Nick Hornby''s best selling autobiographical novel, Fever Pitch. English teacher Paul Ashworth believes his long standing obsession with Arsenal serves him well. But then he meets Sarah. Their relationship develops in tandem with Arsenal''s roller coaster fortunes in the football league, both leading to a nail biting climax.', 'A romantic comedy about a man, a woman and a football team. Based on Nick Hornby''s best selling autobiographical novel, Fever Pitch. English teacher Paul Ashworth believes his long standing obsession with Arsenal serves him well. But then he meets Sarah. Their relationship develops in tandem with Arsenal''s roller coaster fortunes in the football league, both leading to a nail biting climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTpZGWVo5DDk1oQUrUJcRjqGzGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1610'),
  ('337170249254161220', 'Fever Pitch', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bobby Farrelly, Peter Farrelly, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'Lowell Ganz, Babaloo Mandel', 'Drew Barrymore, Jimmy Fallon, Jason Spevack, Jack Kehler, Maureen Keiller, Daniel Greene, Ione Skye, Marissa Jaret Winokur', 'PG-13', 'When Ben Wrightman, a young teacher, begins dating pretty businesswoman Lindsey Meeks, the two don''t seem to have a lot of the same interests, but they fall in love, regardless. Their romance goes well until baseball season begins, and Lindsey soon realizes that Ben is completely obsessed with the Boston Red Sox. Though she tries to understand Ben''s passionate team loyalty, eventually it threatens to end their otherwise happy relationship.', 'When Ben Wrightman, a young teacher, begins dating pretty businesswoman Lindsey Meeks, the two don''t seem to have a lot of the same interests, but they fall in love, regardless. Their romance goes well until baseball season begins, and Lindsey soon realizes that Ben is completely obsessed with the Boston Red Sox. Though she tries to understand Ben''s passionate team loyalty, eventually it threatens to end their otherwise happy relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwJBEOM5BVElAgQIA82KBLX10fu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11431'),
  ('1057361437060172670', 'Fevers', 2014, 'Drama, Family', 'Hicham Ayouch', 'Hicham Ayouch, Hafed Benotman, Aicha Yacoubi', 'Didier Michon, Slimane Dazi, Farida Amrouche, Emilia Derou-Bernal, Lounès Tazairt, Tony Harrisson, Pascal Elso, Mohamed Aroussi', null, 'Benjamin is at war: with life, with adults, with himself. From his earliest childhood onwards, the 13-year old has been shunted from one care home to another. When his mother has to go to prison, he is sent to his father, whom he has never known. The man turns out to be a dead loss, a warehouseman who''s given up on life, a man in his mid-40s who still lives with his Moroccan parents in a high-rise block in the banlieue. Benjamin''s turbulence and violence soon prove too much for his new family.', 'Benjamin is at war: with life, with adults, with himself. From his earliest childhood onwards, the 13-year old has been shunted from one care home to another. When his mother has to go to prison, he is sent to his father, whom he has never known. The man turns out to be a dead loss, a warehouseman who''s given up on life, a man in his mid-40s who still lives with his Moroccan parents in a high-rise block in the banlieue. Benjamin''s turbulence and violence soon prove too much for his new family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2L4obz0E34b5iuNNt2JVRPbJc68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295800'),
  ('745359097959897902', 'Few of Us', 1996, 'Drama', 'Šarūnas Bartas, Šarūnas Bartas', 'Šarūnas Bartas', 'Yekaterina Golubeva, Piotr Kishteev, Sergei Tulayev, Yulia Inozemtseva, Evgeniy Morozov', null, 'A slow, dialogue-free film about a woman''s journey in Siberia.', 'A slow, dialogue-free film about a woman''s journey in Siberia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rE0WYvn0z26PqesgJfOYBWYoJrl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138522'),
  ('331351520591987468', 'Feyzo, The Polite One', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Fethi Erdoğan, Sami Güçlü', 'İhsan Yüce', 'Kemal Sunal, Şener Şen, İlyas Salman, Adile Naşit, Müjde Ar, Erdal Özyağcılar, İhsan Yüce, Reşit Çıldam', null, 'To bid for his beloved''s hand in marriage, poor villager Feyzo must come up with an enormous dowry to appease her father.', 'To bid for his beloved''s hand in marriage, poor villager Feyzo must come up with an enormous dowry to appease her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KLKLTfCnncYVqeJFLI7cNOXY6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27211'),
  ('238644926807267278', 'FF.SS. cioè ''...che mi hai portato a fare sopra a Posillipo se non mi vuoi più bene?''', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Renzo Arbore', 'Luciano De Crescenzo', 'Renzo Arbore, Luciano De Crescenzo, Pietra Montecorvino, Roberto Benigni, Andy Luotto, Gigi Proietti, Isaac George, Teodoro Ricci', null, 'Based on a supposed screenplay by Fellini that fell out of a window, Arbore tells the southern story of a shaggy-haired Neapolitan girl, a toilet attendant, who arrives in the foggy north to become a singer, and whom he becomes her boorish manager.', 'Based on a supposed screenplay by Fellini that fell out of a window, Arbore tells the southern story of a shaggy-haired Neapolitan girl, a toilet attendant, who arrives in the foggy north to become a singer, and whom he becomes her boorish manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6oT09vKGLxcKLk9UyIUg3XyNvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62585'),
  ('470773146878103375', 'Fiancés on the Bridge', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Agnès Varda, Jean Rabier', 'Agnès Varda', 'Anna Karina, Jean-Luc Godard, Emilienne Caille, Eddie Constantine, Sami Frey, Georges de Beauregard, Danièle Delorme, Yves Robert', null, 'A subtitle warns, "beware of dark sunglasses." Anna and her lover, whose looks in bowler and bow tie are reminiscent of a young Buster Keaton, kiss chastely on a bridge overlooking the Seine. He dons sunglasses and waves as she runs down a stairway to the river''s edge, then watches in horror as she''s knocked flat and loaded into the back of a hearse. In vain, he gives chase. Disconsolate, he buys a large funeral wreath and a handkerchief from sympathetic vendors. He removes the glasses to wipe his eyes and realizes they are the cause of all his woe. He replays the farewell without the glasses.', 'A subtitle warns, "beware of dark sunglasses." Anna and her lover, whose looks in bowler and bow tie are reminiscent of a young Buster Keaton, kiss chastely on a bridge overlooking the Seine. He dons sunglasses and waves as she runs down a stairway to the river''s edge, then watches in horror as she''s knocked flat and loaded into the back of a hearse. In vain, he gives chase. Disconsolate, he buys a large funeral wreath and a handkerchief from sympathetic vendors. He removes the glasses to wipe his eyes and realizes they are the cause of all his woe. He replays the farewell without the glasses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxz3xHtDoV5K4UJA5x8HNnSTtN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54464'),
  ('913667357435774744', 'Fiasco in Milan', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Nanni Loy, Roberto Gerardi, Vana Caruso', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Nanni Loy', 'Vittorio Gassman, Renato Salvatori, Claudia Cardinale, Nino Manfredi, Vicky Ludovisi, Riccardo Garrone, Tiberio Murgia, Carlo Pisacane', null, 'The usual gang of robbers are hired by a thief from Milan to steal a suitcase full of money, but troubles will hinder the success of the operation.', 'The usual gang of robbers are hired by a thief from Milan to steal a suitcase full of money, but troubles will hinder the success of the operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gV2LHaPsO2CySurC7vmLyBRjbcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62036'),
  ('484392787475845424', 'Fib the Truth', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Olga Akatyeva, Anton Zenkovich', 'Viktoriya Ostrovskaya, Dmitry Magonov, Nelly Vysotskaya', 'Darya Melnikova, Evgeny Romantsov, Pavel Priluchnyy, Elizaveta Kononova, Aleksandr Oblasov, Grigory Vernik', null, 'A couple in love spends time away from civilization, but the sudden arrivals of the younger sister and then the girl''s ex-boyfriend violate the country idyll.', 'A couple in love spends time away from civilization, but the sudden arrivals of the younger sister and then the girl''s ex-boyfriend violate the country idyll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPUI4KHQKggOdJg9YIBCFEecuU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773543'),
  ('132806843821018593', 'Fida', 2004, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Ken Ghosh, Amit Roy', 'Sunny Mahajan, Lalit Marathe', 'Kareena Kapoor Khan, Shahid Kapoor, Fardeen Khan, Kim Sharma, Akhilendra Mishra, Vivek Vaswani, Dinesh Hingoo, Viju Khote', null, 'Fida tells the story of Jai who one day happen to meet a young and beautiful woman called Neha and he falls in love with her at first sight.', 'Fida tells the story of Jai who one day happen to meet a young and beautiful woman called Neha and he falls in love with her at first sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MBbNqBbTHCtfjEEqrskZWIVfBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166027'),
  ('102222246777797151', 'Fiddle De-Dee', 1947, 'Music, Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'A film fantasy of dancing music and dancing color. Listen to the Mocking Bird played by an oldtime fiddler, brilliant patterns ripple, flow, flicker and blend. A Norman McLaren painting on film, translates sound into sight.', 'A film fantasy of dancing music and dancing color. Listen to the Mocking Bird played by an oldtime fiddler, brilliant patterns ripple, flow, flicker and blend. A Norman McLaren painting on film, translates sound into sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0eLOEcBr3GZ2zhCfcyVTSva0P2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246213'),
  ('146519579022173920', 'Fiddlers', 1973, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Emil Loteanu, Vitali Kalashnikov, Valentina Plugaru', 'Emil Loteanu', 'Grigore Grigoriu, Svetlana Toma, Sergey Lunkevich, Dumitru Hãbãsescu, Jenea Rolko, Olga Câmpeanu, Angelica Iascencu, Galina Vodnyatskaya', null, 'Leader of a traveling gypsy band from the steppes of Bessarabia (now Moldova), Toma Alistar is a skilled violinist whose fame takes him on tours around European capitals and royal courts. He remains obsessed with his first love, beautiful Leanca who was married elsewhere while Toma was traveling, and spends his life and fortune trying to find her.', 'Leader of a traveling gypsy band from the steppes of Bessarabia (now Moldova), Toma Alistar is a skilled violinist whose fame takes him on tours around European capitals and royal courts. He remains obsessed with his first love, beautiful Leanca who was married elsewhere while Toma was traveling, and spends his life and fortune trying to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/en9P38TtMFKoLYM3c6YRLTvKcmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50266'),
  ('343105600151083924', 'Fiddlesticks', 1930, 'Animation', 'Ub Iwerks', null, null, null, 'Flip the Frog was Iwerks'' first creation. He made his debut appearance in "Fiddlesticks." In this cartoon, Iwerks supplied Flip with a bow tie and buttons, but there is no mistaking that Flip is a frog. When he first appears in "Fiddlesticks," Flip hops on all fours from one lily pad to the next as he crosses a pond. And he doesn''t talk. He croaks...', 'Flip the Frog was Iwerks'' first creation. He made his debut appearance in "Fiddlesticks." In this cartoon, Iwerks supplied Flip with a bow tie and buttons, but there is no mistaking that Flip is a frog. When he first appears in "Fiddlesticks," Flip hops on all fours from one lily pad to the next as he crosses a pond. And he doesn''t talk. He croaks...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tye7pPgl7J16AfSg1ZBVm2xnqfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166513'),
  ('190373164454215341', 'Fiddling Around', 1930, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Walt Disney', null, 'Mickey comes onstage to the applause of an unseen audience and plays various classical tunes on the violin, after some minor mishaps. During a sad song, he is overcome with emotion and has to stop.', 'Mickey comes onstage to the applause of an unseen audience and plays various classical tunes on the violin, after some minor mishaps. During a sad song, he is overcome with emotion and has to stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZbVXE30lVd2Se3PLYhensNaRm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166528'),
  ('257731094491319021', 'Fidelio, Alice''s Odyssey', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Adventure', 'Lucie Borleteau, Simon Beaufils', 'Clara Bourreau, Lucie Borleteau', 'Ariane Labed, Melvil Poupaud, Anders Danielsen Lie, Pascal Tagnati, Jean-Louis Coulloc''h, Nathanaël Maïni, Bogdan Zamfir, Manuel Ramirez', null, 'Thirty-year-old Alice''s occupation is rather unusual for a woman: she works as an engineer on a freighter. She loves her job and does it competently but even in a greasy blue overall a woman will be a woman, with her heart, her desires and her seduction - In such conditions can an all-male crew really remain totally insensitive to her charms? A situation all the more complicated as not only does Alice leave her fiancé Felix behind but she also discovers on board the Fidélio that the captain is Gaël, her first love.', 'Thirty-year-old Alice''s occupation is rather unusual for a woman: she works as an engineer on a freighter. She loves her job and does it competently but even in a greasy blue overall a woman will be a woman, with her heart, her desires and her seduction - In such conditions can an all-male crew really remain totally insensitive to her charms? A situation all the more complicated as not only does Alice leave her fiancé Felix behind but she also discovers on board the Fidélio that the captain is Gaël, her first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpv2S4lBEr89Ij06sREAeuOANP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285023'),
  ('736028804740656320', 'Fidelity', 2000, 'Drama', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Patrick Blossier, Sophie Berger Forestier', 'Andrzej Żuławski', 'Sophie Marceau, Guillaume Canet, Pascal Greggory, Michel Subor, Magali Noël, Marina Hands, Marc François, Édith Scob', null, 'A talented photographer who lands a lucrative job in Paris with a scandal-mongering tabloid and becomes romantically involved with an eccentric children''s book publisher while resisting the sexual advances of another photographer.', 'A talented photographer who lands a lucrative job in Paris with a scandal-mongering tabloid and becomes romantically involved with an eccentric children''s book publisher while resisting the sexual advances of another photographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nMKtqNHs69URTAgO85KxELfyn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49979'),
  ('296038666252945869', 'Fidelity', 2019, 'Drama', 'Anastasia Bagirova, Andrey Dergachev, Nadezhda Ilyukevich', 'Lyubov Mulmenko', 'Aleksandr Pal, Evgeniya Gromova, Alexey Agranovich, Marina Vasilyeva, Anna Kotova, Pavel Vorozhtsov, Vasily Rikhter, Anastasiya Denisova', null, 'A successful obstetrician living a seemingly stable married life begins to question her relationship when emotional and physical intimacy fades. Suspecting her husband of betrayal, she seeks connection elsewhere, stepping into a hidden world that offers desire, control, and escape. As she navigates this parallel existence, the boundaries between loyalty, loneliness, and self-discovery slowly begin to blur.', 'A successful obstetrician living a seemingly stable married life begins to question her relationship when emotional and physical intimacy fades. Suspecting her husband of betrayal, she seeks connection elsewhere, stepping into a hidden world that offers desire, control, and escape. As she navigates this parallel existence, the boundaries between loyalty, loneliness, and self-discovery slowly begin to blur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gG8tlkC981yNenGtKuByqUPu48P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575299'),
  ('543297974682779376', 'Fido', 2006, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Andrew Currie, Jan Kiesser', 'Andrew Currie, Robert Chomiak, Dennis Heaton', 'Billy Connolly, Carrie-Anne Moss, Dylan Baker, Kesun Loder, Henry Czerny, Tim Blake Nelson, Sonja Bennett, Alexia Fast', 'R', 'Timmy Robinson''s best friend in the whole wide world is a six-foot tall rotting zombie named Fido. But when Fido eats the next-door neighbor, Mom and Dad hit the roof, and Timmy has to go to the ends of the earth to keep Fido a part of the family. A boy-and-his-dog movie for grown ups, "Fido" will rip your heart out.', 'Timmy Robinson''s best friend in the whole wide world is a six-foot tall rotting zombie named Fido. But when Fido eats the next-door neighbor, Mom and Dad hit the roof, and Timmy has to go to the ends of the earth to keep Fido a part of the family. A boy-and-his-dog movie for grown ups, "Fido" will rip your heart out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKUUn6f4Hxj5iqQKMlQzRqbg2yT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10288'),
  ('96486916410871979', 'Fiebre de Amor', 1985, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'René Cardona Jr.', 'René Cardona Jr.', 'Luis Miguel, Lucero, Maribel Fernández, Mónica Sánchez Navarro, Guillermo Murray, Carlos Monden, Lorena Velázquez, Ricardo Carrión', null, 'A teenage girl with a crush on a young popular singing star sneaks into his house to fulfill her dreams of meeting him. Together they accidentally run into a group of diamond smugglers and she becomes the victim of a kidnapping. The young star comes to her rescue in this romantic comedy with lots of songs and the Acapulco scenery as a backdrop.', 'A teenage girl with a crush on a young popular singing star sneaks into his house to fulfill her dreams of meeting him. Together they accidentally run into a group of diamond smugglers and she becomes the victim of a kidnapping. The young star comes to her rescue in this romantic comedy with lots of songs and the Acapulco scenery as a backdrop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eptHegkmwqNfnVvQE9cLPun7oFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453003'),
  ('817295390289381463', 'Fiebre de juventud', 1966, 'Music, Comedy', 'Raúl Martínez Solares, Alfonso Corona Blake', 'José María Fernández Unsáin', 'Enrique Guzmán, Begoña Palacios, Rosa María Vázquez, Fernando Luján, Ernesto Albán', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3cbQuKk1PC09lO7YAQ8T0ic53z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403220'),
  ('578962941428065221', 'Field and Scream', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, null, null, 'A collection of very brief cartoons, mostly revolving around sight gags and puns, on the subject of hunting and fishing, and the men who are addicted to them.', 'A collection of very brief cartoons, mostly revolving around sight gags and puns, on the subject of hunting and fishing, and the men who are addicted to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gN7QtVP1N22C1wRIK18OjEwPhCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84767'),
  ('895500069477036060', 'Field of Dreams', 1989, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Phil Alden Robinson, John Lindley, Alan Edmisten', 'Phil Alden Robinson', 'Kevin Costner, Amy Madigan, Gaby Hoffmann, Ray Liotta, Timothy Busfield, James Earl Jones, Burt Lancaster, Frank Whaley', 'PG', 'Ray Kinsella is an Iowa farmer who hears a mysterious voice telling him to turn his cornfield into a baseball diamond. He does, but the voice''s directions don''t stop -- even after the spirits of deceased ballplayers turn up to play.', 'Ray Kinsella is an Iowa farmer who hears a mysterious voice telling him to turn his cornfield into a baseball diamond. He does, but the voice''s directions don''t stop -- even after the spirits of deceased ballplayers turn up to play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeM7nAw6FVFICwUaXKCRkDsKjqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2323'),
  ('223930602604049225', 'Fiend', 1980, 'Horror', 'Don Dohler, Don Dohler, Richard Geiwitz', 'Don Dohler', 'Don Leifert, Richard Nelson, Elaine White, George Stover, Greg Dohler, Kim Pfeiffer, Pam Dohler', null, 'An evil spirit resurrects the corpse of a dead music teacher, who now must strangle and absorb people''s energy in order to stay alive. When he moves to the suburbs of Baltimore and resumes giving music lessons, he begins to cause suspicion amongst his neighbors.', 'An evil spirit resurrects the corpse of a dead music teacher, who now must strangle and absorb people''s energy in order to stay alive. When he moves to the suburbs of Baltimore and resumes giving music lessons, he begins to cause suspicion amongst his neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nne4ZJsEX0pMV6YmUUuMI9BpJIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90338'),
  ('773446969082047220', 'Fiend Without a Face', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Arthur Crabtree, Douglas Hickox, Lionel Banes', 'Herbert J. Leder', 'Marshall Thompson, Kynaston Reeves, Kim Parker, Stanley Maxted, Terry Kilburn, James Dyrenforth, Robert MacKenzie, Peter Madden', null, 'An American airbase in Canada provokes resentment from the nearby residents after fallout from nuclear experiments at the base are blamed for a recent spate of disappearances. A captain from the airbase is assigned to investigate, and begins to suspect that an elderly British scientist who lives near the base and conducts research in the field of mind over matter knows more than he is letting on..', 'An American airbase in Canada provokes resentment from the nearby residents after fallout from nuclear experiments at the base are blamed for a recent spate of disappearances. A captain from the airbase is assigned to investigate, and begins to suspect that an elderly British scientist who lives near the base and conducts research in the field of mind over matter knows more than he is letting on..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvy9fNmdFIMlStKVFWUvMP8JpNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29347'),
  ('187424173877623310', 'Fierce', 2020, 'Comedy, Music', 'Anna Wieczur, Witold Płóciennik', 'Wojciech Nerkowski, Piotr Jasek, Julia Kamińska', 'Katarzyna Sawczuk, Maciej Zakościelny, Anita Sokołowska, Julia Kamińska, Tomasz Karolak, Maria Pakulnis, Barbara Wypych, Wojciech Solarz', null, 'Talent and passion for music can take one to the very top. On the way, however, there are going to be showbiz traps.', 'Talent and passion for music can take one to the very top. On the way, however, there are going to be showbiz traps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umvhAr6eqwC10WcGG6RPSSJm9GA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768503'),
  ('706608368021963767', 'Fierce Creatures', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Adrian Biddle, Ian Baker, Robert Young', 'Iain Johnstone, John Cleese', 'John Cleese, Jamie Lee Curtis, Kevin Kline, Michael Palin, Robert Lindsay, Ronnie Corbett, Carey Lowell, Bille Brown', 'PG-13', 'Ex-policeman Rollo Lee is sent to run Marwood Zoo, the newly acquired business of a New Zealand tycoon. In order to meet high profit targets and keep the zoo open, Rollo enforces a new ''fierce creatures'' policy, whereby only the most impressive and dangerous animals are allowed to remain in the zoo. However, the keepers are less enthusiastic about complying with these demands.', 'Ex-policeman Rollo Lee is sent to run Marwood Zoo, the newly acquired business of a New Zealand tycoon. In order to meet high profit targets and keep the zoo open, Rollo enforces a new ''fierce creatures'' policy, whereby only the most impressive and dangerous animals are allowed to remain in the zoo. However, the keepers are less enthusiastic about complying with these demands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Wl0zSEngmsTXjQMVE0GD5s85cM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12145'),
  ('768740073636209827', 'Fierce People', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Griffin Dunne, William Rexer, Craig Matheson', 'Dirk Wittenborn', 'Diane Lane, Anton Yelchin, Donald Sutherland, Chris Evans, Kristen Stewart, Paz de la Huerta, Blu Mankuma, Elizabeth Perkins', 'R', 'A massage therapist looking to overcome her addictions and reconnect with her son, whose father is an anthropologist in South America studying the Yanomani people, moves in with a wealthy ex-client in New Jersey.', 'A massage therapist looking to overcome her addictions and reconnect with her son, whose father is an anthropologist in South America studying the Yanomani people, moves in with a wealthy ex-client in New Jersey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mv4WXcAudHDCxm8xFvVDvqAl36f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19583'),
  ('677585363476359247', 'Fierce Town', 2025, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Konstantin Buslov, Nikita Rozhdestvenskiy, Boris Voyt', 'Vadim Golovanov', 'Aleksey Guskov, Aleksandr Metelkin, Vladimir Lyubimtsev, Artem Volobuev, Polina Chernyshova, Aleksei Shevchenkov, Leonela Manturova, Aglaya Shilovskaya', null, 'By the middle of the 12th century, the borders of the Mongolian Empire stretched from the Adriatic and Mediterranean Seas in the west to the southern lands of China in the east. The Mongolian army, under Khan Batu’s command, was known for its invisibility, destroying anyone who dared to challenge them. Yet, even within their central territories, some areas refused to bow to the Genghisids. Kozelsk was one of them. The Mongolian armies bypassed the high walls of this small town, considering that "the skin of the wolf was not worth the risk of encountering its teeth".However, one of the Khan’s commanders harbored a grudge against the town''s citizens. Now, the people of Kozelsk must face a battle against the strongest army in the world, with no hope of victory. This is a story about people facing their death. Some try to escape, others are willing to do anything to survive, but most are prepared to protect their city from the relentless storms of the Mongolian hordes.', 'By the middle of the 12th century, the borders of the Mongolian Empire stretched from the Adriatic and Mediterranean Seas in the west to the southern lands of China in the east. The Mongolian army, under Khan Batu’s command, was known for its invisibility, destroying anyone who dared to challenge them. Yet, even within their central territories, some areas refused to bow to the Genghisids. Kozelsk was one of them. The Mongolian armies bypassed the high walls of this small town, considering that "the skin of the wolf was not worth the risk of encountering its teeth".However, one of the Khan’s commanders harbored a grudge against the town''s citizens. Now, the people of Kozelsk must face a battle against the strongest army in the world, with no hope of victory. This is a story about people facing their death. Some try to escape, others are willing to do anything to survive, but most are prepared to protect their city from the relentless storms of the Mongolian hordes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYiq2eZKASt3YAbiVX8xpolZisG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584855'),
  ('1055254302202402274', 'Fierrot le pou', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Mathieu Kassovitz', 'Mathieu Kassovitz', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Fabienne Labonne, Alain Brena Labinsky', null, 'A young man shoots hoops in an empty gym. He misses constantly. At the other end of the court, a young woman arrives and starts warming up. She rarely misses. He''s white, she''s black. From time to time, she glances at him and smiles. He''s fully aware of her presence and of his lack of talent. Is there any way he can impress her? His imagination takes over.', 'A young man shoots hoops in an empty gym. He misses constantly. At the other end of the court, a young woman arrives and starts warming up. She rarely misses. He''s white, she''s black. From time to time, she glances at him and smiles. He''s fully aware of her presence and of his lack of talent. Is there any way he can impress her? His imagination takes over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zq51B0qce6MdsVeiz8P7lM3CzLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108521'),
  ('818493830233873102', 'Fièvre', 1921, 'Drama', 'Louis Delluc, Alphonse Gibory, Georges Lucas', 'Louis Delluc', 'Ève Francis, Edmond van Daële, Gaston Modot, George Foottit, Elena Sagrary, Gastao Roxo, Solange Sicard, Andrew Brunelle', null, 'Militis, a sailor, returns to a bar where he finds Sarah, the girl he once loved and is still attracted to. However, he is now married to an exotic woman who took care of him during an illness.', 'Militis, a sailor, returns to a bar where he finds Sarah, the girl he once loved and is still attracted to. However, he is now married to an exotic woman who took care of him during an illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50eYTMc5WB1QiSC3uDEg98VFwA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174171'),
  ('719289541121720689', 'Fifa e arena', 1948, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Vincenzo Seratrice, Leo Catozzo', 'Marcello Marchesi, Steno', 'Totò, Isa Barzizza, Mario Castellani, Franca Marzi, Giulio Marchetti, Cesare Polacco, Vinicio Sofia, Galeazzo Benti', null, 'In Napoli, Nicolino Capece, a truthful pharmacist clerk becomes erroneously recognized as a dangerous Spanish criminal and decides to escape to Spain. In Siviglia, he is blackmailed by the bandit Cast who wants him to marry the rich Patricia Cotten and then kill her. So Nicolino play the bull fighter and heads to the arena....', 'In Napoli, Nicolino Capece, a truthful pharmacist clerk becomes erroneously recognized as a dangerous Spanish criminal and decides to escape to Spain. In Siviglia, he is blackmailed by the bandit Cast who wants him to marry the rich Patricia Cotten and then kill her. So Nicolino play the bull fighter and heads to the arena....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGiqkVBUHzLT35HrNi4GPq9mEbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61210'),
  ('522621867058257833', 'Fifteen and Pregnant', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Sam Pillsbury, James Bartle', 'Susan Cuscuna', 'Kirsten Dunst, Park Overall, David Andrews, Margot Demeter, Karen Trumbo, Julia Whelan, Zachary Ray Sherman, Daniel Kountz', 'NR', 'Based on a true story, 15 year old Tina Spangler discovers she is pregnant. Her choices are abortion, adoption, or a lonely, exhausting life as a single parent. Abandoned by her boyfriend, she turns to her mother. Tina discovers although it has torn her world apart, her pregnancy could re-unite her shattered family and help her find her true purpose in life.', 'Based on a true story, 15 year old Tina Spangler discovers she is pregnant. Her choices are abortion, adoption, or a lonely, exhausting life as a single parent. Abandoned by her boyfriend, she turns to her mother. Tina discovers although it has torn her world apart, her pregnancy could re-unite her shattered family and help her find her true purpose in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehA1FTLR87THjN6QwdI7M4uhe9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60662'),
  ('408815836991832839', 'Fifth Avenue Girl', 1939, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Edward Killy, Perry Ferguson, Gregory La Cava', 'Allan Scott', 'Ginger Rogers, Walter Connolly, Verree Teasdale, James Ellison, Tim Holt, Kathryn Adams, Franklin Pangborn, Ferike Boros', 'NR', 'A wealthy man hires a poor girl to play his mistress in order to get more attention from his neglectful family.', 'A wealthy man hires a poor girl to play his mistress in order to get more attention from his neglectful family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9XTY7hrdVPIMxS45ZXPX6hAO0u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45185'),
  ('181880291926493259', 'Fifth Column Mouse', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy, War', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'G', 'In an allegory for World War II, one mouse''s attempt to appease the cat of the house in exchange for a regular supply of cheese puts all the mice in danger.', 'In an allegory for World War II, one mouse''s attempt to appease the cat of the house in exchange for a regular supply of cheese puts all the mice in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80LDP6Vw4NM5ZvRlfmmhmMeERK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171545'),
  ('46679487949582060', 'Fifty Dead Men Walking', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jonathan Freeman, Kari Skogland, Leon McCarthy', 'Kari Skogland', 'Ben Kingsley, Jim Sturgess, Kevin Zegers, Natalie Press, Rose McGowan, Tom Collins, William Houston, Michael McElhatton', 'R', 'It''s 1989, and in a Belfast torn apart by conflict and terrorism, petty criminal Marty McGartland is recruited by the British police to infiltrate the IRA. Guided by Special Forces officer ''Fergus'', McGartland gains unparalleled insight into the organisation''s dealings, providing his British handler with priceless, life-saving information. Based on a true story.', 'It''s 1989, and in a Belfast torn apart by conflict and terrorism, petty criminal Marty McGartland is recruited by the British police to infiltrate the IRA. Guided by Special Forces officer ''Fergus'', McGartland gains unparalleled insight into the organisation''s dealings, providing his British handler with priceless, life-saving information. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahHguslRzE5Qgx8KTJvlDeSEJE2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17622'),
  ('181451289444263545', 'Fifty Percent Grey', 2001, 'Comedy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Ruairi Robinson', 'Ruairi Robinson', null, null, 'Sergeant wakes up alone with only a widescreen TV for company, in a place designed for him to relax in peace and tranquility, for all eternity...', 'Sergeant wakes up alone with only a widescreen TV for company, in a place designed for him to relax in peace and tranquility, for all eternity...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/379qWaj3ye3kleE583rYXQKgrkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85358'),
  ('627182122735584131', 'Fifty Pills', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Theo Avgerinos', null, 'Lou Taylor Pucci, Kristen Bell, John Hensley, Nora Zehetner, Monica Keena, Diora Baird, Michael Masini, Rachel Boston', 'R', 'Unless Darren can survive New York''s largest drug mogul, write a paper on Dante''s "Inferno," escape three thugs chasing the wrong guy and sell fifty pills of ecstasy to make his tuition payment, he''ll never date the girl of his dreams.', 'Unless Darren can survive New York''s largest drug mogul, write a paper on Dante''s "Inferno," escape three thugs chasing the wrong guy and sell fifty pills of ecstasy to make his tuition payment, he''ll never date the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvRxQKMSI5SciTWJvWgTQ41IU4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13414'),
  ('464247134097988839', 'Fifty Shades Darker', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Foley, John Schwartzman, Phil Pastuhov', 'Niall Leonard', 'Dakota Johnson, Jamie Dornan, Eric Johnson, Eloise Mumford, Bella Heathcote, Rita Ora, Jennifer Ehle, Luke Grimes', 'R', 'When a wounded Christian Grey tries to entice a cautious Ana Steele back into his life, she demands a new arrangement before she will give him another chance. As the two begin to build trust and find stability, shadowy figures from Christian’s past start to circle the couple, determined to destroy their hopes for a future together.', 'When a wounded Christian Grey tries to entice a cautious Ana Steele back into his life, she demands a new arrangement before she will give him another chance. As the two begin to build trust and find stability, shadowy figures from Christian’s past start to circle the couple, determined to destroy their hopes for a future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3qa274gvca9t8pkUoG8nfQgTU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341174'),
  ('310475979918615597', 'Fifty Shades Freed', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Foley, Doug Coleman, John Schwartzman', 'Niall Leonard', 'Dakota Johnson, Jamie Dornan, Eric Johnson, Eloise Mumford, Rita Ora, Luke Grimes, Victor Rasuk, Max Martini', 'R', 'Believing they have left behind shadowy figures from their past, newlyweds Christian and Ana fully embrace an inextricable connection and shared life of luxury. But just as she steps into her role as Mrs. Grey and he relaxes into an unfamiliar stability, new threats could jeopardize their happy ending before it even begins.', 'Believing they have left behind shadowy figures from their past, newlyweds Christian and Ana fully embrace an inextricable connection and shared life of luxury. But just as she steps into her role as Mrs. Grey and he relaxes into an unfamiliar stability, new threats could jeopardize their happy ending before it even begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjPJ4s3DWZZvI4vw8Xfi4Vqa1Q8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337167'),
  ('777258935079483361', 'Fifty Shades of Black', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Tiddes, David Ortkiese', 'Rick Alvarez, Marlon Wayans', 'Marlon Wayans, Kali Hawk, Fred Willard, Mike Epps, Affion Crockett, Jane Seymour, Florence Henderson, Andrew Bachelor', 'R', 'An inexperienced college student meets a wealthy businessman whose sexual practices put a strain on their relationship.', 'An inexperienced college student meets a wealthy businessman whose sexual practices put a strain on their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkGhv7WMbyX7tL8CJkvMY3S2lW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351819'),
  ('598277256731377771', 'Fifty Shades of Grey', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Sam Taylor-Johnson, Peter Kohn, David Arnold', 'Kelly Marcel', 'Dakota Johnson, Jamie Dornan, Jennifer Ehle, Eloise Mumford, Victor Rasuk, Luke Grimes, Marcia Gay Harden, Rita Ora', 'R', 'When college senior Anastasia Steele steps in for her sick roommate to interview prominent businessman Christian Grey for their campus paper, little does she realize the path her life will take. Christian, as enigmatic as he is rich and powerful, finds himself strangely drawn to Ana, and she to him. Though sexually inexperienced, Ana plunges headlong into an affair -- and learns that Christian''s true sexual proclivities push the boundaries of pain and pleasure.', 'When college senior Anastasia Steele steps in for her sick roommate to interview prominent businessman Christian Grey for their campus paper, little does she realize the path her life will take. Christian, as enigmatic as he is rich and powerful, finds himself strangely drawn to Ana, and she to him. Though sexually inexperienced, Ana plunges headlong into an affair -- and learns that Christian''s true sexual proclivities push the boundaries of pain and pleasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63kGofUkt1Mx0SIL4XI4Z5AoSgt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216015'),
  ('472122993064429484', 'Fifty/Fifty', 1993, 'Action, Comedy', 'Charles Martin Smith, David Connell', 'Dennis Shryack, Michael Butler', 'Robert Hays, Peter Weller, Charles Martin Smith, Ramona Rahman, Lim Kay Tong, Dom Magwili, Azmil Mustapha, Dharma Harun', null, 'Two bickering mercenaries are hired by the CIA to overthrow a South East Asian dictator.', 'Two bickering mercenaries are hired by the CIA to overthrow a South East Asian dictator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDP5Fw2uxs5GHKo5kEHoZod77KI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28263'),
  ('656020175737153610', 'Fig Jam', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Aytaç Ağırlar, Metin Turguç, Hasan Gergin', 'Aytaç Ağırlar', 'Halil Sezai Paracıkoğlu, Melike Güner, Sinan Çalışkanoğlu, Barbara Lourens, Mehmet Selim Akgul, Mustafa Uzunyılmaz, Nevin Efe, Batur Belirdi', null, 'On a night of despair after being turned down continuously for the scripts he writes, Metin ends up in a bar where he meets a girl named Duygu. After spending the night together, she walks out in the morning before he wakes up and leaves only a short note. The next time they meet, Metin becomes curious about her secret and decides to follow her. What he finds out will be the beginning of an everlasting love.', 'On a night of despair after being turned down continuously for the scripts he writes, Metin ends up in a bar where he meets a girl named Duygu. After spending the night together, she walks out in the morning before he wakes up and leaves only a short note. The next time they meet, Metin becomes curious about her secret and decides to follow her. What he finds out will be the beginning of an everlasting love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkF7HQOxUlVmKz9UQHjUevBVZf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64335'),
  ('189220048298033117', 'Fig Jam 2', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Aytaç Ağırlar', 'Aytaç Ağırlar', 'Halil Sezai Paracıkoğlu, Şafak Pekdemir, Ahmet Uz, Mehmet Selim Akgul, Sinan Çalışkanoğlu, Tuğba Sarıünal, Melike Güner, Hakan İlçin', null, 'After losing his great love Duygu and spiraling into despair despite directing the film İncir Reçeli, Metin’s nights of singing his own songs at a bar take a turn when newcomer bartender Gizem arrives. Both scarred by past heartbreaks, Metin and Gizem must learn to trust and heal if they are to discover whether a new love can blossom between them.', 'After losing his great love Duygu and spiraling into despair despite directing the film İncir Reçeli, Metin’s nights of singing his own songs at a bar take a turn when newcomer bartender Gizem arrives. Both scarred by past heartbreaks, Metin and Gizem must learn to trust and heal if they are to discover whether a new love can blossom between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7prnyv5OnRoQv3YIqN97Ib3dDQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313822'),
  ('656457845076021713', 'Fig Leaves', 1926, 'Comedy', 'Howard Hawks, James Tinling, Joseph H. August', null, 'George O''Brien, Olive Borden, George Beranger, Phyllis Haver, Heinie Conklin, Eulalie Jensen, William Austin', null, 'Adam, a plumber, is happily married to Eve, a wardrobe-obsessed housewife, until she accidentally meets a supercilious fashion designer. At the prompting of her neighbor, who has secret designs on Adam, Eve secretly becomes a fashion model by day, knowing that her husband would disapprove.', 'Adam, a plumber, is happily married to Eve, a wardrobe-obsessed housewife, until she accidentally meets a supercilious fashion designer. At the prompting of her neighbor, who has secret designs on Adam, Eve secretly becomes a fashion model by day, knowing that her husband would disapprove.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49XF5NkpzHMWnHTZPgbsy7CF4XZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133132'),
