  ('801072343389881086', 'Fight Against Evil', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Qin Pengfei, Zhao Xiaofeng', 'Yang Bingjia', 'Xie Miao, Wang Weishen, Yi Yunhe, Bao Xiaoping, Ding Shaoyi, Gu Jing, Li Daqiang, Ming Xing', null, 'Criminal police Li Hongqi accompanied his girlfriend back to his hometown for the Chinese New Year, and accidentally discovered that his father-in-law was involved in this crime-related case. With a strong sense of justice, Li Hongqi decided to give up his vacation and cooperated with the local police to start an investigation.', 'Criminal police Li Hongqi accompanied his girlfriend back to his hometown for the Chinese New Year, and accidentally discovered that his father-in-law was involved in this crime-related case. With a strong sense of justice, Li Hongqi decided to give up his vacation and cooperated with the local police to start an investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxVGB2He0vQPIFjHx6uZLHyguIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881298'),
  ('1045003547091435210', 'Fight Against Evil 3', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Yang Bingjia, Du Xiaohui', 'Yang Bingjia', 'Xie Miao, Diana Lin Xiaojie, Cui Zhijia, Huang Miyi, Philip Ng Wan-Lung, Ma Qianyi, Zhang Lei, Feng Yao', null, 'Li Hongqi is forced to travel for his wedding but must team up with a local cop to rescue a girl from human traffickers, fighting criminals while racing against his wedding date.', 'Li Hongqi is forced to travel for his wedding but must team up with a local cop to rescue a girl from human traffickers, fighting criminals while racing against his wedding date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5EoZe8Z256w0tgRhYzV0LAtNuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1618784'),
  ('97691028419224586', 'Fight Another Day', 2024, 'Action', 'James Mark, Russ De Jong', 'James Mark, Matthew Nayman', 'Jim Belushi, Martin Kove, Eric Johnson, Ennis Esmer, Chuck Liddell, Ken Kilpatrick, Finn McCager Higgins, Christina Ochoa', null, 'Follows a tough cop, who after being transported to a dystopian future, must enter a deadly combat tournament to be able to return to his past.', 'Follows a tough cop, who after being transported to a dystopian future, must enter a deadly combat tournament to be able to return to his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKnLt1xQV0RdpN6RViowEiD1dFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053008'),
  ('206586867621468353', 'Fight Back to School', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Gordon Chan, Cheng Siu-Keung, Dante Lam Chiu-Yin', 'Gordon Chan, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Stephen Chow, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Sharla Cheung, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu, Karel Wong Chi-Yeung, Gabriel Wong Yat-Shan, Paul Chun Pui', null, 'Chow Sing Sing is about to be kicked out of the Royal Hong Kong Police''s elite Special Duties Unit. But a senior officer decides to give him one last chance: Star must go undercover as a student at the Edinburgh High School in Hong Kong to recover the senior officer''s missing revolver.', 'Chow Sing Sing is about to be kicked out of the Royal Hong Kong Police''s elite Special Duties Unit. But a senior officer decides to give him one last chance: Star must go undercover as a student at the Edinburgh High School in Hong Kong to recover the senior officer''s missing revolver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sC9PZVxrFNtHi3sYKxm6bFasg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47647'),
  ('600945845641933329', 'Fight Back to School 2', 1992, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Gordon Chan, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Yuen Kai-Chi, John Chan Kin-Chung, Gordon Chan', 'Stephen Chow, Sharla Cheung, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Athena Chu Yan, Deanie Ip, Paul Fonoroff, Michael Chow Man-Kin, Gabriel Wong Yat-Shan', null, 'Star Chow, an officer in the elite police unit, resigns when he is made a scapegoat for a botched investigation. He goes undercover at a school to complete the case and realizes a bumbling detective is also undercover as a student.', 'Star Chow, an officer in the elite police unit, resigns when he is made a scapegoat for a botched investigation. He goes undercover at a school to complete the case and realizes a bumbling detective is also undercover as a student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEszZw7fdL8Qch9TBrnEdDVtTNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53165'),
  ('204315385332780731', 'Fight Back to School 3', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Wong Jing, Gigo Lee Ji-Hang, Mang Hoi', 'Wong Jing', 'Stephen Chow, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Sharla Cheung, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Mimi Chu Mai-Mai, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', null, 'Chow Sing Sing returns, only this time he doesn’t go back to school. Instead, Chow goes undercover as the husband of a wealthy socialite, which doesn’t sit well with his fiancée, who tries to convince Chow to quit working as undercover.', 'Chow Sing Sing returns, only this time he doesn’t go back to school. Instead, Chow goes undercover as the husband of a wealthy socialite, which doesn’t sit well with his fiancée, who tries to convince Chow to quit working as undercover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwq4z0x4ISsXI9Ra9EJhBIzyUTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66657'),
  ('922356511840325550', 'Fight Club', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jeff Cronenweth, Mike Topoozian, David Fincher', 'Jim Uhls', 'Edward Norton, Brad Pitt, Helena Bonham Carter, Meat Loaf, Jared Leto, Zach Grenier, Holt McCallany, Eion Bailey', 'R', 'A ticking-time-bomb insomniac and a slippery soap salesman channel primal male aggression into a shocking new form of therapy. Their concept catches on, with underground "fight clubs" forming in every town, until an eccentric gets in the way and ignites an out-of-control spiral toward oblivion.', 'A ticking-time-bomb insomniac and a slippery soap salesman channel primal male aggression into a shocking new form of therapy. Their concept catches on, with underground "fight clubs" forming in every town, until an eccentric gets in the way and ignites an out-of-control spiral toward oblivion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSziioSwPVrOy9Yow3XhWIBDjq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550'),
  ('822719665452066642', 'Fight Club: Members Only', 2006, 'Action', 'Vikram Chopra', 'Sohail Khan', 'Suniel Shetty, Sohail Khan, Zayed Khan, Riteish Deshmukh, Dino Morea, Ashmit Patel, Aashish Chaudhary, Dia Mirza', null, 'Four friends head off to Bombay and get involved in the mother and father of all gang wars.', 'Four friends head off to Bombay and get involved in the mother and father of all gang wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXFmWfWYCCxQTkCn7K86RvDiMHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347807'),
  ('572228750137421227', 'Fight for Your Life', 1977, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Robert A. Endelson', 'Straw Weisman', 'Robert Judd, Catherine Peppers, Lela Small, Yvonne Ross, Reggie Rock Bythewood, Ramon Saunders, William Sanderson, Daniel Faraldo', 'R', 'A minister dispenses justice on three convicts who take his family hostage.', 'A minister dispenses justice on three convicts who take his family hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqKQAGzVqAK7EJaTK2dZ6tjrdUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39342'),
  ('123309642447010565', 'Fight for Your Right Revisited', 2011, 'Music, Comedy', 'Adam Yauch, Wyatt Troll', 'Adam Yauch', 'Elijah Wood, Danny McBride, Seth Rogen, Susan Sarandon, Stanley Tucci, Rashida Jones, Will Arnett, Adam Scott', 'R', 'Fight for Your Right Revisited stars Danny McBride, Seth Rogen, and Elijah Wood as the "young" Beastie Boys from the past and Jack Black, John C. Reilly, and Will Ferrell as the "old" Beastie Boys from the future. The story begins where the video for "Fight for Your Right (1987)" ended. It features music from the band''s album Hot Sauce Committee Part Two.', 'Fight for Your Right Revisited stars Danny McBride, Seth Rogen, and Elijah Wood as the "young" Beastie Boys from the past and Jack Black, John C. Reilly, and Will Ferrell as the "old" Beastie Boys from the future. The story begins where the video for "Fight for Your Right (1987)" ended. It features music from the band''s album Hot Sauce Committee Part Two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txbWkBtDc5fXqOaUdDgty4ouzfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62934'),
  ('295413835650612882', 'Fight Like Angels', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Giorgio Brancia, Gianni Aureli, Teresa di Modugno', 'Gianni Aureli, Massimo Bertocci, Francesco Losavio', 'Teo Guarini, Alessandro Intini, Romeo Tofani, Ralph Palka, Anna Malvaso, Marco Pratesi, Marc Fiorini, Pietro De Silva', null, 'A group of scouts decides to resist Benito Mussolini''s order to close all associations not affiliated with the fascist regime. The young people continue to meet secretly in Val Codera, eventually supporting the Resistance.', 'A group of scouts decides to resist Benito Mussolini''s order to close all associations not affiliated with the fascist regime. The young people continue to meet secretly in Val Codera, eventually supporting the Resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNj49zHHJEg4YCJkwTuL30YrELb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633821'),
  ('941250370604609359', 'Fight or Flight', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'James Madigan, Matt Flannery, Zoltán Gyovai', 'D.J. Cotrona, Brooks McLaren', 'Josh Hartnett, Charithra Chandran, Katee Sackhoff, Marko Zaror, JuJu Chan, Julian Kostov, Hughie O''Donnell, Rebecka Johnston', 'R', 'A mercenary takes on the job of tracking down a target on a plane but must protect that target when they''re surrounded by people trying to kill both of them.', 'A mercenary takes on the job of tracking down a target on a plane but must protect that target when they''re surrounded by people trying to kill both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNyzZaMDS5hmOzWHFgNlgRRPDB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1212855'),
  ('685418758829901028', 'Fight the Dragon: Big Breasts Game of Death', 2020, null, 'Hirohisa Sasaki, Satoshi Kagamihaya, Masato Shimazaki', 'Hirohisa Sasaki', 'Marina Yuzuki, Karina Nishida, Nina Nishimura, Yumi Yoshiyuki, Hiroshi Noda, Shin''ya Orikasa, Kenso Kato, Yuya Ishikawa', null, 'The three sisters Satomi (Marina Yuzuki), Kaori (Karina Nishida), and Tachimi (Nina Nishimura) are toyed with by Kakinuma, a man dressed as a priest with half his face hidden by a mask. Then, an old woman disguised as a fortune teller who calls herself "Shojo Roshi" appears before them. The three sisters begin training under Shojo Roshi in order to get revenge on Kakinuma, but...', 'The three sisters Satomi (Marina Yuzuki), Kaori (Karina Nishida), and Tachimi (Nina Nishimura) are toyed with by Kakinuma, a man dressed as a priest with half his face hidden by a mask. Then, an old woman disguised as a fortune teller who calls herself "Shojo Roshi" appears before them. The three sisters begin training under Shojo Roshi in order to get revenge on Kakinuma, but...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssYWSI8kEcXZpgxBvksyuIz0FrP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876905'),
  ('783571967629402569', 'Fight, Zatoichi, Fight', 1964, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura', 'Tetsurō Yoshida, Masaatsu Matusmura, Seiji Hoshikawa', 'Shintarō Katsu, Nobuo Kaneko, Gen Kimura, Ikuko Mōri, Shōsaku Sugiyama, Hizuru Takachiho, Yoshi Katō, Saburo Date', null, 'Blind swordsman/masseuse Zatoichi befriends a young woman returning home with her baby. When gangsters mistake her for Zatoichi and kill her, Zatoichi determines to escort the baby to its father. He gains the reluctant help of a young pick pocket and together they travel to find the baby''s father. But they do not reckon on the father''s reaction to their arrival, nor on their own growing feelings for the child.', 'Blind swordsman/masseuse Zatoichi befriends a young woman returning home with her baby. When gangsters mistake her for Zatoichi and kill her, Zatoichi determines to escort the baby to its father. He gains the reluctant help of a young pick pocket and together they travel to find the baby''s father. But they do not reckon on the father''s reaction to their arrival, nor on their own growing feelings for the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BecqM4fFbHrz994VYgwqUtD5xm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54266'),
  ('192289080746656844', 'Fight!! Spirit of the Sword', 1993, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Masanori Nishii, Ryo Yasumura, Hideyuki Tanaka', null, 'Megumi Hayashibara, Takeshi Kusao, Chie Sato, Ikuo Nishikawa, Junichi Sugawara, Junko Asami, Junko Sakuma, Masako Katsuki', null, 'Yonosuke Hikura appears to be an ordinary high school student. Yet he has inherited the important role of protecting the harmony between Heaven and Earth. With the help of the magical sword Chitentai, and Tsukinojo Inbe, he courageously battles the demons, sending them back to the Earth World, from which they have escaped.', 'Yonosuke Hikura appears to be an ordinary high school student. Yet he has inherited the important role of protecting the harmony between Heaven and Earth. With the help of the magical sword Chitentai, and Tsukinojo Inbe, he courageously battles the demons, sending them back to the Earth World, from which they have escaped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ctuOltpgm2IXHZ5tbTstFwQ4tT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227326'),
  ('80576394262528644', 'Fighter', 2007, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Natasha Arthy', 'Natasha Arthy, Nikolaj Arcel, Rasmus Heisterberg', 'Semra Turan, Nima Nabipour, Cyron Melville, Molly Egelind, Sadi Tekelioglu, Behruz Banissi, Gao Xian, Denize Karabuda', null, 'Aïcha, a high-school student, is a passionate kung fu fighter. Her Turkish parents expect her to get good grades so she can get into medical school, like her brother Ali. But school doesn´t inspire her. Defying her family, Aïcha starts secretly training at a professional, co-ed kung fu club. A boy, Emil, helps Aïcha train for the club championship and they fall in love. But the rules of life are not as simple as the rules of kung fu, and Aïcha is forced to decide who she is and what she wants.', 'Aïcha, a high-school student, is a passionate kung fu fighter. Her Turkish parents expect her to get good grades so she can get into medical school, like her brother Ali. But school doesn´t inspire her. Defying her family, Aïcha starts secretly training at a professional, co-ed kung fu club. A boy, Emil, helps Aïcha train for the club championship and they fall in love. But the rules of life are not as simple as the rules of kung fu, and Aïcha is forced to decide who she is and what she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjTvqj3IpTrjjJTvrCKysWO6Q2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15930'),
  ('858626393845690409', 'Fighter', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'Satchith Paulose, Suraj Prasad, Harshit Bhatia', 'Biswapati Sarkar', 'Hrithik Roshan, Deepika Padukone, Anil Kapoor, Karan Singh Grover, Sanjeeda Sheikh, Akshay Oberoi, Rishabh Sawhney, Ashutosh Rana', 'NR', 'As India faces a militant attack in Kashmir, the country’s best combat aviators join forces under a reckless yet brilliant squadron leader to form ''Air Dragons'', faces mortal dangers and their inner demons.', 'As India faces a militant attack in Kashmir, the country’s best combat aviators join forces under a reckless yet brilliant squadron leader to form ''Air Dragons'', faces mortal dangers and their inner demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqFuriKJ6pYDvf72kXNLONnuE8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784651'),
  ('72933706869024719', 'Fighter in the Wind', 2004, 'Action, Drama', 'Yun-ho Yang', 'Kim Hyung-joo', 'Yang Dong-geun, Aya Hirayama, Masaya Katō, Jung Doo-hong, Sachiko Kokubu, Fuuma Kosaka, Jeong Tae-woo, Yeom Hye-ran', null, 'An account of karate competitor Choi Yeung-Eui who went to Japan after World War II to become a fighter pilot but found a very different path instead. He changed his name to Masutatsu Oyama and went across the country, defeating martial artists one after another. This film concentrates on the period when he is still young, and developing his famous karate style, Kyokushin.', 'An account of karate competitor Choi Yeung-Eui who went to Japan after World War II to become a fighter pilot but found a very different path instead. He changed his name to Masutatsu Oyama and went across the country, defeating martial artists one after another. This film concentrates on the period when he is still young, and developing his famous karate style, Kyokushin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp4YiskOE7aciwfPomXuruGfxnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21115'),
  ('307623765017387964', 'Fighter Squadron', 1948, 'Action, War', 'Raoul Walsh, Sidney Hickox, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Martin Rackin', 'Edmond O''Brien, Robert Stack, John Rodney, Tom D''Andrea, Henry Hull, James Holden, Walter Reed, Shepperd Strudwick', 'NR', 'During World War II, an insubordinate fighter pilot finds the shoe on the other foot when he''s promoted.', 'During World War II, an insubordinate fighter pilot finds the shoe on the other foot when he''s promoted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPlTtsMalKWvEgZaA8fIskZtBJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101864'),
  ('778605404025209677', 'Fighting', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Romance, Drama', 'Dito Montiel, Stefan Czapsky, Mic Rodgers', 'Robert Munic, Dito Montiel', 'Channing Tatum, Terrence Howard, Zulay Henao, Roger Guenveur Smith, Brian J. White, Angelic Zambrana, Michael Rivera, Flaco Navaja', 'PG-13', 'Small-town boy Shawn MacArthur has come to New York City with nothing. Barely earning a living selling counterfeit goods on the streets, his luck changes when scam artist Harvey Boarden sees that he has a natural talent for streetfighting. When Harvey offers Shawn help at making the real cash, the two form an uneasy partnership.', 'Small-town boy Shawn MacArthur has come to New York City with nothing. Barely earning a living selling counterfeit goods on the streets, his luck changes when scam artist Harvey Boarden sees that he has a natural talent for streetfighting. When Harvey offers Shawn help at making the real cash, the two form an uneasy partnership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP1uogi5Gjnf6ybSN10lyDpqDlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17336'),
  ('463677310797688181', 'Fighting Back', 1982, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Lewis Teague, Deborah L. Marrs, Alan Gibbs', 'Thomas Hedley Jr., David Zelag Goodman', 'Tom Skerritt, Patti LuPone, Michael Sarrazin, Yaphet Kotto, David Rasche, Jim Lovelett, Joseph Ragno, Frank Sivero', 'R', 'An Italian deli owner forms a vigilante group to rid his Philadelphia neighborhood of street punks.', 'An Italian deli owner forms a vigilante group to rid his Philadelphia neighborhood of street punks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltJD95v3n6nwgxyueNrpVXCScDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103210'),
  ('308048639315240183', 'Fighting Caravans', 1931, 'Action, Western, Romance', 'David Burton, Otto Brower, Lee Garmes', 'Keene Thompson', 'Gary Cooper, Lili Damita, Ernest Torrence, Tully Marshall, Fred Kohler, Eugene Pallette, Roy Stewart, May Boley', null, 'Clint Belmet is a bit of a firebrand and is sentenced to at least 30 days in jail, but his partners, Bill Jackson and Jim Bridger talk a sympathetic Frenchwoman named Felice into telling the bumbling, drunken marshal that Clint had married her the previous night. Clint is released so he can accompany Felice on the wagon train heading west to California.', 'Clint Belmet is a bit of a firebrand and is sentenced to at least 30 days in jail, but his partners, Bill Jackson and Jim Bridger talk a sympathetic Frenchwoman named Felice into telling the bumbling, drunken marshal that Clint had married her the previous night. Clint is released so he can accompany Felice on the wagon train heading west to California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvkwH2nYu0yFMdJYyU1Ie93s2Wo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110659'),
  ('879607299580279717', 'Fighting Elegy', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama, Action', 'Seijun Suzuki, Kenji Hagiwara, Masami Kuzū', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Hideki Takahashi, Yūsuke Kawazu, Takeshi Katō, Isao Tamagawa, Kayo Matsuo, Junko Asano, Keiichi Ishikawa, Akira Takahashi', null, 'Kiroku boards with a Roman Catholic family and falls for the daughter Michiko. He ignores his feelings, joins a gang, gets in fights and, eventually, becomes involved with the radical Kita Ikki group.', 'Kiroku boards with a Roman Catholic family and falls for the daughter Michiko. He ignores his feelings, joins a gang, gets in fights and, eventually, becomes involved with the radical Kita Ikki group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6EZUUvfdKWlvfqDXrGCS2Rmb1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42721'),
  ('860328134760947164', 'Fighting Friends', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Hideo Shigehara', 'Kōgo Noda', 'Atsushi Watanabe, Hisao Yoshitani, Eiko Takamatsu, Ichiro Yuki, Ikkō Ōkuni, Tomoko Naniwa, Nobuko Wakaba', null, 'Two friends accidentally run into a young, homeless woman, so they take her in.', 'Two friends accidentally run into a young, homeless woman, so they take her in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ihZfBpLEwyPppuPRqFFhvQbwPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49466'),
  ('199689533633978100', 'Fighting Mad', 1976, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Michael W. Watkins, Jonathan Demme, Evelyn Purcell', 'Jonathan Demme', 'Peter Fonda, Gino Franco, Harry Northup, Philip Carey, Noble Willingham, John Doucette, Scott Glenn, Lynn Lowry', 'R', 'An evil corporation tries to pressure a bunch of Arkansas farmers and ranchers to sell their land so they can strip-mine it for coal. The fiercely proud and stubborn Hunter family refuse to give in. This leads to a bitter conflict that results in several casualties. Eventually the take-charge no-nonsense Tom Hunter exacts a harsh revenge on the villains with the help of his bow and arrow.', 'An evil corporation tries to pressure a bunch of Arkansas farmers and ranchers to sell their land so they can strip-mine it for coal. The fiercely proud and stubborn Hunter family refuse to give in. This leads to a bitter conflict that results in several casualties. Eventually the take-charge no-nonsense Tom Hunter exacts a harsh revenge on the villains with the help of his bow and arrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4ctDlCJDctBq5bBJ9aBdOQu9pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86209'),
  ('763065773402831083', 'Fighting Man of the Plains', 1949, 'Action, Romance, Western', 'Fred Jackman Jr., William Kissell, Edwin L. Marin', 'Frank Gruber', 'Randolph Scott, Bill Williams, Victor Jory, Jane Nigh, Douglas Kennedy, Joan Taylor, Berry Kroeger, Rhys Williams', 'NR', 'Former bandit Jim Dancer becomes marshal of a Kansas town and cleans up the criminal element - with the help of his old pal, Jesse James.', 'Former bandit Jim Dancer becomes marshal of a Kansas town and cleans up the criminal element - with the help of his old pal, Jesse James.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pj2EK7dLpekIVCQzn533AJHE1rH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177870'),
  ('1126159643257699053', 'Fighting Spirit - Mashiba vs. Kimura', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Action, TV Movie', 'Ichiro Uno, Hitoshi Nanba', 'Tatsuhiko Urahata', 'Keiji Fujiwara, Wataru Takagi, Masahiko Tanaka, Kohei Kiyasu, Rikiya Koyama, Kenji Utsumi, Tomokazu Seki, Sanae Kobayashi', null, 'Kimura finally has his championship match. It takes place at the annual champion carnival. But now he must face the intense champion, Mashiba for the Junior Lightweight championship.', 'Kimura finally has his championship match. It takes place at the annual champion carnival. But now he must face the intense champion, Mashiba for the Junior Lightweight championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UNq2kogJ0fNA6TfFJdJt0PXOwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45288'),
  ('996012129905603883', 'Fighting Spirit: Champion Road', 2003, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Satoshi Nishimura, Takahiro Miyata', 'Kazuyuki Fudeyasu', 'Kohei Kiyasu, Rikiya Koyama, Kenji Utsumi, Masaya Onosaka, Tomokazu Seki, Wataru Takagi, Masahiro Tanaka, Keiji Fujiwara', null, 'Makunouchi Ippo is the new Featherweight champion of Japan and is now ready for his first title defense. His opponent, the former Jr. Featherweight champion and a medical student, Sanada Kazuki. In addition to this feud, Sanada is being coached by Kamogawa''s former rival, Hama Dankichi. What makes things worse is that Sanada works at the same hospital where Kumi is a nurse at and everybody at the hospital wants Sanada to win. Not only does Ippo have to defend his title, he has to reclaim his love.', 'Makunouchi Ippo is the new Featherweight champion of Japan and is now ready for his first title defense. His opponent, the former Jr. Featherweight champion and a medical student, Sanada Kazuki. In addition to this feud, Sanada is being coached by Kamogawa''s former rival, Hama Dankichi. What makes things worse is that Sanada works at the same hospital where Kumi is a nurse at and everybody at the hospital wants Sanada to win. Not only does Ippo have to defend his title, he has to reclaim his love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OEX6C9h85Hg7rtsCBKIwyrpoRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45287'),
  ('652485432329390369', 'Fighting with My Family', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Alexa Sheehan, Sam Dawking, Stephen Merchant', 'Stephen Merchant', 'Florence Pugh, Lena Headey, Nick Frost, Vince Vaughn, Jack Lowden, Dwayne Johnson, Thea Trinidad, Aqueela Zoll', 'PG-13', 'Born into a tight-knit wrestling family, Paige and her brother Zak are ecstatic when they get the once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to try out for the WWE. But when only Paige earns a spot in the competitive training program, she must leave her loved ones behind and face this new cutthroat world alone. Paige''s journey pushes her to dig deep and ultimately prove to the world that what makes her different is the very thing that can make her a star.', 'Born into a tight-knit wrestling family, Paige and her brother Zak are ecstatic when they get the once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to try out for the WWE. But when only Paige earns a spot in the competitive training program, she must leave her loved ones behind and face this new cutthroat world alone. Paige''s journey pushes her to dig deep and ultimately prove to the world that what makes her different is the very thing that can make her a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fU4UrY5tTAYAXIzFs7oR9BK5Cqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445629'),
  ('325438260253939206', 'Figures in a Landscape', 1970, 'Thriller, Action', 'Joseph Losey, Peter Suschitzky, Guy Tabary', 'Robert Shaw', 'Robert Shaw, Malcolm McDowell, Henry Woolf, Christopher Malcolm, Andy Bradford, Warwick Sims, Roger Lloyd Pack, Robert East', 'R', 'Two escaped convicts are on the run in an unnamed Latin American country. But everywhere they go, they are followed and hounded by a menacing black helicopter.', 'Two escaped convicts are on the run in an unnamed Latin American country. But everywhere they go, they are followed and hounded by a menacing black helicopter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOzYMaBRe2OeLQHMnjKUlDVQAaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107327'),
  ('330772503789489436', 'File 253', 2015, 'Horror', 'Roque Falabella, Joseph Hemsani Levy, Abe Rosenberg Fishbein', 'Joseph Hemsani Levy, Abe Rosenberg Fishbein', 'Anna Cetti, Mario Escalante, Michel Chauvet, Juan Luis Tovar', null, 'In 2013 a psychiatric clinic which served for more than 50 years caring for patients in Mexico City was demolished. A few months before its demolition, four young men came to investigate the clinic, determined to discover the truth about rumors of strange and paranormal events, recording everything with which they encounter. Today, the whereabouts of these four young men are unknown, remaining only fragments of their recordings.', 'In 2013 a psychiatric clinic which served for more than 50 years caring for patients in Mexico City was demolished. A few months before its demolition, four young men came to investigate the clinic, determined to discover the truth about rumors of strange and paranormal events, recording everything with which they encounter. Today, the whereabouts of these four young men are unknown, remaining only fragments of their recordings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15uFXE2wTPfPsjxzgm3DYp2TehQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317903'),
  ('475250945747241414', 'File of Attempted Murder', 2010, 'War, History, Drama', 'Jorge Fons', 'Vicente Leñero, Fernando Javier León Rodríguez, Jorge Fons', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, José María Yázpik, Julio Bracho, Irene Azuela, Arturo Beristáin, Salvador Sánchez, José María de Tavira, María Rojo', null, 'Tells the story behind an assassination attempt perpetrated in 1897, by a dipsomaniac man, against the President of the Mexican Republic, General Porfirio Diaz.', 'Tells the story behind an assassination attempt perpetrated in 1897, by a dipsomaniac man, against the President of the Mexican Republic, General Porfirio Diaz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/622Gs7zaK3tIDXzAYuR4xHSgaAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183231'),
  ('89359583526077779', 'Filet Meow', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Abe Levitow', null, null, null, 'Perhaps because he''s grown weary of chasing Jerry, Tom sets his sights on the house''s goldfish. But the female goldfish is a friend of Jerry''s, and the little mouse has a crush on her. When Jerry gets involved to rescue his friend, the usual confrontations with Tom begin.', 'Perhaps because he''s grown weary of chasing Jerry, Tom sets his sights on the house''s goldfish. But the female goldfish is a friend of Jerry''s, and the little mouse has a crush on her. When Jerry gets involved to rescue his friend, the usual confrontations with Tom begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1JxCznkDGef1U4ZPlIjNPyrFNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234321'),
  ('55159852334608255', 'Filibus', 1915, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Mario Roncoroni', 'Giovanni Bertinetti', 'Valeria Creti, Cristina Ruspoli, Giovanni Spano, Mario Mariani, Filippo Vallino', null, 'The mysterious air pirate Filibus steals from the rich and then retreats to the safety of her airship, which is manned by a staff of mask-wearing lackeys who instantly obey her every command. When an esteemed detective sets out to investigate the thefts, Filibus attempts to frame him as the burglar, while also slipping between male and female disguises to romance the detective''s sister.', 'The mysterious air pirate Filibus steals from the rich and then retreats to the safety of her airship, which is manned by a staff of mask-wearing lackeys who instantly obey her every command. When an esteemed detective sets out to investigate the thefts, Filibus attempts to frame him as the burglar, while also slipping between male and female disguises to romance the detective''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLIHytkdr4MX2YRD8pvZsDIk0Iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207036'),
  ('838952515164326313', 'Filip', 2023, 'Drama, History, War', 'Michał Kwieciński, Michał Sobociński, Marcin Kasiński', 'Michał Kwieciński, Michał Rosa', 'Eryk Kulm, Victor Meutelet, Caroline Hartig, Zoë Straub, Sandra Drzymalska, Maja Szopa, Gabriel Raab, Bohdan Graczyk', 'R', 'During World War II, a Polish food server at a luxury German hotel tempts fate as he romances local women while hiding his Jewish identity.', 'During World War II, a Polish food server at a luxury German hotel tempts fate as he romances local women while hiding his Jewish identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tu8XMqMlAmNnBCo1xQ0IVj34wxz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999125'),
  ('101224354382559534', 'Filipiñana', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Rafael Manuel', 'Rafael Manuel', 'Jorrybell Agoto, Teroy Guzman, Nour Hooshmand, Carlos Siguion-Reyna, Sunshine Teodoro', null, 'Isabel feels strangely drawn to Dr. Palanca, the president of the country club where she works. However, after piecing together a violent picture of what lies beneath the club’s pristine surface, she realizes that what began as an innocent infatuation is actually rooted in a sinister shared history.', 'Isabel feels strangely drawn to Dr. Palanca, the president of the country club where she works. However, after piecing together a violent picture of what lies beneath the club’s pristine surface, she realizes that what began as an innocent infatuation is actually rooted in a sinister shared history.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F64hnrTmeJEvUYoJyuOM7taE3CqT.jpg', 'plex:movie:filipinana-2026-1'),
  ('691386435280125154', 'Fill ''er Up with Super', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Jean-François Robin, Alain Cavalier', 'Etienne Chicot, Patrick Bouchitey, Bernard Crombey', 'Patrick Bouchitey, Etienne Chicot, Bernard Crombey, Xavier Saint-Macary, Catherine Meurisse, Valérie Quennessen, Nathalie Baye, Béatrice Agenin', null, 'When a young auto salesman is forced to give up a vacation with his wife in order to drive a big American car to its new owner who lives on the Riviera, he makes the best of things. First, he gets and old friend to ride along with him. Then, the two of them are joined by another pair of men who want to ride south.', 'When a young auto salesman is forced to give up a vacation with his wife in order to drive a big American car to its new owner who lives on the Riviera, he makes the best of things. First, he gets and old friend to ride along with him. Then, the two of them are joined by another pair of men who want to ride south.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGiF3i4V4XsiellWB5LgWtSBgrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76410'),
  ('130526012332433071', 'Fill Me with Life', 2000, 'Drama', 'Josetxo San Mateo, Juan Molina', 'Mónica Pérez Capilla, Ricardo González', 'Pilar López de Ayala, Unax Ugalde, Beatriz Argüello, Pilar Barrera, Fede Celada, Antonio Dechent, Carlos Kaniowsky, Paca Lorite', null, 'An urban drama of love and marginality, drugs and falls into the abyss. This is where Josetxo San Mateo''s long-distance survey begins when David, a chic who lives on the street for vocation, begins to see María. One day she decided to approach her and enter a poem that she wrote for her: Báilame el agua. She doesn''t hesitate to follow him. It''s not easy to live on the street: bad companies, drugs, delinquency, including prostitution, become road workers.', 'An urban drama of love and marginality, drugs and falls into the abyss. This is where Josetxo San Mateo''s long-distance survey begins when David, a chic who lives on the street for vocation, begins to see María. One day she decided to approach her and enter a poem that she wrote for her: Báilame el agua. She doesn''t hesitate to follow him. It''s not easy to live on the street: bad companies, drugs, delinquency, including prostitution, become road workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfaPpmm3RxLBCsNPBEGm0TSzMkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86057'),
  ('566817413566486678', 'Fill the Void', 2012, 'Drama', 'Rama Burshtein, Asaf Sudry', 'Rama Burshtein', 'Hadas Yaron, Yiftach Klein, Renana Raz, Irit Sheleg, Razia Israeli, Hila Feldman', 'PG', 'Eighteen-year-old Shira is the youngest daughter of the Mendelman family. She is about to be married off to a promising young man of the same age and background. It is a dream come true, and Shira feels prepared and excited. On Purim, her twenty-eight-year-old sister, Esther, dies while giving birth to her first child, Mordechay. The pain and grief that overwhelm the family postpone Shira''s promised match. Everything changes when a match is proposed to Yochay-Esther''s late husband-to a widow from Belgium. Yochay feels it''s too early, although he realizes that sooner or later he must seriously consider getting married again. When the girls'' mother finds out that Yochay may marry the widow and move to Belgium with her only grandchild, she proposes a match between Shira and the widower. Shira will have to choose between her heart''s wish and her family duty. She will find out that the void which she must choose exists only within her heart.', 'Eighteen-year-old Shira is the youngest daughter of the Mendelman family. She is about to be married off to a promising young man of the same age and background. It is a dream come true, and Shira feels prepared and excited. On Purim, her twenty-eight-year-old sister, Esther, dies while giving birth to her first child, Mordechay. The pain and grief that overwhelm the family postpone Shira''s promised match. Everything changes when a match is proposed to Yochay-Esther''s late husband-to a widow from Belgium. Yochay feels it''s too early, although he realizes that sooner or later he must seriously consider getting married again. When the girls'' mother finds out that Yochay may marry the widow and move to Belgium with her only grandchild, she proposes a match between Shira and the widower. Shira will have to choose between her heart''s wish and her family duty. She will find out that the void which she must choose exists only within her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zE51xR2MFxloryI4WrIBenT5a9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122088'),
  ('602460115072561340', 'Film', 1965, 'Drama', 'Alan Schneider, Boris Kaufman, Samuel Beckett', 'Samuel Beckett', 'Buster Keaton, Nell Harrison, James Karen, Susan Reed', null, 'A man attempts to evade observation by an all-seeing eye.', 'A man attempts to evade observation by an all-seeing eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2o6ybhhxfhY40afRNKUNHICZsTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45592'),
  ('313716347965870840', 'Film', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Mario Schifano', null, 'Annie Girardot, Renato Salvatori, Keith Richards, Anna Carini', null, 'Before the three feature films, Mario Schifano directs the camera towards the people around him to create real film diaries. His friends, his time partner and the artists he frequented are portrayed in their everyday life or object of the mechanical gaze of the camera, a filter through which to look at the outside world.', 'Before the three feature films, Mario Schifano directs the camera towards the people around him to create real film diaries. His friends, his time partner and the artists he frequented are portrayed in their everyday life or object of the mechanical gaze of the camera, a filter through which to look at the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fMNYvC8RnyQCfos8O5he4Og5tM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999123'),
  ('1031841753386748537', 'Film', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Kerem Topuz', 'Kerem Topuz', 'İlker Savaşkurt, Cumali Karakaya, Özgür Emre Yıldırım, Öznur Kula', null, 'Amateur filmmaker Kemal Mutlu captures scenes of everyday life with plans of making a film. He lives with his housemate Nuri in a small flat in Istanbul. One day,Nuri''s friend from orphanage, Izzet, comes to visit unannounced. Just out of prison, Izzet''s colorful character grabs Kemal''s attention, and he decides to make a film about him. Unfortunately, it soon turns out that underneath his friendly exterior, Izzet is a psychopath. When he is refused entry into a bar, he gets in by force and kidnaps actress Oznur Kula. Kemal is happy to have found an actress to star in his film, however things soon get out of control as Izzet''s sick plans unfold.', 'Amateur filmmaker Kemal Mutlu captures scenes of everyday life with plans of making a film. He lives with his housemate Nuri in a small flat in Istanbul. One day,Nuri''s friend from orphanage, Izzet, comes to visit unannounced. Just out of prison, Izzet''s colorful character grabs Kemal''s attention, and he decides to make a film about him. Unfortunately, it soon turns out that underneath his friendly exterior, Izzet is a psychopath. When he is refused entry into a bar, he gets in by force and kidnaps actress Oznur Kula. Kemal is happy to have found an actress to star in his film, however things soon get out of control as Izzet''s sick plans unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFHYRkUGtX8xyEAQQTlqWSeXuyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593831'),
  ('993969909800717360', 'Film Geek', 2005, 'Comedy', 'James Westby, Jason Hughes', 'James Westby', 'Melik Malkasian, Ritah Parrish, John Breen, Dennis Adkins, Tara Walker, Taylor Nida, Tyler Gannon, Leslie Taylor', null, 'The story of Scotty Pelk, a socially inept video store clerk who gets fired from his job and becomes a sensation as an online film critic.', 'The story of Scotty Pelk, a socially inept video store clerk who gets fired from his job and becomes a sensation as an online film critic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNkj69CCl4GZuLqVpPTEugccn7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38908'),
  ('931944158015703103', 'Film in Which There Appear Edge Lettering, Sprocket Holes, Dirt Particles, Etc.', 1966, null, 'Owen Land', null, null, null, 'Film in Which There Appear... is a six-minute loop of the double-printed image of a "China girl" or "Shirley card", her image off-center, making visible the sprocket holes and edge lettering on the film. According to Land, within the loop, "no development in the dramatic or musical sense" occurs. Fred Camper described Film in Which There Appear... as "a kind of Duchampian found object, a [...] film that focuses attention on the medium and the viewer." There also exists a 20-minute "widescreen version" involving two prints of the film projected side-by-side, with the left print flipped horizontally so that the "China girl" forms an almost complete face in the center.', 'Film in Which There Appear... is a six-minute loop of the double-printed image of a "China girl" or "Shirley card", her image off-center, making visible the sprocket holes and edge lettering on the film. According to Land, within the loop, "no development in the dramatic or musical sense" occurs. Fred Camper described Film in Which There Appear... as "a kind of Duchampian found object, a [...] film that focuses attention on the medium and the viewer." There also exists a 20-minute "widescreen version" involving two prints of the film projected side-by-side, with the left print flipped horizontally so that the "China girl" forms an almost complete face in the center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eP3CXdZrqggV9zx50jtINGelR2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115022'),
  ('492242704066022554', 'Film Noir', 2007, 'Mystery, Animation, Crime', 'D. Jud Jones, Risto Topaloski', 'D. Jud Jones', 'Mark Keller, Bettina Devin, Roger L. Jackson, Jeff Atik', null, 'Private detective Sam Ruben''s clever plan falls apart with the onset of amnesia. Everyone is trying to kill him and he doesn''t know why. The classic film noir milieu now comes to you in the form of an animated feature.', 'Private detective Sam Ruben''s clever plan falls apart with the onset of amnesia. Everyone is trying to kill him and he doesn''t know why. The classic film noir milieu now comes to you in the form of an animated feature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRhkpxct1dNv8vot6f59A241sfW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14233'),
  ('94968350719777134', 'Film Socialisme', 2010, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Fabrice Aragno, Paul Grivas', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Catherine Tanvier, Christian Sinniger, Jean-Marc Stehlé, Patti Smith, Robert Maloubier, Alain Badiou, Nadège Beausson-Diagne, Élisabeth Vitali', null, 'A symphony in three movements. Things such as a Mediterranean cruise, numerous conversations, in numerous languages, between the passengers, almost all of whom are on holiday... Our Europe. At night, a sister and her younger brother have summoned their parents to appear before the court of their childhood. The children demand serious explanations of the themes of Liberty, Equality and Fraternity. Our humanities. Visits to six sites of true or false myths: Egypt, Palestine, Odessa, Hellas, Naples and Barcelona.', 'A symphony in three movements. Things such as a Mediterranean cruise, numerous conversations, in numerous languages, between the passengers, almost all of whom are on holiday... Our Europe. At night, a sister and her younger brother have summoned their parents to appear before the court of their childhood. The children demand serious explanations of the themes of Liberty, Equality and Fraternity. Our humanities. Visits to six sites of true or false myths: Egypt, Palestine, Odessa, Hellas, Naples and Barcelona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uokQX94huM68TWyGa0Vm3HlLolR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54083'),
  ('377435110476236789', 'Film Stars Don''t Die in Liverpool', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Susannah Brough, Lucy Eaton-Whitfield, Helen Fraser', 'Peter Turner', 'Annette Bening, Jamie Bell, Julie Walters, Stephen Graham, Kenneth Cranham, Leanne Best, Vanessa Redgrave, Frances Barber', null, 'Liverpool, 1978: What starts as a vibrant affair between a legendary femme-fatale, the eccentric Academy Award-winning actress Gloria Grahame, and her young lover, British actor Peter Turner, quickly grows into a deeper relationship, with Turner being the person Gloria turns to for comfort.', 'Liverpool, 1978: What starts as a vibrant affair between a legendary femme-fatale, the eccentric Academy Award-winning actress Gloria Grahame, and her young lover, British actor Peter Turner, quickly grows into a deeper relationship, with Turner being the person Gloria turns to for comfort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87oy4bxwkhmb4Jb3MRvosvd9NOX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398174'),
  ('33501264781810525', 'Film Study', 1926, 'Animation', 'Hans Richter', 'Hans Richter', 'Stella Simon', null, 'Entertaining Dadaist experimental short, similar to Man Ray''s work, full of shifting geometric shapes, stock footage of seagulls, flying eyeballs, and glaring floating heads.', 'Entertaining Dadaist experimental short, similar to Man Ray''s work, full of shifting geometric shapes, stock footage of seagulls, flying eyeballs, and glaring floating heads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OnwbhC4XxmCfp8eDwrY31tDAsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184882'),
  ('95487813765334162', 'Film, Film, Film', 1968, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Tatyana Dombrovskaya, Boris Kotov', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Vladimir Golovanov', 'Aleksey Polevoy, Georgiy Vitsin', null, 'The trials and tribulations of putting a feature film together.', 'The trials and tribulations of putting a feature film together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ua8TdLuwJP5E5YE22FlrklVAtH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90001'),
  ('399389086384316667', 'Filme da Treta', 2006, 'Comedy', 'José Sacramento', 'Filipe Homem Fonseca, Eduardo Madeira', 'José Pedro Gomes, António Feio, Maria Rueff, José Raposo, Marco Horácio, Joaquim Nicolau, António Melo, Teresa Madruga', null, 'After having an "apocalyptic vision" in a peep-show cabin, Zezé decides to enter in the Order of the Caracolários Descalços. Tóni visits his friend, that is in a monastery. The reencounter of these old friends makes them go back in time and remember their adventures...', 'After having an "apocalyptic vision" in a peep-show cabin, Zezé decides to enter in the Order of the Caracolários Descalços. Tóni visits his friend, that is in a monastery. The reencounter of these old friends makes them go back in time and remember their adventures...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKEdoBQZXuCdCYnBUz0M6oa8Ow1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42681'),
  ('841435476346238372', 'Filming Othello', 1979, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Orson Welles, Gary Graver', 'Orson Welles', 'Orson Welles, Robert Coote, Hilton Edwards, Micheál Mac Liammóir', null, 'Filming Othello is a 1978 documentary film directed by and starring Orson Welles about the making of his award-winning 1952 production Othello. The film, which was produced for West German television, was the last completed feature film directed by Welles.', 'Filming Othello is a 1978 documentary film directed by and starring Orson Welles about the making of his award-winning 1952 production Othello. The film, which was produced for West German television, was the last completed feature film directed by Welles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRZj5fHA4ecOiQ0FwVFYnXJjz7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116800'),
  ('1148869247294914774', 'Filmistaan', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Nitin Kakkar', 'Nitin Kakkar', 'Sharib Hashmi, Kumud Mishra, Gopal Datt, Inaamulhaq', null, 'Sunny is struggling to make a living in the Bollywood industry. He takes a job as assistant director (the operative word being assistant) for an American documentary filmmaking team, but during filming in the Indian Rajasthan province he is kidnapped by Pakistani terrorists – and detained in a small village in Pakistan. The situation is delicate, but the villagers share Sunny''s passion for Bollywood film, and little by little the hostage and the guardians come to understand each other. Eventually, Sunny lays a plan to escape with the help of the villagers.', 'Sunny is struggling to make a living in the Bollywood industry. He takes a job as assistant director (the operative word being assistant) for an American documentary filmmaking team, but during filming in the Indian Rajasthan province he is kidnapped by Pakistani terrorists – and detained in a small village in Pakistan. The situation is delicate, but the villagers share Sunny''s passion for Bollywood film, and little by little the hostage and the guardians come to understand each other. Eventually, Sunny lays a plan to escape with the help of the villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WpoYfif0kxQE9ibeXnLKIYCAn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161064'),
  ('669116017147436613', 'Filmlovers!', 2025, 'Drama', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Noé Bach, Guillaume Bonnier', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Fanny Burdino', 'Louis Birman, Dominique Païni, Clément Hervieu-Léger, Françoise Lebrun, Sandra Laugier, Olga Milshtein, Milo Machado-Graner, Margaux Mussano', null, 'What does it mean, to go to the movies? Why have people been going for over one hundred years? I set out to celebrate movie theaters and their manifold magic. So I walked in the footsteps of young Paul Dédalus, as if in a filmgoer’s coming-of-age story. Memories, fiction, discoveries come together in an irrepressible torrent of pictures.', 'What does it mean, to go to the movies? Why have people been going for over one hundred years? I set out to celebrate movie theaters and their manifold magic. So I walked in the footsteps of young Paul Dédalus, as if in a filmgoer’s coming-of-age story. Memories, fiction, discoveries come together in an irrepressible torrent of pictures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLRYPH6Yzj5ezrINCoeAuYS9Drz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084808'),
  ('742305217190751630', 'Filmpje!', 1995, 'Comedy, Action', 'Paul Ruven, Theo Bierkens', 'Paul Ruven, Paul de Leeuw', 'Paul de Leeuw, Rijk de Gooyer, Olga Zuiderhoek, Porgy Franssen, Willeke Alberti, Carry Tefsen, Debbie Korper, Kees Prins', null, 'Bob and Annie separate. After the court case Annie gives Bob two airline tickets for a tropical island to save their relationship. However, Bob takes someone else with him on holiday: Carmen, the daughter of Mafioso Don Gorgonzola. Annie lags behind in Holland, where she falls in love again with other men.', 'Bob and Annie separate. After the court case Annie gives Bob two airline tickets for a tropical island to save their relationship. However, Bob takes someone else with him on holiday: Carmen, the daughter of Mafioso Don Gorgonzola. Annie lags behind in Holland, where she falls in love again with other men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ajYLWglNAfdORxRoHRbK1ZtAQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49323'),
  ('992398528554186305', 'Filmworker', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Tony Zierra, Tony Zierra', null, 'Leon Vitali, Ryan O''Neal, Danny Lloyd, Matthew Modine, R. Lee Ermey, Stellan Skarsgård, Marie Richardson, Tim Colceri', null, 'The story of Leon Vitali, who surrendered his promising acting career to become Stanley Kubrick''s devoted right-hand man.', 'The story of Leon Vitali, who surrendered his promising acting career to become Stanley Kubrick''s devoted right-hand man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmZDdrb0nwrV6UMNQQWQh60t7pq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458080'),
  ('182545302857633822', 'Filth', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Jon S. Baird, Matthew Jensen, Stina Elinderson', 'Jon S. Baird', 'James McAvoy, Jamie Bell, Eddie Marsan, Imogen Poots, Brian McCardie, Emun Elliott, Gary Lewis, John Sessions', 'R', 'A bigoted junkie cop suffering from borderline personality disorder and drug addiction manipulates and hallucinates his way in a bid to secure promotion.', 'A bigoted junkie cop suffering from borderline personality disorder and drug addiction manipulates and hallucinates his way in a bid to secure promotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeIodobH6Z8jvtHhqRSrqYrxGSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85889'),
  ('919058190813790489', 'Filth and Wisdom', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Madonna, Tim Maurice-Jones', 'Dan Cadan, Madonna', 'Eugene Hutz, Holly Weston, Vicky McClure, Richard E. Grant, Inder Manocha, Clare Wilkie, Elliot Levey, Stephen Graham', null, 'Filth & Wisdom is a poignant view of the lives of three not quite ordinary friends settled into meaningless jobs that barely keep them afloat while helping to finance their dreams of bigger and brighter futures. Their unique yet universal stories capture their struggles that are at turns funny and tragic but always brutally honest. Their intertwined lives explore the inevitable: a path paved with filth will often end in wisdom and one paved with wisdom will often end in filth.', 'Filth & Wisdom is a poignant view of the lives of three not quite ordinary friends settled into meaningless jobs that barely keep them afloat while helping to finance their dreams of bigger and brighter futures. Their unique yet universal stories capture their struggles that are at turns funny and tragic but always brutally honest. Their intertwined lives explore the inevitable: a path paved with filth will often end in wisdom and one paved with wisdom will often end in filth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viVPhoFlBftjPjlEdjDhzjervU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18548'),
  ('571855925456920483', 'Filumena Marturano', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Leonida Barboni, Augusto Carloni, Eduardo De Filippo', 'Piero Tellini, Eduardo De Filippo', 'Titina De Filippo, Eduardo De Filippo, Tina Pica, Tamara Lees, Luigi De Filippo, Gianni Musy, Aldo Giuffrè, Carlo Pennetti', null, 'Filumena, an ex-prostitute and for decades Domenico Soriano''s lover, discovers that he intends to get married and so pretends to be on the verge of death in order to get him to marry her instead.', 'Filumena, an ex-prostitute and for decades Domenico Soriano''s lover, discovers that he intends to get married and so pretends to be on the verge of death in order to get him to marry her instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4aUc3uFhR5MC4v1X5m65i14CYZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262987'),
  ('673592637797044308', 'Filumena Marturano', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Andrea Zuliani, Francesco Amato, Gherardo Gossi', 'Francesco Amato, Massimo Gaudioso, Filippo Gili', 'Vanessa Scalera, Massimiliano Gallo, Nunzia Schiano, Marcello Romolo, Anna Iodice, Vittorio Viviani, Massimiliano Caiazzo, Francesco Russo', null, 'Filumena has lived for years with a wealthy pastry chef. She forces him to marry her, but he soon asks to annul the marriage. She then reveals that one of her children is his, making him obsessed to know which one.', 'Filumena has lived for years with a wealthy pastry chef. She forces him to marry her, but he soon asks to annul the marriage. She then reveals that one of her children is his, making him obsessed to know which one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8bYay29bQIbtbqDHLZaj9McvlK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061593'),
  ('378191528045126805', 'Fin''n Catty', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Robert C. Bruce', null, '"As everyone knows," the narrator begins, "goldfish must have water... and cats hate water." And so it goes.', '"As everyone knows," the narrator begins, "goldfish must have water... and cats hate water." And so it goes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIu2qdU2I4NAdh2zMoKubcRFsGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236696'),
  ('248395085667297599', 'Final', 2001, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Campbell Scott, Dan Gillham', 'Bruce McIntosh', 'Denis Leary, Hope Davis, Marin Hinkle, Earl Hindman, J.C. MacKenzie, Jim Gaffigan, Jim Hornyak, Anthony Pettine', 'R', 'Waking up in a nearly empty room, Bill has strange recollections of his father''s death and a car crash, and occasional paranoid delusions. Ann, a psychologist, tries to help him make sense of it all.', 'Waking up in a nearly empty room, Bill has strange recollections of his father''s death and a car crash, and occasional paranoid delusions. Ann, a psychologist, tries to help him make sense of it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubpAhxDc7E42O6QaaBtNR10ZwWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21176'),
