  ('848294212112938997', 'Final Cut', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dominic Anciano, Ray Burdis, John Ward', 'Ray Burdis, Dominic Anciano', 'Jude Law, Sadie Frost, John Beckett, Ray Winstone, William Scully, Mark Burdis, Perry Benson, Lisa Marsh', null, 'A group of friends gather for a wake, and are shown a video shot by Jude and starring them before he dies. Things go rapidly downhill.', 'A group of friends gather for a wake, and are shown a video shot by Jude and starring them before he dies. Things go rapidly downhill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckeyOoyGjcnsEoCXdMPOFW5Rzd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47072'),
  ('494572328656175585', 'Final Cut', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Pepita Merret, Julien Decoin, Arthur Dezanneau', 'Ryoichi Wada, Shinichiro Ueda, Michel Hazanavicius', 'Romain Duris, Bérénice Bejo, Grégory Gadebois, Finnegan Oldfield, Matilda Lutz, Raphaël Quenard, Luàna Bajrami, Sébastien Chassagne', 'NR', 'Things go badly for a small film crew shooting a low-budget zombie movie when they are attacked by real zombies.', 'Things go badly for a small film crew shooting a low-budget zombie movie when they are attacked by real zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBUdnylt2a84PwGIPQcZDkCVB5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852438'),
  ('837039203533196828', 'Final Cut: Ladies and Gentlemen', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'György Pálfi', 'Zsófia Ruttkay, György Pálfi', 'Brigitte Bardot, Alain Delon, Bruno Ganz, Greta Garbo, Rita Hayworth, Woody Allen, Julie Andrews, Nicolas Cage', null, 'A film where anything can happen - the hero and the heroine changes their faces, age, look, names, and so on. The only same thing: The love between man and woman... in an archetypical love story cut from 500 classics from all around the world.', 'A film where anything can happen - the hero and the heroine changes their faces, age, look, names, and so on. The only same thing: The love between man and woman... in an archetypical love story cut from 500 classics from all around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoMO14iZVBTILw1BppQu6ZHaJdA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126314'),
  ('290230707383564089', 'Final Descent', 1997, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Mike Robe, Alan Caso, Kaären F. Ochoa', null, 'Robert Urich, Annette O''Toole, John de Lancie, Jim Byrnes, Ken Pogue, Blu Mankuma, Tom McBeath, Kevin McNulty', null, 'An airliner collides with a light plane just after takeoff, causing its elevators to jam in the full climb position. It will crash as soon as the fuel runs out, unless some desperate measure succeeds in bringing the nose down.', 'An airliner collides with a light plane just after takeoff, causing its elevators to jam in the full climb position. It will crash as soon as the fuel runs out, unless some desperate measure succeeds in bringing the nose down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpGE3rSkRdojThvzBXHq7Efknvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70180'),
  ('713951131561072851', 'Final Destination', 2000, 'Horror', 'James Wong, Robert McLachlan, Bill McMahon', 'James Wong, Jeffrey Reddick, Glen Morgan', 'Devon Sawa, Ali Larter, Kerr Smith, Kristen Cloke, Daniel Roebuck, Roger Guenveur Smith, Chad Donella, Seann William Scott', 'R', 'After a teenager has a terrifying vision of him and his friends dying in a plane crash, he prevents the accident only to have Death hunt them down, one by one.', 'After a teenager has a terrifying vision of him and his friends dying in a plane crash, he prevents the accident only to have Death hunt them down, one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mXhlQMnlfvJ2frxTjZSQNnA9Vp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9532'),
  ('306609290403070537', 'Final Destination 2', 2003, 'Horror, Mystery', 'David R. Ellis, Gary Capo, Anneke Van Oort', 'Eric Bress, J. Mackye Gruber', 'Ali Larter, A. J. Cook, Michael Landes, David Paetkau, James Kirk, Lynda Boyd, Keegan Connor Tracy, Jonathan Cherry', 'R', 'When Kimberly has a violent premonition of a highway pileup she blocks the freeway, keeping a few others meant to die, safe...Or are they? The survivors mysteriously start dying and it''s up to Kimberly to stop it before she''s next.', 'When Kimberly has a violent premonition of a highway pileup she blocks the freeway, keeping a few others meant to die, safe...Or are they? The survivors mysteriously start dying and it''s up to Kimberly to stop it before she''s next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnFgxRlLTA9fDNcGXLiHmgwmIEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9358'),
  ('745607854381102946', 'Final Destination 3', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Robert McLachlan, James Wong, Catherine Ircha', 'James Wong, Glen Morgan', 'Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Ryan Merriman, Kris Lemche, Alexz Johnson, Sam Easton, Jesse Moss, Gina Holden, Texas Battle', 'R', 'High school senior Wendy''s premonition of a deadly rollercoaster ride saves her life and a lucky few, but not from death itself — which seeks out those who escaped their fate.', 'High school senior Wendy''s premonition of a deadly rollercoaster ride saves her life and a lucky few, but not from death itself — which seeks out those who escaped their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7ARuNKUGPGvkBiDtIDvAzYzonX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9286'),
  ('1121162641913629808', 'Final Destination 5', 2011, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Steven Quale, Brian Pearson, David Clarke', 'Eric Heisserer', 'Nicholas D''Agosto, Emma Bell, Miles Fisher, Ellen Wroe, Jacqueline MacInnes Wood, P.J. Byrne, Arlen Escarpeta, David Koechner', 'R', 'Death is just as omnipresent as ever, and is unleashed after one man’s premonition saves a group of coworkers from a terrifying suspension bridge collapse. But this group of unsuspecting souls was never supposed to survive, and, in a terrifying race against time, the ill-fated group frantically tries to discover a way to escape Death’s sinister agenda.', 'Death is just as omnipresent as ever, and is unleashed after one man’s premonition saves a group of coworkers from a terrifying suspension bridge collapse. But this group of unsuspecting souls was never supposed to survive, and, in a terrifying race against time, the ill-fated group frantically tries to discover a way to escape Death’s sinister agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Akx1Po4ZLetOWfYJhQf75tbhTtK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55779'),
  ('724487427615034722', 'Final Destination Bloodlines', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Adam B. Stein, Zach Lipovsky, Christian Sebaldt', 'Guy Busick, Lori Evans Taylor', 'Kaitlyn Santa Juana, Teo Briones, Rya Kihlstedt, Richard Harmon, Owen Patrick Joyner, Anna Lore, Alex Zahara, April Telek', 'R', 'Plagued by a violent recurring nightmare, college student Stefanie heads home to track down the one person who might be able to break the cycle and save her family from the grisly demise that inevitably awaits them all.', 'Plagued by a violent recurring nightmare, college student Stefanie heads home to track down the one person who might be able to break the cycle and save her family from the grisly demise that inevitably awaits them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WxhEvFsauuACfv8HyoVX6mZKFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574475'),
  ('320217040107128579', 'Final Detention', 2003, 'Action', 'Pongpinij', null, 'Lek Aiyasoon, Pirin Julajitta, Chalomjit Junkaj, Tippawan Junkate, Amie Roger, Yoko Takano, Thunyaluk Worrapimrut', null, 'Having been sentenced to death for murdering their husbands or boyfriends several women from all walks of life are transported to a notorious island prison run by cruel staff whose policies are under suspicion from a Member of Parliament. The idea being to see if they can be reformed before deciding if they should be executed. Their only way out of the living hell they are in is to escape....can they do it?', 'Having been sentenced to death for murdering their husbands or boyfriends several women from all walks of life are transported to a notorious island prison run by cruel staff whose policies are under suspicion from a Member of Parliament. The idea being to see if they can be reformed before deciding if they should be executed. Their only way out of the living hell they are in is to escape....can they do it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QfYp3CriAvf6bLH2eA5yzXFe42.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260424'),
  ('633534323179276914', 'Final Exam', 1981, 'Horror', 'Jimmy Huston, Darrell Cathcart', 'Jimmy Huston', 'Cecile Bagdadi, Joel S. Rice, Ralph Brown, DeAnna Robbins, Sherry Willis-Burch, John fallon, Terry W. Farren, Timothy L. Raynor', 'R', 'In a small college in North Carolina, only a select few students are left to take mid terms. But, when a killer strikes, it could be everyone''s final exam.', 'In a small college in North Carolina, only a select few students are left to take mid terms. But, when a killer strikes, it could be everyone''s final exam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRSF8rruLln8VVmEqgaRKlSzTcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40469'),
  ('87125995921375747', 'Final Fantasy VII: Advent Children', 2005, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tetsuya Nomura, Takeshi Nozue', 'Kazushige Nojima', 'Takahiro Sakurai, Ayumi Ito, Showtaro Morikubo, Maaya Sakamoto, Keiji Fujiwara, Taiten Kusunoki, Yuji Kishi, Shôgo Suzuki', 'PG-13', 'Two years have passed since the final battle with Sephiroth. Though Midgar, city of mako, city of prosperity, has been reduced to ruins, its people slowly but steadily walk the road to reconstruction. However, a mysterious illness called Geostigma torments them. With no cure in sight, it brings death to the afflicted, one after another, robbing the people of their fledgling hope.', 'Two years have passed since the final battle with Sephiroth. Though Midgar, city of mako, city of prosperity, has been reduced to ruins, its people slowly but steadily walk the road to reconstruction. However, a mysterious illness called Geostigma torments them. With no cure in sight, it brings death to the afflicted, one after another, robbing the people of their fledgling hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTIXM2yu8McSlcQVs1VjVSNC45x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647'),
  ('226739018033271805', 'Final Fantasy VII: Last Order', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Morio Asaka, Tetsuya Nomura, Yukihiro Masumoto', 'Kazushige Nojima, Kazuhiko Inukai', 'Kenichi Suzumura, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Ayumi Ito, Junichi Suwabe, Keiji Fujiwara, Taiten Kusunoki, Daisuke Namikawa', null, 'After the destruction of Nibelheim at the hands of Sephiroth, Zack and Cloud are on the run from Shinra Inc. As they make their way back to Midgar, they recall the horrible events that happened at Nibelheim, as well as fight for survival against Shinra.', 'After the destruction of Nibelheim at the hands of Sephiroth, Zack and Cloud are on the run from Shinra Inc. As they make their way back to Midgar, they recall the horrible events that happened at Nibelheim, as well as fight for survival against Shinra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJtM6wQOSYaCSOxccOp4aEfifsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13274'),
  ('367689034760704609', 'Final Fantasy VII: On the Way to a Smile - Episode Denzel', 2009, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Shinji Ishihira, Yoji Shimizu, Kazuo Tomizawa', 'Akio Ofuji', 'Kazumu Izawa, Banjo Ginga, Yasuyuki Kase, Yoshimitsu Shimoyama, Takako Honda, Daisuke Hirakawa, Ikuko Tani, Fumihiko Tachiki', 'PG-13', 'It''s been four years since Meteor fell on Midgar. Denzel meets Reeve at an outskirts coffee shop about joining the World Regenesis Organization. Upon the request Denzel tells Reeve about what his life was like prior to the Meteor incident.', 'It''s been four years since Meteor fell on Midgar. Denzel meets Reeve at an outskirts coffee shop about joining the World Regenesis Organization. Upon the request Denzel tells Reeve about what his life was like prior to the Meteor incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDMFbZeqwaTIrhrxwLMpjVtsbeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59300'),
  ('520539113596659985', 'Final Fantasy: The Spirits Within', 2001, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Hironobu Sakaguchi, Motonori Sakakibara, Andrew R. Jones', 'Al Reinert, Jeff Vintar', 'Ming-Na Wen, Donald Sutherland, Alec Baldwin, Ving Rhames, Steve Buscemi, Peri Gilpin, James Woods, Keith David', 'PG-13', 'Led by a strange dream, scientist Aki Ross struggles to collect the eight spirits in the hope of creating a force powerful enough to protect the planet. With the aid of the Deep Eyes Squadron and her mentor, Dr. Sid, Aki must save the Earth from its darkest hate and unleash the spirits within.', 'Led by a strange dream, scientist Aki Ross struggles to collect the eight spirits in the hope of creating a force powerful enough to protect the planet. With the aid of the Deep Eyes Squadron and her mentor, Dr. Sid, Aki must save the Earth from its darkest hate and unleash the spirits within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47b1EwFqqSWxYna7NtUM7iML4oT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2114'),
