  ('245242675853492317', 'Final Justice', 1984, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Nicholas Josef von Sternberg, Greydon Clark, Daryl Kass', 'Greydon Clark', 'Joe Don Baker, Venantino Venantini, Bill McKinney, Patrizia Pellegrino, Helena Dalli, Rossano Brazzi, Lino Grech, Tony Ellul', 'R', 'Due to his violent past, Deputy Sheriff Thomas Jefferson Geronimo III has been transferred to a rural outpost. When two thugs kill the sheriff, Geronimo shoots one of them, and the other vows revenge. Unfortunately for Geronimo, that thug turns out to be a mob boss, and the court orders Geronimo to extradite him back to his home in Sicily. When their plane is hijacked, the adversaries find their roles reversed.', 'Due to his violent past, Deputy Sheriff Thomas Jefferson Geronimo III has been transferred to a rural outpost. When two thugs kill the sheriff, Geronimo shoots one of them, and the other vows revenge. Unfortunately for Geronimo, that thug turns out to be a mob boss, and the court orders Geronimo to extradite him back to his home in Sicily. When their plane is hijacked, the adversaries find their roles reversed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b44vKrjk2f9PTYf13C3S4yJVY5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31128'),
