  ('531608031971165545', 'Find Me Guilty', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Ron Fortunato, Sidney Lumet, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Robert J. McCrea, Sidney Lumet, T.J. Mancini', 'Vin Diesel, Alex Rocco, Ron Silver, Peter Dinklage, Linus Roache, Frank Pietrangolare, Annabella Sciorra, Richard DeDomenico', 'R', 'Based on the true story of Jack DiNorscio, a mobster who defended himself in court for what would be the longest mafia trial in U.S. history.', 'Based on the true story of Jack DiNorscio, a mobster who defended himself in court for what would be the longest mafia trial in U.S. history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M0dkX7jOor7exKor1txoUl9Ynu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9950'),
  ('418316966763494524', 'Find Me That Girl', 1964, 'Music', 'Fernando Palacios, George Sherman, Antonio L. Ballesteros', 'Vicente Coello, Pedro Masó, Alfonso Paso', 'Marisol, Ramón Arcusa, Manuel de la Calva, Robert Hutton, Isabel Garcés, Juan Carlos Mareco, Perla Cristal, Ethel Rojo', null, 'Sixteen-year-old Marisol sings her way across Spain with her father, chasing dreams and survival. On a sunlit campsite in Mallorca, she meets two students and dares to perform at a bullfighting event—hoping to be discovered. When talent scout Mr. Morrison sees her spark, he whisks her into a new world of ambition and refinement, determined to transform her into “a lady with great talent.” But as Marisol rises, she must decide what she''s willing to leave behind to become the star she’s always dreamed of being.', 'Sixteen-year-old Marisol sings her way across Spain with her father, chasing dreams and survival. On a sunlit campsite in Mallorca, she meets two students and dares to perform at a bullfighting event—hoping to be discovered. When talent scout Mr. Morrison sees her spark, he whisks her into a new world of ambition and refinement, determined to transform her into “a lady with great talent.” But as Marisol rises, she must decide what she''s willing to leave behind to become the star she’s always dreamed of being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2LG7iZL8ELMKeZBjNZBTEQathQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170578'),
  ('479143379527944766', 'Find the Blackmailer', 1943, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'D. Ross Lederman, Wilbur McGaugh, James Van Trees', 'Robert E. Kent', 'Jerome Cowan, Faye Emerson, Gene Lockhart, Marjorie Hoshelle, Robert Kent, Wade Boteler, John Harmon, Lou Lubin', 'NR', 'A private eye is hired by a mayoral candidate to prevent any sort of adverse publicity. It seems that, somewhere in town, there''s a talking blackbird who insists upon saying that the candidate will commit a murder. When the killing occurs, the candidate is implicated, and the detective is off on a hectic pursuit of the incriminating crow and the actual murderer.', 'A private eye is hired by a mayoral candidate to prevent any sort of adverse publicity. It seems that, somewhere in town, there''s a talking blackbird who insists upon saying that the candidate will commit a murder. When the killing occurs, the candidate is implicated, and the detective is off on a hectic pursuit of the incriminating crow and the actual murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pQnWOdH55oiw88n9EhheDpGcNL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74548'),
  ('455126427470135185', 'Find the Lady', 1976, 'Comedy', 'John Trent, Harry Waxman', 'David Main, John Trent', 'John Candy, Mickey Rooney, Peter Cook, Lawrence Dane, Ed McNamara, Alexandra Bastedo, Rummy Bishop, Dick Emery', null, 'Two hoodlums, Trigger (Mickey Rooney) & Leo (Dick Emery) are hired by the unscrupulous J.K. (Peter Cook) to kidnap his niece Victoria (Alexandra Bastedo). The daughter of a wealthy businessman has been kidnapped, and the chief of police, under a lot of pressure to find her as soon as possible, assigns officers Kopek (John Candy) and Broom (Lawrence Dane) to track her down and bring her back safe and sound.', 'Two hoodlums, Trigger (Mickey Rooney) & Leo (Dick Emery) are hired by the unscrupulous J.K. (Peter Cook) to kidnap his niece Victoria (Alexandra Bastedo). The daughter of a wealthy businessman has been kidnapped, and the chief of police, under a lot of pressure to find her as soon as possible, assigns officers Kopek (John Candy) and Broom (Lawrence Dane) to track her down and bring her back safe and sound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kxyJsvlijXgKWOn8umhGvh1nC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346600'),
  ('1022382474745124891', 'Finde', 2021, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Nano Garay Santalo, Agustina Pont Lezica, Ezequiel Galvinis', 'Malena Pichot, Julián Lucero', 'Malena Pichot, Julián Lucero, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Paula Grinszpan, Julián Kartun, Pablo Fusco, Fernando Cacurri, Vanesa Strauch', null, 'A couple, stressed from being confined to their apartment due to the COVID-19 pandemic, decide to spend a weekend in the countryside. The owners of the villa they have rented offer to stay with them and take care of them as if they were in a five-star hotel, but their offer hides other intentions.', 'A couple, stressed from being confined to their apartment due to the COVID-19 pandemic, decide to spend a weekend in the countryside. The owners of the villa they have rented offer to stay with them and take care of them as if they were in a five-star hotel, but their offer hides other intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MYEeM80Iy5MH81PqaOqsnQga7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861717'),
  ('747215006582350556', 'Finder''s Fee', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Francis Kenny, Jeff Probst', 'Jim Gulian, Jeff Probst', 'Erik Palladino, Matthew Lillard, Ryan Reynolds, Dash Mihok, James Earl Jones, Carly Pope, Robert Forster, Frances Bay', 'R', 'Friends Tepper, Quigley, Fishman, and Bolan get together for a weekly poker night with two simple rules: Everyone contributes a lottery ticket to the pot, and no one checks the numbers until the game ends. But this particular, stormy night is different: Tepper plans to propose to his girlfriend, and just before the weekly game, he finds a wallet outside his apartment with a winning lottery ticket worth $6 million. Tepper calls the wallet''s owner, Avery, to come collect what''s his, but keeps the winning ticket for himself...only for Avery to show up and ask to play a hand.', 'Friends Tepper, Quigley, Fishman, and Bolan get together for a weekly poker night with two simple rules: Everyone contributes a lottery ticket to the pot, and no one checks the numbers until the game ends. But this particular, stormy night is different: Tepper plans to propose to his girlfriend, and just before the weekly game, he finds a wallet outside his apartment with a winning lottery ticket worth $6 million. Tepper calls the wallet''s owner, Avery, to come collect what''s his, but keeps the winning ticket for himself...only for Avery to show up and ask to play a hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czm0PdRjPCNpVkG7WMO9GhHCqKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5521'),
  ('1090085906934791730', 'Finders Keepers', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Brian West, Richard Lester, Christopher Newman', 'Ronny Graham, Terence Marsh, Charles Dennis', 'Michael O''Keefe, Beverly D''Angelo, Louis Gossett Jr., Pamela Stephenson, Ed Lauter, David Wayne, Brian Dennehy, Jack Riley', 'R', 'On the run from the police and a female roller derby team, scam artist Michael Rangeloff steals a coffin and boards a train, pretending to be a soldier bringing home a dead war buddy. He gets more than he bargained for from the train and the coffin.', 'On the run from the police and a female roller derby team, scam artist Michael Rangeloff steals a coffin and boards a train, pretending to be a soldier bringing home a dead war buddy. He gets more than he bargained for from the train and the coffin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9yuKKkZcJfGFN0d4TINsk1QwEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5508'),
  ('1106725533756430762', 'Finders Keepers', 2014, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Kaveh Taherian, Alexander Yellen, Alexander Yellen', 'Peter Sullivan', 'Jaime Pressly, Kylie Rogers, Tobin Bell, Patrick Muldoon, Mark DeCarlo, Justina Machado, Lauren K. Montgomery, Marina Sirtis', 'R', 'A haunted doll teaches one little girl why children shouldn''t play with undead things.', 'A haunted doll teaches one little girl why children shouldn''t play with undead things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5817pI8hFBXqChubTM3XlHmVzpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296626'),
  ('1086104617363654601', 'Finders Keepers', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Bryan Carberry, Adam Hobbs, J. Clay Tweel', null, 'Shannon Whisnant, John Wood', 'R', 'In this documentary, recovering addict and amputee John Wood finds himself in a stranger-than-fiction battle to reclaim his mummified leg from Southern entrepreneur Shannon Whisnant, who found it in a grill he bought at an auction and believes it therefore to be his rightful property.', 'In this documentary, recovering addict and amputee John Wood finds himself in a stranger-than-fiction battle to reclaim his mummified leg from Southern entrepreneur Shannon Whisnant, who found it in a grill he bought at an auction and believes it therefore to be his rightful property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wYYDjv95i6KqHq2eDkRef4LA5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319152'),
  ('110073748666626404', 'Finders Keepers, Lovers Weepers!', 1968, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Russ Meyer, Russ Meyer', 'Richard Zachary', 'Anne Chapman, Paul Lockwood, Duncan McLeod, Robert Rudelson, Lavelle Roby, Jan Sinclair, Joey DuPrez, Nick Wolcuff', null, 'The owner of a topless Sunset Strip go-go bar is unaware of his wife''s affair with the hunky bartender and his girlfriend''s plan to rob the club.', 'The owner of a topless Sunset Strip go-go bar is unaware of his wife''s affair with the hunky bartender and his girlfriend''s plan to rob the club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CZxt7FK64H1PKGLnRQOWFAt1eT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5518'),
  ('1079247694576322415', 'Finding Altamira', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Hugh Hudson', 'Olivia Hetreed, José Luis López-Linares', 'Antonio Banderas, Golshifteh Farahani, Rupert Everett, Pierre Niney, Henry Goodman, Tristán Ulloa, Irene Escolar, Allegra Allen', 'NR', 'The story of nine-year old Maria and her father Marcelino who, in 1879, found the first pre-historic cave paintings at the now world famous Altamira cave.', 'The story of nine-year old Maria and her father Marcelino who, in 1879, found the first pre-historic cave paintings at the now world famous Altamira cave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBxW87UkTzLwUF2YQJIBlQtbau3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329718'),
  ('733827108931970715', 'Finding Amanda', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Tolan, Tom Houghton', 'Peter Tolan', 'Matthew Broderick, Brittany Snow, Maura Tierney, Peter Facinelli, Steve Coogan, Ed Begley Jr., Bill Fagerbakke, Patrick Fischler', 'R', 'A television producer with a penchant for drinking and gambling is sent to Las Vegas to convince his troubled niece to enter rehab.', 'A television producer with a penchant for drinking and gambling is sent to Las Vegas to convince his troubled niece to enter rehab.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GS6a3EjW8Bs1Wvhztqt01jveUk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13065'),
  ('106382748289835187', 'Finding Bliss', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Julie Davis, Peter N. Green', 'Julie Davis', 'Leelee Sobieski, Matthew Davis, Denise Richards, Jamie Kennedy, Tim Bagley, DonnaMarie Recco, Kristen Johnston, Mircea Monroe', 'R', 'Jody Balaban, an aspiring filmmaker, is fresh to L.A. with New York film school accolades and the dream of making her movie. Unable to get a job where she can use the skills she so finely honed, Jody must edit adult entertainment to make ends meet. The uncompromising desire to make her movie, leads Jody to secretly film in the porn studio facilities at night - until she is caught in the act.', 'Jody Balaban, an aspiring filmmaker, is fresh to L.A. with New York film school accolades and the dream of making her movie. Unable to get a job where she can use the skills she so finely honed, Jody must edit adult entertainment to make ends meet. The uncompromising desire to make her movie, leads Jody to secretly film in the porn studio facilities at night - until she is caught in the act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btTbG2BGuyL9s3Ne3GFZMKB8oBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31896'),
  ('1097145798131413230', 'Finding Dory', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Andrew Stanton, Jeremy Lasky, Robb Denovan', 'Andrew Stanton, Victoria Strouse', 'Albert Brooks, Ellen DeGeneres, Ed O''Neill, Hayden Rolence, Diane Keaton, Eugene Levy, Ty Burrell, Kaitlin Olson', 'PG', 'Dory is reunited with her friends Nemo and Marlin in the search for answers about her past. What can she remember? Who are her parents? And where did she learn to speak Whale?', 'Dory is reunited with her friends Nemo and Marlin in the search for answers about her past. What can she remember? Who are her parents? And where did she learn to speak Whale?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UVe8NL1E2ZdUZ9EDlKGJY5UzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127380'),
  ('807255752138894461', 'Finding Fanon 1', 2021, null, 'Larry Achiampong, David Blandy', null, null, null, '‘Finding Fanon’ is the first part in a series of works by artists Larry Achiampong and David Blandy; inspired by the lost plays of Frantz Fanon, (1925-1961) a politically radical humanist whose practice dealt with the psychopathology of colonisation and the social and cultural consequences of decolonisation. In the film, the two artists negotiate Fanon’s ideas, examining the politics of race, racism and the post-colonial, and how these societal issues affect their relationship. Their conflict is played out through a script that melds found texts and personal testimony, transposing their drama to a junkyard houseboat at an unspecified time in the future. Navigating the past, present and future, Achiampong and Blandy question the promise of globalisation, recognising its impact on their own heritage.', '‘Finding Fanon’ is the first part in a series of works by artists Larry Achiampong and David Blandy; inspired by the lost plays of Frantz Fanon, (1925-1961) a politically radical humanist whose practice dealt with the psychopathology of colonisation and the social and cultural consequences of decolonisation. In the film, the two artists negotiate Fanon’s ideas, examining the politics of race, racism and the post-colonial, and how these societal issues affect their relationship. Their conflict is played out through a script that melds found texts and personal testimony, transposing their drama to a junkyard houseboat at an unspecified time in the future. Navigating the past, present and future, Achiampong and Blandy question the promise of globalisation, recognising its impact on their own heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hzpI8xIYSDmauchFHc1uRVKTvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870370'),
  ('1143695263700016130', 'Finding Father Christmas', 2016, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Ron Stannett, Julia Bettencourt, Jay Pretula', 'David Golden', 'Erin Krakow, Niall Matter, Wendie Malick, P. Lynn Johnson, Michael Kopsa, Jim Thorburn, Aliyah O''Brien, Macie Juiles', null, 'Orphaned at a young age at Christmas, Miranda finds a clue that could unveil the truth about her father - and maybe a little something else will rekindle her Christmas spirit.', 'Orphaned at a young age at Christmas, Miranda finds a clue that could unveil the truth about her father - and maybe a little something else will rekindle her Christmas spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwvfUurOYrV3SI8MXINU6u0Q2qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421630'),
  ('671673679239896783', 'Finding Forrester', 2000, 'Drama, History', 'Gus Van Sant, Harris Savides, David Webb', 'Mike Rich', 'Sean Connery, Rob Brown, F. Murray Abraham, Anna Paquin, Damany Mathis, Busta Rhymes, April Grace, Michael Pitt', 'PG-13', 'Gus Van Sant tells the story of a young African American man named Jamal who confronts his talents while living on the streets of the Bronx. He accidentally runs into an old writer named Forrester who discovers his passion for writing. With help from his new mentor Jamal receives a scholarship to a private school.', 'Gus Van Sant tells the story of a young African American man named Jamal who confronts his talents while living on the streets of the Bronx. He accidentally runs into an old writer named Forrester who discovers his passion for writing. With help from his new mentor Jamal receives a scholarship to a private school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chd9bCGNYtzDoJqGw5wUHlhrkOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711'),
  ('1140445389711442930', 'Finding Grace', 2020, 'Drama', 'Warren Fast, Lucas Bessey', 'Warren Fast', 'Erin Gray, David Keith, Bo Svenson, Paris Warner, Jasen Wade, London Grace, Lacy Hartselle, Gage Maynard', 'PG', 'A struggling family, already on the verge of disintegration, faces new challenges that will test their faith in God and each other.', 'A struggling family, already on the verge of disintegration, faces new challenges that will test their faith in God and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE1pT8biarqm2Sjk094Sdygsu69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695568'),
  ('1048280641023517284', 'Finding Graceland', 1998, 'Drama', 'Elliot Davis, David Winkler, Rick Avery', 'Jason Horwitch', 'Harvey Keitel, Johnathon Schaech, Bridget Fonda, Gretchen Mol, John Aylward, Susan Traylor, Peggy Gormley', 'PG-13', 'An eccentric drifter claiming to be Elvis Presley hitches a ride with a young man and they find themselves on an adventurous road trip to Memphis.', 'An eccentric drifter claiming to be Elvis Presley hitches a ride with a young man and they find themselves on an adventurous road trip to Memphis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ENZ1rKGFbGU8lhnwmJo57sNx18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38555'),
  ('755903550134791392', 'Finding Harmony: A King''s Vision', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Nicolas Brown', 'Nicolas Brown', 'Kate Winslet, King Charles III of the United Kingdom', null, 'In an unprecedented portrait of King Charles III, Finding Harmony: A King''s Vision provides intimate insight into His Majesty''s passionate quest to reunite humanity with nature. Academy Award-winner Kate Winslet narrates this journey through The King''s Foundation''s vital work.', 'In an unprecedented portrait of King Charles III, Finding Harmony: A King''s Vision provides intimate insight into His Majesty''s passionate quest to reunite humanity with nature. Academy Award-winner Kate Winslet narrates this journey through The King''s Foundation''s vital work.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F75mMe7VSrwNWwSeOKXdWzI0fkXB.jpg', 'plex:movie:finding-harmony-a-kings-vision'),
  ('487028690682554062', 'Finding Harry: The Craft Behind the Magic', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Eliot Rausch, Peter Hadfield, James Lahaise', null, 'Nick Frost, Dominic McLaughlin, Arabella Stanton, Alastair Stout, John Lithgow, Janet McTeer, Paapa Essiedu, Mark Mylod', 'PG', 'Featuring interviews from members of the casting, production design, costume design, and creature effects teams, follow the behind-the-scenes journey of bringing the Harry Potter books to the small screen. Find out how the new Golden Trio were found, and celebrate the commitment to detail of the artists, craftspeople, and technicians who have come together to bring the wizarding world to life.', 'Featuring interviews from members of the casting, production design, costume design, and creature effects teams, follow the behind-the-scenes journey of bringing the Harry Potter books to the small screen. Find out how the new Golden Trio were found, and celebrate the commitment to detail of the artists, craftspeople, and technicians who have come together to bring the wizarding world to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aq8jKIfASiOR6wz9FCeeCH90xZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1662432'),
  ('534756881957490035', 'Finding ʻOhana', 2021, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Jude Weng, Cort Fey, John Gamble', 'Christina Strain', 'X Mayo, Kyndra Sanchez, Alex Aiono, Kea Peahu, Lindsay Watson, Owen Vaccaro, Kelly Hu, Branscombe Richmond', 'PG', 'Two Brooklyn siblings'' summer in a rural Oahu town takes an exciting turn when a journal pointing to long-lost treasure sets them on an adventure, leading them to reconnect with their Hawaiian heritage.', 'Two Brooklyn siblings'' summer in a rural Oahu town takes an exciting turn when a journal pointing to long-lost treasure sets them on an adventure, leading them to reconnect with their Hawaiian heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTWl37oAYRXS3D5mEHmjveXXyrN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644092'),
  ('345187692821104313', 'Finding Love in Mountain View', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Isaac Alongi, Sandra L. Martin', 'D.F.W. Buckingham', 'Danielle Chuchran, Myko Olivier, John-Paul Lavoisier, Skyler Elyse Philpot, Luke Loveless, Marquita Goings, Natalie Canerday, Dean Denton', 'G', 'After learning she''s been entrusted to take care of her deceased cousin''s children, an architect is torn between focusing on her career and honoring her cousin''s wish.', 'After learning she''s been entrusted to take care of her deceased cousin''s children, an architect is torn between focusing on her career and honoring her cousin''s wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZIzT6ik8W951LS36tfmDfx6HB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729348'),
  ('169158464403471215', 'Finding Momo', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Sébastien Thiery, Vincent Lobelle, Jean-Paul Agostini', 'Sébastien Thiery, Pascale Arbillot', 'Christian Clavier, Catherine Frot, Sébastien Thiery, Pascale Arbillot, Eric Larcin, Marie Colapietro, Bruno Georis, Hervé Pierre', null, 'One evening, when they come home, Mr. and Mrs. Prioux are astounded to find that a certain Patrick has moved into their place. This strange young man has returned home to his parents in order to introduce his wife.', 'One evening, when they come home, Mr. and Mrs. Prioux are astounded to find that a certain Patrick has moved into their place. This strange young man has returned home to his parents in order to introduce his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKOaQ3ZQGqRugW6XtBzEAbf1iir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443398'),
  ('47713545622606810', 'Finding Mr. Destiny', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jang Yoo-jung, Hong Seung-chul, Lee Hyung-deok', 'Lee Kyung-ui', 'Lim Soo-jung, Gong Yoo, Cheon Ho-jin, Jeon Soo-kyeong, Ryu Seung-su, Lee Chung-ah, Lee Je-hoon, Kim Min-ji', null, 'A man sets up the First Love Agency to help people locate their long-lost first love. But then he ends up falling in love with his first client.', 'A man sets up the First Love Agency to help people locate their long-lost first love. But then he ends up falling in love with his first client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXRCsm1uKrvgoZCL0Z72Zki7aYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64882'),
  ('977690473950948153', 'Finding Mr. Right', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Xue Xiaolu, Chan Chi-Ying, Wang Qian', 'Xue Xiaolu', 'Tang Wei, Wu Xiubo, Hai Qing, Mai Hongmei, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Liu Yiwei, Wang Qian, Theresa Lee Yee-Hung', null, 'When Jiajia, a young woman in Beijing who lives a luxurious life provided by her wealthy boyfriend, gets pregnant, she goes to the United States, hoping that the baby will be born an American citizen. There she meets Frank who offers help and makes her think twice about who her Mr. Right really is.', 'When Jiajia, a young woman in Beijing who lives a luxurious life provided by her wealthy boyfriend, gets pregnant, she goes to the United States, hoping that the baby will be born an American citizen. There she meets Frank who offers help and makes her think twice about who her Mr. Right really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5878aOaviEYHhddwBzEVW0RazX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188183'),
  ('884972924806465028', 'Finding Mr. Right 2', 2016, 'Romance', 'Chan Chi-Ying, Xue Xiaolu', 'Xue Xiaolu, Mia Jiao', 'Tang Wei, Wu Xiubo, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Paul Chun Pui, Wu Yanshu, Cherry Ngan Cheuk-Ling, Wang Zhiwen, Lu Yi', null, 'Continuing the story of Beijing Meets Seattle I from 2013, the new movie has the couple fall in love again.', 'Continuing the story of Beijing Meets Seattle I from 2013, the new movie has the couple fall in love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fa2bi745iC3D2uP67kKnOSiVGic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395181'),
  ('1071764177029223734', 'Finding Nemo', 2003, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Andrew Stanton, Sharon Calahan, Jeremy Lasky', 'Andrew Stanton, David Reynolds, Bob Peterson', 'Albert Brooks, Ellen DeGeneres, Alexander Gould, Willem Dafoe, Geoffrey Rush, Brad Garrett, Allison Janney, Austin Pendleton', 'G', 'Nemo, an adventurous young clownfish, is unexpectedly taken from his Great Barrier Reef home to a dentist''s office aquarium. It''s up to his worrisome father Marlin and a friendly but forgetful fish Dory to bring Nemo home -- meeting vegetarian sharks, surfer dude turtles, hypnotic jellyfish, hungry seagulls, and more along the way.', 'Nemo, an adventurous young clownfish, is unexpectedly taken from his Great Barrier Reef home to a dentist''s office aquarium. It''s up to his worrisome father Marlin and a friendly but forgetful fish Dory to bring Nemo home -- meeting vegetarian sharks, surfer dude turtles, hypnotic jellyfish, hungry seagulls, and more along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHuGQ10FUzK1mdOY69wF5pGgEf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12'),
  ('504578587028083590', 'Finding Neverland', 2004, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Marc Forster, Roberto Schaefer, Phil Harvey', 'David Magee', 'Johnny Depp, Kate Winslet, Julie Christie, Dustin Hoffman, Freddie Highmore, Radha Mitchell, Kate Maberly, Joe Prospero', 'PG', 'During a writing slump, playwright J.M. Barrie meets a widow and her four children, all young boys—who soon become an important part of Barrie’s life and the inspiration that lead him to create his masterpiece. Peter Pan.', 'During a writing slump, playwright J.M. Barrie meets a widow and her four children, all young boys—who soon become an important part of Barrie’s life and the inspiration that lead him to create his masterpiece. Peter Pan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JyDPH4qdr0I6pF7Bjh1Qrf1Jhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866'),
  ('476376510049311484', 'Finding Normal', 2013, 'Comedy, Family', 'Brian Herzlinger', 'Chuck Konzelman, Cary Solomon', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Valerie Boucvalt, Lou Beatty Jr., Dodie Brown, Trevor St. John, Mark Irvingsen, Nina Leon, Delia Farizath', null, 'Dr. Lisa Leland is a brilliant surgeon with absolutely no bedside manner. She is leaving her practice at UCLA Hospital to move to the Hamptons where she will join her boyfriend as a concierge doctor, treating the rich and famous. As she drives cross-country to her new life she hits a tractor in Normal, North Carolina and her BMW is wrecked. Dr. Leland is found guilty of speeding and ordered to do community service as a doctor in Normal, population 332. In a town with no wi-fi, no lattes and no credit cards, Lisa Leland begins to find herself and discovers what a meaningful life is all about.', 'Dr. Lisa Leland is a brilliant surgeon with absolutely no bedside manner. She is leaving her practice at UCLA Hospital to move to the Hamptons where she will join her boyfriend as a concierge doctor, treating the rich and famous. As she drives cross-country to her new life she hits a tractor in Normal, North Carolina and her BMW is wrecked. Dr. Leland is found guilty of speeding and ordered to do community service as a doctor in Normal, population 332. In a town with no wi-fi, no lattes and no credit cards, Lisa Leland begins to find herself and discovers what a meaningful life is all about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzHG85Lny28W5DjxrwPiw2bDVY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209920'),
  ('257672591113513740', 'Finding North', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Barrett, Merri Brewer, David Lynn', 'Kim Powers', 'Wendy Makkena, John Benjamin Hickey, Anne Bobby, Rebecca Creskoff, Angela Pietropinto, Freddie Roman, Molly McClure, Yusef Bulos', 'NR', 'Rhonda, a big-haired bankteller from Brooklyn, encounters Travis, naked, suicidal and about to jump off the Brooklyn Bridge. Mistaking him for her perfect man, she stalks him all the way to Danton, Texas. Along the way she slowly comes to realize he is gay and is despondent over the AIDS-related death of his former lover. An alliance, and eventually true friendship, is formed between this extremely odd couple as they embark upon a ''treasure hunt'' - with clues provided from beyond the grave.', 'Rhonda, a big-haired bankteller from Brooklyn, encounters Travis, naked, suicidal and about to jump off the Brooklyn Bridge. Mistaking him for her perfect man, she stalks him all the way to Danton, Texas. Along the way she slowly comes to realize he is gay and is despondent over the AIDS-related death of his former lover. An alliance, and eventually true friendship, is formed between this extremely odd couple as they embark upon a ''treasure hunt'' - with clues provided from beyond the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOOQX3rNvrlyqid54GC8YdF4ZdA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65470'),
  ('500655118227777212', 'Finding Rin Tin Tin', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Danny Lerner, Emil Topuzov', 'David Rolland, Jim Tierney', 'Tyler Jensen, Ben Cross, Gregory Gudgeon, Steven O''Donnell, William Hope, Todd Jensen, Ivan Ranković, Ian Porter', null, 'The true story of the legendary German Shepherd who was found by American pilot Lee Duncun in France during World War I, and later became the most famous animal star in Hollywood history.', 'The true story of the legendary German Shepherd who was found by American pilot Lee Duncun in France during World War I, and later became the most famous animal star in Hollywood history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5mvt8mS80yhFXVlZHZEo3ydJMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66733'),
  ('88277677080890119', 'Finding Santa', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'David Winning', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Jodie Sweetin, Eric Winter, Katey Hoffman, Jay Brazeau, Dolores Drake, Billy Wickman, Karen Holness, Laura Mitchell', 'G', 'Christmas is a busy, busy time for the residents of Green River, particularly for Grace Long, the third generation of her family to steward the New England town’s signature Christmas Eve parade. This year’s audience for the parade promises to be in the millions, thanks to a national morning show that has chosen Green River as the site of its Christmas Eve day program.', 'Christmas is a busy, busy time for the residents of Green River, particularly for Grace Long, the third generation of her family to steward the New England town’s signature Christmas Eve parade. This year’s audience for the parade promises to be in the millions, thanks to a national morning show that has chosen Green River as the site of its Christmas Eve day program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6t3RJK3jJi6S6tvuYyZcuMamsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474985'),
  ('832699405202415710', 'Finding Steve McQueen', 2019, 'Crime', 'Mark Steven Johnson, José David Montero', 'Keith Sharon, Ken Hixon', 'Travis Fimmel, Forest Whitaker, Rachael Taylor, William Fichtner, Lily Rabe, Jake Weary, Rhys Coiro, Tess Malis Kincaid', 'R', 'In 1972, a gang of close-knit thieves from Youngstown, Ohio attempt to steal $30 million in illegal contributions. Based on the true story of the biggest bank heist in US history.', 'In 1972, a gang of close-knit thieves from Youngstown, Ohio attempt to steal $30 million in illegal contributions. Based on the true story of the biggest bank heist in US history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhmNHWTVniHHYKTsWSvSir19K1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433499'),
  ('396461597388457210', 'Finding the Adolescence', 2014, 'Drama', 'Raita Kuramoto, Masayuki Nakazawa', 'Raita Kuramoto, Kazuomi Makitaka', 'Honoka Yahagi, Misato Aoyama, Yukie Kawamura, Rin Aizawa, Karin Ogino, Sho Oyamada, Yuki Takao, Himeka Asami', null, 'Takane (Honoka Miki) is a teenage student interested in art. Her friend Mika (Misato Aoyama) wants to become a novelist. They are best friends and have developed feelings for each other. Their relationship though becomes shaken by the presence of Namie (Yukie Kawamura). Namie is an ex-novelist and works as a librarian.', 'Takane (Honoka Miki) is a teenage student interested in art. Her friend Mika (Misato Aoyama) wants to become a novelist. They are best friends and have developed feelings for each other. Their relationship though becomes shaken by the presence of Namie (Yukie Kawamura). Namie is an ex-novelist and works as a librarian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGE3a6Prmq9SeABUegLH1av5zTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329949'),
  ('576382648054543926', 'Finding Vivian Maier', 2014, 'Documentary', 'John Maloof, Charlie Siskel, John Maloof', 'Charlie Siskel, John Maloof', 'Vivian Maier, John Maloof, Daniel Arnaud, Simon Amédé, Maren Baylaender, Eula Biss, Bindy Bitterman, Roger Carlson', 'NR', 'Vivian Maier''s photos were seemingly destined for obscurity, lost among the clutter of the countless objects she''d collected throughout her life. Instead these images have shaken the world of street photography and irrevocably changed the life of the man who brought them to the public eye. This film brings to life the interesting turns and travails of the improbable saga of John Maloof''s discovery of Vivian Maier, unravelling this mysterious tale through her documentary films, photographs, odd collections and personal accounts from the people that knew her. What started as a blog to show her work quickly became a viral sensation in the photography world. Photos destined for the trash heap now line gallery exhibitions, a forthcoming book and this documentary film.', 'Vivian Maier''s photos were seemingly destined for obscurity, lost among the clutter of the countless objects she''d collected throughout her life. Instead these images have shaken the world of street photography and irrevocably changed the life of the man who brought them to the public eye. This film brings to life the interesting turns and travails of the improbable saga of John Maloof''s discovery of Vivian Maier, unravelling this mysterious tale through her documentary films, photographs, odd collections and personal accounts from the people that knew her. What started as a blog to show her work quickly became a viral sensation in the photography world. Photos destined for the trash heap now line gallery exhibitions, a forthcoming book and this documentary film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaj9mpHNpns5j4ODP4352PgDWJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169607'),
  ('16373445986259144', 'Finding You', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Brian Baugh, Michael Lavelle, Ian Adams', 'Brian Baugh', 'Rose Reid, Jedidiah Goodacre, Katherine McNamara, Patrick Bergin, Saoirse-Monica Jackson, Judith Hoag, Fiona Bell, Anabel Sweeney', 'PG', 'Finley, a talented aspiring violinist, meets Beckett, a famous young movie star, on the way to her college semester abroad program in a small coastal village in Ireland. An unexpected romance emerges as the heartthrob Beckett leads the uptight Finley on an adventurous reawakening, and she emboldens him to take charge of his future, until the pressures of his stardom get in the way.', 'Finley, a talented aspiring violinist, meets Beckett, a famous young movie star, on the way to her college semester abroad program in a small coastal village in Ireland. An unexpected romance emerges as the heartthrob Beckett leads the uptight Finley on an adventurous reawakening, and she emboldens him to take charge of his future, until the pressures of his stardom get in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRSsYtYcbhNAfHBp3ha1Nr65agi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769749'),
  ('575554872235670297', 'Finding Your Feet', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Music, Romance', 'Richard Loncraine, John Pardue, Charlotte Hutchings', 'Meg Leonard, Nick Moorcroft', 'Imelda Staunton, Celia Imrie, Timothy Spall, Joanna Lumley, David Hayman, John Sessions, Josie Lawrence, Phoebe Nicholls', 'PG-13', 'When her life is turned upside down upon discovering her husband''s affair, Sandra Abbott seeks refuge in London with her estranged older sister Bif. She begins to find her feet again after letting Bif drag her along to a community dance class.', 'When her life is turned upside down upon discovering her husband''s affair, Sandra Abbott seeks refuge in London with her estranged older sister Bif. She begins to find her feet again after letting Bif drag her along to a community dance class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p54LOicUXx2T5U5nIEJCIOhsAhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426030'),
  ('26134187742773240', 'Fine Dead Girls', 2002, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Dalibor Matanić, Branko Linta', null, 'Nina Violić, Olga Pakalović, Krešimir Mikić, Inge Appelt, Milan Štrljić, Ivica Vidović, Ilija Zovko, Jadranka Đokić', null, 'Iva and Marija, a young lesbian couple, rent an apartment in Zagreb, in a building that seems to provide a quiet and safe environment for their love, but over time the atmosphere in the building becomes more and more threatening. The elder landlady Olga dominates the building. Other tenants include her calm husband, her grown-up son Daniel who has a crush on Iva, the prostitute Lidija, an abused housewife, a widower keeping the corpse of his newly deceased wife, a gynecologist performing abortions in one flat of the house, and an ex-soldier who regularly plays martial music at night. After Olga finds out that Iva and Marija are lesbians, the situation escalates .', 'Iva and Marija, a young lesbian couple, rent an apartment in Zagreb, in a building that seems to provide a quiet and safe environment for their love, but over time the atmosphere in the building becomes more and more threatening. The elder landlady Olga dominates the building. Other tenants include her calm husband, her grown-up son Daniel who has a crush on Iva, the prostitute Lidija, an abused housewife, a widower keeping the corpse of his newly deceased wife, a gynecologist performing abortions in one flat of the house, and an ex-soldier who regularly plays martial music at night. After Olga finds out that Iva and Marija are lesbians, the situation escalates .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmeTpxg27eqtCTrUl237yaW2rT1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10125'),
  ('205933494203042463', 'Fine Feathered Friend', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', 'Joseph Barbera', 'William Hanna, Daws Butler, Red Coffey, Joseph Barbera', 'NR', 'Chased by Tom around the barnyard, Jerry takes refuge under a hen, who, in her nest, is sitting on eggs. Tom has to figure out ways to get Jerry out from under the protective hen.', 'Chased by Tom around the barnyard, Jerry takes refuge under a hen, who, in her nest, is sitting on eggs. Tom has to figure out ways to get Jerry out from under the protective hen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rVZAdIGb1X8uvspayjkHWPWb4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40349'),
  ('1023147323903387261', 'Fine Manners', 1978, 'Drama', 'Jean-Claude Guiguet, Georges Strouvé', 'Jean-Claude Guiguet', 'Hélène Surgère, Emmanuel Lemoine, Martine Simonet, Nicolas Silberg, Hervé Duhamel', null, 'Camille, a young, provincial, proletarian man works for Hélène Courtray, who is still beautiful and seductive. She''s a sophisticated, cultivated and well-to-do woman who has engaged him to care for her reclusive son who has spent the past few years voluntarily locked up in his room. An encounter between two persons and two worlds where the relationship of the young man to this closed, strange and unknown universe rapidly turns tragedy.', 'Camille, a young, provincial, proletarian man works for Hélène Courtray, who is still beautiful and seductive. She''s a sophisticated, cultivated and well-to-do woman who has engaged him to care for her reclusive son who has spent the past few years voluntarily locked up in his room. An encounter between two persons and two worlds where the relationship of the young man to this closed, strange and unknown universe rapidly turns tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWxpglztY9YeJCgUZamJzVYZRbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252091'),
  ('289063819432806636', 'Fine Things', 1990, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Tom Moore, Lloyd Ahem II', 'Peter Lefcourt', 'D.W. Moffett, Cloris Leachman, Judith Hoag, Peter Michael Goetz, Patricia Gaul, Noley Thornton, Tracy Pollan, G.W. Bailey', null, 'Bernard Fine''s career leaves little time for romance, so fate takes over. When Bernie befriends a little girl, he meets - and falls for - her single mother, Liz. They soon marry and add a son to their new family. But the happiness is short-lived as Liz is fatally stricken by cancer. Added to the heartbreak is a threat from the past that could tear the family apart. For Bernie, it''s a struggle to hold on to and savor the truly fine things in life.', 'Bernard Fine''s career leaves little time for romance, so fate takes over. When Bernie befriends a little girl, he meets - and falls for - her single mother, Liz. They soon marry and add a son to their new family. But the happiness is short-lived as Liz is fatally stricken by cancer. Added to the heartbreak is a threat from the past that could tear the family apart. For Bernie, it''s a struggle to hold on to and savor the truly fine things in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXzjqaWH8cb4nd3M4ZiDRXZkHRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174224'),
  ('299947821735140069', 'Fine, Totally Fine', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yosuke Fujita, Yoshihiro Ikeuchi', 'Yosuke Fujita', 'Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Yoshino Kimura, Yoshinori Okada, Naoki Tanaka, Keizo Kanie', null, 'Two listless friends and a clumsy girl try to make sense of their lives, and perhaps find love along the way.', 'Two listless friends and a clumsy girl try to make sense of their lives, and perhaps find love along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajt9VCfgpi95S94M39Ioy40i5tk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25659'),
  ('690964867709453601', 'Finest, the Brave Falcon', 1975, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Gennadi Vasilyev, Vladimir Okunev, Yuri Malinovsky', 'Aleksandr Rou, Lev Potyomkin', 'Vyacheslav Voskresensky, Svetlana Orlova, Mikhail Kononov, Mikhail Pugovkin, Aleksei Smirnov, Lyudmila Khityaeva, Georgiy Vitsin, Mariya Barabanova', null, 'This fairy tale film is dedicated to the memory of the great film director Aleksandr Rou, the founder of the genre. Once upon a time there lived a brave and kind hero named Finist the Bright Falcon. He was famous for his strength, courage and a heart of gold. But one day the Russian land was attacked by an evil enemy, Kartaus, who turned our hero into a forest monster. This spell was cast on a condition that Finist might become a man again, should a beautiful girl, Alyonushka, fall in love with him while he was a beast.', 'This fairy tale film is dedicated to the memory of the great film director Aleksandr Rou, the founder of the genre. Once upon a time there lived a brave and kind hero named Finist the Bright Falcon. He was famous for his strength, courage and a heart of gold. But one day the Russian land was attacked by an evil enemy, Kartaus, who turned our hero into a forest monster. This spell was cast on a condition that Finist might become a man again, should a beautiful girl, Alyonushka, fall in love with him while he was a beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LNIfzKCtXrOgqhrY2BuoBHZsyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148613'),
  ('1011955086382152383', 'Finestkind', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Crille Forsberg, Alyssa Boffoli, Andrew Ward', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Ben Foster, Toby Wallace, Jenna Ortega, Tommy Lee Jones, Ismael Cruz Cordova, Aaron Stanford, Scotty Tovar, Tim Daly', 'R', 'Two brothers from opposite sides of the tracks are reunited as adults. Desperate circumstances force them into a deal with an organized crime syndicate in Boston, and a young woman gets caught in the middle.', 'Two brothers from opposite sides of the tracks are reunited as adults. Desperate circumstances force them into a deal with an organized crime syndicate in Boston, and a young woman gets caught in the middle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90D6sXfbXKhDpd4S1cHICdAe8VD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507532'),
  ('859451531691236505', 'Finger Man', 1955, 'Crime', 'Harold D. Schuster, William A. Sickner', 'Warren Douglas', 'Frank Lovejoy, Forrest Tucker, Peggie Castle, Timothy Carey, John Cliff, William F. Leicester, Glen Gordon, John Close', 'NR', 'An ex-con is inspired to go undercover and "finger" the mob after finding out his sister is hooked on illegal drugs.', 'An ex-con is inspired to go undercover and "finger" the mob after finding out his sister is hooked on illegal drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOT56ikMunWv6LwEhCUrXM8iu8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46410'),
  ('346631857656979570', 'Fingernails', 2023, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Sam Hachey, Jessica Kirec, Tim Singh', 'Stavros Raptis, Christos Nikou, Sam Steiner', 'Jessie Buckley, Riz Ahmed, Jeremy Allen White, Luke Wilson, Christian Meer, Amanda Arcuri, Annie Murphy, Katy Breier', 'R', 'Anna and Ryan have found true love together. It''s been proven by a controversial test. There''s just one problem: Anna still isn''t sure. Then she meets Amir.', 'Anna and Ryan have found true love together. It''s been proven by a controversial test. There''s just one problem: Anna still isn''t sure. Then she meets Amir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q04g3un61aeBoheQEso7enM28AF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790459'),
  ('646525416782282412', 'Fingerprints', 2006, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Harry Basil, Michael Goi, Andrea V. Rossotto', 'Brian Cleveland, Jason Cleveland', 'Leah Pipes, Josh Henderson, Kristin Cavallari, Lou Diamond Phillips, Andrew Lawrence, Sally Kirkland, Geoffrey Lewis, Luka Apt', 'R', 'Fresh out of rehab, a young woman moves back in with her parents and sister, and soon becomes involved in a mystery that has left people in her town paralyzed.', 'Fresh out of rehab, a young woman moves back in with her parents and sister, and soon becomes involved in a mystery that has left people in her town paralyzed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uF8jp3w025guyPBZDEisSwPPIlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27253'),
  ('69679400508847531', 'Fingers', 1978, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'James Toback, Michael Chapman', 'James Toback', 'Harvey Keitel, Tisa Farrow, Jim Brown, Michael V. Gazzo, Marian Seldes, Danny Aiello, Ed Marinaro, Georgette Mosbacher', null, 'A wanna-be concert pianist spends his days making a living by collecting debts for his Mafioso father, a lifestyle that could eventually ruin his dreams of a musical career.', 'A wanna-be concert pianist spends his days making a living by collecting debts for his Mafioso father, a lifestyle that could eventually ruin his dreams of a musical career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcI2LUrK4SNY4JGMyjsWuNlLxGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63435'),
  ('281333381649170173', 'Fingers at the Window', 1942, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Charles Lederer, Harry Stradling Sr., Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Rose Caylor, Lawrence P. Bachmann', 'Lew Ayres, Laraine Day, Basil Rathbone, Walter Kingsford, Miles Mander, Charles D. Brown, Cliff Clark, James Flavin', 'NR', 'In Chicago, an unemployed actor aims to solve the mystery concerning a string of ax murders, apparently committed by a lunatic.', 'In Chicago, an unemployed actor aims to solve the mystery concerning a string of ax murders, apparently committed by a lunatic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akeWqApHR6Kowi95K4bfhyH8Aat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65210'),
  ('770121790998003632', 'Finian''s Rainbow', 1968, 'Fantasy, Romance, Family', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Fred Gammon, Howard G. Kazanjian', 'E.Y. Harburg, Fred Saidy', 'Fred Astaire, Petula Clark, Tommy Steele, Don Francks, Keenan Wynn, Barbara Hancock, Al Freeman Jr., Ronald Colby', 'G', 'An Irishman and his daughter arrive in the American South with a stolen pot of gold, hoping to make their fortune. Pursued by a leprechaun desperate to recover his treasure, they become entangled in a battle over land, love, and prejudice in Rainbow Valley—where the gold’s magic turns wishes, and lives, upside down.', 'An Irishman and his daughter arrive in the American South with a stolen pot of gold, hoping to make their fortune. Pursued by a leprechaun desperate to recover his treasure, they become entangled in a battle over land, love, and prejudice in Rainbow Valley—where the gold’s magic turns wishes, and lives, upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vPJBLw9GL0FlJXXTgZqWnwMzK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42622'),
  ('859479452766904482', 'Finis Terræ', 1929, 'Drama', 'Jean Epstein, Louis Née, Gösta Kotulla', 'Jean Epstein', 'Gibois, Jean-Marie Laot, Malgorn, François Morin, Pierre, Ambroise Rouzic', null, 'On the islet Bannec, off the coast of Brittany, four fishermen have set up camp for three months to harvest seaweed. If processed correctly, the ash of the seaweed can be sold for high prices. It is therefore burnt in several large piles on the island. Problems arise when one of them gets an infected thumb.', 'On the islet Bannec, off the coast of Brittany, four fishermen have set up camp for three months to harvest seaweed. If processed correctly, the ash of the seaweed can be sold for high prices. It is therefore burnt in several large piles on the island. Problems arise when one of them gets an infected thumb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMMpyowTqdwuZgpmUZ6hoR9v4a3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149092'),
  ('657341614710671493', 'Finish Line', 2008, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Gerry Lively, Maximo Munzi, Todd Barron', 'Ron McGee', 'Scott Baio, Steve Tom, Marc Gomes, Taylor Cole, Sam Page, Stephen Full', null, 'Minor league stock car racer Mitch Camponella gets closer to his NASCAR dreams when he''s hired as private mechanic to a millionaire importer. But Mitch''s ambition comes with a heavy price when he realizes that his new boss is a smuggler who''s using Mitch as a pawn in a deadly illegal arms trade.', 'Minor league stock car racer Mitch Camponella gets closer to his NASCAR dreams when he''s hired as private mechanic to a millionaire importer. But Mitch''s ambition comes with a heavy price when he realizes that his new boss is a smuggler who''s using Mitch as a pawn in a deadly illegal arms trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNOkn5An1GUq33ebeKazCL2Ij1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18787'),
  ('246711480995748922', 'Finishing School', 1934, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Nichols Jr., Wanda Tuchock, J. Roy Hunt', 'Wanda Tuchock, Laird Doyle', 'Frances Dee, Billie Burke, Ginger Rogers, Bruce Cabot, John Halliday, Beulah Bondi, Sara Haden, Helen Freeman', null, 'Virginia, who studies at a boarding school for upper-class girls, falls in love with a medical intern who works as a waiter for a living. Both the director of the school and her mother oppose such a relationship.', 'Virginia, who studies at a boarding school for upper-class girls, falls in love with a medical intern who works as a waiter for a living. Both the director of the school and her mother oppose such a relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mTMbv2A60vQtFY0YqEX9olS78o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175983'),
  ('874172333306548110', 'Finishing the Game: The Search for a New Bruce Lee', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Justin Lin, Tom Clancey', 'Josh Diamond, Justin Lin', 'Roger Fan, McCaleb Burnett, Sung Kang, Dustin Nguyễn, Mousa Kraish, James Franco, Jake Sandvig, Meredith Scott Lynn', null, 'In 1973, martial arts great Bruce Lee died, his final film, Game of Death, left unfinished. With the public hungry for more Lee, movie execs decide to find a replacement. This outrageous satire looks at the entire process, from the oddball candidates to the greed and racial motivations that drive the final decision. There''s big business in the movies, and Finishing the Game skewers it with an eye for ''70s detail.', 'In 1973, martial arts great Bruce Lee died, his final film, Game of Death, left unfinished. With the public hungry for more Lee, movie execs decide to find a replacement. This outrageous satire looks at the entire process, from the oddball candidates to the greed and racial motivations that drive the final decision. There''s big business in the movies, and Finishing the Game skewers it with an eye for ''70s detail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UwmkpujGoJhgL4Krnm6Fy0IyxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13983'),
  ('967726595336375461', 'Finnegan Begin Again', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Moen, Paula Randol-Smith, Victoria E. Rhodes', 'Walter Lockwood', 'Mary Tyler Moore, Robert Preston, Sam Waterston, Sylvia Sidney, David Huddleston, Bob Gunton, Giancarlo Esposito, Russell Horton', null, 'A schoolteacher in her early 40s, involved in a dead-end love affair with a married mortician, drifts into a relationship with an aging newspaperman.', 'A schoolteacher in her early 40s, involved in a dead-end love affair with a married mortician, drifts into a relationship with an aging newspaperman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OQFxSBcS3JjQrKlHQ4IEFZ5BYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454914'),
  ('760068261372385332', 'Finnick', 2022, 'Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Denis Chernov', 'Neil Landau, Lev Murzenko, Denis Chernov', 'Mikhail Khrustalev, Veronika Makeeva, Ida Galich, Boris Dergachev, Danila Milokhin, Aleksandr Gudkov, Artur Babich, Andrey Levin', null, 'Not many people know that every house is secretly inhabited by little monsters! These furry creatures take care of a family’s house but cannot be seen. Finnick is a little monster, who doesn’t seem to care about his responsibility of making a home out of the house. But everything changes after a new family comes to his house. When Finn meets 13-year-old Christine, inexplicable events begin to happen in the city and life will never be the same again!', 'Not many people know that every house is secretly inhabited by little monsters! These furry creatures take care of a family’s house but cannot be seen. Finnick is a little monster, who doesn’t seem to care about his responsibility of making a home out of the house. But everything changes after a new family comes to his house. When Finn meets 13-year-old Christine, inexplicable events begin to happen in the city and life will never be the same again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmZGAbI42ecAoixyvZI0Se4Qiau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597845'),
  ('814677164276793790', 'Finsterworld', 2013, 'Drama', 'Frauke Finsterwalder, Markus Förderer', 'Frauke Finsterwalder, Christian Kracht', 'Christoph Bach, Margit Carstensen, Jakub Gierszał, Corinna Harfouch, Sandra Hüller, Carla Juri, Johannes Krisch, Michael Maertens', null, 'The film tells different stories in a kind of parallel Germany about love, affection and hatred.', 'The film tells different stories in a kind of parallel Germany about love, affection and hatred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFz0SwkdTZdZ45yCXQFJ17XAjSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204384'),
  ('140483785829579541', 'Fiona', 1999, 'Drama', 'Amos Kollek, Ed Talavera', 'Amos Kollek', 'Anna Thomson, Felicia Maguire, Alyssa Mulhern, Anna Grace, Bill Dawes, Mike Hodge, Christopher McCann, Sue Ponczkowski', null, 'Fiona is abandoned at six months of age, raised in foster and adoptive homes, abused, and, still a teen, hustles on the streets of New York. We watch her use heroine, fall in love with other women, be pursued by men, engage in murderous violence, hide out in a crack house, and decide to leave the city. We see her mother, also a streetwalker and drug user, occasionally talk about her lost daughter. Fiona has a necklace she was clutching when a foundling. Will mother and daughter meet? Is there a silver lining?', 'Fiona is abandoned at six months of age, raised in foster and adoptive homes, abused, and, still a teen, hustles on the streets of New York. We watch her use heroine, fall in love with other women, be pursued by men, engage in murderous violence, hide out in a crack house, and decide to leave the city. We see her mother, also a streetwalker and drug user, occasionally talk about her lost daughter. Fiona has a necklace she was clutching when a foundling. Will mother and daughter meet? Is there a silver lining?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qbrYrhzr04eXv1w2ZaIwsw9TEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46783'),
  ('809552081583302010', 'Fiore', 2016, 'Drama', 'Claudio Giovannesi, Daniele Ciprì, Ciro Scognamiglio', 'Claudio Giovannesi, Antonella Lattanzi, Filippo Gravino', 'Daphne Scoccia, Josciua Algeri, Laura Vasiliu, Valerio Mastandrea, Gessica Giulianielli, Francesca Riso, Klea Marku, Tatiana Lepore', null, 'Young and in prison for theft, Daphne falls in love with Josh, another inmate. Their love story exists through secret letters and fleeting conversations.', 'Young and in prison for theft, Daphne falls in love with Josh, another inmate. Their love story exists through secret letters and fleeting conversations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHq9J7uX3NudD8bogRF9cxFw5pK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394412'),
  ('386864597536323523', 'Fiorile', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani', 'Sandro Petraglia, Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani', 'Claudio Bigagli, Galatea Ranzi, Michael Vartan, Lino Capolicchio, Constanze Engelbrecht, Athina Cenci, Giovanni Guidelli, Norma Martelli', null, 'The Benedetti family''s wealth comes from gold stolen from the French army during the 18th century. When Jean (Michael Vartan), the lieutenant guarding the coins -- and lover of Elisabette Benedetti (Galatea Ranzi) -- is executed for a crime he did not commit, Elisabette curses the family. Bad luck travels from generation to generation. As the latest Benedettis tell their children about their eccentric grandfather, the children worry that the family curse will be passed on.', 'The Benedetti family''s wealth comes from gold stolen from the French army during the 18th century. When Jean (Michael Vartan), the lieutenant guarding the coins -- and lover of Elisabette Benedetti (Galatea Ranzi) -- is executed for a crime he did not commit, Elisabette curses the family. Bad luck travels from generation to generation. As the latest Benedettis tell their children about their eccentric grandfather, the children worry that the family curse will be passed on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oC7oMifaSO9ZUb1wwTbvHFb6CAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41648'),
  ('415004576130703785', 'Fiorina the Cow', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Vittorio De Sisti, Erico Menczer, Vito Bruschini', 'Vittorio De Sisti, Fabio Pittorru', 'Janet Ågren, Felice Andreasi, Ewa Aulin, Rodolfo Baldini, Mario Carotenuto, Angela Covello, Attilio Duse, Graziella Galvani', null, 'Plenty of fun erotic stories in the spirit of the "Decameron", united by one constant hero - unlucky cow Fiorina.', 'Plenty of fun erotic stories in the spirit of the "Decameron", united by one constant hero - unlucky cow Fiorina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oekblIj2ZusMk88mKcPtgpAUvW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44036'),
  ('656008738121199074', 'Fir Crazy', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Craig Pryce', 'Elizabeth Hackett, Hilary Galanoy', 'Sarah Lancaster, Eric Johnson, Colin Mochrie, Gregory Ambrose Calderone, Inga Cadranel, Lynne Griffin, Derek McGrath, John Bregar', null, 'When marketing executive Elise MacKenzie decides to help sell Christmas trees at her family’s Christmas tree lot, she discovers a newfound fondness for the holidays. But all could be lost when the store owner who hosts the tree lot on his block wants to shut it down, and it’s up to Elise to find a way to rekindle his Christmas Cheer.', 'When marketing executive Elise MacKenzie decides to help sell Christmas trees at her family’s Christmas tree lot, she discovers a newfound fondness for the holidays. But all could be lost when the store owner who hosts the tree lot on his block wants to shut it down, and it’s up to Elise to find a way to rekindle his Christmas Cheer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzZQ3z0cjvyfLJi9Y9RESJs8l1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213901'),
  ('889570926721850170', 'Firaaq', 2009, 'Drama', 'Ravi K. Chandran, Nandita Das', 'Shuchi Kothari', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Paresh Rawal, Inaamulhaq, Nassar, Shahana Goswami, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Honey Chhaya, Deepti Naval', null, 'Firaaq is an Urdu word that means both separation and quest. The film is a work of fiction, based on a thousand stories. The story is set over a 24-hour period, one month after a campaign that took place in Gujarat, India, in 2002. It traces the emotional journey of ordinary people- some who were victims, some perpetrators and some who choose to watch silently.', 'Firaaq is an Urdu word that means both separation and quest. The film is a work of fiction, based on a thousand stories. The story is set over a 24-hour period, one month after a campaign that took place in Gujarat, India, in 2002. It traces the emotional journey of ordinary people- some who were victims, some perpetrators and some who choose to watch silently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6p7eoDgHughtjhr2O3Akkbt1165.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22241'),
  ('201181030716650547', 'Fire', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Deepa Mehta, Giles Nuttgens', 'Deepa Mehta', 'Nandita Das, Shabana Azmi, Javed Jaffrey, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Kushal Rekhi, Ranjit Chowdhry, Karishma Jhalani, Alice Poon', null, 'In a barren, arranged marriage to an amateur swami who seeks enlightenment through celibacy, Radha''s life takes an irresistible turn when her beautiful young sister-in-law seeks to free herself from the confines of her own loveless marriage.', 'In a barren, arranged marriage to an amateur swami who seeks enlightenment through celibacy, Radha''s life takes an irresistible turn when her beautiful young sister-in-law seeks to free herself from the confines of her own loveless marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDUCcZ7bBkqhbZ8R0vml3YUd4GG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513'),
  ('807978644020070828', 'Fire', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Luis Marías, Pau Monras, Aitor Basterretxea', 'Luis Marías', 'Jose Coronado, Aida Folch, Leire Berrocal, Montse Mostaza, Jaime Adalid, Gorka Zufiaurre, Mikel Losada, Teresa Calo', null, 'Bilbao, Basque Country, 2001: a ruthless terrorist attack shatters the family of police officer Carlos Martínez. Barcelona, 2013: Carlos leaves Mariusz, a Polish immigrant, in charge of his daughter and, offering vague excuses, returns to the Basque Country and rents a house in Lekeitio, a small village by the sea.', 'Bilbao, Basque Country, 2001: a ruthless terrorist attack shatters the family of police officer Carlos Martínez. Barcelona, 2013: Carlos leaves Mariusz, a Polish immigrant, in charge of his daughter and, offering vague excuses, returns to the Basque Country and rents a house in Lekeitio, a small village by the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Tl3L2HMgDOgk51Eo6qHQyuyCWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291202'),
  ('339422969168647277', 'Fire', 2020, 'Action, Drama', 'Alexey Nuzhnyy, Mikhail Milashin, Екатерина Молочная', 'Konstantin Mayer, Alexey Nuzhnyy, Nikolai Kulikov', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Andrey Smolyakov, Irina Gorbacheva, Victor Dobronravov, Ivan Yankovsky, Roman Kurtsyn, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Tikhon Zhiznevsky', null, 'Fires are raging in the Moscow region, and the forest protection airbase is on a rotation. However, experienced firefighters are in short supply and team leader Andrey Pavlovich has to take on a new recruit, Roman.', 'Fires are raging in the Moscow region, and the forest protection airbase is on a rotation. However, experienced firefighters are in short supply and team leader Andrey Pavlovich has to take on a new recruit, Roman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wi7poYZy9b4CqmPMod0n1su8Quo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585257'),
  ('603338642382469741', 'Fire and Ice', 1983, 'Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Ralph Bakshi, Francis Grumman', 'Gerry Conway, Roy Thomas', 'Randy Norton, Cynthia Leake, Steve Sandor, Sean Hannon, Leo Gordon, William Ostrander, Eileen O''Neill, Elizabeth Lloyd Shaw', 'PG', 'The villainous Nekron and his mother, Queen Juliana, plot against the human race from their frigid fortress. Creating mass destruction with huge glaciers, mother and son incur the wrath of Larn, a warrior whose entire village was destroyed by ice. When Nekron''s underlings kidnap the beautiful Princess Teegra, Larn sets out to rescue her, assisted by the fierce and enigmatic Darkwolf.', 'The villainous Nekron and his mother, Queen Juliana, plot against the human race from their frigid fortress. Creating mass destruction with huge glaciers, mother and son incur the wrath of Larn, a warrior whose entire village was destroyed by ice. When Nekron''s underlings kidnap the beautiful Princess Teegra, Larn sets out to rescue her, assisted by the fierce and enigmatic Darkwolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0fi9KgmdsUsGtopxxRzbtQ5NIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15035'),
  ('802172008596685467', 'Fire and Ice: The Dragon Chronicles', 2008, 'Drama, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Pitof, Emmanuel Kadosh', 'Angela Mancuso, Michael Konyves', 'Amy Acker, Tom Wisdom, John Rhys-Davies, Arnold Vosloo, Oana Pellea, Răzvan Vasilescu, Cabral Ibacka, Ovidiu Niculescu', null, 'Princess Luisa and knight Gabriel must face a dragon to save their kingdom.', 'Princess Luisa and knight Gabriel must face a dragon to save their kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIctEnkOra3vjZP1I31fepIgUjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16999'),
  ('1093543140438713971', 'Fire at Sea', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Gianfranco Rosi, Gianfranco Rosi, Giuseppe Del Volgo', 'Gianfranco Rosi', 'Samuele Pucillo, Mattias Cucina, Samuele Caruana, Pietro Bartolo, Giuseppe Fragapane, Francesco Paterna, Francesco Mannino, Maria Signorello', null, 'Capturing life on the Italian island of Lampedusa, a frontline in the European migrant crisis.', 'Capturing life on the Italian island of Lampedusa, a frontline in the European migrant crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKZCS6IBTyGX7Sl67eMLSGHFsQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377151'),
  ('894895490877463733', 'Fire Birds', 1990, 'Action, Adventure', 'David Green, Tony Imi, Matt Earl Beesley', 'Nick Thiel, Paul F. Edwards', 'Nicolas Cage, Tommy Lee Jones, Sean Young, Bryan Kestner, Dale Dye, Illana Diamant, Peter Onorati, Marshall R. Teague', 'PG-13', 'A joint task force operation between the Drug Enforcement Administration and the U.S. Army has been formed to dismantle one of the largest drug cartels operating in South America. Multiple attempts to assault the cartel''s mountainous compound have been thwarted by a Scorpion-attack helicopter piloted by a cartel leader, Eric Stoller (Bert Rhine). After having several aircraft shot down, most notably a pair of UH–60 Black Hawks and their AH–1 Cobra escorts, the army turns to the new AH–64 Apache attack helicopter, which can match its enemies'' maneuverability and firepower.', 'A joint task force operation between the Drug Enforcement Administration and the U.S. Army has been formed to dismantle one of the largest drug cartels operating in South America. Multiple attempts to assault the cartel''s mountainous compound have been thwarted by a Scorpion-attack helicopter piloted by a cartel leader, Eric Stoller (Bert Rhine). After having several aircraft shot down, most notably a pair of UH–60 Black Hawks and their AH–1 Cobra escorts, the army turns to the new AH–64 Apache attack helicopter, which can match its enemies'' maneuverability and firepower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovFjMCmlA8Ox1ZYwVQVmWa9KbOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6470'),
  ('491719089435458200', 'Fire Chief', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', 'Carl Barks, Jack Hannah', 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald and his nephews are the staff of a fire station. Huey, Dewey, and Louie, annoyed by Donald''s snoring, ring the fire alarm. Soon, his bumbling sets the fire station itself on fire. They race off at the alarm, not realizing they are already at the destination, and the firefighting efforts go downhill from there.', 'Donald and his nephews are the staff of a fire station. Huey, Dewey, and Louie, annoyed by Donald''s snoring, ring the fire alarm. Soon, his bumbling sets the fire station itself on fire. They race off at the alarm, not realizing they are already at the destination, and the firefighting efforts go downhill from there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bKBPMuabz80h35yEvYyWizlPyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56706'),
  ('542954107870341470', 'Fire Down Below', 1957, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Robert Parrish, Desmond Dickinson', 'Irwin Shaw', 'Rita Hayworth, Robert Mitchum, Jack Lemmon, Herbert Lom, Bernard Lee, Bonar Colleano, Edric Connor, Peter Illing', 'NR', 'Tony and Felix own a tramp boat, and sail around the Caribbean doing odd jobs and drinking a lot. They agree to ferry the beautiful but passportless Irena to another island. They both fall for her, leading to betrayal and a break-up of their partnership. Tony takes a job on a cargo ship. After a collision he finds himself trapped below deck with time running out (the ship is aflame), and only Felix, whom he hates and has sworn to kill, left to save him.', 'Tony and Felix own a tramp boat, and sail around the Caribbean doing odd jobs and drinking a lot. They agree to ferry the beautiful but passportless Irena to another island. They both fall for her, leading to betrayal and a break-up of their partnership. Tony takes a job on a cargo ship. After a collision he finds himself trapped below deck with time running out (the ship is aflame), and only Felix, whom he hates and has sworn to kill, left to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9wNTkhAmDfWfEJ6fmpm5VgI6WW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56188'),
  ('530931267831251340', 'Fire Down Below', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Félix Alcalá', 'Jeb Stuart, Philip Morton', 'Steven Seagal, Marg Helgenberger, Stephen Lang, Brad Hunt, Kris Kristofferson, Levon Helm, Harry Dean Stanton, Mark Collie', 'R', 'When an EPA representative is murdered in a small Appalachian community, EPA undercover agent Jack Taggart is sent in—posing as a handyman working with a Christian relief agency—to determine what happened.', 'When an EPA representative is murdered in a small Appalachian community, EPA undercover agent Jack Taggart is sent in—posing as a handyman working with a Christian relief agency—to determine what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nflONy2WMEui7uCGCAtkD1r9vnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14289'),
  ('901197542955399170', 'Fire from Below', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jim Wynorski, Ken Blakey, Andrew Stevens', 'William Langlois, Jim Wynorski', 'GiGi Erneta, Kevin Sorbo, Alex Meneses, Maeghan Albach, Glenn Morshower, Matthew Tompkins, Kelly O''Neil Jackson, Tom Luce', null, 'Digging at a nearby cave, a careless industrialist unearths a vein of pure base Lithium and inadvertently brings it to the surface, where the Lithium combusts when coming into contact with water and begins to wreak havoc on the country side.', 'Digging at a nearby cave, a careless industrialist unearths a vein of pure base Lithium and inadvertently brings it to the surface, where the Lithium combusts when coming into contact with water and begins to wreak havoc on the country side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaGGad726bfqMbxSyWzAD9Mw6od.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7177'),
  ('969360181162305423', 'Fire in Castilla (Tactilvision from the Moor of Fright)', 1961, 'Documentary', 'José Val del Omar', 'José Val del Omar', null, null, 'A short, experimental documentary featuring sculptures by Alonso de Berruguete and Juan de Juni. Shot within the Valladolid National Museum, the film is an excercise in what Val de Omar called "Tactile vision".', 'A short, experimental documentary featuring sculptures by Alonso de Berruguete and Juan de Juni. Shot within the Valladolid National Museum, the film is an excercise in what Val de Omar called "Tactile vision".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vq8qBOWGAQw0RkPT31ziWtmSwBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125154'),
  ('370829319798459561', 'Fire in Paradise', 1997, 'Drama', 'Markus Imhoof', 'Judith Kennel, Markus Imhoof, Jacques Akchoti', 'Élodie Bouchez, Heinz Bühlmann, Laurent Grévill, Geeta Naïr, Swetlana Schönfeld, Sylvie Testud, Bruno Todeschini, Lauren Walker', null, 'On her honeymoon on a ship the daughter of a rich plant owner realizes that she''s not happy with her marriage. She meets a poor woman on the way to meet her future husband, a missionary in India. The women decide to swap roles...', 'On her honeymoon on a ship the daughter of a rich plant owner realizes that she''s not happy with her marriage. She meets a poor woman on the way to meet her future husband, a missionary in India. The women decide to swap roles...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OYHOahc1zkunL9mtRWMwBJzZ3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242807'),
  ('569056188891080807', 'Fire in the Sky', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rob Lieberman, Bill Pope, Mark Moore', 'Tracy Tormé', 'D. B. Sweeney, Robert Patrick, Craig Sheffer, Peter Berg, Henry Thomas, Bradley Gregg, Noble Willingham, Kathleen Wilhoite', 'PG-13', 'After clearing brush for the government, a group of men return to town claiming their friend was abducted. Despite no apparent motive or evidence of foul play, no-one believes their story and his disappearance is treated as murder.', 'After clearing brush for the government, a group of men return to town claiming their friend was abducted. Despite no apparent motive or evidence of foul play, no-one believes their story and his disappearance is treated as murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTFrjAp1YV49DSTUGCyKSkaEHC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15613'),
  ('1024912278933744107', 'Fire Island', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Andrew Ahn, Felipe Vara de Rey, Mirashyam Blakeslee', 'Joel Kim Booster', 'Joel Kim Booster, Bowen Yang, Margaret Cho, Conrad Ricamora, James Scully, Matt Rogers, Tómas Matos, Torian Miller', 'R', 'A group of queer best friends gather in the Fire Island Pines for their annual week of love and laughter. However, desires, dramas, drink and drugs push their bonds to the limits.', 'A group of queer best friends gather in the Fire Island Pines for their annual week of love and laughter. However, desires, dramas, drink and drugs push their bonds to the limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vVUdYoqUX5rK8plxPGERGGjQLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846250'),
  ('583712051709045814', 'Fire Maidens of Outer Space', 1956, 'Science Fiction', 'Cy Roth, Ian D. Struthers', 'Cy Roth', 'Anthony Dexter, Susan Shaw, Paul Carpenter, Jacqueline Curtis, Harry Fowler, Sydney Tafler, Rodney Diak, Owen Berry', 'NR', 'An astronaut and crew land on Jupiter''s 13th moon and find a monster and women from Atlantis.', 'An astronaut and crew land on Jupiter''s 13th moon and find a monster and women from Atlantis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8Wo5URjEVIzVmXR2qwEWuSkAOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31280'),
  ('716972618256293344', 'Fire of Conscience', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Charlie Lam Chi-Kin, Kenny Tse Chung-To', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun', 'Leon Lai Ming, Richie Jen, Vivian Hsu, Wang Baoqiang, Michelle Ye Xuan, Liu Kai-Chi, Charles Ying Cheong-Yau, Tan Kai', null, 'A police detective must solve a brutal murder to prove his partner''s innocence and unearth the truth behind Hong Kong''s police force. The investigation brings him to an unlikely collaboration with an inspector from the Narcotics Bureau, whose motives may not be what they seem.', 'A police detective must solve a brutal murder to prove his partner''s innocence and unearth the truth behind Hong Kong''s police force. The investigation brings him to an unlikely collaboration with an inspector from the Narcotics Bureau, whose motives may not be what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CV4EEgd5D9DIKDjzAqPE5ktVNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38264'),
  ('984897095153320126', 'Fire of Love', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Sara Dosa', 'Sara Dosa, Shane Boris, Erin Casper', 'Alka Balbir, Guillaume Tremblay, Miranda July, Katia Krafft, Maurice Krafft', 'PG', 'A doomed love triangle between intrepid French scientists Katia and Maurice Krafft, and their beloved volcanoes.', 'A doomed love triangle between intrepid French scientists Katia and Maurice Krafft, and their beloved volcanoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9smEX8UP84yb2GisLwyAyQKvCWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913823'),
  ('723239052545111357', 'Fire of Waters', 1965, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Black atmosphere, with depth-enhancing points of light, broken into shades of dim silhouettes by the ephemeral cloud-glow of lightning.', 'Black atmosphere, with depth-enhancing points of light, broken into shades of dim silhouettes by the ephemeral cloud-glow of lightning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EV3p7kZgL7TAoHgiyFzI8RMtTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229966'),
  ('376606751883604487', 'Fire on the Amazon', 1993, 'Drama, Adventure, Action', 'Luis Llosa, Pili Flores-Guerra', 'Luana Anders, Catherine Cyran', 'Sandra Bullock, Craig Sheffer, Juan Fernández, Judith Chapman, Ramsay Ross, David Elkin, Jorge García Bustamante, Baldomero Cáceres', 'R', 'When a well-known environmental researcher is murdered in the Amazon jungle, an arrogant photojournalist joins forces with a beautiful young activist to find out who is responsible. Along they way, they fall in love as they discover the men responsible for the killing would be more than willing to murder again if it will keep them quiet.', 'When a well-known environmental researcher is murdered in the Amazon jungle, an arrogant photojournalist joins forces with a beautiful young activist to find out who is responsible. Along they way, they fall in love as they discover the men responsible for the killing would be more than willing to murder again if it will keep them quiet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OUU14KPIhRTEjAFcUi4MN52nHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28983'),
  ('949380658053752628', 'Fire on the Plain', 2021, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Zhang Ji, Zhiyuan Chengma', 'Cao Liu', 'Zhou Dongyu, Liu Haoran, Mei Ting, Yuan Hong, Lü Yulai, Chen Minghao, Tang Zeng', null, 'A series of murders strikes the city of Fentun. The crimes mysteriously stop without the authorities having been able to find the perpetrator. Eight years later, a young police officer, close to one of the victims, decides to reopen the investigation.', 'A series of murders strikes the city of Fentun. The crimes mysteriously stop without the authorities having been able to find the perpetrator. Eight years later, a young police officer, close to one of the victims, decides to reopen the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqqweLe7McokopVMK02eBwm8LH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838443'),
  ('1043846890910643533', 'Fire Over England', 1937, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'William K. Howard, Wilfred O''Kelly, René Clair', 'Clemence Dane, Sergei Nolbandov', 'Flora Robson, Raymond Massey, Leslie Banks, Laurence Olivier, Vivien Leigh, Morton Selten, Tamara Desni, Lyn Harding', 'NR', 'The film is a historical drama set during the reign of Elizabeth I (Flora Robson), focusing on the English defeat of the Spanish Armada, whence the title. In 1588, relations between Spain and England are at the breaking point. With the support of Queen Elizabeth I, British sea raiders such as Sir Francis Drake regularly capture Spanish merchantmen bringing gold from the New World.', 'The film is a historical drama set during the reign of Elizabeth I (Flora Robson), focusing on the English defeat of the Spanish Armada, whence the title. In 1588, relations between Spain and England are at the breaking point. With the support of Queen Elizabeth I, British sea raiders such as Sir Francis Drake regularly capture Spanish merchantmen bringing gold from the New World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3d9E8MrV9HJE2gT6t31As3q4oL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22969'),
  ('1041863476760126677', 'Fire Serpent', 2007, 'TV Movie, Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'John Terlesky, Ron Oxley, Patrick McGowan', 'Judith Reeves-Stevens, Garfield Reeves-Stevens', 'Nicholas Brendon, Sandrine Holt, Lisa Langlois, Patrice Goodman, Randolph Mantooth, Robert Beltran, Richard Clarkin, Steve Boyle', 'R', 'Alien creatures emerge from the sun and attack Earth.', 'Alien creatures emerge from the sun and attack Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sC7Pm9xBkPWaNZkHJ1Ruetskfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29792'),
  ('940959427849255409', 'Fire Tripper', 1985, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Motosuke Takahashi, Shigeharu Shiba, Masaaki Fujita', 'Tomoko Konparu', 'Yu Mizushima, Tessyo Genda, Mayumi Tanaka, Sumi Shimamoto, Akiko Tsuboi, Atsuko Mine, Jouji Nakata, Tomohisa Nishimura', null, 'A massive gas explosion in modern-day Tokyo throws 17-year-old Suzuko back in time — 500 years into the past and into a death-strewn battlefield. Rescued from lecherous bandits by the young warrior Shukumaru, Suzuko struggles to untangle the time lines. Slowly she begins to understand the strange force that has exiled her, and how it relates to her own mysterious past. Shukumaru and Suzuko tackle mystery, tragedy and disaster as time unravels amidst the roaring flames of past and present.', 'A massive gas explosion in modern-day Tokyo throws 17-year-old Suzuko back in time — 500 years into the past and into a death-strewn battlefield. Rescued from lecherous bandits by the young warrior Shukumaru, Suzuko struggles to untangle the time lines. Slowly she begins to understand the strange force that has exiled her, and how it relates to her own mysterious past. Shukumaru and Suzuko tackle mystery, tragedy and disaster as time unravels amidst the roaring flames of past and present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUAtcqCczu1jIJ8m4y7YC0vUM5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284755'),
  ('37934752576980611', 'Fire Twister', 2015, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'George Erschbamer, Helena Bowen, Glenn Akers', 'Larry Bain', 'Casper Van Dien, Lisa Ciara, Johnny Hawkes, Leah Bateman, Jon Mack, Jeff Clarke, Jacob Chambers, Benjamin Easterday', null, 'Environmental activist Scott is accidentally involved in a bomb attack on a fuel storage facility. The gigantic explosion unleashes a roller of fire that rolls towards Los Angeles. Desperate, Scott and his colleagues want to save the city. But for the media they are considered to be the culprits - who will soon be hunted by killers ...', 'Environmental activist Scott is accidentally involved in a bomb attack on a fuel storage facility. The gigantic explosion unleashes a roller of fire that rolls towards Los Angeles. Desperate, Scott and his colleagues want to save the city. But for the media they are considered to be the culprits - who will soon be hunted by killers ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZXzPkEqa3F1eoUGLXr0cxH259n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353267'),
  ('844595966321038095', 'Fire Will Come', 2019, 'Drama', 'Oliver Laxe, Mauro Herce', 'Oliver Laxe, Santiago Fillol', 'Arias Amador, Benedicta Sanchez, Inazio Abrao, Elena Mar Fernández, David de Poso, Alvaro de Bazal, Damián Prado, Nando Vázquez', null, 'When Amador Coro gets out of prison for having provoked a fire, nobody is waiting for him. He returns to his home town, a small village hidden in the mountains of rural Galicia, to live with his elder mother, Benedicta, and three cows. Life goes on calmly, following the rhythm of the nature. Until the night when a fire devastates the region.', 'When Amador Coro gets out of prison for having provoked a fire, nobody is waiting for him. He returns to his home town, a small village hidden in the mountains of rural Galicia, to live with his elder mother, Benedicta, and three cows. Life goes on calmly, following the rhythm of the nature. Until the night when a fire devastates the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUKz4u9XTts01u0qpAfu9Jta9tI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575561'),
  ('367969942822533989', 'Fire with Fire', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Duncan Gibbins, Hiro Narita', 'Bill Phillips, Warren Skaaren, Sharon Boorstin', 'Craig Sheffer, Virginia Madsen, Jon Polito, J.J. Cohen, Kate Reid, Jean Smart, Kari Wührer, D. B. Sweeney', 'PG-13', 'A tough, street-smart kid serving a sentence in a state youth reformatory meets a beautiful, innocent girl studying at a nearby convent. When forbidden love blossoms between them, they must fight the prison authorities, their parents and the law.', 'A tough, street-smart kid serving a sentence in a state youth reformatory meets a beautiful, innocent girl studying at a nearby convent. When forbidden love blossoms between them, they must fight the prison authorities, their parents and the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lCi4gHuQmnqn5laJFYZZfaEW9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85654'),
  ('970956897235805119', 'Fire with Fire', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Barrett, Jessica Navran, Christopher Probst', 'Lowell Cauffiel', 'Josh Duhamel, Bruce Willis, Rosario Dawson, Vincent D''Onofrio, 50 Cent, Richard Schiff, Vinnie Jones, James Lesure', 'R', 'A fireman takes an unexpected course of action when a man whom he''s been ordered to testify against—after being held up at a local convenience store—threatens him.', 'A fireman takes an unexpected course of action when a man whom he''s been ordered to testify against—after being held up at a local convenience store—threatens him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kziBJGQFo9f0Vkj9s37qI0G9I0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139567'),
  ('229238171658522480', 'Fire-Eater', 1998, 'Drama', 'Pirjo Honkasalo, Kjell Lagerroos', 'Pirkko Saisio', 'Elina Hurme, Tiina Weckström, Elena Leeve, Elsa Saisio, Jani Volanen, Vappu Jurkka, Jordi Borrell, Unna Kitti', null, 'The twin sisters Helena and Irene are born in Helsinki during World War II. A few months later their mother, Sirkka, leaves the girls in the care of their grandmother, an old communist, and runs away with a German soldier. Their life under the protection of their grandmother and the teachings of communism ends first with the death of Stalin, then with that of their grandmother. The girls are eight years old when they are put in an orphanage. Their mother shows up at the orphanage in the company of Ramon, a Spanish trapeze artist. They are on a talent search for a German circus. Ramon trains the reluctant Irene during circus tours in Central Europe. She becomes the trapeze star of the circus. The hard work soon exhausts Irene and she falls from height, as if on purpose. Helena has secretly learned the art of fire-eating. Now she is burdened with both her mother and her sister. The violent life, however, separates the three from each other. In the present-day Helsinki the middle-aged...', 'The twin sisters Helena and Irene are born in Helsinki during World War II. A few months later their mother, Sirkka, leaves the girls in the care of their grandmother, an old communist, and runs away with a German soldier. Their life under the protection of their grandmother and the teachings of communism ends first with the death of Stalin, then with that of their grandmother. The girls are eight years old when they are put in an orphanage. Their mother shows up at the orphanage in the company of Ramon, a Spanish trapeze artist. They are on a talent search for a German circus. Ramon trains the reluctant Irene during circus tours in Central Europe. She becomes the trapeze star of the circus. The hard work soon exhausts Irene and she falls from height, as if on purpose. Helena has secretly learned the art of fire-eating. Now she is burdened with both her mother and her sister. The violent life, however, separates the three from each other. In the present-day Helsinki the middle-aged...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vkavlX9DjOKKyMT1b7FHdDJuA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143098'),
  ('257963703810356266', 'Fire, Ice & Dynamite', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Charly Steinberger, Willy Bogner, Tomas Erhart', 'Tony Williamson', 'Roger Moore, Shari Belafonte, Simon Shepherd, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Geoffrey Moore, Siegfried Rauch, Ursula Karven, Marjoe Gortner', null, 'Action-comedy about a wealthy man who fakes suicide for the amusement of watching his family and creditors compete for his wealth. Many cameo appearances!', 'Action-comedy about a wealthy man who fakes suicide for the amusement of watching his family and creditors compete for his wealth. Many cameo appearances!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRSqjjpBXt6mY9h5Gyr7704fBL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11491'),
  ('1103071359393822660', 'Fire!', 1968, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gian Vittorio Baldi, Ugo Piccone', 'Gian Vittorio Baldi', 'Mario Bagnato, Lidia Biondi, Giorgio Maulini', null, 'A man opens fire on the statue of the Virgin during the 15th August procession. Barricaded in his home with his wife and daughter, he continues to shoot wildly. He refuses to open the door to the carabinieri and he refuses everything he needs, including water.', 'A man opens fire on the statue of the Virgin during the 15th August procession. Barricaded in his home with his wife and daughter, he continues to shoot wildly. He refuses to open the door to the carabinieri and he refuses everything he needs, including water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZyX2F6688tSkBSLUeAuHKglLKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269999'),
  ('1147548676488264625', 'Fire!', 1977, 'Action, TV Movie', 'Earl Bellamy, Dennis Dalzell, Daniel McCauley', null, 'Ernest Borgnine, Vera Miles, Patty Duke, Alex Cord, Donna Mills, Lloyd Nolan, Neville Brand, Ty Hardin', 'NR', 'The sheer terror and unearthly beauty of a raging forest fire is breathlessly captured in this compelling Irwin Allen production boasting a big-name cast and enough blazing special effects to turn night into day. Involved are a lumber mill owner (Ernest Borgnine), the widowed operator of a forest lodge (Vera Miles), a teacher on a class outing (Donna Mills), a country doctor (Lloyd Nolan), a couple (Patty Duke Astin and Alex Cord) whose shaky marriage is healed when battling the blaze brings out their better natures, and escaping convicts (Neville Brand and Erik Estrada) who use the conflagration to cover their tracks. Like Allen’s crowd-pleasers The Poseidon Adventure and The Towering Inferno, Fire sizzles with suspense and excitement. Turn up the heat!', 'The sheer terror and unearthly beauty of a raging forest fire is breathlessly captured in this compelling Irwin Allen production boasting a big-name cast and enough blazing special effects to turn night into day. Involved are a lumber mill owner (Ernest Borgnine), the widowed operator of a forest lodge (Vera Miles), a teacher on a class outing (Donna Mills), a country doctor (Lloyd Nolan), a couple (Patty Duke Astin and Alex Cord) whose shaky marriage is healed when battling the blaze brings out their better natures, and escaping convicts (Neville Brand and Erik Estrada) who use the conflagration to cover their tracks. Like Allen’s crowd-pleasers The Poseidon Adventure and The Towering Inferno, Fire sizzles with suspense and excitement. Turn up the heat!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RUnzCkmz2AKdHfLiAt9GYThTAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86243'),
  ('446129006556427217', 'Fireback', 1983, 'Action', 'Teddy Page', 'Timothy Jorge', 'Richard Harrison, Bruce Baron, Gwendolyn Hung, Ann Milhench, Jim Gaines, Ruel Vernal, Mike Monty, Ronnie Patterson', null, 'Jack Kaplan is a US Army Soldier and Weapons Expert liberated by a "rescue team", he returns home to the United States only to find out that his wife Diane has been captured by infatuated gangster Duffy Collins. Kaplan embarks on a mission to find his wife, running into characters like Digger, Man With The Golden Hand, and the treacherous femme fatale Eve. He is a man on a mission.', 'Jack Kaplan is a US Army Soldier and Weapons Expert liberated by a "rescue team", he returns home to the United States only to find out that his wife Diane has been captured by infatuated gangster Duffy Collins. Kaplan embarks on a mission to find his wife, running into characters like Digger, Man With The Golden Hand, and the treacherous femme fatale Eve. He is a man on a mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1twLKe1N5vLhMBTyCiw6cxQVtzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171002'),
  ('362092353977084178', 'Fireball', 2009, 'Adventure, Action', 'Thanakorn Pongsuwan', 'Adirek Watleela, Kiat Sansanandana, Taweewat Wantha', 'Preeti Barameeanant, Khanutra Chuchuaysuwan, Kumpanat Oungsoongnern, Nine Million Sam, Arucha Tosawat, Phutharit Prombandal', null, 'A man released from prison learns that his brother has been brutally beaten and left in a coma. As he tries to find those responsible, he learns his brother has become involved in a violent underground sport run by criminal gangs, and joins a team in the hope of getting revenge.', 'A man released from prison learns that his brother has been brutally beaten and left in a coma. As he tries to find those responsible, he learns his brother has become involved in a violent underground sport run by criminal gangs, and joins a team in the hope of getting revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJqUZAoQ8jl1ow5s153mGz9uxdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30305'),
  ('885313906565536071', 'Fireball 500', 1966, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'William Asher, Floyd Crosby, Dale Hutchinson', 'William Asher, Leo Townsend', 'Frankie Avalon, Annette Funicello, Fabian, Chill Wills, Harvey Lembeck, Julie Parrish, Douglas Henderson, Sandy Reed', null, 'Stock car racer Dave Owens plays into the hands of whiskey runners by agreeing to drive in a cross-country road race.', 'Stock car racer Dave Owens plays into the hands of whiskey runners by agreeing to drive in a cross-country road race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9XsZwfzrwGuMCv3zA0PZX4Bhv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86192'),
  ('431953079571201641', 'Fireball: Visitors from Darker Worlds', 2020, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Tore Vollan, Werner Herzog, Clive Oppenheimer', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Clive Oppenheimer, Simon Schaffer, Jon Larsen', 'PG', 'This remarkable journey across our planet and universe explores how meteorites, shooting stars, and deep impacts have awoken our wonder about other realms—and make us rethink our destinies.', 'This remarkable journey across our planet and universe explores how meteorites, shooting stars, and deep impacts have awoken our wonder about other realms—and make us rethink our destinies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9VHW8gHJGLXuEtOLrocH89dzeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574082'),
  ('1101823453004908684', 'Firebase', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, War, Horror', 'Mannie Ferreira, Neill Blomkamp, Bianca Vandewalle', 'Thomas Sweterlitsch, Neill Blomkamp', 'Steve Boyle, Nic Rhind, Robert Hobbs, Chris William Martin, Tyler Johnston, Carlo Yu, Pat Mastroianni, Nguyen Thao Than', null, 'Set during the Vietnam war, Firebase follows American soldier Hines through an ever-deepening web of science fiction madness.', 'Set during the Vietnam war, Firebase follows American soldier Hines through an ever-deepening web of science fiction madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6qVOjp3QKHrA7k2sAbJSlDXkRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463800'),
  ('1116495551967314645', 'Firebird', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Mait Mäekivi, Martti Helde, Piret Toomvap-Schönberg', 'Peeter Rebane, Tom Prior', 'Tom Prior, Oleg Zagorodnii, Diana Pozharskaya, Jake Henderson, Margus Prangel, Nicholas Woodeson, Ester Kuntu, Kaspar Velberg', null, 'At the height of the Cold War, a troubled soldier forms a forbidden love triangle with a daring fighter pilot and his female comrade amid the dangerous surroundings of a Soviet Air Force Base.', 'At the height of the Cold War, a troubled soldier forms a forbidden love triangle with a daring fighter pilot and his female comrade amid the dangerous surroundings of a Soviet Air Force Base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uECWNRjCEwewHBjt0leyZiAyiXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797838'),
  ('298765873875568984', 'Firebrand', 2024, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Karim Aïnouz, Hélène Louvart, Adam Marshall', 'Jessica Ashworth, Henrietta Ashworth', 'Alicia Vikander, Jude Law, Eddie Marsan, Sam Riley, Simon Russell Beale, Erin Doherty, Ruby Bentall, Bryony Hannah', 'R', 'Katherine Parr, the sixth wife of King Henry VIII, is named regent while the tyrant battles abroad. When the king returns, increasingly ill and paranoid, Katherine finds herself fighting for her own survival.', 'Katherine Parr, the sixth wife of King Henry VIII, is named regent while the tyrant battles abroad. When the king returns, increasingly ill and paranoid, Katherine finds herself fighting for her own survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXAc1LaxL64udWr9SOAHQwOBEG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848439'),
  ('670628494305787353', 'Firebreak', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'David Victori, Elías M. Félix, Alejandro Gil', 'Javier Echániz, Asier Guerricaechevarría, Jon Iriarte', 'Belén Cuesta, Enric Auquer, Candela Martínez, Joaquín Furriel, Diana Gómez, Mika Arias, Magdalena Brotto, Carlos Piera', 'R', 'Little Lide disappears in the forest while her family packs up their home. As a fire breaks out, her mother must race to reach her before the flames do.', 'Little Lide disappears in the forest while her family packs up their home. As a fire breaks out, her mother must race to reach her before the flames do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okbpjIlAspXYfkllAqjMRtWgoDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1428862'),
  ('1087874730844798984', 'Firebreather', 2010, 'Fantasy, Animation, Action, Thriller, Family', 'Peter Chung', 'Jim Krieg', 'Dana Delany, Jesse Head, Dante Basco, Grey DeLisle, Reed Diamond, Billy Evans, Josh Keaton, Jameson Moss', 'PG', 'It''s not easy being a teen like Duncan. His mom wants him to pay more attention to his homework, while his dad - a 120-foot-tall monster known as a Kaiju - wants him to become the next King of All Monsters. When these worlds collide, Duncan must use his human wits and his Kaiju powers - including super strength, agility and the ability to breathe fire - to protect his family and friends from a giant monster rampage.', 'It''s not easy being a teen like Duncan. His mom wants him to pay more attention to his homework, while his dad - a 120-foot-tall monster known as a Kaiju - wants him to become the next King of All Monsters. When these worlds collide, Duncan must use his human wits and his Kaiju powers - including super strength, agility and the ability to breathe fire - to protect his family and friends from a giant monster rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTPC0ysx6pa91BK6dnnKvoynjb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50337'),
  ('757704090503458155', 'Firecracker', 1981, 'Action, Thriller', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Ricardo Remias', 'Ken Metcalfe, Cirio H. Santiago', 'Jillian Kesner, Darby Hinton, Rey Malonzo, Ken Metcalfe, Peter Cooper, Don Gordon Bell, Carolyn Smith, Chanda Romero', 'R', 'Femme fatale martial arts expert teaches the mafia a lesson.', 'Femme fatale martial arts expert teaches the mafia a lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wn5mEzpni6hMvPBetzHcquXLzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85676'),
  ('879924285531624696', 'Firecreek', 1968, 'Western', 'Vincent McEveety, William H. Clothier, Jack Cunningham', 'Calvin Clements Sr.', 'James Stewart, Henry Fonda, Inger Stevens, Gary Lockwood, Dean Jagger, Ed Begley, Jay C. Flippen, Jack Elam', 'NR', 'A peace-loving, part-time sheriff in the small town of Firecreek must take a stand when a gang of vicious outlaws takes over his town.', 'A peace-loving, part-time sheriff in the small town of Firecreek must take a stand when a gang of vicious outlaws takes over his town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zypuu5aEoyM5tadMAkbNm3Kccq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4934'),
  ('944674535396988284', 'Fired', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sajit Warrier', null, 'Rahul Bose, Dinesh Lamba, Nassar Abdulla, Militza Radmilovic, Sandeep Sharma', null, 'At the H.W.L.S HEAD OFFICE in LONDON, the egotistical maniac Joy Mittal the CEO of the company, decides to repair his scandal-ridden work record and prove to himself and his partners that he can, indeed, care for his family and be an able leader in an economic meltdown that effects everyone. He is responsible of firing almost half the employees in London and implement major cut-downs. In the turmoil that follows he decides to sack the manager RUBY, a 29-year-old seductress with whom he has been having an affair that affects his personal as well as his professional life. After a day of ultimate stress Joy finally decides to finish off all his paperwork and stand proud in front of his partners for a board meeting that will definitely change his life. Almost after 5 hours of the firing incident, the final two hours in the office is a stressful event.', 'At the H.W.L.S HEAD OFFICE in LONDON, the egotistical maniac Joy Mittal the CEO of the company, decides to repair his scandal-ridden work record and prove to himself and his partners that he can, indeed, care for his family and be an able leader in an economic meltdown that effects everyone. He is responsible of firing almost half the employees in London and implement major cut-downs. In the turmoil that follows he decides to sack the manager RUBY, a 29-year-old seductress with whom he has been having an affair that affects his personal as well as his professional life. After a day of ultimate stress Joy finally decides to finish off all his paperwork and stand proud in front of his partners for a board meeting that will definitely change his life. Almost after 5 hours of the firing incident, the final two hours in the office is a stressful event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDyVWvdtbwCJU3yWRQZIhxiHCcQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59008'),
  ('564596078462870240', 'Fired Up!', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Will Gluck, Todd Amateau, Tony Nahar', 'Will Gluck', 'Nicholas D''Agosto, Eric Christian Olsen, Sarah Roemer, Molly Sims, Danneel Ackles, David Walton, Adhir Kalyan, AnnaLynne McCord', 'PG-13', 'Popular high schoolers and best friends Shawn and Nick decide to ditch football camp for cheerleader camp. For the girls and for the glory.', 'Popular high schoolers and best friends Shawn and Nick decide to ditch football camp for cheerleader camp. For the girls and for the glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Nty5K8ybeigm6qm9cMFFAD4KpF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17927'),
  ('144920612243560356', 'Firefighters', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Emilio Loffredo, Annalisa De Simone', 'Franco Marotta, Neri Parenti, Laura Toscano', 'Paolo Villaggio, Lino Banfi, Massimo Boldi, Christian De Sica, Andrea Roncato, Ricky Tognazzi, Gigi Sammarchi, Paola Onofri', null, 'In the barracks of the "Settecamini" fire brigade in Rome, the shabby Squadra 17 tackles missions with resounding failures, waiting in vain for a chance for redemption.', 'In the barracks of the "Settecamini" fire brigade in Rome, the shabby Squadra 17 tackles missions with resounding failures, waiting in vain for a chance for redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4o2pxQsGIgMw8lV3ElUCNFkpyaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38310'),
  ('939189954367220633', 'Firefighters', 2024, 'Drama', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Lee Yong-gab, Shin Tae-seob', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Kim Yong-dae, Choi Kwan-young', 'Joo Won, Kwak Do-won, You Chea-myung, Lee You-young, Kim Min-jae, Oh Dae-hwan, Lee Jun-hyuk, Jang Young-nam', 'NR', 'Even in the harshest environments, firefighters must focus on extinguishing fires and rescuing everyone there. At 3:47 AM on March 4, 2001, the 119 emergency call center receives a phone call about a fire that has broken out in the Hongje-dong neighborhood. Firefighters, including newcomer Cheol-woong, rush to the scene.', 'Even in the harshest environments, firefighters must focus on extinguishing fires and rescuing everyone there. At 3:47 AM on March 4, 2001, the 119 emergency call center receives a phone call about a fire that has broken out in the Hongje-dong neighborhood. Firefighters, including newcomer Cheol-woong, rush to the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8XgnJrMFyEqB3NRWc1W3Dl0SUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645985'),
  ('11830783327143802', 'Firefighters 2: Heroic Mission', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Capitani, Alessandro Metz, Simona Tartaglia', 'Franco Marotta, Laura Toscano', 'Paolo Villaggio, Lino Banfi, Massimo Boldi, Christian De Sica, Teo Teocoli, Luc Merenda, Franca Gonella, Franca Scagnetti', null, 'Following a twinning between the national fire brigade and the special forces of the Canadian firefighters, Captain Carter arrives in Rome.', 'Following a twinning between the national fire brigade and the special forces of the Canadian firefighters, Captain Carter arrives in Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPkI5tundTev4QklLtJmzVrx6Tp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38312'),
  ('1118069243151352193', 'Fireflies', 2018, 'Drama', 'Bani Khoshnoudi, Benjamín Echazarreta', 'Bani Khoshnoudi', 'Arash Marandi, Flor Eduarda Gurrola, Luis Alberti, Eligio Meléndez, Ishbel Bautista, Eduardo Mendizabal, Uriel Ledesma', 'NR', 'Ramin flees from persecution in Iran and ends up living in the limbo of exile, far from everything he knows, in the tropical port town of Veracruz, Mexico. There his nostalgia and melancholy are confronted with new friendships, while he starts to rediscover his own desires.', 'Ramin flees from persecution in Iran and ends up living in the limbo of exile, far from everything he knows, in the tropical port town of Veracruz, Mexico. There his nostalgia and melancholy are confronted with new friendships, while he starts to rediscover his own desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WAF6eqT7e2i0mpQkj11dkB3ipz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553779'),
  ('182022681503722888', 'Fireflies in the Garden', 2008, 'Drama', 'Dennis Lee, Daniel Moder, Cleta Elaine Ellington', 'Dennis Lee', 'Ryan Reynolds, Willem Dafoe, Emily Watson, Julia Roberts, Hayden Panettiere, Carrie-Anne Moss, Cayden Boyd, Ioan Gruffudd', 'R', 'The semi-autobiographical story centers on the complexities of love and commitment in a family torn apart when faced with an unexpected tragedy.', 'The semi-autobiographical story centers on the complexities of love and commitment in a family torn apart when faced with an unexpected tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozRz07oyk4ZKu5fbYHE33DnnuM9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7353'),
  ('592324197270182793', 'Fireflies in the North', 1984, 'Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Akira Shimizu, Fujio Morita', 'Kōji Takada', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Shima Iwashita, Koichi Sato, Ai Saotome, Daisuke Ryū, Kunihiko Mitamura, Reiko Nakamura, Junko Takazawa', null, 'Set in the icy wilderness of Hokkaido during the early days of the Meiji era, where the brutal warden of Kabato Prison terrorizes convicts sentenced to forced labor to build the roads needed to open up the territory.', 'Set in the icy wilderness of Hokkaido during the early days of the Meiji era, where the brutal warden of Kabato Prison terrorizes convicts sentenced to forced labor to build the roads needed to open up the territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaHbkAd9cA4EhIP49adGXypFSBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298092'),
  ('1081337682005056945', 'Fireflies in the Sun', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Dai Mo, He Shan, Li Tao', 'Li Peng', 'Xiao Yang, Simon Yam, Janice Man Wing-San, Chen Yusi, Song Yang, Aarif Rahman, Chang Shih, Philip Keung Ho-Man', null, 'Lin Rilang, a father and husband whose son is diagnosed with an enlarged heart, gives all his efforts to collect money for his son''s operation.', 'Lin Rilang, a father and husband whose son is diagnosed with an enlarged heart, gives all his efforts to collect money for his son''s operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81SlhuYzQfmKMGtvaxv7BvhLzX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899665'),
