  ('131422737170469951', 'Firefox', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Clint Eastwood, Bruce Surtees, Thomas Riccabona', 'Alex Lasker, Wendell Wellman', 'Clint Eastwood, Freddie Jones, David Huffman, Warren Clarke, Ronald Lacey, Kenneth Colley, Klaus Löwitsch, Nigel Hawthorne', 'PG', 'The Soviets have developed a revolutionary new jet fighter, called ''Firefox''. Worried that the jet will be used as a first-strike weapon—as there are rumours that it is undetectable by radar—the British send ex-Vietnam War pilot, Mitchell Gant on a covert mission into the Soviet Union to steal the Firefox.', 'The Soviets have developed a revolutionary new jet fighter, called ''Firefox''. Worried that the jet will be used as a first-strike weapon—as there are rumours that it is undetectable by radar—the British send ex-Vietnam War pilot, Mitchell Gant on a covert mission into the Soviet Union to steal the Firefox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP6VaKdFEriMzPXe3j5YyDF3ryS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10724'),
  ('695147384001737452', 'Fireheart', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Theodore Anthony Lee Ty, Laurent Zeitoun, Sushant Dholakia', 'Laurent Zeitoun, Jennica Harper, Daphne Ballon', 'Olivia Cooke, Kenneth Branagh, William Shatner, Laurie Holden, Kevin Dennis, Ryan W. Garcia, Mara Junot, Wilex Ly', 'PG', 'The film explores the world of firefighters in 1920s New York City and tells the story of a 16-year-old girl who will have to become a hero in order to save her city.', 'The film explores the world of firefighters in 1920s New York City and tells the story of a 16-year-old girl who will have to become a hero in order to save her city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYAUgsoel6slydF6y4NCPLW96ah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778810'),
  ('657070825471152641', 'Firehouse', 1987, 'Comedy', 'J. Christian Ingvordsen, Steven Kaman', 'J. Christian Ingvordsen, Rick Marx, Steven Kaman', 'Gianna Ranaudo, Martha Peterson, Renee Raiford, Gideon Fountain, Peter MacKenzie, Joe Viviani, Peter Onorati, Dick Biel', 'R', 'Some sexy women get out of Fire Fighter School and go for the jobs they trained for, but first they must survive their male counterparts teasing them.', 'Some sexy women get out of Fire Fighter School and go for the jobs they trained for, but first they must survive their male counterparts teasing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Xe6YUV0MYbTYAo4f1RBhnkvlbx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131304'),
  ('794991115257294394', 'Firehouse Dog', 2007, 'Family, Comedy', 'Victor Hammer, Meg Liberman, Cami Patton', 'Claire-Dee Lim, Mike Werb, Michael Colleary', 'Josh Hutcherson, Bruce Greenwood, Bill Nunn, Scotch Ellis Loring, Teddy Sears, Arwen, Frodo, Rohan', 'PG', 'Rexxx, Hollywood''s top canine star, gets lost and is adopted into a shabby firehouse. He teams up with a young kid to get the station back on its feet.', 'Rexxx, Hollywood''s top canine star, gets lost and is adopted into a shabby firehouse. He teams up with a young kid to get the station back on its feet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6wm2pmx8WiYrNa1vbCaabCUDcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10107'),
  ('603499990445513318', 'Firelight', 1998, 'Romance, Drama', 'William Nicholson, Nic Morris, Edward Brett', 'William Nicholson', 'Sophie Marceau, Stephen Dillane, Dominique Belcourt, Kevin Anderson, Joss Ackland, Lia Williams, Sally Dexter, Emma Amos', 'R', 'In 1838, lovely governess Elisabeth agrees to bear a child of anonymous English landowner, and he will in return pay her father''s debt. At birth she, as agreed, gives up the child. Seven years later she is hired as governess to a girl on a remote Sussex estate. The father of the girl, Charles Godwin, turns out to be that anonymous landowner. So Elisabeth has to be her own daughter''s governess, and she can''t reveal the secret of her tie with little Louisa.', 'In 1838, lovely governess Elisabeth agrees to bear a child of anonymous English landowner, and he will in return pay her father''s debt. At birth she, as agreed, gives up the child. Seven years later she is hired as governess to a girl on a remote Sussex estate. The father of the girl, Charles Godwin, turns out to be that anonymous landowner. So Elisabeth has to be her own daughter''s governess, and she can''t reveal the secret of her tie with little Louisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkgSUgPdOehzyGjczoytG3bzNaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38621'),
  ('182406063128145427', 'Firepower', 1979, 'Action, Adventure', 'Michael Winner, Robert Paynter', 'Gerald Wilson', 'Sophia Loren, James Coburn, O. J. Simpson, Eli Wallach, Anthony Franciosa, George Grizzard, Vincent Gardenia, Victor Mature', 'R', 'A mercenary is hired by the FBI to track down a powerful recluse criminal, a woman is also trying to track him down for her own personal vendetta.', 'A mercenary is hired by the FBI to track down a powerful recluse criminal, a woman is also trying to track him down for her own personal vendetta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGFcLTl8LB6o5fMGHo1Likl1gFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47561'),
  ('642772944887470277', 'Firepower', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Richard Pepin, Scott McAboy, Jerry P. Jacobs', 'Michael January', 'Chad McQueen, Gary Daniels, Jim Hellwig, George Murdock, Joseph Ruskin, Alisha Das, Pablo Marz, Art Camacho', null, 'In the year 2007, crime has risen at an exponential rate. Once highly populated metropolises such as Los Angeles are no longer inhabitable. These cities have transformed into "Hell Zones," ruled by violent street gangs. The Hell Zone, formerly called the "Zone of Personal Freedom," is a safe-haven for criminal warpaths everywhere. This Hell Zone in LA is controlled by a criminal mastermind named Drexal (Joseph Ruskin). For the sake of entertaining his crowds of decadent losers and underlings, Drexal has staged a series of lethal, no-holds-barred matches in the "Death Ring," where the winner takes all of the glory...while the defeated one shall lose his self-respect (or maybe just his head). Meanwhile, two brave cops, Braniff (Chad McQueen), and Sledge (Gary Daniels) must risk their badges...and their lives when they enter Los Angeles''s "Hell Zone."', 'In the year 2007, crime has risen at an exponential rate. Once highly populated metropolises such as Los Angeles are no longer inhabitable. These cities have transformed into "Hell Zones," ruled by violent street gangs. The Hell Zone, formerly called the "Zone of Personal Freedom," is a safe-haven for criminal warpaths everywhere. This Hell Zone in LA is controlled by a criminal mastermind named Drexal (Joseph Ruskin). For the sake of entertaining his crowds of decadent losers and underlings, Drexal has staged a series of lethal, no-holds-barred matches in the "Death Ring," where the winner takes all of the glory...while the defeated one shall lose his self-respect (or maybe just his head). Meanwhile, two brave cops, Braniff (Chad McQueen), and Sledge (Gary Daniels) must risk their badges...and their lives when they enter Los Angeles''s "Hell Zone."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ub9c9I0bV8hd1xR0CemA8Mu2StI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86477'),
  ('494061368717602688', 'Fires of Kuwait', 1992, 'Documentary', 'David Douglas, David Douglas', null, 'Rip Torn', null, 'After Saddam Hussein had the Kuwait Oil wells lit up, teams from all over the world fought those fires for months. They had to save the oil resources, as well as reduce air pollution. The different teams developed different techniques of extinguishing the fires. Man''s emergency creativity can be seen at it''s best.', 'After Saddam Hussein had the Kuwait Oil wells lit up, teams from all over the world fought those fires for months. They had to save the oil resources, as well as reduce air pollution. The different teams developed different techniques of extinguishing the fires. Man''s emergency creativity can be seen at it''s best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byH5AC9fr0WrdXyb6s5c0oQRJ3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26601'),
  ('799402504563362163', 'Fires on the Plain', 1959, 'Drama, War', 'Kon Ichikawa, Setsuo Kobayashi, Tarō Yuge', 'Natto Wada', 'Eiji Funakoshi, Osamu Takizawa, Mickey Curtis, Mantarō Ushio, Kyū Sazanka, Yoshihiro Hamaguchi, Hikaru Hoshi, Masaya Tsukida', 'NR', 'In the closing days of WWII, a Japanese soldier afflicted with tuberculosis is abandoned by his company and left to wander the Philippine island of Leyte.', 'In the closing days of WWII, a Japanese soldier afflicted with tuberculosis is abandoned by his company and left to wander the Philippine island of Leyte.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSCyy8GcJ1UCNGA8G5osYbZB7OD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31427'),
  ('33152084059799543', 'Fires on the Plain', 2015, 'War, Drama', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto, Satoshi Hayashi', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Tatsuya Nakamura, Lily Franky, Yuko Nakamura, Yusaku Mori, Hiroshi Yamamoto, Dean Newcombe, Masato Tsujioka', null, 'In the final days of World War II, occupying Japanese forces in the Philippines face resistance from the local population and the American offensive. The dwindling Japanese soldiers attempt to survive through the horrors of war.', 'In the final days of World War II, occupying Japanese forces in the Philippines face resistance from the local population and the American offensive. The dwindling Japanese soldiers attempt to survive through the horrors of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pC1NiPRz0hO8X8R6ha54vWaSMp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283710'),
  ('878416318509099220', 'Fires Were Started', 1943, 'Drama, War', 'Humphrey Jennings, C.M. Pennington-Richards, Muir Mathieson', 'Humphrey Jennings', 'Phillip Wilson-Dickson, George Gravett, Fred Griffiths, Johnny Houghton, Loris Rey, William Sansom, T.P. Smith, John Barker', null, 'British film written and directed by Humphrey Jennings, filmed in documentary style showing the lives of firefighters through the Blitz in World War II.', 'British film written and directed by Humphrey Jennings, filmed in documentary style showing the lives of firefighters through the Blitz in World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5qsYacdvEZhbLfiz4qtdoYeG6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84656'),
  ('675183103828404303', 'Firestarter', 1984, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Mark L. Lester, Glenn Randall Jr.', 'Stanley Mann', 'David Keith, Drew Barrymore, Freddie Jones, Heather Locklear, Martin Sheen, George C. Scott, Art Carney, Louise Fletcher', 'R', 'Charlene "Charlie" McGee has the amazing ability to start fires with just a glance. Can her psychic power and the love of her father save her from the threatening government agency which wants to destroy her?', 'Charlene "Charlie" McGee has the amazing ability to start fires with just a glance. Can her psychic power and the love of her father save her from the threatening government agency which wants to destroy her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ux5lqNuibd8eOkwwUhzfzAJBqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11495'),
  ('395833758224337555', 'Firestarter', 2022, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Karim Hussain, Keith Thomas', 'Scott Teems', 'Ryan Kiera Armstrong, Zac Efron, Sydney Lemmon, Kurtwood Smith, Michael Greyeyes, Gloria Reuben, John Beasley, Tina Jung', 'R', 'For more than a decade, parents Andy and Vicky have been on the run, desperate to hide their daughter Charlie from a shadowy federal agency that wants to harness her unprecedented gift for creating fire into a weapon of mass destruction. Andy has taught Charlie how to defuse her power, which is triggered by anger or pain. But as Charlie turns 11, the fire becomes harder and harder to control. After an incident reveals the family''s location, a mysterious operative is deployed to hunt down the family and seize Charlie once and for all. Charlie has other plans.', 'For more than a decade, parents Andy and Vicky have been on the run, desperate to hide their daughter Charlie from a shadowy federal agency that wants to harness her unprecedented gift for creating fire into a weapon of mass destruction. Andy has taught Charlie how to defuse her power, which is triggered by anger or pain. But as Charlie turns 11, the fire becomes harder and harder to control. After an incident reveals the family''s location, a mysterious operative is deployed to hunt down the family and seize Charlie once and for all. Charlie has other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjBdPcQ0bplBnv2XgElKLoeFDuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532710'),
  ('395507854810098387', 'Firestorm', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Dean Semler, Stephen F. Windon', 'Chris Soth', 'Howie Long, Scott Glenn, Suzy Amis, William Forsythe, Christianne Hirt, Garwin Sanford, Sebastian Spence, Barry Pepper', 'R', 'Firefighter Jesse Graves has to save ornithologist Jennifer and other people caught in a forest fire, which was set up by the lawyer of convicted killer Earl Shaye, who escaped from the prison with several of his inmates posing as firefighters to recover $37,000,000 in stashed loot.', 'Firefighter Jesse Graves has to save ornithologist Jennifer and other people caught in a forest fire, which was set up by the lawyer of convicted killer Earl Shaye, who escaped from the prison with several of his inmates posing as firefighters to recover $37,000,000 in stashed loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joAzHTg4xoz56zQ7AntfTYENuAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41417'),
  ('826820640508616768', 'Firestorm', 2013, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Alan Yuen Kam-Lun, Chan Chi-Ying', 'Alan Yuen Kam-Lun', 'Andy Lau, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Yao Chen, Hu Jun, Ray Lui, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Jacqueline Chan, Kenny Wong Tak-Ban', null, 'Hong Kong. When Cao Nan and his group of thieves rob an armored car in broad daylight, they don''t hesitate to murder innocent people on the run. Lui Ming Chit, a veteran police inspector, is forced to use sinister tactics to catch them.', 'Hong Kong. When Cao Nan and his group of thieves rob an armored car in broad daylight, they don''t hesitate to murder innocent people on the run. Lui Ming Chit, a veteran police inspector, is forced to use sinister tactics to catch them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKdycnWFGNIALAxEZcTWRtrfWNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244114'),
