  ('489542905506247211', 'Fireworks Wednesday', 2006, 'Drama', 'Asghar Farhadi, Hossein Jafarian', 'Asghar Farhadi, Mani Haghighi', 'Hedie Tehrani, Taraneh Alidoosti, Hamid Farrokhnejad, Pantea Bahram, Sahar Dolatshahi, Houman Seyyedi, Matin Heydarnia, Mehran Mahram', null, 'Rouhi, a young bride-to-be, is hired as a maid for an affluent family in Tehran. Upon arriving, she is suddenly thrust into an explosive domestic conflict. The wife is convinced her husband is having an affair and enlists Rouhi as a spy, to follow her husband, and confirm her suspicions. What Rouhi discovers, however, threatens not only their marriage but her own future.', 'Rouhi, a young bride-to-be, is hired as a maid for an affluent family in Tehran. Upon arriving, she is suddenly thrust into an explosive domestic conflict. The wife is convinced her husband is having an affair and enlists Rouhi as a spy, to follow her husband, and confirm her suspicions. What Rouhi discovers, however, threatens not only their marriage but her own future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PHP13zg4Ym5kzTwts6WM2xovxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43766'),
  ('124943803900372072', 'Fireworks, Should We See It from the Side or the Bottom?', 1995, 'Romance, Drama', 'Shunji Iwai, Yuji Higaki, Isao Yukisada', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Megumi Okina, Yuta Yamazaki, Takayuki Sorita, Kenji Kohashi, Kuniko Asagi, Ken Mitsuishi, Hajime Yamazaki, Kanako Fukaura', null, 'One summer day, a group of sixth-grade boys have an argument about whether fireworks are round or flat when viewed from different angles and embark on a journey for the answer during the annual firework festival. Meanwhile, one of their classmates, Nazuna, is troubled by her parents'' separation and decides to choose one of the boys to run away with.', 'One summer day, a group of sixth-grade boys have an argument about whether fireworks are round or flat when viewed from different angles and embark on a journey for the answer during the annual firework festival. Meanwhile, one of their classmates, Nazuna, is troubled by her parents'' separation and decides to choose one of the boys to run away with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jFNNvewPvhfDkp6cQMkj1jkB2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109302'),
  ('431568612601761254', 'Firma Aquí', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance', 'Julio Llorente, Enrique Vázquez', 'María Torres, Enrique Vázquez', 'Regina Blandón, Leonardo Ortizgris, Patricia Bernal, Coty Camacho, Harold Torres, Adriana Parra, Marcela Guirado, Bryan Dal Pozzo', null, 'In this world he already realized that love forever is impossible. That''s why there is a company that finds the perfect love every four years. After spending a few days on break, Fran meets Roque, who immediately begins to win her heart despite not understanding each other at first. But as time progresses, they learn to know each other and Fran experiences a sensation that she had never felt before. Would it be tragic if they decide to stay together for more than 4 years?', 'In this world he already realized that love forever is impossible. That''s why there is a company that finds the perfect love every four years. After spending a few days on break, Fran meets Roque, who immediately begins to win her heart despite not understanding each other at first. But as time progresses, they learn to know each other and Fran experiences a sensation that she had never felt before. Would it be tragic if they decide to stay together for more than 4 years?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywOfMinoCujghleZEd7sEAe4Og9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675009'),
  ('776185706179066630', 'First a Girl', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Victor Saville', 'Marjorie Gaffney', 'Jessie Matthews, Sonnie Hale, Anna Lee, Griffith Jones, Alfred Drayton, Martita Hunt, Donald Stewart, Constance Godridge', null, 'An aspiring singer quits her menial job and is talked into performing as a female impersonator by her friend. Her drag act makes her famous, which causes problems for her when a very determined young man falls in love with her. A remake of the 1933 German film Viktor und Viktoria.', 'An aspiring singer quits her menial job and is talked into performing as a female impersonator by her friend. Her drag act makes her famous, which causes problems for her when a very determined young man falls in love with her. A remake of the 1933 German film Viktor und Viktoria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkzdYcY3ymKTtGSfj6DSoKbyDTh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190165'),
