  ('657817698403994405', 'First Blood', 1982, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, War', 'Ted Kotcheff, Andrew Laszlo, Craig Huston', 'Sylvester Stallone, Michael Kozoll, William Sackheim', 'Sylvester Stallone, Richard Crenna, Brian Dennehy, Bill McKinney, Jack Starrett, Michael Talbott, Chris Mulkey, John McLiam', 'R', 'When former Green Beret John Rambo is harassed by local law enforcement and arrested for vagrancy, he is forced to flee into the mountains and wage an escalating one-man war against his pursuers.', 'When former Green Beret John Rambo is harassed by local law enforcement and arrested for vagrancy, he is forced to flee into the mountains and wage an escalating one-man war against his pursuers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR5fbo0ry5TsC7euEXFUkx2QzVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1368'),
  ('994997851558938805', 'First Born', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Isaac Webb, Alejandro Martínez', 'Isaac Webb', 'Elisabeth Shue, Steven Mackintosh, Kathleen Chalfant, Khandi Alexander, Carolyn Gilroy, Barbara Rhoades, Blair Brown, Pippa Pearthree', null, 'Laura''s expecting. Her husband, Steven''s a loving guy but has little time for her. Her mom lives thousands of miles away. Forced to give up on her dreams, she''s always been a bit edgy. A C-section drives her over the edge, making her see things in a different light. A creepy babysitter doesn''t make things any better. She begins seeing things, trusts no one, as she goes into self-destruct mode.', 'Laura''s expecting. Her husband, Steven''s a loving guy but has little time for her. Her mom lives thousands of miles away. Forced to give up on her dreams, she''s always been a bit edgy. A C-section drives her over the edge, making her see things in a different light. A creepy babysitter doesn''t make things any better. She begins seeing things, trusts no one, as she goes into self-destruct mode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khZhhaRd3imZBJE5R0HfRypvS33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15418'),
  ('951628042444725507', 'First Born', 2016, 'Horror', 'Nirpal Bhogal, Baber Hussain, Neil Morgan', 'Nirpal Bhogal, Sean Hogan', 'Antonia Thomas, Jonathan Hyde, Luke Norris, Lucy Chappell, Eileen Davies, Thea Petrie, Tommaso Di Vincenzo, Elias Robson', null, 'A young couples lives are turned upside down when the birth of their first child is accompanied by terrifying entities that threaten their newly formed family.', 'A young couples lives are turned upside down when the birth of their first child is accompanied by terrifying entities that threaten their newly formed family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uI0Fz7vMAcYWnhdDEbNSDl90AaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400329'),
  ('257666677692623587', 'First Case', 2024, 'Drama', 'Victoria Musiedlak, Marie Sonne-Jensen, Martin Rit', 'Victoria Musiedlak', 'Noée Abita, Anders Danielsen Lie, Alexis Neises, François Morel, Louise Chevillotte, Saadia Bentaïeb, Chad Chenouga, Sonia Bendhaou', null, 'Nora, 26, is a graduate and still lives with her parents. While Nora has no field experience, she finds herself in charge of a 19-year-old boy, accused of having murdered a girl from his residence. From her first police custody to the follow-up of the instruction, Nora discovers the cruelty of the world around her, in her intimate and professional life. Soon, carried away by the frenzy of her new life, she multiplies the errors.', 'Nora, 26, is a graduate and still lives with her parents. While Nora has no field experience, she finds herself in charge of a 19-year-old boy, accused of having murdered a girl from his residence. From her first police custody to the follow-up of the instruction, Nora discovers the cruelty of the world around her, in her intimate and professional life. Soon, carried away by the frenzy of her new life, she multiplies the errors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIaZdvbZNCkSOKrNsR9Y8e1MrAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997509'),
  ('826050687223200823', 'First Case, Second Case', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Naser Zera''ati, Houshang Baharlou, Abbas Kiarostami', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Mehdi Azadbakht, Mohammadreza Barati, Hedayat Matin Daftari, Nader Ebrahimi, Ehteram Boroumand, Ezzatollah Entezami, Masoud Kimiai', null, 'A documentary about a teacher who sends a group of pupils out of the classroom when one of them does not own up to talking behind the master''s back.', 'A documentary about a teacher who sends a group of pupils out of the classroom when one of them does not own up to talking behind the master''s back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIBq8cMx0gfGIYyspI3XgoT0PNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287877'),
  ('418100316233071262', 'First Communion', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Isa Bartalini, Mario Craveri', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Cesare Zavattini', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Gaby Morlay, Ludmilla Dudarova, Lucien Baroux, Enrico Viarisio, Andreina Mazzotto, Adriana Gallandt, Ernesto Almirante', null, 'The daughter of Signor Carloni is about to take her first communion. A problem arises when the dressmaker spends too much time working on the girl''s communion frock.', 'The daughter of Signor Carloni is about to take her first communion. A problem arises when the dressmaker spends too much time working on the girl''s communion frock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GxPrPbWDVIuWZiC6CFIEeU0Hov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160790'),
  ('95891849375884360', 'First Cow', 2020, 'Drama, Western', 'Chris Carroll, Kyle Eaton, Kelly Reichardt', 'Kelly Reichardt, Jonathan Raymond', 'John Magaro, Orion Lee, Toby Jones, Ewen Bremner, Scott Shepherd, Gary Farmer, Lily Gladstone, Alia Shawkat', 'PG-13', 'In the 1820s, a taciturn loner and skilled cook travels west to Oregon Territory, where he meets a Chinese immigrant also seeking his fortune. Soon the two team up on a dangerous scheme to steal milk from the wealthy landowner’s prized Jersey cow—the first, and only, in the territory.', 'In the 1820s, a taciturn loner and skilled cook travels west to Oregon Territory, where he meets a Chinese immigrant also seeking his fortune. Soon the two team up on a dangerous scheme to steal milk from the wealthy landowner’s prized Jersey cow—the first, and only, in the territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yS41crZ1i0fFxCQbuL7I1Y1VBwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558582'),
  ('558203963990100087', 'First Daughter', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Armand Mastroianni, Mark Wareham, Deborah Antoniou', 'Chad Hayes, Carey Hayes', 'Mariel Hemingway, Doug Savant, Monica Keena, Alan Dale, David Wheeler, Page Falkinburg Jr., Dominic Purcell, Gregory Harrison', null, 'A female Secret Service agent goes against protocol to save the U.S. president from an assassination attempt. She is reassigned to protect the president''s daughter, which she considers a demotion. When the first daughter is kidnapped during a hiking trip, the agent and a river guide go to rescue her.', 'A female Secret Service agent goes against protocol to save the U.S. president from an assassination attempt. She is reassigned to protect the president''s daughter, which she considers a demotion. When the first daughter is kidnapped during a hiking trip, the agent and a river guide go to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeC1xrsfVUkIm8tmHS8K31OzgyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102947'),
  ('976375165363484247', 'First Daughter', 2004, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Forest Whitaker, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Kate Kondell, Jessica Bendinger', 'Katie Holmes, Marc Blucas, Amerie, Michael Keaton, Margaret Colin, Lela Rochon, Michael Milhoan, Dwayne Adway', 'PG', 'Samantha MacKenzie, the daughter of the president of the United States, arrives at college with a group of Secret Service agents. Samantha, however, resents their presence and decides she wants to attend school just like a normal student.', 'Samantha MacKenzie, the daughter of the president of the United States, arrives at college with a group of Secret Service agents. Samantha, however, resents their presence and decides she wants to attend school just like a normal student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUZ3hDMo8SGY2IoujCKwVt8ukm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13969'),
  ('144001088395435413', 'First Desires', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alain Derobe, David Hamilton', 'Michael Erdmann, Philippe Gautier, Bertrand Levergeois', 'Monica Broeke, Emmanuelle Béart, Patrick Bauchau, Anja Schüte, Inge Maria Granzow, Bruno Guillain, Stéphane Freiss, Charly Chemouny', null, 'Three teenage girls decide to visit a romantic island and find love. They get shipwrecked and end up on different sides of the island. Each girl begins her own romantic adventure either with a man, a boy or even another girl.', 'Three teenage girls decide to visit a romantic island and find love. They get shipwrecked and end up on different sides of the island. Each girl begins her own romantic adventure either with a man, a boy or even another girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7ZAvetDYh0W5VYiuCnMS1e9TZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54156'),
  ('819413481902406330', 'First Dog', 2010, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Bryan Michael Stoller, Bruce Alan Greene', 'Bryan Michael Stoller', 'Eric Roberts, Eliza Roberts, John-Paul Howard, Little Bear, Tommy Lister Jr., Priscilla Barnes, Paula Devicq, Tim Peyton', 'PG', 'A foster boy is befriended by a lost dog who turns out to belong to the President of the United States. The boy decides to run away from the foster home to return the canine to the White House -- "Because it''s the right thing to do!"', 'A foster boy is befriended by a lost dog who turns out to belong to the President of the United States. The boy decides to run away from the foster home to return the canine to the White House -- "Because it''s the right thing to do!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDNJBqwrfZg02CHjRQOy0sodasG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57517'),
  ('222030050948788627', 'First Encounter - Last Encounter', 1987, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', 'Vitaliy Melnikov, Yuriy Veksler, Igor Moskvitin', 'Vladimir Valutskiy', 'Mikhail Morozov, Oleg Efremov, Boris Plotnikov, Yuri Bogatyryov, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Sergey Shakurov, Mikhail Kononov, Nikolay Kryuchkov', null, 'The story concerns the events in Saint Petersburg on the eve of the First World War. Private detective Petya Chukhontsev, a law student who has not completed his studies, investigates the case of the murdered inventor Kuklin. He was murdered exactly as he predicted during a New Year''s visit to Chukhontsev. While investigating the Kuklin case, Petya soon realizes that the central figure in this case is the German Scholz, the owner, who cheaply buys up the inventions of Russian craftsmen and hands them over to the spy Siegfried Gay, an advisor to the German embassy. . However, Petya will soon understand that it is better to mind his own business...', 'The story concerns the events in Saint Petersburg on the eve of the First World War. Private detective Petya Chukhontsev, a law student who has not completed his studies, investigates the case of the murdered inventor Kuklin. He was murdered exactly as he predicted during a New Year''s visit to Chukhontsev. While investigating the Kuklin case, Petya soon realizes that the central figure in this case is the German Scholz, the owner, who cheaply buys up the inventions of Russian craftsmen and hands them over to the spy Siegfried Gay, an advisor to the German embassy. . However, Petya will soon understand that it is better to mind his own business...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcMUSFWrGLPjk0sS37BkkTsc9Ct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71047'),
  ('931556984966953605', 'First Flight', 2006, 'Animation, Family', 'Cameron Hood, Kyle Jefferson', 'Kyle Jefferson, Cameron Hood', 'Jeanine Meyers, Jon Spinogatti', 'G', 'The story of a fastidiously organized businessman, whose perspective on life is forever changed through an unexpected encounter with a tiny fledgling bird.', 'The story of a fastidiously organized businessman, whose perspective on life is forever changed through an unexpected encounter with a tiny fledgling bird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRgpgc98Bqklwb6YG7C73WKPSbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118251'),
  ('979086620423236256', 'First Girl I Loved', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kerem Sanga, Ricardo Diaz', 'Kerem Sanga', 'Dylan Gelula, Brianna Hildebrand, Mateo Arias, Pamela Adlon, Tim Heidecker, Cameron Esposito, John Redlinger, Dominic Flores', null, 'Seventeen-year-old Anne just fell in love with Sasha, the most popular girl at her L.A. public high school. But when Anne tells her best friend, Clifton—who has always harbored a secret crush on her—he does his best to get in the way.', 'Seventeen-year-old Anne just fell in love with Sasha, the most popular girl at her L.A. public high school. But when Anne tells her best friend, Clifton—who has always harbored a secret crush on her—he does his best to get in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDIM1XSv4a4UpNUU7xe7w4nAMTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352498'),
  ('938768089224586336', 'First Growth', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jérôme Le Maire, David Ungaro', 'Rémi Bezançon, Vanessa Portal, Jérôme Le Maire', 'Gérard Lanvin, Alice Taglioni, Jalil Lespert, Laura Smet, Lannick Gautry, Frédérique Tirmont, Christiane Millet, Scali Delpeyrat', null, 'Winemaker son, Charlie Marshall left Burgundy to become a Parisian renowned winemaker, author of a successful guide whose notes are annually tremble vineyards. But in Côte-d''Or, his father lost the taste of wine and mistakes the family winery rush towards bankruptcy. At first reluctant, Charlie returns to Burgundy. It must his boots and shoes back up his sleeves and become winemaker confront a profession he does not know, under the skeptical gaze of his father. Between unpredictable weather and a delicate variety, Charlie will have to prove to his father that he is worthy of this land passed from generation to generation in their family. It is easy to note a wine, but how do we do a great wine?', 'Winemaker son, Charlie Marshall left Burgundy to become a Parisian renowned winemaker, author of a successful guide whose notes are annually tremble vineyards. But in Côte-d''Or, his father lost the taste of wine and mistakes the family winery rush towards bankruptcy. At first reluctant, Charlie returns to Burgundy. It must his boots and shoes back up his sleeves and become winemaker confront a profession he does not know, under the skeptical gaze of his father. Between unpredictable weather and a delicate variety, Charlie will have to prove to his father that he is worthy of this land passed from generation to generation in their family. It is easy to note a wine, but how do we do a great wine?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KwutMFpxI44dZf4sVFDLYucqvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361243'),
  ('812561409120294560', 'First Kid', 1996, 'Comedy, Family', 'David Mickey Evans, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Tim Kelleher', 'Sinbad, Brock Pierce, Blake Boyd, Timothy Busfield, Art LaFleur, Robert Guillaume, Lisa Eichhorn, James Naughton', 'PG', 'Some say that to be the leader of a country is one of the loneliest jobs in the world. But being the child of a world leader can be doubly so. Constantly surrounded by security officers, restricted in movements and having almost every waking moment carefully monitored makes normalcy an impossibility. No one knows this better than young Luke Davenport, the son of U.S. President Davenport. He vents his loneliness, frustration and feelings of isolation from family and friends by being a brat to his private Secret Service agent. When the agent snaps from the strain in front of the First Lady, a new agent is assigned to Luke. He turns out to be the enormous Sam Simms, a bit of a rogue who managed to rise through the ranks by sheer determination rather than strict adherence to Secret-Service protocol. At first, Luke tries all his old tricks upon Sam. But instead of getting angry, Sam seems to actually understand.', 'Some say that to be the leader of a country is one of the loneliest jobs in the world. But being the child of a world leader can be doubly so. Constantly surrounded by security officers, restricted in movements and having almost every waking moment carefully monitored makes normalcy an impossibility. No one knows this better than young Luke Davenport, the son of U.S. President Davenport. He vents his loneliness, frustration and feelings of isolation from family and friends by being a brat to his private Secret Service agent. When the agent snaps from the strain in front of the First Lady, a new agent is assigned to Luke. He turns out to be the enormous Sam Simms, a bit of a rogue who managed to rise through the ranks by sheer determination rather than strict adherence to Secret-Service protocol. At first, Luke tries all his old tricks upon Sam. But instead of getting angry, Sam seems to actually understand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7yTkuXQpnougXmRIqgfT32axZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12559'),
  ('358941888424911711', 'First Kill', 2017, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Steven C. Miller, Brandon Cox', 'Nick Gordon', 'Bruce Willis, Hayden Christensen, Ty Joseph Shelton, Megan Leonard, Gethin Anthony, William DeMeo, Deb G. Girdler, Tyler Jon Olson', 'R', 'A police chief tries to solve a kidnapping that involves a bank robber holding a young boy hostage.', 'A police chief tries to solve a kidnapping that involves a bank robber holding a young boy hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aT3UoZS457DifqFCPXAqb4Akw2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410554'),
  ('1090806119128115999', 'First Knight', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Jerry Zucker, Adam Greenberg, Jamie Christopher', 'William Nicholson', 'Sean Connery, Richard Gere, Julia Ormond, Ben Cross, Liam Cunningham, Christopher Villiers, Valentine Pelka, Colin McCormack', 'PG-13', 'The timeless tale of King Arthur and the legend of Camelot are retold in this passionate period drama. Arthur is reluctant to hand the crown to Lancelot, and Guinevere is torn between her loyalty to her husband and her growing love for his rival. But Lancelot must balance his loyalty to the throne with the rewards of true love.', 'The timeless tale of King Arthur and the legend of Camelot are retold in this passionate period drama. Arthur is reluctant to hand the crown to Lancelot, and Guinevere is torn between her loyalty to her husband and her growing love for his rival. But Lancelot must balance his loyalty to the throne with the rewards of true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJH5bwtu3UxbwRsSlhlhmMrV8ZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6520'),
  ('1046253915703486484', 'First Light', 2015, 'Drama', 'Vincenzo Marra, Maura Morales Bergmann, Constanza B. Majluf', 'Angelo Carbone, Vincenzo Marra', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Daniela Ramírez, Gianni Pezzolla, Luis Gnecco, Alejandro Goic, Paulina Urrutia, Maria Eugenia Barrenechea, Mario Mazzarotto', null, 'Marco, a cynical and ambitious young lawyer, lives in Bari with his partner Martina and their eight-year-old son Mateo. Martina had left Chile and moved to Italy when she met Marco. Their relationship has run its course, however, and Martina longs to go back to her country with Mateo, but Marco, the loving father left out of the equation, is adamantly against the idea. The couple clash for weeks on end, until Martina abruptly leaves the country with their son, goes back to Chile and virtually vanishes. With no news of Mateo, time seems to stand still for Marco. Anguished and unable to cope, he finally rallies and sets off in search of his son.', 'Marco, a cynical and ambitious young lawyer, lives in Bari with his partner Martina and their eight-year-old son Mateo. Martina had left Chile and moved to Italy when she met Marco. Their relationship has run its course, however, and Martina longs to go back to her country with Mateo, but Marco, the loving father left out of the equation, is adamantly against the idea. The couple clash for weeks on end, until Martina abruptly leaves the country with their son, goes back to Chile and virtually vanishes. With no news of Mateo, time seems to stand still for Marco. Anguished and unable to cope, he finally rallies and sets off in search of his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4YEdCeejfsorDo01selV7rSshM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356758'),
  ('433162325701128128', 'First Love', 1939, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Joseph A. Valentine, Henry Koster', 'Lionel Houser, Bruce Manning', 'Deanna Durbin, Robert Stack, Eugene Pallette, Helen Parrish, Lewis Howard, Leatrice Joy, Marcia Mae Jones, June Storey', 'NR', 'In this reworking of Cinderella, orphaned Connie Harding is sent to live with her rich aunt and uncle after graduating from boarding school. She''s hardly received with open arms, especially by her snobby cousin Barbara. When the entire family is invited to a major social ball, Barbara sees to it that Connie is forced to stay home. With the aid of her uncle, who acts as her fairy godfather, Connie makes it to the ball and meets her Prince Charming in Ted Drake, her cousin''s boyfriend.', 'In this reworking of Cinderella, orphaned Connie Harding is sent to live with her rich aunt and uncle after graduating from boarding school. She''s hardly received with open arms, especially by her snobby cousin Barbara. When the entire family is invited to a major social ball, Barbara sees to it that Connie is forced to stay home. With the aid of her uncle, who acts as her fairy godfather, Connie makes it to the ball and meets her Prince Charming in Ted Drake, her cousin''s boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9Wq5BTUMqv6WZuehRgvIB8R34F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61645'),
  ('1098575544185728274', 'First Love', 1974, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Jacek Petrycki, Krzysztof Wierzbicki', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', null, null, 'After the doctor''s refusal to perform abortion on a 17-year old girl, she and her boyfriend have to cope with the new situation. They both need to learn to take responsibility for their decisions, in spite of numerous hardships facing them.', 'After the doctor''s refusal to perform abortion on a 17-year old girl, she and her boyfriend have to cope with the new situation. They both need to learn to take responsibility for their decisions, in spite of numerous hardships facing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tS0INoioxxYKfNqBEpr5eSWQ5JP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179847'),
  ('1132562264728195606', 'First Love', 1978, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Tonino Delli Colli, Paul Ronald', 'Dino Risi, Ruggero Maccari', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Ornella Muti, Mario Del Monaco, Caterina Boratto, Riccardo Billi, Venantino Venantini, Luigi Rossi, Alberto Postorino', null, 'Ugo is an old actor who feels too young to be in an "old actor''s house". He just can''t stand the rules of the other old people so he escapes with a young girl.', 'Ugo is an old actor who feels too young to be in an "old actor''s house". He just can''t stand the rules of the other old people so he escapes with a young girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48tgibXjRnb4aQpGbpCbdI2hv6X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81803'),
  ('1040319295237912230', 'First Love', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, Horror', 'Matteo Garrone, Marco Onorato, Gianni Di Gregorio', 'Matteo Garrone, Vitaliano Trevisan, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Michela Cescon, Vitaliano Trevisan, Roberto Comacchio, Alberto Re, Paolo Capoduro, Elvezia Allari, Antonella Mazzuccato, Gianluca Moretto', null, 'Vittorio is looking for a woman who matches his ideal. Through a classified ad he meets Sonia, a sweet, pleasant, intelligent girl. However, she weighs 125 pounds -- which according to Vittorio is way too much. A goldsmith by trade, Vittorio is obsessed with the desire to shape Sonia''s body and mind as does a fire with gold. Almost imperceptibly Sonia becomes a passive participant and the relationship grows into a reciprocal masochistic game. When the two lovers isolate themselves in a country house in the Veneto hills, they dangerously lose touch with reality and the rest of the world.', 'Vittorio is looking for a woman who matches his ideal. Through a classified ad he meets Sonia, a sweet, pleasant, intelligent girl. However, she weighs 125 pounds -- which according to Vittorio is way too much. A goldsmith by trade, Vittorio is obsessed with the desire to shape Sonia''s body and mind as does a fire with gold. Almost imperceptibly Sonia becomes a passive participant and the relationship grows into a reciprocal masochistic game. When the two lovers isolate themselves in a country house in the Veneto hills, they dangerously lose touch with reality and the rest of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9c45ndIEI1zIkiiRCiflYSuSJX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62495'),
  ('963681552591318221', 'First Love', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Yukinari Hanawa, Junichi Fujisawa', 'Yukinari Hanawa, Tetsuro Kamogawa, Harumi Ichikawa', 'Aoi Miyazaki, Keisuke Koide, Masaru Miyazaki, Rena Komine, Tasuku Emoto, Munetaka Aoki, Yuya Matsuura, Shunji Fujimura', null, 'In the chaotic days of the 1960s, Misuzu, a lonely high school girl from a troubled family, finds sanctuary with her nihilistic brother, Ryo, and his friends. They pass their days hanging around a shadowy jazz cafe bar, indulging themselves in a life of sex, drugs and alcohol.', 'In the chaotic days of the 1960s, Misuzu, a lonely high school girl from a troubled family, finds sanctuary with her nihilistic brother, Ryo, and his friends. They pass their days hanging around a shadowy jazz cafe bar, indulging themselves in a life of sex, drugs and alcohol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7Iwdev18JvZzYmfVFEOWx5cxCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33984'),
  ('1127125507338240408', 'First Love', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kōichi Imaizumi', 'Kōichi Imaizumi', 'Kōichi Imaizumi, Takao Kawaguchi, Hotaru Hazuki, Takahiko Kobayashi, Kiyomi Itō', null, 'This is a story about coming of age, coming out and a gay marriage that is sprinkled with both love and comedy, at the centre of which is a teenager who doesn’t yet know what he wants.', 'This is a story about coming of age, coming out and a gay marriage that is sprinkled with both love and comedy, at the centre of which is a teenager who doesn’t yet know what he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DdaqEbT6RixYNvCHUdkx9Lkcaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377905'),
  ('587558261283041853', 'First Love', 2019, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Masaru Nakamura', 'Masataka Kubota, Nao Omori, Shota Sometani, Sakurako Konishi, Becky, Takahiro Miura, Mami Fujioka, Yen Cheng-kuo', 'R', 'One night in Tokyo, Leo, a young boxer, meets his first love, Monica, an imprisoned sex worker. Caught up in a drug-smuggling scheme, they find themselves pursued by a corrupt cop, a yakuza, his nemesis, and a female assassin.', 'One night in Tokyo, Leo, a young boxer, meets his first love, Monica, an imprisoned sex worker. Caught up in a drug-smuggling scheme, they find themselves pursued by a corrupt cop, a yakuza, his nemesis, and a female assassin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCf0l04CXswtzRMExzbalGYftRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597094'),
  ('1114914508431846527', 'First Love', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi', 'Taeko Asano', 'Keiko Kitagawa, Tomoya Nakamura, Kyoko Yoshine, Yosuke Kubozuka, Itsuji Itao, Hoshi Ishida, Sho Kiyohara, Saki Takaoka', null, 'A university student has the usual dreams and aspirations. It turns out to be a pipe dream and so she murders her own flesh and blood. The usual media heads seek an answer in order to sell copy. A psychologist is writing a book about the character and incident. Her research for the subject matter turn the psychologist inward and things come out of the shadows that perhaps are better left buried deep in the shadows of the psyche.', 'A university student has the usual dreams and aspirations. It turns out to be a pipe dream and so she murders her own flesh and blood. The usual media heads seek an answer in order to sell copy. A psychologist is writing a book about the character and incident. Her research for the subject matter turn the psychologist inward and things come out of the shadows that perhaps are better left buried deep in the shadows of the psyche.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axkRDcqBiazTpo4KeACAXbzeC88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735409'),
  ('126847031384920085', 'First Love', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'A.J. Edwards, Joshua Glassman, Cameron H. Price', 'A.J. Edwards', 'Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Sydney Park, Diane Kruger, Jeffrey Donovan, Nikolai Tsankov, Chris Galust, Nanrisa Lee, Blake Weise', null, 'A young man’s difficult entry into adulthood, who experiences the highs and lows of his first love, while dealing with the familial fallout spurred by the financial crisis of 2008.', 'A young man’s difficult entry into adulthood, who experiences the highs and lows of his first love, while dealing with the familial fallout spurred by the financial crisis of 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqwSUWQcnd1cxpc6Gdx1X3t5v2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834742'),
  ('457031212908890360', 'First Love, Last Rites', 1998, 'Drama', 'Alberto Gieco, Michael Melamed, Tom Richmond', 'Jesse Peretz, David Ryan', 'Giovanni Ribisi, Natasha Gregson Wagner, Robert John Burke, Jeannetta Arnette, Donal Logue, Eli Marienthal, Hugh Joseph Babin, Earl S. Binnings', 'R', 'Passion and infatuation ignite as two lovers flounder through their "first time" in this alarmingly sexy film set in the Louisiana bayou. Joey and Sissel are a young misguided couple trying desperately to make their way through their first intense relationship. Blinded by sexual attraction, they become oblivious to everything around them. But when forced far great than themselves threaten their idyllic existence, each must learn to cope with heart-wrenching pain and loss.', 'Passion and infatuation ignite as two lovers flounder through their "first time" in this alarmingly sexy film set in the Louisiana bayou. Joey and Sissel are a young misguided couple trying desperately to make their way through their first intense relationship. Blinded by sexual attraction, they become oblivious to everything around them. But when forced far great than themselves threaten their idyllic existence, each must learn to cope with heart-wrenching pain and loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4yN57gmVvLKdHOdUZ5GDQk6gW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118452'),
  ('667172986488148929', 'First Love: The Litter on the Breeze', 1997, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Eric Kot Man-Fai, Christopher Doyle', 'Ocean Chan, Patrick Kong Pak-Leung', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Vivi Lee, Eric Kot Man-Fai, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Calvin Choi Yat-Chi, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Nancy Lan Sai, Delon Cheung Dik-Lung', null, 'Faced with the task of creating a film about first love for his producer Wong Kar-wai, Kot ruminates on his creative process, his rejected ideas, and finally his two chosen tales, about a sleepwalker guided through the night by a lonely admirer, and a married convenience store owner faced with the vengeful first love that he once rejected.', 'Faced with the task of creating a film about first love for his producer Wong Kar-wai, Kot ruminates on his creative process, his rejected ideas, and finally his two chosen tales, about a sleepwalker guided through the night by a lonely admirer, and a married convenience store owner faced with the vengeful first love that he once rejected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xld75PvfvT36bCGy7C8j4zb82Pg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215984'),
  ('48917691849666422', 'First Man', 2018, 'History, Drama', 'James M. Churchman, Jenne Lee, Spencer Taylor', 'Josh Singer', 'Ryan Gosling, Claire Foy, Jason Clarke, Kyle Chandler, Corey Stoll, Patrick Fugit, Christopher Abbott, Ciarán Hinds', 'PG-13', 'A look at the life of the astronaut, Neil Armstrong, and the legendary space mission that led him to become the first man to walk on the Moon on July 20, 1969.', 'A look at the life of the astronaut, Neil Armstrong, and the legendary space mission that led him to become the first man to walk on the Moon on July 20, 1969.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i91mfvFcPPlaegcbOyjGgiWfZzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369972'),
  ('748310126558131336', 'First Man into Space', 1959, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Drama', 'Robert Day, Geoffrey Faithfull', 'Charles F. Vetter, John Croydon', 'Marshall Thompson, Marla Landi, Bill Edwards, Robert Ayres, Carl Jaffe, Bill Nagy, Roger Delgado, John McLaren', 'NR', 'The first pilot to leave Earth''s atmosphere lands, then vanishes; but something with a craving for blood prowls the countryside...', 'The first pilot to leave Earth''s atmosphere lands, then vanishes; but something with a craving for blood prowls the countryside...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKBIGRetSbZ6cBRWqaNzwHvkgy9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28955'),
  ('614942030833833462', 'First Match', 2018, 'Drama', 'Olivia Newman, Ashley Connor', 'Olivia Newman', 'Elvire Emanuelle, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Colman Domingo, Jharrel Jerome, Jared Kemp, Jeanette Branch, Jimmy Gary Jr., Kim Ramirez', null, 'Hardened by years in foster care, a teenage girl from Brooklyn’s Brownsville neighborhood decides that wrestling boys is the only way back to her estranged father.', 'Hardened by years in foster care, a teenage girl from Brooklyn’s Brownsville neighborhood decides that wrestling boys is the only way back to her estranged father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwmtK6A7jwriIY0gh0HUgvI1ETA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502122'),
  ('1002800954915397725', 'First Men in the Moon', 1964, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Nathan Juran, Wilkie Cooper, George Pollard', 'Nigel Kneale, Jan Read', 'Edward Judd, Martha Hyer, Lionel Jeffries, Miles Malleson, Norman Bird, Gladys Henson, Hugh McDermott, Betty McDowall', 'NR', 'The world is delighted when a spacecraft containing a crew made up of the world''s astronauts lands on the moon, but are shocked when the astronauts discover an old British flag and a document declaring that the moon is taken for Queen Victoria proving that the astronauts were not the first men on the moon.', 'The world is delighted when a spacecraft containing a crew made up of the world''s astronauts lands on the moon, but are shocked when the astronauts discover an old British flag and a document declaring that the moon is taken for Queen Victoria proving that the astronauts were not the first men on the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2Ee1fUretsxTvNrobQzeVYbq22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34276'),
