  ('673627772151119625', 'First Shift', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Béla Baptiste, Phillip Rush, May Satsuki Asai', 'Uwe Boll', 'Gino Anthony Pesi, Kristen Renton, James McMenamin, Willie C. Carpenter, Daniel Sauli, Brandi Bravo, Garry Pastore, Kwabena Ampofo', null, 'NYPD veteran Mike and rookie Angela tackle a high-stakes day on New York''s toughest streets, diving headfirst into a vortex of danger and action. Their adrenaline-fueled pursuits and unexpected threats unfold as they navigate perilous encounters. Amidst the chaos, intense challenges forge unbreakable bonds.', 'NYPD veteran Mike and rookie Angela tackle a high-stakes day on New York''s toughest streets, diving headfirst into a vortex of danger and action. Their adrenaline-fueled pursuits and unexpected threats unfold as they navigate perilous encounters. Amidst the chaos, intense challenges forge unbreakable bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajsGI4JYaciPIe3gPgiJ3Vw5Vre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1090007'),
