  ('1129681115615746564', 'First Sunday', 2008, 'Comedy, Action', 'David E. Talbert, Alan Caso, Basti Van Der Woude', 'David E. Talbert', 'Ice Cube, Katt Williams, Tracy Morgan, Loretta Devine, Michael Beach, Keith David, Regina Hall, Malinda Williams', 'PG-13', 'Durell and LeeJohn are best friends and bumbling petty criminals. When told they have one week to pay a $17,000 debt or Durell will lose his son, they come up with a desperate scheme to rob their neighborhood church. Instead, they end up spending the night in the presence of the Lord and are forced to deal with much more than they bargained for.', 'Durell and LeeJohn are best friends and bumbling petty criminals. When told they have one week to pay a $17,000 debt or Durell will lose his son, they come up with a desperate scheme to rob their neighborhood church. Instead, they end up spending the night in the presence of the Lord and are forced to deal with much more than they bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9l0sdc7ohLe6TdFsYyCTBnVn1F8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14423'),
  ('569431358076476416', 'First Taste', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Roman Perez Jr.', null, 'Angeli Khang, Robb Guinto, Matthew Francisco, Susan Africa, Audrey Avila, Christy Imperial, Lea Bernabe, Jem Milton', 'R', 'Yuna, a woman engaged with her long time boyfriend, Nicco, starts to have second thoughts when she meets again her first love, Becca. Now she is torn between the man she loves and the woman she first loved.', 'Yuna, a woman engaged with her long time boyfriend, Nicco, starts to have second thoughts when she meets again her first love, Becca. Now she is torn between the man she loves and the woman she first loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDWZS6LznvdH7mZOYfCro0ISJCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1308821'),
  ('754385519349879252', 'First They Killed My Father', 2017, 'War, Drama, History', 'Angelina Jolie, Anthony Dod Mantle, Adam Somner', 'Angelina Jolie, Loung Ung', 'Sareum Srey Moch, Phoeung Kompheak, Sveng Socheata, Mun Kimhak, Heng Dara, Khoun Sothea, Sarun Nika, Run Malyna', 'R', 'A 5-year-old girl embarks on a harrowing quest for survival amid the sudden rise and terrifying reign of the Khmer Rouge in Cambodia.', 'A 5-year-old girl embarks on a harrowing quest for survival amid the sudden rise and terrifying reign of the Khmer Rouge in Cambodia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5370jxJfZQY8TUZiiGkpNgvRwU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433247'),
  ('280067945545191924', 'First Time', 2012, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Han Yan, Charlie Lam', 'Han Yan', 'AngelaBaby, Mark Chao You-Ting, Jiang Shan, Cindy Yen, Bai Baihe, Tian Yuan, Huang Xuan', null, 'Sonq Shiqiao (Angelababy), 22, lives with her devoted mother, widowed shop owner Zheng Qing (Jiang Shan). Shiqiao, who always dreamed of being a ballet dancer, cannot exert herself physically as she suffers from form of myasthenia, a neuromuscular disease, that her father died of; the medication she takes also causes memory lapses. One day, at a charity fair, she bumps into Gong Ning (Mark Chao), a former high-school friend she always liked, and the two end up dating, despite the initial disapproval of her mother. Gong Ning dropped out of university to spend more time with a rock band he leads; also, his girlfriend, dancer Peng Wei (Cindy Yen), has dumped him because of his inability to focus his life. However, for Shiqiao, Gong Ning is the perfect partner.', 'Sonq Shiqiao (Angelababy), 22, lives with her devoted mother, widowed shop owner Zheng Qing (Jiang Shan). Shiqiao, who always dreamed of being a ballet dancer, cannot exert herself physically as she suffers from form of myasthenia, a neuromuscular disease, that her father died of; the medication she takes also causes memory lapses. One day, at a charity fair, she bumps into Gong Ning (Mark Chao), a former high-school friend she always liked, and the two end up dating, despite the initial disapproval of her mother. Gong Ning dropped out of university to spend more time with a rock band he leads; also, his girlfriend, dancer Peng Wei (Cindy Yen), has dumped him because of his inability to focus his life. However, for Shiqiao, Gong Ning is the perfect partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tR5MbLnPnBF3gUBzkkXYhfY6cmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118913'),
  ('150139109111529868', 'First Time Felon', 1997, 'Drama', 'Charles S. Dutton, Jeffrey Jur', 'Daniel Therriault', 'Omar Epps, Delroy Lindo, Rachel Ticotin, Treach, Justin Pierce, Lucinda Jenney, Robin Michelle McClamb, Tom Nowicki', 'R', 'Inspired by the true story of Greg Yance. In the film, Yance (Epps) is a hood who goes to jail for possession of drugs. He is given a choice: 5 years in jail or a couple of months in boot camp. He chooses boot camp and finds out it is tougher than he thought it would be. He braves it through and comes home a better man. He then has to deal with the real world, and never gives up no matter what the odds.', 'Inspired by the true story of Greg Yance. In the film, Yance (Epps) is a hood who goes to jail for possession of drugs. He is given a choice: 5 years in jail or a couple of months in boot camp. He chooses boot camp and finds out it is tougher than he thought it would be. He braves it through and comes home a better man. He then has to deal with the real world, and never gives up no matter what the odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FFUIycnveVyGrUWuK3HzPzKF4M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50296'),
  ('203388705286552366', 'Firstborn', 1984, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Apted, Ralf D. Bode', 'Ron Koslow', 'Teri Garr, Peter Weller, Christopher Collet, Corey Haim, Sarah Jessica Parker, Robert Downey Jr., Chris Gartin, James Harper', 'PG-13', 'Because he''s the oldest, Jake has been the man of the house, since his parents divorce. When Mom starts seeing Sam, who always seems to be trying some new way to get rich quick, and declares he''s the man of the house now, Jake puts up with it. Until he discovers Sam''s illegal activities.', 'Because he''s the oldest, Jake has been the man of the house, since his parents divorce. When Mom starts seeing Sam, who always seems to be trying some new way to get rich quick, and declares he''s the man of the house now, Jake puts up with it. Until he discovers Sam''s illegal activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99jvmDl1fmXLeeEow06zi88PqA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54752'),
  ('893221919251184271', 'Fish and Elephant', 2001, 'Romance, Drama', 'Xiaoping Fei, Li Yu', 'Li Yu', 'Pan Yi, Shi Tou, Pengcheng Su, Zhang Jilian, Zhang Qiangian', null, 'A lesbian deals with her former girlfriend and a divorced mother who wants her to meet men.', 'A lesbian deals with her former girlfriend and a divorced mother who wants her to meet men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abrG1zic0Ea1UTrUUTkSusD4cvh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254479'),
  ('678066150701542065', 'Fish Out of Water', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Erik Clausen, Birthe Frost, Claus Loof', 'Leif Sylvester, John Nehm, Sanni Sylvester', 'Erik Clausen, Helle Ryslinge, Leif Sylvester, Anne Marie Helger, Bjarne Liller, Torben Zeller, Lene Brøndum, Kjeld Løfting', null, 'The early 1990s: 300,000 Danes are out of work. Viggo, a machinist with two grown children, is silent about feelings, scared he''ll lose his job, loud about the value of trade unionism, interested in his pet fish, and argumentative at dinner. His wife Oda puts up with his moods and works on family genealogy. When Viggo is laid off, he becomes a fish out of water, hardly looking for work, starting a garden, and taking up with Karen, a polished but unhappy widow. He lies to his wife about a union training and goes to Mallorca with Karen. When she stops the affair, Viggo ends up in a psychiatric ward and must figure out what''s really important in his life and in his character', 'The early 1990s: 300,000 Danes are out of work. Viggo, a machinist with two grown children, is silent about feelings, scared he''ll lose his job, loud about the value of trade unionism, interested in his pet fish, and argumentative at dinner. His wife Oda puts up with his moods and works on family genealogy. When Viggo is laid off, he becomes a fish out of water, hardly looking for work, starting a garden, and taking up with Karen, a polished but unhappy widow. He lies to his wife about a union training and goes to Mallorca with Karen. When she stops the affair, Viggo ends up in a psychiatric ward and must figure out what''s really important in his life and in his character', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f41d3GW4eZVKYAehrvtzugY3vW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57262'),
  ('647740015164209568', 'Fish People', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Jorge Iglesias', 'Jorge Iglesias, Mauro Entrialgo', 'Juan Díaz, David Tenreiro, Diana Palazón, Luke Donovan, Iñaki Esnaola, Ion Gabella, Gorka Aguinagalde, Manuel Manquiña', null, 'A group of guys face the problems of daily life in a shared house', 'A group of guys face the problems of daily life in a shared house', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9kcuRphWnArEk93cazTiZdUfyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102391'),
  ('906854669276729770', 'Fish Story', 2009, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Katsutoshi Hirabayashi, Sêko Ishihata', 'Tamio Hayashi', 'Atsushi Ito, Kengo Kora, Mikako Tabe, Gaku Hamada, Mirai Moriyama, Nao Omori, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Toshimitsu Okawa', null, 'A rock band writes a song called "Fish Story" that is foretold to save the world. The song exceeds the boundaries of space and time and ties people and their stories together.', 'A rock band writes a song called "Fish Story" that is foretold to save the world. The song exceeds the boundaries of space and time and ties people and their stories together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9boTcyjQ4IMnosjrFYhTyFsD7F4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38010'),
  ('211660798514262365', 'Fish Tank', 2009, 'Drama', 'Andrea Arnold, Jo Tew, Lee Grumett', 'Andrea Arnold', 'Katie Jarvis, Michael Fassbender, Kierston Wareing, Rebecca Griffiths, Harry Treadaway, Jason Maza, Jack Gordon, Joanna Horton', 'NR', 'Fifteen-year-old Mia is in a constant state of war with her family and the world around her. When she meets her party-girl mother’s charming new boyfriend Connor, she is amazed to find he returns her attention, and believes he might help her start to make sense of her life.', 'Fifteen-year-old Mia is in a constant state of war with her family and the world around her. When she meets her party-girl mother’s charming new boyfriend Connor, she is amazed to find he returns her attention, and believes he might help her start to make sense of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rI3MKBDsWzQHi9PWDAMKkgmYcff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24469'),
  ('585407528806936106', 'Fishbelly White', 1998, 'Drama', 'Michael Burke, Vanja Černjul', 'Michael Burke', 'Mickey Smith, Jason Hayes, Todd Batstone, Forrest Seward, Sean Flood, Danielle Duby, Ashley Scranton, Rick Bank', null, 'An awkward young farm boy undergoes a profound and painful rite of passage in Michael Burke''s masterful drama of nascent sexuality and friendship. Ridiculed for his love of animals (his best friend is a chicken), the boy''s acceptance by his peers requires a stunning choice.', 'An awkward young farm boy undergoes a profound and painful rite of passage in Michael Burke''s masterful drama of nascent sexuality and friendship. Ridiculed for his love of animals (his best friend is a chicken), the boy''s acceptance by his peers requires a stunning choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csapNKd9J1rRVqNXhIhhAqEmxZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49138'),
  ('633212313784678836', 'Fisherman''s Friends', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jenny Dee, Luc Gavigan, Amber Tordoff-Gibson', 'Piers Ashworth, Meg Leonard, Nick Moorcroft', 'Daniel Mays, James Purefoy, Tuppence Middleton, David Hayman, Dave Johns, Sam Swainsbury, Maggie Steed, Noel Clarke', 'PG-13', 'Ten fishermen from Cornwall are signed by Universal Records and achieve a top ten hit with their debut album of Sea Shanties. Based on the true-life story of Cornish folk band, Fisherman''s Friends.', 'Ten fishermen from Cornwall are signed by Universal Records and achieve a top ten hit with their debut album of Sea Shanties. Based on the true-life story of Cornish folk band, Fisherman''s Friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4faFbkPf8aH5nrY4YcNvn40PXLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559713'),
  ('974609133420435713', 'Fisherman''s Friends: One and All', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Meg Leonard, Nick Moorcroft, Ewan Stewart', 'Meg Leonard, Nick Moorcroft, Piers Ashworth', 'James Purefoy, Dave Johns, Sam Swainsbury, Maggie Steed, Jade Anouka, Richard Harrington, David Hayman, Imelda May', null, 'Following the unexpected success of the band’s debut album “No Hopers, Jokers and Rogues”, we re-join them almost a year later, struggling with the pressures, pitfalls and temptations of their newfound fame, second album syndrome, and performing on the pyramid stage at Glastonbury.', 'Following the unexpected success of the band’s debut album “No Hopers, Jokers and Rogues”, we re-join them almost a year later, struggling with the pressures, pitfalls and temptations of their newfound fame, second album syndrome, and performing on the pyramid stage at Glastonbury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WeMkqQizO3GAdgTvm5wLeQBFUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684006'),
  ('974692451872956172', 'Fisheye', 1980, 'Mystery, Animation, Horror, Drama', 'Joško Marušić', null, null, null, 'A fishing village falls prey to a nightmare revenge from the sea. Award-winning Yugoslavian animated short film.', 'A fishing village falls prey to a nightmare revenge from the sea. Award-winning Yugoslavian animated short film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5z20ARlsR6twqYrDeZH78UCnkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282391'),
  ('714160233518141056', 'Fishin'' Around', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, null, 'Mickey takes Pluto fishing in a boat on a lake, but they aren''t too successful. The fish mock them, and even steal the bait can. Finally, the game warden spots them (Mickey had ignored the "no fishing" sign) and gives chase.', 'Mickey takes Pluto fishing in a boat on a lake, but they aren''t too successful. The fish mock them, and even steal the bait can. Finally, the game warden spots them (Mickey had ignored the "no fishing" sign) and gives chase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeApUZ8kpl1DoPJnZ1ZefQ5Zm6u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162593'),
  ('94856885304497809', 'Fishing Boats', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Vittorio De Seta, Vittorio De Seta', null, null, null, 'The unpredictable nature of the sea governs the world of Sicilian fishermen as they work, rest, and seek refuge from a storm.', 'The unpredictable nature of the sea governs the world of Sicilian fishermen as they work, rest, and seek refuge from a storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67Ac0Qj6xqap3usFII8YhlAllc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148068'),
  ('334395294581590304', 'Fishing for Goldfish', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Andrée Lumière, Auguste Lumière', null, 'A man, holding a baby up in his hands, is standing next to a fishbowl. The baby is trying, in vain, to catch a goldfish with her bare hands.', 'A man, holding a baby up in his hands, is standing next to a fishbowl. The baby is trying, in vain, to catch a goldfish with her bare hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7KFu4hJ9Rb2CNViv30CkMWm8B0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127764'),
  ('345356634707454073', 'Fishlove', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Babinet, Timo Salminen', 'Olivier Babinet, David Elkaïm', 'Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Gustave Kervern, India Hair, Sofian Khammes, Okinawa Valérie Guerard, Edson Anibal, Justin Eng', null, 'Daniel, a biologist studying the disappearance of fish, is haunted by paternity. It is by looking for a woman who could be the mother of his children that he will come across a strange fish and discover what he really lacks: love.', 'Daniel, a biologist studying the disappearance of fish, is haunted by paternity. It is by looking for a woman who could be the mother of his children that he will come across a strange fish and discover what he really lacks: love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y19yeHiAKBINqvm1DheUSrMr0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592782'),
  ('632651605750701237', 'Fishtronaut: The Movie', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Kiko Mistrorigo, Rodrigo Eba, Celia Catunda', null, 'Celso Alves, Fernanda Bullara, Fábio Lucindo', null, 'Fishtronaut, Marina and Zeek travel to the big city in search of Grandpa, only to find that everyone else has mysteriously vanished too.', 'Fishtronaut, Marina and Zeek travel to the big city in search of Grandpa, only to find that everyone else has mysteriously vanished too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVqQ3Z2Xod8RlIshntT7QzY4Pko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456635'),
  ('56847984849490575', 'Fissures', 2007, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Alantė Kavaitė, Dominique Colin', 'Alantė Kavaitė', 'Émilie Dequenne, Ludmila Mikaël, Mathieu Demy, Nadia Barentin, Etienne Chicot, Antoine de Prekel, Bruno Flender, Joël François', null, 'Charlotte, an alienated sound engineer, travels to the country home where her mother was just murdered. She is quickly frustrated by the lack of progress in the police investigation and so begins her own. While listening to a fresh sound recording she made in her mother''s house, Charlotte discovers a strange phenomenon, she can hear sounds from the past in her headphones. Soon she is using this ability to hear the past to piece together the last few days of her mother''s life, drawing ever closer to discovering who killed her, even as the murderer returns to try and eliminate Charlotte before they are discovered.', 'Charlotte, an alienated sound engineer, travels to the country home where her mother was just murdered. She is quickly frustrated by the lack of progress in the police investigation and so begins her own. While listening to a fresh sound recording she made in her mother''s house, Charlotte discovers a strange phenomenon, she can hear sounds from the past in her headphones. Soon she is using this ability to hear the past to piece together the last few days of her mother''s life, drawing ever closer to discovering who killed her, even as the murderer returns to try and eliminate Charlotte before they are discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5HOqIBTdX7USFQULb3fxQsB7OB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59276'),
  ('579998384677653138', 'Fist & Furious', 2019, 'Action, Crime', 'Baek Yoon-seuk, Ha Won-jun', 'Ha Won-jun', 'Jung Doo-hong, Ryu Deok-hwan, Seo Eun-ah, Jeong Ui-gap, Lee Chae-dam, Yoo Jeong-ho, Kim Jung-pal', null, 'Looking for a new interesting story, VJ reporter Guk-hyun is fascinated with a story of a former detective Gi-man, living a life with a blade in his head for certain reason. Guk-hyun convinces Gi-man to take him upon condition that he make a record of Gi-man''s revenge on Tae-hwa, the head of drug cartel. While searching for Tae-hwa''s whereabouts, they decide to head towards unknown Island where Tae-hwa is expected to be staying.', 'Looking for a new interesting story, VJ reporter Guk-hyun is fascinated with a story of a former detective Gi-man, living a life with a blade in his head for certain reason. Guk-hyun convinces Gi-man to take him upon condition that he make a record of Gi-man''s revenge on Tae-hwa, the head of drug cartel. While searching for Tae-hwa''s whereabouts, they decide to head towards unknown Island where Tae-hwa is expected to be staying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAgcdhP400efTl7p4FhqF3PGNXT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607836'),
  ('447004933300001744', 'Fist Fight', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Richie Keen, Eric Alan Edwards, Vincent Lascoumes', 'Evan Susser, Van Robichaux', 'Charlie Day, Ice Cube, Tracy Morgan, Jillian Bell, Christina Hendricks, Dean Norris, Kumail Nanjiani, Dennis Haysbert', 'R', 'When one school teacher gets the other fired, he is challenged to an after-school fight.', 'When one school teacher gets the other fired, he is challenged to an after-school fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huRhv4IZDk2ds0DIDkI6uxdmb6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345922'),
  ('565350749371557308', 'Fist Fighter', 1989, 'Action, Drama', 'Hans Burmann, Frank Zuniga', 'Carlos Vasallo, Max Bloom', 'Jorge Rivero, Matthias Hues, Edward Albert, Brenda Bakke, Mike Connors, Simón Andreu, Emiliano Redondo, Eleazar García Jr.', null, 'C.J. Thunderbird, a down-on-his-luck professional fighter is informed that his old friend has been killed in an illegal fight. He finds out that the killer is a goon named Rhino and, with vengeance on his mind, tracks him down in Bolivia. The trouble is that the guy works for a local drug lord and the only way for C.J. to get to Rhino is to prove himself with his fists. However, the druglord doesn''t want his best goon hurt, so he arranges for the corrupt local authorities to bust C.J. and send him to prison. The only way out is fighting the prison''s monstrous colossal cage-fighting champ known as the Beast, who''s never left an opponent breathing. Druglord''s hot blond Caucasian girlfriend, Ellen, tired of being at the criminal''s mercy, decides to help C.J. anyway she can. Even with all the odds against him, C.J. is no pushover and Rhino slowly becomes worried.', 'C.J. Thunderbird, a down-on-his-luck professional fighter is informed that his old friend has been killed in an illegal fight. He finds out that the killer is a goon named Rhino and, with vengeance on his mind, tracks him down in Bolivia. The trouble is that the guy works for a local drug lord and the only way for C.J. to get to Rhino is to prove himself with his fists. However, the druglord doesn''t want his best goon hurt, so he arranges for the corrupt local authorities to bust C.J. and send him to prison. The only way out is fighting the prison''s monstrous colossal cage-fighting champ known as the Beast, who''s never left an opponent breathing. Druglord''s hot blond Caucasian girlfriend, Ellen, tired of being at the criminal''s mercy, decides to help C.J. anyway she can. Even with all the odds against him, C.J. is no pushover and Rhino slowly becomes worried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCcoztDgDIeKvbEBh88xyOrt7Pr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140468'),
  ('379776641743580409', 'Fist of Fear, Touch of Death', 1980, 'Action, Documentary, Comedy', 'Matthew Mallinson, John Gray, John Hazard', 'Ron Harvey', 'Fred Williamson, Ron Van Clief, Adolph Caesar, Aaron Banks, Bill Louie, Teruyuki Higa, Richard Barathy, Louis Neglia', null, 'A television reporter interviews fighters and promoters about Bruce Lee in preparation for a tournament to claim the title of “Successor to the Bruce Lee legacy”. Footage from Bruce Lee''s films and interviews is repurposed in pseudo-documentary style.', 'A television reporter interviews fighters and promoters about Bruce Lee in preparation for a tournament to claim the title of “Successor to the Bruce Lee legacy”. Footage from Bruce Lee''s films and interviews is repurposed in pseudo-documentary style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yQtzkPKD7z3ZqRraoGXhwMUKwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31249'),
  ('1136449816307330526', 'Fist of Fury', 1972, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Chris Chen Ching-Chu, Lo Wei, Chih Yao-Chang', 'Lo Wei', 'Bruce Lee, Nora Miao, Maria Yi, James Tien Chun, Tien Feng, Huang Tsung-Hsun, Han Ying-Chieh, Wei Ping-Ao', 'R', 'During the Japanese occupation of Shanghai, Chen Zhen, the star pupil of a recently-deceased martial arts teacher battles a Japanese dojo which seeks the demise of his fighting school.', 'During the Japanese occupation of Shanghai, Chen Zhen, the star pupil of a recently-deceased martial arts teacher battles a Japanese dojo which seeks the demise of his fighting school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlcipCOa9hlfBBz7kCAyjsf3q0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11713'),
  ('367739222347389074', 'Fist of Fury 1991', 1991, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jimmy Leung Chi-Ming, Joh Chung-Sing', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Hoh Dung', 'Stephen Chow, Kenny Bee, Sharla Cheung, Corey Yuen, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming, Shing Fui-On, Susan Ha Chi-Chun, Tung Chi', null, 'Lau Ching, a Mainlander with an incredibly powerful right arm, arrives in Hong Kong to find his cousin. He befriends with a drifter named Handsome, and a martial artist girl named Mandy. In order to woo her, Ching participates in a fighting competition in hopes of winning a $10 million prize, and must defeat his love rival, Wai, in the ring.', 'Lau Ching, a Mainlander with an incredibly powerful right arm, arrives in Hong Kong to find his cousin. He befriends with a drifter named Handsome, and a martial artist girl named Mandy. In order to woo her, Ching participates in a fighting competition in hopes of winning a $10 million prize, and must defeat his love rival, Wai, in the ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOXchmNwK4Xzqjip94W7dUZGMpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73414'),
  ('38473702305712448', 'Fist of Fury 1991 II', 1992, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jimmy Leung Chi-Ming, Joh Chung-Sing, Chan Yuen-Kai', 'Hoh Dung, Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Stephen Chow, Josephine Siao Fong-Fong, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Sharla Cheung, Kenny Bee, Yuen Wah, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming, Richard Yuen Tak', null, 'After the total defeat of his love rival, Ching must now deal with the love rival''s brother, Wan To, who seeks revenge against him. When Ching is ambushed by Wan To and his gang in the streets and is at risk, he is rescued and treated by an apprentice of his, Beef Skin, and his feisty sister, Beef Stew. It turns out those two are even harder to handle than Wan To.', 'After the total defeat of his love rival, Ching must now deal with the love rival''s brother, Wan To, who seeks revenge against him. When Ching is ambushed by Wan To and his gang in the streets and is at risk, he is rescued and treated by an apprentice of his, Beef Skin, and his feisty sister, Beef Stew. It turns out those two are even harder to handle than Wan To.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JggJ8UwLdzprT8JueVvOOMQ8Hx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73417'),
  ('439741099306206687', 'Fist of Fury 2', 1977, 'Action', 'Lee Tso-Nam, Jimmy Shaw, Iksan Lahardi', 'Chang Hsin-Yi', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Lo Lieh, Tien Feng, Li Kun, Yasuyoshi Shikamura, James Nam Seok-Hoon, Chao Kin, Chan Wai Lui', null, 'After Japanese warriors execute the Chinese Jingwu kung fu school''s headmaster, Chen Zhen, and raid a number of schools in an effort to weed out Jingwu rebels, Zhen''s brother, Chen Shen, vows revenge.', 'After Japanese warriors execute the Chinese Jingwu kung fu school''s headmaster, Chen Zhen, and raid a number of schools in an effort to weed out Jingwu rebels, Zhen''s brother, Chen Shen, vows revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qi2phgQI6EYZhm2FyBAwfWBcEfT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68742'),
  ('869461489586720060', 'Fist of Jesus', 2012, 'Comedy, Action, Horror', 'David Muñoz, Adrián Cardona, Paco Ferrari', 'David Muñoz', 'Marc Velasco, Noé Blancafort, Salvador Llós, Victoria Roldán, Roger Sotera, José María Angorrilla', null, 'When Jacob tells Jesus that Lazarus, his son, is dead, he goes to his house to raise him from the dead.', 'When Jacob tells Jesus that Lazarus, his son, is dead, he goes to his house to raise him from the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inbO6OFjMm8SMH3cgnSs9sWJFy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167956'),
  ('824659824254967057', 'Fist of Legend', 1994, 'Action', 'Derek Wan Man-Kit, Gordon Chan, Yuen Pau Woo', 'Gordon Chan, Lan Kay Toa, Kim Yip Kwong-Kim', 'Jet Li, Shinobu Nakayama, Chin Siu-Ho, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Yasuaki Kurata, Paul Chun Pui, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Jackson Liu', 'R', 'Chen returns to his school when he finds out that his martial arts teacher has died. When he learns that his school students are harassed by some hooligans, he gears himself up to save them.', 'Chen returns to his school when he finds out that his martial arts teacher has died. When he learns that his school students are harassed by some hooligans, he gears himself up to save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aqa1Yuog2OFrduwSffxZc2w4Tnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17809'),
  ('998340755710205329', 'Fist of the Condor', 2023, 'Action', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza, Nahuel Medel, Nicolás Ibieta', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza', 'Marko Zaror, Gina Aguad, Eyal Meyer, Man Soo Yoon, José Manuel, Francisco Castro, Fernanda Urrejola, Francisco Fuentes', 'NR', 'Upon the empire’s fall to invading conquistadors, the 16th-century Incas quickly concealed a sacred manual containing the secrets behind their deadly fighting technique. But after centuries of careful safeguarding, the manual is again at risk of falling into the wrong hands, leaving its rightful guardian to battle the world’s greatest assassins to protect the ancient secrets within.', 'Upon the empire’s fall to invading conquistadors, the 16th-century Incas quickly concealed a sacred manual containing the secrets behind their deadly fighting technique. But after centuries of careful safeguarding, the manual is again at risk of falling into the wrong hands, leaving its rightful guardian to battle the world’s greatest assassins to protect the ancient secrets within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odpaGY2lG32NG4GL2PuGPt7UUTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064517'),
  ('821163349594633933', 'Fist of the North Star', 1986, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Toyoo Ashida, Kanji Fukunaga, Hideyuki Tanaka', 'Susumu Takaku', 'Akira Kamiya, Yuriko Yamamoto, Kenji Utsumi, Chikao Ohtsuka, Toshio Furukawa, Kaneto Shiozawa, Tomiko Suzuki, Teiyu Ichiryusai', 'NR', 'After a nuclear holocaust tears the world apart, mankind is forced to the harshness of not only the oppression of others who are much more powerful, but the dead earth which seems to be getting worse with every passing moment. But a savior has risen from the ashes, a man who will defeat those who would torment the weak and make the world a livable place once more. A man named Kenshiro...', 'After a nuclear holocaust tears the world apart, mankind is forced to the harshness of not only the oppression of others who are much more powerful, but the dead earth which seems to be getting worse with every passing moment. But a savior has risen from the ashes, a man who will defeat those who would torment the weak and make the world a livable place once more. A man named Kenshiro...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YCNdrSstrYovSYyKMCDxkkDUsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19877'),
  ('229669315450513889', 'Fist of the North Star', 1995, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Tony Randel, Jacques Haitkin', 'Peter Atkins, Tony Randel', 'Gary Daniels, Malcolm McDowell, Costas Mandylor, Downtown Julie Brown, Dante Basco, Nalona Herron, William L. Nagle, Clint Howard', 'R', 'From the immensely popular FIST OF THE NORTH STAR comic book series, comes a new hero. The fate of mankind rests with superhuman warrior Kenshiro who roams the wastelands of the future waging a battle against overwhelming evil. With the spiritual guidance of his dead father, Kenshiro fights to free his stolen love from the brutal tyrant Lord Shin. Through his struggle he must confront his destiny.', 'From the immensely popular FIST OF THE NORTH STAR comic book series, comes a new hero. The fate of mankind rests with superhuman warrior Kenshiro who roams the wastelands of the future waging a battle against overwhelming evil. With the spiritual guidance of his dead father, Kenshiro fights to free his stolen love from the brutal tyrant Lord Shin. Through his struggle he must confront his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkZINehDU8GTiNT0XfssMCeU57T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26300'),
  ('497427301907698858', 'Fist of the North Star: Legend of Raoh - Chapter of Fierce Fighting', 2007, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Romance', 'Toshiki Hirano, Masato Sato, Satoru Koyama', 'Katsuhiko Manabe, Nobuhiko Horie, Yoshinobu Kamo', 'Hiroshi Abe, Takashi Ukaji, Yuriko Ishida, Nobuaki Kakuda, Ko Shibasaki, Daisuke Gori, Daisuke Namikawa, Maaya Sakamoto', null, 'A film adaptation of the Last Nanto General story arc from the manga, depicting the final battle between Kenshiro and Raoh that led to Kenshiro becoming the successor of Hokuto Shinken. Some events from the manga / anime have been excluded from the story (such as Raoh''s fight with Juza) whereas others have been altered or expanded. New content featuring the final battle from Raoh''s perspective have been added. This film serves as the follow-up to the first film in the series, which introduced Raoh and Reina''s relationship, this time bringing it to a conclusion.', 'A film adaptation of the Last Nanto General story arc from the manga, depicting the final battle between Kenshiro and Raoh that led to Kenshiro becoming the successor of Hokuto Shinken. Some events from the manga / anime have been excluded from the story (such as Raoh''s fight with Juza) whereas others have been altered or expanded. New content featuring the final battle from Raoh''s perspective have been added. This film serves as the follow-up to the first film in the series, which introduced Raoh and Reina''s relationship, this time bringing it to a conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kghwkWiK99pPscP61Tm771Vu5lm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114372'),
  ('646003563772592137', 'Fist of the North Star: The Legend of Kenshiro', 2008, 'Animation, Action, Drama', 'Masato Sato, Toru Nakano, Masaki Sato', 'Nobuhiko Horie', 'Hiroshi Abe, Yuriko Ishida, Romi Park, Takeshi Aono, Keiichi Nanba, Mina Tominaga, Hiromi Konno, Shozo Iizuka', null, 'The film''s story is a prequel to the Fist of the North Star depicting the one year interval between Kenshiro''s defeat at the hands of Shin and their later battle. Unlike the others in the series this film has a completely original storyline in which Kenshiro, near death after his battle with Shin and having used his remaining energy to kill a pack of wolves, was captured by slavers. Due to his strength, Kenshiro could escape whenever he wanted, but chose to stay and protect the other slaves.', 'The film''s story is a prequel to the Fist of the North Star depicting the one year interval between Kenshiro''s defeat at the hands of Shin and their later battle. Unlike the others in the series this film has a completely original storyline in which Kenshiro, near death after his battle with Shin and having used his remaining energy to kill a pack of wolves, was captured by slavers. Due to his strength, Kenshiro could escape whenever he wanted, but chose to stay and protect the other slaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJg8uma4IPUZCoJcsczhr2iS8Z9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105231'),
  ('502028733488690648', 'Fist of the North Star: The Legend of the True Savior: Legend of Raoh-Chapter of Death in Love', 2006, 'Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Takahiro Imamura, Shinya Takahashi, Masato Sato', 'Nobuhiko Horie, Yoshinobu Kamo, Katsuhiko Manabe', 'Hiroshi Abe, Takashi Ukaji, Ko Shibasaki, Akio Otsuka, Hochu Otsuka, Kenyu Horiuchi, Unsho Ishizuka, Daisuke Namikawa', null, 'A film adaptation of the Holy Emperor story arc, which primarily depicted the conflict between Kenshiro and Souther. New characters Reina, one of Raoh''s army officers who falls in love with him, and her brother Soga, Raoh''s advisor, play an important part with much of the plot involving Raoh''s relationship with Reina as he conquers the land; most of this portion is new content exclusive to this film. The other side of the story is the retelling of Ken''s attempt to save and protect the villagers from Souther''s army with the help of Shū. There is also a small subplot of Bart returning to his home.', 'A film adaptation of the Holy Emperor story arc, which primarily depicted the conflict between Kenshiro and Souther. New characters Reina, one of Raoh''s army officers who falls in love with him, and her brother Soga, Raoh''s advisor, play an important part with much of the plot involving Raoh''s relationship with Reina as he conquers the land; most of this portion is new content exclusive to this film. The other side of the story is the retelling of Ken''s attempt to save and protect the villagers from Souther''s army with the help of Shū. There is also a small subplot of Bart returning to his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZfAVFIlzA61dsHZx5cyUX9PzYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109080'),
  ('260170390531018962', 'Fist of the North Star: The Legend of Toki', 2008, 'Animation, Action', 'Kobun Shizuno, Hideo Okazaki', 'Nobuhiko Horie', 'Hiroshi Abe, Takashi Ukaji, Yuriko Ishida, Kenyu Horiuchi, Aya Hirano, Chikao Ohtsuka, Unsho Ishizuka, Daisuke Namikawa', null, 'Fourth part of the new Fist of the North Star movie pentalogy presenting the story from Toki''s perspective, leading up to Toki''s imprisonment in Cassandra and eventually his duel with Raoh.', 'Fourth part of the new Fist of the North Star movie pentalogy presenting the story from Toki''s perspective, leading up to Toki''s imprisonment in Cassandra and eventually his duel with Raoh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TAnQOAZLq7c95LLh7zgPLUML4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114371'),
  ('575804156740001353', 'Fist of the North Star: The Legend of Yuria', 2007, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Drama', 'Hidehito Ueda, Satoru Koyama, Tetsuya Ishikawa', 'Toshiyuki Tabe, Nobuhiko Horie', 'Hiroshi Abe, Takashi Ukaji, Yuriko Ishida, David Ito, Chikao Ohtsuka, Kenyu Horiuchi, Akio Otsuka, Shin-ichiro Miki', null, 'Second part of the new Fist of the North Star movie pentalogy presenting the story from Yuria''s perspective, spanning from her childhood, including the day she first met Kenshiro.', 'Second part of the new Fist of the North Star movie pentalogy presenting the story from Yuria''s perspective, spanning from her childhood, including the day she first met Kenshiro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vj8Td4OYEAyWi96TpLqLAjqg0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114370'),
  ('713296264529324069', 'Fist of Unicorn', 1973, 'Action', 'Tang Ti, Ngai Hoi-Fung', 'Tang Ti', 'Little Unicorn, Kitty Meng Chui, Hwang In-shik, Mang Hoi, Ou-Yang De-Dong, Yasuaki Kurata, Mars, Chin Ti', null, 'Unicorn travels to a village troubled by gangsters in search of revenge for the murder of his parents years before. The task is made more complicated when he befriends a middle-aged woman and her son who begin to admire and depend on him.', 'Unicorn travels to a village troubled by gangsters in search of revenge for the murder of his parents years before. The task is made more complicated when he befriends a middle-aged woman and her son who begin to admire and depend on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24vaDsQQrzH4rwkYhGJVVLlavhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127461'),
  ('749624647289534242', 'Fistful of Vengeance', 2022, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné', 'Yalun Tu, Cameron Litvack, Jessica Chou', 'Iko Uwais, Lewis Tan, Lawrence Kao, Pearl Thusi, Francesca Corney, JuJu Chan, Jason Tobin, Rhatha Phongam', 'R', 'A revenge mission becomes a fight to save the world from an ancient threat when superpowered assassin Kai tracks a killer to Bangkok.', 'A revenge mission becomes a fight to save the world from an ancient threat when superpowered assassin Kai tracks a killer to Bangkok.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cccEF9QZgV9bLWyupJO41HSrOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890656'),
  ('953100878204453897', 'Fists in the Pocket', 1965, 'Drama', 'Alberto Marrama, Marco Bellocchio', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Lou Castel, Paola Pitagora, Marino Masé, Liliana Gerace, Pier Luigi Troglio, Jeannie McNeil, Irene Agnelli, Sandra Bergamini', 'NR', 'A deeply disturbed and epileptic young man benignly decides to murder other members of his dysfunctional family for altruistic reasons.', 'A deeply disturbed and epileptic young man benignly decides to murder other members of his dysfunctional family for altruistic reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEMvB9iuUD8Ol4MeUZxVpoRHopl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46591'),
  ('320120231135493721', 'Fists of Bruce Lee', 1978, 'Action', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Kim Hyeong-Jun, Lai Wen-hsiung', 'Ching Kang Yao', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Lo Lieh, Chen Hui-Lou, Charles Bonet, Wei Ping-Ao, Chuan Yuan, Kim Tae-Jeong, Jang Il-Do', null, 'Bruce Lee (Bruce Li) is assigned to go undercover as Lee Min-Chin to investigate a drug ring. The mob hires an assassin to kill him. They are both great at what they do; as they fight to the death only one will come out alive.', 'Bruce Lee (Bruce Li) is assigned to go undercover as Lee Min-Chin to investigate a drug ring. The mob hires an assassin to kill him. They are both great at what they do; as they fight to the death only one will come out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7vI8rrNbVGz4iwVPkhNLwfVExE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54853'),
  ('196399772509382436', 'Fists of Iron', 1995, 'Action', 'Richard W. Munchkin, Garett Griffin, Maurice K. McGuire', 'Sean Dash', 'Michael Worth, Sam J. Jones, Matthias Hues, Jenilee Harrison, Eric Lee, Marshall R. Teague, Nicholas Hill, María Díaz', null, 'When Dale Hartwell''s best friend gets killed, he swears revenge on the bloodthirsty promoter and fighter who did it.', 'When Dale Hartwell''s best friend gets killed, he swears revenge on the bloodthirsty promoter and fighter who did it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIqArEQYyPE0XAPlamClsYRuntW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29801'),
  ('154476771667783562', 'Fists of Legend', 2013, 'Action, Drama', 'Kang Dae-hui, Kang Woo-suk, Kim Uk', 'Jang Min-seok', 'Hwang Jung-min, Yu Jun-sang, Yoon Je-moon, Lee Yo-won, Ji Woo, Park Jeong-min, Kim Tae-hyung, Park Doo-sik', 'NR', 'Three men who share a past participate in a mixed martial arts reality show where they have to fight against other contestants to win the prize money.', 'Three men who share a past participate in a mixed martial arts reality show where they have to fight against other contestants to win the prize money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAfBO77XyugIUX1qBQygD15jVAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180651'),
  ('395289683343701235', 'Fit Lover', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Zhang Jianya', 'Li Wei, Pang Pang', 'Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Deng Chao, Fan Wei, Leo Ku, Huang Bo, Huang Lei, Huang Xiaoming, Lu Yi', null, 'This film centers on Nie Bing, a high-profile TV hostess, who is obsessed with trying to find her "ideal man" before her 30th birthday. Nie Bing is given a magic car by a mischievous angel, and a different handsome man -one of the 12 featured A-list actors from China, Taiwan and Japan- appears each time she drives it. Lam''s character soon collects a dozen admirers, portrayed by A-list actors from China, Taiwan, and Japan, each with a different profession, personality, and ideas of what constitutes romance', 'This film centers on Nie Bing, a high-profile TV hostess, who is obsessed with trying to find her "ideal man" before her 30th birthday. Nie Bing is given a magic car by a mischievous angel, and a different handsome man -one of the 12 featured A-list actors from China, Taiwan and Japan- appears each time she drives it. Lam''s character soon collects a dozen admirers, portrayed by A-list actors from China, Taiwan, and Japan, each with a different profession, personality, and ideas of what constitutes romance', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEaEzsgQsCM7Li6305x2ohth7yq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60834'),
  ('592036892014162372', 'Fit to Be Tied', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Daws Butler', 'NR', 'Jerry removes a tack from Spike''s paw. In gratitude, Spike gives Jerry a bell to ring when he''s in trouble.', 'Jerry removes a tack from Spike''s paw. In gratitude, Spike gives Jerry a bell to ring when he''s in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irJ1hAz0pYbwsb2X2LmZ293YD0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56710'),
  ('791391859966657674', 'Fit to Kill', 1993, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'Andy Sidaris, Mark Morris, Melanie Chapman', 'Andy Sidaris', 'Dona Speir, Roberta Vasquez, Bruce Penhall, Geoffrey Moore, Tony Peck, Julie Strain, Rodrigo Obregón, Cynthia Brimhall', 'R', 'Buxom do-gooders Donna and Nicole set out to reclaim the stolen Alexa diamond from its hiding place in Russia … only to run into their nemesis, Martin Kane.', 'Buxom do-gooders Donna and Nicole set out to reclaim the stolen Alexa diamond from its hiding place in Russia … only to run into their nemesis, Martin Kane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdaqSdk4FCrRAuslGjCDhwWPhik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45029'),
  ('253851985633837154', 'Fitoor', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Anay Goswami, Mukesh Chhabra, Abhishek Kapoor', 'Abhishek Kapoor, Supratik Sen', 'Tabu, Katrina Kaif, Aditya Roy Kapur, Rahul Bhat, Akshay Oberoi, Lara Dutta, Ajay Devgn, Aditi Rao Hydari', null, 'A young artist tries to win the heart of his muse, while her mother hatches a scheme to end his quest for true love.', 'A young artist tries to win the heart of his muse, while her mother hatches a scheme to end his quest for true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D8KKUspZVzr4pevoiP8G5vs6fI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376047'),
  ('1144309110270740786', 'Fitting In', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Molly McGlynn, Nina Djacic, Miia Piironen', 'Molly McGlynn', 'Maddie Ziegler, Emily Hampshire, D''Pharaoh Woon-A-Tai, Ki Griffin, Djouliet Amara, Dale Whibley, Dennis Andres, Michael Therriault', 'R', 'A teenage girl gets diagnosed with a reproductive condition that upends her plans to have sex and propels her into exploring unusual methods to have a sex life, challenging her relationships with everyone in her life, but most importantly, herself.', 'A teenage girl gets diagnosed with a reproductive condition that upends her plans to have sex and propels her into exploring unusual methods to have a sex life, challenging her relationships with everyone in her life, but most importantly, herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/en64gpXZiwbBewh0om3mOGWuPpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986175'),
  ('1001128729911355003', 'Fitzwilly', 1967, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Delbert Mann, Joseph F. Biroc, Terence Nelson', 'Isobel Lennart', 'Dick Van Dyke, Barbara Feldon, John McGiver, Edith Evans, Harry Townes, John Fiedler, Anne Seymour, Norman Fell', 'NR', 'When Miss Vicki''s father dies, she becomes the world''s greatest philanthropist. Unfortunately, she is flat broke! Her loyal butler, Claude Fitzwilliam, leads the household staff to rob from various businesses by charging goods to various wealthy people and misdirecting the shipments, all to keep Miss Vicki''s standard of living.', 'When Miss Vicki''s father dies, she becomes the world''s greatest philanthropist. Unfortunately, she is flat broke! Her loyal butler, Claude Fitzwilliam, leads the household staff to rob from various businesses by charging goods to various wealthy people and misdirecting the shipments, all to keep Miss Vicki''s standard of living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/749GJU7RGeEJijDcUQJh1mFio4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33730'),
  ('693662684699224512', 'Five', 1951, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Louis Clyde Stoumen, Arch Oboler', 'Arch Oboler', 'William Phipps, Susan Douglas, James Anderson, Charles Lampkin, Earl Lee', null, 'The film''s storyline involves five survivors, one woman and four men, of an atomic bomb disaster. The five come together at a remote, isolated hillside house, where they try to figure out how to survive.', 'The film''s storyline involves five survivors, one woman and four men, of an atomic bomb disaster. The five come together at a remote, isolated hillside house, where they try to figure out how to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awMJBJpywUl7u75rLGohrRZ41wl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48481'),
  ('603204702564439219', 'Five', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Cecilia del Valle, Cinthia Varela, Marco Berger', 'Cinthia Varela, Francisco Forbes, Cecilia del Valle', 'Alberto Rojas Apel, Martina Juncadella, Julio Graham, Luis Mango, Mateo Chiarino, Ayelen Berger, Mariano Contreras, Walter Jakob', null, 'Five sex-themed stories: Story 1: At night, while waiting at the central bus station of Retiro, a man meets an adolescent girl, Reneta at the bus station. They go to a cafe and begin a conversation about sex that will prove to be deeply disturbing. Story 2: Walter, an adolescent boy will discover a new interest in his sister''s boyfriend, Platero while they are fooling around on their bunk bed. Story 3: Virginia and Pablo maintained a loving relationship for some years; she is still in love but he is not the man she met. Story 4: Gustavo, a 40-year-old Argentinean married to an American woman living in the USA longs for his sex life in Buenos Aires stimulated by photos of Argentinean teenagers on the Internet. Story 5: A well-built married office employee has sexual fantasies about the women working in his office.', 'Five sex-themed stories: Story 1: At night, while waiting at the central bus station of Retiro, a man meets an adolescent girl, Reneta at the bus station. They go to a cafe and begin a conversation about sex that will prove to be deeply disturbing. Story 2: Walter, an adolescent boy will discover a new interest in his sister''s boyfriend, Platero while they are fooling around on their bunk bed. Story 3: Virginia and Pablo maintained a loving relationship for some years; she is still in love but he is not the man she met. Story 4: Gustavo, a 40-year-old Argentinean married to an American woman living in the USA longs for his sex life in Buenos Aires stimulated by photos of Argentinean teenagers on the Internet. Story 5: A well-built married office employee has sexual fantasies about the women working in his office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/116HX5evUVFoS4Gv30KNaqeVKD1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313809'),
  ('996608871188654618', 'Five', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Igor Gotesman, Julien Roux', 'Mathieu Oullion, Igor Gotesman, Alice Vial', 'Pierre Niney, François Civil, Igor Gotesman, Margot Bancilhon, Idrissa Hanrot, Pascal Demolon, Michèle Moretti, Philippe Duclos', null, 'A young man paying the rent for himself and his lifelong friends ends up flat-broke and resorts to selling marijuana to pay the bills – only to get caught up in the dangerous world of drugs.', 'A young man paying the rent for himself and his lifelong friends ends up flat-broke and resorts to selling marijuana to pay the bills – only to get caught up in the dangerous world of drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qs4tQK0gLpwNmz2gmCYZQ3RQSpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381356'),
  ('889754441304899652', 'Five Aces', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Slovis, David Michael O''Neill', 'Kevin Bernhardt, David Michael O''Neill', 'Tia Carrere, Charlie Sheen, Christopher McDonald, Jeff Cesario, David Sherrill, Michael McGrady, Malia Mathis, Aimée Leigh', null, 'Chris Martin has a problem: his impending marriage. Like any other man about to enter into the holy vows of matrimony, Chris has begun to second guess himself. Is married life what he really wants? While his bride-to-be takes care of the wedding plans, Chris returns to the neighborhood of his youth to consider his married future and to spend one last week of bachelorhood with his four high school buddies: Ray, Ash, Todd and Sean. Together, the reunited "Five Aces" enjoy a funny bittersweet week reminiscing about a time when they had all the answers... only nothing turned out the way they planned. As the week''s events unfold, the Five Aces begin to realize exactly what life and friends mean to each other.', 'Chris Martin has a problem: his impending marriage. Like any other man about to enter into the holy vows of matrimony, Chris has begun to second guess himself. Is married life what he really wants? While his bride-to-be takes care of the wedding plans, Chris returns to the neighborhood of his youth to consider his married future and to spend one last week of bachelorhood with his four high school buddies: Ray, Ash, Todd and Sean. Together, the reunited "Five Aces" enjoy a funny bittersweet week reminiscing about a time when they had all the answers... only nothing turned out the way they planned. As the week''s events unfold, the Five Aces begin to realize exactly what life and friends mean to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgHkx7tpoNTvXlPW4BFOxPbQsL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58049'),
  ('571413874327620200', 'Five Across the Eyes', 2006, 'Horror', 'Greg Swinson, Ryan Thiessen', 'Greg Swinson', 'Sandra Paduch, Danielle Lilley, Mia Yi, Angela Brunda, Jennifer Barnett, Veronica Garcia, Dave Jarnigan', 'NR', 'On their way home from a high school football game, five teenage girls become hopelessly lost. When they stop to get directions at a desolate store, the girls are involved in a minor fender bender which leaves an unattended SUV one headlight short. Inexperienced and frightened that they''ll get into trouble, the girls flee the scene of the accident and speed away down the dark and unfamiliar roads. As they blindly make their way across an area the locals call THE EYES, the girls are suddenly shocked to see one lone headlight appear behind them. As the driver of the damaged SUV begins one terrifying assault after another, the five girls will lose their innocence and possibly their lives in this brutal and shocking thrill ride.', 'On their way home from a high school football game, five teenage girls become hopelessly lost. When they stop to get directions at a desolate store, the girls are involved in a minor fender bender which leaves an unattended SUV one headlight short. Inexperienced and frightened that they''ll get into trouble, the girls flee the scene of the accident and speed away down the dark and unfamiliar roads. As they blindly make their way across an area the locals call THE EYES, the girls are suddenly shocked to see one lone headlight appear behind them. As the driver of the damaged SUV begins one terrifying assault after another, the five girls will lose their innocence and possibly their lives in this brutal and shocking thrill ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxJ7U3dyXz6wanaokZrxZPEhJ9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43639'),
  ('930018663461892220', 'Five and Ten', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Douglas Shearer, George Barnes', null, 'Marion Davies, Leslie Howard, Richard Bennett, Irene Rich, Douglass Montgomery, Mary Duncan, George Irving, Henry Armetta', 'NR', 'John owns the largest chain of five and ten cent stores in the country. He moves his family to New York from Kansas City and their life, though grand, is falling apart due to his constant working. Wife and mother Jenny is lonely. Son Avery hates his job. Daughter Jennifer is snubbed by classmate Muriel and her friends. At a charity bazaar, Jennifer meets Berry and sparks are evident. However, he is engaged to Muriel and Muriel will make sure that she, and only she, marries Berry. After the marriage, Berry still thinks of Jennifer as Jennifer thinks of Berry. Avery laments about the state of his family since they were happy in Kansas City.', 'John owns the largest chain of five and ten cent stores in the country. He moves his family to New York from Kansas City and their life, though grand, is falling apart due to his constant working. Wife and mother Jenny is lonely. Son Avery hates his job. Daughter Jennifer is snubbed by classmate Muriel and her friends. At a charity bazaar, Jennifer meets Berry and sparks are evident. However, he is engaged to Muriel and Muriel will make sure that she, and only she, marries Berry. After the marriage, Berry still thinks of Jennifer as Jennifer thinks of Berry. Avery laments about the state of his family since they were happy in Kansas City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYnB3pqyyffBtuaJbeRfxMMhIJ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53232'),
  ('1129919008787244766', 'Five and the Skin', 1982, 'Drama', 'Pierre Rissient', 'Lucie Albertini, Alain Archambault, Eugène Guillevic', 'Féodor Atkine, Eiko Matsuda, Phillip Salvador, Louie Pascua, Gloria Diaz, Bembol Roco, Joel Lamangan, Robert ''Toffy'' Padua', null, 'Ivan, a writer living in Manila, walks through the city in search of his past.', 'Ivan, a writer living in Manila, walks through the city in search of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A42LMjeuqWWLdP3710ofqNWV1xe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282305'),
  ('5412791925377402', 'Five Blind Dates', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shawn Seet, Martin McGrath', 'Shuang Hu, Nathan Ramos-Park', 'Shuang Hu, Ilai Swindells, Desmond Chiam, Rob Collins, Yoson An, Tzi Ma, Jon Prasida, Tiffany Wong', null, 'More focused on her business than finding love, Lia is forced to go on five blind dates set up by her family and best friend after she is told by a fortune teller that her love life and the success of her tea shop are intertwined.', 'More focused on her business than finding love, Lia is forced to go on five blind dates set up by her family and best friend after she is told by a fortune teller that her love life and the success of her tea shop are intertwined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMFByoqAxTpiY7Irbvq4ugjjC0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231953'),
  ('1104638358291323534', 'Five Bloody Graves', 1969, 'Western, Thriller', 'Bob Dietz, Al Adamson, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Robert Dix', 'Robert Dix, Scott Brady, Jim Davis, John Carradine, Paula Raymond, John "Bud" Cardos, Darlene Lucht, Vicki Volante', 'R', 'A lone gunman hunts the fearsome Apache Satago across the plains of the Wild West. When Satago''s marauders ambush a stagecoach, the gunman rides to the rescue of the trapped passengers and helps them in their last stand against the deadly Indians.', 'A lone gunman hunts the fearsome Apache Satago across the plains of the Wild West. When Satago''s marauders ambush a stagecoach, the gunman rides to the rescue of the trapped passengers and helps them in their last stand against the deadly Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0tbMXqLO3kignEPtotbFqvMlll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82667'),
  ('1096968772344223946', 'Five Branded Women', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Martin Ritt, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Paul Jarrico, Michael Wilson, Ivo Perilli', 'Silvana Mangano, Jeanne Moreau, Vera Miles, Barbara Bel Geddes, Carla Gravina, Van Heflin, Richard Basehart, Harry Guardino', 'NR', 'Five Yugoslav women who consorted with the German occupiers are publicly humiliated and banished by the Yugoslav partisans but they take up arms to fend for themselves.', 'Five Yugoslav women who consorted with the German occupiers are publicly humiliated and banished by the Yugoslav partisans but they take up arms to fend for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wE8KR917jBjNekoa1L6feYiCosu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142405'),
  ('850274176074445992', 'Five Broken Cameras', 2011, 'War, Documentary', 'Guy Davidi, Emad Burnat', 'Emad Burnat, Guy Davidi', 'Emad Burnat, Soraya Burnat, Gibreel Burnat, Mohammed Burnat, Yasin Burnat, Taki-Ydin Burnat, Muhammad Burnat, Intisar Burnat', 'NR', 'Five broken cameras – and each one has a powerful tale to tell. Embedded in the bullet-ridden remains of digital technology is the story of Emad Burnat, a farmer from the Palestinian village of Bil’in, which famously chose nonviolent resistance when the Israeli army encroached upon its land to make room for Jewish colonists. Emad buys his first camera in 2005 to document the birth of his fourth son, Gibreel. Over the course of the film, he becomes the peaceful archivist of an escalating struggle as olive trees are bulldozed, lives are lost, and a wall is built to segregate burgeoning Israeli settlements.', 'Five broken cameras – and each one has a powerful tale to tell. Embedded in the bullet-ridden remains of digital technology is the story of Emad Burnat, a farmer from the Palestinian village of Bil’in, which famously chose nonviolent resistance when the Israeli army encroached upon its land to make room for Jewish colonists. Emad buys his first camera in 2005 to document the birth of his fourth son, Gibreel. Over the course of the film, he becomes the peaceful archivist of an escalating struggle as olive trees are bulldozed, lives are lost, and a wall is built to segregate burgeoning Israeli settlements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPNfzTzvjbcpMUTaGxnk15njMg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84170'),
  ('266675671101095794', 'Five Came Back', 1939, 'Adventure, Drama', 'John Farrow, Albert S. D''Agostino, Nicholas Musuraca', 'Jerome Cady, Dalton Trumbo, Nathanael West', 'Chester Morris, Lucille Ball, Wendy Barrie, John Carradine, Allen Jenkins, Joseph Calleia, C. Aubrey Smith, Kent Taylor', null, 'Twelve people are aboard Coast Airline''s flagship the Silver Queen enroute to South America when the airplane encounters a storm and is blown off course. Crashing into jungles known to be inhabited by head hunters, pilots Bill and Joe race against time to fix the engines and attempt a take off. The situation brings out the best and worst in the stranded dozen as they create a makeshift runway and prepare to escape before the natives attack. But damage to the plane and low fuel reserves means that only 5 people can be carried to safety.', 'Twelve people are aboard Coast Airline''s flagship the Silver Queen enroute to South America when the airplane encounters a storm and is blown off course. Crashing into jungles known to be inhabited by head hunters, pilots Bill and Joe race against time to fix the engines and attempt a take off. The situation brings out the best and worst in the stranded dozen as they create a makeshift runway and prepare to escape before the natives attack. But damage to the plane and low fuel reserves means that only 5 people can be carried to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg5ADlTMjSb6y47JowklE4V0QRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65858'),
  ('819290007966706428', 'Five Children and It', 2004, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'John Stephenson, Mike Brewster, Peter James', 'David Solomons', 'Tara Fitzgerald, Freddie Highmore, Alex Jennings, Jonathan Bailey, Jessica Claridge, Poppy Rogers, Zoë Wanamaker, Kenneth Branagh', 'PG', 'The Psammead is an ''it'', an ancient, ill-tempered sand-fairy with a spider-shaped body, bat-like ears, and snail-like eyes. It is grumpy but has the power to grant one wish a day, which must be made before sunset. Five siblings—Cyril, Anthea, Robert, Jane, and infant Hilary—encounter It and experience the highs and lows of frivolous wish-making.', 'The Psammead is an ''it'', an ancient, ill-tempered sand-fairy with a spider-shaped body, bat-like ears, and snail-like eyes. It is grumpy but has the power to grant one wish a day, which must be made before sunset. Five siblings—Cyril, Anthea, Robert, Jane, and infant Hilary—encounter It and experience the highs and lows of frivolous wish-making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjRlksMO0bDgWVMXqViSj1SNY2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16791'),
  ('594298214956387974', 'Five Cities', 2009, 'Drama', 'Eyüp Boz, Onur Ünlü', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Bülent Emin Yarar, Beste Bereket, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Şebnem Sönmez, Tansu Biçer, Ege Tanman, İpek Erdem, Aşkın Şenol', null, 'Aydın is a policeman recently appointed to a new post in Istanbul. While trying to get used to life in the big city, Aydın stumbles upon Mehtap, a young woman who works at a candy shop in Beyoğlu, and he falls for her. But there is no way that Aydın can make Mehtap realize that he even exists, just as Şevket, a young man who has dropped out of law school before starting to sell toy trains on the streets to make a living, cannot make Dilek, another girl who works at the same store, realize his feelings for her. When Dilek and Aydın meet, Aydın diverts his uncontrollable feelings toward Dilek.', 'Aydın is a policeman recently appointed to a new post in Istanbul. While trying to get used to life in the big city, Aydın stumbles upon Mehtap, a young woman who works at a candy shop in Beyoğlu, and he falls for her. But there is no way that Aydın can make Mehtap realize that he even exists, just as Şevket, a young man who has dropped out of law school before starting to sell toy trains on the streets to make a living, cannot make Dilek, another girl who works at the same store, realize his feelings for her. When Dilek and Aydın meet, Aydın diverts his uncontrollable feelings toward Dilek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uQNaElLbuHXZ1qHZq1y6uHozAZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51334'),
  ('801114387995208207', 'Five Corners', 1987, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Tony Bill, Fred Murphy', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Jodie Foster, Tim Robbins, Todd Graff, John Turturro, Elizabeth Berridge, Cathryn de Prume, Michael R. Howard, Pierre Epstein', 'R', 'A psychotic young man returns to his old neighborhood after release from prison. He seeks out the woman he previously tried to rape and the man who protected her, with twisted ideas of love for her and hate for him.', 'A psychotic young man returns to his old neighborhood after release from prison. He seeks out the woman he previously tried to rape and the man who protected her, with twisted ideas of love for her and hate for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjCavnds8Yfk57fG5GGtBhnNjrt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71881'),
  ('583911697164135143', 'Five Dances', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alan Brown', 'Alan Brown', 'Ryan Steele, Reed Luplau, Catherine Miller, Kimiye Corwin, Luke Murphy, LuLu Roche, Michael Borrelli', null, 'A gifted young dancer arrives in New York City and joins the downtown contemporary dance world. With talent to burn, he soon must choose between his responsibility to his broken family in the Midwest, and forging a life and career for himself.', 'A gifted young dancer arrives in New York City and joins the downtown contemporary dance world. With talent to burn, he soon must choose between his responsibility to his broken family in the Midwest, and forging a life and career for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvaoz2MOT4GkqfhIQcjbTJ7sSZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142115'),
  ('1091163829706197062', 'Five Day Lover', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean Penzer', 'Philippe de Broca, Daniel Boulanger', 'Jean Seberg, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Micheline Presle, François Périer, Carlo Croccolo', null, 'Claire is a young mother and married to Georges, but she is also having an affair with bachelor Antoine, who is being kept by her good friend Madeleine, a wealthy fashion designer. But the meetings at Antoine''s apartment, five afternoons a week, come to a halt when their partners learn the truth.', 'Claire is a young mother and married to Georges, but she is also having an affair with bachelor Antoine, who is being kept by her good friend Madeleine, a wealthy fashion designer. But the meetings at Antoine''s apartment, five afternoons a week, come to a halt when their partners learn the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHRqrwzD2u5YhwseqMJjvpXiAJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269106'),
  ('596640783884825714', 'Five Days One Summer', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fred Zinnemann, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Michael Austin', 'Sean Connery, Betsy Brantley, Lambert Wilson, Jennifer Hilary, Isabel Dean, Gérard Buhr, Anna Massey, Sheila Reid', 'PG', 'A 1930s Scottish doctor goes climbing in the Alps with an infatuated niece he passes off as his wife.', 'A 1930s Scottish doctor goes climbing in the Alps with an infatuated niece he passes off as his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAu8cdw7QExCFE6lpw0XPNk7FLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89571'),
  ('59372460568700632', 'Five Days, Five Nights', 1996, 'Drama', 'José Fonseca e Costa, Affonso Beato, José Maria Vaz da Silva', 'Jennifer Field, José Fonseca e Costa', 'Paulo Pires, Vítor Norte, Ana Padrão, Canto e Castro, Teresa Roby, Miguel Guilherme, Laura Soveral, Rita Durão', null, 'Portugal, late 1940''s. André must leave the country after running away from prison. In Oporto some friends get him a guide, Lambaça, a smuggler who knows very well the Trás-os-Montes border from Portugal to Spain.', 'Portugal, late 1940''s. André must leave the country after running away from prison. In Oporto some friends get him a guide, Lambaça, a smuggler who knows very well the Trás-os-Montes border from Portugal to Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQPMIXiPbhLYi3yYcczrW50ohlq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71785'),
  ('992970369130873217', 'Five Dolls for an August Moon', 1970, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mario Bava, Antonio Rinaldi, Mario Bava', 'Mario Di Nardo', 'Ira von Fürstenberg, Edwige Fenech, Howard Ross, Helena Ronee, Teodoro Corrà, Ely Galleani, Edith Meloni, Mauro Bosco', null, 'A wealthy playboy gathers a group of bourgeois friends at his isolated beach house for a weekend of relaxation. When bodies start pilling up, they realize they’re trapped with a killer in their midst, sending them in a frenzy to figure out who amongst them is killing the others before they are killed next.', 'A wealthy playboy gathers a group of bourgeois friends at his isolated beach house for a weekend of relaxation. When bodies start pilling up, they realize they’re trapped with a killer in their midst, sending them in a frenzy to figure out who amongst them is killing the others before they are killed next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvWAWkRUhxPlDT7XgZOAXsdyUPO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28051'),
  ('1015336038228030936', 'Five Easy Pieces', 1970, 'Drama', 'Bob Rafelson, László Kovács, Sheldon Schrager', 'Carole Eastman', 'Jack Nicholson, Karen Black, Susan Anspach, Lois Smith, Ralph Waite, Billy Green Bush, Irene Dailey, Toni Basil', 'R', 'Robert Dupea spends his days doing various odd jobs, drinking and womanizing until an encounter with his sister makes him revisit his past.', 'Robert Dupea spends his days doing various odd jobs, drinking and womanizing until an encounter with his sister makes him revisit his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AciLTjLqyHiEA0lq35CV4Atnm4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26617'),
  ('101953644458073335', 'Five Element Ninjas', 1982, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Lo Yuen-Ming, Nico Wong Man-Wan', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Ricky Cheng Tien-Chi, Lung Tien-hsiang, Lo Meng, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Chan Pui-Sai, Wong Lik, Chu Ko, Kwan Fung', null, 'A young martial artist vows to take revenge against the ninja who murdered his martial arts master and brothers. He finds a new teacher and faces, together with his new brothers, the Five Element Ninja challenge.', 'A young martial artist vows to take revenge against the ninja who murdered his martial arts master and brothers. He finds a new teacher and faces, together with his new brothers, the Five Element Ninja challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUidOywTrK8kceDCOHQRuLGqs4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41378'),
  ('1109182216953976605', 'Five Evenings', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Pavel Lebeshev, Vladimir Fridman', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Alexander Adabashyan', 'Lyudmila Gurchenko, Stanislav Lyubshin, Valentina Telichkina, Larisa Kuznetsova, Igor Nefyodov, Alexander Adabashyan, Olga Nikolayeva, Naum Kanarsky', null, 'Based on the play of the same name by Aleksandr Volodin "Five Evenings". The end of the 1950s. Aleksandr Petrovich Ilyin travels to the city where he lived before the war. Visiting the telephone operator Zoya, he sees a familiar house through the window and decides to go there for only fifteen minutes. So Aleksandr gets into a communal apartment, where the love of his youth Tamara Vasilyevna lives. They met twenty years ago and fell in love, but the war separated them. Now Ilyin and Tamara Vasilyevna met again, and love broke out with renewed vigor...', 'Based on the play of the same name by Aleksandr Volodin "Five Evenings". The end of the 1950s. Aleksandr Petrovich Ilyin travels to the city where he lived before the war. Visiting the telephone operator Zoya, he sees a familiar house through the window and decides to go there for only fifteen minutes. So Aleksandr gets into a communal apartment, where the love of his youth Tamara Vasilyevna lives. They met twenty years ago and fell in love, but the war separated them. Now Ilyin and Tamara Vasilyevna met again, and love broke out with renewed vigor...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvI4y7fi1b95pcSRdd87qan40Cc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47851'),
  ('625575541340817796', 'Five Feet Apart', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Chelsea Donison, Drew Ann Rosenberg, Frankie DeMarco', 'Mikki Daughtry, Tobias Iaconis', 'Haley Lu Richardson, Cole Sprouse, Moisés Arias, Kimberly Hébert Gregory, Parminder Nagra, Claire Forlani, Cynthia Evans, Gary Weeks', 'PG-13', 'Seventeen-year-old Stella spends most of her time in the hospital as a cystic fibrosis patient. Her life is full of routines, boundaries and self-control — all of which get put to the test when she meets Will, an impossibly charming teen who has the same illness. There''s an instant flirtation, though restrictions dictate that they must maintain a safe distance between them. As their connection intensifies, so does the temptation to throw the rules out the window and embrace that attraction.', 'Seventeen-year-old Stella spends most of her time in the hospital as a cystic fibrosis patient. Her life is full of routines, boundaries and self-control — all of which get put to the test when she meets Will, an impossibly charming teen who has the same illness. There''s an instant flirtation, though restrictions dictate that they must maintain a safe distance between them. As their connection intensifies, so does the temptation to throw the rules out the window and embrace that attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kreTuJBkUjVWePRfhHZuYfhNE1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527641'),
  ('305904029541930504', 'Five Film Exercises: Film 1', 1943, 'Animation', 'John Whitney Sr., James Whitney', null, null, null, 'Begins with a three beat announcement drawn out in time which thereafter serves as a figure to divide the four sections. Each return of this figure is more condensed, and finally used in reverse to conclude the film. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2004.', 'Begins with a three beat announcement drawn out in time which thereafter serves as a figure to divide the four sections. Each return of this figure is more condensed, and finally used in reverse to conclude the film. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2004.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqYkvEGo1m2bObPEVrQln0qv3cS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250631'),
  ('67737705409348094', 'Five Film Exercises: Film 2-3', 1944, 'Animation', 'John Whitney Sr., James Whitney', null, null, null, 'Two short fragments resulting from experiments in controlling the mechanical development of the instrument. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.', 'Two short fragments resulting from experiments in controlling the mechanical development of the instrument. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.', null, 'tmdb:movie:249191'),
  ('175270425226884032', 'Five Fingers', 2006, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Laurence Malkin, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Laurence Malkin, Chad Thumann', 'Laurence Fishburne, Ryan Phillippe, Touriya Haoud, Colm Meaney, Gina Torres, Saïd Taghmaoui', 'R', 'Martijn, an idealistic Dutch pianist, travels to Morocco to help start a food program for malnourished children. Within moments of his arrival, however, Martijn is abducted by a group of terrorists, injected with a debilitating drug, and imprisoned. Under threat of death, the young man engages in a mental chess match with Ahmat, trying to learn his captor''s true objective and avoid a horrible fate', 'Martijn, an idealistic Dutch pianist, travels to Morocco to help start a food program for malnourished children. Within moments of his arrival, however, Martijn is abducted by a group of terrorists, injected with a debilitating drug, and imprisoned. Under threat of death, the young man engages in a mental chess match with Ahmat, trying to learn his captor''s true objective and avoid a horrible fate', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rs9gCICykUKjWuHbT4Nbaecs9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11650'),
  ('301140767243336580', 'Five Fingers of Death', 1972, 'Action, Drama', 'Jeong Chang-hwa, Chang Ching-Po, Choi Seung-Woo', 'Patrick Kong Yeung', 'Lo Lieh, Wang Ping, Huang Chin-feng, Tien Feng, Tung Lin, Fang Mian, Ku Wen-Chung, James Nam Seok-Hoon', 'R', 'A young boxer joins a martial arts school to increase his skill so he can enter a martial arts competition. He leaves the school when he hears that a local gangster is terrorizing the town. He comes to the aid of a young singer and brings on the wrath of the local gang. He eventually enters the martial arts competition after learning iron palm technique and takes out all competition.', 'A young boxer joins a martial arts school to increase his skill so he can enter a martial arts competition. He leaves the school when he hears that a local gangster is terrorizing the town. He comes to the aid of a young singer and brings on the wrath of the local gang. He eventually enters the martial arts competition after learning iron palm technique and takes out all competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAEd4aorPPLwbMNTYsQXLelHclo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21964'),
  ('78835651885745515', 'Five for Hell', 1969, 'War, Action, Adventure', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Sandro Mancori', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Renato Izzo', 'Gianni Garko, Klaus Kinski, Aldo Canti, Margaret Lee, Sal Borgese, Luciano Rossi, Samson Burke, Irio Fantini', null, 'Lt. Glenn Hoffmann is the the fun-loving leader of a bunch of oddball, acrobatic G.I.s whose mission is to steal the German''s secret attack plans from a villa behind enemy lines, where they run into a brutal Nazi commander.', 'Lt. Glenn Hoffmann is the the fun-loving leader of a bunch of oddball, acrobatic G.I.s whose mission is to steal the German''s secret attack plans from a villa behind enemy lines, where they run into a brutal Nazi commander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBlK8lW5aRLkhbXxQff4cT5YeLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54875'),
  ('491261170722347655', 'Five Golden Dragons', 1967, 'Drama, Action', 'Jeremy Summers, John von Kotze', 'Harry Alan Towers', 'Robert Cummings, Margaret Lee, Rupert Davies, Klaus Kinski, Maria Rohm, Sieghardt Rupp, Brian Donlevy, Dan Duryea', null, 'While travelling through Hong Kong, Bob Mitchell accidentally stumbles into the middle of criminal negotiations between a mean gang, the Five Golden Dragons and the local mobsters.', 'While travelling through Hong Kong, Bob Mitchell accidentally stumbles into the middle of criminal negotiations between a mean gang, the Five Golden Dragons and the local mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VCa4n0XcObLG2bHdi6bK7Wqcr8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76131'),
  ('821765349711945236', 'Five Graves to Cairo', 1943, 'War, Thriller, Drama', 'Billy Wilder, John F. Seitz, Henry S. Kesler', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Franchot Tone, Anne Baxter, Akim Tamiroff, Erich von Stroheim, Peter van Eyck, Fortunio Bonanova, Philip Ahlm, Roger Creed', 'NR', 'During the 1942 North African campaign, a British straggler passes as a waiter at the hotel commandeered as Erwin Rommel''s headquarters. He has thoughts of assassinating Rommel but his cover may provide an even better use.', 'During the 1942 North African campaign, a British straggler passes as a waiter at the hotel commandeered as Erwin Rommel''s headquarters. He has thoughts of assassinating Rommel but his cover may provide an even better use.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZuSO4VcIzsGWuoQoM6oEyfp1HV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60216'),
  ('66504134970247960', 'Five Guns West', 1955, 'Western, Action', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby', 'R. Wright Campbell', 'John Lund, Dorothy Malone, Mike Connors, R. Wright Campbell , Jonathan Haze, Paul Birch, James Stone, Jack Ingram', null, 'During the Civil War, five condemned Southern prisoners are plucked off Death Row and promised pardons on the condition that they undertake a mission to head west and bring back a double-crossing Confederate spy who has a stagecoach full of Confederate gold.', 'During the Civil War, five condemned Southern prisoners are plucked off Death Row and promised pardons on the condition that they undertake a mission to head west and bring back a double-crossing Confederate spy who has a stagecoach full of Confederate gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgAMB4Dth4hgDdxylLkm1MmKChh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85849'),
  ('358264215639006773', 'Five Hundred Miles', 2023, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Su Lun', 'Su Lun', 'Lei Jiayin, Zhang Xiaofei, Zhang Youhao, Sha Yi, Liu Mintao, Yu Ailei, Ding Jiali, Wu Yanshu', null, 'If exchanging lives would exchange family members, would you still be willing? After Zhong Da and Jin Hao went on a blind date, he accidentally changed bodies with Lu Xiaogu, a boy who had a crush on Jin Hao, and exchanged family members by mistake, opening a story that is hilarious and tearful.', 'If exchanging lives would exchange family members, would you still be willing? After Zhong Da and Jin Hao went on a blind date, he accidentally changed bodies with Lu Xiaogu, a boy who had a crush on Jin Hao, and exchanged family members by mistake, opening a story that is hilarious and tearful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhtXKE7B5RMWGpFAVJv4vmTAdRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077025'),
  ('348541882994298998', 'Five Loose Women', 1974, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Stephen C. Apostolof, Guy Nicholas, Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Stephen C. Apostolof, Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Jabie Abercrombe, Rene Bond, Tallie Cochrane, Donna Young, Margie Lanier, Harvey Shain, Nicolle Riddell, Douglas Frey', null, 'Five inmates break out of a remote minimum security prison for women. Four are hardened convicts, the fifth was wrongfully convicted. As the authorities chase them down, the cons terrorize or kill anyone who gets in their way.', 'Five inmates break out of a remote minimum security prison for women. Four are hardened convicts, the fifth was wrongfully convicted. As the authorities chase them down, the cons terrorize or kill anyone who gets in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiY3lwjgIx7Cl84ub0CZP81wmUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29672'),
  ('989082593500087692', 'Five Miles to Midnight', 1962, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Anatole Litvak, Henri Alekan', 'Hugh Wheeler, Peter Viertel', 'Sophia Loren, Anthony Perkins, Gig Young, Yolande Turner, Tommy Norden, Élina Labourdette, Mathilde Casadesus, Jacqueline Porel', 'NR', 'American ex-Air Force man and current businessman Bob Macklin is married to the impoverished Italian-born Lisa. Bob’s jealousy and immaturity irks Lisa, who tells him she’s planning to file for a divorce before his plane departs on a business trip for Casablanca.', 'American ex-Air Force man and current businessman Bob Macklin is married to the impoverished Italian-born Lisa. Bob’s jealousy and immaturity irks Lisa, who tells him she’s planning to file for a divorce before his plane departs on a business trip for Casablanca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pZA2D3EGZrLBh3LWFDiurSjsYE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15469'),
  ('367949957314060548', 'Five Minarets in New York', 2010, 'Drama', 'James Gucciardo, Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Haluk Bilginer, Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Mustafa Sandal, Gina Gershon, Danny Glover, Robert Patrick, Engin Altan Düzyatan, Zafer Ergin', 'R', 'Two Turkish anti-terrorist agents are sent to New York City on a mission to find and bring back the dangerous Islamic leader codenamed "Dajjal", believed to be hiding in there. Working with the FBI and NYPD, the agents orchestrate the arrest of Hadji Gumus, a well-respected Muslim scholar and family man who years before fled to the United States after being released from a Turkish prison, where he served time for murder. This tale love, friendship, peace and prejudices, takes us on a journey seeking to answer the question of whether innocence or guilt even matters to one who lusts for vengeance.', 'Two Turkish anti-terrorist agents are sent to New York City on a mission to find and bring back the dangerous Islamic leader codenamed "Dajjal", believed to be hiding in there. Working with the FBI and NYPD, the agents orchestrate the arrest of Hadji Gumus, a well-respected Muslim scholar and family man who years before fled to the United States after being released from a Turkish prison, where he served time for murder. This tale love, friendship, peace and prejudices, takes us on a journey seeking to answer the question of whether innocence or guilt even matters to one who lusts for vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqcRs578GT1kwqjOEcqbDQDf8Z4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51794'),
  ('1021266824646106801', 'Five Minutes of Heaven', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Oliver Hirschbiegel, Sean Roe Curran, Darren Fee', 'Guy Hibbert', 'Liam Neeson, James Nesbitt, Anamaria Marinca, Mark Ryder, Niamh Cusack, Paul Garrett, Gerard Jordan, Conor MacNeill', 'R', 'The story of former Ulster Volunteer Force member Alistair Little. Twenty-five years after Little killed Joe Griffin''s brother, the media arrange an auspicious meeting between the two.', 'The story of former Ulster Volunteer Force member Alistair Little. Twenty-five years after Little killed Joe Griffin''s brother, the media arrange an auspicious meeting between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TVniqOcXh3nKHVyVys1nUjgrgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16759'),
  ('251540965157844779', 'Five Minutes of Pure Cinema', 1926, 'Drama', 'Henri Chomette', null, null, null, 'Avant-garde short focused on the pure elements of film like form, visual composition, and rhythm.', 'Avant-garde short focused on the pure elements of film like form, visual composition, and rhythm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4R098Pe4cfEiXf4JAf27COCkWJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189495'),
  ('827515269350872313', 'Five Minutes to Live', 1961, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Bill Karn, Carl E. Guthrie', 'Cay Forester', 'Johnny Cash, Donald Woods, Cay Forester, Pamela Mason, Vic Tayback, Midge Ware, Ron Howard, Merle Travis', 'G', 'A guitar playing killer terrorizes a housewife while his partner robs the bank where her husband works.', 'A guitar playing killer terrorizes a housewife while his partner robs the bank where her husband works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIduD55OQKSwC3XU34PF3ClwIW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37560'),
  ('1057702521532649804', 'Five Moons Plaza', 2003, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Renzo Martinelli, Blasco Giurato', 'Fabio Campus, Renzo Martinelli', 'Donald Sutherland, Giancarlo Giannini, Stefania Rocca, F. Murray Abraham, Aisha Cerami, Greg Wise, Nicola Di Pinto, Federica Martinelli', null, 'Just the night before his retirement District Attorney Saracini is given a film showing the kidnapping of Aldo Moro. As the District Attorney takes on the case he along with his team finds more compelling and secretive evidences. Too many secrets are found that should stayed as secrets.', 'Just the night before his retirement District Attorney Saracini is given a film showing the kidnapping of Aldo Moro. As the District Attorney takes on the case he along with his team finds more compelling and secretive evidences. Too many secrets are found that should stayed as secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxcugaYS9FPPMp1knL3djmd2YrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4826'),
  ('197201634194237339', 'Five Nights at Freddy''s', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Danny Gonzalez, David Fischer, Mary Anne Olinsky', 'Scott Cawthon, Emma Tammi, Seth Cuddeback', 'Josh Hutcherson, Piper Rubio, Elizabeth Lail, Matthew Lillard, Mary Stuart Masterson, Kat Conner Sterling, David Lind, Christian Stokes', 'PG-13', 'Recently fired and desperate for work, a troubled young man named Mike agrees to take a position as a night security guard at an abandoned theme restaurant: Freddy Fazbear''s Pizzeria. But he soon discovers that nothing at Freddy''s is what it seems.', 'Recently fired and desperate for work, a troubled young man named Mike agrees to take a position as a night security guard at an abandoned theme restaurant: Freddy Fazbear''s Pizzeria. But he soon discovers that nothing at Freddy''s is what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BpNtNfxuocYEVREzVMO75hso1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507089'),
  ('1106588374311480363', 'Five Nights at Freddy''s 2', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Emma Tammi, Lyn Moncrief, Woodrow Travers', 'Scott Cawthon', 'Josh Hutcherson, Piper Rubio, Elizabeth Lail, Matthew Lillard, Freddy Carter, Wayne Knight, Mckenna Grace, David Andrew Calvillo', 'PG-13', 'One year since the supernatural nightmare at Freddy Fazbear''s Pizza, the stories about what transpired there have been twisted into a campy local legend, inspiring the town''s first ever Fazfest. With the truth kept from her, Abby sneaks out to reconnect with Freddy, Bonnie, Chica, and Foxy, setting into motion a terrifying series of events that will reveal dark secrets about the real origin of Freddy''s, and unleash a decades-hidden horror.', 'One year since the supernatural nightmare at Freddy Fazbear''s Pizza, the stories about what transpired there have been twisted into a campy local legend, inspiring the town''s first ever Fazfest. With the truth kept from her, Abby sneaks out to reconnect with Freddy, Bonnie, Chica, and Foxy, setting into motion a terrifying series of events that will reveal dark secrets about the real origin of Freddy''s, and unleash a decades-hidden horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udAxQEORq2I5wxI97N2TEqdhzBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1228246'),
  ('405444116722456744', 'Five Senses of Eros', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Oh Ki-hwan, Min Kyu-dong, Hur Jin-ho', 'Byun Hyuk, Kim Kyung-mi, Lee Jung-hwa', 'Jang Hyuk, Cha Hyun-jung, Kim Kang-woo, Cha Soo-yeon, Bae Jong-ok, Kim Soo-ro, Kim Gyu-ri, Uhm Jung-hwa', null, 'In this anthology film centered around the theme of "Eros," five seperate stories are presented by five top Korean directors. The main characters from each segment are connected with each other in one way or another.', 'In this anthology film centered around the theme of "Eros," five seperate stories are presented by five top Korean directors. The main characters from each segment are connected with each other in one way or another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPMEejVL6YMlrpnaaFioIIASTOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54225'),
  ('35754268792161872', 'Five Shaolin Masters', 1974, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Wu Yueh-ling, Kung Mu-To', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Alexander Fu Sheng, Chi Kuan-Chun, Mang Fei, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Fung Hak-On, Tsai Hung', null, 'Hu Te et al. escape the burning Shaolin temple after the Qing soldiers destroyed it in Shaolin Temple. The group of 5 decide to develop secret codes to identify fellow patriots, enlist those patriots and eventually meet up again to escape to the south away from the Qings, and also identify the traitor who sold out Shaolin temple. Ma Fu Yi, joins the Qing top fighters to eliminate the rebels but is exposed by Ma Chao-Tsing who gets captured by Ma Fu Yi. Hu meets up with a group of Shaolin men secretly posing as bandits to rescue Ma as their leader is killed in the process, thus the bandits join the rest of the Shaolin patriots.', 'Hu Te et al. escape the burning Shaolin temple after the Qing soldiers destroyed it in Shaolin Temple. The group of 5 decide to develop secret codes to identify fellow patriots, enlist those patriots and eventually meet up again to escape to the south away from the Qings, and also identify the traitor who sold out Shaolin temple. Ma Fu Yi, joins the Qing top fighters to eliminate the rebels but is exposed by Ma Chao-Tsing who gets captured by Ma Fu Yi. Hu meets up with a group of Shaolin men secretly posing as bandits to rescue Ma as their leader is killed in the process, thus the bandits join the rest of the Shaolin patriots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqGPXKTZlhcTRJEp90ZI9UpusxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41383'),
  ('823425849867332285', 'Five Square Meters', 2011, 'Drama', 'Max Lemcke, José David Montero', 'Daniel Remón, Pablo Remón', 'Fernando Tejero, Malena Alterio, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Manuel Morón, Jorge Bosch, Secun de la Rosa, Enric Benavent, Lola Moltó', null, 'Álex and Virginia, a couple planning to get married, buy an apartment located in a building under construction. When there are only a few months left before the apartments are to be delivered, the works are stopped indefinitely. Álex wants a solution and will do anything to get his apartment and have the life he had dreamed of.', 'Álex and Virginia, a couple planning to get married, buy an apartment located in a building under construction. When there are only a few months left before the apartments are to be delivered, the works are stopped indefinitely. Álex wants a solution and will do anything to get his apartment and have the life he had dreamed of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AheZlWgJGua5aEjtiEN0SVoZToA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79749'),
  ('1060561346794543324', 'Five Star Christmas', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Amy Belling, Christie Will Wolf', 'Stephen Witkin, Alfonso H. Moreno, Michael Elliot', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Victor Webster, Paula Shaw, Jay Brazeau, Robert Wisden, Alistair Abell, Barbara Patrick, Grace Beedie', null, 'After moving back to her hometown, Lisa (Lenz) plots with her siblings and grandparents to help her father''s bed and breakfast get a five-star review from an incognito travel critic (Webster), but ends up falling for him, not knowing he is the real critic.', 'After moving back to her hometown, Lisa (Lenz) plots with her siblings and grandparents to help her father''s bed and breakfast get a five-star review from an incognito travel critic (Webster), but ends up falling for him, not knowing he is the real critic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YE5vNC4ClIXRWBvWEahul6jPOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746060'),
  ('690309097252026467', 'Five Star Final', 1931, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Sol Polito, Gordon Hollingshead', 'Byron Morgan', 'Edward G. Robinson, Marian Marsh, H.B. Warner, Anthony Bushell, George E. Stone, Frances Starr, Ona Munson, Boris Karloff', 'NR', 'Searching for headlines at any cost, an unscrupulous newspaper owner forces his editor to print a serial based on a past murder, tormenting a woman involved.', 'Searching for headlines at any cost, an unscrupulous newspaper owner forces his editor to print a serial based on a past murder, tormenting a woman involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DZF4buRoDNsnAtkQZd8fIYVCCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42669'),
  ('776240338356559595', 'Five Superfighters', 1979, 'Action', 'John Law Ma, Lam Wah-Chiu, Wan Fat', 'Szeto On', 'Kwan Fung, Hau Chiu-Sing, Austin Wai Tin-Chi, Ng Yuen-Jun, Tony Leung Siu-Hung, Wong Mei-Mei, Jamie Luk Kim-Ming, Lam Fai-Wong', null, 'Three young martial arts students and their teacher are beaten up badly by a wandering man who proclaims himself "a corrector of bad kung-fu." Determined to avenge their teacher and regain their honor, the three students all go their separate ways to find kung-fu masters who will take them as students.', 'Three young martial arts students and their teacher are beaten up badly by a wandering man who proclaims himself "a corrector of bad kung-fu." Determined to avenge their teacher and regain their honor, the three students all go their separate ways to find kung-fu masters who will take them as students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WVtmI9dIzh7JA8mgUWbyTf4UA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90556'),
  ('418134728549759546', 'Five Times Two', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Ozon, Yorick Le Saux', 'François Ozon, Emmanuèle Bernheim', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Stéphane Freiss, Françoise Fabian, Michael Lonsdale, Géraldine Pailhas, Antoine Chappey, Marc Ruchmann, Jason Tavassoli', 'R', 'As young French couple Gilles and Marion officially separate, we see, in reverse order, the milestone moments in their relationship: Gilles revealing his unfaithfulness at a tense dinner party; Marion giving birth to their premature son while Gilles is elsewhere; Gilles and Marion''s joyous wedding; and, finally, the fateful moment when they meet as acquaintances at an Italian beach resort, and their love affair begins.', 'As young French couple Gilles and Marion officially separate, we see, in reverse order, the milestone moments in their relationship: Gilles revealing his unfaithfulness at a tense dinner party; Marion giving birth to their premature son while Gilles is elsewhere; Gilles and Marion''s joyous wedding; and, finally, the fateful moment when they meet as acquaintances at an Italian beach resort, and their love affair begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZRa3rg7kKt8qkJ6C480VPmUR6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4974'),
  ('558002072803580643', 'Five Weeks in a Balloon', 1962, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Irwin Allen, Winton C. Hoch, Ad Schaumer', 'Albert Gail, Charles Bennett, Irwin Allen', 'Red Buttons, Barbara Eden, Cedric Hardwicke, Peter Lorre, Richard Haydn, BarBara Luna, Fabian, Billy Gilbert', 'NR', 'Professor Fergusson plans to make aviation history by making his way across Africa by balloon. He plans to claim uncharted territories in West Africa as proof of his inventions worth.', 'Professor Fergusson plans to make aviation history by making his way across Africa by balloon. He plans to claim uncharted territories in West Africa as proof of his inventions worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX6rzy5SwjMFO9TgHXNBp8nSfpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42996'),
