  ('485126885617004029', 'Fix', 2009, 'Drama', 'Billy Taylor, Tao Ruspoli', 'Tao Ruspoli, Charles Castaldi, Paul Duran', 'Shawn Andrews, Olivia Wilde, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Dedee Pfeiffer, Tao Ruspoli, Frank Alvarez, Aesop Aquarian, Ian Duncan', null, 'FIX takes you from Beverly Hills to Watts, and places in between, in one day, as documentary filmmakers Bella and Milo race to get Milo''s brother Leo from jail to rehab before 8pm, or Leo goes to prison for three years.', 'FIX takes you from Beverly Hills to Watts, and places in between, in one day, as documentary filmmakers Bella and Milo race to get Milo''s brother Leo from jail to rehab before 8pm, or Leo goes to prison for three years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Sc7LvRbSyAQOBqZaX0mnz8eCDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35726'),
  ('983826382078127564', 'Fixed', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Genndy Tartakovsky', 'Genndy Tartakovsky, Jon Vitti', 'Adam Devine, Idris Elba, Kathryn Hahn, Fred Armisen, Bobby Moynihan, Beck Bennett, Michelle Buteau, River Gallo', 'R', 'After learning he''s getting neutered, a dog has 24 hours to squeeze in one last balls-to-the-wall adventure with the boys.', 'After learning he''s getting neutered, a dog has 24 hours to squeeze in one last balls-to-the-wall adventure with the boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udtlwWSJ45S0uQm29BvFvjPJGW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537921'),
  ('310883390645119312', 'Fixed Bayonets!', 1951, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Samuel Fuller, Paul Helmick, Lucien Ballard', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Richard Basehart, Gene Evans, Michael O''Shea, Richard Hylton, Craig Hill, Skip Homeier, Howard Banks, Paul Burke', 'NR', 'The story of a platoon during the Korean War. One by one, Corporal Denno''s superiors are killed until it comes to the point where he must try to take command responsibility.', 'The story of a platoon during the Korean War. One by one, Corporal Denno''s superiors are killed until it comes to the point where he must try to take command responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw5blc9tACbkxKGhR20lxULuipV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46875'),
  ('756349063074048662', 'Fixing Up Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Graham Cairns, Jessica Harmon, Corey MacGregor', 'Ansley Gordon', 'Natalie Dreyfuss, Marshall Williams, Harrison Coe, Bethany Brown, Matthew Kevin Anderson, Cynde Harmon, Allan Harmon, Jessica Harmon', 'G', 'Known as a “fixer” for difficult clients, a talented party planner must help a young CEO plan the Christmas party of the year to dazzle the mayor and save his company. Wil the “fixer” fix something more than just the company?', 'Known as a “fixer” for difficult clients, a talented party planner must help a young CEO plan the Christmas party of the year to dazzle the mayor and save his company. Wil the “fixer” fix something more than just the company?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbN3YUUl2SjJpzijkqhLJJTQJvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849452'),
