  ('990655315705336948', 'Fırıncının Karısı', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Murat Ceylan, Murat Onbul', 'Murat Taşkent', 'Büşra Pekin, Alper Kul, Korhan Herduran, Ferdi Sancar, Beyti Engin, Seda Türkmen, Ayça Koptur', null, 'Puzzled by the pleasantly unexpected changes in her husband''s behavior, Ferdane secretly follows him to identify the cause.', 'Puzzled by the pleasantly unexpected changes in her husband''s behavior, Ferdane secretly follows him to identify the cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKD3t3H3QPSEYdEhyVV1u9jgKOs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634583'),
  ('588428289651046760', 'Fjord', 2026, 'Drama', 'Cristian Mungiu, Tudor Vladimir Panduru, Gjyljeta Berisha', 'Cristian Mungiu', 'Sebastian Stan, Renate Reinsve, Lisa Loven Kongsli, Giulia Nahmany, Ingvild Lien, Turid Vatne, Alin Panc, Emilie Hetland', null, 'The Gheorghius – Catholic and Romanian - settle in a Norwegian village, the mother’s birthplace. They quickly bond with the Halbergs, who live in the neighbouring house near the bay. Despite their very different upbringings, the children of both families soon become close friends. Until the Gheorghius are suspected of hurting their own children…', 'The Gheorghius – Catholic and Romanian - settle in a Norwegian village, the mother’s birthplace. They quickly bond with the Halbergs, who live in the neighbouring house near the bay. Despite their very different upbringings, the children of both families soon become close friends. Until the Gheorghius are suspected of hurting their own children…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttCNqwbCoHnfbuQyrlMdr4QG6c0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1401459'),
  ('1031055315844951430', 'Flag Day', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Sean Penn, Daniel Moder', 'John-Henry Butterworth, Jez Butterworth', 'Sean Penn, Dylan Penn, Hopper Penn, Josh Brolin, Katheryn Winnick, Eddie Marsan, Dale Dickey, Bailey Noble', 'R', 'A father lives a double life as a counterfeiter, bank robber and con man in order to provide for his daughter.', 'A father lives a double life as a counterfeiter, bank robber and con man in order to provide for his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwEJmzgoPdAlX4OODCP2QkMMhca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662712'),
  ('540913727783988480', 'Flags and Waves', 1986, 'Animation', 'Bill Reeves, Alain Fournier', null, null, null, 'This film test is a demonstration of Pixar''s early attempts to research, analyze and recreate qualities of motion, shading and lighting that make water believable. Said techniques are later expanded upon in "Finding Nemo"', 'This film test is a demonstration of Pixar''s early attempts to research, analyze and recreate qualities of motion, shading and lighting that make water believable. Said techniques are later expanded upon in "Finding Nemo"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrBMKU0DhapqaryUCMoSsVGhEno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300445'),
  ('1032027331892215861', 'Flags of Our Fathers', 2006, 'War, Drama, History', 'Tom Stern, Clint Eastwood, Peter Dress', 'William Broyles Jr., Paul Haggis', 'Ryan Phillippe, Jesse Bradford, Adam Beach, John Benjamin Hickey, John Slattery, Barry Pepper, Jamie Bell, Paul Walker', 'R', 'There were five Marines and one Navy Corpsman photographed raising the U.S. flag on Mt. Suribachi by Joe Rosenthal on February 23, 1945. This is the story of three of the six surviving servicemen - John ''Doc'' Bradley, Pvt. Rene Gagnon and Pvt. Ira Hayes - who fought in the battle to take Iwo Jima from the Japanese.', 'There were five Marines and one Navy Corpsman photographed raising the U.S. flag on Mt. Suribachi by Joe Rosenthal on February 23, 1945. This is the story of three of the six surviving servicemen - John ''Doc'' Bradley, Pvt. Rene Gagnon and Pvt. Ira Hayes - who fought in the battle to take Iwo Jima from the Japanese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nkPrhf4YIyMFelfe4zdOnGRYz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3683'),
  ('723712306438627363', 'Flakes', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Lehmann, Nancy Schreiber', 'Chris Poche, Karey Kirkpatrick', 'Aaron Stanford, Zooey Deschanel, Christopher Lloyd, Izabella Miko, Ryan Donowho, Carol Sutton, Frank Wood, Jane Brody', null, 'Aspiring rock musician Neal Downs manages a cereal bar. Stylish Miss Pussy Katz is the creator of radically-themed art clothing. When the cereal bar, brings in an offbeat crew of locals, who debate the arcana of cereal history and ideal milk/flake ratios, an aspiring capitalist rips off their concept.', 'Aspiring rock musician Neal Downs manages a cereal bar. Stylish Miss Pussy Katz is the creator of radically-themed art clothing. When the cereal bar, brings in an offbeat crew of locals, who debate the arcana of cereal history and ideal milk/flake ratios, an aspiring capitalist rips off their concept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2e5t3EUL0gwYs78Ah4XFGpfmJZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13021'),
  ('142067263618329394', 'Flame', 1975, 'Drama, Music', 'Richard Loncraine, Roger Simons, Peter Hannan', 'Andrew Birkin', 'Don Powell, Jim Lea, Noddy Holder, Dave Hill, Tom Conti, Alan Lake, Johnny Shannon, Kenneth Colley', null, 'Light the Rock ''n Roll spark with a Flame in the guise of Dave, Noddy, Jim and Don and their showcase of the rise and demise of rock band Flame. Set in the hardships of North England''s seventies working class society and music scene. This build-up from rags to riches is a parody of realism and grit, with double-dealings and harsh unforgiving dog eat dog mentalities, and the golden rule; if you play with matches then you''re going to get burnt, in the flames of the music industry.', 'Light the Rock ''n Roll spark with a Flame in the guise of Dave, Noddy, Jim and Don and their showcase of the rise and demise of rock band Flame. Set in the hardships of North England''s seventies working class society and music scene. This build-up from rags to riches is a parody of realism and grit, with double-dealings and harsh unforgiving dog eat dog mentalities, and the golden rule; if you play with matches then you''re going to get burnt, in the flames of the music industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itJvYNlFsmLiVqZ54oU3rGYxzyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60808'),
  ('1006818257284789809', 'Flame & Citron', 2008, 'Drama, History, War', 'Ole Christian Madsen, Jørgen Johansson, Joakim Höglund', 'Ole Christian Madsen, Lars K. Andersen', 'Thure Lindhardt, Mads Mikkelsen, Stine Stengade, Peter Mygind, Mille Lehfeldt, Christian Berkel, Hanns Zischler, Claus Riis Østergaard', 'NR', 'Gunman Flame and his partner Citron assassinate Nazi collaborators for the Danish resistance. Assigned targets by their Allies-connected leader, Aksel Winther, they relish the opportunity to begin targeting the Nazis themselves. When they begin to doubt the validity of their assignments, their morally complicated task becomes even more labyrinthine.', 'Gunman Flame and his partner Citron assassinate Nazi collaborators for the Danish resistance. Assigned targets by their Allies-connected leader, Aksel Winther, they relish the opportunity to begin targeting the Nazis themselves. When they begin to doubt the validity of their assignments, their morally complicated task becomes even more labyrinthine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32CKp29QyqimkjtdJRBzSRHPx4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8883'),
  ('495030881582210957', 'Flame in the Streets', 1961, 'Drama', 'Roy Ward Baker, Christopher Challis, Stanley Hosgood', 'Ted Willis', 'John Mills, Sylvia Syms, Brenda De Banzie, Earl Cameron, Johnny Sekka, Meredith Edwards, Ann Lynn, Wilfrid Brambell', null, 'Domestic difficulties develop in a working-class family when their daughter falls in love with a Jamaican man.', 'Domestic difficulties develop in a working-class family when their daughter falls in love with a Jamaican man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSa3At06mVbbxbvrIBboJsukSMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171898'),
  ('882212756196978406', 'Flame of Barbary Coast', 1945, 'Romance, Western', 'Joseph Kane, Robert De Grasse', 'Borden Chase', 'John Wayne, Ann Dvorak, Joseph Schildkraut, William Frawley, Virginia Grey, Russell Hicks, Jack Norton, Paul Fix', 'NR', 'Duke Fergus falls for Ann ''Flaxen'' Tarry in the Barbary Coast in turn-of-the-century San Francisco. He loses money to crooked gambler Boss Tito Morell, goes home, learns to gamble, and returns. After he makes a fortune, he opens his own place with Flaxen as the entertainer; but the 1906 quake destroys his place.', 'Duke Fergus falls for Ann ''Flaxen'' Tarry in the Barbary Coast in turn-of-the-century San Francisco. He loses money to crooked gambler Boss Tito Morell, goes home, learns to gamble, and returns. After he makes a fortune, he opens his own place with Flaxen as the entertainer; but the 1906 quake destroys his place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuW9HCAXQFkfhJhDutugC3JlOMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40716'),
  ('525243828611402859', 'Flame of My Love', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kōhei Sugiyama, Tomotarô Nashiki', 'Kaneto Shindō, Yoshikata Yoda', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Mitsuko Mito, Kuniko Miyake, Ichirō Sugai, Eitarō Ozawa, Shinobu Araki, Eijirō Tōno, Koreya Senda', null, 'In 1880s Japan, women''s struggle for equality rages on. Eiko Hirayama leaves Okayama for Tokyo, where she helps the fledgling Liberal Party and falls in love with its leader Kentaro Omoi, just as the party is being disbanded by the government.', 'In 1880s Japan, women''s struggle for equality rages on. Eiko Hirayama leaves Okayama for Tokyo, where she helps the fledgling Liberal Party and falls in love with its leader Kentaro Omoi, just as the party is being disbanded by the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aaDzJJArZXIXYXwx0MxwfTY0Joa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124994'),
  ('294460888933695187', 'Flamenco', 1995, 'Documentary, Music', 'Carlos Saura, Isidro Muñoz', 'Carlos Saura', 'La Paquera de Jerez, Paco de Lucía, Fernanda de Utrera, Antonio Toscano, Matilde Coral, Duquende, Merche Esmeralda, Mario Maya', null, 'The film presents thirteen rhythms of flamenco, each with song, guitar, and dance: the up-tempo bularías, a brooding farruca, an anguished martinete, and a satiric fandango de huelva. There are tangos, a taranta, alegrías, siguiriyas, soleás, a guajira of patrician women, a petenera about a sentence to death, villancicos, and a final rumba.', 'The film presents thirteen rhythms of flamenco, each with song, guitar, and dance: the up-tempo bularías, a brooding farruca, an anguished martinete, and a satiric fandango de huelva. There are tangos, a taranta, alegrías, siguiriyas, soleás, a guajira of patrician women, a petenera about a sentence to death, villancicos, and a final rumba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5ARP9mrtud1OB1e7q0Wcm8x7hp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26824'),
  ('256546062562792932', 'Flamenco at 5:15', 1983, 'Documentary, Music', 'Cynthia Scott, Paul Cowan', null, 'Susana Robledo, Antonio Robledo', null, 'In this Oscar Winning documentary short film, students in their final year at the National Ballet School of Canada are seen learning the flamenco from Susana and Antonio Robledo, who come to the school every winter to conduct classes which are held after the day''s regular schedule has ended.', 'In this Oscar Winning documentary short film, students in their final year at the National Ballet School of Canada are seen learning the flamenco from Susana and Antonio Robledo, who come to the school every winter to conduct classes which are held after the day''s regular schedule has ended.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whJxnsGOZPgaKbYeTQR3zeeJMvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244449'),
  ('537597247168344613', 'Flamenco Flamenco', 2010, 'Music, Documentary', 'Carlos Saura, Isidro Muñoz, Vittorio Storaro', 'Carlos Saura', 'Paco de Lucía, Niña Pastori, Miguel Poveda, Arcángel, Eva la Yerbabuena, José Mercé, Farruquito, Sara Baras', null, 'A look at the history and traditions of flamenco music and dance.', 'A look at the history and traditions of flamenco music and dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cl8gwRRGxStaKJPpaPGC1Of0Voe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91950'),
  ('972917191680226343', 'Flaming Brothers', 1987, 'Action, Crime, Romance', 'Joe Cheung Tung-Cho, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Wong Kar-Wai', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Alan Tang Kwong-Wing, Pat Ha Man-Jik, Jenny Tseng, Patrick Tse Yin, Philip Chan Yan-Kin, James Yi Lui, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung', null, 'Two blood brothers, who have grown up on the streets of Macau, are bound together by a special code of honour. However, this bond ultimately leads them into brutal conflict when they struggle to leave the violent world they live in.', 'Two blood brothers, who have grown up on the streets of Macau, are bound together by a special code of honour. However, this bond ultimately leads them into brutal conflict when they struggle to leave the violent world they live in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNjubg0adlqebOxZsCTPHyZKoes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70542'),
  ('460894837783574763', 'Flaming Creatures', 1963, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Jack Smith, Marc Schleifer, Jack Smith', 'Jack Smith', 'Francis Francine, Sheila Bick, Joel Markman, Mario Montez, Arnold Rockwood, Judith Malina, Marian Zazeela, Beverly Grant', null, 'Filmmaker and artist Jack Smith described his own film as a “comedy set in a haunted movie studio.” Flaming Creatures begins humorously enough with several men and women, mostly of indeterminate gender, vamping it up in front of the camera and participating in a mock advertisement for an indelible, heart-shaped brand of lipstick. However, things take a dark, nightmarish turn when a transvestite chases, catches and begins molesting a woman. Soon, all of the titular “creatures” participate in a (mostly clothed) orgy that causes a massive earthquake. After the creatures are killed in the resulting chaos, a vampire dressed like an old Hollywood starlet rises from her coffin to resurrect the dead. All ends happily enough when the now undead creatures dance with each other, even though another orgy and earthquake loom over the end title card.', 'Filmmaker and artist Jack Smith described his own film as a “comedy set in a haunted movie studio.” Flaming Creatures begins humorously enough with several men and women, mostly of indeterminate gender, vamping it up in front of the camera and participating in a mock advertisement for an indelible, heart-shaped brand of lipstick. However, things take a dark, nightmarish turn when a transvestite chases, catches and begins molesting a woman. Soon, all of the titular “creatures” participate in a (mostly clothed) orgy that causes a massive earthquake. After the creatures are killed in the resulting chaos, a vampire dressed like an old Hollywood starlet rises from her coffin to resurrect the dead. All ends happily enough when the now undead creatures dance with each other, even though another orgy and earthquake loom over the end title card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agXfZnar50z6v1DrGdzjgssuth7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47122'),
  ('333481019272384760', 'Flaming Ears', 1992, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Ursula Pürrer, A. Hans Scheirl, Dietmar Schipek', 'Ursula Pürrer, Dietmar Schipek', 'Susanna Heilmayr, Ursula Pürrer, A. Hans Scheirl, Margarete Neumann, Gabriele Szekatsch', null, 'In the year 2700, a comic book artist encounters a mysterious alien while seeking revenge against the pyromaniac who burned down her printing presses.', 'In the year 2700, a comic book artist encounters a mysterious alien while seeking revenge against the pyromaniac who burned down her printing presses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YWm7I7RR069T7NyTbNeb1JhsMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261362'),
  ('775352383436005002', 'Flaming Frontier', 1965, 'Adventure, Western', 'Alfred Vohrer, Eva Ebner, Slavko Andreš', 'Fred Denger, Eberhard Keindorff, Johanna Sibelius', 'Stewart Granger, Pierre Brice, Larry Pennell, Letícia Román, Terence Hill, Milan Srdoč, Wolfgang Lukschy, Erik Schumann', null, 'Old Surehand and his faithful old friend Old Wabble are on the trail of a cold-blooded killer with the nickname ''The General''. The brother of Old Surehand was murdered by him. On the way Old Surehand and Old Wabble are involved in the running conflict between settlers and Comanches who are likely to go on the war path. Old Surehand can count on the support of his friend and blood brother Winnetou, the amiable chief of the Apaches. Written by Robert', 'Old Surehand and his faithful old friend Old Wabble are on the trail of a cold-blooded killer with the nickname ''The General''. The brother of Old Surehand was murdered by him. On the way Old Surehand and Old Wabble are involved in the running conflict between settlers and Comanches who are likely to go on the war path. Old Surehand can count on the support of his friend and blood brother Winnetou, the amiable chief of the Apaches. Written by Robert', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y32jmHx7Wm6u0DcTXHaKvLPUcr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9627'),
  ('1142852013685265650', 'Flaming Star', 1960, 'Western', 'Don Siegel, Richard Talmadge, Charles G. Clarke', 'Clair Huffaker, Nunnally Johnson', 'Elvis Presley, Barbara Eden, Steve Forrest, Dolores del Río, John McIntire, Rodolfo Acosta, Karl Swenson, Ford Rainey', 'PG', 'Sam Burton''s second wife is a Kiowa, and their son is therefore born mixed-race. When a struggle starts between the whites and the native Kiowas, the Burton family is split between loyalties.', 'Sam Burton''s second wife is a Kiowa, and their son is therefore born mixed-race. When a struggle starts between the whites and the native Kiowas, the Burton family is split between loyalties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OoB7NErxql4RfEimGIcSHCE3Ve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18639'),
  ('685286828355065091', 'Flamingo Pride', 2011, 'Animation', 'Tomer Eshed', 'Tristian Taylor', 'Sebastian Schulz, Nadine Boske, Tristian Taylor', null, 'Frustrated at being the only straight flamingo in a gay flock, our hero falls in love with a lady stork who flies by. Unable to convince her of his serious intentions, he isolates himself and endures an identity crisis. An intensive encounter inspires him to make a bold move.', 'Frustrated at being the only straight flamingo in a gay flock, our hero falls in love with a lady stork who flies by. Unable to convince her of his serious intentions, he isolates himself and endures an identity crisis. An intensive encounter inspires him to make a bold move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WhHN0UkKWdZo4n5TV7oqp2PKxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129853'),
  ('706157221995274891', 'Flamingo Road', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ted D. McCord, Michael Curtiz, David Curtiz', 'Robert Wilder', 'Joan Crawford, Zachary Scott, Sydney Greenstreet, David Brian, Gladys George, Virginia Huston, Fred Clark, Gertrude Michael', 'NR', 'A stranded carnival dancer takes on a corrupt political boss when she marries into small-town society.', 'A stranded carnival dancer takes on a corrupt political boss when she marries into small-town society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBISF3qpoDTN82Tz2RbPLNVGda8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27563'),
  ('546074751967241895', 'Flaminia', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Manfredo Archinto, Michela Giraud, Giuseppe Costantino', 'Greta Scicchitano, Francesco Marioni, Michela Giraud', 'Michela Giraud, Rita Abela, Antonello Fassari, Nina Soldano, Ed Hendrik, Catherine Bertoni de Laet, Ludovica Bizzaglia, Francesca Valtorta', null, 'Flaminia De Angelis, a cheerful girl from North Rome, is obsessed with fitness and comes from a wealthy background. Under pressure from her mother, she is about to marry Alberto, the son of a diplomat, as a means to climb the social ladder. The arrival of her autistic half-sister, Ludovica, turns her life upside down, and an unexpected event puts everything at risk.', 'Flaminia De Angelis, a cheerful girl from North Rome, is obsessed with fitness and comes from a wealthy background. Under pressure from her mother, she is about to marry Alberto, the son of a diplomat, as a means to climb the social ladder. The arrival of her autistic half-sister, Ludovica, turns her life upside down, and an unexpected event puts everything at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9BetYTe7MJfi9SRe3jvf1ea0dJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140225'),
  ('686144927032604224', 'Flammenmädchen', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Catalina Molina, Klemens Hufnagl', 'Catalina Molina', 'Stefanie Reinsperger, Manuel Rubey, Simon Schwarz, Annika Wonner, Thomas Mraz, Nils Arztmann, Bettina Ratschew, Christine Ostermayer', null, 'First barns burn, then an old house burns. A fire brigade goes around. A corpse burned beyond recognition is found in the old house. Intention or amazing coincidence? Franzi Heilmayr and Martin Merana believe in coincidence - until the evidence suddenly points in a completely different direction. And deadly danger still emanates from there.', 'First barns burn, then an old house burns. A fire brigade goes around. A corpse burned beyond recognition is found in the old house. Intention or amazing coincidence? Franzi Heilmayr and Martin Merana believe in coincidence - until the evidence suddenly points in a completely different direction. And deadly danger still emanates from there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBIS1PMyeMHS271BWPb1slarQ4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:839065'),
  ('704038822947386952', 'Flammes', 1998, 'Animation', 'Patrick Bokanowski', 'Patrick Bokanowski', null, null, 'Memories split in the space.', 'Memories split in the space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocPCyu2fJhDZCG2QTaHfX4YRrWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270152'),
  ('66849838023586597', 'Flanders', 2006, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Bruno Dumont, Yves Cape', 'Bruno Dumont', 'Adélaïde Leroux, Samuel Boidin, Henri Cretel, Jean-Marie Bruveart, David Poulain, Patrice Venant, David Legay, Inge Decaesteker', null, 'André Demester secretly and painfully loves Barbe, his childhood friend, accepting from her the little that she gives him. He leaves home to be a soldier in a war in a far off land. Barbarity, camaraderie and fear turn him into a warrior. As the seasons go by, Barbe, alone and wasting away, waits for the soldiers to return. Will Demester’s boundless love for Barbe save him?', 'André Demester secretly and painfully loves Barbe, his childhood friend, accepting from her the little that she gives him. He leaves home to be a soldier in a war in a far off land. Barbarity, camaraderie and fear turn him into a warrior. As the seasons go by, Barbe, alone and wasting away, waits for the soldiers to return. Will Demester’s boundless love for Barbe save him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qY8n5t12OBfiQI1X2rI4YrYxVoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36143'),
  ('735938789980296050', 'Flareup', 1969, 'Thriller', 'James Neilson, Mai Lisi, Andrew J. McIntyre', 'Mark Rodgers', 'Raquel Welch, James Stacy, Luke Askew, Don Chastain, Ron Rifkin, Jean Byron, Pat Delaney, Sandra Giles', 'PG-13', 'A Las Vegas go-go dancer moves to Los Angeles to escape the psycho who has killed her partners.', 'A Las Vegas go-go dancer moves to Los Angeles to escape the psycho who has killed her partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oJDjXtSFSra0mdU9OA4FtOoqQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126405'),
  ('529983207226561102', 'Flash', 1997, 'Family, Drama', 'Simon Wincer, David Burr', 'Monte Merrick', 'Lucas Black, Brian Kerwin, Tom Nowicki, Shawn Toovey, Von Coulter, Ellen Burstyn, Dan Biggers, Sharon Blackwood', null, 'A boy falls in love with a horse named Flash that''s for sale. He gets a job to earn the money to buy the horse, but he''s forced to sell when the family falls upon hard times.', 'A boy falls in love with a horse named Flash that''s for sale. He gets a job to earn the money to buy the horse, but he''s forced to sell when the family falls upon hard times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8X8HeeIzNAR4OhoGRHOdz4qffb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181574'),
  ('638360275822676319', 'Flash Gordon', 1936, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Frederick Stephani, Ray Taylor, Jerome Ash', 'Frederick Stephani, Ella O''Neill, Basil Dickey', 'Buster Crabbe, Jean Rogers, Frank Shannon, Charles Middleton, Priscilla Lawson, Richard Alexander, Jack ''Tiny'' Lipson, James Pierce', 'NR', 'Disaster seems imminent when scientists discover that the planet Mongo is about to crash into Earth. Luckily, heroic young Flash Gordon is on hand to lead an investigative mission into outer space and onto the speedily approaching planet. There, he and his best girl, Dale, who is along for the ride, learn that Ming, the devious ruler of Mongo, has purposely put the planet on a collision course with Earth, and only Flash can stop him.', 'Disaster seems imminent when scientists discover that the planet Mongo is about to crash into Earth. Luckily, heroic young Flash Gordon is on hand to lead an investigative mission into outer space and onto the speedily approaching planet. There, he and his best girl, Dale, who is along for the ride, learn that Ming, the devious ruler of Mongo, has purposely put the planet on a collision course with Earth, and only Flash can stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MPf3bzsw1EtUjlXUGArFD80Y9q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3632'),
  ('926910414162777501', 'Flash Gordon', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Mike Hodges, Gilbert Taylor, John Graysmark', 'Lorenzo Semple Jr.', 'Sam J. Jones, Melody Anderson, Max von Sydow, Chaim Topol, Ornella Muti, Timothy Dalton, Brian Blessed, Peter Wyngarde', 'PG', 'A football player and his mates travel to the planet Mongo and find themselves fighting the tyranny of Ming the Merciless to save Earth.', 'A football player and his mates travel to the planet Mongo and find themselves fighting the tyranny of Ming the Merciless to save Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTdEaRjtVnFbd5KVhxLRfbYW46e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3604'),
  ('70450140340370543', 'Flash Gordon Conquers the Universe', 1940, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Ford Beebe, Ray Taylor, Jerome Ash', 'George H. Plympton, Basil Dickey, Barry Shipman', 'Buster Crabbe, Carol Hughes, Charles Middleton, Anne Gwynne, Frank Shannon, John Hamilton, Herbert Rawlinson, Tom Chatterton', 'NR', 'A mysterious plague, the Purple Death, ravages the earth. Dr. Zarkov, investigating in his spaceship, finds a ship from planet Mongo seeding the atmosphere with dust. Sure enough, Ming the Merciless is up to his old tricks. So it''s back to Mongo for Flash, Dale, and Zarkov.', 'A mysterious plague, the Purple Death, ravages the earth. Dr. Zarkov, investigating in his spaceship, finds a ship from planet Mongo seeding the atmosphere with dust. Sure enough, Ming the Merciless is up to his old tricks. So it''s back to Mongo for Flash, Dale, and Zarkov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vT3VkTpdLQ2Me1WWbLHA7QCLr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68064'),
  ('517303457184518261', 'Flash Gordon: The Greatest Adventure of All', 1982, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'R.W. Pope, Gwen Wetzler, Marsh Lamore', 'Samuel A. Peeples', 'Robert Ridgely, Diane Pershing, Bob Holt, David Opatoshu, Vic Perrin, Melendy Britt, Ted Cassidy, Robert Douglas', 'G', 'Flash Gordon, Dale Arden and Dr. Hans Zarkov travel to the planet Mongo to fight the evil emperor Ming the Merciless.', 'Flash Gordon, Dale Arden and Dr. Hans Zarkov travel to the planet Mongo to fight the evil emperor Ming the Merciless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rP8fqGqx1klI4hlCkkQDlC0DpKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3679'),
  ('514929096135486200', 'Flash Gordon''s Trip to Mars', 1938, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Ford Beebe, Robert F. Hill, Jerome Ash', 'Ray Trampe, Norman S. Hall, Wyndham Gittens', 'Buster Crabbe, Jean Rogers, Frank Shannon, Charles Middleton, Beatrice Roberts, Donald Kerr, Richard Alexander, C. Montague Shaw', 'NR', 'When a deadly Nitron ray strikes Earth, Flash Gordon and his friends travel to Mars to battle Ming the Merciless and his new ally Queen Azura.', 'When a deadly Nitron ray strikes Earth, Flash Gordon and his friends travel to Mars to battle Ming the Merciless and his new ally Queen Azura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AUYxfXApSUVQWnIuGmUYs5d4xb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129089'),
  ('487519085953601972', 'Flash of Genius', 2008, 'Drama', 'Marc Abraham, Dante Spinotti', 'John Seabrook, Philip Railsback', 'Greg Kinnear, Lauren Graham, Dermot Mulroney, Jake Abel, Daniel Roebuck, Mitch Pileggi, Tim Kelleher, Bill Smitrovich', 'PG-13', 'In this David vs. Goliath drama based on a true story, college professor Robert Kearns goes up against the giants of the auto industry when they fail to give him credit for inventing intermittent windshield wipers. Kearns doggedly pursues recognition for his invention, as well as the much-deserved financial rewards for the sake of his wife and six kids.', 'In this David vs. Goliath drama based on a true story, college professor Robert Kearns goes up against the giants of the auto industry when they fail to give him credit for inventing intermittent windshield wipers. Kearns doggedly pursues recognition for his invention, as well as the much-deserved financial rewards for the sake of his wife and six kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14gyR9JMVfngQlolzD2N365ZeRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14914'),
  ('658233354758381746', 'Flashback', 1969, 'War, Drama', 'Raffaele Andreassi, Raffaele Andreassi', 'Callisto Cosulich, Maurizio Barendson, Raffaele Andreassi', 'Fred Robsahm, Pilar Castel, Dada Gallotti, Sandra Dal Sasso, Gianni Cavina, Antonietta Fiorito', null, 'Heinz is a German soldier stationed as a sniper overlooking his own army from a tree. When he falls asleep, his troops are gone and he is left alone to defend the incoming enemy invasion. Flashbacks recall his wartime experiences and his transition from a human being into a sadistic murderer and rapist.', 'Heinz is a German soldier stationed as a sniper overlooking his own army from a tree. When he falls asleep, his troops are gone and he is left alone to defend the incoming enemy invasion. Flashbacks recall his wartime experiences and his transition from a human being into a sadistic murderer and rapist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhzxtj0Qs25Ox2XSWhkeht3pIMa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121550'),
  ('513051056307841755', 'Flashback', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Franco Amurri, Stefan Czapsky', 'David Loughery', 'Dennis Hopper, Kiefer Sutherland, Carol Kane, Paul Dooley, Cliff DeYoung, Richard Masur, Michael McKean, Kathleen York', 'R', 'A hippie radical, Huey Walker has been a fugitive for decades, accused of a crime that he may not have committed. Finally apprehended, Walker is escorted to trial by uptight 20-something FBI agent John Buckner. While the two seem to be polar opposites, it turns out that Buckner may have more in common with Walker than is initially apparent, a point that is driven home when the pair faces off against a sinister small-town sheriff.', 'A hippie radical, Huey Walker has been a fugitive for decades, accused of a crime that he may not have committed. Finally apprehended, Walker is escorted to trial by uptight 20-something FBI agent John Buckner. While the two seem to be polar opposites, it turns out that Buckner may have more in common with Walker than is initially apparent, a point that is driven home when the pair faces off against a sinister small-town sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHJbL26SdgeWbKFJVKNfEI4LJwS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12719'),
  ('531233816376252109', 'Flashback', 2000, 'Horror', 'Michael Karen, Peter Krause', 'Jimmy Sangster, Natalie Scharf', 'Valerie Niehaus, Xaver Hutter, Alexandra Neldel, Simone Hanselmann, Detlev Buck, Katja Woywood, Elke Sommer, Rhea Harder', null, 'A young woman is released from an asylum where she has been since witnessing the murder of her parents, but violence continues to haunt her.', 'A young woman is released from an asylum where she has been since witnessing the murder of her parents, but violence continues to haunt her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lt7ydemeMXp66eoGuFf4sHCFqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10492'),
  ('54880450254504431', 'Flashback', 2020, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Christopher MacBride, Brendan Steacy', 'Christopher MacBride', 'Dylan O''Brien, Hannah Gross, Emory Cohen, Keir Gilchrist, Maika Monroe, Liisa Repo-Martell, Amanda Brugel, A.C. Peterson', 'R', 'Frederick Fitzell is living his best life—until he starts having horrific visions of Cindy, a girl who vanished in high school. After reaching out to old friends with whom he used to take a mystery drug called Mercury, Fredrick realizes the only way to stop the visions lies deep within his own memories, so he embarks on a terrifying mental odyssey to learn the truth.', 'Frederick Fitzell is living his best life—until he starts having horrific visions of Cindy, a girl who vanished in high school. After reaching out to old friends with whom he used to take a mystery drug called Mercury, Fredrick realizes the only way to stop the visions lies deep within his own memories, so he embarks on a terrifying mental odyssey to learn the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8DPeAno9IT47gCQBrKqJ9czUyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522406'),
  ('1003030801055875002', 'Flashback', 2021, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Caroline Vigneaux, Vincent Mathias', 'Caroline Vigneaux', 'Caroline Vigneaux, Gad Elmaleh, Suzanne Clément, Marion Creusvaux, Sophia Aram, Sylvie Testud, Julien Pestel, Issa Doumbia', null, 'A female lawyer travels back in time and crosses paths with other women in history who fought for women''s rights.', 'A female lawyer travels back in time and crosses paths with other women in history who fought for women''s rights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLJEwWOUmHHBW2HxkP8LEoqvq1L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809065'),
  ('297498534513523981', 'Flashback', 2023, 'Fantasy, Romance, Thriller', 'Jed Shepherd, Rick Joaquim', 'Jed Shepherd', 'Jemma Moore, Amar Chadha-Patel, Haley Bishop, Scroobius Pip, Maya Graham, Zakiy Jogi, Edward Linard, Malik Ibheis', 'NR', 'After a violent attack at her home, a yoga instructor sees flashbacks of her life and begins a frantic race through her past to try to save her boyfriend.', 'After a violent attack at her home, a yoga instructor sees flashbacks of her life and begins a frantic race through her past to try to save her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQ2jQbygvJW5HsEyaCNv2WxtAnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191885'),
  ('612394601667208830', 'Flashbacks of a Fool', 2008, 'Drama', 'Baillie Walsh, Marci Trout, John Mathieson', 'Baillie Walsh', 'Daniel Craig, Harry Eden, Miriam Karlin, Jodhi May, Helen McCrory, Olivia Williams, Felicity Jones, Keeley Hawes', 'R', 'An aging Hollywood star, Joe Scott, lives a life of narcissistic hedonism, observed by his laconic personal assistant, Ophelia. The death of his childhood best friend, Boots, takes our protagonist, and the movie, into an extended flashback to a sea-side town in 1970s Britain.', 'An aging Hollywood star, Joe Scott, lives a life of narcissistic hedonism, observed by his laconic personal assistant, Ophelia. The death of his childhood best friend, Boots, takes our protagonist, and the movie, into an extended flashback to a sea-side town in 1970s Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5lGyJD8nHZt0cKf2n6uR7svBbS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13793'),
  ('560751648822711873', 'Flashdance', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Donald Peterman, Adrian Lyne, Albert M. Shapiro', 'Joe Eszterhas, Thomas Hedley Jr.', 'Jennifer Beals, Michael Nouri, Sunny Johnson, Kyle T. Heffner, Cynthia Rhodes, Lee Ving, Ron Karabatsos, Lilia Skala', 'R', 'Alex Owens, a young woman juggling between two odd jobs, aspires to become a successful ballet dancer. Nick, who is her boss and lover, supports and encourages her to fulfil her dream.', 'Alex Owens, a young woman juggling between two odd jobs, aspires to become a successful ballet dancer. Nick, who is her boss and lover, supports and encourages her to fulfil her dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziiy6ORt8BlxWFXskBChBMInvDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535'),
  ('749860159626081239', 'Flashman', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Mino Loy, Stefano Rolla, Florian Trenker', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Paolo Gozlino, Claudie Lange, Ivano Staccioli, Jack Ary, Micaela Pignatelli, Anne Marie Williams, Seyna Seyn, Emilio Messina', null, 'Superhero Flashman--who is secretly a member of the British royal family--battles a host of villains and gangsters, including Mafia bank robbers and a gang of beautiful female counterfeiters.', 'Superhero Flashman--who is secretly a member of the British royal family--battles a host of villains and gangsters, including Mafia bank robbers and a gang of beautiful female counterfeiters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Tqvl75Bzijfesc2itiYOlqzBCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106925'),
  ('678513095206641801', 'Flashover', 2023, 'Drama, Action', 'Oxide Pang Chun, William Chan Wai-Lin', 'Wang Ran, Yang Daiyuan, Zhang Hongtao', 'Du Jiang, Wang Qianyuan, Tong Liya, Cecilia Han, Yu Haoming, Elvis Han, Wang Ge, Yin Xiaotian', null, 'A large blast hits the gas pipeline in the industrial park due to a sudden earthquake, which triggers massive explosions and engulfs the neighboring area in flames. Facing the escalating fire danger, the Fire and Rescue Force quickly reaches the hazardous zone to hold the fire and cut a firebreak, in the meantime, many survivors are pulled out of the rubble.', 'A large blast hits the gas pipeline in the industrial park due to a sudden earthquake, which triggers massive explosions and engulfs the neighboring area in flames. Facing the escalating fire danger, the Fire and Rescue Force quickly reaches the hazardous zone to hold the fire and cut a firebreak, in the meantime, many survivors are pulled out of the rubble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svmCmybIlMOpyN8zWkIo0DOwEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949698'),
  ('956366195368566849', 'Flashpoint', 1984, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kenneth Gilbert, Arne Schmidt, John Marshall', 'Dennis Shryack, Michael Butler', 'Kris Kristofferson, Treat Williams, Rip Torn, Kevin Conway, Kurtwood Smith, Miguel Ferrer, Jean Smart, Guy Boyd', 'R', 'Two Texas border guards find a jeep buried in the desert, with a skeleton, a scoped rifle, and a box with $800,000 in cash. Before they decide whether to keep the money or report it, they privately investigate the clues and unravel a decades old mystery.', 'Two Texas border guards find a jeep buried in the desert, with a skeleton, a scoped rifle, and a box with $800,000 in cash. Before they decide whether to keep the money or report it, they privately investigate the clues and unravel a decades old mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAMzujbmShAG6W13z71ov5wnfTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47825'),
  ('678914754624601732', 'Flat Foot Stooges', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Charley Chase', 'Charley Chase', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Dick Curtis, Lola Jensen, Chester Conklin, Al Thompson', 'NR', 'The stooges are firemen at a station that still uses horses to pull the engines. A salesman who wants to sell the chief some modern equipment plants gun powder in one of the engines. The chiefs daughter catches him and after a chase both are knocked unconscious. When a fire starts, the stooges respond to the alarm, but don''t realize its their firehouse that''s burning! Somehow they manage to arrive in time to save the girl, and the villain gets his just desserts.', 'The stooges are firemen at a station that still uses horses to pull the engines. A salesman who wants to sell the chief some modern equipment plants gun powder in one of the engines. The chiefs daughter catches him and after a chase both are knocked unconscious. When a fire starts, the stooges respond to the alarm, but don''t realize its their firehouse that''s burning! Somehow they manage to arrive in time to save the girl, and the villain gets his just desserts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdIEPTpHXwUq5C7PKcJoOZhanrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115922'),
  ('110293087583100222', 'Flat Girls', 2025, 'Drama', 'Jirassaya Wongsutin, Boonyanuch Kraithong, Vorada Chatjirakal', 'Jirassaya Wongsutin', 'Fatima Dechawaleekul, Kirana Pipityakorn, Pakorn Chatborirak, Wachirakon Raksasuwan, Namfon Pakdee, Suraphan Chaopaknam, Kornpassorn Ratanameathanont, Neennara Boonnithipaisit', null, 'Two teen girls grapple with the realities of love, friendship and burgeoning adulthood when one of them has to leave the home where they both grew up.', 'Two teen girls grapple with the realities of love, friendship and burgeoning adulthood when one of them has to leave the home where they both grew up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8J1XOJ5vfYhRx48VjhyhzDPbCwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290205'),
