  ('549240007556160545', 'Flatfoot in Africa', 1978, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Steno, Alberto Spagnoli, Thomas Franke', 'Adriano Bolzoni, Franco Verucci, Giovanni Simonelli', 'Bud Spencer, Enzo Cannavale, Werner Pochath, Joe Stewardson, Carel Trichardt, Desmond Thompson, Baldwyn Dakile, Dagmar Lassander', null, 'Inspector Rizzo in Napoli gets a message from a policeman from South Africa who wants to meet him. Immediately before this meeting the South African policeman is killed. Dying he shows Rizzo a picture of his young son Bodo. Rizzo travels to Johannesburg to find out what the policeman was working on and to find Bodo.', 'Inspector Rizzo in Napoli gets a message from a policeman from South Africa who wants to meet him. Immediately before this meeting the South African policeman is killed. Dying he shows Rizzo a picture of his young son Bodo. Rizzo travels to Johannesburg to find out what the policeman was working on and to find Bodo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNdEEsnYgKaaKIhlcRyAjSbpni4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11055'),
  ('926804988717438058', 'Flatfoot in Egypt', 1980, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Steno, Luigi Kuveiller, Sandro Borni', 'Steno, Adriano Bolzoni, Massimo Franciosa', 'Bud Spencer, Enzo Cannavale, Angelo Infanti, Cinzia Monreale, Karl-Otto Alberty, Adel Adham, Mahmoud Qabil, Baldwyn Dakile', null, 'Inspector Rizzo and Marshal Caputo go to Egypt and look for Professor Cerullo, who is missing.', 'Inspector Rizzo and Marshal Caputo go to Egypt and look for Professor Cerullo, who is missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZjyq2RLgZ0ksDXDBudAqvOOwKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11160'),
