  ('71140146788907123', 'Flesh & Blood', 1979, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jud Taylor, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Eric Bercovici', 'Tom Berenger, Mitchell Ryan, Kristin Griffith, Denzel Washington, Suzanne Pleshette, John Cassavetes, Anthony Charnota, Bert Remsen', 'NR', 'A young street-tough-turned-boxer struggles to reach the top while finding his romance with an attractive TV reporter is complicated by an incestuous relationship with his mother.', 'A young street-tough-turned-boxer struggles to reach the top while finding his romance with an attractive TV reporter is complicated by an incestuous relationship with his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i09c4aAWfjmYOEZSjWB538LpidJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358861'),
