  ('808851329268140374', 'Flesh for Sale', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Vicente Pérez Herrero', null, 'Nacho Vidal, Anastasia Mayo, Bibian Norai', null, 'The porn industry has grown from a product purchased on the sly, to be sold on newsstands in the daily press. "La piel vendida" aims to open a window to this film. His actors, actresses, directors, producers ... tell us their profession from the lights and shadows of a cinema by dint of being explicit in its imagery and themes, is hidden in their motivations: the viewer and their protagonists.', 'The porn industry has grown from a product purchased on the sly, to be sold on newsstands in the daily press. "La piel vendida" aims to open a window to this film. His actors, actresses, directors, producers ... tell us their profession from the lights and shadows of a cinema by dint of being explicit in its imagery and themes, is hidden in their motivations: the viewer and their protagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPrRaowFYtqBhBON9yzshnlOKof.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141028'),
