  ('591244313254922647', 'Fletch', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Michael Ritchie, Fred Schuler, Larry Rapaport', 'Andrew Bergman', 'Chevy Chase, Tim Matheson, Dana Wheeler-Nicholson, Joe Don Baker, Richard Libertini, Geena Davis, M. Emmet Walsh, George Wendt', 'PG', 'When investigative reporter Irwin "Fletch" Fletcher goes undercover to write a piece on the drug trade at a local beach, he''s approached by wealthy businessman Alan Stanwyk, who offers him $50,000 to murder him. With sarcastic wit and a knack for disguises, Fletch sets out to uncover Stanwyk''s story.', 'When investigative reporter Irwin "Fletch" Fletcher goes undercover to write a piece on the drug trade at a local beach, he''s approached by wealthy businessman Alan Stanwyk, who offers him $50,000 to murder him. With sarcastic wit and a knack for disguises, Fletch sets out to uncover Stanwyk''s story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKDnMvVynvj7lwdv1iAZO1DzTYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9749'),
