  ('396601905249869290', 'Flic tout simplement', 2015, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'Yves Rénier, Kika Ungaro', 'Olivier Norek, Hugues Pagan', 'Mathilde Seigner, Philippe Torreton, Yves Rénier, Jean-Marie Winling, Kamel Belghazi, Steve Driesen, Samantha Rénier, Patrick Ridremont', null, 'Serial killer Guy Georges'' hunt by a female captain who created a DNA database that revolutionized the police methods.', 'Serial killer Guy Georges'' hunt by a female captain who created a DNA database that revolutionized the police methods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4BBeKZfM0rzy0eG6HBQSAimFuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378573'),
  ('53633861663920265', 'Flicka', 2006, 'Family, Drama', 'Michael Mayer, Timothy R. Price, Rebecca Strickland', 'Lawrence Konner, Mark Rosenthal', 'Alison Lohman, Tim McGraw, Maria Bello, Ryan Kwanten, Danny Pino, Dallas Roberts, Kaylee DeFer, Jeffrey Nordling', 'PG', 'Katy McLaughlin desires to work on her family''s mountainside horse ranch, although her father insists she finish boarding school. Katy finds a mustang in the hills near her ranch. The headstrong 16 year old then sets her mind to tame a mustang and prove to her father she can run the ranch. But when tragedy happens, it will take all the love and strength the family can muster to restore hope.', 'Katy McLaughlin desires to work on her family''s mountainside horse ranch, although her father insists she finish boarding school. Katy finds a mustang in the hills near her ranch. The headstrong 16 year old then sets her mind to tame a mustang and prove to her father she can run the ranch. But when tragedy happens, it will take all the love and strength the family can muster to restore hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhJlXSmiHnlVxea5J5l3wfuATwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14012'),
  ('1046785254177441419', 'Flicka 2', 2010, 'Family, Drama', 'Michael Damian, Ron Stannett', 'Jennifer Robinson', 'Patrick Warburton, Tammin Sursok, Emily Tennant, Reilly Dolman, Clint Black, Ted Whittall, Lorne Cardinal, Dwayne Wiley', 'PG', 'Carrie is a big-city teenager whose life is turned upside down when she moves to a horse ranch in Wyoming to live with her father. But everything changes when Carrie meets Flicka, a wild, jet-black mustang who''s just as free-spirited and strong-willed as Carrie. The two form a special bond and Carrie opens her heart to her father and a handsome, local boy, but when a jealous rival puts Flicka''s life in jeopardy, Carrie must do whatever it takes to save her best friend.', 'Carrie is a big-city teenager whose life is turned upside down when she moves to a horse ranch in Wyoming to live with her father. But everything changes when Carrie meets Flicka, a wild, jet-black mustang who''s just as free-spirited and strong-willed as Carrie. The two form a special bond and Carrie opens her heart to her father and a handsome, local boy, but when a jealous rival puts Flicka''s life in jeopardy, Carrie must do whatever it takes to save her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fon68TdGTlcgVmHe0arPLnEvc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37932'),
  ('265817305861750435', 'Flicka: Country Pride', 2012, 'Drama, Family', 'Michael Damian, Ron Stannett', 'Jennifer Robinson', 'Clint Black, Lisa Hartman, Kacey Rohl, Lily Pearl Black, Teryl Rothery, Siobhan Williams, Max Lloyd-Jones, Laura Soltis', 'G', 'Flicka and Toby help out a struggling stable owner and her teenage daughter.', 'Flicka and Toby help out a struggling stable owner and her teenage daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJpYWz8wqXypAWhJJ0yVUtaHc79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105768'),
  ('409686179662362891', 'Flickering Ghosts of Love Gone By', 2022, 'Documentary', 'André Bonzel', 'André Bonzel', null, null, 'Inheriting a film collection of home movies after the death of a relative, a film director recounts his life and the women he loved while investigating some family secrets hidden in the recovered images.', 'Inheriting a film collection of home movies after the death of a relative, a film director recounts his life and the women he loved while investigating some family secrets hidden in the recovered images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKvSptW7ayx9xLe0mzQVBnOP7MI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844180'),
  ('633369335931131341', 'Flickering Lights', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Eric Kress, Jannik Johansen', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Søren Pilmark, Ulrich Thomsen, Mads Mikkelsen, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Sofie Gråbøl, Iben Hjejle, Frits Helmuth, Ole Thestrup', null, 'Four small gangsters from Copenhagen trick a gangster boss: they take over 4,000,000 kroner which they were supposed to bring him. Trying to escape to Barcelona they are forced to stop in the countryside, in an old, wrecked house, hiding there for several weeks. Slowly, one after another, they realize, that they would like to stay there, start a new life.', 'Four small gangsters from Copenhagen trick a gangster boss: they take over 4,000,000 kroner which they were supposed to bring him. Trying to escape to Barcelona they are forced to stop in the countryside, in an old, wrecked house, hiding there for several weeks. Slowly, one after another, they realize, that they would like to stay there, start a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20ApKJUi1XYri37RAH3SDIp2Ykh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10180'),
  ('202801122790409949', 'Flics de Choc', 1983, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jean-Pierre Desagnat, Maurice Fellous', 'Jean Ardy, Guy Pérol', 'Pierre Banderet, Marc Chapiteau, Pierre Massimi, Chantal Nobel, Mylène Demongeot, Jacques Balutin, Jean-Luc Moreau, Laetitia Gabrielli', null, 'Sylvie and Marie-Christine, two young girls abducted by force by pimps in order to make them participate in perverse shows, testify against their captors and are subsequently assassinated. Commissioner Beauclair and her teammates vigorously tackle the prostitution network in the Paris region. But the witnesses they meet are eliminated one after another ...', 'Sylvie and Marie-Christine, two young girls abducted by force by pimps in order to make them participate in perverse shows, testify against their captors and are subsequently assassinated. Commissioner Beauclair and her teammates vigorously tackle the prostitution network in the Paris region. But the witnesses they meet are eliminated one after another ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRmZiYaIvIWm0pXJseEu4EZI3Jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285349'),
  ('365859242591467499', 'Flies', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Aritz Moreno, Javier Agirre Erauso', 'Javier Gullón', 'Ernesto Alterio, Claudio Rissi, Mara Bestelli, Tomás Pozzi, Gabriel Fernández, Gastón Chamorro, Natalia Cociuffo, Juan Cottet', null, 'Mr. Machi is a businessman fond of luxuries, easy money and women. A despicable person who abuses his power and position, but suddenly finds himself in an extreme situation: one morning, in broad daylight, he punctures a tire. But his surprise comes when he discovers the disfigured corpse of a stranger in his trunk. Someone has set a trap for him. There he begins a desperate route to get rid of the body, discover his identity and know who is behind all this. One of the many enemies that he has cultivated over the years, from his own wife to co-workers, bodyguards and politicians. It could have been any of those that he has stepped on during these years to continue climbing or to consolidate his power, because for Luis Machi, people are so insignificant that from afar they look like flies.', 'Mr. Machi is a businessman fond of luxuries, easy money and women. A despicable person who abuses his power and position, but suddenly finds himself in an extreme situation: one morning, in broad daylight, he punctures a tire. But his surprise comes when he discovers the disfigured corpse of a stranger in his trunk. Someone has set a trap for him. There he begins a desperate route to get rid of the body, discover his identity and know who is behind all this. One of the many enemies that he has cultivated over the years, from his own wife to co-workers, bodyguards and politicians. It could have been any of those that he has stepped on during these years to continue climbing or to consolidate his power, because for Luis Machi, people are so insignificant that from afar they look like flies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9N3Ve9inJAHIF8vYHpm4hdUdBH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1177908'),
  ('953723290212295945', 'Flight', 2012, 'Drama', 'Robert Zemeckis, Don Burgess, Dana J. Kuznetzkoff', 'John Gatins', 'Denzel Washington, Don Cheadle, Kelly Reilly, John Goodman, Bruce Greenwood, Brian Geraghty, Tamara Tunie, Nadine Velazquez', 'R', 'Commercial airline pilot Whip Whitaker has a problem with drugs and alcohol, though so far he''s managed to complete his flights safely. His luck runs out when a disastrous mechanical malfunction sends his plane hurtling toward the ground. Whip pulls off a miraculous crash-landing that results in only six lives lost. Shaken to the core, Whip vows to get sober -- but when the crash investigation exposes his addiction, he finds himself in an even worse situation.', 'Commercial airline pilot Whip Whitaker has a problem with drugs and alcohol, though so far he''s managed to complete his flights safely. His luck runs out when a disastrous mechanical malfunction sends his plane hurtling toward the ground. Whip pulls off a miraculous crash-landing that results in only six lives lost. Shaken to the core, Whip vows to get sober -- but when the crash investigation exposes his addiction, he finds himself in an even worse situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFsHDNclXoCKy2xMxskzXXMaFJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87502'),
  ('710443533896688518', 'Flight 666', 2018, 'Horror, Action', 'Josh Maas, Rob Pallatina', 'Jacob Cooney, Brandon Stroud', 'Renée Willett, Jannica Olin, Joseph Michael Harris, Jose Rosete, Paul Logan, Liz Fenning, Greg Furman, Clarissa Thibeaux', null, 'Passengers and crew on a flight are attacked by unseen forces that threaten all aboard.', 'Passengers and crew on a flight are attacked by unseen forces that threaten all aboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3K52LBS5VW0tcgrZAMMJXvTOAkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527642'),
  ('727754683057027026', 'Flight 714', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Eric Rondeaux, David P. Scherer', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Marc Moro, Susan Roman', null, 'Tintin and his friends get involved in an unexpected and weird adventure when they meet Laszlo Carreidas, an eccentric millionaire.', 'Tintin and his friends get involved in an unexpected and weird adventure when they meet Laszlo Carreidas, an eccentric millionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TV1EnC9V6TM5rnXDVYqAkwcOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441337'),
  ('511870190169261214', 'Flight 7500', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Takashi Shimizu, David Tattersall, Hal Olofsson', 'Craig Rosenberg', 'Leslie Bibb, Jamie Chung, Jerry Ferrara, Ryan Kwanten, Amy Smart, Scout Taylor-Compton, Christian Serratos, Nicky Whelan', 'PG-13', 'Flight 7500 departs Los Angeles International Airport bound for Tokyo. As the overnight flight makes its way over the Pacific Ocean during its ten-hour course, the passengers encounter what appears to be a supernatural force in the cabin.', 'Flight 7500 departs Los Angeles International Airport bound for Tokyo. As the overnight flight makes its way over the Pacific Ocean during its ten-hour course, the passengers encounter what appears to be a supernatural force in the cabin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRO8pbC9W4Uf0FSe0H8stZl2agI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82657'),
  ('578559731769604800', 'Flight 90: Disaster on the Potomac', 1984, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Michael Lewis, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'John McGreevey', 'Barry Corbin, Jeannetta Arnette, Stephen Macht, Richard Masur, Dinah Manoff, Donnelly Rhodes, Jamie Rose, Richard Beauchamp', null, 'Flight 90: Disaster on the Potomac is a true story based on the crash of Air Florida flight 90 on January 13, 1982 in Washington D.C. This movie follows the main players throughout the day, with a lot of care taken to re-create what actually went wrong, who died, and who survived. There is a lot of actual footage from the day, as well as accurate representations of aircraft type and airline.', 'Flight 90: Disaster on the Potomac is a true story based on the crash of Air Florida flight 90 on January 13, 1982 in Washington D.C. This movie follows the main players throughout the day, with a lot of care taken to re-create what actually went wrong, who died, and who survived. There is a lot of actual footage from the day, as well as accurate representations of aircraft type and airline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lo6yxXuBKGXuNdmx3HPKWYxFNpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54637'),
  ('743134191631132940', 'Flight 93', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Peter Markle, Mark Irwin', 'Nevin Schreiner', 'Jeffrey Nordling, Brennan Elliott, Kendall Cross, Ty Olsson, Monnae Michaell, Asim Wali, Anthony Harrison, Laura Mennell', 'PG-13', 'Flight 93 is a 2006 made-for-TV film, directed by Peter Markle, which chronicles the events aboard United Airlines Flight 93 during the September 11 attacks. It premiered January 30, 2006 on the A&amp;E Network and was re-broadcast several times throughout 2006. The film focused heavily on eight passengers, namely Todd Beamer, Mark Bingham, Tom Burnett, Jeremy Glick, Lauren Grandcolas, Donald Greene, Nicole Miller, and Honor Elizabeth Wainio. It features small appearances from many other passengers, namely Donald Peterson and his wife, Jean, and also from flight attendant Sandra Bradshaw.', 'Flight 93 is a 2006 made-for-TV film, directed by Peter Markle, which chronicles the events aboard United Airlines Flight 93 during the September 11 attacks. It premiered January 30, 2006 on the A&amp;E Network and was re-broadcast several times throughout 2006. The film focused heavily on eight passengers, namely Todd Beamer, Mark Bingham, Tom Burnett, Jeremy Glick, Lauren Grandcolas, Donald Greene, Nicole Miller, and Honor Elizabeth Wainio. It features small appearances from many other passengers, namely Donald Peterson and his wife, Jean, and also from flight attendant Sandra Bradshaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2jz1F7u4u4jID3xaFjuUBFEpxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10958'),
  ('121493032883788879', 'Flight Attendant: Scandal', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Osamu Murakami, Masaru Konuma, Koichi Suzuki', 'Hisashi Watanabe, Osamu Murakami', 'Tomoko Ai, Kate Asabuki, Shigeru Muroi, Makoto Yoshino, Ryosei Tayama, Koichi Ueda, Osamu Murakami, Nakatomi Kaze', null, 'Four female flight attendants embark on some salacious misadventures: A few go to a company singles party to cavort with some pilots, while the lovely Misako embarks on an adventure all her own after meeting a street fortune teller...', 'Four female flight attendants embark on some salacious misadventures: A few go to a company singles party to cavort with some pilots, while the lovely Misako embarks on an adventure all her own after meeting a street fortune teller...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZuLbAy3EjHJeizXYnmDyekgCM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578883'),
  ('800245067663022295', 'Flight Command', 1940, 'Drama, War', 'Frank Borzage', 'Wells Root, Harvey S. Haislip', 'Robert Taylor, Ruth Hussey, Walter Pidgeon, Paul Kelly, Shepperd Strudwick, Red Skelton, Nat Pendleton, Dick Purcell', null, 'A rookie flyer, Ens. Alan Drake, joins the famous Hellcats Squadron right out of flight school in Pensacola. He doesn''t make a great first impression when he is forced to ditch his airplane and parachute to safety when he arrives at the base but is unable to land due to heavy fog. On his first day on the job, his poor shooting skills results in the Hellcats losing an air combat competition. His fellow pilots accept him anyways but they think he''s crossed the line when they erroneously conclude that while their CO Billy Gray is away, Drake has an affair with his wife Lorna. Drake is now an outcast and is prepared to resign from the Navy but his extreme heroism in saving Billy Gray''s life turns things around.', 'A rookie flyer, Ens. Alan Drake, joins the famous Hellcats Squadron right out of flight school in Pensacola. He doesn''t make a great first impression when he is forced to ditch his airplane and parachute to safety when he arrives at the base but is unable to land due to heavy fog. On his first day on the job, his poor shooting skills results in the Hellcats losing an air combat competition. His fellow pilots accept him anyways but they think he''s crossed the line when they erroneously conclude that while their CO Billy Gray is away, Drake has an affair with his wife Lorna. Drake is now an outcast and is prepared to resign from the Navy but his extreme heroism in saving Billy Gray''s life turns things around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOrD3Sx6hq1Geh3V2KCE8hl0fAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100010'),
  ('190291882013318768', 'Flight Crew', 2016, 'Action', 'Irek Hartowicz, Nikolay Lebedev', 'Yuri Korotkov, Aleksey Onishchenko, Tikhon Kornev', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Vladimir Mashkov, Agnė Grudytė, Sergey Shakurov, Sergey Romanovich, Elena Yakovleva, Sergey Gazarov, Sergey Kempo', null, 'A story about bravery, self-sacrifice and human dignity put on trial by the merciless power of nature. A young pilot is fired from military air force after disobeying an absurd order. He gets a job as a co-pilot with a civil airline. Being brutally honest and direct, he is not on best terms with his new colleagues. During a flight to Asia his crew receives a distress message from a volcanic island and makes a decision to attempt a rescue mission. Will it be a success? Will they survive the disaster? They have a single chance to find that out: by being a team and sticking up for one another.', 'A story about bravery, self-sacrifice and human dignity put on trial by the merciless power of nature. A young pilot is fired from military air force after disobeying an absurd order. He gets a job as a co-pilot with a civil airline. Being brutally honest and direct, he is not on best terms with his new colleagues. During a flight to Asia his crew receives a distress message from a volcanic island and makes a decision to attempt a rescue mission. Will it be a success? Will they survive the disaster? They have a single chance to find that out: by being a team and sticking up for one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nL1WhzLiD2nZ7ixQcp5K0z4eEB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380111'),
  ('419716424697661352', 'Flight Into Darkness', 1935, 'Drama, War', 'Anatole Litvak, Louis Née, Armand Thirard', 'Joseph Kessel, Anatole Litvak', 'Annabella, Charles Vanel, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Jean Murat, Daniel Mendaille, Raymond Cordy, Suzanne Desprès, Alexandre Rignault', null, 'During the First World War, before joining a squadron at the front in 1918, Herbillon (Jean-Pierre Aumont) has a liaison with Helene (Annabella), a married woman. The young man discovers that his mistress is none other than the wife of Maury (Charles Vanel), an aviator friend.', 'During the First World War, before joining a squadron at the front in 1918, Herbillon (Jean-Pierre Aumont) has a liaison with Helene (Annabella), a married woman. The young man discovers that his mistress is none other than the wife of Maury (Charles Vanel), an aviator friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUZekUNiBaKR5tZ6L96kX91ZFqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258384'),
  ('167690017813246637', 'Flight of Black Angel', 1991, 'Action, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Mostow, Lee Redmond, Chris Auer', 'John Brancato, Michael Ferris', 'Peter Strauss, William O''Leary, James O''Sullivan, K Callan, Michele Pawk, Michael Keys Hall, Ben Rawnsley, Marcus Chong', null, 'A US Air Force pilot steals a nuclear bomb and sets off on what he believes is a divine mission against an American city.', 'A US Air Force pilot steals a nuclear bomb and sets off on what he believes is a divine mission against an American city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d55mSfyJQJ9tSZjpuVqgWLdHanC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124201'),
  ('1016353025629807512', 'Flight of Fury', 2007, 'Action', 'Michael Keusch, Geoffrey Hall', 'Steven Seagal, Joe Halpin', 'Steven Seagal, Steve Toussaint, Angus MacInnes, Mark Bazeley, Ciera Payton, Alki David, Tim Woodward, Vincenzo Nicoli', 'R', 'John, a secret government operative is sent to recover a stolen Stealth Bomber from the hands of terrorist organization which plans to use it in a deadly attack, with warheads containing bio-weapons.', 'John, a secret government operative is sent to recover a stolen Stealth Bomber from the hands of terrorist organization which plans to use it in a deadly attack, with warheads containing bio-weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0b2EY7VqDF8pp3ghTd02fiwCLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24351'),
  ('860829289939048142', 'Flight of the Doves', 1971, 'Family, Drama', 'Ralph Nelson, Harry Waxman', 'Ralph Nelson, Frank Gabrielson', 'Ron Moody, Jack Wild, Dorothy McGuire, Stanley Holloway, Helen Raye, William Rushton, Dana, John Molloy', 'G', 'While fleeing across the Irish countryside, two orphans are pursued by their villainous uncle, a master of disguises.', 'While fleeing across the Irish countryside, two orphans are pursued by their villainous uncle, a master of disguises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebOrJtbDxrxiY2qy1TgRZ8NO4yI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82191'),
  ('313304529938543074', 'Flight of the Innocent', 1992, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Adventure', 'Carlo Carlei, Raffaele Mertes', 'Gualtiero Rosella, Carlo Carlei', 'Manuel Colao, Federico Pacifici, Francesca Neri, Jacques Perrin, Sal Borgese, Anita Zagaria, Giusi Cataldo, Nicola Di Pinto', 'R', 'The boy Vito is a portrait of beauty and wide-eyed innocence spawned from a violent family of kidnapers and murderers in the South of Italy. When his entire family is murdered by a rival clan of kidnapers, Vito must flee for his own life and in the end attempts to make atonement for some of his family''s sins.', 'The boy Vito is a portrait of beauty and wide-eyed innocence spawned from a violent family of kidnapers and murderers in the South of Italy. When his entire family is murdered by a rival clan of kidnapers, Vito must flee for his own life and in the end attempts to make atonement for some of his family''s sins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEcoQCEOYV2HM7ADrGOzIZoDW1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41655'),
  ('765435442800087046', 'Flight of the Intruder', 1991, 'Action, War', 'John Milius, Fred J. Koenekamp, Terry Leonard', 'David Shaber', 'Danny Glover, Willem Dafoe, Brad Johnson, Rosanna Arquette, Tom Sizemore, J. Kenneth Campbell, Jared Chandler, Dann Florek', 'PG-13', 'U.S. Navy pilot Lt. Jake Grafton and his bombardier buddy, Lt. Cmdr. Virgil Cole, are two soldiers embedded in the Vietnam War growing frustrated by the military''s constraints on their missions. Despite the best efforts of their commanding officer, Cmdr. Frank Camparelli, to re-engage them, this disillusioned pair decide to take the war effort into their own hands with an explosive battle plan that could well get them court-martialed.', 'U.S. Navy pilot Lt. Jake Grafton and his bombardier buddy, Lt. Cmdr. Virgil Cole, are two soldiers embedded in the Vietnam War growing frustrated by the military''s constraints on their missions. Despite the best efforts of their commanding officer, Cmdr. Frank Camparelli, to re-engage them, this disillusioned pair decide to take the war effort into their own hands with an explosive battle plan that could well get them court-martialed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzjCePBItSRfZxLnOd3KBGHQIJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18886'),
  ('521447404721053242', 'Flight of the Living Dead', 2007, 'Horror', 'Scott Thomas, Mark Eberle', 'Sidney Iwanter, Scott Thomas, Mark Onspaugh', 'David Chisum, Kristen Kerr, Richard Tyson, Kevin J. O''Connor, Erick Avari, Todd Babcock, Laura Cayouette, Siena Goines', 'R', 'On a flight from Los Angeles to Paris, a mad scientist on the run from the CIA is transporting a coffin containing the body of a colleague infected with a genetically modified virus. While the 747 crosses a violent thunderstorm, the instability of the aircraft allows the corpse to get out of its container.', 'On a flight from Los Angeles to Paris, a mad scientist on the run from the CIA is transporting a coffin containing the body of a colleague infected with a genetically modified virus. While the 747 crosses a violent thunderstorm, the instability of the aircraft allows the corpse to get out of its container.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulLuFAX6MK8QRMrhJWPJ1G9qeVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16126'),
  ('423002206273473243', 'Flight of the Navigator', 1986, 'Family, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Randal Kleiser, James Glennon, Peter Lyons Collister', 'Michael Burton, Matt MacManus', 'Joey Cramer, Paul Reubens, Veronica Cartwright, Cliff DeYoung, Sarah Jessica Parker, Matt Adler, Howard Hesseman, Robert Small', 'PG', '12-year-old David is accidentally knocked out in the forest near his home, but when he awakens eight years have passed. His family is overjoyed to have him back, but is just as perplexed as he is that he hasn''t aged. When a NASA scientist discovers a UFO nearby, David gets the chance to unravel the mystery and recover the life he lost.', '12-year-old David is accidentally knocked out in the forest near his home, but when he awakens eight years have passed. His family is overjoyed to have him back, but is just as perplexed as he is that he hasn''t aged. When a NASA scientist discovers a UFO nearby, David gets the chance to unravel the mystery and recover the life he lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdRgQWMximj0tL6OWu9kRTtePmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10122'),
  ('586757419080654457', 'Flight of the Phoenix', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'John Moore, Brendan Galvin, Jennifer Blatt', 'Lukas Heller', 'Dennis Quaid, Tyrese Gibson, Giovanni Ribisi, Miranda Otto, Tony Curran, Sticky Fingaz, Jacob Vargas, Hugh Laurie', 'PG-13', 'When an oil rig in the Gobi Desert of Mongolia proves unproductive, an aircraft crew are sent to shut the operation down and fly them out. On the flight out over the desert on the way to Beijing, Capt. Frank Towns and co-pilot A.J. are unable to keep their cargo plane, a C-119 Flying Boxcar, in the air when a violent sandstorm strikes. Crash-landing in a remote uncharted part of the desert, the two pilots and their passengers -- a crew of oil workers and a drifter -- must work together to survive by rebuilding the aircraft. Soon, low supplies and a band of merciless smugglers add even greater urgency to their task.', 'When an oil rig in the Gobi Desert of Mongolia proves unproductive, an aircraft crew are sent to shut the operation down and fly them out. On the flight out over the desert on the way to Beijing, Capt. Frank Towns and co-pilot A.J. are unable to keep their cargo plane, a C-119 Flying Boxcar, in the air when a violent sandstorm strikes. Crash-landing in a remote uncharted part of the desert, the two pilots and their passengers -- a crew of oil workers and a drifter -- must work together to survive by rebuilding the aircraft. Soon, low supplies and a band of merciless smugglers add even greater urgency to their task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcj6unMsKCw0ogWFlUXmbc9gKap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11866'),
  ('606757593381131109', 'Flight of the Red Balloon', 2007, 'Family, Drama', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'François Margolin, Hou Hsiao-hsien', 'Juliette Binoche, Simon Iteanu, Song Fang, Hippolyte Girardot, Louise Margolin, Anna Sigalevitch, Flore Vannier-Moreau', null, 'The first part in a new series of films produced by Musée d''Orsay, ''Flight of the Red Balloon'' tells the story of a French family as seen through the eyes of a Chinese student. The film was shot in August and September 2006 on location in Paris. This is Hou Hsiao-Hsien''s first Western film. It is based on the classic French short The Red Balloon directed by Albert Lamorisse.', 'The first part in a new series of films produced by Musée d''Orsay, ''Flight of the Red Balloon'' tells the story of a French family as seen through the eyes of a Chinese student. The film was shot in August and September 2006 on location in Paris. This is Hou Hsiao-Hsien''s first Western film. It is based on the classic French short The Red Balloon directed by Albert Lamorisse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DUY5Xg0bIAa6k8HR6lbwNhpDrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12198'),
  ('1127108561425220681', 'Flight Risk', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rob Burgess, Mel Gibson, Tim Swope', 'Jared Rosenberg', 'Mark Wahlberg, Michelle Dockery, Topher Grace, Leah Remini, Maaz Ali, Paul Ben-Victor, Eilise Patton, Savanah Joeckel', 'R', 'A pilot transports a U.S. Marshal accompanying a government witness to a trial in New York. As they cross the Alaskan wilderness, tensions soar and trust is tested, as not everyone on board is who they seem.', 'A pilot transports a U.S. Marshal accompanying a government witness to a trial in New York. As they cross the Alaskan wilderness, tensions soar and trust is tested, as not everyone on board is who they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0bCG4NX32iIEsRFZqRtuvzNCyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126166'),
  ('267798316785953340', 'Flight to Mars', 1951, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lesley Selander, Harry Neumann', 'Arthur Strawn', 'Arthur Franz, Virginia Huston, Cameron Mitchell, John Litel, Richard Gaines, Morris Ankrum, Marguerite Chapman, Lucille Barkley', null, 'Four scientists and a newsman crash land on Mars and meet martians who act friendly.', 'Four scientists and a newsman crash land on Mars and meet martians who act friendly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frpl5j2OLXoQKGGky5Z8O5H1VqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43374'),
  ('1073852799817430432', 'Flight World War II', 2015, 'Action, Science Fiction, War', 'Emile Edwin Smith, Ben Demaree', 'Bill Hanstock, Jacob Cooney', 'Faran Tahir, Robbie Kay, Aqueela Zoll, Matias Ponce, Alberto Barros Jr., Vi Flaten, David Campfield, Angie Teodora Dick', 'NR', 'International Flight 42 is on course, when all of a sudden a massive and weird storm crops up around the plane. This sends the plane back in time to the year 1940- smack dab in the middle of WWII! Now, the crew and passengers must not only find a way back to their time, but fight off the Axis powers.', 'International Flight 42 is on course, when all of a sudden a massive and weird storm crops up around the plane. This sends the plane back in time to the year 1940- smack dab in the middle of WWII! Now, the crew and passengers must not only find a way back to their time, but fight off the Axis powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1CTPba4qdZ0AgbyHQHGX4XRUE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343070'),
  ('29288266445483903', 'Flight/Risk', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Omar Mullick, Karim Amer, Omar Mullick', null, 'Dominic Gates, Zipporah Kuria, Justin Green, Edward Pierson, Eric Havian, Dan Carey, Dennis Tajer, Sean Patrick Maloney', 'PG', 'Everyday people find themselves in the midst of a global tragedy when two Boeing 737 Max planes crashed only five months apart in 2018 and 2019. This powerful documentary is told through the perspective of affected family members, their legal teams, whistleblowers, and Pulitzer-winning Seattle Times journalist, Dominic Gates.', 'Everyday people find themselves in the midst of a global tragedy when two Boeing 737 Max planes crashed only five months apart in 2018 and 2019. This powerful documentary is told through the perspective of affected family members, their legal teams, whistleblowers, and Pulitzer-winning Seattle Times journalist, Dominic Gates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8G7MK4VEoGDmkM0kDsk20NV2OEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001869'),
  ('506805979399298451', 'Flightplan', 2005, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Robert Schwentke, Florian Ballhaus, Gerald Sullivan', 'Billy Ray, Peter A. Dowling', 'Jodie Foster, Peter Sarsgaard, Erika Christensen, Kate Beahan, Greta Scacchi, Judith Scott, Sean Bean, Michael Irby', 'PG-13', 'Flying at 40,000 feet in a state-of-the art aircraft that she helped design, Kyle Pratt''s 6-year-old daughter Julia vanishes without a trace. Or did she? No one on the plane believes Julia was ever onboard. And now Kyle, desperate and alone, can only count on her own wits to unravel the mystery and save her daughter.', 'Flying at 40,000 feet in a state-of-the art aircraft that she helped design, Kyle Pratt''s 6-year-old daughter Julia vanishes without a trace. Or did she? No one on the plane believes Julia was ever onboard. And now Kyle, desperate and alone, can only count on her own wits to unravel the mystery and save her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNjZFzbe7PfF3TxztNHDkinOPyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9315'),
  ('290735265287244374', 'Flights in Dreams and in Reality', 1983, 'Drama', 'Roman Balayan, Vilen Kalyuta, Lyudmila Lyubenskaya', 'Viktor Merezhko', 'Oleg Yankovskiy, Oleg Menshikov, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Oleg Tabakov, Lyudmila Ivanova, Lyudmila Zorina, Elena Kostina, Lyubov Rudneva', null, 'On the eve of his fortieth anniversary Sergei Makarov looks back at his life and learns that he has achieved nothing. He was not able to be happy and to bring happiness to the closest people in his life, neither to his long-suffering wife nor young mistress nor friends nor work... It is about the men who never grew up and could not find themselves in the time of stagnation – gifted, charming, but infantile and lost, they never were able to realize themselves...', 'On the eve of his fortieth anniversary Sergei Makarov looks back at his life and learns that he has achieved nothing. He was not able to be happy and to bring happiness to the closest people in his life, neither to his long-suffering wife nor young mistress nor friends nor work... It is about the men who never grew up and could not find themselves in the time of stagnation – gifted, charming, but infantile and lost, they never were able to realize themselves...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3qjOc9jLl7QBoUIkF77JgoidPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83486'),
  ('86365203930523754', 'Fling', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John Stewart Muller, Frederick Schroeder', 'Laura Boersma, John Stewart Muller', 'Brandon Routh, Steve Sandvoss, Courtney Ford, Shoshana Bush, Nick Wechsler, Ellen Hollman, Mousa Kraish, Deborah Rush', null, 'An attractive young couple''s open relationship is stretched to the breaking point when each partner finds themselves falling in love with other people.', 'An attractive young couple''s open relationship is stretched to the breaking point when each partner finds themselves falling in love with other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3D8yE5PGFHwavMEwBkHt00LkHuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19572'),
  ('919624061311580926', 'Flintstone Family Christmas', 1993, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ray Patterson, Kris Zimmerman', 'Sean Roche, David Ehrman', 'Henry Corden, Jean Vander Pyl, Frank Welker, B.J. Ward, Didi Conn, Christine Cavanaugh, John Stephenson, Megan Mullally', 'NR', 'While the Flintstones and the Rubbles are waiting for Pebbles, Bamm-Bamm and the twins to begin the holiday festivities, they end up tring to teach a homeless boy about values.', 'While the Flintstones and the Rubbles are waiting for Pebbles, Bamm-Bamm and the twins to begin the holiday festivities, they end up tring to teach a homeless boy about values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDhK1nKEd8FZ01IBpHAjmfIShuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48873'),
  ('452396757920200252', 'Flip That Romance', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Barb Atamaniuk, Ronaldo Nacionales, William McKnight', 'Jill Girling, Lori Mather-Welch', 'Julie Gonzalo, Tyler Hynes, Pauline Egan, Cardi Wong, Ramon Terrell, Jacqueline Samuda, Fiona Vroom, Matthew Kevin Anderson', null, 'Rival house flippers, Jules Briggs and Lance Waddell, renovate dual sides of a duplex and rekindle an old romance.', 'Rival house flippers, Jules Briggs and Lance Waddell, renovate dual sides of a duplex and rekindle an old romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g82ETVLuFCE8JwitEuQmP0jrMUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581310'),
  ('277112958850737769', 'Flipped', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Rob Reiner, Thomas Del Ruth, Brian Relyea', 'Andrew Scheinman, Rob Reiner', 'Madeline Carroll, Callan McAuliffe, Rebecca De Mornay, Anthony Edwards, John Mahoney, Penelope Ann Miller, Aidan Quinn, Kevin Weisman', 'PG', 'When Juli meets Bryce in the second grade, she knows it''s true love. After spending six years trying to convince Bryce the same, she''s ready to give up - until he starts to reconsider.', 'When Juli meets Bryce in the second grade, she knows it''s true love. After spending six years trying to convince Bryce the same, she''s ready to give up - until he starts to reconsider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zDYFigohwncqFL00MKbFV01dWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43949'),
  ('238493875662240781', 'Flipper', 1963, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'James B. Clark, Lamar Boren, Joseph C. Brun', 'Arthur Weiss', 'Chuck Connors, Luke Halpin, Connie Scott, Jane Rose, Joe Higgins, Robertson White, George Applewhite, Kathleen Maguire', null, 'Sandy is distraught when, having saved Flipper by pulling out a spear, his father insists the dolphin be released. A grateful Flipper, however, returns the favor when Sandy is threatened by sharks.', 'Sandy is distraught when, having saved Flipper by pulling out a spear, his father insists the dolphin be released. A grateful Flipper, however, returns the favor when Sandy is threatened by sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8tmePZ3082Na0QTqOgB5zZVb2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19893'),
  ('773434395933305077', 'Flipper', 1996, 'Adventure, Family', 'Alan Shapiro, Bill Butler', 'Alan Shapiro, Arthur Weiss', 'Elijah Wood, Paul Hogan, Jonathan Banks, Robert Deacon, Chelsea Field, Mary Jo Faraci, Allison Bertolino, Jessica Wesson', 'PG', 'Sandy Ricks is sent by his mom to Coral Key, a rustic island in the Florida keys, to spend the summer with his uncle Porter Ricks. Sandy dislikes everything about his new environment until a new friend comes into his life, a dolphin named Flipper, that brings uncle and nephew together and leads Sandy on the summer adventure of a lifetime.', 'Sandy Ricks is sent by his mom to Coral Key, a rustic island in the Florida keys, to spend the summer with his uncle Porter Ricks. Sandy dislikes everything about his new environment until a new friend comes into his life, a dolphin named Flipper, that brings uncle and nephew together and leads Sandy on the summer adventure of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEtFJvmAOteCsfq3MCB5EXeaC4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36355'),
  ('395039821540858115', 'Flipper''s New Adventure', 1964, 'Adventure, Family', 'Leon Benson, Lamar Boren', 'Art Arthur', 'Luke Halpin, Pamela Franklin, Tom Helmore, Helen Cherry, Francesca Annis, Brian Kelly, Robert Baldwin, Joe Higgins', null, 'While widowed Porter Ricks is away at school learning to be a park ranger, his teen-aged son, Sandy, under adult supervision from a neighbor, remains at the family home in the Florida Keys with his pet dolphin, Flipper. While Po (as Porter is called by most) is away, Sandy learns that the family home, built on state land, is being torn down to make way for a highway. In turn, Sandy would be sent to live with relatives, while Flipper would be sent to the seaquarium permanently. Not wanting to be separated from Flipper, Sandy, using his skiff, runs away with Flipper. A distraught Po returns home to look for his son. Meanwhile, the Hopewell family from Britain are vacationing in the area. Their sailboat is hijacked by three escaped convicts, who take the father, Halsey, hostage, and set the three Hopewell women - mother Julia, and teen-aged daughters Gwen and Penny - adrift, they who eventually land on the island where Sandy is hiding... Written by Huggo', 'While widowed Porter Ricks is away at school learning to be a park ranger, his teen-aged son, Sandy, under adult supervision from a neighbor, remains at the family home in the Florida Keys with his pet dolphin, Flipper. While Po (as Porter is called by most) is away, Sandy learns that the family home, built on state land, is being torn down to make way for a highway. In turn, Sandy would be sent to live with relatives, while Flipper would be sent to the seaquarium permanently. Not wanting to be separated from Flipper, Sandy, using his skiff, runs away with Flipper. A distraught Po returns home to look for his son. Meanwhile, the Hopewell family from Britain are vacationing in the area. Their sailboat is hijacked by three escaped convicts, who take the father, Halsey, hostage, and set the three Hopewell women - mother Julia, and teen-aged daughters Gwen and Penny - adrift, they who eventually land on the island where Sandy is hiding... Written by Huggo', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y5uKkHSsEWx2NA1IGKizfMCYqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79547'),
  ('284422275851622188', 'Flirt', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hal Hartley, Steve Apicella, Michael Spiller', 'Hal Hartley', 'Bill Sage, King Mustafa Obafemi, Miho Nikaido, Parker Posey, Martin Donovan, Karen Sillas, Michael Imperioli, Maria Schrader', null, 'The same situation is played out in different cities (New York, Berlin and Tokyo). A lover has to choose whether to commit to a partner who is returning home. In each case there are other people involved, an ex-partner and someone else in a "permanent" relationship, what do they choose to do?', 'The same situation is played out in different cities (New York, Berlin and Tokyo). A lover has to choose whether to commit to a partner who is returning home. In each case there are other people involved, an ex-partner and someone else in a "permanent" relationship, what do they choose to do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DGq5lReLwfrfaeidNeHpYtAZ9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46986'),
  ('67928555339474105', 'Flirtation Walk', 1934, 'Music, Romance', 'Frank Borzage, Sol Polito, William H. Cannon', 'Delmer Daves', 'Dick Powell, Ruby Keeler, Pat O''Brien, Ross Alexander, John Arledge, John Eldredge, Henry O''Neill, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams', 'NR', 'A private stationed in Hawaii gets involved with the general''s engaged daughter. In order to avoid a scandal, the pair break up, but meet again years later when he''s at West Point producing the annual play that turns out to star her.', 'A private stationed in Hawaii gets involved with the general''s engaged daughter. In order to avoid a scandal, the pair break up, but meet again years later when he''s at West Point producing the annual play that turns out to star her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WP0c2tSBW1urf3xKcELdptVuq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84100'),
  ('885445052721594371', 'Flirting', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Duigan, Geoff Burton, Emma Schofield', 'John Duigan', 'Noah Taylor, Thandiwe Newton, Nicole Kidman, Bartholomew Rose, Felix Nobis, Josh Picker, Kiri Paramore, Marc Aden Gray', 'R', 'Two freethinking teenagers - a boy and a girl - confront with authoritarian teachers in their boarding schools. The other students treat this differently.', 'Two freethinking teenagers - a boy and a girl - confront with authoritarian teachers in their boarding schools. The other students treat this differently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4WVST3uUSzxwKR5wlsiREVj50d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21828'),
  ('1098281826143625239', 'Flirting in the Air', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Aman Chang Man', 'Wong Jing', 'Chapman To Man-Chat, Dada Chan Ching, Connie Man, Jim Chim Sui-Man, Lam Tze-Chung, Dominic Ho Hou-Man, Bella Lo, Hazel Tong Chi-Yui', null, 'Airline pilots Cool, Sam and Guy were proud womanizers whom all took tremendous pleasure in making the rounds with every stewardess they came across. But one day during a seemingly routine flight, they encountered a violent magnetic storm that sent them falling through a wormhole. Upon landing, they assumed the storm had blown them off course onto a film set, but in reality, they had travelled back in time to Ming Dynasty, China.', 'Airline pilots Cool, Sam and Guy were proud womanizers whom all took tremendous pleasure in making the rounds with every stewardess they came across. But one day during a seemingly routine flight, they encountered a violent magnetic storm that sent them falling through a wormhole. Upon landing, they assumed the storm had blown them off course onto a film set, but in reality, they had travelled back in time to Ming Dynasty, China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2iSIwAlwq2jFcjWU0lPbYiBh3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291448'),
  ('830749356292728069', 'Flirting Scholar', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Lee Lik-Chi, Stephen Chow, David Chung', 'Lee Lik-Chi, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Chan Man-Keung', 'Stephen Chow, Gong Li, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Cheng Pei-Pei, Mimi Chu Mai-Mai, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, James Wong Jim', 'NR', 'A scholar in search of true love. Disguising himself as a houseboy, he indentures himself to a rich family in order to pursue the ravishing servant girl who has stolen his heart.', 'A scholar in search of true love. Disguising himself as a houseboy, he indentures himself to a rich family in order to pursue the ravishing servant girl who has stolen his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlTMQXCrwInbQd0qFapPoPVsnOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37703'),
  ('45348481012547182', 'Flirting with Disaster', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Eric Alan Edwards, David O. Russell', 'David O. Russell', 'Ben Stiller, Patricia Arquette, Téa Leoni, Mary Tyler Moore, George Segal, Alan Alda, Lily Tomlin, Richard Jenkins', 'R', 'Adopted as a child, new father Mel Colpin decides he cannot name his son until he knows his birth parents, and determines to make a cross-country quest to find them. Accompanied by his wife, Nancy, and an inept yet gorgeous adoption agent, Tina, he departs on an epic road trip that quickly devolves into a farce of mistaken identities, wrong turns, and overzealous and love-struck ATF agents.', 'Adopted as a child, new father Mel Colpin decides he cannot name his son until he knows his birth parents, and determines to make a cross-country quest to find them. Accompanied by his wife, Nancy, and an inept yet gorgeous adoption agent, Tina, he departs on an epic road trip that quickly devolves into a farce of mistaken identities, wrong turns, and overzealous and love-struck ATF agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfuYLKrOcSlzydbtwdHeAWddKO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2074'),
  ('37932158291311824', 'Flirting with Forty', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Mikael Salomon, Jon Joffin', null, 'Heather Locklear, Robert Buckley, Vanessa Williams, Cameron Bancroft, Sam Duke, Anne Hawthorne, Chelah Horsdal, Stefanie von Pfetten', 'PG', 'A divorcee has a passionate affair with a much younger surfing instructor in Hawaii.', 'A divorcee has a passionate affair with a much younger surfing instructor in Hawaii.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOyyB1as3g5qIzb2Fm6KV32XiCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20113'),
  ('663569844541288847', 'Flirty Birdy', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, 'NR', 'Tom is all set to eat Jerry when a hawk swoops down and grabs Jerry. To get Jerry back, Tom poses as a female hawk and quickly finds his new lover to be more than he bargained for.', 'Tom is all set to eat Jerry when a hawk swoops down and grabs Jerry. To get Jerry back, Tom poses as a female hawk and quickly finds his new lover to be more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUqma4sdcY8O1D2CCvbEvkMvUCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40470'),
  ('156059690175455424', 'Flo', 2023, 'History, Drama', 'Alain Olivieri, Sibylle Horvath, Géraldine Danon', 'Agnès de Sacy, Géraldine Danon, Yann Queffélec', 'Stéphane Caillard, Alexis Michalik, Alison Wheeler, Pierre Deladonchamps, Charles Berling, Marilyne Canto, Loup Lamazou, Samuel Jouy', null, 'World premiering on the Plage, it tells the story of « the little fiancée of the Atlantic », who’s career reached its peak with her victory of the Route du Rhum in 1990.', 'World premiering on the Plage, it tells the story of « the little fiancée of the Atlantic », who’s career reached its peak with her victory of the Route du Rhum in 1990.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qubYjXgPN4vbnONUNQLCMtVC8Vg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:966086'),
  ('240149996379486038', 'Float', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Bobby Rubio', 'Bobby Rubio', 'Eli Fucile, Bobby Rubio, Luna Watson', 'PG', 'A father discovers that his son floats, which makes him different from other kids. To keep them both safe from the judgement of the world, Dad hides, covers, and grounds him. But when his son''s ability becomes public, Dad must decide whether to run and hide or to accept his son as he is.', 'A father discovers that his son floats, which makes him different from other kids. To keep them both safe from the judgement of the world, Dad hides, covers, and grounds him. But when his son''s ability becomes public, Dad must decide whether to run and hide or to accept his son as he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgwObpU1NCXfPqF7ZaTpi80mxsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574093'),
  ('461479320231328071', 'Float', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sherren Lee, Trevor Zurkan, Jeremy Doiron', 'Sherren Lee, Jesse LaVercombe', 'Andrea Bang, Robbie Amell, Sarah Desjardins, Ghazal Azarbad, Michelle Krusiec, Andrew Bachelor, Rukiya Bernard, Fiona Fu', 'PG-13', 'Waverly thought she had her future figured out: she’d start her medical residency in Toronto after a summer visit to her parents in Taipei. When her plans suddenly change, she makes an impulsive detour to a small Canadian town where she meets local lifeguard Blake. After he saves her from nearly drowning at a beach party, Blake offers to teach Waverly to swim, and as the lessons continue, the two unexpectedly find themselves falling in love.', 'Waverly thought she had her future figured out: she’d start her medical residency in Toronto after a summer visit to her parents in Taipei. When her plans suddenly change, she makes an impulsive detour to a small Canadian town where she meets local lifeguard Blake. After he saves her from nearly drowning at a beach party, Blake offers to teach Waverly to swim, and as the lessons continue, the two unexpectedly find themselves falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkTggTHd2N85aNU0fbHMlORCwkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895959'),
  ('55084782398534259', 'Floating', 1997, 'Drama', 'William Roth, Wolfgang Held', 'William Roth', 'Norman Reedus, Chad Lowe, Will Lyman, Sybil Darrow, Casey Affleck, Jonathan Quint, Josh Marchette, Rachel Reposa', null, 'Already suffering fiscal and emotional bankruptcy after a car crash shatters his life, young Van finds himself in a vacuum when his buddies go off to college and he stays behind to look after his disabled, alcoholic father. Lacking an outlet for his rage, Van starts to run with two local punks and drifts into a life of crime. Then he meets Doug, who seems to have everything Van desires ... but Doug has demons of his own.', 'Already suffering fiscal and emotional bankruptcy after a car crash shatters his life, young Van finds himself in a vacuum when his buddies go off to college and he stays behind to look after his disabled, alcoholic father. Lacking an outlet for his rage, Van starts to run with two local punks and drifts into a life of crime. Then he meets Doug, who seems to have everything Van desires ... but Doug has demons of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRQ1M2CH0W1fxGBNeJtSqoD0IEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100568'),
  ('112277176039255844', 'Floating Clouds', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mikio Naruse, Masao Tamai, Kihachi Okamoto', 'Yōko Mizuki', 'Hideko Takamine, Masayuki Mori, Mariko Okada, Isao Yamagata, Chieko Nakakita, Daisuke Katō, Noriko Sengoku, Mayuri Mokushô', null, 'A married Japanese forester during WWII is sent to Indochina to manage forests. He meets a young Japanese typist and promises to leave his wife. He doesn''t and after the war, she turns up and the affair resumes.', 'A married Japanese forester during WWII is sent to Indochina to manage forests. He meets a young Japanese typist and promises to leave his wife. He doesn''t and after the war, she turns up and the affair resumes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nMSSTPvNG9vfyHqIXafWg6RHgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77285'),
  ('525238582419536576', 'Floating Skyscrapers', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tomasz Wasilewski, Jakub Kijowski', 'Tomasz Wasilewski', 'Mateusz Banasiuk, Marta Nieradkiewicz, Bartosz Gelner, Katarzyna Herman, Izabela Kuna, Olga Frycz, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Mariusz Drężek', null, 'Kuba attends an art opening with his girlfriend of two years and bumps into Mikal. The connection between these two young men is instantaneous and intoxicating, and despite opposition from all sides, he allows Mikal into his life. The results go beyond anything he could have imagined. This intimate and bold second feature from Polish director Tomasz Wasilewski captures the often-complicated consequences of finding love where others do not want it.', 'Kuba attends an art opening with his girlfriend of two years and bumps into Mikal. The connection between these two young men is instantaneous and intoxicating, and despite opposition from all sides, he allows Mikal into his life. The results go beyond anything he could have imagined. This intimate and bold second feature from Polish director Tomasz Wasilewski captures the often-complicated consequences of finding love where others do not want it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igRklNw4dMSooyJGW88DcaW3wTh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174372'),
  ('368657128240007680', 'Floating Weeds', 1959, 'Drama', 'Kazuo Miyagawa, Yasujirō Ozu, Bainari Nakamura', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Kōgo Noda, Tadao Ikeda', 'Ganjirō Nakamura II, Machiko Kyō, Ayako Wakao, Hiroshi Kawaguchi, Haruko Sugimura, Hitomi Nozoe, Chishū Ryū, Kōji Mitsui', null, 'When a theater troupe''s master visits his old flame, he unintentionally sets off a chain of unexpected events with devastating consequences.', 'When a theater troupe''s master visits his old flame, he unintentionally sets off a chain of unexpected events with devastating consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLepKtb48XSnPQNsuS4svbtNBY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46918'),
  ('231459460431382236', 'Floating!', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dominik Berg, Julia C. Kaiser', 'Julia C. Kaiser', 'Julia Becker, Anna König, Jakob Renger, Till Butterbach, Rhon Diels, Nina Bernards, Christian Natter, Sina Bianca Hentschel', null, 'A bride-to-be ends up on a rafting trip and meets a surprising guest: the sperm donor she''s planning to use. Back in Berlin, her fiancée is visited by an ex.', 'A bride-to-be ends up on a rafting trip and meets a surprising guest: the sperm donor she''s planning to use. Back in Berlin, her fiancée is visited by an ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1rUtg1Ot7xj9p5asRYCrVPP3ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322465'),
  ('766637976241792276', 'Flodder', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Dick Maas, Marc Felperlaan', null, 'Nelly Frijda, Huub Stapel, René van ''t Hof, Tatjana Simić, Horace Cohen, Lou Landré, Apollonia van Ravenstein, Herbert Flack', null, 'A low-class antisocial family ends up in a rich upper-class neighborhood and causes all sorts of trouble.', 'A low-class antisocial family ends up in a rich upper-class neighborhood and causes all sorts of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbQX4kpoyj3Xj3Km4fPmWO7edst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10570'),
  ('1063988339811289679', 'Flodder 3', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Dick Maas, Philip Hering', 'Wijo Koek, Dick Maas', 'Nelly Frijda, Coen van Vrijberghe de Coningh, Stefan de Walle, Tatjana Simić, Lou Landré, Sander Swart, Bert André, Edmond Classen', null, 'Back from their trip abroad, the family must meet the people of the neighborhood while preparing for the 25th anniversary of Zonnedael. Ma falls in love with a bum that is not exactly what he seems to be.', 'Back from their trip abroad, the family must meet the people of the neighborhood while preparing for the 25th anniversary of Zonnedael. Ma falls in love with a bum that is not exactly what he seems to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lygAXQ3vw8Le0jUslzGt91LluHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11084'),
  ('996026289292221788', 'Flodder Does Manhattan!', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Marc Felperlaan, Dick Maas, Lily van Rijs', 'Dick Maas', 'Huub Stapel, Nelly Frijda, Tatjana Simić, René van ''t Hof, Jon Polito, Lou Landré, Lonny Price, Dan Frazer', null, 'The mayor of Sunny Dale see a chance to get rid of the Flodder family: They send the asocial bunch for an international exchange to New York. There they get confused with a Russian delegation of medical doctors while the street worker Werner who accompanies them becomes imprisoned.', 'The mayor of Sunny Dale see a chance to get rid of the Flodder family: They send the asocial bunch for an international exchange to New York. There they get confused with a Russian delegation of medical doctors while the street worker Werner who accompanies them becomes imprisoned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgF2RyQTFl9lKyT0CJlZhzZfbNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10408'),
  ('657842028533890881', 'Flood', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Pierre Jodoin, Tony Mitchell, Thomas Brown', 'Matthew Cope, Justin Bodle, Nick Morley', 'Robert Carlyle, Jessalyn Gilsig, Tom Courtenay, Joanne Whalley, David Suchet, Martin Ball, Nigel Planer, Poppy Miller', null, 'Timely yet terrifying, The Flood predicts the unthinkable. When a raging storm coincides with high seas it unleashes a colossal tidal surge, which travels mercilessly down England''s East Coast and into the Thames Estuary. Overwhelming the Barrier, torrents of water pour into the city. The lives of millions of Londoners are at stake.', 'Timely yet terrifying, The Flood predicts the unthinkable. When a raging storm coincides with high seas it unleashes a colossal tidal surge, which travels mercilessly down England''s East Coast and into the Thames Estuary. Overwhelming the Barrier, torrents of water pour into the city. The lives of millions of Londoners are at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0F2iDMtj6uYQPqbjwCPlwug2O4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6309'),
  ('272643376383338959', 'Flood: A River''s Rampage', 1997, 'Drama', 'Bruce Pittman', null, 'Richard Thomas, Kate Vernon, Nigel Bennett, Mairon Bennett, Gabriel Hogan, Kristen Bone, Vince Corazza, Jan Rubeš', null, 'After heavy rain, the Mississippi is breaking it''s banks flooding small towns. Richard Thomas and Kate Vernon realise their town is next on the hit list. Lots and lots of sand bags might not do the trick but a huge explosion might. In the meantime the plot is filled up with a predictable story about a family dreading their mistake of staying behind when they become entrapped in their own home.', 'After heavy rain, the Mississippi is breaking it''s banks flooding small towns. Richard Thomas and Kate Vernon realise their town is next on the hit list. Lots and lots of sand bags might not do the trick but a huge explosion might. In the meantime the plot is filled up with a predictable story about a family dreading their mistake of staying behind when they become entrapped in their own home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8EjNRtjFxcAWsl2DX2IVqVNO7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70117'),
  ('670035163885116254', 'Flood!', 1977, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Earl Bellamy, Lamar Boren, Daniel McCauley', 'Don Ingalls', 'Robert Culp, Martin Milner, Barbara Hershey, Richard Basehart, Carol Lynley, Roddy McDowall, Cameron Mitchell, Eric Olson', 'NR', 'Two helicopter pilots rush aid to a small town devastated by a flood following the collapse of an aging dam.', 'Two helicopter pilots rush aid to a small town devastated by a flood following the collapse of an aging dam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aNYOZ2vgltxEvJtDEZ0hzemLZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160035'),
  ('480440907633716049', 'Floodland', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Jordan Giusti, Bonita Carzino', 'Jordan Giusti', 'Carlie Atkinson, Judy Atkinson, Harper Dalton, Isabel Dickson', null, 'In flood-prone Lismore, Australia, residents face life-changing decisions after devastating floods. A man copes pragmatically, his friend turns activist, and an Indigenous social worker builds a healing center.', 'In flood-prone Lismore, Australia, residents face life-changing decisions after devastating floods. A man copes pragmatically, his friend turns activist, and an Indigenous social worker builds a healing center.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7JYMJDaO97wt8bgm4OorUX2YLcN.jpg', 'plex:movie:floodland-2026'),
  ('644243046821702533', 'Flora', 1989, 'Horror, Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'The last moments of a creature made of fruits and vegetables.', 'The last moments of a creature made of fruits and vegetables.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgHbHHaclA8YfPvQBi6wRb8q1EY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109707'),
  ('929491867624479839', 'Flora & Ulysses', 2021, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Lena Khan, Andrew Dunn, Emily Schweber', 'Brad Copeland', 'Matilda Lawler, Alyson Hannigan, Ben Schwartz, Benjamin Evan Ainsworth, Danny Pudi, Darien Martin, Anna Deavere Smith, Bobby Moynihan', 'PG', 'When Flora rescues a squirrel she names Ulysses, she is amazed to discover he possesses unique superhero powers, which take them on an adventure of humorous complications that ultimately change Flora''s life--and her outlook--forever.', 'When Flora rescues a squirrel she names Ulysses, she is amazed to discover he possesses unique superhero powers, which take them on an adventure of humorous complications that ultimately change Flora''s life--and her outlook--forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syobJCxZcIJl0OpjNroZSQKa1kW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621876'),
  ('1088210325574607393', 'Flora and Son', 2023, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'John Carney, John Conroy, Andrew Hegarty', 'John Carney', 'Eve Hewson, Orén Kinlan, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Jack Reynor, Marcella Plunkett, Paul Reid, Don Wycherley, Amy Huberman', 'R', 'Single mom Flora is at a loss about what to do with her rebellious teenage son, Max. Her efforts to keep him out of trouble lead to a beat-up acoustic guitar, a washed-up LA musician, and harmony for this frayed Dublin family.', 'Single mom Flora is at a loss about what to do with her rebellious teenage son, Max. Her efforts to keep him out of trouble lead to a beat-up acoustic guitar, a washed-up LA musician, and harmony for this frayed Dublin family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pq2p8ovf8PZps2HafvJaLrZK8gS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059811'),
  ('819833500585139430', 'Florbela', 2012, 'History, Drama', 'Vicente Alves do Ó, Luís Branquinho, Cesário Monteiro', 'Vicente Alves do Ó', 'Dalila Carmo, Albano Jerónimo, Ivo Canelas, Soraia Chaves, Maria João Abreu, Maya Booth, Rute Miranda, Rita Loureiro', null, 'Shaken by a divorce in the 1920s, Portuguese poetess Florbela Espanca uses her writing to deal with her tumultuous relationship with men, eroticism and love.', 'Shaken by a divorce in the 1920s, Portuguese poetess Florbela Espanca uses her writing to deal with her tumultuous relationship with men, eroticism and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuqEcysi4WgheFPtNS1EMoWhMms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89448'),
  ('401323198717034932', 'Florence and the Uffizi Gallery', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Luca Viotto', null, null, null, 'Follows a trail of over 10 museums and 150 artworks amongst the most well-known in the world. It is an artistic foray into Florence taking in everything from the Brancacci Chapel to the Bargello National Museum, from Palazzo Medici, to the narrow city streets and Brunelleschi’s Dome, from Palazzo Vecchio to the Uffizi Gallery and the Accademia Gallery, without neglecting picture postcard places such as the Ponte Vecchio and Piazza della Signoria.', 'Follows a trail of over 10 museums and 150 artworks amongst the most well-known in the world. It is an artistic foray into Florence taking in everything from the Brancacci Chapel to the Bargello National Museum, from Palazzo Medici, to the narrow city streets and Brunelleschi’s Dome, from Palazzo Vecchio to the Uffizi Gallery and the Accademia Gallery, without neglecting picture postcard places such as the Ponte Vecchio and Piazza della Signoria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIBE4QztG2dHduxNu8x35dfChtS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378089'),
  ('1065671663770970583', 'Florence Fight Club', 2010, 'Action, Documentary, Adventure', 'Rovero Impiglia, Luigi Maria Perotti', 'Rovero Impiglia, Luigi Maria Perotti', null, null, 'Four men decided to enter in the oldest Fight Club of the History, The Florentine Football tournament. A father and son, a black guy, an old champion and outsider clerk will enter in an arena of the time to win their fears, to go over their limits, to be heroes for a day.', 'Four men decided to enter in the oldest Fight Club of the History, The Florentine Football tournament. A father and son, a black guy, an old champion and outsider clerk will enter in an arena of the time to win their fears, to go over their limits, to be heroes for a day.', null, 'tmdb:movie:104782'),
  ('628545381464382807', 'Florence Foresti : Boys Boys Boys', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Stéphane Bohée, Florence Foresti, Romain Belloche', 'Florence Foresti, Pascal Serieis', 'Florence Foresti', null, '25 years after the beginning of her career, Florence Foresti speaks frankly about seduction, in a funny and striking tone. This is an opportunity for the comedian to take stock of the state of male-female relations five years after #MeToo.', '25 years after the beginning of her career, Florence Foresti speaks frankly about seduction, in a funny and striking tone. This is an opportunity for the comedian to take stock of the state of male-female relations five years after #MeToo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGzv7gRpxz1gC7zkx6MZ6InFJTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265725'),
  ('985468767864621979', 'Florence Foresti : Epilogue', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Xavier Maingon', 'Florence Foresti', 'Florence Foresti', null, 'After three years of absence, Florence Foresti goes back on stage. She jubilantly tackles everyday absurdities, old age, disillusionment, death and relationships between men and women.', 'After three years of absence, Florence Foresti goes back on stage. She jubilantly tackles everyday absurdities, old age, disillusionment, death and relationships between men and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfXfGuDhmHy88AS9cAuTZ1uBwE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656612'),
  ('96660586060341548', 'Florence Foster Jenkins', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen Frears, Danny Cohen, Patrick Rolfe', 'Stephen Frears', 'Meryl Streep, Hugh Grant, Simon Helberg, Rebecca Ferguson, Nina Arianda, Stanley Townsend, Allan Corduner, Christian McKay', 'PG-13', 'The story of Florence Foster Jenkins, a New York heiress, who dreamed of becoming an opera singer, despite having a terrible singing voice.', 'The story of Florence Foster Jenkins, a New York heiress, who dreamed of becoming an opera singer, despite having a terrible singing voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4cV732zTZ5pwtLh1OXQZ4LIgcu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315664'),
  ('240583669279845842', 'Florence Nightingale', 1985, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Daryl Duke, Jack Hildyard', null, 'Jaclyn Smith, Claire Bloom, Timothy Dalton, Timothy West, Peter McEnery, Stephan Chase, Jeremy Brett, Jeremy Child', null, 'This is the fact-based story of an aristocratic woman who defies Victorian society to reform hospital sanitation and to define the nursing profession as it is known today. After volunteering to travel to Scutari to care for the wounded soldiers, who are victims of the Crimean war, she finds herself very unwelcome and faces great opposition for her new way of thinking. However through her selfless acts of caring, she quickly becomes known as ''The Lady with the Lamp'', the caring nurse whose shadow soldiers kiss.', 'This is the fact-based story of an aristocratic woman who defies Victorian society to reform hospital sanitation and to define the nursing profession as it is known today. After volunteering to travel to Scutari to care for the wounded soldiers, who are victims of the Crimean war, she finds herself very unwelcome and faces great opposition for her new way of thinking. However through her selfless acts of caring, she quickly becomes known as ''The Lady with the Lamp'', the caring nurse whose shadow soldiers kiss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMtRgkmHqEyfSz72c3NwuqBHJLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49349'),
  ('243136492293200089', 'Flores', 2017, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jorge Jácome, Marta Simões', 'David Cabecinha, Jorge Jácome', 'André Andrade, Gabriel Desplanque, Jorge Jácome, Pedro Rosa', null, 'In a natural crisis scenario, the entire population of Azores is forced to evict due to an uncontrolled plague of hydrangeas, a common flower in these islands. Two young soldiers, bound to the beauty of the landscape, guide us to the stories of sadness of those forced to leave and the inherent desire to resist by inhabiting the islands. The filmic wandering becomes a nostalgic and political reflection on territorial belonging and identity, and the roles we assume in the places we came from.', 'In a natural crisis scenario, the entire population of Azores is forced to evict due to an uncontrolled plague of hydrangeas, a common flower in these islands. Two young soldiers, bound to the beauty of the landscape, guide us to the stories of sadness of those forced to leave and the inherent desire to resist by inhabiting the islands. The filmic wandering becomes a nostalgic and political reflection on territorial belonging and identity, and the roles we assume in the places we came from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kLzw4Lg67UX94DhEOTiBVQtuYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457985'),
  ('806518994081800073', 'Flores para Antonio', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Isaki Lacuesta, Elena Molina, Juana Jiménez', 'Isaki Lacuesta, Elena Molina', 'Alba Flores, Ana Villa, Lolita Flores, Rosario Flores', null, 'A daughter sets out to find out the truth about the man who was her father, a legendary musician, who died when she was 8 years old. He is Antonio Flores, and she the also famous actress Alba Flores. Alba stopped singing when she lost Antonio and is now determined to recover her voice and her background, asking family members and friends for the first time.', 'A daughter sets out to find out the truth about the man who was her father, a legendary musician, who died when she was 8 years old. He is Antonio Flores, and she the also famous actress Alba Flores. Alba stopped singing when she lost Antonio and is now determined to recover her voice and her background, asking family members and friends for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTSwtWH1mD0kjodSh7S7yNwcTUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1357349'),
  ('348235424492765522', 'Florianópolis Dream', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ana Katz, Gustavo Biazzi', 'Ana Katz, Daniel Katz', 'Mercedes Morán, Gustavo Garzón, Andréa Beltrão, Marco Ricca, Manuela Martínez, Joaquín Garzón, Caio Horowicz, Wmarcão', null, 'A recently separated Argentinian man and woman, with their two teenage children, go on a family holiday to Florianópolis, Brazil, where they become delightfully and problematically involved with the family from whom they rent a house.', 'A recently separated Argentinian man and woman, with their two teenage children, go on a family holiday to Florianópolis, Brazil, where they become delightfully and problematically involved with the family from whom they rent a house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSx2rLWoGGap6bEMItrvy9AeYqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534366'),
  ('190798598486709255', 'Florida', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Philippe Le Guay', null, 'Jean Rochefort, Sandrine Kiberlain, Anamaria Marinca, Laurent Lucas, Clément Métayer, Coline Beal, Édith Le Merdy, Christèle Tual', null, 'Although he''s now eighty years old, Claude Lherminier is still as imposing as he ever was. But his bouts of forgetfulness and confusion are becoming increasingly frequent. Even so, he stubbornly refuses to admit that anything is wrong. Carole, his oldest daughter, wages a daily and taxing battle to ensure that he''s not left on his own. Claude suddenly decides on a whim to go to Florida. What lies behind this sudden trip?', 'Although he''s now eighty years old, Claude Lherminier is still as imposing as he ever was. But his bouts of forgetfulness and confusion are becoming increasingly frequent. Even so, he stubbornly refuses to admit that anything is wrong. Carole, his oldest daughter, wages a daily and taxing battle to ensure that he''s not left on his own. Claude suddenly decides on a whim to go to Florida. What lies behind this sudden trip?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9i91hzKVphqDPFUc8roQWygP5pZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340361'),
  ('2035049811555938', 'Florida Straits', 1986, 'Action, Adventure, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mike Hodges, Dennis C. Lewiston', 'Roderick Taylor', 'Raúl Juliá, Fred Ward, Daniel H. Jenkins, Jaime Sánchez, Victor Argo, Ilka Tanya Payán, Antonio Fargas, Jesse Corti', 'PG-13', 'A man who spent 20 years in Cuban prison after the failure of the Bay of Pigs invasion and a boat captain and his crew go covertly to Cuba to find a cache of gold buried during the invasion. But can they trust each other?', 'A man who spent 20 years in Cuban prison after the failure of the Bay of Pigs invasion and a boat captain and his crew go covertly to Cuba to find a cache of gold buried during the invasion. But can they trust each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHNLfj3NJ0NjQ2a6EpQz2PAK6Qq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78489'),
  ('405579839509819702', 'Floundering', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter McCarthy, Angie Brown, Jeanne McCarthy', 'Peter McCarthy', 'James Le Gros, Shaka, Zander Schloss, John Cusack, Nina Siemaszko, Jeremy Piven, Dolores DeLuce, Eddie Baytos', 'R', 'John Boyz lives close to where they film "Baywatch", but you''d never know it. His life is full of bizarre friends, sweaty sex, pistol wielding gangsters, bungling bureaucrats, police fanatics, revolutionaries, and weirdos. All John wants is a little peace of mind and a little piece of the action, but in "Floundering" it wont come easy.', 'John Boyz lives close to where they film "Baywatch", but you''d never know it. His life is full of bizarre friends, sweaty sex, pistol wielding gangsters, bungling bureaucrats, police fanatics, revolutionaries, and weirdos. All John wants is a little peace of mind and a little piece of the action, but in "Floundering" it wont come easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTW4JE8SOn5x50bhzYd47SOhWtQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41578'),
  ('300889302075442029', 'Flow', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, Horror, Crime', 'Quentin Lee', 'Quentin Lee', 'Tedd Szeto, Lela Lee, Ray Chang, Paulino Tamayo', null, 'A filmmaker talks about his work and love life with an unseen friend behind the camera. We also watch four of his short films.', 'A filmmaker talks about his work and love life with an unseen friend behind the camera. We also watch four of his short films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqUwD865PnyxEKXVdHrHEL6bRIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262610'),
  ('1135929355808937706', 'FLOW', 2024, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, 'As the ‘flow’ progresses, the world where our ‘giant’ once stood gradually fades away, replaced by their inner worlds. Our ‘giant’ continues to advance endlessly, questioning the relationship between the world and oneself.', 'As the ‘flow’ progresses, the world where our ‘giant’ once stood gradually fades away, replaced by their inner worlds. Our ‘giant’ continues to advance endlessly, questioning the relationship between the world and oneself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggFrFg3l2FPOIkwgsXZDzEQ5nrg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1281775'),
  ('95386101613940214', 'Flower', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Max Winkler, Bryan Goeres, Jason Suhrke', 'Max Winkler, Matt Spicer, Alex McAulay', 'Zoey Deutch, Kathryn Hahn, Tim Heidecker, Adam Scott, Joey Morgan, Dylan Gelula, Maya Eshet, Eric Edelstein', 'R', 'Rebellious, quick-witted Erica Vandross is a 17-year-old firecracker living with her single mom, Laurie, and her mom''s new boyfriend, Bob, in L.A.''s San Fernando Valley. When Bob''s mentally unbalanced son, Luke, arrives from rehab to live with the family, Erica finds her domestic and personal life overwhelmed. With Luke and her sidekicks Kala and Claudine in tow, Erica acts out by exposing a high school teacher''s dark secret.', 'Rebellious, quick-witted Erica Vandross is a 17-year-old firecracker living with her single mom, Laurie, and her mom''s new boyfriend, Bob, in L.A.''s San Fernando Valley. When Bob''s mentally unbalanced son, Luke, arrives from rehab to live with the family, Erica finds her domestic and personal life overwhelmed. With Luke and her sidekicks Kala and Claudine in tow, Erica acts out by exposing a high school teacher''s dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYTI11qFnmx39LRhDOsGEabfqtp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421471'),
  ('39590160968103848', 'Flower & Snake', 1974, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Masaru Konuma, Seisaku Kimura, Shōhei Andō', 'Yōzō Tanaka', 'Naomi Tani, Nagatoshi Sakamoto, Kiyoshi Abe, Willie Dorsey, Hiroko Fuji, Yasuhiko Ishizu, Hiroyuki Mikawa, Toshihiko Oda', null, 'Shizuka is the aristocratic wife of the president of a large company. When she wants to divorce her domineering husband, he orders his employee Yoshi, the son of an adult toy store owner, to train his wife to become sexually submissive.', 'Shizuka is the aristocratic wife of the president of a large company. When she wants to divorce her domineering husband, he orders his employee Yoshi, the son of an adult toy store owner, to train his wife to become sexually submissive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3vMxxuEBylPe3uWAo87qvlcry6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49573'),
