  ('862681618301714859', 'Flowers and Trees', 1932, 'Animation, Music, Romance, Comedy, Thriller', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Clarence Nash, Esther Campbell, Marion Darlington, Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney', 'NR', 'A jealous stump threatens two trees that are in love by starting a forest fire. When the rain comes and puts out the fire the forest revives and celebrates the wedding.', 'A jealous stump threatens two trees that are in love by starting a forest fire. When the rain comes and puts out the fire the forest revives and celebrates the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qV8IuQll3DxZWYtCpj8HtwwGiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106112'),
  ('982306636699546039', 'Flowers for Algernon', 2000, 'Drama', 'Jeff Bleckner, Mike Fash, David McLennan', null, 'Matthew Modine, Kelli Williams, Ron Rifkin, Bonnie Bedelia, Gloria Slade, Cliff Saunders, Kathryn Kirkpatrick, David McFarlane', 'NR', 'Charlie Gordon is mentally handicapped and all he wants in life is to be a genius. When he gets picked for experimental surgery it looks like his dream may finally come true. But the surgery has side effects that could could kill Charlie. Can Charlie survive being just plain old "Charlie Gordon" and will his newfound romance survive this test of character?', 'Charlie Gordon is mentally handicapped and all he wants in life is to be a genius. When he gets picked for experimental surgery it looks like his dream may finally come true. But the surgery has side effects that could could kill Charlie. Can Charlie survive being just plain old "Charlie Gordon" and will his newfound romance survive this test of character?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20dVWa6Ujpsx6nQxaSp0cEhX3Tu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29136'),
  ('44188339673281071', 'Flowers From Another World', 1999, 'Drama', 'Icíar Bollaín, Teo Delgado', 'Icíar Bollaín, Julio Llamazares', 'José Sancho, Luis Tosar, Lissete Mejía, Chete Lera, Marilyn Torres, Elena Irureta, Amparo Valle, Rubén Ochandiano', null, 'Patricia, a woman from Dominican Republic, needs a home and an economic security that her illegal status in Madrid does not provide her. Milady, twenty, born in Havana and dying to travel the world. Marirosi has a job, a home, and the most complete solitude... just like Alfonso, Damián and Carmelo, men from the St. Eulalia, a village lacking both marrying women and future. A bachelors'' party forces the encounter between them and the beginning of this bittersweet story of sharing a living.', 'Patricia, a woman from Dominican Republic, needs a home and an economic security that her illegal status in Madrid does not provide her. Milady, twenty, born in Havana and dying to travel the world. Marirosi has a job, a home, and the most complete solitude... just like Alfonso, Damián and Carmelo, men from the St. Eulalia, a village lacking both marrying women and future. A bachelors'' party forces the encounter between them and the beginning of this bittersweet story of sharing a living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnC6e1aef2JDMZxhuCjjudoXUxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54976'),
  ('667621981538306940', 'Flowers in the Attic', 1987, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Jeffrey Bloom, Gil Hubbs, Frank Byers', 'Jeffrey Bloom', 'Louise Fletcher, Victoria Tennant, Kristy Swanson, Jeb Stuart Adams, Ben Ryan Ganger, Lindsay Parker, Nathan Davis, Gus Peters', 'R', 'After the death of her husband, a mother takes her kids off to live with their grandparents in a huge, decrepit old mansion. However, the kids are kept hidden in a room just below the attic, visited only by their mother who becomes less and less concerned about them and their failing health, and more concerned about herself and the inheritence she plans to win back from her dying father.', 'After the death of her husband, a mother takes her kids off to live with their grandparents in a huge, decrepit old mansion. However, the kids are kept hidden in a room just below the attic, visited only by their mother who becomes less and less concerned about them and their failing health, and more concerned about herself and the inheritence she plans to win back from her dying father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upcJxm5AquYh9lTPaJEQ6tgoVbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15658'),
  ('836397491227484230', 'Flowers in the Attic', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Patrick Weir, Troy Scott, Mirosław Baszak', null, 'Heather Graham, Kiernan Shipka, Mason Dye, Ava Telek, Maxwell Kovach, Dylan Bruce, Chad Willett, Ellen Burstyn', 'NR', 'After the sudden death of their father, four children face cruel treatment from their ruthless grandmother.', 'After the sudden death of their father, four children face cruel treatment from their ruthless grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owzDkkxL2DogC2mq1fgIvrlDcux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236399'),
  ('449902280758012090', 'Flowers in the Mirror, Wind and Moon: The Ghost Returns', 1987, 'Horror', 'Hsin Yen', null, 'Jiang Lingling, Kao Wen-Song, Chu Hui-Te, Ai Ting, Ye Ling, Chia-bao Lan', null, 'Horror movie from Taiwan.', 'Horror movie from Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HQ4WtrmgyyWSp8VpQWc1VWSZdG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1074139'),
  ('259714198732294840', 'Flowers of Shanghai', 1998, 'Drama', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Chu Tien-Wen', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Michiko Hada, Carina Lau, Michele Reis, Jack Kao, Rebecca Pan, Stephanie Fong Shuan, Annie Shizuka Inoh', 'NR', 'At the end of the 19th century, Shanghai is divided into several foreign concessions. In the British concession, a number of luxurious “flower houses” are reserved for the male elite of the city. Since Chinese dignitaries are not allowed to frequent brothels, these establishments are the only ones that these men can visit. They form a self-contained world, with its own rites, traditions and even its own language. The men don’t only visit the houses to frequent the courtesans but also to dine, smoke opium, play mahjong and relax. The women working there are known as the “flowers of Shanghai”.', 'At the end of the 19th century, Shanghai is divided into several foreign concessions. In the British concession, a number of luxurious “flower houses” are reserved for the male elite of the city. Since Chinese dignitaries are not allowed to frequent brothels, these establishments are the only ones that these men can visit. They form a self-contained world, with its own rites, traditions and even its own language. The men don’t only visit the houses to frequent the courtesans but also to dine, smoke opium, play mahjong and relax. The women working there are known as the “flowers of Shanghai”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9N3TdNbr5pyT69M5cHODmfc4zTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45935'),
  ('39610712991143723', 'Flowers of Taipei: Taiwan New Cinema', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Hsieh Chin-Lin', null, 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Apichatpong Weerasethakul, Olivier Assayas, Hirokazu Kore-eda, Ai Weiwei, Jia Zhangke, Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Shu Kei', null, 'With Taiwan remaining in the grip of martial law in 1982, a group of filmmakers from that country set out to establish a cultural identity through cinema and to share it with the world. This engaging documentary looks at the movement''s legacy.', 'With Taiwan remaining in the grip of martial law in 1982, a group of filmmakers from that country set out to establish a cultural identity through cinema and to share it with the world. This engaging documentary looks at the movement''s legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6TV6SfMs3HGSGftvkel8GIqDXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310799'),
  ('481683578615428150', 'Flowing', 1956, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masayoshi Kawanishi, Masao Tamai', 'Sumie Tanaka', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Isuzu Yamada, Hideko Takamine, Mariko Okada, Haruko Sugimura, Sumiko Kurishima, Chieko Nakakita, Natsuko Kahara', null, 'Otsuta is running the geisha house Tsuta in Tokyo. Her business is heavily in debt. Her daughter Katsuyo doesn''t see any future in her mother''s trade in the late days of Geisha. But Otsuta will not give up. This film portraits the day time life of geisha when not entertaining customers.', 'Otsuta is running the geisha house Tsuta in Tokyo. Her business is heavily in debt. Her daughter Katsuyo doesn''t see any future in her mother''s trade in the late days of Geisha. But Otsuta will not give up. This film portraits the day time life of geisha when not entertaining customers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgf4Jmc8IqJydUO3p6IaDr7WYPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46493'),
  ('540376976266734437', 'Flowing', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Cristiano Di Nicola, Paolo Strippoli', 'Gustavo Hernández, Paolo Strippoli, Jacopo del Giudice', 'Fabrizio Rongione, Cristiana Dell''Anna, Francesco Gheghi, Aurora Menenti, Leon de La Vallée, Nicolò Galasso, Ondina Quadri, Elena Di Cioccio', null, 'In the past few days Rome has been the scene of a singular event: when it rains, the manholes exhale a dense steam whose origin and composition is unknown. No one can imagine that whoever breathes in the mysterious substance will have to deal with what he/she represses, their darkest instincts, their anger. Not even the Morel family.', 'In the past few days Rome has been the scene of a singular event: when it rains, the manholes exhale a dense steam whose origin and composition is unknown. No one can imagine that whoever breathes in the mysterious substance will have to deal with what he/she represses, their darkest instincts, their anger. Not even the Morel family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebXBf5FTdk8Hr86coAVDEVeSh8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848483'),
  ('322015643489258266', 'Flu Bird Horror', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Leigh Scott, Ovidiu Morariu, Maria Nita', 'Brian D. Smith, Tony Daniel', 'Clare Carey, Lance Guest, Sarah Butler, Jonathon Trent, Rebekah Kochan, Bill Posley, Brent Lydic, Gabriel Costin', 'R', 'A group of teenagers go on a excursion to the mountains. There, they are attacked by birds infected with a lethal virus. When the teens reach a nearby village, the haunting birds start passing their virus on to all the dwellers.', 'A group of teenagers go on a excursion to the mountains. There, they are attacked by birds infected with a lethal virus. When the teens reach a nearby village, the haunting birds start passing their virus on to all the dwellers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtkmyFE3U9ThIU1vmUDGQSK8o12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39368'),
  ('839884986516897491', 'Flubber', 1997, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Les Mayfield, Dean Cundey, Matthew H. Rowland', 'John Hughes, Bill Walsh', 'Robin Williams, Marcia Gay Harden, Christopher McDonald, Raymond J. Barry, Clancy Brown, Nancy Olson, Ted Levine, Wil Wheaton', 'PG', 'Professor Phillip Brainard, an absent minded professor, works with his assistant Weebo, trying to create a substance that''s a new source of energy and that will save Medfield College where his sweetheart Sara is the president. He has missed his wedding twice, and on the afternoon of his third wedding, Professor Brainard creates flubber, which allows objects to fly through the air.', 'Professor Phillip Brainard, an absent minded professor, works with his assistant Weebo, trying to create a substance that''s a new source of energy and that will save Medfield College where his sweetheart Sara is the president. He has missed his wedding twice, and on the afternoon of his third wedding, Professor Brainard creates flubber, which allows objects to fly through the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnKvk04icAyCO1KjqhsaEXBO9aJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9574'),
