  ('171518248268981033', 'Fluke', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Maciej Dutkiewicz, Andrzej J. Jaroszewicz', 'Maciej Dutkiewicz, Robert Brutter', 'Agnieszka Krukówna, Maciej Stuhr, Janusz Gajos, Adam Ferency, Stanisława Celińska, Tomasz Dedek, Gabriela Kownacka, Krzysztof Stelmaszyk', null, 'Two broken, police, destruction of property by arson with an explosive charge, stealing a car. Not bad for one night! Such is the balance of Alex''s eighteenth birthday - the main hero of the film.', 'Two broken, police, destruction of property by arson with an explosive charge, stealing a car. Not bad for one night! Such is the balance of Alex''s eighteenth birthday - the main hero of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27BgoeVtjVvbjeRGxqzANq7Xv7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36387'),
