  ('687796118117462706', 'Fly', 1970, null, 'John Lennon, Yoko Ono', 'John Lennon, Yoko Ono', 'Virginia Lust', null, 'The camera follows a fly as it walks about the body of a nude woman. Shot in extreme closeup and accompanied by Ono''s eponymous song, the film sets out to celebrate the human body.', 'The camera follows a fly as it walks about the body of a nude woman. Shot in extreme closeup and accompanied by Ono''s eponymous song, the film sets out to celebrate the human body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xbr7o1LO7ZCCBrxH3KGiH0AvXL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150996'),
  ('1039226011844845425', 'Fly', 2021, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Torsten Breuer, Bernhard Jasper, Katja von Garnier', 'Daphne Ferraro', 'Svenja Jung, Benjamin Wichert, Jasmin Tabatabai, Nicolette Krebitz, Katja Riemann, Aleksandar Jovanović, Nadine Schori, Andreas Pietschmann', null, 'Bex has caused a serious accident and is therefore in prison. In order to rehabilitate the inmates, the prison offers them a dance class led by Ava. But Bex doesn''t want to take part. However, she has no other choice and soon she feels drawn to Jay in particular and they realize that they have much more in common than this dance class. The cohesion within the prisoners of rehabilitation grows, but when Bex''s past catches up with them again, everything is in danger.', 'Bex has caused a serious accident and is therefore in prison. In order to rehabilitate the inmates, the prison offers them a dance class led by Ava. But Bex doesn''t want to take part. However, she has no other choice and soon she feels drawn to Jay in particular and they realize that they have much more in common than this dance class. The cohesion within the prisoners of rehabilitation grows, but when Bex''s past catches up with them again, everything is in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXQ4dJDl32ELytbmnz0V8sa7rQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842424'),
  ('637219097962781133', 'Fly Away Home', 1996, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Caleb Deschanel, Carroll Ballard', 'Robert Rodat, Vince McKewin', 'Jeff Daniels, Anna Paquin, Dana Delany, Terry Kinney, Holter Graham, Jeremy Ratchford, Deborah Verginella, Michael J. Reynolds', 'PG', 'Amy is only 13 years old when her mother is killed. She goes to Canada to live with her father, an eccentric inventor whom she barely knows. Amy is miserable in her new life... until she discovers a nest of goose eggs that were abandoned when a local forest was torn down. The eggs hatch and Amy becomes "Mama Goose". When winter comes, Amy and her dad must find a way to lead the birds South.', 'Amy is only 13 years old when her mother is killed. She goes to Canada to live with her father, an eccentric inventor whom she barely knows. Amy is miserable in her new life... until she discovers a nest of goose eggs that were abandoned when a local forest was torn down. The eggs hatch and Amy becomes "Mama Goose". When winter comes, Amy and her dad must find a way to lead the birds South.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obcQJkZB2OsRxd5GWIcQ5Qjv4YW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11076'),
  ('224780201218529512', 'Fly Me Away', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christophe Barratier', 'Christophe Barratier, Matthieu Delaporte, Alexandre de La Patellière', 'Victor Belmondo, Gérard Lanvin, Yoann Eloundou Noah, Ornella Fleury, Marie-Sohna Condé, Lili Aupetit, Daphné De Quatrebarbes, François Bureloup', null, 'Thomas, a blasé young man, spends his nights in clubs and his days in bed. Until his father, Dr. Reinhard, fed up with his son’s escapades, cuts him off completely and forces him to take care of one of his young patients. Mar- cus, 12, was born with a serious congenital disorder. He lives with his mother in the poor suburbs of Paris and spends his days either at the hospital or in a center for sick children. This encounter will disrupt their lives and change them both, profoundly and forever.', 'Thomas, a blasé young man, spends his nights in clubs and his days in bed. Until his father, Dr. Reinhard, fed up with his son’s escapades, cuts him off completely and forces him to take care of one of his young patients. Mar- cus, 12, was born with a serious congenital disorder. He lives with his mother in the poor suburbs of Paris and spends his days either at the hospital or in a center for sick children. This encounter will disrupt their lives and change them both, profoundly and forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5brVH61okbGfeQntpvMu3Vgha2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783558'),
  ('886473210834798684', 'Fly Me to Polaris', 1999, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Lo Chi-Leung, Yeung Sin-Ling', 'Richie Jen, Cecilia Cheung, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, William So Wing-Hong, Sheren Tang Shui-Man, Eric Kot Man-Fai, Sandy Lam San-San, Isabel Chan Yat-Ning', null, 'A young man, blind and dumb, works as an audio tape typist in a hospital and fostering a tender and sincere relationship with a beautiful but introverted nurse. When hit by a car, he is the sixty billionth human being to die on earth, and is on transit to Polaris, en route to a yet more sophisticated form of existence in Vega. Given a reprieve of five days and a chance to be reunited with his love on earth, he cannot reveal his true identity behind the temporary facade he must present to her. Both boy and girl eventually learn, through a tangle of difficult and miraculous events, how love and good things always find ways of creeping into people''s lives when people are not greedy and least expect these blessings.', 'A young man, blind and dumb, works as an audio tape typist in a hospital and fostering a tender and sincere relationship with a beautiful but introverted nurse. When hit by a car, he is the sixty billionth human being to die on earth, and is on transit to Polaris, en route to a yet more sophisticated form of existence in Vega. Given a reprieve of five days and a chance to be reunited with his love on earth, he cannot reveal his true identity behind the temporary facade he must present to her. Both boy and girl eventually learn, through a tangle of difficult and miraculous events, how love and good things always find ways of creeping into people''s lives when people are not greedy and least expect these blessings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKDX5jWXyTPyFDaEAcyjakxOrpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45464'),
  ('175451970653001125', 'Fly Me to the Moon', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Ben Stassen', 'Domonic Paris', 'Tim Curry, Robert Patrick, Kelly Ripa, Trevor Gagnon, Philip Bolden, Nicollette Sheridan, Ed Begley Jr., David Gore', 'G', 'Three young houseflies stow away aboard the Apollo 11 flight to the moon.', 'Three young houseflies stow away aboard the Apollo 11 flight to the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdjn8YldRIgusHRf8aqdKqriRnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13956'),
  ('35167853716201571', 'Fly Me to the Moon', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Greg Berlanti, Cam Everson, Robert S. Hoffman', 'Rose Gilroy', 'Scarlett Johansson, Channing Tatum, Woody Harrelson, Ray Romano, Jim Rash, Anna Garcia, Donald Watkins, Noah Robbins', 'PG-13', 'Sparks fly in all directions as marketing maven Kelly Jones, brought in to fix NASA''s public image, wreaks havoc on Apollo 11 launch director Cole Davis'' already difficult task of putting a man on the moon. When the White House deems the mission too important to fail, Jones is directed to stage a fake moon landing as backup, and the countdown truly begins.', 'Sparks fly in all directions as marketing maven Kelly Jones, brought in to fix NASA''s public image, wreaks havoc on Apollo 11 launch director Cole Davis'' already difficult task of putting a man on the moon. When the White House deems the mission too important to fail, Jones is directed to stage a fake moon landing as backup, and the countdown truly begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lb0XDH6LbkYwzbHTqjsUNZTLXMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956842'),
  ('877463434607473891', 'Fly Me to the Saitama', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Rei Narakino, Hideki Takeuchi, Sohei Tanikawa', 'Yuichi Tokunaga', 'Fumi Nikaido, GACKT, Yūsuke Iseya, Brother Tom, Kumiko Aso, Haruka Shimazaki, Ryo Narita, Shotaro Mamiya', null, 'People from Saitama Prefecture are persecuted and, because of this, they hide the fact that they are from there. In Tokyo, Momomi Hakuhodo is a male high school student and the son of the Tokyo governor. Physically, Momomi Hakuhodo looks like a girl. One day, he meets mysterious male transfer student Rei Asami. They are attracted to each other, but Rei Asami is from Saitama Prefecture.', 'People from Saitama Prefecture are persecuted and, because of this, they hide the fact that they are from there. In Tokyo, Momomi Hakuhodo is a male high school student and the son of the Tokyo governor. Physically, Momomi Hakuhodo looks like a girl. One day, he meets mysterious male transfer student Rei Asami. They are attracted to each other, but Rei Asami is from Saitama Prefecture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLIe5td2VpWHRMez5Wc8fVYJ8wM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554814'),
  ('357669840997072104', 'Fly On', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Takuya Kato, Shota Nakajima', 'Takuya Kato', 'Mugi Kadowaki, Shota Sometani, Kentaro Tamura, Haru Kuroki, Kanji Furutachi, Sei Ando, Takenori Kaneko, Ryutaro Akimoto', null, 'Watako has just lost her lover, Kimura, in a traffic accident in Tokyo. She decides to bury the trauma of this tragedy and carries on with her life with her husband. Although she puts on a facade for a while, the loss of Kimura has left deep marks, and she can''t escape his memory any longer. She must now confront her grief.', 'Watako has just lost her lover, Kimura, in a traffic accident in Tokyo. She decides to bury the trauma of this tragedy and carries on with her life with her husband. Although she puts on a facade for a while, the loss of Kimura has left deep marks, and she can''t escape his memory any longer. She must now confront her grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTbodQx3O4ic2LDlgaJdgAmjKaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175932'),
  ('1082364501683874463', 'Fly Out', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Ahmed El Gendy, Ahmed Gabr', 'Omar Taher', 'Ahmed Mekky, Donia Samir Ghanem, Maged El Kedwany, Lotfy Labib, Mohamed Sallam, Hesham Ismail, Engy Wegdan, Khairy Hassan', null, 'Baheeg is a shy veterinarian who secretly loves Laila, the owner of a sick puppy in his clinic. On his birthday, Baheeg finds a genie who grants him many wishes in order to graduate from genie school. Baheeg tries through his wishes to attract Laila''s attention by becoming many different characters in hopes that she will fall for love him.', 'Baheeg is a shy veterinarian who secretly loves Laila, the owner of a sick puppy in his clinic. On his birthday, Baheeg finds a genie who grants him many wishes in order to graduate from genie school. Baheeg tries through his wishes to attract Laila''s attention by becoming many different characters in hopes that she will fall for love him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWm1ZCvEgMjHuJn1kathmtjAdYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60179'),
  ('128699465111277020', 'Fly Rocket Fly', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Oliver Schwehm', null, null, null, 'A long time ago, years before Elon Musk reached for the stars with his Space X project, a young man had his own childhood dream about a journey into space. This documentary tells the fantastic story of German astrophysicist Lutz Kayser who developed the world''s first private space company. He did this under the curious and concerned eyes of secret services around the world.', 'A long time ago, years before Elon Musk reached for the stars with his Space X project, a young man had his own childhood dream about a journey into space. This documentary tells the fantastic story of German astrophysicist Lutz Kayser who developed the world''s first private space company. He did this under the curious and concerned eyes of secret services around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xL72XJ9CZ90g8a0ZDfBp8HxvnFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533598'),
  ('953779434984254704', 'Fly, Daddy, Fly', 2006, 'Action, Drama', 'Choi Joo-young, Choi Jong-tae', null, 'Lee Moon-sik, Lee Joon-gi, Lee Yeon-su, Cho Seong-ha, Lee Jae-yong, Kim So-eun', null, 'An ordinary businessman in his forties, JANG Ga-pil returns home one day to find his daughter sexually molested by some schoolboys, including school boxing star KANG Tae-wook. Realizing that he has no background and money to fight back, he plans to stab KANG on the way to school. This fails miserably, but another student named GO Seung-suk agrees to teach Ga-pil to fight ? in only 45 days.', 'An ordinary businessman in his forties, JANG Ga-pil returns home one day to find his daughter sexually molested by some schoolboys, including school boxing star KANG Tae-wook. Realizing that he has no background and money to fight back, he plans to stab KANG on the way to school. This fails miserably, but another student named GO Seung-suk agrees to teach Ga-pil to fight ? in only 45 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8akgiuT0Vsl0B9LriJp40vAdPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39139'),
  ('975151120261812205', 'Flyboys', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History, Romance, War', 'Tony Bill, Henry Braham, Ray Chan', 'David S. Ward', 'James Franco, David Ellison, Jean Reno, Philip Winchester, Todd Boyce, Mac McDonald, Abdul Salis, Karen Ford', 'PG-13', 'The adventures of the Lafayette Escadrille, young Americans who volunteered for the French military before the U.S. entered World War I, and became the country''s first fighter pilots.', 'The adventures of the Lafayette Escadrille, young Americans who volunteered for the French military before the U.S. entered World War I, and became the country''s first fighter pilots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xezeqrrno6ytLyLrbTXRGUk4rdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9664'),
  ('776271906420104655', 'Flying', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Lynch, Perci Young', 'John Sheppard', 'Olivia D''Abo, Keanu Reeves, Rita Tushingham, Jessica Steen, Sean McCann, Samantha Langevin, Renee Murphy, Nicole Kolman', 'R', 'Robin and her father have a car accident. Her father dies. Robin is badly injured and cannot compete in gymnastics tournaments anymore. She lives with her mother and bad step-father. Robin is accepted to the school athlethics team but is not accepted by some other girls, so she works out at a friends house. Eventually Robin and her team compete in the national scholastic meet.', 'Robin and her father have a car accident. Her father dies. Robin is badly injured and cannot compete in gymnastics tournaments anymore. She lives with her mother and bad step-father. Robin is accepted to the school athlethics team but is not accepted by some other girls, so she works out at a friends house. Eventually Robin and her team compete in the national scholastic meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppcoRM6wNT92N2bLkX91YTOLZ8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62768'),
  ('157627091261843518', 'Flying', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Margherita Buy, Giovanni Candelari', 'Margherita Buy, Doriana Leondeff, Antonio Leotti', 'Margherita Buy, Anna Bonaiuto, Giulia Michelini, Euridice Axén, Francesco Colella, Roberto De Francesco, Maurizio Donadoni, Pietro Ragusa', null, 'Annabì has a fear of flying, which holds back her life and acting career. When her daughter decides to study abroad, Annabì sets out to conquer her fear by taking a course designed specifically for those who are afraid of flying.', 'Annabì has a fear of flying, which holds back her life and acting career. When her daughter decides to study abroad, Annabì sets out to conquer her fear by taking a course designed specifically for those who are afraid of flying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqNMSMwHzJwKmZiVhm8sxdJPfjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151156'),
  ('918868151550622124', 'Flying Colors', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nobuhiro Doi, Yasushi Hanamura', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Kasumi Arimura, Atsushi Ito, Shuhei Nomura, Yoh Yoshida, Tetsushi Tanaka, Ken Yasuda, Morio Agata, Airi Matsui', null, 'A high school girl, Sayaka Kudō was the bottom of the class. After a year, she improved her deviation value from 30 to 70, then passed Keio University that is considered one of the most difficult to enter in Japan.', 'A high school girl, Sayaka Kudō was the bottom of the class. After a year, she improved her deviation value from 30 to 70, then passed Keio University that is considered one of the most difficult to enter in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m53V2l1A5imyTvXDlxltc49hZfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349498'),
  ('329143381265689645', 'Flying Dagger', 1993, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Kevin Chu, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Chen Jung-Shu', 'Wong Jing', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, Jimmy Lin Chih-Ying, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Maggie Cheung, Sharla Cheung, Gloria Yip Wan-Yee, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Chen Hung-Lieh', null, 'The well-known "Flying Dagger" Chung and his nephew Lam lived on rewards from apprehending bandits. Chung refused the love of "Great Coquette" Lady Fung. Therefore, Fung always mess up Chung''s business for revenge. Flying Fox, the country''s number one bandit, had stolen the millionaire Tsao''s evidence of being a traitor. Hence, Tsao employed Chung to catch the bandit. Flying Fox''s wife, Flying Cat seduced Chung to save her husband, which caused jealousy and a severe fight with Fung. Meanwhile Lam was kidnapped by Tsao. Chung and Fung finally realized that Tsao was the head of East Wing. They united together to beat against Tsao...', 'The well-known "Flying Dagger" Chung and his nephew Lam lived on rewards from apprehending bandits. Chung refused the love of "Great Coquette" Lady Fung. Therefore, Fung always mess up Chung''s business for revenge. Flying Fox, the country''s number one bandit, had stolen the millionaire Tsao''s evidence of being a traitor. Hence, Tsao employed Chung to catch the bandit. Flying Fox''s wife, Flying Cat seduced Chung to save her husband, which caused jealousy and a severe fight with Fung. Meanwhile Lam was kidnapped by Tsao. Chung and Fung finally realized that Tsao was the head of East Wing. They united together to beat against Tsao...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmzGU0uYlmnET0IYhZLYZvPCLOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40207'),
  ('661858549020317076', 'Flying Down to Rio', 1933, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Thornton Freeland, J. Roy Hunt, Max Steiner', 'Cyril Hume, H.W. Hanemann, Erwin S. Gelsey', 'Dolores del Río, Gene Raymond, Raul Roulien, Ginger Rogers, Fred Astaire, Blanche Friderici, Walter Walker, Etta Moten', 'NR', 'An American bandleader woos a Brazilian beauty who is already engaged to his employer. His friends try to help him, while learning the local dance, The Carioca. The first pairing of Fred Astaire & Ginger Rogers, and their only pre-Code film.', 'An American bandleader woos a Brazilian beauty who is already engaged to his employer. His friends try to help him, while learning the local dance, The Carioca. The first pairing of Fred Astaire & Ginger Rogers, and their only pre-Code film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKBXy84eN6tgwXaYsiFSCgq0GBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28293'),
  ('534115777327027284', 'Flying Elephants', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Frank Butler, Hal Roach', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Edna Marion, Dorothy Coburn, Viola Richard, Fay Lanphier, Budd Fine', null, 'Cavemen Stan and Ollie vie for the affections of a stone-age beauty.', 'Cavemen Stan and Ollie vie for the affections of a stone-age beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoaVJWPcoSsEkC2PyOIMnVlmcWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48820'),
  ('684297243528348434', 'Flying Guillotine II', 1978, 'Action', 'Cheng Kang, Hua Shan, Cheung Tak-Wai', 'Ni Kuang, Lee Wing-Cheung, Cheng Kang', 'Ti Lung, Shih Szu, Ku Feng, Lo Lieh, Wai Wang, Shih Chung-Tien, Nancy Yen Nan-See, Lau Luk-Wah', null, 'The emperor''s reign of terror expands. Heroic outlaw Ma Teng joins a squad of female rebels, whose leader is torn between family loyalties.', 'The emperor''s reign of terror expands. Heroic outlaw Ma Teng joins a squad of female rebels, whose leader is torn between family loyalties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyCrHRUZupfbFolXfYGj7lfhsBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66160'),
  ('18574061841850163', 'Flying Home', 2014, 'Romance', 'Dominique Deruddere, Frank van den Eeden', 'Dominique Deruddere', 'Jamie Dornan, Charlotte De Bruyne, Jan Decleir, Ali Suliman, Josse De Pauw, Viviane de Muynck, Gene Bervoets, Anthony Stewart Head', null, 'Colin, an ambitious young American businessman, has a deal with a potential client, a rich Arab sheikh who is a passionate pigeon fancier. The sheikh has tried several times to buy a champion pigeon, but the owner continues to stubbornly refuse his offer. In an attempt to gain the trust of the Sheikh, Colin offers him a deal: if he manages to convince the owner to sell the champion pigeon, the sheikh will agree to do business with Colin''s company. But when Colin meets Jos, the grumpy owner of the pigeon, and Isabella, his granddaughter, he realizes that this mission will not be as easy as he had hoped.', 'Colin, an ambitious young American businessman, has a deal with a potential client, a rich Arab sheikh who is a passionate pigeon fancier. The sheikh has tried several times to buy a champion pigeon, but the owner continues to stubbornly refuse his offer. In an attempt to gain the trust of the Sheikh, Colin offers him a deal: if he manages to convince the owner to sell the champion pigeon, the sheikh will agree to do business with Colin''s company. But when Colin meets Jos, the grumpy owner of the pigeon, and Isabella, his granddaughter, he realizes that this mission will not be as easy as he had hoped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgzekfyPgfdNxNpFZVcXec9FzcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261375'),
  ('383026343683696410', 'Flying Leathernecks', 1951, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Nicholas Ray, William E. Snyder, Sam Ruman', 'Beirne Lay Jr., Edmund Grainger, James Edward Grant', 'John Wayne, Robert Ryan, Don Taylor, Janis Carter, Jay C. Flippen, William Harrigan, James Bell, Barry Kelley', 'NR', 'Major Daniel Kirby takes command of a squadron of Marine fliers just before they are about to go into combat. While the men are well meaning, he finds them undisciplined and prone to always finding excuses to do what is easy rather than what is necessary. The root of the problem is the second in command, Capt. Carl ''Griff'' Griffin. Griff is the best flier in the group but Kirby finds him a poor commander who is not prepared to make the difficult decision that all commanders have to make - to put men in harm''s way knowing that they may be killed.', 'Major Daniel Kirby takes command of a squadron of Marine fliers just before they are about to go into combat. While the men are well meaning, he finds them undisciplined and prone to always finding excuses to do what is easy rather than what is necessary. The root of the problem is the second in command, Capt. Carl ''Griff'' Griffin. Griff is the best flier in the group but Kirby finds him a poor commander who is not prepared to make the difficult decision that all commanders have to make - to put men in harm''s way knowing that they may be killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhT8QtoHibGosDVGBrRI9TxmPEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47555'),
  ('653759187031552389', 'Flying Padre', 1951, 'Documentary', 'Stanley Kubrick, Stanley Kubrick', null, 'Bob Hite, Fred Stadtmueller', 'G', 'Stanley Kubrick’s short documentary about Father Fred Stadtmueller, a Catholic priest serving a vast 4,000-square-mile parish in rural New Mexico. To reach his scattered congregation, he pilots his own Piper Cub aircraft, the Spirit of St. Joseph. Over two days, Kubrick follows the “flying padre” as he conducts Mass, mediates between quarreling children, attends a funeral, and airlifts a sick child to medical care—capturing both the challenges and quiet heroism of his daily mission.', 'Stanley Kubrick’s short documentary about Father Fred Stadtmueller, a Catholic priest serving a vast 4,000-square-mile parish in rural New Mexico. To reach his scattered congregation, he pilots his own Piper Cub aircraft, the Spirit of St. Joseph. Over two days, Kubrick follows the “flying padre” as he conducts Mass, mediates between quarreling children, attends a funeral, and airlifts a sick child to medical care—capturing both the challenges and quiet heroism of his daily mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aog5qVlMFakpogT1Nar9Z7gqq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45970'),
  ('895873517532696394', 'Flying Phantom Ship', 1969, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Hiroshi Ikeda, Yukio Katayama, Hiroshi Takeda', 'Masaki Tsuji, Hiroshi Ikeda', 'Masako Nozawa, Akio Tanaka, Akira Nagoya, Gorō Naya, Kyôko Satomi, Kosei Tomita, Yukiko Okada, Junko Hori', null, 'Hayato''s home city is under attack from a gigantic robot. His parents are lying dead in the rubble and the only remaining friend is his dog. His only thought now is revenge against the owner of the Phantom Ship (from where the robot said he was sent). He ends up in the house of Kuroshio, the leader of the fight against the Phantom Ship and the most important person in the city. By complete accident, Hayato finds his way to an underground passageway where he realises that the true nature of events does not mesh with what Kuroshio has told him. His life is now in great danger, and only he can stop the plans of the evildoers.', 'Hayato''s home city is under attack from a gigantic robot. His parents are lying dead in the rubble and the only remaining friend is his dog. His only thought now is revenge against the owner of the Phantom Ship (from where the robot said he was sent). He ends up in the house of Kuroshio, the leader of the fight against the Phantom Ship and the most important person in the city. By complete accident, Hayato finds his way to an underground passageway where he realises that the true nature of events does not mesh with what Kuroshio has told him. His life is now in great danger, and only he can stop the plans of the evildoers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aG75j2rMhqlciuFiG7eCP30ud7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76722'),
  ('121665176225169049', 'Flying Saucers Over Hollywood: The ''Plan 9'' Companion', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Mark Patrick Carducci', 'Mark Patrick Carducci, Lee Harris', 'Forrest J. Ackerman, Carl Anthony, Stephen C. Apostolof, Conrad Brooks, Paul Marco, Maila Nurmi, Crawford John Thomas, Harry Thomas', null, 'A documentary detailing the making of the cult favorite "Plan 9 from Outer Space," featuring interviews with cast members and prominent filmmakers about the film, its lasting legacy, and its creator, Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'A documentary detailing the making of the cult favorite "Plan 9 from Outer Space," featuring interviews with cast members and prominent filmmakers about the film, its lasting legacy, and its creator, Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Oclb3oeGgOXYCDDHzeTvc7SoNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41763'),
  ('745976346743915696', 'Flying Swords of Dragon Gate', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Sun Jiankui, Yuen Bun, Allen Lan Hai-Han', 'Tsui Hark', 'Jet Li, Zhou Xun, Chen Kun, Gwei Lun-mei, Chris Lee Yuchun, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Mavis Fan, Du Yiheng', null, 'Three years after the infamous Dragon Inn was burnt down in the desert when its innkeeper Jade vanished. A new gang of marauders had taken over - innkeepers by day and treasure hunters by night. The inn is the rumoured location of a lost city buried under the desert, and its hidden treasure would only be revealed by a gigantic storm every 60 years. The gang used the inn as a front to locate the lost treasure.', 'Three years after the infamous Dragon Inn was burnt down in the desert when its innkeeper Jade vanished. A new gang of marauders had taken over - innkeepers by day and treasure hunters by night. The inn is the rumoured location of a lost city buried under the desert, and its hidden treasure would only be revealed by a gigantic storm every 60 years. The gang used the inn as a front to locate the lost treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1i5kkGZne5tKfSlTtaYnfJQNN6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81870'),
  ('8236983084100697', 'Flying Tigers', 1942, 'Action, Drama, War', 'David Miller, Walter Scharf, Jack A. Marta', 'Kenneth Gamet, Barry Trivers', 'John Wayne, John Carroll, Anna Lee, Paul Kelly, Gordon Jones, Mae Clarke, Addison Richards, Edmund MacDonald', 'NR', 'Jim Gordon commands a unit of the famed Flying Tigers, the American Volunteer Group which fought the Japanese in China before America''s entry into World War II. Gordon must send his outnumbered band of fighter pilots out against overwhelming odds while juggling the disparate personalities and problems of his fellow flyers.', 'Jim Gordon commands a unit of the famed Flying Tigers, the American Volunteer Group which fought the Japanese in China before America''s entry into World War II. Gordon must send his outnumbered band of fighter pilots out against overwhelming odds while juggling the disparate personalities and problems of his fellow flyers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Aee8HBwkq1yjKYMnL9YMPhXJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29372'),
  ('168947464564499613', 'Flying Virus', 2001, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Hare, Brad Rushing, Steve Hart', 'Jeff Hare', 'Gabrielle Anwar, Rutger Hauer, Craig Sheffer, Duncan Regehr, Jason Brooks, David Naughton, Mark Adair-Rios, Hunter Bodine', 'R', 'After a series of Amazonian Indian attacks on US owned petroleum installation in Brazil, both governments start a secret ''special program''. In fact colonel Ezekial''s men use GM killer bees to eradicate the tribes. During an Indian attack, reporter Ann Bauer is stung, yet survives after a mysterious rescue. Dr. Stephen North realizes the venom has priceless healing powers and smuggles the bee aboard a flight to New York. Bauer, her nearly-divorced husband, Martin, who is aboard and her friend, US State Department project representative, Scotty, face potential mass-killing after turbulence releases the bees aboard.', 'After a series of Amazonian Indian attacks on US owned petroleum installation in Brazil, both governments start a secret ''special program''. In fact colonel Ezekial''s men use GM killer bees to eradicate the tribes. During an Indian attack, reporter Ann Bauer is stung, yet survives after a mysterious rescue. Dr. Stephen North realizes the venom has priceless healing powers and smuggles the bee aboard a flight to New York. Bauer, her nearly-divorced husband, Martin, who is aboard and her friend, US State Department project representative, Scotty, face potential mass-killing after turbulence releases the bees aboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7o2AQIexOMdVPSzJIZpP9ATh6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72231'),
  ('553257160773505617', 'Flying Wild', 1941, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy, Drama', 'William West, Herman Pett, Arthur Hammond', 'Al Martin', 'Leo Gorcey, Bobby Jordan, Joan Barclay, Dave O''Brien, George Pembroke, Sunshine Sammy Morrison, David Gorcey, Donald Haines', null, 'A group of young men who work at an aviation factory begin to suspect that a doctor who runs an air ambulance service is secretly a spy transporting secret information from the plant to enemy agents.', 'A group of young men who work at an aviation factory begin to suspect that a doctor who runs an air ambulance service is secretly a spy transporting secret information from the plant to enemy agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GY6QnwuH8lRZnvdDHcwu0Y3IUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87889'),
  ('545367255422811642', 'Flypaper', 1999, 'Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Klaus Hoch, Jürgen Baum', 'Klaus Hoch', 'Sadie Frost, Craig Sheffer, Robert Loggia, Illeana Douglas, John C. McGinley, Lucy Liu, Sal Lopez, Talisa Soto', 'R', 'Greed, lust and fate bring together a motley collection of oddballs and lowlifes for some rather sticky situations in Hoch''s twisted neo-noir debut. Three separate but interconnected stories, all set on a deceptively sunny day in California and centered around one million dollars in cash, inspire Hoch''s quirky characters to commit acts both devious and depraved in an attempt to make the big score.', 'Greed, lust and fate bring together a motley collection of oddballs and lowlifes for some rather sticky situations in Hoch''s twisted neo-noir debut. Three separate but interconnected stories, all set on a deceptively sunny day in California and centered around one million dollars in cash, inspire Hoch''s quirky characters to commit acts both devious and depraved in an attempt to make the big score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waNpLc3u6tIibbhrJ8DP0fh8dDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50473'),
  ('54598355226938117', 'Flypaper', 2011, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'Rob Minkoff, Steven Poster', 'Jon Lucas, Scott Moore', 'Patrick Dempsey, Ashley Judd, Tim Blake Nelson, Mekhi Phifer, Matt Ryan, Jeffrey Tambor, John Ventimiglia, Pruitt Taylor Vince', 'R', 'A man caught in the middle of two simultaneous robberies at a bank desperately tries to protect the teller with whom he''s secretly in love.', 'A man caught in the middle of two simultaneous robberies at a bank desperately tries to protect the teller with whom he''s secretly in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJcxUKIy2GXDODT2pDl0q9XvByq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62046'),
  ('913379628495903070', 'Flywheel', 2003, 'Drama, Family', 'Alex Kendrick, Alex Kendrick', 'Alex Kendrick', 'Alex Kendrick, Janet Lee Dapper, Richie Hunnewell, Roger Breland, Lisa Arnold, Tracy Goode, Walter Burnett, Jim McBride', 'NR', 'Jay Austin wants to sell you a used car, but watch out! Many victims have fallen prey to his smiling face and hasty promises. Austin does everything his way until his dishonesty and manipulation are exposed. Like many men, he becomes disgusted by the masks he wears and the lies he tells. In every man''s life, there can be a turning point. When Jay makes his turn, he never looks back.', 'Jay Austin wants to sell you a used car, but watch out! Many victims have fallen prey to his smiling face and hasty promises. Austin does everything his way until his dishonesty and manipulation are exposed. Like many men, he becomes disgusted by the masks he wears and the lies he tells. In every man''s life, there can be a turning point. When Jay makes his turn, he never looks back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5M5h80QGQq5BXxcpoT1wkaxPdwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17345'),
  ('290260696699055711', 'FM', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'John A. Alonzo, David Myers, Bert Gold', 'Ezra Sacks', 'Michael Brandon, Eileen Brennan, Alex Karras, Cleavon Little, Martin Mull, Cassie Yates, Linda Ronstadt, Jimmy Buffett', 'PG', 'When a liberal music station''s owners decide to introduce army recruitment ads, despite the protests of its manager, the rebellious DJs are determined to fight back, no matter the cost.', 'When a liberal music station''s owners decide to introduce army recruitment ads, despite the protests of its manager, the rebellious DJs are determined to fight back, no matter the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zp8PLcseuX2z7VAtMrxjF0VmJiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42204'),
  ('794141587733436595', 'Foam Party!', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'José Martín Rosete, Roberto Pérez Toledo, David Casas Riesco', 'Roberto Pérez Toledo', 'Sara Sálamo, Diego Martínez, Nacho San José, Carlo D''Ursi, Adrián Expósito, Pepe Ocio, Miguel Diosdado, Daniel Muriel', null, 'A message circulates from mobile phone to mobile phone. A bunch of strangers meet in a mansion. They come searching for sex, but never has an orgy been so full of love.', 'A message circulates from mobile phone to mobile phone. A bunch of strangers meet in a mansion. They come searching for sex, but never has an orgy been so full of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FaB2eisDfGJCKJp9wcWfJs1FqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456280'),
  ('1150077604717948499', 'Focus', 2001, 'Drama', 'Neal Slavin, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Kendrew Lascelles', 'William H. Macy, Laura Dern, David Paymer, Meat Loaf, Kay Hawtrey, Michael Copeman, Kenneth Welsh, Peter Oldring', 'PG-13', 'In the waning months of World War II, a man and his wife are mistakenly identified as Jews by their anti-Semitic Brooklyn neighbors. Suddenly the victims of religious and racial persecution, they find themselves aligned with a local Jewish immigrant in a struggle for dignity and survival.', 'In the waning months of World War II, a man and his wife are mistakenly identified as Jews by their anti-Semitic Brooklyn neighbors. Suddenly the victims of religious and racial persecution, they find themselves aligned with a local Jewish immigrant in a struggle for dignity and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0VybfDiQ8U62kqdf4BzDebrCQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18192'),
  ('1070988434836189069', 'Focus', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime', 'Stephen E. Hagen, Jon Recher, Desiree Stevenson', 'Glenn Ficarra, John Requa', 'Will Smith, Margot Robbie, Adrian Martinez, Gerald McRaney, Rodrigo Santoro, BD Wong, Brennan Brown, Robert Taylor', 'R', 'Nicky, an accomplished con artist, gets romantically involved with his disciple Jess but later ends their relationship. Years later, she returns as a femme fatale to spoil his plans.', 'Nicky, an accomplished con artist, gets romantically involved with his disciple Jess but later ends their relationship. Years later, she returns as a femme fatale to spoil his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOzGWjceYTd0kd5HyX7Ch46O9kh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256591'),
  ('394812769637594003', 'Foe', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Garth Davis, Janie Parker, Mátyás Erdély', 'Garth Davis, Iain Reid', 'Paul Mescal, Saoirse Ronan, Aaron Pierre, Jordan Chodziesner, William Freeman, Jalen Ong, Patrick Williams, David Woods', 'R', 'Henrietta and Junior farm a secluded piece of land that has been in Junior''s family for generations, but their quiet life is thrown into turmoil when an uninvited stranger shows up at their door with a startling proposal. Will they risk their relationship & personal identity for a chance to survive in a new world?', 'Henrietta and Junior farm a secluded piece of land that has been in Junior''s family for generations, but their quiet life is thrown into turmoil when an uninvited stranger shows up at their door with a startling proposal. Will they risk their relationship & personal identity for a chance to survive in a new world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTPBizhkX6B9NgzPzkhVIOvwXxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760245'),
  ('826288934756477522', 'Fog and Night', 2007, 'Crime, Adventure', 'Turgut Yasalar, Gökhan Atılmış', 'Turgut Yasalar', 'Uğur Polat, Selma Ergeç, Yetkin Dikinciler, Oktay Kaynarca, İlyas Salman, Ayten Uncuoğlu, Devrim Nas, Hakan Pişkin', null, 'Fog and the Night is the search of an investigator who has lost his confidence in his organization and whose happy "family father" order has been disrupted by his young lover.And introverted man due to his profession, not a big talker or well in expressing his feelings, Sedat is being consumed, going through the hardest time of his life, not able to silence his guilty conscience because he was unsuccessful in solving the murder of his partner, whom he saw as a brother. His faith in his organization is shaken as he witnesses the schemes in machination inside the organization and between the organization and the state. Meanwhile, while trying to find his lover who has disappeared after falling for a former militant, he does not refrain from making use of the filthiest methods of his profession.', 'Fog and the Night is the search of an investigator who has lost his confidence in his organization and whose happy "family father" order has been disrupted by his young lover.And introverted man due to his profession, not a big talker or well in expressing his feelings, Sedat is being consumed, going through the hardest time of his life, not able to silence his guilty conscience because he was unsuccessful in solving the murder of his partner, whom he saw as a brother. His faith in his organization is shaken as he witnesses the schemes in machination inside the organization and between the organization and the state. Meanwhile, while trying to find his lover who has disappeared after falling for a former militant, he does not refrain from making use of the filthiest methods of his profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCQQM0hXAWSuoTPg5wj1RiFtf9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37999'),
  ('834270021533952745', 'Fog City', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Solidum, Steve Wolsh, John J. Tierney', 'Steve Wolsh', 'Victoria Konefal, Connor Weil, Reese Mishler, Luke Benward, Juliette Goglia, Noah Gray-Cabey, Jonny Beauchamp, Cody Kennedy', null, 'A group of friends seal themselves inside a secluded Cape Cod vacation home after a mysterious orange fog leaks from an old nearby factory. Once trapped, they quickly learn there is no escape.', 'A group of friends seal themselves inside a secluded Cape Cod vacation home after a mysterious orange fog leaks from an old nearby factory. Once trapped, they quickly learn there is no escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isewxmxthIUrmPpGHQQlIuOid3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517929'),
  ('363077396380825979', 'Fog in August', 2016, 'Drama', 'Hagen Bogdanski, Kai Wessel', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt', 'Ivo Pietzcker, Sebastian Koch, Fritzi Haberlandt, Thomas Schubert, Henriette Confurius, Branko Samarovski, David Bennent, Karl Markovics', null, 'A Yenish boy is placed in a mental hospital and experiences the Nazi euthanasia program. Aware of what was happening and attached to friends, the lad attempts to sabotage the program. The film addresses the complexities of the program director, the lives of the child victims, and the struggles of the child protagonist. More than five thousand children died in the Nazi euthanasia program.', 'A Yenish boy is placed in a mental hospital and experiences the Nazi euthanasia program. Aware of what was happening and attached to friends, the lad attempts to sabotage the program. The film addresses the complexities of the program director, the lives of the child victims, and the struggles of the child protagonist. More than five thousand children died in the Nazi euthanasia program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nq8Q278MsQOVDtjGzVqgW9Nn5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380075'),
  ('744555249888781482', 'Fog Island', 1945, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Terry O. Morse, William A. Calihan Jr., Ira H. Morgan', 'Pierre Gendron', 'George Zucco, Lionel Atwill, Jerome Cowan, Veda Ann Borg, Sharon Douglas, John Whitney, Jacqueline deWit, Ian Keith', null, 'Leo, a former convict, is living in seclusion on an island with his step-daughter, the daughter of his late wife. Leo was framed by a group of former business associates, and he also suspects that one of them killed his wife. He has invited the group to his island, tempting them by hinting about a hidden fortune, and he has installed a number of traps and secret passages in his home. He is aided in his efforts by a former cell-mate who holds a grudge against the same persons. When everyone arrives, the atmosphere of mutual suspicion and the thick fog that covers the island promise a tense and hazardous weekend for everyone.', 'Leo, a former convict, is living in seclusion on an island with his step-daughter, the daughter of his late wife. Leo was framed by a group of former business associates, and he also suspects that one of them killed his wife. He has invited the group to his island, tempting them by hinting about a hidden fortune, and he has installed a number of traps and secret passages in his home. He is aided in his efforts by a former cell-mate who holds a grudge against the same persons. When everyone arrives, the atmosphere of mutual suspicion and the thick fog that covers the island promise a tense and hazardous weekend for everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMvognU7wny0XO4jEQNg7cY6P0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41033'),
  ('306323337587458523', 'Fog Line', 1970, null, 'Larry Gottheim', null, null, null, 'Larry Gottheim’s Fog Line consists of a fixed shot of clearing fog in a valley in upstate New York where he lived and worked in the early seventies.', 'Larry Gottheim’s Fog Line consists of a fixed shot of clearing fog in a valley in upstate New York where he lived and worked in the early seventies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzbeEiu85jmDwO2g0cY0H7L2dNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211208'),
  ('1024202453906383552', 'Fog of War', 2025, 'Thriller', 'Michael Day, Dan Taggatz, Nick Flavin', 'Luke Langsdale', 'Jake Abel, Brianna Hildebrand, Géza Röhrig, John Cusack, Mira Sorvino, David B. Meadows, Sal Rendino, David Gere', null, 'With WWII raging around them, an injured pilot and his fiancée find themselves stranded on a remote estate. As the Allies plan the D-Day Invasion, the couple become aware of a Nazi spy hiding amongst them with stolen documents bound for Germany. Unsure of who to trust, and facing danger around every corner, they must uncover the spy’s identity as the outcome of the war hangs in the balance.', 'With WWII raging around them, an injured pilot and his fiancée find themselves stranded on a remote estate. As the Allies plan the D-Day Invasion, the couple become aware of a Nazi spy hiding amongst them with stolen documents bound for Germany. Unsure of who to trust, and facing danger around every corner, they must uncover the spy’s identity as the outcome of the war hangs in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvKfxdKaV20YikapsiYA23ETXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1138621'),
  ('316529580413759769', 'Fog Over Frisco', 1934, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'William Dieterle, Tony Gaudio', 'Robert N. Lee', 'Bette Davis, Donald Woods, Margaret Lindsay, Lyle Talbot, Hugh Herbert, Arthur Byron, Robert Barrat, Henry O''Neill', 'NR', 'Val takes the assistance of a society reporter and a journalist to investigate the disappearance of her half-sister Arlene, a wealthy socialite who is involved in criminal activities.', 'Val takes the assistance of a society reporter and a journalist to investigate the disappearance of her half-sister Arlene, a wealthy socialite who is involved in criminal activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3MO3qDLIlq4F01Y8p61V0sOywi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50675'),
  ('881247373686772450', 'Fogaréu', 2022, 'Drama', 'Luciana Baseggio, Glauco Firpo, Thomas Sparfel', 'Melanie Dimantas, Flávia Neves', 'Bárbara Colen, Nena Inoue, Eucir de Souza, Fernanda Vianna, Vilminha Chaves, Kelly Crifer, Timothy Wilson, Fernanda Pimenta', null, 'On the border between the real and the fantastic, between the colonial past and the overwhelming modernity of agribusiness, the city of Goiás is the scene of the meeting between the young Fernanda and her secret roots. She returns to the home of her wealthy uncle, after the death of her adoptive mother, in order to implode the certainties and to reveal the painful truth about its origin.', 'On the border between the real and the fantastic, between the colonial past and the overwhelming modernity of agribusiness, the city of Goiás is the scene of the meeting between the young Fernanda and her secret roots. She returns to the home of her wealthy uncle, after the death of her adoptive mother, in order to implode the certainties and to reveal the painful truth about its origin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmf3NS6HXc5xMB5ctDB3rtdaBE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764516'),
  ('392241128782046056', 'Fögi Is a Bastard', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcel Gisler', 'Rudolf Nadler, Marcel Gisler', 'Frédéric Andrau, Vincent Branchet, Urs Peter Halter, Jean-Pierre von Dach, Ulrich Bodamer, Jaqueline Brutsche, Jessica Früh, Mirjam Hoffmann', null, '15-year-old Beni falls in love with Fögi, a singer in a Rock band. As Fögi seduces him, he is only willing to follow him where ever Fögi wants to. But Fögi is a drug addict and pulls Beni deeper and deeper into the hell of drug addiction.', '15-year-old Beni falls in love with Fögi, a singer in a Rock band. As Fögi seduces him, he is only willing to follow him where ever Fögi wants to. But Fögi is a drug addict and pulls Beni deeper and deeper into the hell of drug addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKUX5f7Za3nNq3VVrXZ6XsjMera.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29457'),
  ('743928611074658661', 'Folklore: The Long Pond Studio Sessions', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Taylor Swift, Ethan Palmer', 'Taylor Swift', 'Taylor Swift, Jack Antonoff, Aaron Dessner, Justin Vernon', 'PG-13', 'An intimate concert film, in which Taylor Swift performs each song from her album ''folklore'' in order, as she reveals the meaning and the stories behind all 17 tracks for the very first time.', 'An intimate concert film, in which Taylor Swift performs each song from her album ''folklore'' in order, as she reveals the meaning and the stories behind all 17 tracks for the very first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iroJUn8YuQBekDwGy7r61YHXiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768141'),
  ('1134041858327770293', 'Folks!', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Ted Kotcheff, Glen Sanford, Larry Pizer', 'Robert Klane', 'Tom Selleck, Don Ameche, Anne Jackson, Christine Ebersole, Wendy Crewson, Michael Murphy, Robert Pastorelli, Kevin Chevalia', 'PG-13', 'A slightly self absorbed yuppie takes in his parents including his senile father, after their home burns down. But his personal and professional life fall apart soon after.', 'A slightly self absorbed yuppie takes in his parents including his senile father, after their home burns down. But his personal and professional life fall apart soon after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCx6kmi8YMvpGJyayCpnGseoenZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18495'),
  ('585842434046284771', 'Follies', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Eric K Boulianne', 'Eric K Boulianne', 'Eric K. Boulianne, Catherine Chabot, Ambre Jabrane', null, 'After 16 years together, François and Julie open their relationship to explore sexual adventures and self-discovery. With two kids and their bond at stake, the path proves more complex than expected.', 'After 16 years together, François and Julie open their relationship to explore sexual adventures and self-discovery. With two kids and their bond at stake, the path proves more complex than expected.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F9%2Fgracenote%2F9d32a1b084ee9bedac44d37a977b2759.jpg', 'plex:movie:follies-2026'),
  ('1137305300017318659', 'Follow', 2019, 'Horror', 'Carlo Ledesma', 'Anton C. Santamaria', 'Carmina Villarroel, Mylene Dizon, Krystal Brimner, Rhed Bustamante, Susan Africa, JC Santos, Kate Alejandrino, Freddie Webb', null, 'A woman is desperate to find the cure to her daughter''s illness. She takes a job at a call center, only to be haunted by the ghost in it.', 'A woman is desperate to find the cure to her daughter''s illness. She takes a job at a call center, only to be haunted by the ghost in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKseIXuROOOmXqkVdWxoHT6lm03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638238'),
