  ('398019664718106467', 'Follow a Star', 1959, 'Comedy, Music', 'Robert Asher', 'Jack Davis, Henry Blyth, Norman Wisdom', 'Norman Wisdom, June Laverick, Jerry Desmonde, Hattie Jacques, Richard Wattis, Eddie Leslie, John Le Mesurier, Sydney Tafler', null, 'Norman Truscott is a store worker who dreams of stardom. Vernon Carew is a singer whose star is fading. Vernon manages to get a recording of Norman singing and passes it off as himself.', 'Norman Truscott is a store worker who dreams of stardom. Vernon Carew is a singer whose star is fading. Vernon manages to get a recording of Norman singing and passes it off as himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xjy7MPcdG6dXnQjoKMR0ZrlCmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38380'),
  ('582605660710716', 'Follow Her', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Sylvia Caminer, Sibyl Santiago, Thorstein Foss', 'Dani Barker', 'Dani Barker, Luke Cook, Eliana Jones, Mark Moses, Sawandi Wilson, Cristala Carter, Brian Vincent, Justin L. Wilson', 'NR', 'An aspiring actress responds to a mysterious classified ad and finds herself trapped in her new boss''s twisted revenge fantasy.', 'An aspiring actress responds to a mysterious classified ad and finds herself trapped in her new boss''s twisted revenge fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjUVNAuJjKJoBNIV4OLI2IsKIld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943919'),
  ('808090394040826234', 'Follow Me', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ricky Dean Monsey, Michael Breines, Will Wernick', 'Will Wernick', 'Keegan Allen, Holland Roden, Denzel Whitaker, Ronen Rubinstein, Pasha D. Lychnikoff, George Janko, Siya, Daniyar', 'R', 'A social media personality travels with his friends to Moscow to capture new content for his successful vlog. Always pushing the limits and catering to a growing audience, they enter a cold world of mystery, excess, and danger. When the lines between real life and social media are blurred, the group must fight to escape, and survive.', 'A social media personality travels with his friends to Moscow to capture new content for his successful vlog. Always pushing the limits and catering to a growing audience, they enter a cold world of mystery, excess, and danger. When the lines between real life and social media are blurred, the group must fight to escape, and survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glwOyoD0Pzxzyb3l7nELEgjSjQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606625'),
  ('398934791789424144', 'Follow Me Quietly', 1949, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard Fleischer, Robert De Grasse, James E. Casey', 'Lillie Hayward', 'William Lundigan, Dorothy Patrick, Jeff Corey, Nestor Paiva, Charles D. Brown, Paul Guilfoyle, Edwin Max, Frank Ferguson', 'NR', 'When it rains in the city, a serial killer known as "The Judge" looks for his next strangling victim. For months, the madman has been stalking at night, leaving behind clues, but police efforts have been fruitless. Constructing a life-size dummy of the murderer, police Lt. Harry Grant is growing obsessed with capturing him, and always following Grant is the relentless reporter Ann Gorman looking to break the story, but the hunt continues.', 'When it rains in the city, a serial killer known as "The Judge" looks for his next strangling victim. For months, the madman has been stalking at night, leaving behind clues, but police efforts have been fruitless. Constructing a life-size dummy of the murderer, police Lt. Harry Grant is growing obsessed with capturing him, and always following Grant is the relentless reporter Ann Gorman looking to break the story, but the hunt continues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/undj4wTGliQ909hYypS0LRRGyRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31167'),
  ('520874311432583964', 'Follow Me to Daisy Hills', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Jorge Requena Ramos, Jorge Requena Ramos, Robbin MacDonald', 'G.Y. Cohen', 'Cindy Busby, Marshall Williams, Jade Michael, Paul Essiembre, Sharon Bajer, Adrian McLean, Erik Athavale', null, 'When Jo realizes that her family''s general store in Daisy Hills is losing money, her father Duke calls in a favor to help. Duke''s help is Jo''s ex-boyfriend, Blake, former Daisy Hills native.', 'When Jo realizes that her family''s general store in Daisy Hills is losing money, her father Duke calls in a favor to help. Duke''s help is Jo''s ex-boyfriend, Blake, former Daisy Hills native.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78UTvk1yE7zUVhqbK7bpuiuqWTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733277'),
  ('564804144649301556', 'Follow Me, Boys!', 1966, 'Drama, Family', 'Norman Tokar, Clifford Stine', 'Louis Pelletier', 'Fred MacMurray, Vera Miles, Lillian Gish, Charles Ruggles, Elliott Reid, Kurt Russell, Luana Patten, Ken Murray', null, 'Lem Siddons is part of a traveling band who has a dream of becoming a lawyer. Deciding to settle down, he finds a job as a stockboy in the general store of a small town. Trying to fit in, he volunteers to become scoutmaster of the newly formed Troop 1. Becoming more and more involved with the scout troop, he finds his plans to become a lawyer being put on the back burner, until he realizes that his life has been fulfilled helping the youth of the small town.', 'Lem Siddons is part of a traveling band who has a dream of becoming a lawyer. Deciding to settle down, he finds a job as a stockboy in the general store of a small town. Trying to fit in, he volunteers to become scoutmaster of the newly formed Troop 1. Becoming more and more involved with the scout troop, he finds his plans to become a lawyer being put on the back burner, until he realizes that his life has been fulfilled helping the youth of the small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9K6Opys2zr5B64EbfsnuxPmbRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40454'),
  ('487259457403281257', 'Follow Me!', 1972, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Carol Reed, Christopher Challis, Sally Nicholl', 'Peter Shaffer', 'Mia Farrow, Chaim Topol, Michael Jayston, Margaret Rawlings, Annette Crosbie, Dudley Foster, Michael Aldridge, Michael Barrington', 'G', 'A strait-laced British banker hires an eccentric private detective to follow his free-spirited American wife, whom he suspects is cheating on him.', 'A strait-laced British banker hires an eccentric private detective to follow his free-spirited American wife, whom he suspects is cheating on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jykagagworxyvQpsmeX00GXnA02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86049'),
  ('63940587003958658', 'Follow My Voice', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Inés Pintor, Pablo Santidrián, Andreu Ortoll', 'Inés Pintor, Pablo Santidrián', 'Berta Castañé, Jae Woo Yang, Claudia Traisac, Fernando Guallar, Itziar Ituño, Nuno Gallego, Yasmina Drissi, Sofía de Iznájar', null, 'After a health crisis that keeps her home, Klara does nothing but listen to her favorite radio show, Follow My Voice. But one day she wonders: is it possible to fall in love with someone she has only heard on the radio but never met? Could she really have feelings for Kang, the radio show host whose voice she has only heard once, and will she overcome her fears to step out into the world again?', 'After a health crisis that keeps her home, Klara does nothing but listen to her favorite radio show, Follow My Voice. But one day she wonders: is it possible to fall in love with someone she has only heard on the radio but never met? Could she really have feelings for Kang, the radio show host whose voice she has only heard once, and will she overcome her fears to step out into the world again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBd17L811S97JESH9ma1pPMO0o0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1144443'),
  ('38330020690745422', 'Follow That Bird', 1985, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Music', 'Ken Kwapis, Curtis Clark', 'Judy Freudberg, Tony Geiss', 'Caroll Spinney, Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Richard Hunt, Kathryn Mullen, Jerry Nelson, Paul Bartel, Sandra Bernhard', 'G', 'Big Bird is sent to live far from Sesame Street by a pesky social worker, who thinks it would be better for him to live with other birds. Unhappy, Big Bird runs away from his foster home, prompting the rest of the Sesame Street gang to go on a cross-country journey to find him.', 'Big Bird is sent to live far from Sesame Street by a pesky social worker, who thinks it would be better for him to live with other birds. Unhappy, Big Bird runs away from his foster home, prompting the rest of the Sesame Street gang to go on a cross-country journey to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkhgC0IDWtmPYX6FxMrVGx7jJnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36536'),
  ('91571714413083328', 'Follow That Camel', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume', 'Talbot Rothwell', 'Phil Silvers, Kenneth Williams, Jim Dale, Charles Hawtrey, Joan Sims, Angela Douglas, Peter Butterworth, Bernard Bresslaw', null, 'Bertram Oliphant ''Bo'' West wants to clear his unjustly smeared reputation, so he joins the Foreign Legion—with Simpson his manservant in tow. But the fort they get posted to is full of eccentric legionnaires, and there''s trouble brewing with the locals too. Unbeknown to Bo, his lady love has followed him in disguise.', 'Bertram Oliphant ''Bo'' West wants to clear his unjustly smeared reputation, so he joins the Foreign Legion—with Simpson his manservant in tow. But the fort they get posted to is full of eccentric legionnaires, and there''s trouble brewing with the locals too. Unbeknown to Bo, his lady love has followed him in disguise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6JcQoUgI33c3qKfYw8SMWA7qag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24568'),
  ('1041921359513610800', 'Follow That Dream', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Gordon Douglas, Bert Chervin, Leo Tover', 'Charles Lederer', 'Elvis Presley, Arthur O''Connell, Anne Helm, Joanna Moore, Jack Kruschen, Simon Oakland, Roland Winters, Alan Hewitt', 'NR', 'When the Kwimper family car runs out of fuel on a new Florida highway and an officious state supervisor tries to run them off, Pop Kwimper digs in his heels and decides to do a little homesteading. He and his son Toby and their ''adopted'' children—Holly, Ariadne, and the twins—start their own little community along a strip of the roadside.', 'When the Kwimper family car runs out of fuel on a new Florida highway and an officious state supervisor tries to run them off, Pop Kwimper digs in his heels and decides to do a little homesteading. He and his son Toby and their ''adopted'' children—Holly, Ariadne, and the twins—start their own little community along a strip of the roadside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpTkjmDyjN8rsWwmoZsba8xZzMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18643'),
  ('197612869419909563', 'Follow the Boys', 1944, 'Music, Comedy, War', 'A. Edward Sutherland, David Abel', 'Lou Breslow, Gertrude Purcell', 'George Raft, Vera Zorina, Grace McDonald, Charley Grapewin, Ramsay Ames, Charles Butterworth, Elizabeth Patterson, Regis Toomey', 'NR', 'During World War II, all the studios put out "all-star" vehicles which featured virtually every star on the lot--often playing themselves--in musical numbers and comedy skits, and were meant as morale-boosters to both the troops overseas and the civilians at home. This was Universal Pictures'' effort. It features everyone from Donald O''Connor to the Andrews Sisters to Orson Welles to W.C. Fields to George Raft to Marlene Dietrich, and dozens of other Universal players.', 'During World War II, all the studios put out "all-star" vehicles which featured virtually every star on the lot--often playing themselves--in musical numbers and comedy skits, and were meant as morale-boosters to both the troops overseas and the civilians at home. This was Universal Pictures'' effort. It features everyone from Donald O''Connor to the Andrews Sisters to Orson Welles to W.C. Fields to George Raft to Marlene Dietrich, and dozens of other Universal players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFrQrxdDOYIVH8OQ6h5TgFg9JEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27628'),
  ('1139192818418193970', 'Follow the Fleet', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Sandrich, David Abel, Carroll Clark', 'Dwight Taylor, Allan Scott', 'Fred Astaire, Ginger Rogers, Randolph Scott, Harriet Nelson, Astrid Allwyn, Betty Grable, Harry Beresford, Russell Hicks', 'NR', 'When the US Navy fleet docks at San Francisco, sailor Bake Baker tries to rekindle the flame with his old dancing partner, Sherry Martin, while Bake''s buddy Bilge Smith romances Sherry''s sister, Connie. But it''s not all smooth sailing—Bake has a habit of losing Sherry''s jobs for her and, despite Connie''s dreams, Bilge is not ready to settle down.', 'When the US Navy fleet docks at San Francisco, sailor Bake Baker tries to rekindle the flame with his old dancing partner, Sherry Martin, while Bake''s buddy Bilge Smith romances Sherry''s sister, Connie. But it''s not all smooth sailing—Bake has a habit of losing Sherry''s jobs for her and, despite Connie''s dreams, Bilge is not ready to settle down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8crR3tx6JapNwH4WcrxDkOaDkRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28292'),
  ('425942985039979894', 'Follow The River', 1995, 'Drama, Action', 'Michael Gershman, Martin Davidson', 'Jennifer Miller', 'Ellen Burstyn, Sheryl Lee, Tim Guinee, Eric Schweig, Andy Stahl, Tyler Noyes, Gabriel Macht, Tony Amendola', null, 'Mary Ingles is pregnant when she and her two sons are captured from their homestead in Virginia''s Blue Ridge Mountains by Shawnee Indians. Her husband, Will, narrowly escapes death during the attack. Impressed by her grace under the pressure of captivity, Wildcat, the Shawnee chief, confers special privileges on Mary and her children, eventually proposing that Mary become his mate. Surprised by her attraction to the handsome brave, Mary nonetheless opts to remain faithful to Will and engineers a plan for her escape. Separated from her children, Mary joins another female settler, and together they embark on a harrowing homeward trek. Her odyssey comes full circle more than a decade later when she is finally reunited with her long-lost children.', 'Mary Ingles is pregnant when she and her two sons are captured from their homestead in Virginia''s Blue Ridge Mountains by Shawnee Indians. Her husband, Will, narrowly escapes death during the attack. Impressed by her grace under the pressure of captivity, Wildcat, the Shawnee chief, confers special privileges on Mary and her children, eventually proposing that Mary become his mate. Surprised by her attraction to the handsome brave, Mary nonetheless opts to remain faithful to Will and engineers a plan for her escape. Separated from her children, Mary joins another female settler, and together they embark on a harrowing homeward trek. Her odyssey comes full circle more than a decade later when she is finally reunited with her long-lost children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47o1Q8ycevDh9hldyh28rCbMvA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139949'),
  ('400654369229470610', 'Follow Your Heart', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cristina Comencini, Roberto Forza', 'Roberta Mazzoni, Cristina Comencini', 'Virna Lisi, Margherita Buy, Galatea Ranzi, Massimo Ghini, Tchéky Karyo, Valentina Chico, Lavinia Guglielman, Valeria Sabel', null, 'The complicated travails of several generations of Italian women provide the basis for this drama that is based on a novel by Susanna Tamaro. It begins with the peaceful death of Olga, the elderly family matriarch. Marta, her granddaughter returns from the US to attend the funeral and once in Olga''s villa in Trieste, begins reading her grandmother''s diary. Olga''s story unfolds via flashback. As a young woman, Oldga had to marry Antonio a man she didn''t love. Later she became passionately involved with a handsome doctor at the local spa. He impregnates her and shortly thereafter dies in a terrible car wreck. The result of their love is Illaria, who grows up to be terribly neurotic. She bears Marta and then she too dies in an automobile accident, leaving Marta to be raised by Olga.', 'The complicated travails of several generations of Italian women provide the basis for this drama that is based on a novel by Susanna Tamaro. It begins with the peaceful death of Olga, the elderly family matriarch. Marta, her granddaughter returns from the US to attend the funeral and once in Olga''s villa in Trieste, begins reading her grandmother''s diary. Olga''s story unfolds via flashback. As a young woman, Oldga had to marry Antonio a man she didn''t love. Later she became passionately involved with a handsome doctor at the local spa. He impregnates her and shortly thereafter dies in a terrible car wreck. The result of their love is Illaria, who grows up to be terribly neurotic. She bears Marta and then she too dies in an automobile accident, leaving Marta to be raised by Olga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubAuHoWjb88JbBphXedrp35ojZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79174'),
  ('947439812843031242', 'Follow Your Heart', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Sandra L. Martin', 'Sandra L. Martin, D.F.W. Buckingham', 'Galadriel Stineman, Kevin Joy, Jonathan Patrick Moore, Madison Lawlor, Karla Mosley, Laura Shatkus, Remi Hilson, Scott McLean Harrison', null, 'Kathy Yoder has left her Amish ways and is a successful travel guide writer. When Kathy goes home to settle her dad''s affairs, she''s reminded of her life before she left the Amish community, including her old love, Isaac. Will Kathy decide to stay or return to her traveling lifestyle?', 'Kathy Yoder has left her Amish ways and is a successful travel guide writer. When Kathy goes home to settle her dad''s affairs, she''s reminded of her life before she left the Amish community, including her old love, Isaac. Will Kathy decide to stay or return to her traveling lifestyle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrXxERGdMIdaWGOREVM3Wxj6gMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667682'),
  ('977228260489898247', 'Followed', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Antoine Le, Jason Soudah, Sara Monaghan', 'Todd Klick', 'Matthew Solomon, Tim Drier, Kelsey Griswold, Caitlin Grace, John Savage, Sam Valentine, Christopher Ross Martin, Sarah Chang', 'R', 'Social media influencer, ''DropTheMike'', seeks thrills and stardom in the most horrific places. When he’s offered the possibility of a lucrative sponsorship, he takes his online channel to one of the most haunted hotels in America. What begins as a fun challenge accompanied by friends descends into a personal hell, begging the timely question: how far would you go to pursue internet fame?', 'Social media influencer, ''DropTheMike'', seeks thrills and stardom in the most horrific places. When he’s offered the possibility of a lucrative sponsorship, he takes his online channel to one of the most haunted hotels in America. What begins as a fun challenge accompanied by friends descends into a personal hell, begging the timely question: how far would you go to pursue internet fame?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3B2twt8I02cLAPHG6dkDpTFbgz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521531'),
  ('916438601133569693', 'Following', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Christopher Nolan, Christopher Nolan', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Jeremy Theobald, Alex Haw, Lucy Russell, John Nolan, Dick Bradsell, Gillian El-Kadi, Jennifer Angel, Nicolas Carlotti', 'R', 'Bill, an idle, unemployed aspiring writer, walks the crowded streets of London following randomly chosen strangers, a seemingly innocent entertainment that becomes dangerous when he crosses paths with a mysterious character.', 'Bill, an idle, unemployed aspiring writer, walks the crowded streets of London following randomly chosen strangers, a seemingly innocent entertainment that becomes dangerous when he crosses paths with a mysterious character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bX6VVSMf0dvzk5pMT4ALG5A92d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11660'),
  ('493761027083069679', 'Following', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Kim Se-hwi, Park Sung-ju, Kim Hyo-seong', 'Kim Se-hwi', 'Byun Yo-han, Shin Hye-sun, Lee El, Yoon Byung-hee, Lee Chang-won, Shim Dal-gi, Kim Mi-hye, Park Myung-hoon', null, 'A realtor who loves sneaking into people''s homes finds the dead body of a scamming social media influencer – can he find out who did it?', 'A realtor who loves sneaking into people''s homes finds the dead body of a scamming social media influencer – can he find out who did it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TSnW71f1J63XgtZIHojLcclm7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743815'),
  ('593410781377856596', 'Folly to Be Wise', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Frank Launder, Jack Hildyard', 'Frank Launder, John Dighton', 'Alastair Sim, Elizabeth Allan, Roland Culver, George Cole, Colin Gordon, Martita Hunt, Janet Brown, Peter Martyn', null, 'A newly-arrived army chaplain is put in charge of camp entertainment and has the idea of putting on a Brains Trust with local notables. Unfortunately for him, it emerges from a question on the rights and wrongs of marriage that there is more going on between three of the panelists than he wants to know about - though the audience obviously thinks differently.', 'A newly-arrived army chaplain is put in charge of camp entertainment and has the idea of putting on a Brains Trust with local notables. Unfortunately for him, it emerges from a question on the rights and wrongs of marriage that there is more going on between three of the panelists than he wants to know about - though the audience obviously thinks differently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2R7mXfTT4q96wMFRxxNevalFciw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175126'),
  ('385301195219868440', 'Foney Fables', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Frank Graham', null, 'A series of fractured fairy tales vignettes.', 'A series of fractured fairy tales vignettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLGm4rd3yviiZ0r5DnBHfLG53bA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236639'),
  ('1118343589239285705', 'Fonissa', 2023, 'Drama', 'Panagiotis Vasilakis, Eva Nathena', 'Katerina Bei', 'Karyofyllia Karabeti, Maria Protopappa, Elena Topalidou, Penelope Tsilika, Georgianna Dalara, Christos Stergioglou, Stathis Stamoulakatos, Dimitris Imellos', null, 'It is the early 20th century on a dystopian Greek island. Hadoula, a widow who lost her husband, loannis Fragkos, at a young age, is a woman who has learned how to survive in a male-dominated and extremely patriarchal society. Hadoula carries a difficult burden within her. Like a baton passed on to her from her mother, and the generations before her, she is meant to accept the belittling and degradation of women. Hadoula reacts. Her personal, internal revolution soon comes forth. The victims of her outburst are the little girls of the island, whom she sets free from the social and economic burden that their existence entails by taking their lives. Her actions will bring her face to face with the law. She leaves her home and escapes to her refuge, nature. But as much as her faith and morals dictate that she did the right thing, her trans-generational trauma follows her everywhere. And the end comes as redemption.', 'It is the early 20th century on a dystopian Greek island. Hadoula, a widow who lost her husband, loannis Fragkos, at a young age, is a woman who has learned how to survive in a male-dominated and extremely patriarchal society. Hadoula carries a difficult burden within her. Like a baton passed on to her from her mother, and the generations before her, she is meant to accept the belittling and degradation of women. Hadoula reacts. Her personal, internal revolution soon comes forth. The victims of her outburst are the little girls of the island, whom she sets free from the social and economic burden that their existence entails by taking their lives. Her actions will bring her face to face with the law. She leaves her home and escapes to her refuge, nature. But as much as her faith and morals dictate that she did the right thing, her trans-generational trauma follows her everywhere. And the end comes as redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mqv3FZSiHXOjpee7pNNNUUJFm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196489'),
  ('1136874292927300413', 'Fonzy', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Isabelle Doval, Gilles Henry', 'Isabelle Doval, José Garcia, Karine de Demo', 'José Garcia, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Audrey Fleurot, Gérard Hernandez, Alice Belaïdi, Alison Wheeler, Hugo Dessioux, Arnaud Tsamere', null, 'Set in Paris, a man working in fish delivery becomes involved in a legal battle with his sperm donations.', 'Set in Paris, a man working in fish delivery becomes involved in a legal battle with his sperm donations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5GZFcA1KgwU5yudqBp7htPLrUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200823'),
  ('193747781790632737', 'Foo Fighters: Back and Forth', 2011, 'Documentary, Music', 'James Moll', null, 'Dave Grohl, Chris Shiflett, Pat Smear, Taylor Hawkins, Nate Mendel, Bob Mould', null, 'FOO FIGHTERS BACK AND FORTH chronicles the 16 year history of the Foo Fighters: from the band''s very first songs created as cassette demos Dave Grohl recorded during his tenure as Nirvana''s drummer, through its ascent to their Grammy-winning, multi-platinum, arena and stadium headlining status as one of the biggest rock bands on the planet.', 'FOO FIGHTERS BACK AND FORTH chronicles the 16 year history of the Foo Fighters: from the band''s very first songs created as cassette demos Dave Grohl recorded during his tenure as Nirvana''s drummer, through its ascent to their Grammy-winning, multi-platinum, arena and stadium headlining status as one of the biggest rock bands on the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9t11iPy8Mo5O4yHorqcKXXDLwtt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61488'),
  ('256659980677446376', 'Foo Fighters: Live At Wembley Stadium', 2008, 'Music', 'Nick Wickham', null, 'Dave Grohl, Nate Mendel, Chris Shiflett, Taylor Hawkins, Pat Smear, Jimmy Page, John Paul Jones', null, 'Foo Fighters captured over their two sold-out nights at Wembley on 6th and 7th June, 2008.', 'Foo Fighters captured over their two sold-out nights at Wembley on 6th and 7th June, 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRpGDqyX9DpUT6SjT6udnpz7wYj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22258'),
  ('754382143802883445', 'Food', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Ludvík Šváb, Josef Fiala, Bedřich Glaser, Jan Kraus, Pavel Marek, Jaromír Kallista, Karel Hamr, Marie Zemanová', null, 'Examines the human relationship with food by showing breakfast, lunch, and dinner.', 'Examines the human relationship with food by showing breakfast, lunch, and dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4KGIZeBjbJq9cH7uWlzSAqhjZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60316'),
  ('728443462226095135', 'Food and Shelter', 2015, 'Drama', 'Juan Miguel del Castillo', 'Juan Miguel del Castillo', 'Natalia de Molina, Mariana Cordero, Montse Torrent, Natalia Roig, Mercedes Hoyos, Manuel Tallafé, Vidal Sancho, Gaspar Campuzano', null, 'A single mother struggles to pay the rent and put food on the table for her 10 year old son.', 'A single mother struggles to pay the rent and put food on the table for her 10 year old son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oM9HCaTypbH4ZdKdmYPThvx9pUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331641'),
  ('458446479419369310', 'Food Chains', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Sanjay Rawal', null, 'Forest Whitaker, Eric Schlosser, Eva Longoria, Kerry Kennedy, Robert F. Kennedy Jr., V', null, 'This call to arms documentary details the questionable ethics of the food supply industry, pointing out the power of huge supermarket chains to dictate low wages and inhumane labor conditions for farmworkers in the United States.', 'This call to arms documentary details the questionable ethics of the food supply industry, pointing out the power of huge supermarket chains to dictate low wages and inhumane labor conditions for farmworkers in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibue9QCounLfYJW6Lwnf6lxGcZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292539'),
  ('1129986625676019080', 'Food Choices', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Michal Siewierski', 'Michal Siewierski', 'Pam Popper, T. Colin Campbell, Joe Cross, Ashlee Piper, John McDougall, Michael Greger, RIch Roll, Hillary Biscay', null, 'This documentary explores the impact that food choices have on people''s health, the health of our planet and on the lives of other living species. And also discusses several misconceptions about food and diet.', 'This documentary explores the impact that food choices have on people''s health, the health of our planet and on the lives of other living species. And also discusses several misconceptions about food and diet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gU1TfrhkrkaHYr5M1VIxAV7EIH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393961'),
  ('990897799033921363', 'Food for Feudin''', 1950, 'Animation, Family', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Chip and Dale are busy collecting nuts and hiding them in a tree, when Pluto comes along and tries to hide his bone in the same tree. When all of the nuts end up in Pluto''s dog house, Chip and Dale must come up with a way to get the nuts back.', 'Chip and Dale are busy collecting nuts and hiding them in a tree, when Pluto comes along and tries to hide his bone in the same tree. When all of the nuts end up in Pluto''s dog house, Chip and Dale must come up with a way to get the nuts back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc6RlzWvqzotGHj9nuT03DrOFW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74965'),
  ('5326606834196781', 'Food for Profit', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Pablo D''Ambrosi, Giulia Innocenzi, Krishna Agazzi', 'Giulia Innocenzi, Pablo D''Ambrosi', null, null, 'The film exposes the links between Agrifood and politics. With a pool of international experts it analyses the many problems related to factory farming: water pollution, migrants exploitation, biodiversity loss and antibiotic resistance.', 'The film exposes the links between Agrifood and politics. With a pool of international experts it analyses the many problems related to factory farming: water pollution, migrants exploitation, biodiversity loss and antibiotic resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46ezC4wp3QPSL7zVzPpUWWWt2GF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250096'),
