  ('927408200093868889', 'Food of the Gods II', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Damian Lee, Curtis Petersen', 'Mike Werb, Richard Bennett', 'Paul Coufos, Lisa Schrage, Réal Andrews, Stuart Hughes, Karen Hines, Frank Pellegrino, Jackie Burroughs, Sean Mitchell', 'R', 'A growth hormone experiment gets out of hand, when the the resulting giant man-eating rats escape, reaking havoc on the unsuspecting campus. Much blood-letting follows.', 'A growth hormone experiment gets out of hand, when the the resulting giant man-eating rats escape, reaking havoc on the unsuspecting campus. Much blood-letting follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qraPjfqWfNNBQsXIqRfCTv52LMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68347'),
  ('908604124308482768', 'Food Truck: Stolen Love... and Moo Deng', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chaleumpol Tikumpornteerawong, Watcharapong Pattama, Chanon Yingyong', 'Parrames Samranrom', 'Mario Maurer, Choi Yu-lee, Chaleumpol Tikumpornteerawong, Padung Songsang, Pachchun Hiranprateep, Deedeed Piamwiriyakul, Warawich Chanthamenchai, Petchtai Wongkamlao', null, 'Jake and Bobby, with the art director by the truck, don''t know their vehicle will force Mamiew to face his past once more.', 'Jake and Bobby, with the art director by the truck, don''t know their vehicle will force Mamiew to face his past once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOhSmHSEm0iVQ2AdG5SkjXnsvUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1522496'),
  ('819635866102954466', 'Food Will Win the War', 1942, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Hamilton Luske', null, 'Fred Shields', 'NR', 'World War II propaganda film on the importance of American farming. A morale booster film stressing the abudance of American agricultural output.', 'World War II propaganda film on the importance of American farming. A morale booster film stressing the abudance of American agricultural output.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSPd2r3FMSpdopGNiktpnn9iM6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64659'),
  ('455471769528197723', 'Food, Inc.', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Robert Kenner, Richard Pearce', 'Elise Pearlstein, Kim Roberts, Robert Kenner', 'Michael Pollan, Eric Schlosser, Richard Lobb, Vince Edwards, Carole Morison', 'PG', 'Documentary filmmaker Robert Kenner examines how mammoth corporations have taken over all aspects of the food chain in the United States, from the farms where our food is grown to the chain restaurants and supermarkets where it''s sold. Narrated by author and activist Eric Schlosser, the film features interviews with average Americans about their dietary habits, commentary from food experts like Michael Pollan and unsettling footage shot inside large-scale animal processing plants.', 'Documentary filmmaker Robert Kenner examines how mammoth corporations have taken over all aspects of the food chain in the United States, from the farms where our food is grown to the chain restaurants and supermarkets where it''s sold. Narrated by author and activist Eric Schlosser, the film features interviews with average Americans about their dietary habits, commentary from food experts like Michael Pollan and unsettling footage shot inside large-scale animal processing plants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdwN4o7OGAZGJw9T64lRAGTEP8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18570'),
  ('756754783371472261', 'Foodfight!', 2012, 'Adventure, Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Lawrence Kasanoff', 'Brent V. Friedman, Rebecca Swanson, Sean Catherine Derek', 'Charlie Sheen, Hilary Duff, Eva Longoria, Wayne Brady, Christopher Lloyd, Chris Kattan, Larry Miller, Ed Asner', 'PG', 'The evil Brand X joins a supermarket that becomes a city after closing time.', 'The evil Brand X joins a supermarket that becomes a city after closing time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/to9ggXVyhNTCICHcHMCtFtANd8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116977'),
  ('361888373514328197', 'Foodiverse', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Wang Boxue, Liaoyu Chen', null, 'Liu Sitong, Bo Sun, Wu Xu', null, 'Grab your space helmet and blast off into a fantastical adventure set in a distant galaxy made entirely of food: the FOODIVERSE! When a maniacal super villan sets out to dominate the foodiverse, our heroes Miss Penny, a little dumpling, and her bestie Mr. Podge, a tubby pork bun, are bound to embark on an intergalactic mission to save the homes they hold so dear.', 'Grab your space helmet and blast off into a fantastical adventure set in a distant galaxy made entirely of food: the FOODIVERSE! When a maniacal super villan sets out to dominate the foodiverse, our heroes Miss Penny, a little dumpling, and her bestie Mr. Podge, a tubby pork bun, are bound to embark on an intergalactic mission to save the homes they hold so dear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgueB7u35bAYawTsSUvqLLdDWN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549644'),
  ('29624573013870017', 'Fool Circle', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Vincent Mariette, Julien Roux', 'Vincent Mariette', 'Ludivine Sagnier, Laurent Lafitte, Vincent Macaigne, Noémie Lvovsky, Dominique Reymond, Anne Azoulay, Philippe Rebbot, Délia Espinat-Dief', null, 'Two, very different, brothers are reunited for their father''s funeral. But, when they arrive at the crematorium nobody is there, not even the corpse, except for Chloe who introduces herself as their sister.', 'Two, very different, brothers are reunited for their father''s funeral. But, when they arrive at the crematorium nobody is there, not even the corpse, except for Chloe who introduces herself as their sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5UvkMsv01MR5p2nzlGdU9nMAlj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274483'),
  ('657047599746073990', 'Fool Coverage', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Daffy Duck is an insurance peddler, who arrives uninvited at Porky Pig''s door to persuade him to purchase an accident policy on the pretext that his home is loaded with hazards. When Porky rejects Daffy''s claim that accidents in the home are "waiting" to happen, Daffy rigs some.', 'Daffy Duck is an insurance peddler, who arrives uninvited at Porky Pig''s door to persuade him to purchase an accident policy on the pretext that his home is loaded with hazards. When Porky rejects Daffy''s claim that accidents in the home are "waiting" to happen, Daffy rigs some.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZjdSgz5Vgb6hpuQtG7B6Gf6cgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235933'),
  ('666767558858882565', 'Fool for Love', 1985, 'Drama', 'Robert Altman, Pierre Mignot', 'Sam Shepard', 'Sam Shepard, Kim Basinger, Harry Dean Stanton, Randy Quaid, Martha Crawford, Louise Egolf, Sura Cox, Jonathan Skinner', 'R', 'A woman is waiting in a motel for her boyfriend, when an old flame turns up and tries to take her back to the life she is trying to leave behind.', 'A woman is waiting in a motel for her boyfriend, when an old flame turns up and tries to take her back to the life she is trying to leave behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZciKF71Fa96kx7UZ3nl57pgkdA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71125'),
  ('1101928569217709469', 'Fool N Final', 2007, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ahmed Khan, Johny Lal', 'Neeraj Vora, Anurag Kashyap', 'Shahid Kapoor, Ayesha Takia, Sunny Deol, Vivek Oberoi, Om Puri, Sharmila Tagore, Arbaaz Khan, Chunky Panday', null, 'A bunch of misfits and gangsters embarks on a journey to find a lost and stolen diamond.', 'A bunch of misfits and gangsters embarks on a journey to find a lost and stolen diamond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GA1DrCFEOw99h0acpdiWcmG8jf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156288'),
  ('859346867702220660', 'Fool''s Gold', 2008, 'Adventure, Romance, Comedy', 'Andy Tennant, Don Burgess, Ray Chan', 'Andy Tennant, Daniel Zelman, John Claflin', 'Matthew McConaughey, Kate Hudson, Donald Sutherland, Alexis Dziena, Ewen Bremner, Ray Winstone, Kevin Hart, Malcolm-Jamal Warner', 'PG-13', 'Treasure hunter Ben "Finn" Finnegan has sunk his marriage to Tess and his trusty boat in his obsessive quest to find the legendary Queen''s Dowry. When he finds a vital clue that may finally pinpoint the treasure''s whereabouts, he drags Tess and her boss, billionaire Nigel Honeycutt, along on the hunt. But Finn is not the only one interested in the gold; his former mentor-turned-enemy Moe Fitch, hired by rapper-turned-gangster Bigg Bunny, will stop at nothing to beat him to it.', 'Treasure hunter Ben "Finn" Finnegan has sunk his marriage to Tess and his trusty boat in his obsessive quest to find the legendary Queen''s Dowry. When he finds a vital clue that may finally pinpoint the treasure''s whereabouts, he drags Tess and her boss, billionaire Nigel Honeycutt, along on the hunt. But Finn is not the only one interested in the gold; his former mentor-turned-enemy Moe Fitch, hired by rapper-turned-gangster Bigg Bunny, will stop at nothing to beat him to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4djEBW3nyGRPLTcDlWYyaO43mx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8676'),
  ('199753337830778545', 'Fool’s Mate', 1956, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jacques Rivette, Jean-Marie Straub, Charles L. Bitsch', 'Jacques Rivette, Charles L. Bitsch', 'Virginie Vitry, Anne Doat, Jean-Claude Brialy, Jacques Doniol-Valcroze, François Truffaut, Jean-Luc Godard, Robert Lachenay, Claude Chabrol', null, 'Claire is a chic young Parisian woman married to a somewhat older husband, Jean. Claire meets her lover, Claude, at his apartment, where he gifts her a fur coat. Now Claire needs to figure out how to return home with this expensive gift without the affair being found out.', 'Claire is a chic young Parisian woman married to a somewhat older husband, Jean. Claire meets her lover, Claude, at his apartment, where he gifts her a fur coat. Now Claire needs to figure out how to return home with this expensive gift without the affair being found out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vsReHIaZES7RgYPuAYNktTEwMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49701'),
  ('211006518599522253', 'Fool''s Paradise', 2023, 'Comedy', 'James Currier, Alex Terzic, Marc Scizak', 'Charlie Day', 'Charlie Day, Ken Jeong, Kate Beckinsale, Adrien Brody, Jason Sudeikis, Ray Liotta, Steve Coulter, Jason Bateman', 'R', 'A down-on-his-luck publicist discovers a recently released mental health patient who looks just like a misbehaving movie star. The publicist subs him into a film, creating a new star. But fame and fortune are not all they are cracked up to be.', 'A down-on-his-luck publicist discovers a recently released mental health patient who looks just like a misbehaving movie star. The publicist subs him into a film, creating a new star. But fame and fortune are not all they are cracked up to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPv4KYbcG16xmr2Q0rlV2Brqh6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553147'),
  ('1141054837590568749', 'Foolish', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dave Meyers', null, 'Master P, Eddie Griffin, Amie Petersen, Frank Sivero, Daphnée Duplaix Samuel, Jonathan Banks, Andrew Dice Clay, Sven-Ole Thorsen', null, '''Foolish'' Waise is a talented comedian with a hard-edge trying to make it in the comedy clubs in LA while his brother is a hard-nosed gangster trying to make it on the streets. With all the competition they face in their chosen "professions," their biggest battle is with each other over the love of a pretty girl.', '''Foolish'' Waise is a talented comedian with a hard-edge trying to make it in the comedy clubs in LA while his brother is a hard-nosed gangster trying to make it on the streets. With all the competition they face in their chosen "professions," their biggest battle is with each other over the love of a pretty girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCBsJyLnZbnlfwooB5733LLXF24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27455'),
  ('651490357097301062', 'Foolish Wives', 1922, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Erich von Stroheim, William H. Daniels, Edward Sowders', 'Erich von Stroheim, Erich von Stroheim', 'Erich von Stroheim, Rudolph Christians, Miss DuPont, Maude George, Mae Busch, Dale Fuller, Cesare Gravina, Malvina Polo', null, 'A con artist masquerades as Russian nobility and attempts to seduce the wife of an American diplomat.', 'A con artist masquerades as Russian nobility and attempts to seduce the wife of an American diplomat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esdMep54xAUYUE4CCktAh2Rh3gk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35227'),
  ('634271157548776796', 'Foolish Years', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zoran Čalić', 'Zoran Čalić', 'Rialda Kadrić, Vladimir Petrović, Dragomir ''Gidra'' Bojanić, Marko Todorović, Velimir Živojinović, Ljubiša Samardžić, Darinka ''Dara'' Čalenić, Milan Srdoč', null, 'Teenagers Marija and Boba fall in love. When Marija gets pregnant, Boba''s friends come up with a plan to help the young couple out.', 'Teenagers Marija and Boba fall in love. When Marija gets pregnant, Boba''s friends come up with a plan to help the young couple out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bw6ov1RZGevj4CLO58ww3ZVQ5b1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55111'),
  ('197414942347470022', 'Foolproof', 2003, 'Action', 'William Phillips, Derek Rogers, William Spahic', 'William Phillips', 'Ryan Reynolds, Kristin Booth, Joris Jarsky, David Suchet, David Hewlett, James Allodi, Sean Sullivan, Tara Slone', 'R', 'Kevin, Sam and Rob have an unusual hobby: planning foolproof heists, without intending to actually perform them. The game goes wrong when their latest plan is stolen and carried out. Things get even worse when a mysterious man approaches them with an offer: plan a heist for him, or go to jail. As the clock ticks, they find that the risk might be higher than just their freedom.', 'Kevin, Sam and Rob have an unusual hobby: planning foolproof heists, without intending to actually perform them. The game goes wrong when their latest plan is stolen and carried out. Things get even worse when a mysterious man approaches them with an offer: plan a heist for him, or go to jail. As the clock ticks, they find that the risk might be higher than just their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gudhSz8sDzRXxHY5XchllQKxw77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14527'),
  ('536562483704004569', 'Fools in the Mountains', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Edith Carlmar', 'Otto Carlmar', 'Leif Juster, Unni Bernhoft, Frank Robert, Anne Lise Christiansen, Nanna Stenersen, Anne Lise Wang, Einar Sissener, Willie Hoel', null, 'At a high mountain hotel in Norway, porter Poppe tries to do the best he can for the guests with an often unhelpful piccolo Rudolf. This, however, leads to a lot of problems, and Poppe thinks some of the guests behave inappropriate.', 'At a high mountain hotel in Norway, porter Poppe tries to do the best he can for the guests with an often unhelpful piccolo Rudolf. This, however, leads to a lot of problems, and Poppe thinks some of the guests behave inappropriate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rvAOLB3uG8cAMGXPj2K8jq8AtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56697'),
  ('925523535754962580', 'Fools Rush In', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Andy Tennant, Robbie Greenberg, Scott Printz', 'Katherine Reback', 'Matthew Perry, Salma Hayek Pinault, Jon Tenney, Carlos Gómez, Tomas Milian, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, John Bennett Perry, Stanley DeSantis', 'PG-13', 'After a one night stand with Alex, Isabel realizes that she is pregnant and they decide to get married. However, along with the marriage comes compromise of one''s own cultural traditions.', 'After a one night stand with Alex, Isabel realizes that she is pregnant and they decide to get married. However, along with the marriage comes compromise of one''s own cultural traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcRaMjWoF8K7h1LqOH7FOOLRQ3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1968'),
  ('319302188214463849', 'Fools'' Parade', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, Hawk Koch, Harry Stradling Jr.', 'James Lee Barrett', 'James Stewart, George Kennedy, Anne Baxter, Strother Martin, Kurt Russell, Katherine Cannon, David Huddleston, Mike Kellin', 'G', 'When a trio of ex-convicts led by Mattie Appleyard is released from prison, they hope to open a general store using money Mattie has saved during his 40-year sentence. This attempt is met with great resistance from a corrupt prison official and the banker who issued Mattie the check.', 'When a trio of ex-convicts led by Mattie Appleyard is released from prison, they hope to open a general store using money Mattie has saved during his 40-year sentence. This attempt is met with great resistance from a corrupt prison official and the banker who issued Mattie the check.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gffMBBnlXu3tPSzxevaPadlusiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65502'),
  ('292223689172483545', 'Foontic and the Detectives', 1986, 'Animation', 'Anatoliy Solin', 'Yuriy Fridman, Valeri Shulzhik', 'Zoya Pylnova, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Irina Muravyova, Olga Aroseva, Raisa Mukhametshina, Spartak Mishulin, Yuri Volyntsev, Anatoliy Barantsev', null, 'About how the evil and greedy owner of the department store "Tears of a Child" Mrs. Belladonna tried to steal away escaped Foontic from the clown Fokus-Mokus.', 'About how the evil and greedy owner of the department store "Tears of a Child" Mrs. Belladonna tried to steal away escaped Foontic from the clown Fokus-Mokus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hwEKGZVXOyyt4d8z3TX3VongUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222011'),
  ('132998184329330875', 'Foontic at the Сircus', 1988, 'Animation', 'Anatoliy Solin', null, 'Zoya Pylnova, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Irina Muravyova, Olga Aroseva, Raisa Mukhametshina, Spartak Mishulin, Yuri Volyntsev, Anatoliy Barantsev', null, 'Foontic and his new friends once again outwit the evil Mrs. Belladonna, who, under the influence of sleeping pills, is taken in the middle of the night in their car to the Three Roads roadside hotel and handed over to her old friend, an equally greedy and cynical businessman named Durillo. When she regains consciousness, Belladonna resumes her pursuit of Foontic, who, together with the kind-hearted clown Mokus, the clever monkey Bambino, and the hippopotamus Chocolate, is preparing to put on a grand circus show in the city.', 'Foontic and his new friends once again outwit the evil Mrs. Belladonna, who, under the influence of sleeping pills, is taken in the middle of the night in their car to the Three Roads roadside hotel and handed over to her old friend, an equally greedy and cynical businessman named Durillo. When she regains consciousness, Belladonna resumes her pursuit of Foontic, who, together with the kind-hearted clown Mokus, the clever monkey Bambino, and the hippopotamus Chocolate, is preparing to put on a grand circus show in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnJ77OrgpwX7r5D58wuKleOGZui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222013'),
