  ('305673402035602119', 'Football (Now and Then)', 1953, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Dennis Day', 'NR', 'An old-timer tells his grandson that old-time football players could take a modern team, so we see a game with just that match-up: Bygone U. vs. Present State. More specifically, the Bygone U. team of 11 vs. Present State''s dozens of special squads and support personnel. Even the stadium, fans, and press are modern vs. old-time. The game is close, and fiercely fought.', 'An old-timer tells his grandson that old-time football players could take a modern team, so we see a game with just that match-up: Bygone U. vs. Present State. More specifically, the Bygone U. team of 11 vs. Present State''s dozens of special squads and support personnel. Even the stadium, fans, and press are modern vs. old-time. The game is close, and fiercely fought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtFa0nVQILp9d3vhXQ9GKzEcjxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57220'),
  ('910010987596810048', 'Football 17776', 2026, 'Science Fiction', 'Apollo Nava, Juliette Dias', 'Apollo Nava', 'Tyler Riggers, Juliette Dias, Dallas Ordulu, Maya Vasquez, Alvin Flang', 'PG-13', 'In the distant future, three sentient space probes observe two humans traveling to watch an evolved form of American football.', 'In the distant future, three sentient space probes observe two humans traveling to watch an evolved form of American football.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1X84NZKkwW72Fq7owNKRHmo5V7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1625253'),
  ('472404655352206917', 'Football or Me', 2017, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Adriana Vior, Marcos Carnevale, Santiago Boskovich', 'Adrián Suar, Marcos Carnevale', 'Adrián Suar, Julieta Díaz, Federico D''Elía, Peto Menahem, Alfredo Casero, Rafael Spregelburd, Dalia Gutmann, Giuliana Scaglione', null, 'A sports fan loses everything for being addicted to his team and soccer. He then starts a quest to find a cure and recover his wife''s love.', 'A sports fan loses everything for being addicted to his team and soccer. He then starts a quest to find a cure and recover his wife''s love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwKUS69UvdWUdr4ADeqCPv9lFih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467634'),
  ('800640403199226671', 'Football Rules Ok', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Tomy Wigand, Diethard Prengel', 'Matthias Dinter, Martin Ritzenhoff', 'Uwe Ochsenknecht, Ralf Richter, Oscar Ortega Sánchez, Walter Gontermann, Michael Sideris, Tana Schanzara, Tobias Schenke, Marita Marschall', null, 'For Hans Pollack and his friends, soccer is the most wonderful hobby in the world. They all worship the world-class forward Pablo Dios. Their adoration goes so far that it makes them forget the birth of a daughter, gamble away a house, "accidentally" kidnap the rich and arrogant football star, and tear apart the family. However, Pablo and Hans gradually develop an unlikely friendship...', 'For Hans Pollack and his friends, soccer is the most wonderful hobby in the world. They all worship the world-class forward Pablo Dios. Their adoration goes so far that it makes them forget the birth of a daughter, gamble away a house, "accidentally" kidnap the rich and arrogant football star, and tear apart the family. However, Pablo and Hans gradually develop an unlikely friendship...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkey0NrYt1ZtYIVyQ5eGpXoxkM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1612'),
  ('738379148354558859', 'Footlight Parade', 1933, 'Comedy, Music', 'Lloyd Bacon, George Barnes, Gordon Hollingshead', 'Peter Milne', 'James Cagney, Joan Blondell, Ruby Keeler, Dick Powell, Frank McHugh, Guy Kibbee, Ruth Donnelly, Hugh Herbert', 'NR', 'A fledgling producer finds himself at odds with his workers, financiers and his greedy ex-wife when he tries to produce live musicals for movie-going audiences.', 'A fledgling producer finds himself at odds with his workers, financiers and his greedy ex-wife when he tries to produce live musicals for movie-going audiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i03jv70icLoxJiwkqcFsLmmmrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28432'),
  ('122250205106681576', 'Footloose', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Herbert Ross, Ric Waite, Donald Hauer', 'Dean Pitchford', 'Kevin Bacon, Lori Singer, John Lithgow, Dianne Wiest, Chris Penn, Sarah Jessica Parker, John Laughlin, Elizabeth Gorcey', 'PG', 'When teenager Ren and his family move from big-city Chicago to a small town in the West, he''s in for a real case of culture shock after discovering he''s living in a place where music and dancing are illegal.', 'When teenager Ren and his family move from big-city Chicago to a small town in the West, he''s in for a real case of culture shock after discovering he''s living in a place where music and dancing are illegal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JEDjBCXCx3eKTSkXwispf0UN3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1788'),
  ('912983393376615512', 'Footloose', 2011, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Craig Brewer, G.A. Aguilar, Amy Vincent', 'Craig Brewer, Dean Pitchford', 'Dennis Quaid, Kenny Wormald, Julianne Hough, Andie MacDowell, Miles Teller, Ray McKinnon, Patrick John Flueger, Kim Dickens', 'PG-13', 'Ren MacCormack is transplanted from Boston to the small southern town of Bomont where loud music and dancing are prohibited. Not one to bow to the status quo, Ren challenges the ban, revitalizing the town and falling in love with the minister’s troubled daughter Ariel in the process.', 'Ren MacCormack is transplanted from Boston to the small southern town of Bomont where loud music and dancing are prohibited. Not one to bow to the status quo, Ren challenges the ban, revitalizing the town and falling in love with the minister’s troubled daughter Ariel in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDUW5RWmyHcTxu7eg9eMqhBQy2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68817'),
  ('930718168622081147', 'Footnote', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Joseph Cedar, Shir Shoshani, Hila Yuval', 'Joseph Cedar', 'Shlomo Bar-Aba, Lior Ashkenazi, Aliza Rosen, Alma Zak, Micah Lewensohn, Nevo Kimchi, Yuval Scharf, Daniel Markovich', 'PG', 'Jerusalem, Israel. Professors Eliezer and Uriel Shkolnik, father and son, have dedicated their lives to the study of the Jewish scriptures. Eliezer is a stubborn and methodical scholar who has never been recognized for his work; Uriel is a rising star, someone admired and praised by his colleagues. The fragile balance that has kept their personal relationship almost intact is broken in an unexpected way by a simple phone call.', 'Jerusalem, Israel. Professors Eliezer and Uriel Shkolnik, father and son, have dedicated their lives to the study of the Jewish scriptures. Eliezer is a stubborn and methodical scholar who has never been recognized for his work; Uriel is a rising star, someone admired and praised by his colleagues. The fragile balance that has kept their personal relationship almost intact is broken in an unexpected way by a simple phone call.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qy0W1KssDhGbtisBGKZHlcuuYqn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72551'),
  ('1099874943599397583', 'Footnotes', 2016, 'Music, Comedy', 'Paul Calori, Kostia Testut', 'Paul Calori, Kostia Testut', 'Pauline Étienne, Olivier Chantreau, Julie Victor, François Morel, Loïc Corbery, Clémentine Yelnik, Sophie Tabakov, Nadine Emin', null, 'When Julie finally lands a job at a luxury shoemaker, her dreams of stability collapse as the owner threatens to close the factory. Together with an intrepid group of women, they decide to resist, bringing back to life a bold and elegant shoe model to save the renowned brand. But when Samy, a young truck driver as wily as charming, jumps in the middle of the fight, this is no longer the same song.', 'When Julie finally lands a job at a luxury shoemaker, her dreams of stability collapse as the owner threatens to close the factory. Together with an intrepid group of women, they decide to resist, bringing back to life a bold and elegant shoe model to save the renowned brand. But when Samy, a young truck driver as wily as charming, jumps in the middle of the fight, this is no longer the same song.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPMVS9aWrgOMBPQnA7ZTHxm8MWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395599'),
  ('457462362440357440', 'Footpath', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Vikram Bhatt, Pravin Bhatt', 'Mahesh Bhatt, Girish Dhamija', 'Aftab Shivdasani, Bipasha Basu, Rahul Dev, Emraan Hashmi, Anupama Verma, Irrfan Khan, Anup Soni, Arif Zakaria', null, 'Two friends of a man help him avenge his father''s death. Years later, he reunites with his friends who have now become criminals. What they don''t know, is that he is now an undercover cop.', 'Two friends of a man help him avenge his father''s death. Years later, he reunites with his friends who have now become criminals. What they don''t know, is that he is now an undercover cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQQbUMIZNhSksdsJPIZhe8yCLXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117322'),
  ('656761621669610805', 'Footprints on the Moon', 1975, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Luigi Bazzoni, Vittorio Storaro, Umberto Angelucci', 'Luigi Bazzoni, Mario Fanelli', 'Florinda Bolkan, Peter McEnery, Nicoletta Elmi, Klaus Kinski, Lila Kedrova, Caterina Boratto, John Karlsen, Ida Galli', null, 'Alice, a young translator, finds the real world slowly merging with her recurring nightmares as she tries to solve the puzzle of her recent memory loss. A postcard leads her to the island of Garma where the locals seems to know her. Is she who she thinks she is? And what significance does her dream of an astronaut abandoned on the moon have?', 'Alice, a young translator, finds the real world slowly merging with her recurring nightmares as she tries to solve the puzzle of her recent memory loss. A postcard leads her to the island of Garma where the locals seems to know her. Is she who she thinks she is? And what significance does her dream of an astronaut abandoned on the moon have?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLEnjCTWzmxTpCgQBjuPhmkAi85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82362'),
