  ('542719443574238596', 'Footrot Flats: The Dog''s Tale', 1986, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Murray Ball', 'Murray Ball, Tom Scott', 'Peter Rowley, Rawiri Paratene, Fiona Samuel, Peter Hayden, Dorothy McKegg, Billy T. James, Brian Sergent, Marshall Napier', 'PG', 'Featuring the characters from Murray Ball''s "Footrot Flats" (New Zealands most beloved local cartoon strip), questions to be answered include: Will Wal Footrot win the affections of Cheeky Hobson over the sleazy Spit Murphy? Will the Dog win the affections of the lovely Jess? Will Wal make a good impression on the selectors at Saturday''s rugby match? Can Rangi and Pongo save Cooch''s prize stag from the depths of Blackwater Station, home of the Murphys, their vicious dogs and deadly croco-pigs? All this and more will be answered as the small town of Raupo comes to life on the big screen.', 'Featuring the characters from Murray Ball''s "Footrot Flats" (New Zealands most beloved local cartoon strip), questions to be answered include: Will Wal Footrot win the affections of Cheeky Hobson over the sleazy Spit Murphy? Will the Dog win the affections of the lovely Jess? Will Wal make a good impression on the selectors at Saturday''s rugby match? Can Rangi and Pongo save Cooch''s prize stag from the depths of Blackwater Station, home of the Murphys, their vicious dogs and deadly croco-pigs? All this and more will be answered as the small town of Raupo comes to life on the big screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xWNTZx4ght4KToWu8rAQkEK80B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20579'),
  ('882416146633363008', 'Footsteps in the Dark', 1941, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Lloyd Bacon, Ernest Haller, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Lester Cole, John Wexley', 'Errol Flynn, Brenda Marshall, Ralph Bellamy, Alan Hale, Lee Patrick, Allen Jenkins, Lucile Watson, William Frawley', 'NR', 'A high-society gent has a secret life - he writes murder mysteries and hangs out with the police attempting to solve crimes. This causes him no end of problems when his wife wants to know about his little disappearances and exceptionally late nights out.', 'A high-society gent has a secret life - he writes murder mysteries and hangs out with the police attempting to solve crimes. This causes him no end of problems when his wife wants to know about his little disappearances and exceptionally late nights out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6T0x5ygxrOMmM1Baxqn3RfiG2N5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62507'),
  ('370098087896978099', 'Footsteps in the Fog', 1955, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Arthur Lubin, Christopher Challis, Ronald Spencer', 'Dorothy Davenport, Lenore J. Coffee', 'Stewart Granger, Jean Simmons, Bill Travers, Finlay Currie, Ronald Squire, Belinda Lee, William Hartnell, Frederick Leister', 'NR', 'A Victorian-era murder mystery about a parlour maid who discovers that her employer may have killed his first wife.', 'A Victorian-era murder mystery about a parlour maid who discovers that her employer may have killed his first wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8Uu7rjm7fdUh0AUzLFTyZcyLpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44902'),
  ('110139456302553158', 'Footsteps in the Night', 1957, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Jean Yarbrough, Harry Neumann, Edward Morey Jr.', 'Elwood Ullman, Albert Band', 'Bill Elliott, Don Haggerty, Eleanore Tanin, Douglas Dick, James Flavin, Harry Tyler, Robert Shayne, Gregg Palmer', null, 'Two detectives investigate the strangulation murder of a man whom everyone seemed to like.', 'Two detectives investigate the strangulation murder of a man whom everyone seemed to like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrOZOw5rinnVhJXnXjLtL654Fl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46449'),
  ('997352019109026464', 'For 200 Grand, You Get Nothing Now', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Édouard Molinaro, Michael Epp, Philippe Guézel', 'Didier Kaminka', 'Daniel Auteuil, Gérard Jugnot, Elisa Servier, Anémone, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, François Perrot, Paul Barge, Georges Géret', null, 'After getting screwed over by life (again), two losers decide that enough is enough. Using stolen ski masks and stolen toy guns, they take hostages in their local bank, holding them for ransom. Things go well until the hostages learn what''s going on, and demand a piece of the action for themselves.', 'After getting screwed over by life (again), two losers decide that enough is enough. Using stolen ski masks and stolen toy guns, they take hostages in their local bank, holding them for ransom. Things go well until the hostages learn what''s going on, and demand a piece of the action for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZHuDYS8RBnjc3ZC67FNMruh25F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59455'),
  ('395631907647292045', 'For a Cop''s Hide', 1981, 'Thriller, Action, Romance, Crime', 'Alain Delon, Jean Tournier', 'Alain Delon, Christopher Frank', 'Alain Delon, Anne Parillaud, Daniel Ceccaldi, Jean-Pierre Darras, Xavier Depraz, Jacques Rispal, Gérard Hérold, Pierre Belot', null, 'Victim of manipulation, Cop Choucas is wanted for two murders and searched for by every cop in town.', 'Victim of manipulation, Cop Choucas is wanted for two murders and searched for by every cop in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RXZnmk4acVaUl3YRDPAcBErnK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118732'),
  ('551932601084861493', 'For a Few Bullets', 2016, 'Comedy, Mystery, Action, Romance, Adventure', 'Pan Anzi', 'Pan Anzi, Zhou Zhiyong', 'Lin Gengxin, Zhang Jingchu, Liu Xiaoqing, Kenneth Tsang, Shi Yu Fei, Vivian Dawson, Asano Nagahide, Han Pujun', null, 'When a professional thief sees his lifetime goal of being the best potentially realized in stealing a rare artifact, he finds himself entangled in a worldwide plot involving the Soviets, the Japanese and a band of outsiders. It’s up to him and a special agent to save the world!', 'When a professional thief sees his lifetime goal of being the best potentially realized in stealing a rare artifact, he finds himself entangled in a worldwide plot involving the Soviets, the Japanese and a band of outsiders. It’s up to him and a special agent to save the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5Pw0FNhwTWb2UeN2oHFnUWjOup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406099'),
  ('407368583497919775', 'For a Few Dollars More', 1965, 'Western', 'Sergio Leone, Massimo Dallamano, Fernando Di Leo', 'Sergio Leone, Luciano Vincenzoni', 'Clint Eastwood, Lee Van Cleef, Gian Maria Volonté, Luigi Pistilli, Klaus Kinski, Joseph Egger, Panos Papadopulos, Mara Krupp', 'R', 'Two bounty hunters both pursue the brutal and sadistic bandit, El Indio, who has a large bounty on his head.', 'Two bounty hunters both pursue the brutal and sadistic bandit, El Indio, who has a large bounty on his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooqASvA7qxlTVKL3KwOzBwy57Dh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938'),
  ('202003452245916879', 'For a Fistful of Fries', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime, Thriller', 'Yves Hinant, Jean Libon', 'Yves Hinant, Jean Libon', 'Anne Gruwez, Jean-Michel Lemoine', null, 'For several days, a team of police officers (backed by Judge Anne Gruwez, the revelation from their previous So Help Me God) sift through the evidence in a murder case that’s tougher than it appears. Jean Libon and Yves Hinant lead a police investigation unlike anything you’ve ever seen. With every banal turn of events, camaraderie and professionalism go hand in hand as humour meets tragedy and a handful of fries, a Tupperware container and St. Rita heighten the suspense. Hilariously scathing, yet filled with tenderness.', 'For several days, a team of police officers (backed by Judge Anne Gruwez, the revelation from their previous So Help Me God) sift through the evidence in a murder case that’s tougher than it appears. Jean Libon and Yves Hinant lead a police investigation unlike anything you’ve ever seen. With every banal turn of events, camaraderie and professionalism go hand in hand as humour meets tragedy and a handful of fries, a Tupperware container and St. Rita heighten the suspense. Hilariously scathing, yet filled with tenderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp0XrglZRMyoXOWuNF7Q6iOLqoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:873097'),
  ('156039418630507538', 'For a Good Time, Call...', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jamie Travis, James Laxton', 'Lauren Miller Rogen, Katie Anne Naylon', 'Ari Graynor, Lauren Miller Rogen, Justin Long, Mark Webber, Mimi Rogers, Don McManus, Nia Vardalos, Seth Rogen', 'R', 'College "frenemies" Lauren and Katie move in together after losing a relationship and rent control, respectively. Sharing Katie''s late grandmother''s apartment in New York City, the girls bicker with each other until one fateful night, when Katie''s noisy bedroom activities make Lauren barge in and discover a dirty little secret. This revelation brings them closer together, and Lauren (the brains) and Katie (the talent) concoct a wildly successful business venture. As profits swell, the girls reevaluate their hopes and dreams and realize that just because someone pees in your hair in college doesn''t mean she won''t be your best friend 10 years later.', 'College "frenemies" Lauren and Katie move in together after losing a relationship and rent control, respectively. Sharing Katie''s late grandmother''s apartment in New York City, the girls bicker with each other until one fateful night, when Katie''s noisy bedroom activities make Lauren barge in and discover a dirty little secret. This revelation brings them closer together, and Lauren (the brains) and Katie (the talent) concoct a wildly successful business venture. As profits swell, the girls reevaluate their hopes and dreams and realize that just because someone pees in your hair in college doesn''t mean she won''t be your best friend 10 years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eIlVo8lvk9fmfP05JGFKlPha80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84200'),
  ('579284863197565543', 'For a Handful of Kisses', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Menkes, Néstor Calvo', 'David Menkes', 'Ana de Armas, Martiño Rivas, Marina Salas, Megan Montaner, Andrea Duro, Jan Cornet, Richard Sahagún, Mario Pardo', null, 'A girl. A boy. A love story. But also about dreams, fears, life, true love, friendship and how we deal with it. And a secret between them...', 'A girl. A boy. A love story. But also about dreams, fears, life, true love, friendship and how we deal with it. And a secret between them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boN7qOZXh2B7AW3Nr7yzCnTtdIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258751'),
  ('1117893894288037561', 'For a Lost Soldier', 1992, 'Drama', 'Roeland Kerbosch, Nils Post', 'Roeland Kerbosch, Don Bloch', 'Maarten Smit, Jeroen Krabbé, Andrew Kelley, Freark Smink, Elsje de Wijn, Derk-Jan Kroon, Wiendelt Hooijer, Iris Misset', null, 'In the occupied Netherlands near the end of WWII, a young teenager, Jeroen Boman (Maarten Smit) is sent to the Dutch countryside to avoid the war in Amsterdam. While living with his adopted family, Jeroen meets and becomes friends with a Canadian soldier named Walt Cook, who is stationed at the same town he is staying at. Joroen and Walt spend a lot of time playing around and eventually a romantic relationship develops between them. The boy’s sexual curiosity leads him to have a sexual experience with Walt, an encounter that is shown with some vague detail but without actually showing any nudity, even though sexual intimacy between the two of them is implied. Overall, the movie handles this difficult subject with an elegant style and feeling, without having the adult-child relationship overwhelm the viewer and thus allowing the movie to be seen as just a wartime relationship between two people that marks an important time in a young boy’s life.', 'In the occupied Netherlands near the end of WWII, a young teenager, Jeroen Boman (Maarten Smit) is sent to the Dutch countryside to avoid the war in Amsterdam. While living with his adopted family, Jeroen meets and becomes friends with a Canadian soldier named Walt Cook, who is stationed at the same town he is staying at. Joroen and Walt spend a lot of time playing around and eventually a romantic relationship develops between them. The boy’s sexual curiosity leads him to have a sexual experience with Walt, an encounter that is shown with some vague detail but without actually showing any nudity, even though sexual intimacy between the two of them is implied. Overall, the movie handles this difficult subject with an elegant style and feeling, without having the adult-child relationship overwhelm the viewer and thus allowing the movie to be seen as just a wartime relationship between two people that marks an important time in a young boy’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83qNwms7atRnkBcFAdowojG072C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27052'),
  ('529213073212525662', 'For a Moment, Freedom', 2008, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Arash T. Riahi, Michael Riebl', 'Arash T. Riahi', 'Navid Navid, Pourya Mahyari, Payam Madjlessi, Behi Djanati Atai, Elika Bozorgi, Sina Saba, Said Oveissi, Fares Fares', null, 'Centers on a group of weary Middle Eastern refugees who have made their way to Turkey to apply for European visas.', 'Centers on a group of weary Middle Eastern refugees who have made their way to Turkey to apply for European visas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlNcpd4PFkyFDd3OUSr2WNlzFuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59935'),
  ('666566793330606390', 'For a Woman', 2013, 'Drama', 'Gilles Henry, Diane Kurys', 'Diane Kurys', 'Benoît Magimel, Mélanie Thierry, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Sylvie Testud, Denis Podalydès, Julie Ferrier, Clotilde Hesme, Clément Sibony', null, 'After the death of her mother, Anne makes a shocking discovery: an old photograph casts doubt on her origins and leads her to discover a mysterious uncle who lived with her parents after the war. As she lifts the lid on a long forgotten family secret, the young woman learns that her mother once succumbed to an amorous passion that was as intense as it was short-lived...', 'After the death of her mother, Anne makes a shocking discovery: an old photograph casts doubt on her origins and leads her to discover a mysterious uncle who lived with her parents after the war. As she lifts the lid on a long forgotten family secret, the young woman learns that her mother once succumbed to an amorous passion that was as intense as it was short-lived...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkqgfi7aLxfwhLvbMw2IvteZlGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199977'),
  ('53544497468578396', 'For All Mankind', 1989, 'Documentary, History', 'Al Reinert', null, 'Jim Lovell, Russell Schweickart, Eugene Cernan, Michael Collins, Charles Conrad, Richard Gordon, Alan Bean, Jack Swigert', null, 'A testament to NASA''s Apollo program of the 1960s and ''70s. Composed of actual NASA footage of the missions and astronaut interviews, the documentary offers the viewpoint of the individuals who braved the remarkable journey to the moon and back.', 'A testament to NASA''s Apollo program of the 1960s and ''70s. Composed of actual NASA footage of the missions and astronaut interviews, the documentary offers the viewpoint of the individuals who braved the remarkable journey to the moon and back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k8ylisWiEGxdRSlAf6v4PWiAjH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20423'),
  ('212625598541971758', 'For Better and for Worse', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Tristan Séguéla, Constance Frederix, Guillaume Moulin', 'Guy Laurent, Isabelle Lazard', 'Fabrice Luchini, Catherine Frot, Philippe Katerine, Artus, Bastien Ughetto, Paul Mirabel, Agnès Hurstel, Camille Le Gall', null, 'Jean has been the conservative mayor of a small town for several years. He intends to run for another term. Edith, his wife, is the paragon of the traditional devoted housewife and mother. So it comes as quite a shock when she tells her husband of forty years that deep down, she has always been... A MAN! Totally blindsided, Jean didn''t see this coming. For a politician campaigning on family values, this is too much! But Edith, still the loving wife, make a deal with him: she will postpone her transition and stay a woman until after the elections. But as we know, campaigns are all about digging up dirt to keep the rumor mill turning', 'Jean has been the conservative mayor of a small town for several years. He intends to run for another term. Edith, his wife, is the paragon of the traditional devoted housewife and mother. So it comes as quite a shock when she tells her husband of forty years that deep down, she has always been... A MAN! Totally blindsided, Jean didn''t see this coming. For a politician campaigning on family values, this is too much! But Edith, still the loving wife, make a deal with him: she will postpone her transition and stay a woman until after the elections. But as we know, campaigns are all about digging up dirt to keep the rumor mill turning', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxBJnMOfESBWV5lo6ZanL0rsECV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875818'),
  ('847844625986164717', 'For Better, For Worse', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gabriel Barragán Sentíes, Antonio Quercia', 'Ángel Pulido, Gabriel Barragán Sentíes, Nicolás López', 'Alberto Guerra, Zuria Vega, Natalia Téllez, Christian Chávez, Macarena Achaga, Diana Bracho, José Alonso, Ariel Levy', null, 'Sebastian and Valeria are about to get married. Everything seems perfect but a woman tries to seduce Sebastian while Valeria is pregnant.', 'Sebastian and Valeria are about to get married. Everything seems perfect but a woman tries to seduce Sebastian while Valeria is pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUrQZ1KeayOhQwjbEj9KK0p46Wr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554580'),
  ('629662822548837833', 'For Both of Us', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Umur Turagay', 'Pınar Bulut', 'Nejat İşler, Serenay Sarıkaya, Zerrin Tekindor, İştar Gökseven, Özgür Emre Yıldırım, Merve Çağıran, Aslı Bekiroğlu, Aysegül Cengiz', null, 'Çiçek is a girl who grew up in a small village. She has so many questions about her own life with no answers. And then her life is changed by Dogan, her literature teacher.', 'Çiçek is a girl who grew up in a small village. She has so many questions about her own life with no answers. And then her life is changed by Dogan, her literature teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdVEvb0WCzzcZxcf2DP8RCCZp1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449546'),
  ('997187977371170807', 'For Colored Girls', 2010, 'Drama', 'Tyler Perry, Alexander Gruszynski, Roger M. Bobb', 'Tyler Perry', 'Kimberly Elise, Janet Jackson, Loretta Devine, Thandiwe Newton, Anika Noni Rose, Kerry Washington, Tessa Thompson, Phylicia Rashād', 'R', 'About existence from the perspective of 20 nameless black females. Each of the women portray one of the characters represented in the collection of twenty poems, revealing different issues that impact women in general and women of color in particular.', 'About existence from the perspective of 20 nameless black females. Each of the women portray one of the characters represented in the collection of twenty poems, revealing different issues that impact women in general and women of color in particular.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lj7SFMEUL0BRi41TDdVTVcq70Gt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44944'),
  ('499798669020384178', 'For Elise', 2013, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Juanra Fernández, David Valldepérez', 'Juanra Fernández', 'Ana Turpin, Ona Casamiquela, Luisa Gavasa, Enrique Villén', null, 'A young college is responsible for the care of an innocent little girl, but soon all he knows give a twist that will endanger his own life. All begin when crossing under the floor of the third floor to the left, a road without knowing directly the door open to the forces of evil, freeing them at will through the building. A desperate race to save the lives when terror and pure evil are in the next aisle.', 'A young college is responsible for the care of an innocent little girl, but soon all he knows give a twist that will endanger his own life. All begin when crossing under the floor of the third floor to the left, a road without knowing directly the door open to the forces of evil, freeing them at will through the building. A desperate race to save the lives when terror and pure evil are in the next aisle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nb0czEOWmGW0HAUeOGkdn5TqNdw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191312'),
  ('784868999177645999', 'For Ever Mozart', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, War', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Christophe Pollock, Jean-Pierre Fedrizzi', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Madeleine Assas, Ghalya Lacroix, Bérangère Allaux, Vicky Messica, Frédéric Pierrot, Harry Cleven, Michel Francini, Sabine Bail', null, 'Episodic film that follows a theater troupe from France attempting to put on a play in Sarajevo. Along their journey they are captured and held in a POW camp, and they call for help from their friends and relations in France.', 'Episodic film that follows a theater troupe from France attempting to put on a play in Sarajevo. Along their journey they are captured and held in a POW camp, and they call for help from their friends and relations in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TCe8LHpl8aZ9OvGvFkakAYyYlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111367'),
  ('785171077541732874', 'For freedom and justice', 1949, 'History, Drama', 'Svend Methling, Jørgen Skov, Erik Balling', 'Leck Fischer', 'Svend Methling, Ebbe Rode, Angelo Bruun, Rasmus Ottesen, Mogens Wieth, Karen Berg, Kai Holm, Poul Holck Hofmann', null, 'A picture of the life of the Danish people from the late 1820s to the introduction of the free constitution in 1849. A fictional character, Rasmus Nielsen, travels around the country, first as a traveling teacher, later in other positions, and through his experiences we are introduced to the conditions of various population groups. The central figure in the portrayal of historical figures is the politician Orla Lehmann.', 'A picture of the life of the Danish people from the late 1820s to the introduction of the free constitution in 1849. A fictional character, Rasmus Nielsen, travels around the country, first as a traveling teacher, later in other positions, and through his experiences we are introduced to the conditions of various population groups. The central figure in the portrayal of historical figures is the politician Orla Lehmann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JUne4OEHSnhvPCxR3iSYQ3tsqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286439'),
  ('74229852483686829', 'For Heaven''s Sake', 1926, 'Comedy', 'Sam Taylor, Walter Lundin, Robert A. Golden', 'Ted Wilde, John Grey, Clyde Bruckman', 'Harold Lloyd, Jobyna Ralston, Noah Young, James Pier Mason, Paul Weigel, Constantine Romanoff, Richard Daniels, Oscar Smith', 'NR', 'An irresponsible young millionaire changes his tune when he falls for the daughter of a downtown minister.', 'An irresponsible young millionaire changes his tune when he falls for the daughter of a downtown minister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIaZ41s0IqU8AlMufJ7fsUKq7Vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42368'),
  ('77701947034729846', 'For Horowitz', 2006, 'Drama', 'Kwon Hyung-jin', 'Ee-Jae Shin, Kwon Hyung-jin, Kim Min-Sook', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Sin Ee-Jae, Park Yong-woo, Choi Sun-ja, Jeong In-gi, Kim Bo-ra, Kim Hee-jung, Yoo Ji-yeon', null, '31-year-old single woman Kim Ji-su once wanted to become a famous pianist like Horowitz. Her dream was shattered but she went on by teaching children piano. One day, she discovers a young musical genius, and begins giviving intensive lessons to prepare him for competition. However, while it doesn''t turn out, Ji-su is shocked when she realizes that the boy carries a secret that will change her life forever.', '31-year-old single woman Kim Ji-su once wanted to become a famous pianist like Horowitz. Her dream was shattered but she went on by teaching children piano. One day, she discovers a young musical genius, and begins giviving intensive lessons to prepare him for competition. However, while it doesn''t turn out, Ji-su is shocked when she realizes that the boy carries a secret that will change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wE7PWfMGvX6vHhoVaPpNuezeZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168208'),
  ('59487744566212146', 'For Jojo', 2022, 'Drama', 'Barbara Ott', 'Stefanie Ren', 'Caro Cult, Nina Gummich, Steven Sowah, Louis Nitsche, Susanne Bredehöft, Mohamed Elgendy, Sidsel Hindhede, Tom Lass', 'R', 'When her best friend Jojo falls in love and moves on from their wild dating adventures in Berlin, Paula does everything she can to sabotage her wedding.', 'When her best friend Jojo falls in love and moves on from their wild dating adventures in Berlin, Paula does everything she can to sabotage her wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvRYsYZEadRlFJIOIWjEthikROm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:968572'),
  ('252388294952769095', 'For Keeps', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John G. Avildsen, James Crabe', 'Denise DeClue, Tim Kazurinsky', 'Molly Ringwald, Randall Batinkoff, Kenneth Mars, Miriam Flynn, Conchata Ferrell, Sharon Brown, John Zarchen, Pauly Shore', 'PG-13', 'Young high school couple Darcy Elliot and Stan Bobrucz are one year from graduation, with promising futures ahead of them. But their paths take a drastic turn when Darcy becomes pregnant. Unwilling to go through an abortion or an adoption — despite their parents'' pleas — Darcy and Stan decide to sacrifice their college experiences and degrees in order to keep and raise the baby. After a quick marriage, the two realize it won''t be as easy as they thought.', 'Young high school couple Darcy Elliot and Stan Bobrucz are one year from graduation, with promising futures ahead of them. But their paths take a drastic turn when Darcy becomes pregnant. Unwilling to go through an abortion or an adoption — despite their parents'' pleas — Darcy and Stan decide to sacrifice their college experiences and degrees in order to keep and raise the baby. After a quick marriage, the two realize it won''t be as easy as they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1o2jt1UXNuZmRN1Y2vg1y2T8qE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26355'),
  ('233662892349270567', 'For Love and Honor', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ferenc Pap, Ayhan Özen, Tolgay Ziyal', 'Yavuz Turgul, Mevlut Acik', 'Şener Şen, Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, İsmail Hacıoğlu, Aslı Tandoğan, Rasim Öztekin, Süleyman Turan, Ruhi Sarı, Rana Cabbar', null, 'Ali Osman is a former bully of city of Istanbul. But lately he gives up bully and starts to operate a synthetic pitch. He often meets his old friends, former bullies, too. One day Ali Osman receives a news which is related with his previous passionate life. Then the whole action stats as a chain of events.', 'Ali Osman is a former bully of city of Istanbul. But lately he gives up bully and starts to operate a synthetic pitch. He often meets his old friends, former bullies, too. One day Ali Osman receives a news which is related with his previous passionate life. Then the whole action stats as a chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8mpVlzCOoF92bHICJkJQGodqVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27953'),
  ('362559648687477633', 'For Love of the Game', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Bailey, Sam Raimi, Eric Heffron', 'Dana Stevens', 'Kevin Costner, Kelly Preston, John C. Reilly, Jena Malone, Brian Cox, J.K. Simmons, Vin Scully, Steve Lyons', 'PG-13', 'A baseball legend almost finished with his distinguished career at the age of forty has one last chance to prove who he is, what he is capable of, and win the heart of the woman he has loved for the past four years.', 'A baseball legend almost finished with his distinguished career at the age of forty has one last chance to prove who he is, what he is capable of, and win the heart of the woman he has loved for the past four years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkeKxoSXE1qMArcFNTNBBH8TjKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10390'),
  ('404465514743864687', 'For Love or Money', 1993, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Barry Sonnenfeld, Oliver Wood, Mark McGann', 'Lawrence Konner, Mark Rosenthal', 'Michael J. Fox, Gabrielle Anwar, Anthony Higgins, Fyvush Finkel, Sandra Reaves-Phillips, LaChanze, Mike Moyer, Saverio Guerra', 'PG', 'New York concierge Doug Ireland wants to go into business for himself and refurbish a hotel on Roosevelt Island, N.Y., but he needs an investor. With a few weeks left before his option on the site runs out, Doug agrees to help wealthy Christian Hanover conceal his affair with salesgirl Andy Hart from his wife. Despite his own attraction to Andy, Doug tries to stay focused on getting Christian to invest $3 million in his project.', 'New York concierge Doug Ireland wants to go into business for himself and refurbish a hotel on Roosevelt Island, N.Y., but he needs an investor. With a few weeks left before his option on the site runs out, Doug agrees to help wealthy Christian Hanover conceal his affair with salesgirl Andy Hart from his wife. Despite his own attraction to Andy, Doug tries to stay focused on getting Christian to invest $3 million in his project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qjr1LWkoJQJ1HXwYJj0edPk9EW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9024'),
  ('459289134541140824', 'For Love''s Sake', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, Music, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Kato Fumiaki, 島根淳', 'Takayuki Takuma', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Emi Takei, Sakura Ando, Yo Hitoto, Masachika Ichimura, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Seishirou Katou, Ken Maeda', null, 'Troubled high school student Makoto arrives in Tokyo to exact revenge from a past incident. He then falls in love at first sight with Ai, a daughter raised in a wholesome family. Around Makoto and Ai are Iwashimizu, who has feelings for Ai and Gamuko, a gang member who eyes Makoto.', 'Troubled high school student Makoto arrives in Tokyo to exact revenge from a past incident. He then falls in love at first sight with Ai, a daughter raised in a wholesome family. Around Makoto and Ai are Iwashimizu, who has feelings for Ai and Gamuko, a gang member who eyes Makoto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyxiIsazpFdQWC7tqChtfrdQrBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110430'),
