  ('62474258812924824', 'For Me and My Gal', 1942, 'Music, Romance, War', 'Busby Berkeley, William H. Daniels, Douglas Shearer', 'Fred F. Finklehoffe, Richard Sherman, Sid Silvers', 'Judy Garland, Gene Kelly, George Murphy, Mártha Eggerth, Ben Blue, Stephen McNally, Lester Dorr, Ernie Alexander', 'NR', 'Two vaudeville performers fall in love, but find their relationship tested by the arrival of WWI.', 'Two vaudeville performers fall in love, but find their relationship tested by the arrival of WWI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWCTKiFf2ffrMjieb2wU3RzZ6Wx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27017'),
  ('1136728698335015963', 'For Members Only', 1960, 'Drama', 'Ramsey Herrington, James Wilson, Geoffrey Helman', 'Mark Grantham', 'Shelly Martin, Brian Cobby, Anthony Oliver, Natalie Lynn, Jacqueline D''Orsay, Joy Hinton, Paul Kendrick, Robert Raglan', null, 'A somewhat prudish young lady inherits a nudist camp. She wants to shut it down, but is persuaded by its members to give the place a look before she takes any action. She agrees, and while touring the camp finds herself attracted to one of the patrons. The trouble is, so does another young woman at the camp. Complications ensue.', 'A somewhat prudish young lady inherits a nudist camp. She wants to shut it down, but is persuaded by its members to give the place a look before she takes any action. She agrees, and while touring the camp finds herself attracted to one of the patrons. The trouble is, so does another young woman at the camp. Complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSPB3Oap7Y3DI38DWAHUTYL7f8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189690'),
  ('833927452524003899', 'For My Country', 2023, 'Drama', 'Rachid Hami, Jérôme Alméras, Med Ali Souissi', 'Rachid Hami, Ollivier Pourriol', 'Karim Leklou, Shaïn Boumedine, Lubna Azabal, Samir Guesmi, Vivian Sung, Laurent Lafitte, Elyes Aguis, Alicia Hava', null, 'Aissa, a young officer of Algerian origin, tragically loses his life during a fresher initiation ritual at the prestigious French military academy of Saint-Cyr. As the death tears through his family, controversy arises over Aissa’s funeral plans when the Army refuses to take responsibility. Ismael, his older, rebellious brother, tries to keep the family united as they fight to win justice for Aissa.', 'Aissa, a young officer of Algerian origin, tragically loses his life during a fresher initiation ritual at the prestigious French military academy of Saint-Cyr. As the death tears through his family, controversy arises over Aissa’s funeral plans when the Army refuses to take responsibility. Ismael, his older, rebellious brother, tries to keep the family united as they fight to win justice for Aissa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVwqbqw8VqcIc142Ig0HuJcd2if.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958219'),
  ('76860212696981160', 'For My Daughter''s Honor', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Alan Metzger, Geoffrey Erb', 'Diana Gould', 'Gary Cole, Nicholle Tom, Alyson Hannigan, Sara Rue, Mac Davis, Mary Kay Place, Tom Virtue, Teddi Siddall', null, 'Fourteen-year-old high school student, Amy Dustin, becomes an object of romantic affection to the school''s biology teacher and football coach, Pete Nash. They take a sudden interest in each other, sending each other notes and talking on the telephone. Although Pete has a family, the two begin a secret relationship. People then begin to suspect that Pete and Amy are having an affair.', 'Fourteen-year-old high school student, Amy Dustin, becomes an object of romantic affection to the school''s biology teacher and football coach, Pete Nash. They take a sudden interest in each other, sending each other notes and talking on the telephone. Although Pete has a family, the two begin a secret relationship. People then begin to suspect that Pete and Amy are having an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FkHMDXQ7cqK8GO5qYC5GjZrecy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105437'),
  ('241224514362625772', 'For Night Will Come', 2024, 'Drama, Horror', 'Abdelhadi El Fakir, Céline Rouzet, Ludovic Giraud', 'William Martin, Céline Rouzet', 'Mathias Legoût Hammond, Élodie Bouchez, Jean-Charles Clichet, Céleste Brunnquell, Laly Mercier, Louis Peres, Angèle Metzger, Bakary Diombera', null, 'The day they move into a new neighborhood, the Feral family plans to look as normal and friendly as possible. But their son, Philemon, is no ordinary teenager. When he gets closer to his new neighbor, Camila, his thirst for blood grows and his difference becomes impossible to hide…', 'The day they move into a new neighborhood, the Feral family plans to look as normal and friendly as possible. But their son, Philemon, is no ordinary teenager. When he gets closer to his new neighbor, Camila, his thirst for blood grows and his difference becomes impossible to hide…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdZkWuvFiunCI5RtbYbnaPbNT3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158416'),
