  ('377362257766316255', 'For Pete''s Sake', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Peter Yates, László Kovács, Harry Caplan', 'Stanley Shapiro, Maurice Richlin', 'Barbra Streisand, Michael Sarrazin, Estelle Parsons, Molly Picon, William Redfield, Louis Zorich, Heywood Hale Broun, Richard Ward', 'PG', 'Henrietta Robbins borrows money from a loan shark to finance her husband''s investment in the stock market. However, when their stock plummets, she scrambles to find a way to pay the money back.', 'Henrietta Robbins borrows money from a loan shark to finance her husband''s investment in the stock market. However, when their stock plummets, she scrambles to find a way to pay the money back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvm15Xfgj6j1IPzEjPg0c2OiNkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31901'),
  ('936321546207524331', 'For Queen & Country', 1988, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Martin Stellman, Richard Greatrex', 'Trix Worrell', 'Denzel Washington, Dorian Healy, Amanda Redman, Bruce Payne, George Baker, Sean Chapman, Craig Fairbrass, Paul McKenzie', null, 'A retired British soldier struggles to adjust to everyday life, with increasing difficulty.', 'A retired British soldier struggles to adjust to everyday life, with increasing difficulty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwiOZ5gT6dbRQVgpvrAmYvRoDFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42347'),
  ('227149183245997011', 'For Richer or Poorer', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Buzz Feitshans IV, Bryan Spicer', 'Jana Howington, Steve LuKanic', 'Tim Allen, Kirstie Alley, Wayne Knight, Larry Miller, Jay O. Sanders, Michael Lerner, Miguel A. Núñez Jr., Megan Cavanagh', 'PG-13', 'Brad Sexton and his wife, Caroline, are wealthy New Yorkers with both marital and financial problems. The latter issue becomes a pressing matter when they discover that their accountant has embezzled millions and pinned the blame on them. Forced to go on the lam, Brad and Caroline end up in an Amish area of Pennsylvania and decide to pose as members of the religious group to evade the IRS. As the two adapt to the simple Amish lifestyle, they begin to reconnect.', 'Brad Sexton and his wife, Caroline, are wealthy New Yorkers with both marital and financial problems. The latter issue becomes a pressing matter when they discover that their accountant has embezzled millions and pinned the blame on them. Forced to go on the lam, Brad and Caroline end up in an Amish area of Pennsylvania and decide to pose as members of the religious group to evade the IRS. As the two adapt to the simple Amish lifestyle, they begin to reconnect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPjqY9Qp5WOIBFKnyEpMBVwGr01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10371'),
  ('607691120888108394', 'For Richer, for Poorer', 1992, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jay Sandrich, Arthur Albert', 'Stan Daniels', 'Jack Lemmon, Talia Shire, Jonathan Silverman, Joanna Gleason, Madeline Kahn, George Wyner, Dakin Matthews, Stephen Caffrey', null, 'Fresh out of college, a young man lazes about his family''s estate, which irritates his father, a self-made millionaire who hatches a bankruptcy plan that he hopes will inspire his son to get a job.', 'Fresh out of college, a young man lazes about his family''s estate, which irritates his father, a self-made millionaire who hatches a bankruptcy plan that he hopes will inspire his son to get a job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snm3gnbwpMrKySutTVRQt3w7In5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59136'),
  ('182504453786327918', 'For Sale', 1998, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Laetitia Masson', 'Laetitia Masson', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Sergio Castellitto, Aurore Clément, Chiara Mastroianni, Mireille Perrier, Samuel Le Bihan, Caroline Baehr, Roschdy Zem', null, 'A Private detective is hired to trace a woman who ran away and disappeared on her wedding day. The movie follows him and recounts the story of her life through her eyes and the eyes of those interviewed by the detective.', 'A Private detective is hired to trace a woman who ran away and disappeared on her wedding day. The movie follows him and recounts the story of her life through her eyes and the eyes of those interviewed by the detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgvP7t2xL9Eb6tE9A9iiL9HzxGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78281'),
  ('403157922937484027', 'For Sale or Rent', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Betse de Paula, Jacques Cheuiche, Ricardo Favilla', 'Maria Lúcia Dahl, José Roberto Torero, Júlia de Abreu', 'Marieta Severo, Nathália Timberg, Marcos Palmeira, Sílvia Buarque, Beatriz Morgana, André Mattos, Maria Assunção, Pedro Monteiro', null, 'A once-rich family of women in Rio de Janeiro must sell their mansion in order to keep their high standard of living, but the proximity to the slums disrupts business.', 'A once-rich family of women in Rio de Janeiro must sell their mansion in order to keep their high standard of living, but the proximity to the slums disrupts business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Id2VxyoV1GHkH2gQV15vahwHO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213131'),
  ('205199032363849316', 'For Sama', 2019, 'Documentary, War', 'Waad al-Kateab, Edward Watts, Waad al-Kateab', null, 'Sama Al-Khateab, Hamza Al-Khateab, Waad al-Kateab', null, 'A love letter from a young mother to her daughter, the film tells the story of Waad al-Kateab’s life through five years of the uprising in Aleppo, Syria as she falls in love, gets married and gives birth to Sama, all while cataclysmic conflict rises around her. Her camera captures incredible stories of loss, laughter and survival as Waad wrestles with an impossible choice– whether or not to flee the city to protect her daughter’s life, when leaving means abandoning the struggle for freedom for which she has already sacrificed so much.', 'A love letter from a young mother to her daughter, the film tells the story of Waad al-Kateab’s life through five years of the uprising in Aleppo, Syria as she falls in love, gets married and gives birth to Sama, all while cataclysmic conflict rises around her. Her camera captures incredible stories of loss, laughter and survival as Waad wrestles with an impossible choice– whether or not to flee the city to protect her daughter’s life, when leaving means abandoning the struggle for freedom for which she has already sacrificed so much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDna51F8QfrJFZOgPGQUz3VKqsB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576017'),
  ('167704464662622023', 'For Sasha', 1991, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Alexandre Arcady, Robert Alazraki', 'Antoine Lacomblez, Alexandre Arcady, Daniel Saint-Hamont', 'Sophie Marceau, Richard Berry, Fabien Orcier, Niels Dubost, Gérard Darmon, Jean-Claude de Goros, Emmanuelle Riva, Ayelet Zurer', 'NR', 'Israel, 1967. Sacha and Laura have been living in a kibbutz near the Syrian border for two years. They are visited by Simon, Michel and Paul, three friends from Paris who have come to celebrate Laura''s twentieth birthday. Simon is obsessed by the death of the girl he loved and during the birthday evening, attempts to find someone to blame amongst his friends. Laura alone knows that the young girl died of a broken heart. She also loved Sacha.', 'Israel, 1967. Sacha and Laura have been living in a kibbutz near the Syrian border for two years. They are visited by Simon, Michel and Paul, three friends from Paris who have come to celebrate Laura''s twentieth birthday. Simon is obsessed by the death of the girl he loved and during the birthday evening, attempts to find someone to blame amongst his friends. Laura alone knows that the young girl died of a broken heart. She also loved Sacha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JPbvj7Ewvj7z0tFglmfn37IsCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78032'),
  ('32487007254464721', 'For Scent-imental Reasons', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Pepé Le Pew invades a Parisian perfumery, where he sniffs the various scents. The shopkeeper runs in horror and recruits a female cat to run the skunk out of the shop. She tosses the cat inside, and a bottle of dye falls over, accidentally painting a white stripe down the cat''s back. Pepé gives chase...', 'Pepé Le Pew invades a Parisian perfumery, where he sniffs the various scents. The shopkeeper runs in horror and recruits a female cat to run the skunk out of the shop. She tosses the cat inside, and a bottle of dye falls over, accidentally painting a white stripe down the cat''s back. Pepé gives chase...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOqcLns81CYB3G6orcezkyzy1Lj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83773'),
  ('195099803625218694', 'For the Bible Tells Me So', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Daniel Karslake, Brad Graeber, Bruce Tinnin', 'Helen R. Mendoza, Daniel Karslake', 'Imogene Robinson, Victor Robinson, Gene Robinson, Isabella ''Boo'' McDaniel, Mel White, Dick Gephardt', null, 'An exploration of the intersection between religion and homosexuality in the U.S. and how the religious right has used its interpretation of the Bible to stigmatize the gay community.', 'An exploration of the intersection between religion and homosexuality in the U.S. and how the religious right has used its interpretation of the Bible to stigmatize the gay community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sz7ucLIEpu1KPmrBW2eB5fyqv4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15651'),
  ('995699719397224126', 'For the Birds', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Ralph Eggleston', 'Ralph Eggleston', 'Ralph Eggleston', 'G', 'One by one, a flock of small birds perches on a telephone wire. Sitting close together has problems enough, and then comes along a large dopey bird that tries to join them. The birds of a feather can''t help but make fun of him - and their clique mentality proves embarrassing in the end.', 'One by one, a flock of small birds perches on a telephone wire. Sitting close together has problems enough, and then comes along a large dopey bird that tries to join them. The birds of a feather can''t help but make fun of him - and their clique mentality proves embarrassing in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GogfWZYkZh802fnaMoDBnu8cfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13930'),
  ('334712822634759553', 'For the Boys', 1991, 'Drama, Music, Comedy, War', 'Mark Rydell, Christopher Wilkinson, Stephen Goldblatt', 'Neal Jimenez, Lindy Laub, Marshall Brickman', 'Bette Midler, James Caan, George Segal, Patrick O''Neal, Christopher Rydell, Arye Gross, Norman Fell, Rosemary Murphy', null, 'Talented USO entertainer Dixie Leonard and comedian Eddie Sparks deal with their relationship over the course of 5 decades from World War II to the Vietnam War era to their twilight era in the 90''s.', 'Talented USO entertainer Dixie Leonard and comedian Eddie Sparks deal with their relationship over the course of 5 decades from World War II to the Vietnam War era to their twilight era in the 90''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1pIYwjYVzfQMe6lOPf2vf6lL1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25221'),
  ('497500413357060553', 'For the Children', 1916, 'Comedy', 'Louis Feuillade', 'Roger Lion', 'Marcel Lévesque, Musidora, René Poyen, Stacia Napierkowska, Édouard Mathé', null, 'The artist awakens. His maid brings him a letter from the Gaumont Studio. After a quick glance to it, he hastens to get dressed and runs to the studio followed by his wife, his maid and his son, Bout-de-Zan who want a part in the movie.', 'The artist awakens. His maid brings him a letter from the Gaumont Studio. After a quick glance to it, he hastens to get dressed and runs to the studio followed by his wife, his maid and his son, Bout-de-Zan who want a part in the movie.', null, 'tmdb:movie:163235'),
  ('1091786483998490854', 'For the Defense', 1930, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'John Cromwell, Charles Lang', 'Oliver H.P. Garrett', 'William Powell, Kay Francis, Scott Kolk, William B. Davidson, John Elliott, Thomas E. Jackson, Harry Walker, James Finlayson', 'NR', 'William Foster is a slick attorney who stays within the law, but specializes in representing crooks and shady characters. He''s adept at keeping them out of jail, winning acquittals, and having decisions reversed, thus springing criminals out of prison. He is romantically involved with dancer Irene Manners, who is two-timing him, although she wants to marry him. She kills a man driving while out with her other man, Jack Defoe, who takes the blame. Unfortunately, a ring Foster had just given Irene is found at the crime scene. Foster ends up defending Jack, but when the ring is found, he thinks he is protecting Irene, so pleads guilty to jury tampering.', 'William Foster is a slick attorney who stays within the law, but specializes in representing crooks and shady characters. He''s adept at keeping them out of jail, winning acquittals, and having decisions reversed, thus springing criminals out of prison. He is romantically involved with dancer Irene Manners, who is two-timing him, although she wants to marry him. She kills a man driving while out with her other man, Jack Defoe, who takes the blame. Unfortunately, a ring Foster had just given Irene is found at the crime scene. Foster ends up defending Jack, but when the ring is found, he thinks he is protecting Irene, so pleads guilty to jury tampering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OQvOBWcsoUhctaYyBGMUP0LgXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224261'),
  ('215238844716866843', 'For the Emperor', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Cha Taek-kyun, Park Sang-joon, Lee Byung-kwan', 'Lee Yong-soo', 'Lee Min-ki, Park Sung-woong, Lee Tae-im, Kim Jong-goo, Jung Heung-Chae, Lee Jae-won, Park Jin-woo, Han Jae-yeong', null, 'A former professional baseball player becomes entangled in loan-sharking and mob connections after a fixing scandal ejects him from his sport. When his girlfriend vanishes he is forced to confront his mentor and enter a deadly battle.', 'A former professional baseball player becomes entangled in loan-sharking and mob connections after a fixing scandal ejects him from his sport. When his girlfriend vanishes he is forced to confront his mentor and enter a deadly battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4s6I2Owpqu9oQ6YagJXQTrdFWCF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280019'),
  ('250655272899513479', 'For the Good of Others', 2010, 'Thriller, Drama, Fantasy', 'Oskar Santos, Josu Inchaustegui', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Eduardo Noriega, Belén Rueda, Clara Lago, Angie Cepeda, Cristina Plazas, Marcel Borràs, Carlos Leal, Luis Callejo', null, 'Diego is a doctor so used to working in extreme situations that he has immunized himself to others'' pain. He has switched off from his work, his partner and his commitment as a father. Over the course of a disturbing meeting, Diego is threatened with a gun. Hours later, he can only remember the sound of a bang and the strange feeling of having being hit with something more than a bullet. Diego has to take an irreversible decision which will affect his own life and that of his loved ones.', 'Diego is a doctor so used to working in extreme situations that he has immunized himself to others'' pain. He has switched off from his work, his partner and his commitment as a father. Over the course of a disturbing meeting, Diego is threatened with a gun. Hours later, he can only remember the sound of a bang and the strange feeling of having being hit with something more than a bullet. Diego has to take an irreversible decision which will affect his own life and that of his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHldiqoslN9BUAtY8PQyGKv9mhG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53739'),
  ('956877114411233718', 'For the Love of Benji', 1977, 'Family', 'Joe Camp, Don Reddy', 'Joe Camp', 'Benjean, Patsy Garrett, Cynthia Smith, Allen Fiuzat, Ed Nelson, Art Vasil, Peter Bowles, Bridget Armstrong', 'G', 'Benji gets lost after a flight overseas and becomes a stray in Athens, Greece. He then tries everyday to reunite with his family while mysterious people pursue him, in a race to get a code which was secretly tattooed on his paw at the airport. But who are the bad guys and who are the agents that can be trusted? Will Benji and his kids and their nanny ever get to enjoy their vacation?', 'Benji gets lost after a flight overseas and becomes a stray in Athens, Greece. He then tries everyday to reunite with his family while mysterious people pursue him, in a race to get a code which was secretly tattooed on his paw at the airport. But who are the bad guys and who are the agents that can be trusted? Will Benji and his kids and their nanny ever get to enjoy their vacation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqB2iwZnteFdWH9rL50objGwmNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38802'),
  ('809479638910074550', 'For the Love of Jessee', 2020, 'Drama', 'David McAbee', null, 'Randy Wayne, Mandahla Rose, Adrienne Barbeau, Tony Denman, Bre Blair, Curta Edwards Schlarbaum', null, 'Doctor Luke Matthew''s world comes crashing down when he loses the love of his life and becomes a father in the same night. When he hires Sage as the new nanny, they both begin to realize that the best form of medicine is letting go.', 'Doctor Luke Matthew''s world comes crashing down when he loses the love of his life and becomes a father in the same night. When he hires Sage as the new nanny, they both begin to realize that the best form of medicine is letting go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cR1Pr9X8KpYzW1itOizETIdQcgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699060'),
  ('332458681367281865', 'For the Love of Nancy', 1994, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Eric Van Haren Noman, Paul Schneider, Harriet Greenspan', 'Carol Evan McKeand, Nigel McKeand', 'Tracey Gold, Jill Clayburgh, Cameron Bancroft, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Michael MacRae, Garwin Sanford, William Devane, Deanna Milligan', null, 'The parents of an anorexic woman fight to save her life.', 'The parents of an anorexic woman fight to save her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OvdOCxkkdHCbI02WcEKRdj6kNh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108243'),
  ('633678539918457285', 'For the Love of Spock', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Adam Nimoy, Kevin Layne', 'Adam Nimoy', 'William Shatner, George Takei, J.J. Abrams, Simon Pegg, Chris Pine, Adam Nimoy, Nichelle Nichols, Zachary Quinto', null, 'The life of Mr. Spock, as well as that of Leonard Nimoy, the actor who played him for almost fifty years, written and directed by his son: Adam.', 'The life of Mr. Spock, as well as that of Leonard Nimoy, the actor who played him for almost fifty years, written and directed by his son: Adam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pDgqNx9GdW82QJU4Rc6egT3YAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338544'),
  ('262935393064832043', 'For the Matches', 1980, 'Comedy, Adventure, History', 'Risto Orko, German Krylov, Kare Orko', 'Leonid Gaidai, Risto Orko, Vladlen Bakhnov', 'Evgeni Leonov, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy, Rita Polster, Ritva Valkama, Georgiy Vitsin, Galina Polskikh, Kauko Helovirta, Leo Lastumäki', null, 'In Eastern Finland, in Liperi to be exact, Anna-Liisa Ihalainen asks her husband Antti to get some matches from the Ihalainen household. Unfortunately that trip takes a little longer than expected...', 'In Eastern Finland, in Liperi to be exact, Anna-Liisa Ihalainen asks her husband Antti to get some matches from the Ihalainen household. Unfortunately that trip takes a little longer than expected...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlH4ePoG8ER6lSXxXPzavCG5qwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78132'),
  ('616650447757367949', 'For the Moment', 1993, 'War, Drama, Romance, Action', 'Aaron Kim Johnston', null, 'Russell Crowe, Christianne Hirt, Wanda Cannon, Scott Kraft, Peter Outerbridge, Sara McMillan, Bruce Boa, Katelynd Johnston', 'PG-13', 'This Canadian film presents and old-fashioned war time romance. It is set during 1942 in Manitoba and traces the doomed affair between a young farmer''s wife (Christianne Hirt) whose husband is fighting abroad and a dashing Australian pilot (Russell Crowe). The pilot has come to train in the British Commonwealth Air Training Plan of Canada. When the pilot, Lachlan, is not training, he is surreptitiously wooing Lill, the farmer''s wife. At the other end of town, Betsy (Wanda Cannon) who supports her two kids by bootlegging, charges for her services. She gets involved with Zeek (Scott Kraft), an American flight instructor.', 'This Canadian film presents and old-fashioned war time romance. It is set during 1942 in Manitoba and traces the doomed affair between a young farmer''s wife (Christianne Hirt) whose husband is fighting abroad and a dashing Australian pilot (Russell Crowe). The pilot has come to train in the British Commonwealth Air Training Plan of Canada. When the pilot, Lachlan, is not training, he is surreptitiously wooing Lill, the farmer''s wife. At the other end of town, Betsy (Wanda Cannon) who supports her two kids by bootlegging, charges for her services. She gets involved with Zeek (Scott Kraft), an American flight instructor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zSzkQSCKfNumTvQyjRlDHT6rCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37218'),
  ('286945927241156581', 'For the Sake of Vicious', 2021, 'Action, Horror, Mystery', 'Peter Szabo, Andy Wolting, Alex Tong', 'Reese Eveneshen', 'Lora Burke, Nick Smyth, Colin Paradine, T.J. Kennedy, James Fler, Adam Ewings, Boris Milinkovich, Nick Spartan', null, 'An overworked nurse returns home to find a maniac hiding out with a bruised and beaten hostage. When an unexpected wave of violent intruders descend upon her home, it becomes a fight for survival.', 'An overworked nurse returns home to find a maniac hiding out with a bruised and beaten hostage. When an unexpected wave of violent intruders descend upon her home, it becomes a fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqO2sTFqm6XwEXmlLxKDX75RPjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722780'),
  ('691399066476586908', 'For the Term of His Natural Life', 1927, 'Crime, Drama', 'Norman Dawn', null, 'Eva Novak, George Fisher, Dunstan Webb, Jessica Harcourt, Arthur McLaglen, Katherine Dawn, Gerald Kay Souper', null, 'A convict, wrongfully accused and sent a harsh prison colony, attempts to escape.', 'A convict, wrongfully accused and sent a harsh prison colony, attempts to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qm7aVovOmAQrj7mo9ndH0Iw0OA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118489'),
  ('639445750365737190', 'For Them That Trespass', 1949, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alberto Cavalcanti, Derick Williams', 'J. Lee Thompson, William Douglas-Home', 'Richard Todd, Patricia Plunkett, Stephen Murray, Michael Laurence, Vida Hope, Rosalyn Boulter, James Hayter, Harry Fowler', null, 'In this drama, a frustrated upper-class writer decides that he will find real inspiration by examining his subjects first-hand. This leads him to begin wandering about the seamiest side of town where he witnesses a murder. When an innocent man is arrested, the writer refuses to assist him as the knowledge that he has been "slumming" could destroy his career. The young man is sentenced to 15 years in prison.', 'In this drama, a frustrated upper-class writer decides that he will find real inspiration by examining his subjects first-hand. This leads him to begin wandering about the seamiest side of town where he witnesses a murder. When an innocent man is arrested, the writer refuses to assist him as the knowledge that he has been "slumming" could destroy his career. The young man is sentenced to 15 years in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3SCWkSyewttS4SXpTzO1QBPJbB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86946'),
  ('251992665342523963', 'For Those I Loved', 1983, 'Drama, War', 'Robert Enrico, François Catonné', 'Robert Enrico, Tony Sheer', 'Michael York, Brigitte Fossey, Jacques Penot, Jean Bouise, Helen Hughes, Macha Méril, Wolfgang Müller, Boris Bergman', null, 'Polish Martin Gray recalls the Holocaust, New York prosperity, and losing his wife and family.', 'Polish Martin Gray recalls the Holocaust, New York prosperity, and losing his wife and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTZBWejO6HWrABAxTh8CYbWf3iW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74400'),
  ('815446489399272957', 'For Those We Love', 2007, 'War, Drama', 'Taku Shinjo, Hiroyuki Kitazawa, Shoji Ueda', 'Shintarō Ishihara', 'Satoshi Tokushige, Yosuke Kubozuka, Michitaka Tsutsui, Keiko Kishi, Mikako Tabe, Yasuyuki Maekawa, Tomoya Nakamura, Dai Watanabe', null, 'In 1943, as Japan''s WWII effort falters, a vice-admiral proposes training squadrons of "volunteer" flyers to crash their armed planes into Allied warships. Yarn follows the lives of kamikaze pilots, as remembered by an aging Kyushu restaurateur who cherishes their memory. Honoring the dead and multiple military anthems may stir the soul of some Japanese, but elsewhere auds will make a one-way trip for exits. Battle scenes are well-executed and script delivers some memorable scenes, but overall competent helming and thesping are powerless over writer-cum-Tokyo governor Shintaro Ishiara''s repetitive storytelling. A post-war postscript adds considerable length to an already over-extended narrative. Tech credits are good quality.', 'In 1943, as Japan''s WWII effort falters, a vice-admiral proposes training squadrons of "volunteer" flyers to crash their armed planes into Allied warships. Yarn follows the lives of kamikaze pilots, as remembered by an aging Kyushu restaurateur who cherishes their memory. Honoring the dead and multiple military anthems may stir the soul of some Japanese, but elsewhere auds will make a one-way trip for exits. Battle scenes are well-executed and script delivers some memorable scenes, but overall competent helming and thesping are powerless over writer-cum-Tokyo governor Shintaro Ishiara''s repetitive storytelling. A post-war postscript adds considerable length to an already over-extended narrative. Tech credits are good quality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k602Yndns4nXusXvBfJpWZztvGy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54462'),
  ('220213628522954715', 'For Those Who Think Young', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leslie H. Martinson, Harold E. Stine, Arthur Jacobson', 'Dan Beaumont, George O''Hanlon, James O''Hanlon', 'James Darren, Pamela Tiffin, Paul Lynde, Tina Louise, Bob Denver, Robert Middleton, Nancy Sinatra, Claudia Martini', null, 'A wealthy young man tries to woo a university student, while her two uncles work to popularize a local club.', 'A wealthy young man tries to woo a university student, while her two uncles work to popularize a local club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJwpZBYf56otl4rezGfmOMvFmiC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121716'),
  ('449011905238692884', 'For Whom the Alchemist Exists', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Chikashi Kadekaru, Kento Toya, Yoshinori Deno', 'Toshizo Nemoto', 'Inori Minase, Ryota Osaka, Ai Furihata, Natsuki Hanae, Kaito Ishikawa, Hitomi Nabatame, Yui Horie, Lynn', null, 'Set in the continent of Babel, where the Tower of Babel looms large over seven nations. After the invention of alchemy led to its use as a tool of war that brought humanity to the brink of extinction, the seven nations struck an uneasy peace that led to a prohibition on alchemy for hundreds of years since. In the Continental Year 911, the nation of Lustrice broke the pact by assembling an army bolstered by alchemy, with ambitions of conquest over the continent. Led by Envylia, the six nations allied and struck down the rogue nation, casting alchemy once again to darkness. But 20 years after the war, alchemy once again begins to cause chaos in the land.', 'Set in the continent of Babel, where the Tower of Babel looms large over seven nations. After the invention of alchemy led to its use as a tool of war that brought humanity to the brink of extinction, the seven nations struck an uneasy peace that led to a prohibition on alchemy for hundreds of years since. In the Continental Year 911, the nation of Lustrice broke the pact by assembling an army bolstered by alchemy, with ambitions of conquest over the continent. Led by Envylia, the six nations allied and struck down the rogue nation, casting alchemy once again to darkness. But 20 years after the war, alchemy once again begins to cause chaos in the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n57V1Dv31lLCpdqN4KARSBt8OHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597419'),
  ('323172244119452187', 'For Whom the Bell Rings', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Orestis Laskos, Markos Defilippou', 'Hristos Kyriakos', 'Kostas Voutsas, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Beata Asimakopoulou, Nora Valsami, Periklis Hristoforidis, Christos Doxaras, Makis Demiris, Nasos Kedrakas', null, 'The industrialist Apostolos Lampirikos is drowning in debt. All were asking borrowed, but none of the return. From this predicament is to get him his employee, Costas, with a trick. Kostas proposed to his boss ... to "commit suicide". The Lampirikos, with a large stone tied around his neck, supposedly falls overboard and the truth Kostas him and sent a photo. their accomplices to fraud, wife of Apostle Flora and his daughter Alice. Kostas closes his boss in a shack in the yard of his house, where he comes only with password hitting a bell. The supposed death of Lampiris made headlines in newspapers and creditors stop pressuring him, debtors pay and orders go much better. Finally, the "shoe Lampiris'' survives. Things get complicated, however, when one supplier seeks to marry the widow Lampiris, but cunning Kostas "resurrects" Tolis wins and Alice, for the sake of which also did what he did.', 'The industrialist Apostolos Lampirikos is drowning in debt. All were asking borrowed, but none of the return. From this predicament is to get him his employee, Costas, with a trick. Kostas proposed to his boss ... to "commit suicide". The Lampirikos, with a large stone tied around his neck, supposedly falls overboard and the truth Kostas him and sent a photo. their accomplices to fraud, wife of Apostle Flora and his daughter Alice. Kostas closes his boss in a shack in the yard of his house, where he comes only with password hitting a bell. The supposed death of Lampiris made headlines in newspapers and creditors stop pressuring him, debtors pay and orders go much better. Finally, the "shoe Lampiris'' survives. Things get complicated, however, when one supplier seeks to marry the widow Lampiris, bu