  ('497539842276597541', 'For Whom the Bell Tolls', 1943, 'War, Romance, History, Drama, Adventure', 'Ray Rennahan, Sam Wood, Clem Jones', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Gary Cooper, Ingrid Bergman, Akim Tamiroff, Arturo de Córdova, Vladimir Sokoloff, Mikhail Rasumny, Fortunio Bonanova, Eric Feldary', 'G', 'Spain in the 1930s is the place to be for a man of action like Robert Jordan. There is a civil war going on and Jordan—who has joined up on the side that appeals most to idealists of that era—has been given a high-risk assignment up in the mountains. He awaits the right time to blow up a crucial bridge in order to halt the enemy''s progress.', 'Spain in the 1930s is the place to be for a man of action like Robert Jordan. There is a civil war going on and Jordan—who has joined up on the side that appeals most to idealists of that era—has been given a high-risk assignment up in the mountains. He awaits the right time to blow up a crucial bridge in order to halt the enemy''s progress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoNTHrpeOgIuWsC5Eucx5Sp483D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27854'),
  ('282788043497684701', 'For Whom the Bulls Toil', 1953, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Joaquin Garay, Rafael Jaime Mendéz', null, 'Goofy, driving through Mexico, deals with a stubborn bull on the road who eventually charges, and Goofy unwittingly subdues the bull. Mexicans who are watching the scene believe that Goofy is "the great Matador" and the minute Goofy arrives in Mexico City, they dress him like a matador and make him do battle with another bull. The reluctant Goofy tries to escape the enormous bull although after a while, once again, he triumphs over the bull by accident.', 'Goofy, driving through Mexico, deals with a stubborn bull on the road who eventually charges, and Goofy unwittingly subdues the bull. Mexicans who are watching the scene believe that Goofy is "the great Matador" and the minute Goofy arrives in Mexico City, they dress him like a matador and make him do battle with another bull. The reluctant Goofy tries to escape the enormous bull although after a while, once again, he triumphs over the bull by accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHAoy2hh5D4Kf5yJPaUh8n3880T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67624'),
  ('301987796568248972', 'For Worse', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Amy Landecker, Rebecca Baehler, Eyde Belasco', 'Amy Landecker', 'Nico Hiraga, Gaby Hoffmann, Ken Marino, Missi Pyle, Kiersey Clemons', 'Not Rated', 'Lauren, a newly divorced, sober mom, feels like she has a new lease on life after joining her first acting class and starting a fling with her hot, young scene partner. However, when they attend their Gen Z classmate''s wedding together, things begin to fall apart, and Lauren finds herself behaving like a drunk 25-year-old bridesmaid. Luckily after a disastrous night she stumbles into a new day and a new beginning.', 'Lauren, a newly divorced, sober mom, feels like she has a new lease on life after joining her first acting class and starting a fling with her hot, young scene partner. However, when they attend their Gen Z classmate''s wedding together, things begin to fall apart, and Lauren finds herself behaving like a drunk 25-year-old bridesmaid. Luckily after a disastrous night she stumbles into a new day and a new beginning.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd8a0fd59a0e9bf93f00735ee52e1ea28.jpg', 'plex:movie:for-worse-2026'),
  ('295481956770836219', 'For Y''ur Height Only', 1981, 'Comedy, Action', 'Eddie Nicart', 'Cora Caballes', 'Weng Weng, Yehlen Catral, Carmi Martin, Anna Marie Gutierrez, Beth Sandoval, Tony Ferrer, Rodolfo ''Boy'' Garcia, Mike Cohen', null, 'Mr. Giant has kidnapped the brilliant Dr. Van Kohler and is planning to use the Doctor''s invention, the N-bomb, to hold the world hostage. The only one who can foil Mr. Giant''s evil scheme is Agent 00, a 3-foot-tall filipino martial arts master, expert marksman, top-class romancer and all-around superspy. Can Agent 00 rescue Dr. Kohler before it''s too late?', 'Mr. Giant has kidnapped the brilliant Dr. Van Kohler and is planning to use the Doctor''s invention, the N-bomb, to hold the world hostage. The only one who can foil Mr. Giant''s evil scheme is Agent 00, a 3-foot-tall filipino martial arts master, expert marksman, top-class romancer and all-around superspy. Can Agent 00 rescue Dr. Kohler before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGl22BMQ9WjyrhO5COeRx8ufrky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40471'),
  ('795362424693580011', 'For You I Will Fight', 2010, 'Drama', 'Fiona Braillon, Rachel Lang', 'Rachel Lang', 'Salomé Richard, Sarah Gilman, Eloïse Genet, Marina Djafar, Jean Schneider, Yoann Micl, Martine Willequet', null, '19 years old and with nothing else to do, Ana joins the army and, through the enforced discipline and comradeship, begins to find her way in the world.', '19 years old and with nothing else to do, Ana joins the army and, through the enforced discipline and comradeship, begins to find her way in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGCjgSzVG9unDhSENc1H3fozd1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418763'),
  ('913477768712105003', 'For Your Consideration', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Guest, Roberto Schaefer, Cas Donovan', 'Christopher Guest, Eugene Levy', 'Catherine O''Hara, Harry Shearer, Parker Posey, Christopher Moynihan, John Michael Higgins, Eugene Levy, Jane Lynch, Fred Willard', 'PG-13', 'The possibility of Oscar gold holds the cast and crew of an independent film in its grip after the performance of its virtually unknown, veteran star generates awards buzz.', 'The possibility of Oscar gold holds the cast and crew of an independent film in its grip after the performance of its virtually unknown, veteran star generates awards buzz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvXClgY4ZJ7dBxalFuxPgb4nJ9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14799'),
