  ('303571451172273958', 'For Your Love', 2015, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe M. Gaudino, Matteo Cocco', 'Giuseppe M. Gaudino, Isabella Sandri, Lina Sarti', 'Valeria Golino, Massimiliano Gallo, Adriano Giannini, Elisabetta Mirra, Edoardo Crò, Daria D''Isanto, Salvatore Cantalupo, Rosaria Di Ciocco', null, 'An extremely mannered and increasingly preposterous tale of a fortysomething woman who has to deal with an abusive, double-dealing husband and a handsome, soap-actor lover who seems to be too good to be true.', 'An extremely mannered and increasingly preposterous tale of a fortysomething woman who has to deal with an abusive, double-dealing husband and a handsome, soap-actor lover who seems to be too good to be true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvA8Og5eMm76nyQOKGq9S7TBu0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352199'),
  ('497996227064826939', 'For Zeko', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hussien Asar, Peter Mimi', 'Youssef Emad, Ahmed Mohamed Salem, Mostafa Hamdy', 'Karim Mahmoud Abdel Aziz, Menna Shalabi, Mahmoud Hafez, Mohamed Mahmoud, Youssef Salah, Amr Abdel Gelil, Diab, Mohamed Tharwat', null, 'The story follows a simple family whose young son, Zeko, wins the opportunity to participate in a contest for Egypt''s smartest child. As they set out to attend the contest, many paradoxes happen to them during the two-day trip', 'The story follows a simple family whose young son, Zeko, wins the opportunity to participate in a contest for Egypt''s smartest child. As they set out to attend the contest, many paradoxes happen to them during the two-day trip', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okcbyzM7bNakeUUVAJCWYYcc1id.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911622'),
  ('206939904549079553', 'Forbidden', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker', 'Frank Capra', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Adolphe Menjou, Ralph Bellamy, Dorothy Peterson, Thomas Jefferson, Myrna Fresholt, Charlotte Henry, Oliver Eckhardt', 'NR', 'On a cruise to Cuba, Lulu Smith falls in love with Bob Grover. Back home, she breaks off the romance when he tells her he is married. Lulu has a baby but doesn''t tell Bob, who turns out to be a rising politician. She passes herself off as the baby''s nanny. When Bob learns what is going on, he adopts the little girl, not telling his wife or anyone else where she came from. Lulu gets a job at a newspaper. Things get complicated when the editor gets the dirt on Bob, but also wants to marry Lulu.', 'On a cruise to Cuba, Lulu Smith falls in love with Bob Grover. Back home, she breaks off the romance when he tells her he is married. Lulu has a baby but doesn''t tell Bob, who turns out to be a rising politician. She passes herself off as the baby''s nanny. When Bob learns what is going on, he adopts the little girl, not telling his wife or anyone else where she came from. Lulu gets a job at a newspaper. Things get complicated when the editor gets the dirt on Bob, but also wants to marry Lulu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBUDSm2r6UvFXGjMiGSMnPmTEFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50072'),
  ('426592803989324964', 'Forbidden', 1953, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Rudolph Maté, John Sherwood, William H. Daniels', 'William Sackheim, Gil Dund', 'Tony Curtis, Joanne Dru, Lyle Bettger, Marvin Miller, Victor Sen Yung, Peter Mamakos, Mai Tai Sing, Howard Chuman', 'NR', 'Eddie Darrow, seeking a mobster''s widow in Macao, gets involved in a casino owner''s affairs.', 'Eddie Darrow, seeking a mobster''s widow in Macao, gets involved in a casino owner''s affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EFAtNu9TZiQd6wHeg2aQD53R7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27399'),
  ('464896674241540814', 'Forbidden Arsenal', 1991, 'Action', 'Yuen Jun-Man, Cheng Siu-Keung, Chung Chi Kwong', 'Tony Leung Siu-Hung, Patrick Yuen Yeuk-Gwong', 'Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Cynthia Khan, Garry Chow Ging-Yeung, Robin Shou, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Do Siu-Chun, Tse Wai-Kit, Phillip Kwok Chui', null, 'Hong Kong policewoman Yeung teams up with Taiwanese and Mainland officers to take down a gunrunning ring.', 'Hong Kong policewoman Yeung teams up with Taiwanese and Mainland officers to take down a gunrunning ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y3E9uxkUD0FTkQElqk5GfcpFdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170810'),
  ('1036285899275030094', 'Forbidden Beach', 1985, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Enrique Gómez Vadillo, Tino Geiser', 'Carlos Valdemar', 'Sasha Montenegro, José Alonso, Jaime Garza, Óscar Alejandro, Luis Mario Quiroz, Isaura Espinoza, Claudio Báez, Carla Ivonne', null, 'An engineer moves into a bungalow on the beach next to a widow and her two boys. The older boy has a bit of an Oedipal complex and seems to like his mom. Of course, that means that no other man can come and break up their "happy" family.', 'An engineer moves into a bungalow on the beach next to a widow and her two boys. The older boy has a bit of an Oedipal complex and seems to like his mom. Of course, that means that no other man can come and break up their "happy" family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEsqMji1FGpKPcMngrMwnk80nDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215846'),
  ('744398757745225448', 'Forbidden City Cop', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Stephen Chow, Lee Kin-Keung', 'Stephen Chow, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Lo Man-Sang', 'Stephen Chow, Carina Lau, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Law Kar-Ying, Cheung Tat-Ming, Tats Lau Yee-Tat, Lee Lik-Chi, Alvina Kong Yan-Yin', 'NR', 'An imperial agent gets ridiculed for his various inventions, until his supportive wife encourages him to attend a conference, which''s actually a trap to kill all the doctors serving the emperor, where his crazy inventions come in handy.', 'An imperial agent gets ridiculed for his various inventions, until his supportive wife encourages him to attend a conference, which''s actually a trap to kill all the doctors serving the emperor, where his crazy inventions come in handy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bywu9M03JAowpRqWYB43lINsfo5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37702'),
  ('1145816658904782089', 'Forbidden Dream', 2019, 'History, Drama', 'Hur Jin-ho, Lee Seong-hwan, Lee Mo-gae', 'Jung Bum-shik, Lee Ji-min', 'Choi Min-sik, Han Suk-kyu, Shin Gu, Huh Joon-ho, Kim Tae-woo, Kim Won-hae, Im Won-hee, Park Sung-hoon', null, 'A true historical drama about King Sejong, the greatest ruler in Joseon history who sought to enhance national prosperity and military power through astronomy, and Jang Yeong-sil, the most remarkable scientist.', 'A true historical drama about King Sejong, the greatest ruler in Joseon history who sought to enhance national prosperity and military power through astronomy, and Jang Yeong-sil, the most remarkable scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqYWQ1M1rYcqTxhVR6REtarcDjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569267'),
  ('735483720296636267', 'Forbidden Dreams', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Alberto Spagnoli, Marina Mattoli', 'Franco Marotta, Laura Toscano, Neri Parenti', 'Paolo Villaggio, Janet Ågren, Alessandro Haber, Alida Valli, Sofia Lombardo, Antonio Allocca, Renzo Rinaldi, Mike Bongiorno', null, 'Paolo Coniglio is a naive and clumsy employee in a comics publishing house, bullied by his manager and his terrible future mother-in-law. To escape his dreary daily routine, he finds himself living vivid daydreams with "Dalia", the beautiful heroine of the books that he''s translating. One day, though, while shopping, Paolo meets a charming blonde that looks like Dalia, and finds himself trapped in a shady intrigue.', 'Paolo Coniglio is a naive and clumsy employee in a comics publishing house, bullied by his manager and his terrible future mother-in-law. To escape his dreary daily routine, he finds himself living vivid daydreams with "Dalia", the beautiful heroine of the books that he''s translating. One day, though, while shopping, Paolo meets a charming blonde that looks like Dalia, and finds himself trapped in a shady intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDvrs8yBSHal8ci7CCRjEa8JEaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106256'),
  ('601920042246799019', 'Forbidden Dreams', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Karel Kachyňa, Vladimír Smutný, Zeno Dostál', 'Karel Kachyňa, Dušan Hamšík', 'Karel Heřmánek, Marta Vančurová, Rudolf Hrušínský, Jiří Krampol, Lubor Tokoš, Dana Vlková, Ladislav Potměšil, Oldřich Vlach', null, 'Leo Popper is a happy family man living in rural Bohemia in the years preceding the Nazi invasion. Out of economic necessity he moves with his family to the big city and becomes an enterprising vacuum cleaner salesman. There he embarks on a series of adulterous adventures, has encounters with boxing pros and famous portrait artists, and schemes to purchase the perfect pond to fulfill his passion for fishing. When the Nazis gain control, the comedy turns sour - he loses his lake, his job, and finally, his family.', 'Leo Popper is a happy family man living in rural Bohemia in the years preceding the Nazi invasion. Out of economic necessity he moves with his family to the big city and becomes an enterprising vacuum cleaner salesman. There he embarks on a series of adulterous adventures, has encounters with boxing pros and famous portrait artists, and schemes to purchase the perfect pond to fulfill his passion for fishing. When the Nazis gain control, the comedy turns sour - he loses his lake, his job, and finally, his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/544xNgusG5dwhVx5XYORgWA4tlk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80163'),
  ('577138478318898239', 'Forbidden Empire', 2014, 'Thriller, Adventure, Mystery, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Oleg Stepchenko, Yaroslav Pilunskyi, Yuliya Ratnikova', 'Oleg Stepchenko, Alexander Karpov', 'Jason Flemyng, Aleksey Chadov, Agniya Ditkovskite, Yuriy Tsurilo, Olga Zaytseva, Aleksandr Yakovlev, Igor Jijikine, Valeriy Zolotukhin', 'R', 'Early 18th century. Cartographer Jonathan Green undertakes a scientific voyage from Europe to the East. Having passed through Transylvania and crossed the Carpathian Mountains, he finds himself in a small village lost in impassible woods. Nothing but chance and heavy fog could bring him to this cursed place. People who live here do not resemble any other people which the traveler saw before that. The villagers, having dug a deep moat to fend themselves from the rest of the world, share a naive belief that they could save themselves from evil, failing to understand that evil has made its nest in their souls and is waiting for an opportunity to gush out upon the world.', 'Early 18th century. Cartographer Jonathan Green undertakes a scientific voyage from Europe to the East. Having passed through Transylvania and crossed the Carpathian Mountains, he finds himself in a small village lost in impassible woods. Nothing but chance and heavy fog could bring him to this cursed place. People who live here do not resemble any other people which the traveler saw before that. The villagers, having dug a deep moat to fend themselves from the rest of the world, share a naive belief that they could save themselves from evil, failing to understand that evil has made its nest in their souls and is waiting for an opportunity to gush out upon the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0o9JQDp6PHY4zK0Aw1NHpyQyeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208763'),
  ('591984502062100890', 'Forbidden Fairytale', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lee Jong-suk, Kim Ji-hyun, Kang Dong-geon', 'Yoon Ju-hun', 'Park Ji-hyun, Choi Si-won, Sung Dong-il, Park Geon-il, Hwang Se-on, Seol Woo-in, Park Cheol-min, Kim Young-ah', null, 'An aspiring children''s book writer agrees to write erotic web novels to pay her car repair debt – with unintended consequences for her coworker.', 'An aspiring children''s book writer agrees to write erotic web novels to pay her car repair debt – with unintended consequences for her coworker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKDCQpSfGJIyZmuXyZlnPmjV3QW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1174128'),
  ('415647436725578826', 'Forbidden Fruit', 1921, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cecil B. DeMille', 'Jeanie Macpherson', 'Agnes Ayres, Clarence Burton, Theodore Roberts, Kathlyn Williams, Forrest Stanley, Theodore Kosloff, Shannon Day, Bertram Johns', null, 'Mary Maddock works as a seamstress to bring home money while her husband Steve, unemployed, has no real prospects of earning money. Mary''s employers, are trying to strike an oil related business deal with a rich man by the name of Nelson Rogers. The deal does not seem to be on the table, as Mr. Rogers is leaving town shortly and does not have the time to work out the details of such a deal. In an order to entice him to stay, Mrs. Mallory - wife of Mr. Mallory who is proposing the business deal - convinces Mary to be her guest at a dinner party with the intent of making Mr. Rogers fall for her and thus stay long enough for Mr. Mallory to make him agree to a business deal.', 'Mary Maddock works as a seamstress to bring home money while her husband Steve, unemployed, has no real prospects of earning money. Mary''s employers, are trying to strike an oil related business deal with a rich man by the name of Nelson Rogers. The deal does not seem to be on the table, as Mr. Rogers is leaving town shortly and does not have the time to work out the details of such a deal. In an order to entice him to stay, Mrs. Mallory - wife of Mr. Mallory who is proposing the business deal - convinces Mary to be her guest at a dinner party with the intent of making Mr. Rogers fall for her and thus stay long enough for Mr. Mallory to make him agree to a business deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwVNfWHi8Jw7x1n0I5sfMflHY26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72496'),
  ('732465947051600354', 'Forbidden Fruit', 1952, 'Romance, Drama', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Georges Simenon', 'Fernandel, Françoise Arnoul, Jacques Castelot, Fernand Sardou, René Génin, Pierrette Bruno, Manuel Gary, Max Dalcourt', null, 'A doctor, leading an agreed life of the provincial petty bourgeoisie, falls in love with a young woman. As their relationship deepens, he becomes violently jealous and blames her for her dating and friendships.', 'A doctor, leading an agreed life of the provincial petty bourgeoisie, falls in love with a young woman. As their relationship deepens, he becomes violently jealous and blames her for her dating and friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4l2Xb0ymRnCOlYNW5Byu9omscB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95287'),
  ('1116740501092691081', 'Forbidden Fruit', 2009, 'Drama', 'Dome Karukoski, Mark Lwoff, Paula Pitkänen', 'Aleksi Bardy', 'Marjut Maristo, Amanda Pilke, Malla Malmivaara, Joel Mäkinen, Jarkko Niemi, Olavi Uusivirta, Timo Tikka, Jani Volanen', null, 'Two 18-year old girls from a christian fundamentalist community flee to a city for a summer job.', 'Two 18-year old girls from a christian fundamentalist community flee to a city for a summer job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLLeYpYp71klc00YnYvAjT5tcP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22326'),
  ('559407174635951149', 'Forbidden Fruits', 2026, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Meredith Alloway, Karim Hussain, Donna Dupere', 'Meredith Alloway, Lily Houghton', 'Lili Reinhart, Lola Tung, Victoria Pedretti, Alexandra Shipp, Emma Chamberlain, Gabrielle Union, Hailey Summer, Jordan Duarte', 'R', 'Free Eden employee Apple secretly runs a witchy femme cult in the basement of the mall store after hours – with fellow fruits Cherry and Fig. But, when new hire Pumpkin challenges their performative sisterhood, the women are forced to face their own poisons or succumb to a bloody fate.', 'Free Eden employee Apple secretly runs a witchy femme cult in the basement of the mall store after hours – with fellow fruits Cherry and Fig. But, when new hire Pumpkin challenges their performative sisterhood, the women are forced to face their own poisons or succumb to a bloody fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3hvrrrqvRoURz4y1A1aCys6WD9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1450527'),
  ('125842639751524399', 'Forbidden Games', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edward Holzman, Harris Done, Edward Holzman', 'Edward Holzman', 'Jeff Griggs, Lesli Kay, Gail Harris, Amy Weber, Elizabeth Sandifer, Ashlie Rhey, Jefferson Wagner, Aleksandra Kaniak', 'R', 'Michael is a private investigator with special psychic powers allowing him to subconsciously see clues in a case. He is hired to investigate the death of the very wealthy Charles who has a very healthy sum of money going to his wife and daughter. Michael needs to unravel the clues to see if Charles died accidentally or was murdered. There are several characters who may benefit from his death as well as a mistress and a nude modelling agency.', 'Michael is a private investigator with special psychic powers allowing him to subconsciously see clues in a case. He is hired to investigate the death of the very wealthy Charles who has a very healthy sum of money going to his wife and daughter. Michael needs to unravel the clues to see if Charles died accidentally or was murdered. There are several characters who may benefit from his death as well as a mistress and a nude modelling agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnXHUtM7G6c8lTS61R5OpQAmpSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179778'),
  ('756722132794001426', 'Forbidden Ground', 2013, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Johan Earl, Adrian Powers', 'Johan Earl', 'Johan Earl, Tim Pocock, Martin Copping, Denai Gracie, Sarah Mawbey, Barry Quin, Damian Sommerlad, Oliver Trajkovski', 'R', 'Three British soldiers find themselves stranded in No Man''s Land after a failed charge on the German Trenches. Set in France 1916.', 'Three British soldiers find themselves stranded in No Man''s Land after a failed charge on the German Trenches. Set in France 1916.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbADqCeTMMhyUqXWXGlbQgY6oK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215814'),
  ('758831030245960129', 'Forbidden Homework', 1992, 'Drama', 'Pablo Barbachano, Alberto Atala, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo', 'María Rojo, Esteban Soberanes, Julián Pastor', null, 'A young man completing an assignment for his film class invites Marieda, a middle-aged woman, over to his aunt''s house to rehearse for a drama she believes they will eventually record. But she doesn''t realize that she is being videotaped since her arrival.', 'A young man completing an assignment for his film class invites Marieda, a middle-aged woman, over to his aunt''s house to rehearse for a drama she believes they will eventually record. But she doesn''t realize that she is being videotaped since her arrival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOvvfakeTMkyImaj1DdMFhlTFdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290717'),
  ('936879892575278902', 'Forbidden House', 2011, 'Drama, Horror', 'Hélène Angel, Gordon Spooner', 'Hélène Angel, Jean-Claude Jay', 'Valérie Bonneton, Charles Berling, Guilaine Londez, Thierry Godard, Vasil Vivitz Grecu, Gean Cartier', null, 'Benoît and Claire want to sell their country-side house where Claire´s brother commit suicide. Both go to the house to renovate it and sell it for a better price. Since the first night they stay there Claire is convinced that they are not alone...', 'Benoît and Claire want to sell their country-side house where Claire´s brother commit suicide. Both go to the house to renovate it and sell it for a better price. Since the first night they stay there Claire is convinced that they are not alone...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5MoZpyzeO0fenat9GDDXmTNyJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67667'),
