  ('100997604027835070', 'Forbidden Zone', 1980, 'Music, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Richard Elfman, Gregory Sandor', 'Richard Elfman, Matthew Bright, Nick L. Martinson', 'Hervé Villechaize, Susan Tyrrell, Matthew Bright, Gene Cunningham, Marie-Pascale Elfman, Virginia Rose, Phil Gordon, Hyman Diamond', 'R', 'A mysterious door in the basement of the Hercules house leads to the Sixth Dimension by way of a gigantic set of intestine. When Frenchy slips through the door, King Fausto falls in love with her. The jealous Queen Doris takes Frenchy prisoner, and it is up to the Hercules family and friend Squeezit Henderson to rescue her.', 'A mysterious door in the basement of the Hercules house leads to the Sixth Dimension by way of a gigantic set of intestine. When Frenchy slips through the door, King Fausto falls in love with her. The jealous Queen Doris takes Frenchy prisoner, and it is up to the Hercules family and friend Squeezit Henderson to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4lrDkJVkW2kQZnNcHtUQ38DDAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16127'),
  ('457745028054561170', 'Force', 2011, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Frank Henry, Jean-Pierre Sauvaire', 'Frank Henry', 'Isabelle Adjani, Éric Cantona, Simon Abkarian, Thierry Frémont, Anne Consigny, Linh-Dan Pham, Slimane Dazi, Cyril Lecomte', null, 'Following a series of unsolved robberies, the authorities decide to give carte blanche to commander Clara Damico to neutralize a particularly organized gang. Manual Makarov, a well-known figure in organized crime, is currently serving a sentence of twelve years in prison. Commander Damico promises him freedom in exchange for his cooperation. He refuses. There is no other solution, she is obliged to compel him by force.', 'Following a series of unsolved robberies, the authorities decide to give carte blanche to commander Clara Damico to neutralize a particularly organized gang. Manual Makarov, a well-known figure in organized crime, is currently serving a sentence of twelve years in prison. Commander Damico promises him freedom in exchange for his cooperation. He refuses. There is no other solution, she is obliged to compel him by force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jU6wmsXDcPuNEPdWLFXSI70cfOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79249'),
