  ('55931702661818477', 'Force of Evil', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'George Barnes, Abraham Polonsky, Robert Aldrich', 'Ira Wolfert, Abraham Polonsky', 'John Garfield, Thomas Gomez, Marie Windsor, Howland Chamberlain, Roy Roberts, Paul Fix, Stanley Prager, Barry Kelley', 'NR', 'Lawyer Joe Morse wants to consolidate all the small-time numbers racket operators into one big powerful operation. But his elder brother Leo is one of these small-time operators who wants to stay that way, preferring not to deal with the gangsters who dominate the big-time.', 'Lawyer Joe Morse wants to consolidate all the small-time numbers racket operators into one big powerful operation. But his elder brother Leo is one of these small-time operators who wants to stay that way, preferring not to deal with the gangsters who dominate the big-time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x33LVKf4yWdjMeczJkzE5sIw4VG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26744'),
  ('75146257691797118', 'Force of Execution', 2014, 'Action, Crime', 'Keoni Waxman, Nathan Wilson, Loren Schoel', 'Michael Black, Richard Beattie', 'Steven Seagal, Danny Trejo, Ving Rhames, David House, Jenny Gabrielle, Bren Foster, Sarah Minnich, Jesus Jr.', 'R', 'Seagal stars as mob kingpin Mr. Alexander, an old-school boss who rules his criminal empire with both nobility and brutality. For a simple prison hit, he sends his best enforcer and protégé Roman Hurst (Foster). When the hit goes wrong, Hurst is forced to pay the price of his failure: banishment in the city that he almost once ruled. But a war is brewing for the soul of the city between Alexander, a cold-blooded gangster known as ''The Iceman" (Rhames) and a merciless Mexican cartel. Hurst, with the help of an ex-con restaurant owner (Trejo) who has a few hidden moves of his own, will rediscover his own will to survive the coming conflict and to wreak vengeance on those who have wronged him.', 'Seagal stars as mob kingpin Mr. Alexander, an old-school boss who rules his criminal empire with both nobility and brutality. For a simple prison hit, he sends his best enforcer and protégé Roman Hurst (Foster). When the hit goes wrong, Hurst is forced to pay the price of his failure: banishment in the city that he almost once ruled. But a war is brewing for the soul of the city between Alexander, a cold-blooded gangster known as ''The Iceman" (Rhames) and a merciless Mexican cartel. Hurst, with the help of an ex-con restaurant owner (Trejo) who has a few hidden moves of his own, will rediscover his own will to survive the coming conflict and to wreak vengeance on those who have wronged him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KQlvJDp1X609PhMlr9aLx4Wc7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227359'),
